শেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68861,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"مُّؤْمِنَةٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"mu''minatin","translation_bn":"(যে হবে) মু''মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُّؤْمِنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":68863,"position":48,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"তবে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68864,"position":49,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":68865,"position":50,"text_uthmani":"يَجِدْ","transliteration":"yajid","translation_bn":"পায়","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68866,"position":51,"text_uthmani":"فَصِيَامُ","transliteration":"faṣiyāmu","translation_bn":"রোযা সেক্ষেত্রে রাখবে","root":"صوم","lemma":"صِيَام","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":68867,"position":52,"text_uthmani":"شَهْرَيْنِ","transliteration":"shahrayni","translation_bn":"দু''মাস","root":"شهر","lemma":"شَهْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68868,"position":53,"text_uthmani":"مُتَتَابِعَيْنِ","transliteration":"mutatābiʿayni","translation_bn":"ক্রমাগত","root":"تبع","lemma":"مُتَتَابِعَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":68869,"position":54,"text_uthmani":"تَوْبَةًۭ","transliteration":"tawbatan","translation_bn":"তওবা (করার নীতি)","root":"توب","lemma":"تَوْبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68870,"position":55,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68871,"position":56,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68873,"position":57,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68874,"position":58,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68875,"position":59,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمًا","transliteration":"ʿalīman","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68876,"position":60,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ḥakīman","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":68877,"position":61,"text_uthmani":"٩٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯২)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kāna limu''minin an yaqtula mu''minan illā khaṭa-an waman qatala mu''minan khaṭa-an fataḥrīru raqabatin mu''minatin wadiyatun musallamatun ilā ahlihi illā an yaṣṣaddaqū fa-in kāna min qawmin ʿaduwwin lakum wahuwa mu''minun fataḥrīru raqabatin mu''minatin wa-in kāna min qawmin baynakum wabaynahum mīthāqun fadiyatun musallamatun ilā ahlihi wataḥrīru raqabatin mu''minatin faman lam yajid faṣiyāmu shahrayni mutatābiʿayni tawbatan mina l-lahi wakāna l-lahu ʿalīman ḥakīman', 'কোন মু’মিনকে হত্যা করা কোন মু’মিনের কাজ নয় তবে ভুলবশত হতে পারে, কেউ কোন মু’মিনকে ভুলক্রমে হত্যা করলে, একজন মু’মিন দাস মুক্ত করা বা তার পরিবারবর্গকে রক্তপণ দেয়া কর্তব্য, যদি না তারা ক্ষমা করে দেয়। যদি সে তোমাদের শত্রুপক্ষের লোক হয় এবং মু’মিন হয় তবে একজন মু’মিন গোলাম আযাদ করা কর্তব্য, আর যদি সে এমন গোত্রের লোক হয় যাদের মধ্যে ও তোমাদের মধ্যে চুক্তি রয়েছে তবে তার পরিবারকে রক্তপণ দেয়া এবং একজন মু’মিন গোলাম আযাদ করা কর্তব্য এবং যে ব্যক্তি সঙ্গতিহীন সে একাদিক্রমে দু’ মাস রোযা পালন করবে। এটাই হল আল্লাহর নিকট তাওবাহ করার ব্যবস্থা, আল্লাহ মহাজ্ঞানী, সুবিজ্ঞ।', 'And never is it for a believer to kill a believer except by mistake. And whoever kills a believer by mistake - then the freeing of a believing slave and a compensation payment presented to the deceased''s family [is required] unless they give [up their right as] charity. But if the deceased was from a people at war with you and he was a believer - then [only] the freeing of a believing slave; and if he was from a people with whom you have a treaty - then a compensation payment presented to his family and the freeing of a believing slave. And whoever does not find [one or cannot afford to buy one] - then [instead], a fast for two months consecutively, [seeking] acceptance of repentance from Allah. And Allah is ever Knowing and Wise.', 'কোন মু’মিনকে হত্যা করা কোন মু’মিনের কাজ নয় তবে ভুলবশত হতে পারে, কেউ কোন মু’মিনকে ভুলক্রমে হত্যা করলে, একজন মু’মিন দাস মুক্ত করা বা তার পরিবারবর্গকে রক্তপণ দেয়া কর্তব্য, যদি না তারা ক্ষমা করে দেয়। যদি সে তোমাদের শত্রুপক্ষের লোক হয় এবং মু’মিন হয় তবে একজন মু’মিন গোলাম আযাদ করা কর্তব্য, আর যদি সে এমন গোত্রের লোক হয় যাদের মধ্যে ও তোমাদের মধ্যে চুক্তি রয়েছে তবে তার পরিবারকে রক্তপণ দেয়া এবং একজন মু’মিন গোলাম আযাদ করা কর্তব্য এবং যে ব্যক্তি সঙ্গতিহীন সে একাদিক্রমে দু’ মাস রোযা পালন করবে। এটাই হল আল্লাহর নিকট তাওবাহ করার ব্যবস্থা, আল্লাহ মহাজ্ঞানী, সুবিজ্ঞ।', 'And never is it for a believer to kill a believer except by mistake. And whoever kills a believer by mistake - then the freeing of a believing slave and a compensation payment presented to the deceased''s family [is required] unless they give [up their right as] charity. But if the deceased was from a people at war with you and he was a believer - then [only] the freeing of a believing slave; and if he was from a people with whom you have a treaty - then a compensation payment presented to his family and the freeing of a believing slave. And whoever does not find [one or cannot afford to buy one] - then [instead], a fast for two months consecutively, [seeking] acceptance of repentance from Allah. And Allah is ever Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004092.mp3', now()),
  (4, 93, '', '[{"id":69300,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69301,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَقْتُلْ","transliteration":"yaqtul","translation_bn":"হত্যা করবে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69302,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُؤْمِنًۭا","transliteration":"mu''minan","translation_bn":"মু''মিনকে","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69303,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُّتَعَمِّدًۭا","transliteration":"mutaʿammidan","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছাকৃত","root":"عمد","lemma":"مُّتَعَمِّد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69304,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَجَزَآؤُهُۥ","transliteration":"fajazāuhu","translation_bn":"তার শাস্তি (হলো)","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":69305,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمُ","transliteration":"jahannamu","translation_bn":"জাহান্নাম","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69306,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدًۭا","transliteration":"khālidan","translation_bn":"সে স্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69307,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69308,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَغَضِبَ","transliteration":"waghaḍiba","translation_bn":"ও ক্রুদ্ধ হয়েছেন","root":"غضب","lemma":"غَضِبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69309,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69310,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69311,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعَنَهُۥ","transliteration":"walaʿanahu","translation_bn":"তাকে লা''নত করেছেন","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69312,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَأَعَدَّ","transliteration":"wa-aʿadda","translation_bn":"ও প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন","root":"عدد","lemma":"أَعَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69313,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69314,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابًا","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69315,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿaẓīman","translation_bn":"বিরাট","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":69316,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٩٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman yaqtul mu''minan mutaʿammidan fajazāuhu jahannamu khālidan fīhā waghaḍiba l-lahu ʿalayhi walaʿanahu wa-aʿadda lahu ʿadhāban ʿaẓīman', 'যে ব্যক্তি কোন মু’মিনকে ইচ্ছাপূর্বক হত্যা করে, তার শাস্তি জাহান্নাম। যাতে স্থায়ীভাবে থাকবে, তার উপর আল্লাহর ক্রোধ ও অভিসম্পাত। আল্লাহ তার জন্য মহাশাস্তি নির্দিষ্ট করে রেখেছেন।', 'But whoever kills a believer intentionally - his recompense is Hell, wherein he will abide eternally, and Allah has become angry with him and has cursed him and has prepared for him a great punishment.', 'যে ব্যক্তি কোন মু’মিনকে ইচ্ছাপূর্বক হত্যা করে, তার শাস্তি জাহান্নাম। যাতে স্থায়ীভাবে থাকবে, তার উপর আল্লাহর ক্রোধ ও অভিসম্পাত। আল্লাহ তার জন্য মহাশাস্তি নির্দিষ্ট করে রেখেছেন।', 'But whoever kills a believer intentionally - his recompense is Hell, wherein he will abide eternally, and Allah has become angry with him and has cursed him and has prepared for him a great punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004093.mp3', now()),
  (4, 94, '', '[{"id":69317,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"ওহে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":69318,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69319,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছ","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69320,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":69321,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ضَرَبْتُمْ","transliteration":"ḍarabtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা যাত্রা কর","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69322,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(মধ্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69323,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথে","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69324,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69325,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَتَبَيَّنُوا۟","transliteration":"fatabayyanū","translation_bn":"তোমরা (শত্রু-মিত্র) যাচাই করো তখন","root":"بين","lemma":"تَبَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":69326,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"ও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69327,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"taqūlū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69328,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِمَنْ","transliteration":"liman",