ext_uthmani":"مَغَانِمُ","transliteration":"maghānimu","translation_bn":"গণিমতের মাল","root":"غنم","lemma":"مَغَانِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69341,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرَةٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"kathīratun","translation_bn":"প্রচুর","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِيرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":69343,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এরূপই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69344,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69345,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69346,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"ইতিপূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69347,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنَّ","transliteration":"famanna","translation_bn":"অতঃপর অনুগ্রহ করেছেন","root":"منن","lemma":"مَنَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69348,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69349,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69350,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"فَتَبَيَّنُوٓا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"fatabayyanū","translation_bn":"তোমরা সুতরাং যাচাই কর","root":"بين","lemma":"تَبَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69352,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":69353,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69354,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69355,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐবিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69356,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ কর","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69357,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"خَبِيرًۭا","transliteration":"khabīran","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69358,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"٩٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū idhā ḍarabtum fī sabīli l-lahi fatabayyanū walā taqūlū liman alqā ilaykumu l-salāma lasta mu''minan tabtaghūna ʿaraḍa l-ḥayati l-dun''yā faʿinda l-lahi maghānimu kathīratun kadhālika kuntum min qablu famanna l-lahu ʿalaykum fatabayyanū inna l-laha kāna bimā taʿmalūna khabīran', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! যখন তোমরা আল্লাহর পথে যাত্রা করবে তখন কে বন্ধু আর কে শত্রু তা পরীক্ষা করে নেবে, কেউ তোমাদেরকে সালাম করলে তাকে বলো না, ‘তুমি মু’মিন নও’, তোমরা ইহজগতের সম্পদের আকাঙ্ক্ষা কর, বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহর নিকট তোমাদের জন্য প্রচুর গনীমত আছে। তোমরাও এর পূর্বে এ রকমই ছিলে (অর্থাৎ তোমারাও তাদের মতই তোমাদের ঈমানকে তোমাদের কওম থেকে গোপন করতে), তৎপর আল্লাহ তোমাদের প্রতি কৃপা করেছেন, কাজেই অগ্রে বিশেষভাবে পরীক্ষা করে নিবে; তোমরা যা কিছু কর, সে বিষয়ে আল্লাহ সবিশেষ অবহিত।', 'O you who have believed, when you go forth [to fight] in the cause of Allah, investigate; and do not say to one who gives you [a greeting of] peace "You are not a believer," aspiring for the goods of worldly life; for with Allah are many acquisitions. You [yourselves] were like that before; then Allah conferred His favor upon you, so investigate. Indeed Allah is ever, with what you do, Acquainted.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! যখন তোমরা আল্লাহর পথে যাত্রা করবে তখন কে বন্ধু আর কে শত্রু তা পরীক্ষা করে নেবে, কেউ তোমাদেরকে সালাম করলে তাকে বলো না, ‘তুমি মু’মিন নও’, তোমরা ইহজগতের সম্পদের আকাঙ্ক্ষা কর, বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহর নিকট তোমাদের জন্য প্রচুর গনীমত আছে। তোমরাও এর পূর্বে এ রকমই ছিলে (অর্থাৎ তোমারাও তাদের মতই তোমাদের ঈমানকে তোমাদের কওম থেকে গোপন করতে), তৎপর আল্লাহ তোমাদের প্রতি কৃপা করেছেন, কাজেই অগ্রে বিশেষভাবে পরীক্ষা করে নিবে; তোমরা যা কিছু কর, সে বিষয়ে আল্লাহ সবিশেষ অবহিত।', 'O you who have believed, when you go forth [to fight] in the cause of Allah, investigate; and do not say to one who gives you [a greeting of] peace "You are not a believer," aspiring for the goods of worldly life; for with Allah are many acquisitions. You [yourselves] were like that before; then Allah conferred His favor upon you, so investigate. Indeed Allah is ever, with what you do, Acquainted.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004094.mp3', now()),
  (4, 95, '', '[{"id":69746,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":69747,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِى","transliteration":"yastawī","translation_bn":"সমান হয়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69748,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَـٰعِدُونَ","transliteration":"l-qāʿidūna","translation_bn":"(গৃহে) উপবেশনকারী (ঐসব লোক)","root":"قعد","lemma":"قَاعِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69749,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69750,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69751,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرُ","transliteration":"ghayru","translation_bn":"এব্যতীত","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":69752,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لِى","transliteration":"ulī","translation_bn":"(প্রথম)","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69753,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضَّرَرِ","transliteration":"l-ḍarari","translation_bn":"অক্ষমতাশীলরা","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضَّرَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69754,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُجَـٰهِدُونَ","transliteration":"wal-mujāhidūna","translation_bn":"ও মুজাহিদরা (যারা জিহাদ করে)","root":"جهد","lemma":"مُجَٰهِدِين","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69755,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(মধ্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69756,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথে","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69757,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69758,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","transliteration":"bi-amwālihim","translation_bn":"তাদের মাল-সম্পদ দিয়ে","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69759,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفُسِهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"wa-anfusihim","translation_bn":"ও তাদের জান (দিয়ে)","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69761,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَضَّلَ","transliteration":"faḍḍala","translation_bn":"শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব দিয়েছেন","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69762,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69763,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجَـٰهِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-mujāhidīna","translation_bn":"জিহাদকারীদেরকে","root":"جهد","lemma":"مُجَٰهِدِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69764,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","transliteration":"bi-amwālihim","translation_bn":"তাদের মাল-সম্পদ দিয়ে","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69765,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"wa-anfusihim","translation_bn":"ও তাদের জান (দিয়ে)","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69766,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(তাদের) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69767,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَـٰعِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-qāʿidīna","translation_bn":"(যারা) (গৃহে) উপবেশনকারী","root":"قعد","lemma":"قَاعِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69768,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"دَرَجَةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"darajatan","translation_bn":"মর্যাদায়","root":"درج","lemma":"دَرَجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69770,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَكُلًّۭا","transliteration":"wakullan","translation_bn":"এবং প্রত্যেকেরই","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69771,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدَ","transliteration":"waʿada","translation_bn":"ওয়াদা দিয়েছেন","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69772,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69773,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥus''nā","translation_bn":"কল্যাণের","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69775,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَفَضَّلَ","transliteration":"wafaḍḍala","translation_bn":"কিন্তু শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব দিয়েছেন","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضَّلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69776,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69777,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجَـٰهِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-mujāhidīna","translation_bn":"জিহাদকারীদেরকে","root":"جهد","lemma":"مُجَٰهِدِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69778,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69779,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَـٰعِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-qāʿidīna","translation_bn":"উপবিষ্টদের","root":"قعد","lemma":"قَاعِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69780,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرًا","transliteration":"ajran","translation_bn":"পুরস্কারের (ক্ষেত্রে)","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69781,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿaẓīman","translation_bn":"বিরাট","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":69782,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"٩٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā yastawī l-qāʿidūna mina l-mu''minīna ghayru ulī l-ḍarari wal-mujāhidūna fī sabīli l-lahi bi-amwālihim wa-anfusihim faḍḍala l-lahu l-mujāhidīna bi-amwālihim wa-anfusihim ʿalā l-qāʿidīna darajatan wakullan waʿada l-lahu l-ḥus''nā wafaḍḍala l-lahu l-mujāhidīna ʿalā l-qāʿidīna ajran ʿaẓīman', 'অক্ষম নয় এমন বসে-থাকা মু’মিনরা আর জান-মাল দ্বারা আল্লাহর পথে জিহাদকারীগণ সমান নয়; নিজেদের ধন-প্রাণ দ্বারা জিহাদকারীদেরকে বসে-থাকা লোকেদের উপর আল্লাহ মর্যাদা দিয়েছেন। আল্লাহ সকলের জন্যই কল্যাণের ওয়াদা করেছেন এবং মুজাহিদদেরকে বসে-থাকা লোকেদের তুলনায় আল্লাহ মহাপুরস্কার দিয়ে মর্যাদা দান করেছেন।', 'Not equal are those believers remaining [at home] - other than the disabled - and the mujahideen, [who strive and fight] in the cause of Allah with their wealth and their lives. Allah has preferred the mujahideen through their wealth and their lives over those who remain [behind], by degrees. And to both Allah has promised the best [reward]. But Allah has preferred the mujahideen over those who remain [behind] with a great reward -', 'অক্ষম নয় এমন বসে-থাকা মু’মিনরা আর জান-মাল দ্বারা আল্লাহর পথে জিহাদকারীগণ সমান নয়; নিজেদের ধন-প্রাণ দ্বারা জিহাদকারীদেরকে বসে-থাকা লোকেদের উপর আল্লাহ মর্যাদা দিয়েছেন। আল্লাহ সকলের জন্যই কল্যাণের ওয়াদা করেছেন এবং মুজাহিদদেরকে বসে-থাকা লোকেদের তুলনায় আল্লাহ মহাপুরস্কার দিয়ে মর্যাদা দান করেছেন।', 'Not equal are those believers remaining [at home] - other than the disabled - and the mujahideen, [who strive and fight] in the cause of Allah with their wealth and their lives. Allah has preferred the mujahideen through their wealth and their lives over those who remain [behind], by degrees. And to both Allah has promised the best [reward]. But Allah has preferred the mujahideen over those who remain [behind] with a great reward -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004095.mp3', now()),
  (4, 96, '', '[{"id":70100,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"دَرَجَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"darajātin","translation_bn":"মর্যাদায়","root":"درج","lemma":"دَرَجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70101,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তাঁর পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70102,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَمَغْفِرَةًۭ","transliteration":"wamaghfiratan","translation_bn":"ও ক্ষমা","root":"غفر","lemma":"مَّغْفِرَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70103,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"waraḥmatan","translation_bn":"ও রহমত (রয়েছে)","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70105,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70106,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70107,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورًۭا","transliteration":"ghafūran","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70108,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمًا","transliteration":"raḥīman","translation_bn":"মেহেরবান","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":70109,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٩٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'darajātin min''hu wamaghfiratan waraḥmatan wakāna l-lahu ghafūran raḥīman', 'ওটা আল্লাহর নিকট হতে পদমর্যাদা, ক্ষমা ও দয়া; আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়াবান।', 'Degrees [of high position] from Him and forgiveness and mercy. And Allah is ever Forgiving and Merciful.', 'ওটা আল্লাহর নিকট হতে পদমর্যাদা, ক্ষমা ও দয়া; আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়াবান।', 'Degrees [of high position] from Him and forgiveness and mercy. And Allah is ever Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004096.mp3', now()),
  (4, 97, '', '[{"id":70399,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":70400,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70401,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَوَفَّىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"tawaffāhumu","translation_bn":"তাদের জান কবজ করে","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70402,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতারা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70403,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَالِمِىٓ","transliteration":"ẓālimī","translation_bn":"জুলুমকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِمِى^","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70404,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"তাদের নিজেদের উপর","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70405,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"(ফেরেশতারা) বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70406,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَ","transliteration":"fīma","translation_bn":"''''কেমন তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70407,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে''''","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70409,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70410,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"''''আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70411,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُسْتَضْعَفِينَ","transliteration":"mus''taḍʿafīna","translation_bn":"দুর্বল","root":"ضعف","lemma":"مُّسْتَضْعَفُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70412,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70413,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"দুনিয়ার","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70415,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70416,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"''''কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":70417,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَكُنْ","transliteration":"takun","translation_bn":"ছিল","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70418,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَرْضُ","transliteration":"arḍu","translation_bn":"জমিন","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70419,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70420,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَٰسِعَةًۭ","transliteration":"wāsiʿatan","translation_bn":"প্রশস্ত","root":"وسع","lemma":"وَٰسِعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70421,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فَتُهَاجِرُوا۟","transliteration":"fatuhājirū","translation_bn":"তোমরা অতঃপর হিজরত করতে","root":"هجر","lemma":"هَاجَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70422,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا ۚ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে''''","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70424,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক অতএব","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":70425,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مَأْوَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"mawāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের বাসস্থল (হবে)","root":"اوي","lemma":"مَأْوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70426,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمُ ۖ","transliteration":"jahannamu","translation_bn":"জাহান্নাম","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70428,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَسَآءَتْ","transliteration":"wasāat","translation_bn":"এবং অতি খারাপ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":70429,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مَصِيرًا","transliteration":"maṣīran","translation_bn":"গন্তব্যস্থান","root":"صير","lemma":"مَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70430,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٩٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna tawaffāhumu l-malāikatu ẓālimī anfusihim qālū fīma kuntum qālū kunnā mus''taḍʿafīna fī l-arḍi qālū alam takun arḍu l-lahi wāsiʿatan fatuhājirū fīhā fa-ulāika mawāhum jahannamu wasāat maṣīran', 'যারা নিজেদের আত্মার উপর যুলম করেছিল এমন লোকেদের প্রাণ হরণের সময় ফেরেশতারা তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস করে- ‘তোমরা কোন্ কাজে নিমজ্জিত ছিলে’? তারা বলে, ‘দুনিয়ায় আমরা দুর্বল ক্ষমতাহীন ছিলাম’, ফেরেশতারা বলে, ‘আল্লাহর যমীন কি প্রশস্ত ছিল না যাতে তোমরা হিজরাত করতে’? সুতরাং তাদের আবাসস্থল হবে জাহান্নাম এবং তা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট প্রত্যাবর্তন স্থান!', 'Indeed, those whom the angels take [in death] while wronging themselves - [the angels] will say, "In what [condition] were you?" They will say, "We were oppressed in the land." The angels will say, "Was not the earth of Allah spacious [enough] for you to emigrate therein?" For those, their refuge is Hell - and evil it is as a destination.', 'যারা নিজেদের আত্মার উপর যুলম করেছিল এমন লোকেদের প্রাণ হরণের সময় ফেরেশতারা তাদেরকে জিজ্ঞেস করে- ‘তোমরা কোন্ কাজে নিমজ্জিত ছিলে’? তারা বলে, ‘দুনিয়ায় আমরা দুর্বল ক্ষমতাহীন ছিলাম’, ফেরেশতারা বলে, ‘আল্লাহর যমীন কি প্রশস্ত ছিল না যাতে তোমরা হিজরাত করতে’? সুতরাং তাদের আবাসস্থল হবে জাহান্নাম এবং তা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট প্রত্যাবর্তন স্থান!', 'Indeed, those whom the angels take [in death] while wronging themselves - [the angels] will say, "In what [condition] were you?" They will say, "We were oppressed in the land." The angels will say, "Was not the earth of Allah spacious [enough] for you to emigrate therein?" For those, their refuge is Hell - and evil it is as a destination.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004097.mp3', now()),
