:12,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلًۭا","transliteration":"sabīlan","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70765,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٩٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'illā l-mus''taḍʿafīna mina l-rijāli wal-nisāi wal-wil''dāni lā yastaṭīʿūna ḥīlatan walā yahtadūna sabīlan', 'কিন্তু যে সকল সহায়হীন পুরুষ, নারী ও বালক যারা উপায় বের করতে পারে না আর তারা পথও পায় না,', 'Except for the oppressed among men, women and children who cannot devise a plan nor are they directed to a way -', 'কিন্তু যে সকল সহায়হীন পুরুষ, নারী ও বালক যারা উপায় বের করতে পারে না আর তারা পথও পায় না,', 'Except for the oppressed among men, women and children who cannot devise a plan nor are they directed to a way -', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004098.mp3', now()),
  (4, 99, '', '[{"id":71023,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"সুতরাং ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71024,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَسَى","transliteration":"ʿasā","translation_bn":"হয়ত","root":"عسي","lemma":"عَسَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71025,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71026,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(যে)","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":71027,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَعْفُوَ","transliteration":"yaʿfuwa","translation_bn":"মাফ করবেন","root":"عفو","lemma":"عَفَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71028,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71030,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71031,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71032,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَفُوًّا","transliteration":"ʿafuwwan","translation_bn":"মার্জনাকারী","root":"عفو","lemma":"عَفُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71033,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورًۭا","transliteration":"ghafūran","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71034,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٩٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-ulāika ʿasā l-lahu an yaʿfuwa ʿanhum wakāna l-lahu ʿafuwwan ghafūran', 'আশা আছে যে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে ক্ষমা করবেন এবং আল্লাহ গুনাহ মোচনকারী, বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল।', 'For those it is expected that Allah will pardon them, and Allah is ever Pardoning and Forgiving.', 'আশা আছে যে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে ক্ষমা করবেন এবং আল্লাহ গুনাহ মোচনকারী, বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল।', 'For those it is expected that Allah will pardon them, and Allah is ever Pardoning and Forgiving.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004099.mp3', now()),
  (4, 100, '', '[{"id":71257,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71258,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُهَاجِرْ","transliteration":"yuhājir","translation_bn":"হিজরত করবে","root":"هجر","lemma":"هَاجَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71259,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(মধ্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71260,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথে","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71261,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71262,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَجِدْ","transliteration":"yajid","translation_bn":"সে পাবে","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71263,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71264,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71265,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُرَٰغَمًۭا","transliteration":"murāghaman","translation_bn":"আশ্রয়স্থল","root":"رغم","lemma":"مُرَٰغَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71266,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"অনেক","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71267,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَسَعَةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"wasaʿatan","translation_bn":"ও প্রাচুর্য","root":"وسع","lemma":"سَعَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71269,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71270,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَخْرُجْ","transliteration":"yakhruj","translation_bn":"বের হবে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71271,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71272,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بَيْتِهِۦ","transliteration":"baytihi","translation_bn":"তার ঘর","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71273,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُهَاجِرًا","transliteration":"muhājiran","translation_bn":"মুহাজির হয়ে","root":"هجر","lemma":"مُهَاجِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71274,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71275,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71276,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের (দিকে)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71277,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71278,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يُدْرِكْهُ","transliteration":"yud''rik''hu","translation_bn":"তাকে পাবে","root":"درك","lemma":"أَدْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71279,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتُ","transliteration":"l-mawtu","translation_bn":"মৃত্যু","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71280,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয় তবে","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":71281,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَقَعَ","transliteration":"waqaʿa","translation_bn":"(দায়িত্ব ভার) পড়ল","root":"وقع","lemma":"وَقَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71282,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرُهُۥ","transliteration":"ajruhu","translation_bn":"তার পুরস্কারের","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71283,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71284,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71286,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71287,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71288,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورًۭا","transliteration":"ghafūran","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71289,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمًۭا","transliteration":"raḥīman","translation_bn":"মেহেরবান","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71290,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"١٠٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman yuhājir fī sabīli l-lahi yajid fī l-arḍi murāghaman kathīran wasaʿatan waman yakhruj min baytihi muhājiran ilā l-lahi warasūlihi thumma yud''rik''hu l-mawtu faqad waqaʿa ajruhu ʿalā l-lahi wakāna l-lahu ghafūran raḥīman', 'যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহর পথে হিজরাত করবে, সে পৃথিবীতে বহু আশ্রয়স্থল এবং প্রাচুর্য প্রাপ্ত হবে; এবং যে ব্যক্তি নিজের গৃহ হতে আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের দিকে হিজরাত করে বের হয়, অতঃপর মৃত্যু তাকে পেয়ে বসে তার সাওয়াব আল্লাহর জিম্মায় সাব্যস্ত হয়ে গেছে এবং আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'And whoever emigrates for the cause of Allah will find on the earth many [alternative] locations and abundance. And whoever leaves his home as an emigrant to Allah and His Messenger and then death overtakes him - his reward has already become incumbent upon Allah. And Allah is ever Forgiving and Merciful.', 'যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহর পথে হিজরাত করবে, সে পৃথিবীতে বহু আশ্রয়স্থল এবং প্রাচুর্য প্রাপ্ত হবে; এবং যে ব্যক্তি নিজের গৃহ হতে আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের দিকে হিজরাত করে বের হয়, অতঃপর মৃত্যু তাকে পেয়ে বসে তার সাওয়াব আল্লাহর জিম্মায় সাব্যস্ত হয়ে গেছে এবং আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'And whoever emigrates for the cause of Allah will find on the earth many [alternative] locations and abundance. And whoever leaves his home as an emigrant to Allah and His Messenger and then death overtakes him - his reward has already become incumbent upon Allah. And Allah is ever Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004100.mp3', now()),
  (4, 101, '', '[{"id":71726,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71727,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ضَرَبْتُمْ","transliteration":"ḍarabtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা সফর কর","root":"ضرب","lemma":"ضَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71728,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(মধ্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71729,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"জমিনে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71730,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"falaysa","translation_bn":"নাই তখন","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":71731,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71732,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جُنَاحٌ","transliteration":"junāḥun","translation_bn":"কোন গুনাহ","root":"جنح","lemma":"جُنَاح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71733,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":71734,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَقْصُرُوا۟","transliteration":"taqṣurū","translation_bn":"তোমরা কসর করবে","root":"قصر","lemma":"تَقْصُرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71735,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71736,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ṣalati","translation_bn":"সলাতে","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71737,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":71738,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"خِفْتُمْ","transliteration":"khif''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় কর","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71739,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":71740,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتِنَكُمُ","transliteration":"yaftinakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের বিপদে ফেলবে","root":"فتن","lemma":"فَتَنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71741,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":71742,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوٓا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"কুফরী করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71744,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71745,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফিররা","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71746,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71747,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71748,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوًّۭا","transliteration":"ʿaduwwan","translation_bn":"শত্রু","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71749,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينًۭا","transliteration":"mubīnan","translation_bn":"প্রকাশ্য","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71750,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"١٠١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā ḍarabtum fī l-arḍi falaysa ʿalaykum junāḥun an taqṣurū mina l-ṣalati in khif''tum an yaftinakumu alladhīna kafarū inna l-kāfirīna kānū lakum ʿaduwwan mubīnan', 'যখন তোমরা দেশে-বিদেশে সফর কর, তখন নামায কসর করাতে তোমাদের কিছুমাত্র দোষ নেই, যদি তোমরা ভয় কর যে, কাফিরগণ তোমাদেরকে বিপদগ্রস্ত করবে। নিঃসন্দেহে কাফিরগণ তো তোমাদের প্রকাশ্য শত্রু।', 'And when you travel throughout the land, there is no blame upon you for shortening the prayer, [especially] if you fear that those who disbelieve may disrupt [or attack] you. Indeed, the disbelievers are ever to you a clear enemy.', 'যখন তোমরা দেশে-বিদেশে সফর কর, তখন নামায কসর করাতে তোমাদের কিছুমাত্র দোষ নেই, যদি তোমরা ভয় কর যে, কাফিরগণ তোমাদেরকে বিপদগ্রস্ত করবে। নিঃসন্দেহে কাফিরগণ তো তোমাদের প্রকাশ্য শত্রু।', 'And when you travel throughout the land, there is no blame upon you for shortening the prayer, [especially] if you fear that those who disbelieve may disrupt [or attack] you. Indeed, the disbelievers are ever to you a clear enemy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004101.mp3', now()),
