","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80840,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","transliteration":"ittakhadhū","translation_bn":"তারা গ্রহণ করেছিল","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80841,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِجْلَ","transliteration":"l-ʿij''la","translation_bn":"বাছুরকে (উপাস্যরূপে)","root":"عجل","lemma":"عِجْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80842,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80843,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"এরপরেও","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80844,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":80845,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْهُمُ","transliteration":"jāathumu","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে এসেছিল","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80846,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ","transliteration":"l-bayinātu","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণগুলো","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80847,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"فَعَفَوْنَا","transliteration":"faʿafawnā","translation_bn":"আমরা তবুও মাফ করেছিলাম","root":"عفو","lemma":"عَفَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80848,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80849,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ ۚ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":80851,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَيْنَا","transliteration":"waātaynā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা দিয়েছিলাম","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80852,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":80853,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"سُلْطَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"sul''ṭānan","translation_bn":"প্রমাণ","root":"سلط","lemma":"سُلْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80854,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينًۭا","transliteration":"mubīnan","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":80855,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"١٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yasaluka ahlu l-kitābi an tunazzila ʿalayhim kitāban mina l-samāi faqad sa-alū mūsā akbara min dhālika faqālū arinā l-laha jahratan fa-akhadhathumu l-ṣāʿiqatu biẓul''mihim thumma ittakhadhū l-ʿij''la min baʿdi mā jāathumu l-bayinātu faʿafawnā ʿan dhālika waātaynā mūsā sul''ṭānan mubīnan', 'কিতাবধারীগণ তোমাকে আসমান থেকে তাদের সামনে কিতাব নিয়ে আসতে বলে। তারা তো মূসার কাছে এর চেয়েও বড় দাবী পেশ করেছিল। তারা বলেছিল- আমাদেরকে প্রকাশ্যে আল্লাহকে দেখাও। তখন তাদের অন্যায় ও বাড়াবাড়ির কারণে বিদ্যুৎ তাদের উপর আঘাত হেনেছিল। অতঃপর তাদের কাছে স্পষ্ট প্রমাণ আসার পরেও তারা গো-বৎসকে (উপাস্য) গ্রহণ করেছিল, তাও আমি ক্ষমা করে দিয়েছিলাম, আর মূসাকে সুস্পষ্ট কর্তৃত্ব দান করেছিলাম।', 'The People of the Scripture ask you to bring down to them a book from the heaven. But they had asked of Moses [even] greater than that and said, "Show us Allah outright," so the thunderbolt struck them for their wrongdoing. Then they took the calf [for worship] after clear evidences had come to them, and We pardoned that. And We gave Moses a clear authority.', 'কিতাবধারীগণ তোমাকে আসমান থেকে তাদের সামনে কিতাব নিয়ে আসতে বলে। তারা তো মূসার কাছে এর চেয়েও বড় দাবী পেশ করেছিল। তারা বলেছিল- আমাদেরকে প্রকাশ্যে আল্লাহকে দেখাও। তখন তাদের অন্যায় ও বাড়াবাড়ির কারণে বিদ্যুৎ তাদের উপর আঘাত হেনেছিল। অতঃপর তাদের কাছে স্পষ্ট প্রমাণ আসার পরেও তারা গো-বৎসকে (উপাস্য) গ্রহণ করেছিল, তাও আমি ক্ষমা করে দিয়েছিলাম, আর মূসাকে সুস্পষ্ট কর্তৃত্ব দান করেছিলাম।', 'The People of the Scripture ask you to bring down to them a book from the heaven. But they had asked of Moses [even] greater than that and said, "Show us Allah outright," so the thunderbolt struck them for their wrongdoing. Then they took the calf [for worship] after clear evidences had come to them, and We pardoned that. And We gave Moses a clear authority.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004153.mp3', now()),
  (4, 154, '', '[{"id":80968,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَرَفَعْنَا","transliteration":"warafaʿnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা উঠিয়ে ছিলাম","root":"رفع","lemma":"رَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80969,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقَهُمُ","transliteration":"fawqahumu","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":80970,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطُّورَ","transliteration":"l-ṭūra","translation_bn":"তুর পাহাড়","root":"طور","lemma":"طُور","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80971,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِمِيثَـٰقِهِمْ","transliteration":"bimīthāqihim","translation_bn":"তাদের অঙ্গীকারের জন্য","root":"وثق","lemma":"مِّيثَٰق","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80972,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَقُلْنَا","transliteration":"waqul''nā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা বলেছিলাম","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80973,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80974,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْخُلُوا۟","transliteration":"ud''khulū","translation_bn":"''''প্রবেশ কর","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80975,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَابَ","transliteration":"l-bāba","translation_bn":"দরজায়","root":"بوب","lemma":"بَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80976,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سُجَّدًۭا","transliteration":"sujjadan","translation_bn":"নতশিরে''''","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَاجِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80977,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَقُلْنَا","transliteration":"waqul''nā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা বলেছিলাম","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80978,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80979,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"''''না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":80980,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَعْدُوا۟","transliteration":"taʿdū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করো","root":"عدو","lemma":"يَعْدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80981,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(বিধিনিষেধ) সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80982,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبْتِ","transliteration":"l-sabti","translation_bn":"শনিবারের''''","root":"سبت","lemma":"سَّبْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80983,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَأَخَذْنَا","transliteration":"wa-akhadhnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা নিয়েছিলাম","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80984,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُم","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80985,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِّيثَـٰقًا","transliteration":"mīthāqan","translation_bn":"অঙ্গীকার","root":"وثق","lemma":"مِّيثَٰق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80986,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"غَلِيظًۭا","transliteration":"ghalīẓan","translation_bn":"সুদৃঢ়","root":"غلظ","lemma":"غَلِيظ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":80987,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'warafaʿnā fawqahumu l-ṭūra bimīthāqihim waqul''nā lahumu ud''khulū l-bāba sujjadan waqul''nā lahum lā taʿdū fī l-sabti wa-akhadhnā min''hum mīthāqan ghalīẓan', 'তাদের নিকট হতে অঙ্গীকার গ্রহণের জন্য আমি তূর পাহাড়কে তাদের ঊর্ধ্বে তুলে ধরেছিলাম, আর তাদেরকে বলেছিলাম- অবনত মস্তকে (নগর) দ্বারে প্রবেশ কর আর তাদেরকে বলেছিলাম শনিবারের আইন ভঙ্গ করো না, আর তাদের নিকট থেকে নিয়েছিলাম পাকা প্রতিশ্রুতি।', 'And We raised over them the mount for [refusal of] their covenant; and We said to them, "Enter the gate bowing humbly", and We said to them, "Do not transgress on the sabbath", and We took from them a solemn covenant.', 'তাদের নিকট হতে অঙ্গীকার গ্রহণের জন্য আমি তূর পাহাড়কে তাদের ঊর্ধ্বে তুলে ধরেছিলাম, আর তাদেরকে বলেছিলাম- অবনত মস্তকে (নগর) দ্বারে প্রবেশ কর আর তাদেরকে বলেছিলাম শনিবারের আইন ভঙ্গ করো না, আর তাদের নিকট থেকে নিয়েছিলাম পাকা প্রতিশ্রুতি।', 'And We raised over them the mount for [refusal of] their covenant; and We said to them, "Enter the gate bowing humbly", and We said to them, "Do not transgress on the sabbath", and We took from them a solemn covenant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004154.mp3', now()),
  (4, 155, '', '[{"id":81179,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَبِمَا","transliteration":"fabimā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর কারণে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81180,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَقْضِهِم","transliteration":"naqḍihim","translation_bn":"তাদের ভঙ্গের","root":"نقض","lemma":"نَقْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81181,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّيثَـٰقَهُمْ","transliteration":"mīthāqahum","translation_bn":"তাদের অঙ্গীকার","root":"وثق","lemma":"مِّيثَٰق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81182,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَكُفْرِهِم","transliteration":"wakuf''rihim","translation_bn":"ও তাদের অস্বীকার করার","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81183,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"biāyāti","translation_bn":"আয়াতগুলোকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81184,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81185,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَقَتْلِهِمُ","transliteration":"waqatlihimu","translation_bn":"ও তাদের হত্যা করার","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81186,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنۢبِيَآءَ","transliteration":"l-anbiyāa","translation_bn":"নবীদেরকে","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81187,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"(অন্যভাবে)","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81188,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَقٍّۢ","transliteration":"ḥaqqin","translation_bn":"অন্যায়ভাবে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81189,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَقَوْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"waqawlihim","translation_bn":"ও তাদের এ উক্তির (কারণে যে)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81190,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبُنَا","transliteration":"qulūbunā","translation_bn":"''''আমাদের অন্তরগুলো","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81191,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"غُلْفٌۢ ۚ","transliteration":"ghul''fun","translation_bn":"আচ্ছাদিত (তারা অভিশপ্ত হয়)''''","root":"غلف","lemma":"غُلْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81193,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":81194,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"طَبَعَ","transliteration":"ṭabaʿa","translation_bn":"মোহর মেরে দিয়েছেন","root":"طبع","lemma":"طَبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81195,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81196,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81197,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِكُفْرِهِمْ","transliteration":"bikuf''rihim","translation_bn":"তাদের কুফরীর কারণে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81198,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তাই না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81199,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"তারা ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81200,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"তবে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":81201,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلًۭا","transliteration":"qalīlan","translation_bn":"অল্পসংখ্যক","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81202,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fabimā naqḍihim mīthāqahum wakuf''rihim biāyāti l-lahi waqatlihimu l-anbiyāa bighayri ḥaqqin waqawlihim qulūbunā ghul''fun bal ṭabaʿa l-lahu ʿalayhā bikuf''rihim falā yu''minūna illā qalīlan', '(তাদের প্রতি আল্লাহর অসন্তোষ নেমে এসেছে) তাদের ওয়া‘দা ভঙ্গের কারণে, আর আল্লাহর নিদর্শনসমূহকে অস্বীকার করার কারণে, অন্যায়ভাবে নাবীগণকে তাদের হত্যা করার কারণে, আর ‘আমাদের হৃদয়গুলো আচ্ছাদিত’ তাদের এ কথা বলার কারণে- বরং তাদের অস্বীকৃতির কারণে আল্লাহ তাদের হৃদয়গুলোতে মোহর মেরে দিয়েছেন। যে কারণে তাদের অল্পসংখ্যক ছাড়া ঈমান আনে না।', 'And [We cursed them] for their breaking of the covenant and their disbelief in the signs of Allah and their killing of the prophets without right and their saying, "Our hearts are wrapped". Rather, Allah has sealed them because of their disbelief, so they believe not, except for a few.', '(তাদের প্রতি আল্লাহর অসন্তোষ নেমে এসেছে) তাদের ওয়া‘দা ভঙ্গের কারণে, আর আল্লাহর নিদর্শনসমূহকে অস্বীকার করার কারণে, অন্যায়ভাবে নাবীগণকে তাদের হত্যা করার কারণে, আর ‘আমাদের হৃদয়গুলো আচ্ছাদিত’ তাদের এ কথা বলার কারণে- বরং তাদের অস্বীকৃতির কারণে আল্লাহ তাদের হৃদয়গুলোতে মোহর মেরে দিয়েছেন। যে কারণে তাদের অল্পসংখ্যক ছাড়া ঈমান আনে না।', 'And [We cursed them] for their breaking of the covenant and their disbelief in the signs of Allah and their killing of the prophets without right and their saying, "Our hearts are wrapped". Rather, Allah has sealed them because of their disbelief, so they believe not, except for a few.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004155.mp3', now()),
  (4, 156, '', '[{"id":81219,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَبِكُفْرِهِمْ","transliteration":"wabikuf''rihim","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের কুফরীর কারণে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81220,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَقَوْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"waqawlihim","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের উক্তির (কারণেও)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81221,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81222,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَرْيَمَ","transliteration":"maryama","translation_bn":"মারইয়ামের","root":"—","lemma":"مَرْيَم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81223,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بُهْتَـٰنًا","transliteration":"buh''tānan","translation_bn":"(যা ছিল) অপবাদ","root":"بهت","lemma":"بُهْتَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81224,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ʿaẓīman","translation_bn":"গুরুতর","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":81225,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wabikuf''rihim waqawlihim ʿalā maryama buh''tānan ʿaẓīman', '(তাদের প্রতি আল্লাহর অসন্তোষ নেমে এসেছে) তাদের কুফরীর জন্য আর মারইয়ামের প্রতি তাদের গুরুতর অপবাদপূর্ণ কথা উচ্চারণের জন্য।', 'And [We cursed them] for their disbelief and their saying against Mary a great slander,', '(তাদের প্রতি আল্লাহর অসন্তোষ নেমে এসেছে) তাদের কুফরীর জন্য আর মারইয়ামের প্রতি তাদের গুরুতর অপবাদপূর্ণ কথা উচ্চারণের জন্য।', 'And [We cursed them] for their disbelief and their saying against Mary a great slander,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004156.mp3', now()),
  (4, 157, '', '[{"id":81444,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَوْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"waqawlihim","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের উক্তি (এও যে)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81445,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"''''আমরা নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":81446,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَتَلْنَا","transliteration":"qatalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা হত্যা করেছি","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81447,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَسِيحَ","transliteration":"l-masīḥa","translation_bn":"মসীহকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَسِيح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81448,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِيسَى","transliteration":"ʿīsā","translation_bn":"(অর্থাৎ) ঈসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"عِيسَى","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81449,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْنَ","transliteration":"ib''na","translation_bn":"তনয়","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81450,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَرْيَمَ","transliteration":"maryama","translation_bn":"মারইয়ামের","root":"—","lemma":"مَرْيَم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81451,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولَ","transliteration":"rasūla","translation_bn":"(যিনি) রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81452,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর''''","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81453,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81454,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَتَلُوهُ","transliteration":"qatalūhu","translation_bn":"তাকে তারা হত্যা করেছে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81455,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81456,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"صَلَبُوهُ","transliteration":"ṣalabūhu","translation_bn":"তাকে তারা শুলে চড়িয়েছে","root":"صلب","lemma":"صَلَبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81457,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":81458,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شُبِّهَ","transliteration":"shubbiha","translation_bn":"বিভ্রম হয়েছিল","root":"شبه","lemma":"شُبِّهَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81459,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81461,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81462,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":81463,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟","transliteration":"ikh''talafū","translation_bn":"মতভেদ করেছিল","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81464,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"সে বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81465,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَفِى","transliteration":"lafī","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মধ্যে আছে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":81466,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"شَكٍّۢ","transliteration":"shakkin","translation_bn":"সন্দেহের","root":"شكك","lemma":"شَكّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81467,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ ۚ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81469,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":81470,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের আছে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81471,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"এ সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81472,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81473,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81474,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":81475,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ٱتِّبَاعَ","transliteration":"ittibāʿa","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتِّبَاع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81476,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّنِّ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ẓani","translation_bn":"অনুমানের","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81478,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81479,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"قَتَلُوهُ","transliteration":"qatalūhu","translation_bn":"তাকে তারা হত্যা করেছে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81480,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"يَقِينًۢا","transliteration":"yaqīnan","translation_bn":"নিঃসন্দেহে","root":"يقن","lemma":"يَقِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81481,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"١٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqawlihim innā qatalnā l-masīḥa ʿīsā ib''na maryama rasūla l-lahi wamā qatalūhu wamā ṣalabūhu walākin shubbiha lahum wa-inna alladhīna ikh''talafū fīhi lafī shakkin min''hu mā lahum bihi min ʿil''min illā ittibāʿa l-ẓani wamā qatalūhu yaqīnan', 'আর ‘আমরা আল্লাহর রসূল মাসীহ ঈসা ইবনু মারইয়ামকে হত্যা করেছি’ তাদের এ উক্তির জন্য। কিন্তু তারা না তাকে হত্যা করেছে, না তাকে ক্রুশবিদ্ধ করেছে, কেবলমাত্র তাদের জন্য (এক লোককে) তার সদৃশ করা হয়েছিল, আর যারা এ বিষয়ে মতভেদ করেছিল তারাও এ সম্পর্কে সন্দেহে পতিত হয়েছিল। শুধু অমূলক ধারণার অনুসরণ ছাড়া এ ব্যাপারে তাদের কোন জ্ঞানই ছিল না। এটা নিশ্চিত সত্য যে, তারা তাকে হত্যা করেনি।', 'And [for] their saying, "Indeed, we have killed the Messiah, Jesus, the son of Mary, the messenger of Allah." And they did not kill him, nor did they crucify him; but [another] was made to resemble him to them. And indeed, those who differ over it are in doubt about it. They have no knowledge of it except the following of assumption. And they did not kill him, for certain.', 'আর ‘আমরা আল্লাহর রসূল মাসীহ ঈসা ইবনু মারইয়ামকে হত্যা করেছি’ তাদের এ উক্তির জন্য। কিন্তু তারা না তাকে হত্যা করেছে, না তাকে ক্রুশবিদ্ধ করেছে, কেবলমাত্র তাদের জন্য (এক লোককে) তার সদৃশ করা হয়েছিল, আর যারা এ বিষয়ে মতভেদ করেছিল তারাও এ সম্পর্কে সন্দেহে পতিত হয়েছিল। শুধু অমূলক ধারণার অনুসরণ ছাড়া এ ব্যাপারে তাদের কোন জ্ঞানই ছিল না। এটা নিশ্চিত সত্য যে, তারা তাকে হত্যা করেনি।', 'And [for] their saying, "Indeed, we have killed the Messiah, Jesus, the son of Mary, the messenger of Allah." And they did not kill him, nor did they crucify him; but [another] was made to resemble him to them. And indeed, those who differ over it are in doubt about it. They have no knowledge of it except the following of assumption. And they did not kill him, for certain.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004157.mp3', now()),
  (4, 158, '', '[{"id":81529,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"بَل","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":81530,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَّفَعَهُ","transliteration":"rafaʿahu","translation_bn":"তাকে উঠিয়ে নেন","root":"رفع","lemma":"رَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81531,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81532,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ ۚ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81534,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81535,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81536,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزًا","transliteration":"ʿazīzan","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81537,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ḥakīman","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":81538,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'bal rafaʿahu l-lahu ilayhi wakāna l-lahu ʿazīzan ḥakīman', 'বরং আল্লাহ তাকে নিজের কাছে উঠিয়ে নিয়েছেন, আর আল্লাহ হলেন মহাপরাক্রমশালী, মহাবিজ্ঞানী।', 'Rather, Allah raised him to Himself. And ever is Allah Exalted in Might and Wise.', 'বরং আল্লাহ তাকে নিজের কাছে উঠিয়ে নিয়েছেন, আর আল্লাহ হলেন মহাপরাক্রমশালী, মহাবিজ্ঞানী।', 'Rather, Allah raised him to Himself. And ever is Allah Exalted in Might and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004158.mp3', now()),
  (4, 159, '', '[{"id":81685,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং না (আছে এমন কেউ)","root":"—","lemma":"إِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81686,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81687,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِ","transliteration":"ahli","translation_bn":"আহলি","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81688,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবদের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81689,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":81690,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَيُؤْمِنَنَّ","transliteration":"layu''minanna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবে অবশ্য","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":81691,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81692,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَ","transliteration":"qabla","translation_bn":"পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":81693,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَوْتِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"mawtihi","translation_bn":"তার মৃত্যুর","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81695,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81696,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"কিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81697,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونُ","transliteration":"yakūnu","translation_bn":"সে হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81698,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81699,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًۭا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81700,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in min ahli l-kitābi illā layu''minanna bihi qabla mawtihi wayawma l-qiyāmati yakūnu ʿalayhim shahīdan', 'কিতাবওয়ালাদের মধ্যে এমন কেউ নেই যে, তার মৃত্যুর পূর্বে তার প্রতি অবশ্যই ঈমান আনবে না, আর ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন সে তাদের বিরুদ্ধে সাক্ষ্য দেবে।', 'And there is none from the People of the Scripture but that he will surely believe in Jesus before his death. And on the Day of Resurrection he will be against them a witness.', 'কিতাবওয়ালাদের মধ্যে এমন কেউ নেই যে, তার মৃত্যুর পূর্বে তার প্রতি অবশ্যই ঈমান আনবে না, আর ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন সে তাদের বিরুদ্ধে সাক্ষ্য দেবে।', 'And there is none from the People of the Scripture but that he will surely believe in Jesus before his death. And on the Day of Resurrection he will be against them a witness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004159.mp3', now()),
  (4, 160, '', '[{"id":81853,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَبِظُلْمٍۢ","transliteration":"fabiẓul''min","translation_bn":"তাই জুলুমের কারণে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81854,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"(তাদের) মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81855,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":81856,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَادُوا۟","transliteration":"hādū","translation_bn":"ইহুদী রয়েছে","root":"هود","lemma":"هَادُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81857,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمْنَا","transliteration":"ḥarramnā","translation_bn":"আমরা নিষিদ্ধ করেছিলাম","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81858,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81859,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"طَيِّبَـٰتٍ","transliteration":"ṭayyibātin","translation_bn":"পবিত্র বস্তুগুলোকে (যা)","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّبَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81860,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أُحِلَّتْ","transliteration":"uḥillat","translation_bn":"বৈধ করা হয়েছিল (পূর্বে)","root":"حلل","lemma":"أَحَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81861,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81862,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَبِصَدِّهِمْ","transliteration":"wabiṣaddihim","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের বাধাদানের কারণেও","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81863,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81864,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81865,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81866,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"অনেককে","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":81867,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fabiẓul''min mina alladhīna hādū ḥarramnā ʿalayhim ṭayyibātin uḥillat lahum wabiṣaddihim ʿan sabīli l-lahi kathīran', 'আমি ইয়াহূদীদের জন্য পবিত্র বস্তুসমূহ যা তাদের জন্য হালাল ছিল, তা হারাম করে দিয়েছি তাদের বাড়াবাড়ির কারণে আর বহু লোককে আল্লাহর পথে তাদের বাধা দেয়ার কারণে।', 'For wrongdoing on the part of the Jews, We made unlawful for them [certain] good foods which had been lawful to them, and for their averting from the way of Allah many [people],', 'আমি ইয়াহূদীদের জন্য পবিত্র বস্তুসমূহ যা তাদের জন্য হালাল ছিল, তা হারাম করে দিয়েছি তাদের বাড়াবাড়ির কারণে আর বহু লোককে আল্লাহর পথে তাদের বাধা দেয়ার কারণে।', 'For wrongdoing on the part of the Jews, We made unlawful for them [certain] good foods which had been lawful to them, and for their averting from the way of Allah many [people],', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004160.mp3', now()),
  (4, 161, '', '[{"id":81868,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَخْذِهِمُ","transliteration":"wa-akhdhihimu","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের গ্রহণেরও (কারণে)","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخْذ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81869,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّبَوٰا۟","transliteration":"l-riba","translation_bn":"সুদ","root":"ربو","lemma":"رِّبَوٰا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81870,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"ও নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81871,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نُهُوا۟","transliteration":"nuhū","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে মানা করা হয়েছিল","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81872,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُ","transliteration":"ʿanhu","translation_bn":"তা থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81873,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَكْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"wa-aklihim","translation_bn":"ও তাদের খাওয়ার (জন্য)","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81874,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلَ","transliteration":"amwāla","translation_bn":"মালসমূহ","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81875,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81876,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَـٰطِلِ ۚ","transliteration":"bil-bāṭili","translation_bn":"অন্যায়ভাবে (এ কঠোরতা দিয়েছিলাম)","root":"بطل","lemma":"بَٰطِل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81878,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَأَعْتَدْنَا","transliteration":"wa-aʿtadnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছি","root":"عتد","lemma":"أَعْتَدَتْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81879,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"lil''kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফিরদের জন্য","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81880,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81881,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابًا","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81882,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمًۭا","transliteration":"alīman","translation_bn":"মর্মন্তুদ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":81883,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-akhdhihimu l-riba waqad nuhū ʿanhu wa-aklihim amwāla l-nāsi bil-bāṭili wa-aʿtadnā lil''kāfirīna min''hum ʿadhāban alīman', 'এবং তাদের সুদ গ্রহণের কারণে যদিও তাত্থেকে তাদেরকে নিষেধ করা হয়েছিল এবং তাদের অন্যায়ভাবে লোকেদের ধন-সম্পদ গ্রাস করার কারণে এবং আমি তাদের মাঝে যারা অবিশ্বাসী তাদের জন্যে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তি প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছি।', 'And [for] their taking of usury while they had been forbidden from it, and their consuming of the people''s wealth unjustly. And we have prepared for the disbelievers among them a painful punishment.', 'এবং তাদের সুদ গ্রহণের কারণে যদিও তাত্থেকে তাদেরকে নিষেধ করা হয়েছিল এবং তাদের অন্যায়ভাবে লোকেদের ধন-সম্পদ গ্রাস করার কারণে এবং আমি তাদের মাঝে যারা অবিশ্বাসী তাদের জন্যে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তি প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছি।', 'And [for] their taking of usury while they had been forbidden from it, and their consuming of the people''s wealth unjustly. And we have prepared for the disbelievers among them a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004161.mp3', now()),
  (4, 162, '', '[{"id":82012,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّـٰكِنِ","transliteration":"lākini","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংশোধন পদ (Amendment)"},{"id":82013,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّٰسِخُونَ","transliteration":"l-rāsikhūna","translation_bn":"সুগভীর ব্যক্তিরা","root":"رسخ","lemma":"رَّٰسِخُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82014,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(মধ্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82015,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِلْمِ","transliteration":"l-ʿil''mi","translation_bn":"জ্ঞানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82016,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের মধ্যকার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82017,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"wal-mu''minūna","translation_bn":"ও মু''মিনরা","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82018,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82019,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"(ঐবিষয়ে) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82020,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"নাযিল করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82021,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82022,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82023,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"নাযিল করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82024,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82025,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ ۚ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"তোমার পূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82027,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُقِيمِينَ","transliteration":"wal-muqīmīna","translation_bn":"এবং (তারা) প্রতিষ্ঠাকারীরা","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّقِيم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82028,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সলাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82030,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُؤْتُونَ","transliteration":"wal-mu''tūna","translation_bn":"ও (তারা) আদায়কারী","root":"اتي","lemma":"مُؤْتُون","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82031,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-zakata","translation_bn":"জাকাত","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82032,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"wal-mu''minūna","translation_bn":"ও (তারা) ঈমানদার","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82033,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82034,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","translation_bn":"ও দিনের (উপর)","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82035,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","translation_bn":"আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82036,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোকদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":82037,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"سَنُؤْتِيهِمْ","transliteration":"sanu''tīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের দিব আমরা","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":82038,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرًا","transliteration":"ajran","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82039,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمًا","transliteration":"ʿaẓīman","translation_bn":"বিরাট","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":82040,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"١٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lākini l-rāsikhūna fī l-ʿil''mi min''hum wal-mu''minūna yu''minūna bimā unzila ilayka wamā unzila min qablika wal-muqīmīna l-ṣalata wal-mu''tūna l-zakata wal-mu''minūna bil-lahi wal-yawmi l-ākhiri ulāika sanu''tīhim ajran ʿaẓīman', 'কিন্তু তাদের মধ্যে যারা জ্ঞানে পরিপক্ক আর মু’মিনগণ তোমার প্রতি যা অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে আর তোমার পূর্বে যা অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তাতে বিশ্বাস স্থাপন করে আর তারা নামায ক্বায়িমকারী ও যাকাত আদায়কারী এবং আল্লাহ্তে ও শেষ দিনের প্রতি বিশ্বাসী; এদেরকেই আমি শীঘ্র মহাপুরস্কার দান করব।', 'But those firm in knowledge among them and the believers believe in what has been revealed to you, [O Muhammad], and what was revealed before you. And the establishers of prayer [especially] and the givers of zakah and the believers in Allah and the Last Day - those We will give a great reward.', 'কিন্তু তাদের মধ্যে যারা জ্ঞানে পরিপক্ক আর মু’মিনগণ তোমার প্রতি যা অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে আর তোমার পূর্বে যা অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তাতে বিশ্বাস স্থাপন করে আর তারা নামায ক্বায়িমকারী ও যাকাত আদায়কারী এবং আল্লাহ্তে ও শেষ দিনের প্রতি বিশ্বাসী; এদেরকেই আমি শীঘ্র মহাপুরস্কার দান করব।', 'But those firm in knowledge among them and the believers believe in what has been revealed to you, [O Muhammad], and what was revealed before you. And the establishers of prayer [especially] and the givers of zakah and the believers in Allah and the Last Day - those We will give a great reward.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004162.mp3', now()),
  (4, 163, '', '[{"id":82068,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّآ","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"(হে নবী) আমরা নিশ্চয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":82069,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","transliteration":"awḥaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা ওহী পাঠিয়েছি","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82070,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82071,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَمَآ","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82072,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَوْحَيْنَآ","transliteration":"awḥaynā","translation_bn":"আমরা ওহী পাঠিয়েছি","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82073,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82074,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نُوحٍۢ","transliteration":"nūḥin","translation_bn":"নূহের","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82075,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ","transliteration":"wal-nabiyīna","translation_bn":"ও নবীদের","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82076,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82077,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"baʿdihi","translation_bn":"তার","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82079,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَوْحَيْنَآ","transliteration":"wa-awḥaynā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা ওহী পাঠিয়েছি","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82080,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82081,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীমের","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82082,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ","transliteration":"wa-is''māʿīla","translation_bn":"ও ইসমাঈলের","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْمَاعِيل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82083,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَإِسْحَـٰقَ","transliteration":"wa-is''ḥāqa","translation_bn":"ও ইসহাকের","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْحَاق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82084,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْقُوبَ","transliteration":"wayaʿqūba","translation_bn":"ও ইয়াকুবের","root":"—","lemma":"يَعْقُوب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82085,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَسْبَاطِ","transliteration":"wal-asbāṭi","translation_bn":"ও (তার) বংশধরদের (প্রতি)","root":"سبط","lemma":"أَسْبَاط","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82086,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَعِيسَىٰ","transliteration":"waʿīsā","translation_bn":"ও ঈসার","root":"—","lemma":"عِيسَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82087,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَأَيُّوبَ","transliteration":"wa-ayyūba","translation_bn":"ও আইয়ুবের","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّوب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82088,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَيُونُسَ","transliteration":"wayūnusa","translation_bn":"ও ইউনুসের","root":"—","lemma":"يُونُس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82089,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰرُونَ","transliteration":"wahārūna","translation_bn":"ও হারুনের","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰرُون","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82090,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَسُلَيْمَـٰنَ ۚ","transliteration":"wasulaymāna","translation_bn":"ও সুলাইমানের (প্রতি)","root":"—","lemma":"سُلَيْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82092,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتَيْنَا","transliteration":"waātaynā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা দিয়েছি","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82093,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"دَاوُۥدَ","transliteration":"dāwūda","translation_bn":"দাঊদকে","root":"—","lemma":"دَاوُد","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82094,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"زَبُورًۭا","transliteration":"zabūran","translation_bn":"যাবুর","root":"زبر","lemma":"زَبُور","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82095,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"١٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innā awḥaynā ilayka kamā awḥaynā ilā nūḥin wal-nabiyīna min baʿdihi wa-awḥaynā ilā ib''rāhīma wa-is''māʿīla wa-is''ḥāqa wayaʿqūba wal-asbāṭi waʿīsā wa-ayyūba wayūnusa wahārūna wasulaymāna waātaynā dāwūda zabūran', 'আমি তোমার কাছে ওয়াহী পাঠিয়েছি যেমন নূহ ও তার আগের নাবীগণের নিকট ওয়াহী পাঠিয়েছিলাম, আর ইবরাহীম, ইসমাঈল, ইসহাক, ইয়াকুব ও তার বংশধর আর ঈসা, আইয়ূব, ইউনুস, হারূন ও সুলায়মানের নিকটও ওয়াহী পাঠিয়েছিলাম আর আমি দাঊদকে যাবূর প্রদান করেছিলাম।', 'Indeed, We have revealed to you, [O Muhammad], as We revealed to Noah and the prophets after him. And we revealed to Abraham, Ishmael, Isaac, Jacob, the Descendants, Jesus, Job, Jonah, Aaron, and Solomon, and to David We gave the book [of Psalms].', 'আমি তোমার কাছে ওয়াহী পাঠিয়েছি যেমন নূহ ও তার আগের নাবীগণের নিকট ওয়াহী পাঠিয়েছিলাম, আর ইবরাহীম, ইসমাঈল, ইসহাক, ইয়াকুব ও তার বংশধর আর ঈসা, আইয়ূব, ইউনুস, হারূন ও সুলায়মানের নিকটও ওয়াহী পাঠিয়েছিলাম আর আমি দাঊদকে যাবূর প্রদান করেছিলাম।', 'Indeed, We have revealed to you, [O Muhammad], as We revealed to Noah and the prophets after him. And we revealed to Abraham, Ishmael, Isaac, Jacob, the Descendants, Jesus, Job, Jonah, Aaron, and Solomon, and to David We gave the book [of Psalms].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004163.mp3', now()),
  (4, 164, '', '[{"id":82200,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَرُسُلًۭا","transliteration":"warusulan","translation_bn":"এবং (এসব) রাসূলদেরকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82201,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":82202,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَصَصْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"qaṣaṣnāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের আমরা বর্ণনা করেছি","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82203,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82204,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82205,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"ইতিপূর্বে","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82206,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَرُسُلًۭا","transliteration":"warusulan","translation_bn":"এবং (এমন সব) রাসূলও (ছিলেন)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82207,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":82208,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نَقْصُصْهُمْ","transliteration":"naqṣuṣ''hum","translation_bn":"তাদের আমরা বর্ণনা করেছি","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82209,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82211,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَكَلَّمَ","transliteration":"wakallama","translation_bn":"এবং কথা বলেছেন","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلَّمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82212,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82213,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসার (সাথে)","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82214,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَكْلِيمًۭا","transliteration":"taklīman","translation_bn":"(সরাসরি) কথাবার্তা","root":"كلم","lemma":"تَكْلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82215,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'warusulan qad qaṣaṣnāhum ʿalayka min qablu warusulan lam naqṣuṣ''hum ʿalayka wakallama l-lahu mūsā taklīman', 'আমি সেই রসূলদের প্রতিও ওয়াহী পাঠিয়েছি যাদের সম্পর্কে আমি তোমাকে আগেই বলেছি, আর অনেক রসূল যাদের কথা আমি তোমাকে বলিনি। আর আল্লাহ মূসার সাথে কথা বলেছেন সরাসরি।', 'And [We sent] messengers about whom We have related [their stories] to you before and messengers about whom We have not related to you. And Allah spoke to Moses with [direct] speech.', 'আমি সেই রসূলদের প্রতিও ওয়াহী পাঠিয়েছি যাদের সম্পর্কে আমি তোমাকে আগেই বলেছি, আর অনেক রসূল যাদের কথা আমি তোমাকে বলিনি। আর আল্লাহ মূসার সাথে কথা বলেছেন সরাসরি।', 'And [We sent] messengers about whom We have related [their stories] to you before and messengers about whom We have not related to you. And Allah spoke to Moses with [direct] speech.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004164.mp3', now()),
  (4, 165, '', '[{"id":82333,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رُّسُلًۭا","transliteration":"rusulan","translation_bn":"(এসব) রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82334,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُّبَشِّرِينَ","transliteration":"mubashirīna","translation_bn":"সুসংবাদদাতা","root":"بشر","lemma":"مُبَشِّر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82335,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَمُنذِرِينَ","transliteration":"wamundhirīna","translation_bn":"ও সতর্ককারী (ছিলেন)","root":"نذر","lemma":"مُنذِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82336,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِئَلَّا","transliteration":"li-allā","translation_bn":"না যেন","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82337,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونَ","transliteration":"yakūna","translation_bn":"থাকে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82338,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"লোকদের জন্য","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82339,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82340,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82341,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"حُجَّةٌۢ","transliteration":"ḥujjatun","translation_bn":"কোন যুক্তি","root":"حجج","lemma":"حُجَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82342,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":82343,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرُّسُلِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-rusuli","translation_bn":"রাসূলদের (আগমনের)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82345,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82346,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82347,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزًا","transliteration":"ʿazīzan","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82348,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ḥakīman","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":82349,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rusulan mubashirīna wamundhirīna li-allā yakūna lilnnāsi ʿalā l-lahi ḥujjatun baʿda l-rusuli wakāna l-lahu ʿazīzan ḥakīman', 'রসূলগণ ছিলেন সুসংবাদদাতা ও সতর্ককারী যাতে রসূলদের আগমনের পর আল্লাহর বিরুদ্ধে মানুষের কোন অযুহাতের সুযোগ না থাকে। আল্লাহ হলেন মহাপরাক্রমশালী, বিজ্ঞানময়।', '[We sent] messengers as bringers of good tidings and warners so that mankind will have no argument against Allah after the messengers. And ever is Allah Exalted in Might and Wise.', 'রসূলগণ ছিলেন সুসংবাদদাতা ও সতর্ককারী যাতে রসূলদের আগমনের পর আল্লাহর বিরুদ্ধে মানুষের কোন অযুহাতের সুযোগ না থাকে। আল্লাহ হলেন মহাপরাক্রমশালী, বিজ্ঞানময়।', '[We sent] messengers as bringers of good tidings and warners so that mankind will have no argument against Allah after the messengers. And ever is Allah Exalted in Might and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004165.mp3', now()),
  (4, 166, '', '[{"id":82505,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّـٰكِنِ","transliteration":"lākini","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংশোধন পদ (Amendment)"},{"id":82506,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82507,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَشْهَدُ","transliteration":"yashhadu","translation_bn":"সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছেন","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82508,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"(ঐ বিষয়ে) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82509,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"নাযিল করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82510,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82512,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"anzalahu","translation_bn":"তা তিনি নাযিল করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82513,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِعِلْمِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"biʿil''mihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর জ্ঞানের ভিত্তিতে","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82515,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"wal-malāikatu","translation_bn":"এবং ফেরেশতারাও","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":82516,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَشْهَدُونَ ۚ","transliteration":"yashhadūna","translation_bn":"সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছে","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82518,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَكَفَىٰ","transliteration":"wakafā","translation_bn":"এবং যথেষ্ট","root":"كفي","lemma":"كَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82519,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82520,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী হিসেবে","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82521,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lākini l-lahu yashhadu bimā anzala ilayka anzalahu biʿil''mihi wal-malāikatu yashhadūna wakafā bil-lahi shahīdan', 'কিন্তু আল্লাহ সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছেন যে, যা তিনি নাযিল করেছেন তা তাঁর জ্ঞানের ভিত্তিতেই নাযিল করেছেন। ফেরেশতারাও সে সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছে আর সাক্ষী হিসেবে আল্লাহ্ই যথেষ্ট।', 'But Allah bears witness to that which He has revealed to you. He has sent it down with His knowledge, and the angels bear witness [as well]. And sufficient is Allah as Witness.', 'কিন্তু আল্লাহ সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছেন যে, যা তিনি নাযিল করেছেন তা তাঁর জ্ঞানের ভিত্তিতেই নাযিল করেছেন। ফেরেশতারাও সে সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছে আর সাক্ষী হিসেবে আল্লাহ্ই যথেষ্ট।', 'But Allah bears witness to that which He has revealed to you. He has sent it down with His knowledge, and the angels bear witness [as well]. And sufficient is Allah as Witness.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004166.mp3', now()),
  (4, 167, '', '[{"id":82531,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":82532,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":82533,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"কুফরী করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82534,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَصَدُّوا۟","transliteration":"waṣaddū","translation_bn":"ও বাধা দিয়েছে","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82535,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82536,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82537,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82538,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":82539,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ضَلُّوا۟","transliteration":"ḍallū","translation_bn":"তারা পথভ্রষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82540,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلًۢا","transliteration":"ḍalālan","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্টতায়","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82541,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعِيدًا","transliteration":"baʿīdan","translation_bn":"বহুদূরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":82542,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna kafarū waṣaddū ʿan sabīli l-lahi qad ḍallū ḍalālan baʿīdan', 'যারা কুফরী করে আর লোকেদেরকে আল্লাহর পথ হতে ফিরিয়ে রাখে তারা চরম পথভ্রষ্টতায় পথভ্রষ্ট হয়ে গেছে।', 'Indeed, those who disbelieve and avert [people] from the way of Allah have certainly gone far astray.', 'যারা কুফরী করে আর লোকেদেরকে আল্লাহর পথ হতে ফিরিয়ে রাখে তারা চরম পথভ্রষ্টতায় পথভ্রষ্ট হয়ে গেছে।', 'Indeed, those who disbelieve and avert [people] from the way of Allah have certainly gone far astray.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004167.mp3', now()),
  (4, 168, '', '[{"id":82658,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":82659,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":82660,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"কুফরী করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82661,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"waẓalamū","translation_bn":"ও জুলুম করেছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82662,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":82663,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَكُنِ","transliteration":"yakuni","translation_bn":"হবেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82664,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (এমন যে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82665,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِيَغْفِرَ","transliteration":"liyaghfira","translation_bn":"মাফ করবেন","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82666,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82667,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82668,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِيَهْدِيَهُمْ","transliteration":"liyahdiyahum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে হিদায়াত দিবেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82669,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"طَرِيقًا","transliteration":"ṭarīqan","translation_bn":"(সঠিক) পথের","root":"طرق","lemma":"طَرِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82670,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna kafarū waẓalamū lam yakuni l-lahu liyaghfira lahum walā liyahdiyahum ṭarīqan', 'যারা কুফরী করেছে আর বাড়াবাড়ি করেছে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে ক্ষমা করবেন না, তাদেরকে কোন পথও দেখাবেন না।', 'Indeed, those who disbelieve and commit wrong [or injustice] - never will Allah forgive them, nor will He guide them to a path.', 'যারা কুফরী করেছে আর বাড়াবাড়ি করেছে, আল্লাহ তাদেরকে ক্ষমা করবেন না, তাদেরকে কোন পথও দেখাবেন না।', 'Indeed, those who disbelieve and commit wrong [or injustice] - never will Allah forgive them, nor will He guide them to a path.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004168.mp3', now()),
  (4, 169, '', '[{"id":82719,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":82720,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"طَرِيقَ","transliteration":"ṭarīqa","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"طرق","lemma":"طَرِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82721,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82722,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"অবস্থানকারী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82723,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَآ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82724,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَبَدًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"abadan","translation_bn":"চিরকাল","root":"ابد","lemma":"أَبَدًا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":82726,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82727,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":82728,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82729,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82730,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَسِيرًۭا","transliteration":"yasīran","translation_bn":"সহজ","root":"يسر","lemma":"يَسِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82731,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'illā ṭarīqa jahannama khālidīna fīhā abadan wakāna dhālika ʿalā l-lahi yasīran', 'জাহান্নামের পথ ছাড়া, যাতে তারা চিরকালের জন্য স্থায়ী হবে, আর এটা আল্লাহর জন্য সহজ।', 'Except the path of Hell; they will abide therein forever. And that, for Allah, is [always] easy.', 'জাহান্নামের পথ ছাড়া, যাতে তারা চিরকালের জন্য স্থায়ী হবে, আর এটা আল্লাহর জন্য সহজ।', 'Except the path of Hell; they will abide therein forever. And that, for Allah, is [always] easy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004169.mp3', now()),
  (4, 170, '', '[{"id":82873,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":82874,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"লোকেরা","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82875,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":82876,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكُمُ","transliteration":"jāakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82877,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولُ","transliteration":"l-rasūlu","translation_bn":"রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82878,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্য সহকারে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82879,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82880,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82881,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَـَٔامِنُوا۟","transliteration":"faāminū","translation_bn":"তোমরা অতএব ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82882,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"(এটাই) উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":82883,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82885,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"আর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82886,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَكْفُرُوا۟","transliteration":"takfurū","translation_bn":"তোমরা অস্বীকার কর","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82887,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয় তবে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":82888,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহরই জন্য","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82889,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":82890,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82891,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আসমানসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82892,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীতে","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82894,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانَ","transliteration":"wakāna","translation_bn":"এবং হলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82895,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82896,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمًا","transliteration":"ʿalīman","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82897,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمًۭا","transliteration":"ḥakīman","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":82898,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"١٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nāsu qad jāakumu l-rasūlu bil-ḥaqi min rabbikum faāminū khayran lakum wa-in takfurū fa-inna lillahi mā fī l-samāwāti wal-arḍi wakāna l-lahu ʿalīman ḥakīman', 'হে মানুষ! রসূল তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে সত্য বিধান নিয়ে এসেছে, কাজেই তোমরা ঈমান আন, এটা তোমাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর হবে, আর যদি কুফরী কর (তাহলে জেনে রেখ) আকাশসমূহে আর যমীনে যা কিছু আছে সবই আল্লাহর আর আল্লাহ হলেন সর্বজ্ঞ, মহা কুশলী।', 'O Mankind, the Messenger has come to you with the truth from your Lord, so believe; it is better for you. But if you disbelieve - then indeed, to Allah belongs whatever is in the heavens and earth. And ever is Allah Knowing and Wise.', 'হে মানুষ! রসূল তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে সত্য বিধান নিয়ে এসেছে, কাজেই তোমরা ঈমান আন, এটা তোমাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর হবে, আর যদি কুফরী কর (তাহলে জেনে রেখ) আকাশসমূহে আর যমীনে যা কিছু আছে সবই আল্লাহর আর আল্লাহ হলেন সর্বজ্ঞ, মহা কুশলী।', 'O Mankind, the Messenger has come to you with the truth from your Lord, so believe; it is better for you. But if you disbelieve - then indeed, to Allah belongs whatever is in the heavens and earth. And ever is Allah Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004170.mp3', now()),
  (4, 171, '', '[{"id":82924,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","transliteration":"yāahla","translation_bn":"হে আহলি","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":82925,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82926,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":82927,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَغْلُوا۟","transliteration":"taghlū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বাড়াবাড়ি করো","root":"غلو","lemma":"تَغْلُو","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82928,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82929,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دِينِكُمْ","transliteration":"dīnikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের দ্বীনের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82930,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82931,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"taqūlū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82932,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82933,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82934,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া যা","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":82935,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقَّ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","translation_bn":"হক","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82937,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলত","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":82938,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَسِيحُ","transliteration":"l-masīḥu","translation_bn":"মসীহ","root":"—","lemma":"مَسِيح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82939,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عِيسَى","transliteration":"ʿīsā","translation_bn":"ঈসা","root":"—","lemma":"عِيسَى","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82940,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱبْنُ","transliteration":"ub''nu","translation_bn":"পুত্র","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82941,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَرْيَمَ","transliteration":"maryama","translation_bn":"মারইয়ামের","root":"—","lemma":"مَرْيَم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82942,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولُ","transliteration":"rasūlu","translation_bn":"(তিনি ছিলেন) রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82943,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82944,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَكَلِمَتُهُۥٓ","transliteration":"wakalimatuhu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর ফরমান","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82945,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَلْقَىٰهَآ","transliteration":"alqāhā","translation_bn":"যা তিনি প্রেরণ করেন","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82946,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82947,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مَرْيَمَ","transliteration":"maryama","translation_bn":"মারইয়ামের","root":"—","lemma":"مَرْيَم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82948,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَرُوحٌۭ","transliteration":"warūḥun","translation_bn":"ও রূহ","root":"روح","lemma":"رُوح","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82949,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ ۖ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তাঁর পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82951,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فَـَٔامِنُوا۟","transliteration":"faāminū","translation_bn":"তোমরা অতএব ঈমান আন","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82952,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82953,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"وَرُسُلِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"warusulihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলদের (উপর)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82955,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82956,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"تَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"taqūlū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82957,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ثَلَـٰثَةٌ ۚ","transliteration":"thalāthatun","translation_bn":"''''তিন (ইলাহ)''''","root":"ثلث","lemma":"ثَلَٰثَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82959,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱنتَهُوا۟","transliteration":"intahū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিরত হও","root":"نهي","lemma":"ٱنتَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82960,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"(এটাই) উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82961,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82963,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলত","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":82964,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82965,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٌۭ","transliteration":"ilāhun","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82966,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"wāḥidun","translation_bn":"একই","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82968,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"sub''ḥānahu","translation_bn":"তিনি পবিত্র","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82969,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এ হতে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":82970,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونَ","transliteration":"yakūna","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82971,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82972,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدٌۭ ۘ","transliteration":"waladun","translation_bn":"কোন সন্তান","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82974,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তারই","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82975,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু আছে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":82976,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82977,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আসমানসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82978,"position":48,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"ও যা কিছু (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82979,"position":49,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82980,"position":50,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82982,"position":51,"text_uthmani":"وَكَفَىٰ","transliteration":"wakafā","translation_bn":"এবং যথেষ্ট","root":"كفي","lemma":"كَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82983,"position":52,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82984,"position":53,"text_uthmani":"وَكِيلًۭا","transliteration":"wakīlan","translation_bn":"কর্মবিধায়ক হিসেবে","root":"وكل","lemma":"وَكِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82985,"position":54,"text_uthmani":"١٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāahla l-kitābi lā taghlū fī dīnikum walā taqūlū ʿalā l-lahi illā l-ḥaqa innamā l-masīḥu ʿīsā ub''nu maryama rasūlu l-lahi wakalimatuhu alqāhā ilā maryama warūḥun min''hu faāminū bil-lahi warusulihi walā taqūlū thalāthatun intahū khayran lakum innamā l-lahu ilāhun wāḥidun sub''ḥānahu an yakūna lahu waladun lahu mā fī l-samāwāti wamā fī l-arḍi wakafā bil-lahi wakīlan', 'ওহে কিতাবধারীগণ! তোমরা তোমাদের দ্বীনের ব্যাপারে বাড়াবাড়ি করো না, আর আল্লাহ সম্বন্ধে সত্য ছাড়া কিছু বলো না, ঈসা মাসীহ তো আল্লাহর রসূল আর তাঁর বানী যা তিনি মারইয়ামের নিকট প্রেরণ করেছিলেন, আর তাঁর পক্ষ হতে নির্দেশ, কাজেই তোমরা আল্লাহর প্রতি ও তাঁর রসূলগণের প্রতি ঈমান আনো, আর বলো না ‘তিন’ (জন ইলাহ আছে), নিবৃত্ত হও, তা হবে তোমাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর, আল্লাহ তো একক ইলাহ, তিনি পবিত্র এত্থেকে যে, তাঁর সন্তান হবে। আসমানসমূহে আর যমীনে যা আছে সব কিছু তাঁরই, আর কর্মবিধায়ক হিসেবে আল্লাহই যথেষ্ট।', 'O People of the Scripture, do not commit excess in your religion or say about Allah except the truth. The Messiah, Jesus, the son of Mary, was but a messenger of Allah and His word which He directed to Mary and a soul [created at a command] from Him. So believe in Allah and His messengers. And do not say, "Three"; desist - it is better for you. Indeed, Allah is but one God. Exalted is He above having a son. To Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth. And sufficient is Allah as Disposer of affairs.', 'ওহে কিতাবধারীগণ! তোমরা তোমাদের দ্বীনের ব্যাপারে বাড়াবাড়ি করো না, আর আল্লাহ সম্বন্ধে সত্য ছাড়া কিছু বলো না, ঈসা মাসীহ তো আল্লাহর রসূল আর তাঁর বানী যা তিনি মারইয়ামের নিকট প্রেরণ করেছিলেন, আর তাঁর পক্ষ হতে নির্দেশ, কাজেই তোমরা আল্লাহর প্রতি ও তাঁর রসূলগণের প্রতি ঈমান আনো, আর বলো না ‘তিন’ (জন ইলাহ আছে), নিবৃত্ত হও, তা হবে তোমাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর, আল্লাহ তো একক ইলাহ, তিনি পবিত্র এত্থেকে যে, তাঁর সন্তান হবে। আসমানসমূহে আর যমীনে যা আছে সব কিছু তাঁরই, আর কর্মবিধায়ক হিসেবে আল্লাহই যথেষ্ট।', 'O People of the Scripture, do not commit excess in your religion or say about Allah except the truth. The Messiah, Jesus, the son of Mary, was but a messenger of Allah and His word which He directed to Mary and a soul [created at a command] from Him. So believe in Allah and His messengers. And do not say, "Three"; desist - it is better for you. Indeed, Allah is but one God. Exalted is He above having a son. To Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth. And sufficient is Allah as Disposer of affairs.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004171.mp3', now()),
  (4, 172, '', '[{"id":83096,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কক্ষনো না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":83097,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَنكِفَ","transliteration":"yastankifa","translation_bn":"হেয় জ্ঞান করে","root":"نكف","lemma":"ٱسْتَنكَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83098,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَسِيحُ","transliteration":"l-masīḥu","translation_bn":"মসীহ","root":"—","lemma":"مَسِيح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83099,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(যে)","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":83100,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونَ","transliteration":"yakūna","translation_bn":"হওয়াতে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83101,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَبْدًۭا","transliteration":"ʿabdan","translation_bn":"বান্দা","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83102,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83103,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83104,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতারাও","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83105,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُقَرَّبُونَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-muqarabūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) ঘনিষ্ঠ","root":"قرب","lemma":"مُقَرَّبُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83107,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83108,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَنكِفْ","transliteration":"yastankif","translation_bn":"হেয় জ্ঞান করে","root":"نكف","lemma":"ٱسْتَنكَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83109,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83110,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادَتِهِۦ","transliteration":"ʿibādatihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর বন্দেগী","root":"عبد","lemma":"عِبَادَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83111,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَيَسْتَكْبِرْ","transliteration":"wayastakbir","translation_bn":"ও অহংকার করে","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83112,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَسَيَحْشُرُهُمْ","transliteration":"fasayaḥshuruhum","translation_bn":"একত্র করবেন তবে তাদের","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":83113,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83114,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সকলকে","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83115,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lan yastankifa l-masīḥu an yakūna ʿabdan lillahi walā l-malāikatu l-muqarabūna waman yastankif ʿan ʿibādatihi wayastakbir fasayaḥshuruhum ilayhi jamīʿan', 'মাসীহ আল্লাহর বান্দা হওয়াকে তুচ্ছ জ্ঞান করে না, আর নৈকট্যের অধিকারী ফেরেশতারাও না। যে তাঁর ‘ইবাদাতকে হেয় জ্ঞান করে আর অহঙ্কার করে, তিনি তাদের সকলকে শীঘ্রই তাঁর কাছে একত্রিত করবেন।', 'Never would the Messiah disdain to be a servant of Allah, nor would the angels near [to Him]. And whoever disdains His worship and is arrogant - He will gather them to Himself all together.', 'মাসীহ আল্লাহর বান্দা হওয়াকে তুচ্ছ জ্ঞান করে না, আর নৈকট্যের অধিকারী ফেরেশতারাও না। যে তাঁর ‘ইবাদাতকে হেয় জ্ঞান করে আর অহঙ্কার করে, তিনি তাদের সকলকে শীঘ্রই তাঁর কাছে একত্রিত করবেন।', 'Never would the Messiah disdain to be a servant of Allah, nor would the angels near [to Him]. And whoever disdains His worship and is arrogant - He will gather them to Himself all together.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004172.mp3', now()),
  (4, 173, '', '[{"id":83161,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَمَّا","transliteration":"fa-ammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83162,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":83163,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83164,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83165,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"নেকীসমূহের","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83166,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَيُوَفِّيهِمْ","transliteration":"fayuwaffīhim","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে অতঃপর পূর্ণ দেবেন","root":"وفي","lemma":"وَفَّىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":83167,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُجُورَهُمْ","transliteration":"ujūrahum","translation_bn":"তাদের কর্মফলসমূহ","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83168,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَيَزِيدُهُم","transliteration":"wayazīduhum","translation_bn":"এবং বেশীও দিবেন তাদেরকে","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83169,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83170,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83172,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمَّا","transliteration":"wa-ammā","translation_bn":"আর","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83173,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":83174,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَنكَفُوا۟","transliteration":"is''tankafū","translation_bn":"হেয় জ্ঞান করলো","root":"نكف","lemma":"ٱسْتَنكَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83175,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-is''takbarū","translation_bn":"ও অহংকার করল","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83176,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَيُعَذِّبُهُمْ","transliteration":"fayuʿadhibuhum","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে তাহলে শাস্তি দিবেন","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":83177,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابًا","transliteration":"ʿadhāban","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83178,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمًۭا","transliteration":"alīman","translation_bn":"মর্মন্তুদ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":83179,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":83180,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَجِدُونَ","transliteration":"yajidūna","translation_bn":"তারা পাবে","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83181,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"তাদের জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83182,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(থেকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83183,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83184,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83185,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيًّۭا","transliteration":"waliyyan","translation_bn":"কোন অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83186,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83187,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"نَصِيرًۭا","transliteration":"naṣīran","translation_bn":"কোন সাহায্যকারী","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83188,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"١٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-ammā alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti fayuwaffīhim ujūrahum wayazīduhum min faḍlihi wa-ammā alladhīna is''tankafū wa-is''takbarū fayuʿadhibuhum ʿadhāban alīman walā yajidūna lahum min dūni l-lahi waliyyan walā naṣīran', 'কিন্তু যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে আল্লাহ তাদের পুরস্কার পুরোপুরি দান করবেন, আর নিজ অনুগ্রহে আরো বেশি দেবেন। আর যারা তুচ্ছ জ্ঞান করবে ও অহঙ্কার করবে তাদেরকে কষ্টদায়ক শাস্তি দান করবেন। আল্লাহ ব্যতীত তাদের জন্য তারা না পাবে কোন অভিভাবক, না (পাবে) কোন সাহায্যকারী।', 'And as for those who believed and did righteous deeds, He will give them in full their rewards and grant them extra from His bounty. But as for those who disdained and were arrogant, He will punish them with a painful punishment, and they will not find for themselves besides Allah any protector or helper.', 'কিন্তু যারা ঈমান আনে ও সৎ কাজ করে আল্লাহ তাদের পুরস্কার পুরোপুরি দান করবেন, আর নিজ অনুগ্রহে আরো বেশি দেবেন। আর যারা তুচ্ছ জ্ঞান করবে ও অহঙ্কার করবে তাদেরকে কষ্টদায়ক শাস্তি দান করবেন। আল্লাহ ব্যতীত তাদের জন্য তারা না পাবে কোন অভিভাবক, না (পাবে) কোন সাহায্যকারী।', 'And as for those who believed and did righteous deeds, He will give them in full their rewards and grant them extra from His bounty. But as for those who disdained and were arrogant, He will punish them with a painful punishment, and they will not find for themselves besides Allah any protector or helper.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004173.mp3', now()),
  (4, 174, '', '[{"id":83226,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":83227,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"মানবজাতি","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83228,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":83229,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكُم","transliteration":"jāakum","translation_bn":"কাছে এসেছে তোমাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83230,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بُرْهَـٰنٌۭ","transliteration":"bur''hānun","translation_bn":"দলীল প্রমাণ","root":"برهن","lemma":"بُرْهَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83231,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83232,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83233,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنزَلْنَآ","transliteration":"wa-anzalnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা নাযিল করেছি","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83234,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ilaykum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83235,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نُورًۭا","transliteration":"nūran","translation_bn":"আলো''","root":"نور","lemma":"نُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83236,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينًۭا","transliteration":"mubīnan","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":83237,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nāsu qad jāakum bur''hānun min rabbikum wa-anzalnā ilaykum nūran mubīnan', 'হে মানবমন্ডলী! তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে তোমাদের কাছে উজ্জ্বল প্রমাণ এসে পৌঁছেছে, আর আমি তোমাদের নিকট সুস্পষ্ট জ্যোতি অবতীর্ণ করেছি।', 'O mankind, there has come to you a conclusive proof from your Lord, and We have sent down to you a clear light.', 'হে মানবমন্ডলী! তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে তোমাদের কাছে উজ্জ্বল প্রমাণ এসে পৌঁছেছে, আর আমি তোমাদের নিকট সুস্পষ্ট জ্যোতি অবতীর্ণ করেছি।', 'O mankind, there has come to you a conclusive proof from your Lord, and We have sent down to you a clear light.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004174.mp3', now()),
  (4, 175, '', '[{"id":83350,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَمَّا","transliteration":"fa-ammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83351,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":83352,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83353,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর উপর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83354,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱعْتَصَمُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-iʿ''taṣamū","translation_bn":"ও দৃঢ়তা অবলম্বন করেছে","root":"عصم","lemma":"ٱعْتَصَمُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83355,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"তাতে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83356,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَسَيُدْخِلُهُمْ","transliteration":"fasayud''khiluhum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শীঘ্রই তাদেরকে  প্রবেশ করাবেন","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":83357,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83358,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"raḥmatin","translation_bn":"রহমতের","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83359,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"তাঁর পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83360,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَفَضْلٍۢ","transliteration":"wafaḍlin","translation_bn":"ও অনুগ্রহে","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83361,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَيَهْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"wayahdīhim","translation_bn":"ও তাদেরকে পরিচালিত করবেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83362,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"তাঁর দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83363,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطًۭا","transliteration":"ṣirāṭan","translation_bn":"(অর্থাৎ) পথে","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83364,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمًۭا","transliteration":"mus''taqīman","translation_bn":"সরল সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":83365,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-ammā alladhīna āmanū bil-lahi wa-iʿ''taṣamū bihi fasayud''khiluhum fī raḥmatin min''hu wafaḍlin wayahdīhim ilayhi ṣirāṭan mus''taqīman', 'অতঃপর যারা আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান আনে আর তাঁকে দৃঢ়ভাবে অাঁকড়ে ধরে থাকে, অচিরেই তিনি তাদেরকে তাঁর রহমত ও অনুগ্রহের মধ্যে দাখিল করবেন এবং তাঁর দিকে সরল-সুদৃঢ় পথে পরিচালিত করবেন।', 'So those who believe in Allah and hold fast to Him - He will admit them to mercy from Himself and bounty and guide them to Himself on a straight path.', 'অতঃপর যারা আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান আনে আর তাঁকে দৃঢ়ভাবে অাঁকড়ে ধরে থাকে, অচিরেই তিনি তাদেরকে তাঁর রহমত ও অনুগ্রহের মধ্যে দাখিল করবেন এবং তাঁর দিকে সরল-সুদৃঢ় পথে পরিচালিত করবেন।', 'So those who believe in Allah and hold fast to Him - He will admit them to mercy from Himself and bounty and guide them to Himself on a straight path.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/004175.mp3', now()),
  (4, 176, '', '[{"id":83385,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَفْتُونَكَ","transliteration":"yastaftūnaka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে সমাধান চায় তারা","root":"فتي","lemma":"يَسْتَفْتُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83386,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قُلِ","transliteration":"quli","translation_bn":"বল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83387,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"''''আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83388,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُفْتِيكُمْ","transliteration":"yuf''tīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে সমাধান দিচ্ছেন","root":"فتي","lemma":"يُفْتِي","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83389,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83390,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَلَـٰلَةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-kalālati","translation_bn":"মাতা-পিতাহীনও নিঃসন্তান ব্যক্তির","root":"كلل","lemma":"كَلَٰلَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83392,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنِ","transliteration":"ini","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":83393,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱمْرُؤٌا۟","transliteration":"im''ru-on","translation_bn":"কোন পুরুষ (এ ধরনের)","root":"مرا","lemma":"ٱمْرُؤٌا","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83394,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هَلَكَ","transliteration":"halaka","translation_bn":"মারা যায়","root":"هلك","lemma":"هَلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83395,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"না (থাকে)","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83396,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83397,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدٌۭ","translite