"aḥadihimā","translation_bn":"দুু’জনের একজন তাদের","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29980,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29981,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُتَقَبَّلْ","transliteration":"yutaqabbal","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করা হলো","root":"قبل","lemma":"تَقَبَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29982,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29983,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخَرِ","transliteration":"l-ākhari","translation_bn":"অন্য জনের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29984,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29985,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَأَقْتُلَنَّكَ ۖ","transliteration":"la-aqtulannaka","translation_bn":"\"অবশ্যই আমি হত্যা করবোই তোমাকে\"","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":29987,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29988,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":29989,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَتَقَبَّلُ","transliteration":"yataqabbalu","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করেন (কুরবানি)","root":"قبل","lemma":"تَقَبَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29990,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29991,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29992,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীদের","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29993,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ut''lu ʿalayhim naba-a ib''nay ādama bil-ḥaqi idh qarrabā qur''bānan fatuqubbila min aḥadihimā walam yutaqabbal mina l-ākhari qāla la-aqtulannaka qāla innamā yataqabbalu l-lahu mina l-mutaqīna', 'আদামের দু’পুত্রের খবর তাদেরকে সঠিকভাবে জানিয়ে দাও। উভয়ে যখন একটি করে কুরবানী হাজির করেছিল তখন তাদের একজনের নিকট হতে কবূল করা হল। অন্যজনের নিকট হতে কবূল করা হল না। সে বলল, আমি তোমাকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই হত্যা করব। অন্যজন বলল, ‘আল্লাহ কেবল মুত্তাকীদের কুরবানী কবূল করেন,', 'And recite to them the story of Adam''s two sons, in truth, when they both offered a sacrifice [to Allah], and it was accepted from one of them but was not accepted from the other. Said [the latter], "I will surely kill you." Said [the former], "Indeed, Allah only accepts from the righteous [who fear Him].', 'আদামের দু’পুত্রের খবর তাদেরকে সঠিকভাবে জানিয়ে দাও। উভয়ে যখন একটি করে কুরবানী হাজির করেছিল তখন তাদের একজনের নিকট হতে কবূল করা হল। অন্যজনের নিকট হতে কবূল করা হল না। সে বলল, আমি তোমাকে অবশ্য অবশ্যই হত্যা করব। অন্যজন বলল, ‘আল্লাহ কেবল মুত্তাকীদের কুরবানী কবূল করেন,', 'And recite to them the story of Adam''s two sons, in truth, when they both offered a sacrifice [to Allah], and it was accepted from one of them but was not accepted from the other. Said [the latter], "I will surely kill you." Said [the former], "Indeed, Allah only accepts from the righteous [who fear Him].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005027.mp3', now()),
  (5, 28, '', '[{"id":31062,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَئِنۢ","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":31063,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بَسَطتَ","transliteration":"basaṭta","translation_bn":"তুমি সম্প্রসারিত করো","root":"بسط","lemma":"بَسَطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31064,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"আমার দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31065,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَدَكَ","transliteration":"yadaka","translation_bn":"তোমার হাত","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31066,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِتَقْتُلَنِى","transliteration":"litaqtulanī","translation_bn":"আমাকে তুমি হত্যা করো","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31067,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":31068,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":31069,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِبَاسِطٍۢ","transliteration":"bibāsiṭin","translation_bn":"সম্প্রসারিতকারী (হবো)","root":"بسط","lemma":"بَٰسِط","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31070,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَدِىَ","transliteration":"yadiya","translation_bn":"আমার হাত","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31071,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"তোমার দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31072,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِأَقْتُلَكَ ۖ","transliteration":"li-aqtulaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে আমি হত্যা করার জন্যে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31074,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":31075,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"ভয় করি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31076,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31077,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّ","transliteration":"rabba","translation_bn":"(যিনি) রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31078,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্ব জগতের\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31079,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'la-in basaṭta ilayya yadaka litaqtulanī mā anā bibāsiṭin yadiya ilayka li-aqtulaka innī akhāfu l-laha rabba l-ʿālamīna', 'আমাকে হত্যা করার জন্য তুমি আমার দিকে হাত বাড়ালেও আমি তোমাকে হত্যা করার জন্য তোমার দিকে হাত বাড়াব না, আমি বিশ্ব জগতের প্রতিপালক আল্লাহকে ভয় করি।', 'If you should raise your hand against me to kill me - I shall not raise my hand against you to kill you. Indeed, I fear Allah, Lord of the worlds.', 'আমাকে হত্যা করার জন্য তুমি আমার দিকে হাত বাড়ালেও আমি তোমাকে হত্যা করার জন্য তোমার দিকে হাত বাড়াব না, আমি বিশ্ব জগতের প্রতিপালক আল্লাহকে ভয় করি।', 'If you should raise your hand against me to kill me - I shall not raise my hand against you to kill you. Indeed, I fear Allah, Lord of the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005028.mp3', now()),
  (5, 29, '', '[{"id":32034,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":32035,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُرِيدُ","transliteration":"urīdu","translation_bn":"আমি চাই","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32036,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":32037,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَبُوٓأَ","transliteration":"tabūa","translation_bn":"বহন করবে তুমি","root":"بوا","lemma":"بَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32038,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِإِثْمِى","transliteration":"bi-ith''mī","translation_bn":"নিয়ে আমার পাপ","root":"اثم","lemma":"إِثْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32039,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَإِثْمِكَ","transliteration":"wa-ith''mika","translation_bn":"ও তোমার পাপকে","root":"اثم","lemma":"إِثْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32040,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَتَكُونَ","transliteration":"fatakūna","translation_bn":"অত:পর তুমি হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32041,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32042,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبِ","transliteration":"aṣḥābi","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীদের","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32043,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"(দোযখের) আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32045,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32046,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جَزَٰٓؤُا۟","transliteration":"jazāu","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32047,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32048,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innī urīdu an tabūa bi-ith''mī wa-ith''mika fatakūna min aṣḥābi l-nāri wadhālika jazāu l-ẓālimīna', 'আমি চাই তুমি আমার ও তোমার পাপের বোঝা বহন কর আর অগ্নিবাসী হয়ে যাও, অন্যায়কারীদের এটাই প্রতিদান।’', 'Indeed I want you to obtain [thereby] my sin and your sin so you will be among the companions of the Fire. And that is the recompense of wrongdoers."', 'আমি চাই তুমি আমার ও তোমার পাপের বোঝা বহন কর আর অগ্নিবাসী হয়ে যাও, অন্যায়কারীদের এটাই প্রতিদান।’', 'Indeed I want you to obtain [thereby] my sin and your sin so you will be among the companions of the Fire. And that is the recompense of wrongdoers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005029.mp3', now()),
  (5, 30, '', '[{"id":32917,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَطَوَّعَتْ","transliteration":"faṭawwaʿat","translation_bn":"অত:পর উত্তেজিত করলো","root":"طوع","lemma":"طَوَّعَتْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32918,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32919,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسُهُۥ","transliteration":"nafsuhu","translation_bn":"প্রবৃত্তি তার","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32920,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَتْلَ","transliteration":"qatla","translation_bn":"হত্যায়","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32921,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَخِيهِ","transliteration":"akhīhi","translation_bn":"ভাইয়ের তার","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32922,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَقَتَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"faqatalahu","translation_bn":"অত:পর সে হত্যা করলো তাকে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":32923,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَأَصْبَحَ","transliteration":"fa-aṣbaḥa","translation_bn":"ফলে সে হলো","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32924,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32925,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَـٰسِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-khāsirīna","translation_bn":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্তদের","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَٰسِرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32926,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faṭawwaʿat lahu nafsuhu qatla akhīhi faqatalahu fa-aṣbaḥa mina l-khāsirīna', 'অতঃপর তার আত্মা তাকে ভ্রাতৃহত্যার কাজে প্ররোচিত করল। ফলতঃ সে তাকে হত্যা করল এবং ক্ষতিগ্রস্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয়ে গেল।', 'And his soul permitted to him the murder of his brother, so he killed him and became among the losers.', 'অতঃপর তার আত্মা তাকে ভ্রাতৃহত্যার কাজে প্ররোচিত করল। ফলতঃ সে তাকে হত্যা করল এবং ক্ষতিগ্রস্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয়ে গেল।', 'And his soul permitted to him the murder of his brother, so he killed him and became among the losers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005030.mp3', now()),
  (5, 31, '', '[{"id":33415,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَبَعَثَ","transliteration":"fabaʿatha","translation_bn":"অত:পর পাঠালেন","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33416,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33417,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"غُرَابًۭا","transliteration":"ghurāban","translation_bn":"এক কাক","root":"غرب","lemma":"غُرَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33418,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَبْحَثُ","transliteration":"yabḥathu","translation_bn":"সে খুঁড়তে লাগলো","root":"بحث","lemma":"يَبْحَثُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33419,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33420,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"মাটির","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33421,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِيُرِيَهُۥ","transliteration":"liyuriyahu","translation_bn":"যাতে সে দেখাতে পারে তাকে","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33422,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কিভাবে","root":"كيف","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33423,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُوَٰرِى","transliteration":"yuwārī","translation_bn":"সে লুকাবে","root":"وري","lemma":"وُ,رِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33424,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"سَوْءَةَ","transliteration":"sawata","translation_bn":"লাশ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَوْءَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33425,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَخِيهِ ۚ","transliteration":"akhīhi","translation_bn":"ভাইয়ের তার","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33427,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33428,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰوَيْلَتَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yāwaylatā","translation_bn":"\"হায়! আমার দুর্ভোগ","root":"—","lemma":"وَيْل","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":33429,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَعَجَزْتُ","transliteration":"aʿajaztu","translation_bn":"কি আমি অক্ষম হলাম","root":"عجز","lemma":"عَجَزْ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":33430,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":33431,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَكُونَ","transliteration":"akūna","translation_bn":"আমি হবো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33432,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِثْلَ","transliteration":"mith''la","translation_bn":"মতো","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33433,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":33434,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغُرَابِ","transliteration":"l-ghurābi","translation_bn":"কাকের","root":"غرب","lemma":"غُرَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33435,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فَأُوَٰرِىَ","transliteration":"fa-uwāriya","translation_bn":"যেন আমি লুকাতে পারি","root":"وري","lemma":"وُ,رِىَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":33436,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"سَوْءَةَ","transliteration":"sawata","translation_bn":"লাশ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَوْءَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33437,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَخِى ۖ","transliteration":"akhī","translation_bn":"আমার ভাইয়ের\"","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":33439,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَأَصْبَحَ","transliteration":"fa-aṣbaḥa","translation_bn":"অবশেষে সে হলো","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":33440,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33441,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّـٰدِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-nādimīna","translation_bn":"অনুতাপকারীদের","root":"ندم","lemma":"نَٰدِمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33442,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fabaʿatha l-lahu ghurāban yabḥathu fī l-arḍi liyuriyahu kayfa yuwārī sawata akhīhi qāla yāwaylatā aʿajaztu an akūna mith''la hādhā l-ghurābi fa-uwāriya sawata akhī fa-aṣbaḥa mina l-nādimīna', 'তারপর আল্লাহ একটি কাক পাঠালেন, সে মাটি খনন করতে লাগল, সে তার ভাইয়ের লাশ কীভাবে গোপন করবে তা দেখানোর জন্য। সে বলল, ধিক আমাকে! আমি এই কাকটির মতও হতে পারলাম না যাতে আমার ভাইয়ের লাশ গোপন করতে পারি? তাই সে অনুতপ্ত হল।', 'Then Allah sent a crow searching in the ground to show him how to hide the disgrace of his brother. He said, "O woe to me! Have I failed to be like this crow and hide the body of my brother?" And he became of the regretful.', 'তারপর আল্লাহ একটি কাক পাঠালেন, সে মাটি খনন করতে লাগল, সে তার ভাইয়ের লাশ কীভাবে গোপন করবে তা দেখানোর জন্য। সে বলল, ধিক আমাকে! আমি এই কাকটির মতও হতে পারলাম না যাতে আমার ভাইয়ের লাশ গোপন করতে পারি? তাই সে অনুতপ্ত হল।', 'Then Allah sent a crow searching in the ground to show him how to hide the disgrace of his brother. He said, "O woe to me! Have I failed to be like this crow and hide the body of my brother?" And he became of the regretful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005031.mp3', now()),
