—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā jazāu alladhīna yuḥāribūna l-laha warasūlahu wayasʿawna fī l-arḍi fasādan an yuqattalū aw yuṣallabū aw tuqaṭṭaʿa aydīhim wa-arjuluhum min khilāfin aw yunfaw mina l-arḍi dhālika lahum khiz''yun fī l-dun''yā walahum fī l-ākhirati ʿadhābun ʿaẓīmun', 'যারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ করে আর যমীনে বিশৃঙ্খলা ছড়িয়ে বেড়ায় তাদের শাস্তি হল এই যে, তাদেরকে হত্যা করা হবে অথবা ক্রুশবিদ্ধ করা হবে অথবা তাদের হাত পা বিপরীত দিক থেকে কেটে ফেলা হবে, অথবা তাদেরকে দেশ থেকে নির্বাসিত করা হবে। এ হল তাদের জন্য দুনিয়াতে লাঞ্ছনা, আর তাদের জন্য আখেরাতে রয়েছে মহাশাস্তি।', 'Indeed, the penalty for those who wage war against Allah and His Messenger and strive upon earth [to cause] corruption is none but that they be killed or crucified or that their hands and feet be cut off from opposite sides or that they be exiled from the land. That is for them a disgrace in this world; and for them in the Hereafter is a great punishment,', 'যারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ করে আর যমীনে বিশৃঙ্খলা ছড়িয়ে বেড়ায় তাদের শাস্তি হল এই যে, তাদেরকে হত্যা করা হবে অথবা ক্রুশবিদ্ধ করা হবে অথবা তাদের হাত পা বিপরীত দিক থেকে কেটে ফেলা হবে, অথবা তাদেরকে দেশ থেকে নির্বাসিত করা হবে। এ হল তাদের জন্য দুনিয়াতে লাঞ্ছনা, আর তাদের জন্য আখেরাতে রয়েছে মহাশাস্তি।', 'Indeed, the penalty for those who wage war against Allah and His Messenger and strive upon earth [to cause] corruption is none but that they be killed or crucified or that their hands and feet be cut off from opposite sides or that they be exiled from the land. That is for them a disgrace in this world; and for them in the Hereafter is a great punishment,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005033.mp3', now()),
  (5, 34, '', '[{"id":36775,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":36776,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36777,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَابُوا۟","transliteration":"tābū","translation_bn":"তওবা করে","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36778,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36779,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36780,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":36781,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَقْدِرُوا۟","transliteration":"taqdirū","translation_bn":"তোমরা সক্ষম হবে","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36782,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের(আধিপত্য বিস্তারে)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36784,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"fa-iʿ''lamū","translation_bn":"তবে তোমরা জেনে রেখো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36785,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":36786,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36787,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36788,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":36789,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'illā alladhīna tābū min qabli an taqdirū ʿalayhim fa-iʿ''lamū anna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', '(তবে এ শাস্তি) তাদের জন্য নয় যারা তোমাদের আয়ত্বে আসার পূর্বে তাওবা করবে। জেনে রেখ, আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'Except for those who return [repenting] before you apprehend them. And know that Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', '(তবে এ শাস্তি) তাদের জন্য নয় যারা তোমাদের আয়ত্বে আসার পূর্বে তাওবা করবে। জেনে রেখ, আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'Except for those who return [repenting] before you apprehend them. And know that Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005034.mp3', now()),
  (5, 35, '', '[{"id":37463,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":37464,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37465,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37466,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37467,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37468,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱبْتَغُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-ib''taghū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা সন্ধান করো","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37469,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"দিকে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37470,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوَسِيلَةَ","transliteration":"l-wasīlata","translation_bn":"নৈকট্য লাভের উপায়","root":"وسل","lemma":"وَسِيلَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37471,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَجَـٰهِدُوا۟","transliteration":"wajāhidū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা জিহাদ করো","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37472,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37473,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِهِۦ","transliteration":"sabīlihi","translation_bn":"পথের তাঁর","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37474,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"সম্ভবতঃ তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":37475,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تُفْلِحُونَ","transliteration":"tuf''liḥūna","translation_bn":"সফলকাম হবে","root":"فلح","lemma":"أَفْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37476,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū ittaqū l-laha wa-ib''taghū ilayhi l-wasīlata wajāhidū fī sabīlihi laʿallakum tuf''liḥūna', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, তাঁর নৈকট্য অনুসন্ধান কর এবং তাঁর পথে জিহাদ কর যাতে তোমরা সফলকাম হতে পার।', 'O you who have believed, fear Allah and seek the means [of nearness] to Him and strive in His cause that you may succeed.', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! আল্লাহকে ভয় কর, তাঁর নৈকট্য অনুসন্ধান কর এবং তাঁর পথে জিহাদ কর যাতে তোমরা সফলকাম হতে পার।', 'O you who have believed, fear Allah and seek the means [of nearness] to Him and strive in His cause that you may succeed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005035.mp3', now()),
  (5, 36, '', '[{"id":38249,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38250,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":38251,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38252,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":38253,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38254,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38255,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":38256,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38257,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38258,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সমস্তই","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38259,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمِثْلَهُۥ","transliteration":"wamith''lahu","translation_bn":"ও সমতুল্য তার(আরও কিছু)","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"সঙ্গতিবাচক (Comitative)"},{"id":38260,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَعَهُۥ","transliteration":"maʿahu","translation_bn":"সাথে তার","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":38261,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِيَفْتَدُوا۟","transliteration":"liyaftadū","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের মুক্তিপণ দিয়ে বাঁচার","root":"فدي","lemma":"ٱفْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38262,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"বিনিময়ে তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38263,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38264,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابِ","transliteration":"ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38265,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمِ","transliteration":"yawmi","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38266,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের (আর মুক্তিপণ দেয়ও)","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38267,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তবুও) না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":38268,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تُقُبِّلَ","transliteration":"tuqubbila","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করা হবে","root":"قبل","lemma":"تَقَبَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38269,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38271,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38272,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38273,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":38274,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna kafarū law anna lahum mā fī l-arḍi jamīʿan wamith''lahu maʿahu liyaftadū bihi min ʿadhābi yawmi l-qiyāmati mā tuqubbila min''hum walahum ʿadhābun alīmun', 'যারা কুফরী করেছে দুনিয়ায় যা কিছু আছে সব যদি তাদের হয় এবং আরো সমপরিমাণও হয় ক্বিয়ামাত দিবসের শাস্তি থেকে পরিত্রাণের মুক্তিপণ হিসেবে, তবুও তা তাদের থেকে গ্রহণ করা হবে না; তাদের জন্য আছে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তি।', 'Indeed, those who disbelieve - if they should have all that is in the earth and the like of it with it by which to ransom themselves from the punishment of the Day of Resurrection, it will not be accepted from them, and for them is a painful punishment', 'যারা কুফরী করেছে দুনিয়ায় যা কিছু আছে সব যদি তাদের হয় এবং আরো সমপরিমাণও হয় ক্বিয়ামাত দিবসের শাস্তি থেকে পরিত্রাণের মুক্তিপণ হিসেবে, তবুও তা তাদের থেকে গ্রহণ করা হবে না; তাদের জন্য আছে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তি।', 'Indeed, those who disbelieve - if they should have all that is in the earth and the like of it with it by which to ransom themselves from the punishment of the Day of Resurrection, it will not be accepted from them, and for them is a painful punishment', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005036.mp3', now()),
  (5, 37, '', '[{"id":39044,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُونَ","transliteration":"yurīdūna","translation_bn":"তারা চাইবে","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39045,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":39046,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَخْرُجُوا۟","transliteration":"yakhrujū","translation_bn":"তারা বের হবে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39047,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39048,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39049,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39050,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":39051,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِخَـٰرِجِينَ","transliteration":"bikhārijīna","translation_bn":"বের হতে পারবে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَارِج","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39052,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا ۖ","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39054,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39055,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39056,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُّقِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"muqīmun","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":39057,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yurīdūna an yakhrujū mina l-nāri wamā hum bikhārijīna min''hā walahum ʿadhābun muqīmun', 'তারা আগুন থেকে বেরিয়ে আসতে চাইবে, কিন্তু তারা তাত্থেকে বের হতে পারবে না, তাদের জন্য আছে স্থায়ী শাস্তি।', 'They will wish to get out of the Fire, but never are they to emerge therefrom, and for them is an enduring punishment.', 'তারা আগুন থেকে বেরিয়ে আসতে চাইবে, কিন্তু তারা তাত্থেকে বের হতে পারবে না, তাদের জন্য আছে স্থায়ী শাস্তি।', 'They will wish to get out of the Fire, but never are they to emerge therefrom, and for them is an enduring punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005037.mp3', now()),
  (5, 38, '', '[{"id":39883,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلسَّارِقُ","transliteration":"wal-sāriqu","translation_bn":"এবং পুরুষ চোর (হউক)","root":"سرق","lemma":"سَّارِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39884,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلسَّارِقَةُ","transliteration":"wal-sāriqatu","translation_bn":"বা নারী চোর","root":"سرق","lemma":"سَّارِقَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39885,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَٱقْطَعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"fa-iq''ṭaʿū","translation_bn":"অত:পর তোমরা কেটে দাও","root":"قطع","lemma":"قُطِعَ","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":39886,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيَهُمَا","transliteration":"aydiyahumā","translation_bn":"হাত উভয়ের","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39887,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآءًۢ","transliteration":"jazāan","translation_bn":"প্রতিফলস্বরূপ","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39888,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39889,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَسَبَا","transliteration":"kasabā","translation_bn":"অর্জন করেছে উভয়ে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39890,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَكَـٰلًۭا","transliteration":"nakālan","translation_bn":"দন্ড হিসেবে","root":"نكل","lemma":"نَكَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39891,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39892,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39894,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39895,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39896,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":39897,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-sāriqu wal-sāriqatu fa-iq''ṭaʿū aydiyahumā jazāan bimā kasabā nakālan mina l-lahi wal-lahu ʿazīzun ḥakīmun', 'আর চোর ও চোরনী তাদের হাত কেটে দাও, তাদের কৃতকর্মের ফল স্বরূপ, আল্লাহর পক্ষ থেকে দৃষ্টান্তমূলক শাস্তি। আল্লাহ হলেন মহাপরাক্রান্ত, মহাবিজ্ঞানী।', '[As for] the thief, the male and the female, amputate their hands in recompense for what they committed as a deterrent [punishment] from Allah. And Allah is Exalted in Might and Wise.', 'আর চোর ও চোরনী তাদের হাত কেটে দাও, তাদের কৃতকর্মের ফল স্বরূপ, আল্লাহর পক্ষ থেকে দৃষ্টান্তমূলক শাস্তি। আল্লাহ হলেন মহাপরাক্রান্ত, মহাবিজ্ঞানী।', '[As for] the thief, the male and the female, amputate their hands in recompense for what they committed as a deterrent [punishment] from Allah. And Allah is Exalted in Might and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005038.mp3', now()),
  (5, 39, '', '[{"id":40703,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"তবে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40704,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَابَ","transliteration":"tāba","translation_bn":"তওবা করে","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40705,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40706,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40707,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظُلْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"ẓul''mihi","translation_bn":"অন্যায়ের তার","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40708,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَصْلَحَ","transliteration":"wa-aṣlaḥa","translation_bn":"ও সংশোধন হয়","root":"صلح","lemma":"أَصْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40709,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":40710,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40711,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَتُوبُ","transliteration":"yatūbu","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা করবেন","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40712,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ ۗ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40714,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":40715,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40716,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40717,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":40718,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faman tāba min baʿdi ẓul''mihi wa-aṣlaḥa fa-inna l-laha yatūbu ʿalayhi inna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'কিন্তু অন্যায় করার পর কেউ তাওবা করলে এবং (নিজেকে) সংশোধন করলে, আল্লাহ তার প্রতি ক্ষমাদৃষ্টি করেন, আল্লাহ হলেন বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'But whoever repents after his wrongdoing and reforms, indeed, Allah will turn to him in forgiveness. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'কিন্তু অন্যায় করার পর কেউ তাওবা করলে এবং (নিজেকে) সংশোধন করলে, আল্লাহ তার প্রতি ক্ষমাদৃষ্টি করেন, আল্লাহ হলেন বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'But whoever repents after his wrongdoing and reforms, indeed, Allah will turn to him in forgiveness. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005039.mp3', now()),
  (5, 40, '', '[{"id":41538,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":41539,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمْ","transliteration":"taʿlam","translation_bn":"তুমি জানো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41540,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":41541,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41542,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41543,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُلْكُ","transliteration":"mul''ku","translation_bn":"সার্বভৌমত্ব","root":"ملك","lemma":"مُلْك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41544,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41545,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41546,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُعَذِّبُ","transliteration":"yuʿadhibu","translation_bn":"তিনি শাস্তি দেন","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41547,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41548,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41549,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَيَغْفِرُ","transliteration":"wayaghfiru","translation_bn":"ও ক্ষমা করেন","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41550,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41551,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۗ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41553,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41554,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41555,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41556,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুরই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41557,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قَدِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"qadīrun","translation_bn":"সর্বশক্তিমান","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41558,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam taʿlam anna l-laha lahu mul''ku l-samāwāti wal-arḍi yuʿadhibu man yashāu wayaghfiru liman yashāu wal-lahu ʿalā kulli shayin qadīrun', 'তুমি কি জান না আল্লাহ, আকাশসমূহ ও যমীনের সার্বভৌমত্ব তাঁরই, যাকে ইচ্ছে তিনি শাস্তি দেন, যাকে ইচ্ছে ক্ষমা করেন, আল্লাহ সর্ব বিষয়ে সর্বশক্তিমান।', 'Do you not know that to Allah belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth? He punishes whom He wills and forgives whom He wills, and Allah is over all things competent.', 'তুমি কি জান না আল্লাহ, আকাশসমূহ ও যমীনের সার্বভৌমত্ব তাঁরই, যাকে ইচ্ছে তিনি শাস্তি দেন, যাকে ইচ্ছে ক্ষমা করেন, আল্লাহ সর্ব বিষয়ে সর্বশক্তিমান।', 'Do you not know that to Allah belongs the dominion of the heavens and the earth? He punishes whom He wills and forgives whom He wills, and Allah is over all things competent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005040.mp3', now()),
