ʿ ahwāahum wa-iḥ''dharhum an yaftinūka ʿan baʿḍi mā anzala l-lahu ilayka fa-in tawallaw fa-iʿ''lam annamā yurīdu l-lahu an yuṣībahum bibaʿḍi dhunūbihim wa-inna kathīran mina l-nāsi lafāsiqūna', 'আর তুমি তাদের মধ্যে বিচার ফয়সালা কর আল্লাহ যা নাযিল করেছেন তদনুযায়ী, তাদের খেয়াল খুশির অনুসরণ করবে না। আর তাদের থেকে সতর্ক থাক তারা যেন আল্লাহ তোমার প্রতি যা নাযিল করেছেন তার কোন কিছু থেকে তোমাকে ফেতনায় না ফেলতে পারে। যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়, তবে জেনে রেখ, আল্লাহ তাদের কোন কোন পাপের কারণে তাদেরকে শাস্তি দিতে চান, মানুষদের অধিকাংশই প্রকৃতপক্ষে সত্য ত্যাগী।', 'And judge, [O Muhammad], between them by what Allah has revealed and do not follow their inclinations and beware of them, lest they tempt you away from some of what Allah has revealed to you. And if they turn away - then know that Allah only intends to afflict them with some of their [own] sins. And indeed, many among the people are defiantly disobedient.', 'আর তুমি তাদের মধ্যে বিচার ফয়সালা কর আল্লাহ যা নাযিল করেছেন তদনুযায়ী, তাদের খেয়াল খুশির অনুসরণ করবে না। আর তাদের থেকে সতর্ক থাক তারা যেন আল্লাহ তোমার প্রতি যা নাযিল করেছেন তার কোন কিছু থেকে তোমাকে ফেতনায় না ফেলতে পারে। যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়, তবে জেনে রেখ, আল্লাহ তাদের কোন কোন পাপের কারণে তাদেরকে শাস্তি দিতে চান, মানুষদের অধিকাংশই প্রকৃতপক্ষে সত্য ত্যাগী।', 'And judge, [O Muhammad], between them by what Allah has revealed and do not follow their inclinations and beware of them, lest they tempt you away from some of what Allah has revealed to you. And if they turn away - then know that Allah only intends to afflict them with some of their [own] sins. And indeed, many among the people are defiantly disobedient.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005049.mp3', now()),
  (5, 50, '', '[{"id":48776,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَحُكْمَ","transliteration":"afaḥuk''ma","translation_bn":"কি তবে বিধান","root":"حكم","lemma":"حُكْم","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":48777,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَـٰهِلِيَّةِ","transliteration":"l-jāhiliyati","translation_bn":"জাহিলীয়াতের","root":"جهل","lemma":"جَٰهِلِيَّة2","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48778,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَبْغُونَ ۚ","transliteration":"yabghūna","translation_bn":"তারা চায়","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48780,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং কে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48781,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَحْسَنُ","transliteration":"aḥsanu","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48782,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"চেয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48783,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48784,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حُكْمًۭا","transliteration":"ḥuk''man","translation_bn":"বিধান দানে","root":"حكم","lemma":"حُكْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48785,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"(সেইসব) সম্প্রদায়ের জন্যে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48786,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُوقِنُونَ","transliteration":"yūqinūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) দৃঢ় বিশ্বাসী","root":"يقن","lemma":"يُوقِنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48787,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afaḥuk''ma l-jāhiliyati yabghūna waman aḥsanu mina l-lahi ḥuk''man liqawmin yūqinūna', 'তারা কি জাহিলী যুগের আইন বিধান চায়? দৃঢ় বিশ্বাসী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য আইন-বিধান প্রদানে আল্লাহ হতে কে বেশী শ্রেষ্ঠ?', 'Then is it the judgement of [the time of] ignorance they desire? But who is better than Allah in judgement for a people who are certain [in faith].', 'তারা কি জাহিলী যুগের আইন বিধান চায়? দৃঢ় বিশ্বাসী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য আইন-বিধান প্রদানে আল্লাহ হতে কে বেশী শ্রেষ্ঠ?', 'Then is it the judgement of [the time of] ignorance they desire? But who is better than Allah in judgement for a people who are certain [in faith].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005050.mp3', now()),
  (5, 51, '', '[{"id":49325,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":49326,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49327,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49328,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":49329,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّخِذُوا۟","transliteration":"tattakhidhū","translation_bn":"তোমরা গ্রহণ করো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49330,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَهُودَ","transliteration":"l-yahūda","translation_bn":"ইয়াহুদীদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"يَهُودِيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49331,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"wal-naṣārā","translation_bn":"এবং খ্রিষ্টানদেরকে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصْرَانِيّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49332,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآءَ ۘ","transliteration":"awliyāa","translation_bn":"বন্ধুরূপে","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49334,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُهُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","translation_bn":"একে তাদের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49335,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآءُ","transliteration":"awliyāu","translation_bn":"বন্ধু","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49336,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"baʿḍin","translation_bn":"অপরের (অর্থাৎ পরস্পরে বন্ধু)","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49338,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49339,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَتَوَلَّهُم","transliteration":"yatawallahum","translation_bn":"বন্ধু বানাবে তাদেরকে","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49340,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49341,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"fa-innahu","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই সে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":49342,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্যকার তাদের(গণ্য হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49344,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":49345,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":49346,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":49347,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"সতপথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49348,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-qawma","translation_bn":"(ঐসব)সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49349,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"(যারা)সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49350,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā tattakhidhū l-yahūda wal-naṣārā awliyāa baʿḍuhum awliyāu baʿḍin waman yatawallahum minkum fa-innahu min''hum inna l-laha lā yahdī l-qawma l-ẓālimīna', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমরা ইয়াহূদ ও নাসারাদেরকে বন্ধু হিসেবে গ্রহণ করো না, তারা একে অপরের বন্ধু। তোমাদের মধ্যে কেউ তাদেরকে বন্ধুরূপে গ্রহণ করলে সে তাদেরই অন্তর্ভুক্ত হবে। আল্লাহ যালিমদেরকে সৎপথে পরিচালিত করেন না।', 'O you who have believed, do not take the Jews and the Christians as allies. They are [in fact] allies of one another. And whoever is an ally to them among you - then indeed, he is [one] of them. Indeed, Allah guides not the wrongdoing people.', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমরা ইয়াহূদ ও নাসারাদেরকে বন্ধু হিসেবে গ্রহণ করো না, তারা একে অপরের বন্ধু। তোমাদের মধ্যে কেউ তাদেরকে বন্ধুরূপে গ্রহণ করলে সে তাদেরই অন্তর্ভুক্ত হবে। আল্লাহ যালিমদেরকে সৎপথে পরিচালিত করেন না।', 'O you who have believed, do not take the Jews and the Christians as allies. They are [in fact] allies of one another. And whoever is an ally to them among you - then indeed, he is [one] of them. Indeed, Allah guides not the wrongdoing people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005051.mp3', now()),
  (5, 52, '', '[{"id":50021,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَتَرَى","transliteration":"fatarā","translation_bn":"তাই তুমি দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50022,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50023,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50024,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِم","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"অন্তরগুলোতে তাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50025,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّرَضٌۭ","transliteration":"maraḍun","translation_bn":"(মুনাফেকীর)রোগ","root":"مرض","lemma":"مَّرَض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50026,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُسَـٰرِعُونَ","transliteration":"yusāriʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা দ্রুত ধাবিত হয়","root":"سرع","lemma":"يُسَٰرِعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50027,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِمْ","transliteration":"fīhim","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50028,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50029,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"نَخْشَىٰٓ","transliteration":"nakhshā","translation_bn":"\"ভয় করি আমরা","root":"خشي","lemma":"خَشِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50030,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":50031,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تُصِيبَنَا","transliteration":"tuṣībanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপর পড়বে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50032,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"دَآئِرَ ةٌۭ ۚ","transliteration":"dāiratun","translation_bn":"কোনো ভাগ্য বিপর্যয়\"","root":"دور","lemma":"دَا^ئِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50034,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَعَسَى","transliteration":"faʿasā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর হয়তো (যখন)","root":"عسي","lemma":"عَسَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50035,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50036,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":50037,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِىَ","transliteration":"yatiya","translation_bn":"আসবেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50038,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْفَتْحِ","transliteration":"bil-fatḥi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে বিজয় (তোমাদেরকে)","root":"فتح","lemma":"فَتْح","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50039,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50040,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرٍۢ","transliteration":"amrin","translation_bn":"(অন্য কিছু) বিষয়","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50041,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50042,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عِندِهِۦ","transliteration":"ʿindihi","translation_bn":"নিকট তাঁর","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50043,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فَيُصْبِحُوا۟","transliteration":"fayuṣ''biḥū","translation_bn":"তখন তারা হবে","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50044,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50045,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50046,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"أَسَرُّوا۟","transliteration":"asarrū","translation_bn":"তারা গোপন করতো (অর্থাৎ মুনাফেকী)","root":"سرر","lemma":"أَسَرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50047,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50048,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"নিজেদের তাদের (মনের)","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50049,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"نَـٰدِمِينَ","transliteration":"nādimīna","translation_bn":"অনুতাপকারী (হবে)","root":"ندم","lemma":"نَٰدِمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50050,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fatarā alladhīna fī qulūbihim maraḍun yusāriʿūna fīhim yaqūlūna nakhshā an tuṣībanā dāiratun faʿasā l-lahu an yatiya bil-fatḥi aw amrin min ʿindihi fayuṣ''biḥū ʿalā mā asarrū fī anfusihim nādimīna', 'যাদের অন্তরে ব্যাধি আছে তুমি তাদেরকে দেখবে তারা তাদের (অর্থাৎ ইয়াহূদী, নাসারা মুশরিকদের) দৌড়ে গিয়ে বলবে, আমাদের ভয় হয় আমরা বিপদের চক্করে পড়ে না যাই। হয়তো আল্লাহ বিজয় দান করবেন কিংবা নিজের পক্ষ হতে এমন কিছু দিবেন যাতে তারা তাদের অন্তরে যা লুকিয়ে রেখেছিল তার কারণে লজ্জিত হবে।', 'So you see those in whose hearts is disease hastening into [association with] them, saying, "We are afraid a misfortune may strike us." But perhaps Allah will bring conquest or a decision from Him, and they will become, over what they have been concealing within themselves, regretful.', 'যাদের অন্তরে ব্যাধি আছে তুমি তাদেরকে দেখবে তারা তাদের (অর্থাৎ ইয়াহূদী, নাসারা মুশরিকদের) দৌড়ে গিয়ে বলবে, আমাদের ভয় হয় আমরা বিপদের চক্করে পড়ে না যাই। হয়তো আল্লাহ বিজয় দান করবেন কিংবা নিজের পক্ষ হতে এমন কিছু দিবেন যাতে তারা তাদের অন্তরে যা লুকিয়ে রেখেছিল তার কারণে লজ্জিত হবে।', 'So you see those in whose hearts is disease hastening into [association with] them, saying, "We are afraid a misfortune may strike us." But perhaps Allah will bring conquest or a decision from Him, and they will become, over what they have been concealing within themselves, regretful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005052.mp3', now()),
  (5, 53, '', '[{"id":50637,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُ","transliteration":"wayaqūlu","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50638,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50639,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50640,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَهَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"ahāulāi","translation_bn":"\"কি এইসব লোকেরা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":50641,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারাই) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50642,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَقْسَمُوا۟","transliteration":"aqsamū","translation_bn":"শপথ করেছিলো (বিশ্বাস করাতো)","root":"قسم","lemma":"أَقْسَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50643,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"নামে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50644,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَهْدَ","transliteration":"jahda","translation_bn":"দৃঢ়ভাবে","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَهْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50645,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَيْمَـٰنِهِمْ ۙ","transliteration":"aymānihim","translation_bn":"শপথগুলোকে তাদের","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50647,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":50648,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَمَعَكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lamaʿakum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সাথে তোমাদের\"","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":50650,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَبِطَتْ","transliteration":"ḥabiṭat","translation_bn":"বিনষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"حبط","lemma":"حَبِطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50651,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ","transliteration":"aʿmāluhum","translation_bn":"কাজগুলো তাদের","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50652,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَأَصْبَحُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-aṣbaḥū","translation_bn":"অতএব তারা হয়েছে","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50653,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰسِرِينَ","transliteration":"khāsirīna","translation_bn":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَٰسِرِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50654,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaqūlu alladhīna āmanū ahāulāi alladhīna aqsamū bil-lahi jahda aymānihim innahum lamaʿakum ḥabiṭat aʿmāluhum fa-aṣbaḥū khāsirīna', 'মু’মিনগণ বলবে, এরা কি তারাই যারা আল্লাহর নামে শক্ত কসম খেয়ে বলত যে, তারা অবশ্যই তোমাদের সঙ্গে আছে। তাদের কৃতকর্ম নিস্ফল হয়ে গেছে, যার ফলে তারা ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়েছে।', 'And those who believe will say, "Are these the ones who swore by Allah their strongest oaths that indeed they were with you?" Their deeds have become worthless, and they have become losers.', 'মু’মিনগণ বলবে, এরা কি তারাই যারা আল্লাহর নামে শক্ত কসম খেয়ে বলত যে, তারা অবশ্যই তোমাদের সঙ্গে আছে। তাদের কৃতকর্ম নিস্ফল হয়ে গেছে, যার ফলে তারা ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়েছে।', 'And those who believe will say, "Are these the ones who swore by Allah their strongest oaths that indeed they were with you?" Their deeds have become worthless, and they have become losers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005053.mp3', now()),
  (5, 54, '', '[{"id":51420,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":51421,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51422,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51423,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":51424,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَرْتَدَّ","transliteration":"yartadda","translation_bn":"ফিরে যাবে","root":"ردد","lemma":"ٱرْتَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51425,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51426,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51427,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"دِينِهِۦ","transliteration":"dīnihi","translation_bn":"তার দীন (যাক না)","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51428,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"এরপর শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":51429,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِى","transliteration":"yatī","translation_bn":"আসবেন (অর্থাৎ সৃষ্টি করবেন)","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51430,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51431,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"biqawmin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে (এমন)সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51432,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّهُمْ","transliteration":"yuḥibbuhum","translation_bn":"ভালোবাসবেন তিনি যাদেরকে","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51433,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَيُحِبُّونَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"wayuḥibbūnahu","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ভালোবাসবে তাঁকে","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51434,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَذِلَّةٍ","transliteration":"adhillatin","translation_bn":"(তারা)কোমল","root":"ذلل","lemma":"أَذِلَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":51435,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51436,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু’মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51437,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَعِزَّةٍ","transliteration":"aʿizzatin","translation_bn":"কঠোর","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":51438,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51439,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফিরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51440,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يُجَـٰهِدُونَ","transliteration":"yujāhidūna","translation_bn":"তারা জিহাদ করবে","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51441,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51442,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51443,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51444,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":51445,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يَخَافُونَ","transliteration":"yakhāfūna","translation_bn":"তারা ভয় করবে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51446,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لَوْمَةَ","transliteration":"lawmata","translation_bn":"নিন্দার","root":"لوم","lemma":"لَوْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51447,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"لَآئِمٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"lāimin","translation_bn":"(কোনো)নিন্দুকের","root":"لوم","lemma":"لَا^ئِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51449,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":51450,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلُ","transliteration":"faḍlu","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51451,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51452,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْتِيهِ","transliteration":"yu''tīhi","translation_bn":"তিনি দেন তা","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51453,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51454,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51456,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51457,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"وَٰسِعٌ","transliteration":"wāsiʿun","translation_bn":"প্রাচুর্যময়","root":"وسع","lemma":"وَٰسِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51458,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":51459,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū man yartadda minkum ʿan dīnihi fasawfa yatī l-lahu biqawmin yuḥibbuhum wayuḥibbūnahu adhillatin ʿalā l-mu''minīna aʿizzatin ʿalā l-kāfirīna yujāhidūna fī sabīli l-lahi walā yakhāfūna lawmata lāimin dhālika faḍlu l-lahi yu''tīhi man yashāu wal-lahu wāsiʿun ʿalīmun', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমাদের মধ্য হতে কেউ তার দ্বীন হতে ফিরে গেলে সত্বর আল্লাহ এমন এক সম্প্রদায়কে নিয়ে আসবেন যাদেরকে তিনি ভালবাসেন আর তারাও তাঁকে ভালবাসবে, তারা মু’মিনদের প্রতি কোমল আর কাফিরদের প্রতি কঠোর হবে, তারা আল্লাহর পথে যুদ্ধ করবে, কোন নিন্দুকের নিন্দাকে তারা ভয় করবে না, এটা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ- যাকে ইচ্ছে তিনি দান করেন এবং আল্লাহ প্রাচুর্যের অধিকারী, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'O you who have believed, whoever of you should revert from his religion - Allah will bring forth [in place of them] a people He will love and who will love Him [who are] humble toward the believers, powerful against the disbelievers; they strive in the cause of Allah and do not fear the blame of a critic. That is the favor of Allah; He bestows it upon whom He wills. And Allah is all-Encompassing and Knowing.', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমাদের মধ্য হতে কেউ তার দ্বীন হতে ফিরে গেলে সত্বর আল্লাহ এমন এক সম্প্রদায়কে নিয়ে আসবেন যাদেরকে তিনি ভালবাসেন আর তারাও তাঁকে ভালবাসবে, তারা মু’মিনদের প্রতি কোমল আর কাফিরদের প্রতি কঠোর হবে, তারা আল্লাহর পথে যুদ্ধ করবে, কোন নিন্দুকের নিন্দাকে তারা ভয় করবে না, এটা আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ- যাকে ইচ্ছে তিনি দান করেন এবং আল্লাহ প্রাচুর্যের অধিকারী, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'O you who have believed, whoever of you should revert from his religion - Allah will bring forth [in place of them] a people He will love and who will love Him [who are] humble toward the believers, powerful against the disbelievers; they strive in the cause of Allah and do not fear the blame of a critic. That is the favor of Allah; He bestows it upon whom He wills. And Allah is all-Encompassing and Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005054.mp3', now()),
  (5, 55, '', '[{"id":51805,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত পক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51806,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيُّكُمُ","transliteration":"waliyyukumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের বন্ধু","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51807,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":51808,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولُهُۥ","transliteration":"warasūluhu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51809,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51810,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে (তারা)","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51811,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51812,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُقِيمُونَ","transliteration":"yuqīmūna","translation_bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠা করে","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51813,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51814,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَيُؤْتُونَ","transliteration":"wayu''tūna","translation_bn":"ও প্রদান করে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51815,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-zakata","translation_bn":"যাকাত","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51816,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":51817,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَٰكِعُونَ","transliteration":"rākiʿūna","translation_bn":"অবনমিত (আল্লাহর কাছে)","root":"ركع","lemma":"رَاكِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51818,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā waliyyukumu l-lahu warasūluhu wa-alladhīna āmanū alladhīna yuqīmūna l-ṣalata wayu''tūna l-zakata wahum rākiʿūna', 'তোমাদের বন্ধু কেবল আল্লাহ, তাঁর রসূল ও মু’মিনগণ যারা নামায কায়িম করে, যাকাত আদায় করে এবং আল্লাহর কাছে অবনত হয়।', 'Your ally is none but Allah and [therefore] His Messenger and those who have believed - those who establish prayer and give zakah, and they bow [in worship].', 'তোমাদের বন্ধু কেবল আল্লাহ, তাঁর রসূল ও মু’মিনগণ যারা নামায কায়িম করে, যাকাত আদায় করে এবং আল্লাহর কাছে অবনত হয়।', 'Your ally is none but Allah and [therefore] His Messenger and those who have believed - those who establish prayer and give zakah, and they bow [in worship].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005055.mp3', now()),
  (5, 56, '', '[{"id":52323,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52324,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَتَوَلَّ","transliteration":"yatawalla","translation_bn":"বন্ধু বানাবে","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52325,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52326,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52327,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও (তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52328,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52329,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":52330,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حِزْبَ","transliteration":"ḥiz''ba","translation_bn":"(সেই) দল","root":"حزب","lemma":"حِزْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52331,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52332,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":52333,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَـٰلِبُونَ","transliteration":"l-ghālibūna","translation_bn":"বিজয়ী হবে","root":"غلب","lemma":"غَالِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52334,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman yatawalla l-laha warasūlahu wa-alladhīna āmanū fa-inna ḥiz''ba l-lahi humu l-ghālibūna', 'যে কেউ আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূল এবং ঈমানদারগণকে বন্ধুরূপে গ্রহণ করবে (সে দেখতে পাবে যে) আল্লাহর দলই বিজয়ী হবে।', 'And whoever is an ally of Allah and His Messenger and those who have believed - indeed, the party of Allah - they will be the predominant.', 'যে কেউ আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূল এবং ঈমানদারগণকে বন্ধুরূপে গ্রহণ করবে (সে দেখতে পাবে যে) আল্লাহর দলই বিজয়ী হবে।', 'And whoever is an ally of Allah and His Messenger and those who have believed - indeed, the party of Allah - they will be the predominant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005056.mp3', now()),
  (5, 57, '', '[{"id":52690,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":52691,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52692,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52693,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":52694,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّخِذُوا۟","transliteration":"tattakhidhū","translation_bn":"তোমরা গ্রহণ করো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52695,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52696,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","transliteration":"ittakhadhū","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করেছে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52697,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"دِينَكُمْ","transliteration":"dīnakum","translation_bn":"দীনকে তোমাদের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52698,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هُزُوًۭا","transliteration":"huzuwan","translation_bn":"বিদ্রুপরূপে","root":"هزا","lemma":"هُزُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52699,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعِبًۭا","transliteration":"walaʿiban","translation_bn":"ও খেলার বস্তু হিসেবে","root":"لعب","lemma":"لَعِب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52700,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52701,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52702,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أُوتُوا۟","transliteration":"ūtū","translation_bn":"দেয়া হয়েছিলো","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52703,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52704,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52705,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكُمْ","transliteration":"qablikum","translation_bn":"পূর্ব তোমাদের","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52706,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْكُفَّارَ","transliteration":"wal-kufāra","translation_bn":"এবং কাফিরদেরকেও","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَافِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52707,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآءَ ۚ","transliteration":"awliyāa","translation_bn":"বন্ধুরূপে (গ্রহণ করো না)","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52709,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52710,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52711,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":52712,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52713,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু’মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52714,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā tattakhidhū alladhīna ittakhadhū dīnakum huzuwan walaʿiban mina alladhīna ūtū l-kitāba min qablikum wal-kufāra awliyāa wa-ittaqū l-laha in kuntum mu''minīna', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমাদের পূর্বে যাদেরকে কিতাব দেয়া হয়েছিল তাদের মধ্যে যারা তোমাদের দ্বীনকে হাসি-তামাসা ও খেলার বস্তু হিসেবে গ্রহণ করে তাদেরকে এবং কাফিরদেরকে বন্ধুরূপে গ্রহণ করো না আর আল্লাহকে ভয় কর যদি তোমরা মু’মিন হও।', 'O you who have believed, take not those who have taken your religion in ridicule and amusement among the ones who were given the Scripture before you nor the disbelievers as allies. And fear Allah, if you should [truly] be believers.', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমাদের পূর্বে যাদেরকে কিতাব দেয়া হয়েছিল তাদের মধ্যে যারা তোমাদের দ্বীনকে হাসি-তামাসা ও খেলার বস্তু হিসেবে গ্রহণ করে তাদেরকে এবং কাফিরদেরকে বন্ধুরূপে গ্রহণ করো না আর আল্লাহকে ভয় কর যদি তোমরা মু’মিন হও।', 'O you who have believed, take not those who have taken your religion in ridicule and amusement among the ones who were given the Scripture before you nor the disbelievers as allies. And fear Allah, if you should [truly] be believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005057.mp3', now()),
  (5, 58, '', '[{"id":53595,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53596,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَادَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"nādaytum","translation_bn":"ডাকা হয় তোমাদেরকে","root":"ندو","lemma":"نَادَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53597,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53598,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ṣalati","translation_bn":"সালাতের","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53599,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذُوهَا","transliteration":"ittakhadhūhā","translation_bn":"তারা গ্রহণ করে তা","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53600,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُزُوًۭا","transliteration":"huzuwan","translation_bn":"বিদ্রুপ (রূপে)","root":"هزا","lemma":"هُزُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53601,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعِبًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"walaʿiban","translation_bn":"ও খেলা হিসেবে","root":"لعب","lemma":"لَعِب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53603,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":53604,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53605,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"qawmun","translation_bn":"(এমন)সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53606,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"(যারা) না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":53607,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","translation_bn":"বিচার বিবেচনা করে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53608,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā nādaytum ilā l-ṣalati ittakhadhūhā huzuwan walaʿiban dhālika bi-annahum qawmun lā yaʿqilūna', 'তোমরা যখন সলাতের জন্য আহবান জানাও তখন তারা সেটিকে তামাশা ও খেলার বস্তু হিসেবে গ্রহণ করে। এটা এজন্য যে, তারা হল নির্বোধ সম্প্রদায়।', 'And when you call to prayer, they take it in ridicule and amusement. That is because they are a people who do not use reason.', 'তোমরা যখন সলাতের জন্য আহবান জানাও তখন তারা সেটিকে তামাশা ও খেলার বস্তু হিসেবে গ্রহণ করে। এটা এজন্য যে, তারা হল নির্বোধ সম্প্রদায়।', 'And when you call to prayer, they take it in ridicule and amusement. That is because they are a people who do not use reason.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005058.mp3', now()),
  (5, 59, '', '[{"id":53882,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53883,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","transliteration":"yāahla","translation_bn":"\"হে অধিকারীরা","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":53884,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53885,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":53886,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَنقِمُونَ","transliteration":"tanqimūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রতিশোধ নিচ্ছো","root":"نقم","lemma":"نَقَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53887,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنَّآ","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"থেকে আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53888,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া (অন্য কিছুর)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":53889,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":53890,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَّا","transliteration":"āmannā","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছি আমরা","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53891,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"উপর আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53892,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53893,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53894,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ilaynā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53895,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53896,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53897,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53898,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53899,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"আর(মূল কথা হলো)যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53900,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَكُمْ","transliteration":"aktharakum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ তোমাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53901,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰسِقُونَ","transliteration":"fāsiqūna","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগী\"","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53902,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul yāahla l-kitābi hal tanqimūna minnā illā an āmannā bil-lahi wamā unzila ilaynā wamā unzila min qablu wa-anna aktharakum fāsiqūna', 'বল, ‘ওহে কিতাবধারী সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা এ ছাড়া অন্য কারণে আমাদের প্রতি রাগান্বিত নও যে, আমরা আল্লাহর প্রতি এবং আমাদের প্রতি আর আমাদের পূর্বে যা নাযিল হয়েছিল তার প্রতি ঈমান এনেছি, তোমাদের অধিকাংশই তো হচ্ছে ফাসিক।’', 'Say, "O People of the Scripture, do you resent us except [for the fact] that we have believed in Allah and what was revealed to us and what was revealed before and because most of you are defiantly disobedient?"', 'বল, ‘ওহে কিতাবধারী সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা এ ছাড়া অন্য কারণে আমাদের প্রতি রাগান্বিত নও যে, আমরা আল্লাহর প্রতি এবং আমাদের প্রতি আর আমাদের পূর্বে যা নাযিল হয়েছিল তার প্রতি ঈমান এনেছি, তোমাদের অধিকাংশই তো হচ্ছে ফাসিক।’', 'Say, "O People of the Scripture, do you resent us except [for the fact] that we have believed in Allah and what was revealed to us and what was revealed before and because most of you are defiantly disobedient?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005059.mp3', now()),
  (5, 60, '', '[{"id":54740,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54741,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"\"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":54742,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُنَبِّئُكُم","transliteration":"unabbi-ukum","translation_bn":"সংবাদ দিবো তোমাদের","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54743,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِشَرٍّۢ","transliteration":"bisharrin","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে নিকৃষ্টের","root":"شرر","lemma":"شَرّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54744,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"চেয়েও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54745,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":54746,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَثُوبَةً","transliteration":"mathūbatan","translation_bn":"পরিণতির দিক দিয়ে","root":"ثوب","lemma":"مَثُوبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54747,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":54748,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54750,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(সে ঐলোক) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54751,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَّعَنَهُ","transliteration":"laʿanahu","translation_bn":"অভিশাপ দিয়েছেন তাকে","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54752,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54753,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَغَضِبَ","transliteration":"waghaḍiba","translation_bn":"ও রাগ হয়েছেন","root":"غضب","lemma":"غَضِبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54754,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54755,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"ও বানিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54756,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمُ","transliteration":"min''humu","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে কাউকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54757,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِرَدَةَ","transliteration":"l-qiradata","translation_bn":"বানর","root":"قرد","lemma":"قِرَدَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54758,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْخَنَازِيرَ","transliteration":"wal-khanāzīra","translation_bn":"ও শুকর","root":"خنزر","lemma":"خِنزِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54759,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَعَبَدَ","transliteration":"waʿabada","translation_bn":"ও সে উপাসনা করেছে","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54760,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطَّـٰغُوتَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ṭāghūta","translation_bn":"অসত্য দেবতার","root":"طغي","lemma":"طَّٰغُوت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54762,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":54763,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"شَرٌّۭ","transliteration":"sharrun","translation_bn":"নিকৃষ্ট","root":"شرر","lemma":"شَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54764,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مَّكَانًۭا","transliteration":"makānan","translation_bn":"মর্যাদায়","root":"كون","lemma":"مَّكَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54765,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَأَضَلُّ","transliteration":"wa-aḍallu","translation_bn":"ও অধিক পথভ্রষ্ট","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54766,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54767,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"سَوَآءِ","transliteration":"sawāi","translation_bn":"সরল সোজা","root":"سوي","lemma":"سَوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54768,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلِ","transliteration":"l-sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ\"","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54769,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul hal unabbi-ukum bisharrin min dhālika mathūbatan ʿinda l-lahi man laʿanahu l-lahu waghaḍiba ʿalayhi wajaʿala min''humu l-qiradata wal-khanāzīra waʿabada l-ṭāghūta ulāika sharrun makānan wa-aḍallu ʿan sawāi l-sabīli', 'বল, আমি তোমাদেরকে কি এর চেয়ে খারাপ কিছুর সংবাদ দেব যা আল্লাহর নিকট প্রতিদান হিসেবে আছে? (আর তা হল) যাকে আল্লাহ লা‘নাত করেছেন, যার উপর তিনি ক্রোধান্বিত হয়েছেন, যাদের কতককে তিনি বানর ও শুকরে পরিণত করেছেন আর যারা তাগুতের ‘ইবাদাত করেছে তারাই সবচেয়ে নিকৃষ্ট মানের লোক এবং সরল সত্য পথ হতে সবচেয়ে বিচ্যুত।', 'Say, "Shall I inform you of [what is] worse than that as penalty from Allah? [It is that of] those whom Allah has cursed and with whom He became angry and made of them apes and pigs and slaves of Taghut. Those are worse in position and further astray from the sound way."', 'বল, আমি তোমাদেরকে কি এর চেয়ে খারাপ কিছুর সংবাদ দেব যা আল্লাহর নিকট প্রতিদান হিসেবে আছে? (আর তা হল) যাকে আল্লাহ লা‘নাত করেছেন, যার উপর তিনি ক্রোধান্বিত হয়েছেন, যাদের কতককে তিনি বানর ও শুকরে পরিণত করেছেন আর যারা তাগুতের ‘ইবাদাত করেছে তারাই সবচেয়ে নিকৃষ্ট মানের লোক এবং সরল সত্য পথ হতে সবচেয়ে বিচ্যুত।', 'Say, "Shall I inform you of [what is] worse than that as penalty from Allah? [It is that of] those whom Allah has cursed and with whom He became angry and made of them apes and pigs and slaves of Taghut. Those are worse in position and further astray from the sound way."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005060.mp3', now()),
  (5, 61, '', '[{"id":55320,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55321,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءُوكُمْ","transliteration":"jāūkum","translation_bn":"কাছে আসে তোমাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55322,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55323,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَّا","transliteration":"āmannā","translation_bn":"\"ঈমান এনেছি আমরা\"","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55324,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَقَد","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":55325,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دَّخَلُوا۟","transliteration":"dakhalū","translation_bn":"তারা প্রবেশ করেছে","root":"دخل","lemma":"دَخَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55326,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْكُفْرِ","transliteration":"bil-kuf''ri","translation_bn":"নিয়ে অবিশ্বাস","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55327,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55328,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":55329,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَرَجُوا۟","transliteration":"kharajū","translation_bn":"বের হয়েছে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55330,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55332,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55333,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55334,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55335,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55336,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَكْتُمُونَ","transliteration":"yaktumūna","translation_bn":"তারা গোপন করে (মনের মধ্যে)","root":"كتم","lemma":"كَتَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55337,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā jāūkum qālū āmannā waqad dakhalū bil-kuf''ri wahum qad kharajū bihi wal-lahu aʿlamu bimā kānū yaktumūna', 'যখন তারা তোমাদের কাছে আসে তখন বলে ‘‘আমরা ঈমান এনেছি’’। বাস্তবে তারা কুফরী নিয়েই প্রবেশ করে, কুফরী নিয়েই বেরিয়ে যায়, তারা যা লুকিয়ে রাখে আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে পূর্ণরূপে অবগত।', 'And when they come to you, they say, "We believe." But they have entered with disbelief [in their hearts], and they have certainly left with it. And Allah is most knowing of what they were concealing.', 'যখন তারা তোমাদের কাছে আসে তখন বলে ‘‘আমরা ঈমান এনেছি’’। বাস্তবে তারা কুফরী নিয়েই প্রবেশ করে, কুফরী নিয়েই বেরিয়ে যায়, তারা যা লুকিয়ে রাখে আল্লাহ সে সম্পর্কে পূর্ণরূপে অবগত।', 'And when they come to you, they say, "We believe." But they have entered with disbelief [in their hearts], and they have certainly left with it. And Allah is most knowing of what they were concealing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005061.mp3', now()),
  (5, 62, '', '[{"id":55723,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتَرَىٰ","transliteration":"watarā","translation_bn":"এবং তুমি দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55724,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"অনেক (লোককে)","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55725,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55726,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُسَـٰرِعُونَ","transliteration":"yusāriʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা দ্রুত ধাবিত হয়","root":"سرع","lemma":"يُسَٰرِعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55727,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55728,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِثْمِ","transliteration":"l-ith''mi","translation_bn":"পাপের","root":"اثم","lemma":"إِثْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55729,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْعُدْوَٰنِ","transliteration":"wal-ʿud''wāni","translation_bn":"ও সীমালঙ্ঘনে","root":"عدو","lemma":"عُدْوَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55730,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَكْلِهِمُ","transliteration":"wa-aklihimu","translation_bn":"ও তাদের খাওয়া","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55731,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسُّحْتَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-suḥ''ta","translation_bn":"অবৈধ(অতি তৎপর)","root":"سحت","lemma":"سُّحْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55733,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"labi''sa","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিকৃষ্ট","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":55734,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":55735,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55736,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করে এসেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55737,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watarā kathīran min''hum yusāriʿūna fī l-ith''mi wal-ʿud''wāni wa-aklihimu l-suḥ''ta labi''sa mā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'তাদের অনেককেই তুমি পাপ, শত্রুতা আর হারাম ভক্ষণের প্রতিযোগিতায় ব্যস্ত দেখতে পাবে। তারা যা করে তা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট!', 'And you see many of them hastening into sin and aggression and the devouring of [what is] unlawful. How wretched is what they have been doing.', 'তাদের অনেককেই তুমি পাপ, শত্রুতা আর হারাম ভক্ষণের প্রতিযোগিতায় ব্যস্ত দেখতে পাবে। তারা যা করে তা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট!', 'And you see many of them hastening into sin and aggression and the devouring of [what is] unlawful. How wretched is what they have been doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005062.mp3', now()),
  (5, 63, '', '[{"id":56225,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَا","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"উৎসাহবাচক (Exhortation)"},{"id":56226,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنْهَىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"yanhāhumu","translation_bn":"নিষেধ করে তাদের","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56227,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّبَّـٰنِيُّونَ","transliteration":"l-rabāniyūna","translation_bn":"রব্বানি","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبَّٰنِيِّن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56228,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَحْبَارُ","transliteration":"wal-aḥbāru","translation_bn":"ও পন্ডিতগণ (তাদের মধ্যকার)","root":"حبر","lemma":"أَحْبَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56229,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56230,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلِهِمُ","transliteration":"qawlihimu","translation_bn":"কথা তাদের (বলা)","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56231,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِثْمَ","transliteration":"l-ith''ma","translation_bn":"পাপের","root":"اثم","lemma":"إِثْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56232,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَكْلِهِمُ","transliteration":"wa-aklihimu","translation_bn":"ও তাদের খাওয়া (হতে)","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56233,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسُّحْتَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-suḥ''ta","translation_bn":"অবৈধ","root":"سحت","lemma":"سُّحْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56235,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَبِئْسَ","transliteration":"labi''sa","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিকৃষ্ট","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":56236,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56237,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56238,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَصْنَعُونَ","transliteration":"yaṣnaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা রচনা করে এসেছে","root":"صنع","lemma":"صَنَعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56239,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lawlā yanhāhumu l-rabāniyūna wal-aḥbāru ʿan qawlihimu l-ith''ma wa-aklihimu l-suḥ''ta labi''sa mā kānū yaṣnaʿūna', 'দরবেশ ও পুরোহিতগণ তাদেরকে পাপের কথা বলা হতে এবং হারাম ভক্ষণ থেকে নিষেধ করে না কেন? তারা যা করে তা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট!', 'Why do the rabbis and religious scholars not forbid them from saying what is sinful and devouring what is unlawful? How wretched is what they have been practicing.', 'দরবেশ ও পুরোহিতগণ তাদেরকে পাপের কথা বলা হতে এবং হারাম ভক্ষণ থেকে নিষেধ করে না কেন? তারা যা করে তা কতই না নিকৃষ্ট!', 'Why do the rabbis and religious scholars not forbid them from saying what is sinful and devouring what is unlawful? How wretched is what they have been practicing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005063.mp3', now()),
  (5, 64, '', '[{"id":56686,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَتِ","transliteration":"waqālati","translation_bn":"এবং বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56687,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَهُودُ","transliteration":"l-yahūdu","translation_bn":"ইয়াহুদীরা","root":"—","lemma":"يَهُودِيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56688,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَدُ","transliteration":"yadu","translation_bn":"হাত","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56689,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56690,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَغْلُولَةٌ ۚ","transliteration":"maghlūlatun","translation_bn":"অবরুদ্ধ\"","root":"غلل","lemma":"مَغْلُولَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56692,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"غُلَّتْ","transliteration":"ghullat","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে অবরুদ্ধ হয়েছে","root":"غلل","lemma":"غَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56693,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"aydīhim","translation_bn":"হাতগুলো তাদের (অর্থাৎ ইয়াহুদীদের)","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56694,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلُعِنُوا۟","transliteration":"waluʿinū","translation_bn":"ও তারা অভিশপ্ত হয়েছে","root":"لعن","lemma":"لَعَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56695,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56696,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟ ۘ","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56698,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":56699,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَدَاهُ","transliteration":"