أَوْقَدُوا۟","transliteration":"awqadū","translation_bn":"তারা জ্বালিয়েছে","root":"وقد","lemma":"أَوْقَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56726,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"نَارًۭا","transliteration":"nāran","translation_bn":"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56727,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْحَرْبِ","transliteration":"lil''ḥarbi","translation_bn":"জন্যে যুদ্ধের","root":"حرب","lemma":"حَرْب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56728,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"أَطْفَأَهَا","transliteration":"aṭfa-ahā","translation_bn":"নিভিয়ে দিয়েছেন তা","root":"طفا","lemma":"أَطْفَأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56729,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56731,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"وَيَسْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"wayasʿawna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা চেষ্টা করে","root":"سعي","lemma":"سَعَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56732,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56733,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56734,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"فَسَادًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"fasādan","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয়ের","root":"فسد","lemma":"فَسَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56736,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56737,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":56738,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"পছন্দ করেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56739,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-muf''sidīna","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টিকারীদের","root":"فسد","lemma":"مُفْسِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56740,"position":48,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālati l-yahūdu yadu l-lahi maghlūlatun ghullat aydīhim waluʿinū bimā qālū bal yadāhu mabsūṭatāni yunfiqu kayfa yashāu walayazīdanna kathīran min''hum mā unzila ilayka min rabbika ṭugh''yānan wakuf''ran wa-alqaynā baynahumu l-ʿadāwata wal-baghḍāa ilā yawmi l-qiyāmati kullamā awqadū nāran lil''ḥarbi aṭfa-ahā l-lahu wayasʿawna fī l-arḍi fasādan wal-lahu lā yuḥibbu l-muf''sidīna', 'ইয়াহূদীরা বলে, আল্লাহর হাত আবদ্ধ, তাদের হাতই আবদ্ধ, তাদের (প্রলাপ) উক্তির কারণে তারা হয়েছে অভিশপ্ত, বরং আল্লাহর উভয় হাত প্রসারিত, যেভাবে ইচ্ছে করেন দান করেন, তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে তোমার নিকট যা অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তা তাদের অনেকের সীমালঙ্ঘন ও কুফরী অবশ্য অবশ্যই বাড়িয়ে দিবে, আর ক্বিয়ামাত অবধি আমি তাদের পরস্পরের মধ্যে শত্রুতা ও বিদ্বেষ সৃষ্টি করে দিয়েছি। যখনই তারা যুদ্ধের আগুন প্রজ্জ্বলিত করে, আল্লাহ তা নিভিয়ে দেন, আর তারা দুনিয়ায় ফাসাদ ছড়িয়ে বেড়ায়, আল্লাহ ফাসাদ সৃষ্টিকারীদের পছন্দ করেন না।', 'And the Jews say, "The hand of Allah is chained." Chained are their hands, and cursed are they for what they say. Rather, both His hands are extended; He spends however He wills. And that which has been revealed to you from your Lord will surely increase many of them in transgression and disbelief. And We have cast among them animosity and hatred until the Day of Resurrection. Every time they kindled the fire of war [against you], Allah extinguished it. And they strive throughout the land [causing] corruption, and Allah does not like corrupters.', 'ইয়াহূদীরা বলে, আল্লাহর হাত আবদ্ধ, তাদের হাতই আবদ্ধ, তাদের (প্রলাপ) উক্তির কারণে তারা হয়েছে অভিশপ্ত, বরং আল্লাহর উভয় হাত প্রসারিত, যেভাবে ইচ্ছে করেন দান করেন, তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে তোমার নিকট যা অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তা তাদের অনেকের সীমালঙ্ঘন ও কুফরী অবশ্য অবশ্যই বাড়িয়ে দিবে, আর ক্বিয়ামাত অবধি আমি তাদের পরস্পরের মধ্যে শত্রুতা ও বিদ্বেষ সৃষ্টি করে দিয়েছি। যখনই তারা যুদ্ধের আগুন প্রজ্জ্বলিত করে, আল্লাহ তা নিভিয়ে দেন, আর তারা দুনিয়ায় ফাসাদ ছড়িয়ে বেড়ায়, আল্লাহ ফাসাদ সৃষ্টিকারীদের পছন্দ করেন না।', 'And the Jews say, "The hand of Allah is chained." Chained are their hands, and cursed are they for what they say. Rather, both His hands are extended; He spends however He wills. And that which has been revealed to you from your Lord will surely increase many of them in transgression and disbelief. And We have cast among them animosity and hatred until the Day of Resurrection. Every time they kindled the fire of war [against you], Allah extinguished it. And they strive throughout the land [causing] corruption, and Allah does not like corrupters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005064.mp3', now()),
  (5, 65, '', '[{"id":57375,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57376,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"(এমন হতো) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57377,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَ","transliteration":"ahla","translation_bn":"অধিকারীরা","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57378,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57379,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনতো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57380,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقَوْا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqaw","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ভয় করতো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57381,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَكَفَّرْنَا","transliteration":"lakaffarnā","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমরা মুছে দিতাম","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَّرَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":57382,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57383,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّـَٔاتِهِمْ","transliteration":"sayyiātihim","translation_bn":"দোষগুলো তাদের","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّـ#َات","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57384,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَأَدْخَلْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"wala-adkhalnāhum","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই আমরা প্রবেশ করাতাম তাদের","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57385,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتِ","transliteration":"jannāti","translation_bn":"জান্নাতে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57386,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّعِيمِ","transliteration":"l-naʿīmi","translation_bn":"সুখকর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَعِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57387,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw anna ahla l-kitābi āmanū wa-ittaqaw lakaffarnā ʿanhum sayyiātihim wala-adkhalnāhum jannāti l-naʿīmi', 'গ্রন্থধারীরা যদি ঈমান আনতো আর তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করত তাহলে আমি তাদের পাপ অবশ্যই মোচন করে দিতাম আর তাদেরকে নিআমতে ভরা জান্নাতে অবশ্যই দাখিল করতাম।', 'And if only the People of the Scripture had believed and feared Allah, We would have removed from them their misdeeds and admitted them to Gardens of Pleasure.', 'গ্রন্থধারীরা যদি ঈমান আনতো আর তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করত তাহলে আমি তাদের পাপ অবশ্যই মোচন করে দিতাম আর তাদেরকে নিআমতে ভরা জান্নাতে অবশ্যই দাখিল করতাম।', 'And if only the People of the Scripture had believed and feared Allah, We would have removed from them their misdeeds and admitted them to Gardens of Pleasure.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005065.mp3', now()),
  (5, 66, '', '[{"id":57770,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57771,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57772,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَقَامُوا۟","transliteration":"aqāmū","translation_bn":"প্রতিষ্ঠা করতো","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57773,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ","transliteration":"l-tawrāta","translation_bn":"তাওরাত","root":"—","lemma":"تَّوْرَىٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57774,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْإِنجِيلَ","transliteration":"wal-injīla","translation_bn":"ও ইনজীল","root":"—","lemma":"إِنجِيل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57775,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57776,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57777,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57778,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57779,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"তাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57780,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَأَكَلُوا۟","transliteration":"la-akalū","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তারা খাবার পেতো","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":57781,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57782,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقِهِمْ","transliteration":"fawqihim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57783,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَمِن","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"ও থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57784,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِ","transliteration":"taḥti","translation_bn":"নিচ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57785,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَرْجُلِهِم ۚ","transliteration":"arjulihim","translation_bn":"পায়ের তাদের","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57787,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57788,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٌۭ","transliteration":"ummatun","translation_bn":"একদল (আছে)","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57789,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مُّقْتَصِدَةٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"muq''taṣidatun","translation_bn":"সত্যপন্থী","root":"قصد","lemma":"مُّقْتَصِدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":57791,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَكَثِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"wakathīrun","translation_bn":"কিন্তু অধিকাংশই","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57792,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57793,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"سَآءَ","transliteration":"sāa","translation_bn":"নিকৃষ্ট","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57794,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":57795,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57796,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw annahum aqāmū l-tawrāta wal-injīla wamā unzila ilayhim min rabbihim la-akalū min fawqihim wamin taḥti arjulihim min''hum ummatun muq''taṣidatun wakathīrun min''hum sāa mā yaʿmalūna', 'তারা যদি তাওরাত ইঞ্জিল আর তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে যা তাদের প্রতি অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তার নিয়ম-বিধান প্রতিষ্ঠিত করত, তাহলে তাদের উপর থেকে আর তাদের পায়ের নীচ থেকে আহার্য পেত। তাদের মধ্যে একটি সত্যপন্থী দল আছে, কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই যা করে তা খারাপ।', 'And if only they upheld [the law of] the Torah, the Gospel, and what has been revealed to them from their Lord, they would have consumed [provision] from above them and from beneath their feet. Among them are a moderate community, but many of them - evil is that which they do.', 'তারা যদি তাওরাত ইঞ্জিল আর তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে যা তাদের প্রতি অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তার নিয়ম-বিধান প্রতিষ্ঠিত করত, তাহলে তাদের উপর থেকে আর তাদের পায়ের নীচ থেকে আহার্য পেত। তাদের মধ্যে একটি সত্যপন্থী দল আছে, কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই যা করে তা খারাপ।', 'And if only they upheld [the law of] the Torah, the Gospel, and what has been revealed to them from their Lord, they would have consumed [provision] from above them and from beneath their feet. Among them are a moderate community, but many of them - evil is that which they do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005066.mp3', now()),
  (5, 67, '', '[{"id":58263,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":58264,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولُ","transliteration":"l-rasūlu","translation_bn":"রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58265,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَلِّغْ","transliteration":"balligh","translation_bn":"প্রচার করো","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَّغْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58266,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58267,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58268,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58269,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58270,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكَ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58272,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58273,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58274,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَفْعَلْ","transliteration":"tafʿal","translation_bn":"তুমি করো","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58275,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"তবে না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":58276,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَلَّغْتَ","transliteration":"ballaghta","translation_bn":"তুমি প্রচার করলে","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَّغْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58277,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رِسَالَتَهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"risālatahu","translation_bn":"বার্তা তাঁর","root":"رسل","lemma":"رِسَالَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58279,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58280,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَعْصِمُكَ","transliteration":"yaʿṣimuka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে রক্ষা করবেন","root":"عصم","lemma":"يَعْصِمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58281,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58282,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58284,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":58285,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58286,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58287,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58288,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-qawma","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58289,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফিরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58290,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-rasūlu balligh mā unzila ilayka min rabbika wa-in lam tafʿal famā ballaghta risālatahu wal-lahu yaʿṣimuka mina l-nāsi inna l-laha lā yahdī l-qawma l-kāfirīna', 'হে রসূল! তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে যা তোমার প্রতি অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তা প্রচার কর, যদি না কর তাহলে তুমি তাঁর বার্তা পৌঁছানোর দায়িত্ব পালন করলে না। মানুষের অনিষ্ট হতে আল্লাহ্ই তোমাকে রক্ষা করবেন, আল্লাহ কাফির সম্প্রদায়কে কক্ষনো সৎপথ প্রদর্শন করবেন না।', 'O Messenger, announce that which has been revealed to you from your Lord, and if you do not, then you have not conveyed His message. And Allah will protect you from the people. Indeed, Allah does not guide the disbelieving people.', 'হে রসূল! তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে যা তোমার প্রতি অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তা প্রচার কর, যদি না কর তাহলে তুমি তাঁর বার্তা পৌঁছানোর দায়িত্ব পালন করলে না। মানুষের অনিষ্ট হতে আল্লাহ্ই তোমাকে রক্ষা করবেন, আল্লাহ কাফির সম্প্রদায়কে কক্ষনো সৎপথ প্রদর্শন করবেন না।', 'O Messenger, announce that which has been revealed to you from your Lord, and if you do not, then you have not conveyed His message. And Allah will protect you from the people. Indeed, Allah does not guide the disbelieving people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005067.mp3', now()),
  (5, 68, '', '[{"id":58655,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বল","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58656,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَهْلَ","transliteration":"yāahla","translation_bn":"\"হে অধিকারীরা","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":58657,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58658,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَسْتُمْ","transliteration":"lastum","translation_bn":"নও তোমরা","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58659,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58660,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কোনো কিছুর (দন্ডায়মান)","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58661,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58662,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تُقِيمُوا۟","transliteration":"tuqīmū","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রতিষ্ঠিত করো","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58663,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّوْرَىٰةَ","transliteration":"l-tawrāta","translation_bn":"তাওরাত","root":"—","lemma":"تَّوْرَىٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58664,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْإِنجِيلَ","transliteration":"wal-injīla","translation_bn":"ও ইনজীল","root":"—","lemma":"إِنجِيل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58665,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58666,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58667,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُم","transliteration":"ilaykum","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58668,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58669,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58671,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَيَزِيدَنَّ","transliteration":"walayazīdanna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই  বৃদ্ধি করবে","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58672,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"অনেক (লোককে)","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58673,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُم","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58674,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مَّآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58675,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَ","transliteration":"unzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করা হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58676,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58677,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58678,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58679,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"طُغْيَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"ṭugh''yānan","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন","root":"طغي","lemma":"طُغْيَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58680,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَكُفْرًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"wakuf''ran","translation_bn":"ও অবিশ্বাস","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58682,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58683,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"تَأْسَ","transliteration":"tasa","translation_bn":"দুঃখ করো","root":"اسو","lemma":"تَأْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58684,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58685,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58686,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফির","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58687,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul yāahla l-kitābi lastum ʿalā shayin ḥattā tuqīmū l-tawrāta wal-injīla wamā unzila ilaykum min rabbikum walayazīdanna kathīran min''hum mā unzila ilayka min rabbika ṭugh''yānan wakuf''ran falā tasa ʿalā l-qawmi l-kāfirīna', 'বল, হে গ্রন্থধারীগণ! তোমরা তাওরাত, ইঞ্জিল আর তোমাদের রবের নিকট হতে যা তোমাদের প্রতি নাযিল হয়েছে তার বিধি-বিধান প্রতিষ্ঠিত না করা পর্যন্ত তোমরা কোন ভিত্তির উপরই দন্ডায়মান নও। তোমার রবের নিকট হতে যা তোমার প্রতি অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তা তাদের অনেকের সীমালঙ্ঘন আর কুফরী অবশ্য অবশ্যই বৃদ্ধি করবে। কাজেই কাফির সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য তুমি আফসোস করো না।', 'Say, "O People of the Scripture, you are [standing] on nothing until you uphold [the law of] the Torah, the Gospel, and what has been revealed to you from your Lord." And that which has been revealed to you from your Lord will surely increase many of them in transgression and disbelief. So do not grieve over the disbelieving people.', 'বল, হে গ্রন্থধারীগণ! তোমরা তাওরাত, ইঞ্জিল আর তোমাদের রবের নিকট হতে যা তোমাদের প্রতি নাযিল হয়েছে তার বিধি-বিধান প্রতিষ্ঠিত না করা পর্যন্ত তোমরা কোন ভিত্তির উপরই দন্ডায়মান নও। তোমার রবের নিকট হতে যা তোমার প্রতি অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে তা তাদের অনেকের সীমালঙ্ঘন আর কুফরী অবশ্য অবশ্যই বৃদ্ধি করবে। কাজেই কাফির সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য তুমি আফসোস করো না।', 'Say, "O People of the Scripture, you are [standing] on nothing until you uphold [the law of] the Torah, the Gospel, and what has been revealed to you from your Lord." And that which has been revealed to you from your Lord will surely increase many of them in transgression and disbelief. So do not grieve over the disbelieving people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005068.mp3', now()),
  (5, 69, '', '[{"id":59219,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":59220,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59221,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59222,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59223,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَادُوا۟","transliteration":"hādū","translation_bn":"ইয়াহুদী হয়েছে","root":"هود","lemma":"هَادُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59224,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلصَّـٰبِـُٔونَ","transliteration":"wal-ṣābiūna","translation_bn":"ও সাবরী","root":"صبا","lemma":"صَّٰبِـ#ِين","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59225,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّصَـٰرَىٰ","transliteration":"wal-naṣārā","translation_bn":"ও খ্রিষ্টান","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصْرَانِيّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59226,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":59227,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59228,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"উপর আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59229,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","translation_bn":"ও দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59230,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","translation_bn":"আখেরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59231,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلَ","transliteration":"waʿamila","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করবে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59232,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59233,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":59234,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"خَوْفٌ","transliteration":"khawfun","translation_bn":"কোনো ভয়","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَوْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59235,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59236,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59237,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":59238,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَحْزَنُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥzanūna","translation_bn":"দুশ্চিন্তা করবে","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59239,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna āmanū wa-alladhīna hādū wal-ṣābiūna wal-naṣārā man āmana bil-lahi wal-yawmi l-ākhiri waʿamila ṣāliḥan falā khawfun ʿalayhim walā hum yaḥzanūna', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে আর যারা ইয়াহূদী হয়েছে আর সাবিয়ী সম্প্রদায় আর নাসারা, যে কেউ আল্লাহ আর আখিরাত দিবসের প্রতি ঈমান আনবে আর সৎকাজ করবে, তাদের জন্য কোন ভয় নেই, চিন্তা-ভাবনা নেই।', 'Indeed, those who have believed [in Prophet Muhammad] and those [before Him] who were Jews or Sabeans or Christians - those [among them] who believed in Allah and the Last Day and did righteousness - no fear will there be concerning them, nor will they grieve.', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে আর যারা ইয়াহূদী হয়েছে আর সাবিয়ী সম্প্রদায় আর নাসারা, যে কেউ আল্লাহ আর আখিরাত দিবসের প্রতি ঈমান আনবে আর সৎকাজ করবে, তাদের জন্য কোন ভয় নেই, চিন্তা-ভাবনা নেই।', 'Indeed, those who have believed [in Prophet Muhammad] and those [before Him] who were Jews or Sabeans or Christians - those [among them] who believed in Allah and the Last Day and did righteousness - no fear will there be concerning them, nor will they grieve.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005069.mp3', now()),
  (5, 70, '', '[{"id":59604,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":59605,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَخَذْنَا","transliteration":"akhadhnā","translation_bn":"আমরা নিয়েছিলাম","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59606,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِيثَـٰقَ","transliteration":"mīthāqa","translation_bn":"অঙ্গীকার","root":"وثق","lemma":"مِّيثَٰق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59607,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَنِىٓ","transliteration":"banī","translation_bn":"সন্তানদের (থেকে)","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59608,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","transliteration":"is''rāīla","translation_bn":"ইসরাঈলদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْرَائِيل","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59609,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَرْسَلْنَآ","transliteration":"wa-arsalnā","translation_bn":"ও আমরা পাঠিয়েছিলাম","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59610,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59611,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"rusulan","translation_bn":"বহু রাসূলকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59613,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّمَا","transliteration":"kullamā","translation_bn":"যখনই","root":"كلل\r","lemma":"كُلَّمَا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":59614,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"এসেছে তাদের (কাছে)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59615,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولٌۢ","transliteration":"rasūlun","translation_bn":"কোনো রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59616,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"(এমন কিছু) নিয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59617,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":59618,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَهْوَىٰٓ","transliteration":"tahwā","translation_bn":"কামনা করে","root":"هوي","lemma":"هَوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59619,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسُهُمْ","transliteration":"anfusuhum","translation_bn":"মন তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59620,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَرِيقًۭا","transliteration":"farīqan","translation_bn":"একদলকে","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59621,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা সাব্যস্ত করেছে তারা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59622,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَفَرِيقًۭا","transliteration":"wafarīqan","translation_bn":"ও এক দলকে","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرِيق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59623,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَقْتُلُونَ","transliteration":"yaqtulūna","translation_bn":"তারা হত্যা করেছে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59624,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad akhadhnā mīthāqa banī is''rāīla wa-arsalnā ilayhim rusulan kullamā jāahum rasūlun bimā lā tahwā anfusuhum farīqan kadhabū wafarīqan yaqtulūna', 'আমি বানী ইসরাঈলের নিকট হতে অঙ্গীকার নিয়েছিলাম আর তাদের কাছে রসূলগণকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। যখনই কোন রসূল তাদের কাছে এমন কিছু নিয়ে এসেছে যা তাদের মনঃপুত নয়, তখন কতককে তারা অমান্য করেছে আর কতককে হত্যা করেছে।', 'We had already taken the covenant of the Children of Israel and had sent to them messengers. Whenever there came to them a messenger with what their souls did not desire, a party [of messengers] they denied, and another party they killed.', 'আমি বানী ইসরাঈলের নিকট হতে অঙ্গীকার নিয়েছিলাম আর তাদের কাছে রসূলগণকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। যখনই কোন রসূল তাদের কাছে এমন কিছু নিয়ে এসেছে যা তাদের মনঃপুত নয়, তখন কতককে তারা অমান্য করেছে আর কতককে হত্যা করেছে।', 'We had already taken the covenant of the Children of Israel and had sent to them messengers. Whenever there came to them a messenger with what their souls did not desire, a party [of messengers] they denied, and another party they killed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005070.mp3', now()),
  (5, 71, '', '[{"id":60173,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَحَسِبُوٓا۟","transliteration":"waḥasibū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ধারণা করেছিলো","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسِبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60174,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":60175,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونَ","transliteration":"takūna","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60176,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِتْنَةٌۭ","transliteration":"fit''natun","translation_bn":"কোনো শাস্তি","root":"فتن","lemma":"فِتْنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60177,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَعَمُوا۟","transliteration":"faʿamū","translation_bn":"ফলে তারা অন্ধ হলো","root":"عمي","lemma":"عَمِىَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":60178,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَصَمُّوا۟","transliteration":"waṣammū","translation_bn":"ও তারা বধির হলো","root":"صمم","lemma":"صَمُّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60179,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60180,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَابَ","transliteration":"tāba","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা করলেন","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60181,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60182,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60183,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপরও","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60184,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ʿamū","translation_bn":"অন্ধ হয়ে রইলো","root":"عمي","lemma":"عَمِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60185,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَصَمُّوا۟","transliteration":"waṣammū","translation_bn":"ও বধির হয়ে রইলো","root":"صمم","lemma":"صَمُّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60186,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"kathīrun","translation_bn":"অনেক (লোক)","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60187,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60189,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60190,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌۢ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"সর্বদ্রষ্টা","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60191,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60192,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60193,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waḥasibū allā takūna fit''natun faʿamū waṣammū thumma tāba l-lahu ʿalayhim thumma ʿamū waṣammū kathīrun min''hum wal-lahu baṣīrun bimā yaʿmalūna', 'তারা ভেবেছিল তাদের কোন বিপর্যয় হবে না এজন্য তারা অন্ধ ও বধির হয়ে গিয়েছিল। অতঃপর আল্লাহ তাদের প্রতি ক্ষমা দৃষ্টি করলেন। তারপর তাদের অনেকেই পুনরায় অন্ধ ও বধির হয়ে গেল। তারা যা করে আল্লাহ তার সম্যক দ্রষ্টা।', 'And they thought there would be no [resulting] punishment, so they became blind and deaf. Then Allah turned to them in forgiveness; then [again] many of them became blind and deaf. And Allah is Seeing of what they do.', 'তারা ভেবেছিল তাদের কোন বিপর্যয় হবে না এজন্য তারা অন্ধ ও বধির হয়ে গিয়েছিল। অতঃপর আল্লাহ তাদের প্রতি ক্ষমা দৃষ্টি করলেন। তারপর তাদের অনেকেই পুনরায় অন্ধ ও বধির হয়ে গেল। তারা যা করে আল্লাহ তার সম্যক দ্রষ্টা।', 'And they thought there would be no [resulting] punishment, so they became blind and deaf. Then Allah turned to them in forgiveness; then [again] many of them became blind and deaf. And Allah is Seeing of what they do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005071.mp3', now()),
