","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":67712,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"حَلَفْتُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ḥalaftum","translation_bn":"শপথ করবে তোমরা","root":"حلف","lemma":"حَلَفْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67714,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"وَٱحْفَظُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-iḥ''faẓū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা রক্ষা করো","root":"حفظ","lemma":"حَفِظَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67715,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"أَيْمَـٰنَكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"aymānakum","translation_bn":"শপথগুলোর তোমাদের","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67717,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67718,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"يُبَيِّنُ","transliteration":"yubayyinu","translation_bn":"বর্ণনা করেন","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيَّنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67719,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67720,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67721,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","transliteration":"āyātihi","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী তাঁর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67722,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"যেন তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":67723,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"تَشْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"tashkurūna","translation_bn":"কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করো","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67724,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā yuākhidhukumu l-lahu bil-laghwi fī aymānikum walākin yuākhidhukum bimā ʿaqqadttumu l-aymāna fakaffāratuhu iṭ''ʿāmu ʿasharati masākīna min awsaṭi mā tuṭ''ʿimūna ahlīkum aw kis''watuhum aw taḥrīru raqabatin faman lam yajid faṣiyāmu thalāthati ayyāmin dhālika kaffāratu aymānikum idhā ḥalaftum wa-iḥ''faẓū aymānakum kadhālika yubayyinu l-lahu lakum āyātihi laʿallakum tashkurūna', 'তোমাদের অর্থহীন শপথের জন্য আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবেন না, কিন্তু বুঝে সুঝে যে সব শপথ তোমরা কর তার জন্য তোমাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবেন। (এ পাকড়াও থেকে অব্যাহতির) কাফফারা হল দশ জন মিসকিনকে মধ্যম মানের খাদ্যদান যা তোমরা তোমাদের স্ত্রী পরিবারকে খাইয়ে থাক, অথবা তাদেরকে বস্ত্রদান অথবা একজন ক্রীতদাস মুক্তকরণ। আর এগুলো করার যার সামর্থ্য নেই তার জন্য তিন দিন রোযা পালন। এগুলো হল তোমাদের শপথের কাফফারা যখন তোমরা শপথ কর। তোমরা তোমাদের শপথ রক্ষা করবে। আল্লাহ তাঁর আয়াতসমূহ তোমাদের জন্য বিষদভাবে বর্ণনা করেন যাতে তোমরা শোকর আদায় কর।', 'Allah will not impose blame upon you for what is meaningless in your oaths, but He will impose blame upon you for [breaking] what you intended of oaths. So its expiation is the feeding of ten needy people from the average of that which you feed your [own] families or clothing them or the freeing of a slave. But whoever cannot find [or afford it] - then a fast of three days [is required]. That is the expiation for oaths when you have sworn. But guard your oaths. Thus does Allah make clear to you His verses that you may be grateful.', 'তোমাদের অর্থহীন শপথের জন্য আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবেন না, কিন্তু বুঝে সুঝে যে সব শপথ তোমরা কর তার জন্য তোমাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবেন। (এ পাকড়াও থেকে অব্যাহতির) কাফফারা হল দশ জন মিসকিনকে মধ্যম মানের খাদ্যদান যা তোমরা তোমাদের স্ত্রী পরিবারকে খাইয়ে থাক, অথবা তাদেরকে বস্ত্রদান অথবা একজন ক্রীতদাস মুক্তকরণ। আর এগুলো করার যার সামর্থ্য নেই তার জন্য তিন দিন রোযা পালন। এগুলো হল তোমাদের শপথের কাফফারা যখন তোমরা শপথ কর। তোমরা তোমাদের শপথ রক্ষা করবে। আল্লাহ তাঁর আয়াতসমূহ তোমাদের জন্য বিষদভাবে বর্ণনা করেন যাতে তোমরা শোকর আদায় কর।', 'Allah will not impose blame upon you for what is meaningless in your oaths, but He will impose blame upon you for [breaking] what you intended of oaths. So its expiation is the feeding of ten needy people from the average of that which you feed your [own] families or clothing them or the freeing of a slave. But whoever cannot find [or afford it] - then a fast of three days [is required]. That is the expiation for oaths when you have sworn. But guard your oaths. Thus does Allah make clear to you His verses that you may be grateful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005089.mp3', now()),
  (5, 90, '', '[{"id":68026,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":68027,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68028,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68029,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68030,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَمْرُ","transliteration":"l-khamru","translation_bn":"মদ","root":"خمر","lemma":"خَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68031,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَيْسِرُ","transliteration":"wal-maysiru","translation_bn":"ও জুয়া","root":"يسر","lemma":"مَيْسِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68032,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَنصَابُ","transliteration":"wal-anṣābu","translation_bn":"ও পূজার বেদীগুলো","root":"نصب","lemma":"نُصُب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68033,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَزْلَـٰمُ","transliteration":"wal-azlāmu","translation_bn":"ও ভাগ্য নির্ধারক তীরগুলো","root":"زلم","lemma":"أَزْلَٰم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68034,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رِجْسٌۭ","transliteration":"rij''sun","translation_bn":"অপবিত্র","root":"رجس","lemma":"رِجْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68035,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"এক ধরণের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68036,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلِ","transliteration":"ʿamali","translation_bn":"কাজ","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68037,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","translation_bn":"শয়তানের","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68038,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَٱجْتَنِبُوهُ","transliteration":"fa-ij''tanibūhu","translation_bn":"তাই বেঁচে থাকো তা হতে","root":"جنب","lemma":"ٱجْتَنَبُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68039,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"যেন তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68040,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تُفْلِحُونَ","transliteration":"tuf''liḥūna","translation_bn":"সফলকাম হতে পারো","root":"فلح","lemma":"أَفْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68041,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٩٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯০)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū innamā l-khamru wal-maysiru wal-anṣābu wal-azlāmu rij''sun min ʿamali l-shayṭāni fa-ij''tanibūhu laʿallakum tuf''liḥūna', 'হে বিশ্বাসীগণ! মদ, জুয়া আর মূর্তী ও ভাগ্য নির্ধারক তীর ঘৃণিত শয়তানী কাজ, তোমরা তা বর্জন কর, যাতে তোমরা সাফল্যমন্ডিত হতে পার।', 'O you who have believed, indeed, intoxicants, gambling, [sacrificing on] stone alters [to other than Allah], and divining arrows are but defilement from the work of Satan, so avoid it that you may be successful.', 'হে বিশ্বাসীগণ! মদ, জুয়া আর মূর্তী ও ভাগ্য নির্ধারক তীর ঘৃণিত শয়তানী কাজ, তোমরা তা বর্জন কর, যাতে তোমরা সাফল্যমন্ডিত হতে পার।', 'O you who have believed, indeed, intoxicants, gambling, [sacrificing on] stone alters [to other than Allah], and divining arrows are but defilement from the work of Satan, so avoid it that you may be successful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005090.mp3', now()),
  (5, 91, '', '[{"id":68484,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68485,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"yurīdu","translation_bn":"চায়","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68486,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68487,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":68488,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُوقِعَ","transliteration":"yūqiʿa","translation_bn":"ঘটাবে","root":"وقع","lemma":"يُوقِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68489,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَكُمُ","transliteration":"baynakumu","translation_bn":"মাঝে তোমাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":68490,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَدَٰوَةَ","transliteration":"l-ʿadāwata","translation_bn":"শত্রুতা","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدَٰوَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68491,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَغْضَآءَ","transliteration":"wal-baghḍāa","translation_bn":"ও বিদ্বেষ","root":"بغض","lemma":"بَغْضَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68492,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মাধ্যমে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68493,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَمْرِ","transliteration":"l-khamri","translation_bn":"মদের","root":"خمر","lemma":"خَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68494,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَيْسِرِ","transliteration":"wal-maysiri","translation_bn":"ও জুয়ার","root":"يسر","lemma":"مَيْسِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68495,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَيَصُدَّكُمْ","transliteration":"wayaṣuddakum","translation_bn":"ও বাধা দিবে তোমাদের","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68496,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68497,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرِ","transliteration":"dhik''ri","translation_bn":"স্মরণ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68498,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68499,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَعَنِ","transliteration":"waʿani","translation_bn":"ও হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68500,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ṣalati","translation_bn":"সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68502,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَهَلْ","transliteration":"fahal","translation_bn":"তবুও কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68503,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُم","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":68504,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مُّنتَهُونَ","transliteration":"muntahūna","translation_bn":"নিবৃত্ত হবে (না)","root":"نهي","lemma":"مُّنتَهُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68505,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٩١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯১)","root":"—","lemma":"٩١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā yurīdu l-shayṭānu an yūqiʿa baynakumu l-ʿadāwata wal-baghḍāa fī l-khamri wal-maysiri wayaṣuddakum ʿan dhik''ri l-lahi waʿani l-ṣalati fahal antum muntahūna', 'মদ আর জুয়ার মাধ্যমে শয়তান তো চায় তোমাদের মাঝে শত্রুতা আর বিদ্বেষ সৃষ্টি করতে, আল্লাহর স্মরণ আর নামায থেকে তোমাদেরকে বাধা দিতে। কাজেই তোমরা কি এসব থেকে বিরত থাকবে?', 'Satan only wants to cause between you animosity and hatred through intoxicants and gambling and to avert you from the remembrance of Allah and from prayer. So will you not desist?', 'মদ আর জুয়ার মাধ্যমে শয়তান তো চায় তোমাদের মাঝে শত্রুতা আর বিদ্বেষ সৃষ্টি করতে, আল্লাহর স্মরণ আর নামায থেকে তোমাদেরকে বাধা দিতে। কাজেই তোমরা কি এসব থেকে বিরত থাকবে?', 'Satan only wants to cause between you animosity and hatred through intoxicants and gambling and to avert you from the remembrance of Allah and from prayer. So will you not desist?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005091.mp3', now()),
  (5, 92, '', '[{"id":68755,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68756,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68757,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَأَطِيعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aṭīʿū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা আনুগত্য করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68758,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولَ","transliteration":"l-rasūla","translation_bn":"রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68759,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱحْذَرُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"wa-iḥ''dharū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা সতর্ক হও","root":"حذر","lemma":"يَحْذَرُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68761,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68762,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّيْتُمْ","transliteration":"tawallaytum","translation_bn":"মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও তোমরা","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68763,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"fa-iʿ''lamū","translation_bn":"তবে তোমরা জেনে রেখো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":68764,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّمَا","transliteration":"annamā","translation_bn":"যে কেবল","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":68765,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68766,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولِنَا","transliteration":"rasūlinā","translation_bn":"রাসূলের আমাদের (দায়িত্ব)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68767,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ","transliteration":"l-balāghu","translation_bn":"(নির্দেশাবলী)প্রচার করা","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَٰغ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68768,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُبِينُ","transliteration":"l-mubīnu","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্টভাবে","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68769,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٩٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯২)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-aṭīʿū l-laha wa-aṭīʿū l-rasūla wa-iḥ''dharū fa-in tawallaytum fa-iʿ''lamū annamā ʿalā rasūlinā l-balāghu l-mubīnu', 'তোমরা আল্লাহকে মেনে চল আর তাঁর রসূলকে মেনে চল আর (মন্দ থেকে) সতর্ক থাক আর যদি তোমরা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও, তাহলে জেনে রেখ আমার রসূলের দায়িত্ব হল সুস্পষ্টভাবে (আমার বাণী) পৌঁছে দেয়া।', 'And obey Allah and obey the Messenger and beware. And if you turn away - then know that upon Our Messenger is only [the responsibility for] clear notification.', 'তোমরা আল্লাহকে মেনে চল আর তাঁর রসূলকে মেনে চল আর (মন্দ থেকে) সতর্ক থাক আর যদি তোমরা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও, তাহলে জেনে রেখ আমার রসূলের দায়িত্ব হল সুস্পষ্টভাবে (আমার বাণী) পৌঁছে দেয়া।', 'And obey Allah and obey the Messenger and beware. And if you turn away - then know that upon Our Messenger is only [the responsibility for] clear notification.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005092.mp3', now()),
  (5, 93, '', '[{"id":69115,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69116,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69117,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69118,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69119,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69120,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69121,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جُنَاحٌۭ","transliteration":"junāḥun","translation_bn":"পাপ","root":"جنح","lemma":"جُنَاح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69122,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَا","transliteration":"fīmā","translation_bn":"তার মধ্যে যা","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69123,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"طَعِمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"ṭaʿimū","translation_bn":"তারা খেয়েছে (পূর্বে)","root":"طعم","lemma":"طَعِمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69124,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":69125,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":69126,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقَوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqaw","translation_bn":"তারা ভয় করে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69127,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَّءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"waāmanū","translation_bn":"ও ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69128,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَعَمِلُوا۟","transliteration":"waʿamilū","translation_bn":"ও কাজ করে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69129,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥāti","translation_bn":"সৎ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَّٰلِحَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69130,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69131,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقَوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqaw","translation_bn":"তারা বেঁচে চলে (নিষিদ্ধ জিনিষ হতে)","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69132,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَّءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"waāmanū","translation_bn":"ও তারা মেনে নেয় (সব নির্দেশ)","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69133,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69134,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّقَوا۟","transliteration":"ittaqaw","translation_bn":"তারা সংযত থাকে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69135,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَّأَحْسَنُوا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"wa-aḥsanū","translation_bn":"ও তারা উত্তম কাজ করে","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69137,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69138,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"ভালোবাসেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69139,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-muḥ''sinīna","translation_bn":"উত্তম কর্মশীলদেরকে","root":"حسن","lemma":"مُحْسِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69140,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٩٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laysa ʿalā alladhīna āmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti junāḥun fīmā ṭaʿimū idhā mā ittaqaw waāmanū waʿamilū l-ṣāliḥāti thumma ittaqaw waāmanū thumma ittaqaw wa-aḥsanū wal-lahu yuḥibbu l-muḥ''sinīna', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকর্ম করে তারা পূর্বে যা খেয়েছে তার জন্য তাদের উপর কোন পাপ নেই যদি তারা (হারাম থেকে) বিরত থাকে, আর ঈমান আনে ও সৎকাজ করে, অতঃপর সাবধানতা অবলম্বন করে আর ঈমানের উপর থাকে, অতঃপর আল্লাহকে ভয় করে এবং সৎকাজ করে। আল্লাহ সৎকর্মশীলদের ভালবাসেন।', 'There is not upon those who believe and do righteousness [any] blame concerning what they have eaten [in the past] if they [now] fear Allah and believe and do righteous deeds, and then fear Allah and believe, and then fear Allah and do good; and Allah loves the doers of good.', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর সৎকর্ম করে তারা পূর্বে যা খেয়েছে তার জন্য তাদের উপর কোন পাপ নেই যদি তারা (হারাম থেকে) বিরত থাকে, আর ঈমান আনে ও সৎকাজ করে, অতঃপর সাবধানতা অবলম্বন করে আর ঈমানের উপর থাকে, অতঃপর আল্লাহকে ভয় করে এবং সৎকাজ করে। আল্লাহ সৎকর্মশীলদের ভালবাসেন।', 'There is not upon those who believe and do righteousness [any] blame concerning what they have eaten [in the past] if they [now] fear Allah and believe and do righteous deeds, and then fear Allah and believe, and then fear Allah and do good; and Allah loves the doers of good.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005093.mp3', now()),
  (5, 94, '', '[{"id":69538,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":69539,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69540,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69541,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَيَبْلُوَنَّكُمُ","transliteration":"layabluwannakumu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই পরীক্ষা করবেন তোমাদের","root":"بلو","lemma":"بَلَوْ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":69542,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69543,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِشَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"bishayin","translation_bn":"দিয়ে(কিছু) জিনিস","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69544,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69545,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّيْدِ","transliteration":"l-ṣaydi","translation_bn":"শিকারের","root":"صيد","lemma":"صَيْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69546,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَنَالُهُۥٓ","transliteration":"tanāluhu","translation_bn":"নাগালে আসে যা","root":"نيل","lemma":"يَنَالُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69547,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيكُمْ","transliteration":"aydīkum","translation_bn":"হাতগুলোর তোমাদের","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69548,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَرِمَاحُكُمْ","transliteration":"warimāḥukum","translation_bn":"ও বর্শাগুলোর তোমাদের","root":"رمح","lemma":"رِمَاح","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69549,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِيَعْلَمَ","transliteration":"liyaʿlama","translation_bn":"যেন জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69550,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69551,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69552,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَخَافُهُۥ","transliteration":"yakhāfuhu","translation_bn":"ভয় করে তাঁকে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69553,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْغَيْبِ ۚ","transliteration":"bil-ghaybi","translation_bn":"অবস্থায় অদৃশ্য","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69555,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنِ","transliteration":"famani","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69556,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْتَدَىٰ","transliteration":"iʿ''tadā","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করবে","root":"عدو","lemma":"ٱعْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69557,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরেও","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":69558,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":69559,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"falahu","translation_bn":"তবে জন্যে তার (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":69560,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69561,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":69562,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٩٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū layabluwannakumu l-lahu bishayin mina l-ṣaydi tanāluhu aydīkum warimāḥukum liyaʿlama l-lahu man yakhāfuhu bil-ghaybi famani iʿ''tadā baʿda dhālika falahu ʿadhābun alīmun', 'ওহে ঈমানদারগণ! আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে কঠিন পরীক্ষার সম্মুখীন করবেন (মুহরিম অবস্থায়) শিকারের ব্যাপারে যা তোমাদের হাত আর বর্শার নাগালের ভিতর এসে যায়, এটা জেনে নেয়ার জন্য যে অদৃশ্যে থেকেও কে আল্লাহকে ভয় করে। (সুস্পষ্টভাবে জানানো হয়েছে) এরপরও যারা সীমালঙ্ঘন করে তাদের জন্য রয়েছে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তি।', 'O you who have believed, Allah will surely test you through something of the game that your hands and spears [can] reach, that Allah may make evident those who fear Him unseen. And whoever transgresses after that - for him is a painful punishment.', 'ওহে ঈমানদারগণ! আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে কঠিন পরীক্ষার সম্মুখীন করবেন (মুহরিম অবস্থায়) শিকারের ব্যাপারে যা তোমাদের হাত আর বর্শার নাগালের ভিতর এসে যায়, এটা জেনে নেয়ার জন্য যে অদৃশ্যে থেকেও কে আল্লাহকে ভয় করে। (সুস্পষ্টভাবে জানানো হয়েছে) এরপরও যারা সীমালঙ্ঘন করে তাদের জন্য রয়েছে যন্ত্রণাদায়ক শাস্তি।', 'O you who have believed, Allah will surely test you through something of the game that your hands and spears [can] reach, that Allah may make evident those who fear Him unseen. And whoever transgresses after that - for him is a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005094.mp3', now()),
