":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69884,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"وَبَالَ","transliteration":"wabāla","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল","root":"وبل","lemma":"وَبَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69885,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِهِۦ ۗ","transliteration":"amrihi","translation_bn":"কাজের তার","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69887,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"عَفَا","transliteration":"ʿafā","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা করেছেন","root":"عفو","lemma":"عَفَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69888,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69889,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"তা (সব) যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69890,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"سَلَفَ ۚ","transliteration":"salafa","translation_bn":"অতীত হয়েছে","root":"سلف","lemma":"سَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69892,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"কিন্তু যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69893,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"عَادَ","transliteration":"ʿāda","translation_bn":"পুনরাবৃত্তি করবে","root":"عود","lemma":"عَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69894,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"فَيَنتَقِمُ","transliteration":"fayantaqimu","translation_bn":"তখন প্রতিশোধ নিবেন","root":"نقم","lemma":"ٱنتَقَمْ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":69895,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69896,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ ۗ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"থেকে তার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69898,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69899,"position":48,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69900,"position":49,"text_uthmani":"ذُو","transliteration":"dhū","translation_bn":"সক্ষম","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69901,"position":50,"text_uthmani":"ٱنتِقَامٍ","transliteration":"intiqāmin","translation_bn":"প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণে","root":"نقم","lemma":"ٱنتِقَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69902,"position":51,"text_uthmani":"٩٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā taqtulū l-ṣayda wa-antum ḥurumun waman qatalahu minkum mutaʿammidan fajazāon mith''lu mā qatala mina l-naʿami yaḥkumu bihi dhawā ʿadlin minkum hadyan bāligha l-kaʿbati aw kaffāratun ṭaʿāmu masākīna aw ʿadlu dhālika ṣiyāman liyadhūqa wabāla amrihi ʿafā l-lahu ʿammā salafa waman ʿāda fayantaqimu l-lahu min''hu wal-lahu ʿazīzun dhū intiqāmin', 'ওহে বিশ্বাসীগণ! ইহরাম অবস্থায় তোমরা শিকার হত্যা করো না। জেনে বুঝে তোমাদের কেউ তা হত্যা করলে তার বিনিময় হচ্ছে অনুরূপ গৃহপালিত জন্তু। যে ব্যাপারে তোমাদের মধ্যের ন্যায়পরায়ণ দু’জন লোক ফায়সালা করে দেবে, তা কা‘বাতে কুরবানীর জন্য পাঠাতে হবে। কিংবা তার কাফফারা হল কয়েকজন মিসকিনকে খাদ্য দান অথবা তদনুরূপ রোযা পালন, যেন সে স্বীয় কৃতকর্মের ফল ভোগ করে, পূর্বে যা হয়ে গেছে আল্লাহ তা ক্ষমা করেছেন; কেউ (পাপকাজ) পুনরায় করলে আল্লাহ তার নিকট হতে প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করবেন। আল্লাহ মহা পরাক্রমশালী, প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণে পূর্ণ সক্ষম।', 'O you who have believed, do not kill game while you are in the state of ihram. And whoever of you kills it intentionally - the penalty is an equivalent from sacrificial animals to what he killed, as judged by two just men among you as an offering [to Allah] delivered to the Ka''bah, or an expiation: the feeding of needy people or the equivalent of that in fasting, that he may taste the consequence of his deed. Allah has pardoned what is past; but whoever returns [to violation], then Allah will take retribution from him. And Allah is Exalted in Might and Owner of Retribution.', 'ওহে বিশ্বাসীগণ! ইহরাম অবস্থায় তোমরা শিকার হত্যা করো না। জেনে বুঝে তোমাদের কেউ তা হত্যা করলে তার বিনিময় হচ্ছে অনুরূপ গৃহপালিত জন্তু। যে ব্যাপারে তোমাদের মধ্যের ন্যায়পরায়ণ দু’জন লোক ফায়সালা করে দেবে, তা কা‘বাতে কুরবানীর জন্য পাঠাতে হবে। কিংবা তার কাফফারা হল কয়েকজন মিসকিনকে খাদ্য দান অথবা তদনুরূপ রোযা পালন, যেন সে স্বীয় কৃতকর্মের ফল ভোগ করে, পূর্বে যা হয়ে গেছে আল্লাহ তা ক্ষমা করেছেন; কেউ (পাপকাজ) পুনরায় করলে আল্লাহ তার নিকট হতে প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণ করবেন। আল্লাহ মহা পরাক্রমশালী, প্রতিশোধ গ্রহণে পূর্ণ সক্ষম।', 'O you who have believed, do not kill game while you are in the state of ihram. And whoever of you kills it intentionally - the penalty is an equivalent from sacrificial animals to what he killed, as judged by two just men among you as an offering [to Allah] delivered to the Ka''bah, or an expiation: the feeding of needy people or the equivalent of that in fasting, that he may taste the consequence of his deed. Allah has pardoned what is past; but whoever returns [to violation], then Allah will take retribution from him. And Allah is Exalted in Might and Owner of Retribution.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005095.mp3', now()),
  (5, 96, '', '[{"id":70166,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُحِلَّ","transliteration":"uḥilla","translation_bn":"বৈধ করা হয়েছে","root":"حلل","lemma":"أَحَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70167,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70168,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"صَيْدُ","transliteration":"ṣaydu","translation_bn":"শিকার","root":"صيد","lemma":"صَيْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70169,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَحْرِ","transliteration":"l-baḥri","translation_bn":"সাগরের","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70170,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَطَعَامُهُۥ","transliteration":"waṭaʿāmuhu","translation_bn":"ও খাওয়া তা","root":"طعم","lemma":"طَعَام","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70171,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَتَـٰعًۭا","transliteration":"matāʿan","translation_bn":"ভোগ্যবস্তু হিসেবে (বৈধ)","root":"متع","lemma":"مَتَٰع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70172,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70173,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلسَّيَّارَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"walilssayyārati","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যেও পর্যটকদের","root":"سير","lemma":"سَيَّارَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70175,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَحُرِّمَ","transliteration":"waḥurrima","translation_bn":"কিন্তু নিষিদ্ধ করা হয়েছে","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70176,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70177,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"صَيْدُ","transliteration":"ṣaydu","translation_bn":"শিকার","root":"صيد","lemma":"صَيْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70178,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَرِّ","transliteration":"l-bari","translation_bn":"ডাঙার","root":"برر","lemma":"بَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70179,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":70180,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"دُمْتُمْ","transliteration":"dum''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা থাকো","root":"دوم","lemma":"دَامُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70181,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حُرُمًۭا ۗ","transliteration":"ḥuruman","translation_bn":"ইহরামে","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70183,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70184,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70185,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি (এমন সত্ত্বা যে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70186,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"দিকে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70187,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تُحْشَرُونَ","transliteration":"tuḥ''sharūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের একত্র করা হবে","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70188,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٩٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'uḥilla lakum ṣaydu l-baḥri waṭaʿāmuhu matāʿan lakum walilssayyārati waḥurrima ʿalaykum ṣaydu l-bari mā dum''tum ḥuruman wa-ittaqū l-laha alladhī ilayhi tuḥ''sharūna', 'সমুদ্রের শিকার ও তা ভক্ষণ তোমাদের জন্য হালাল করা হয়েছে, তোমাদের আর সফরকারীদের ভোগের জন্য। ইহরাম অবস্থায় থাকা পর্যন্ত স্থলের শিকার তোমাদের জন্য হারাম করা হয়েছে। আল্লাহকে ভয় কর যাঁর কাছে তোমাদেরকে একত্রিত করা হবে।', 'Lawful to you is game from the sea and its food as provision for you and the travelers, but forbidden to you is game from the land as long as you are in the state of ihram. And fear Allah to whom you will be gathered.', 'সমুদ্রের শিকার ও তা ভক্ষণ তোমাদের জন্য হালাল করা হয়েছে, তোমাদের আর সফরকারীদের ভোগের জন্য। ইহরাম অবস্থায় থাকা পর্যন্ত স্থলের শিকার তোমাদের জন্য হারাম করা হয়েছে। আল্লাহকে ভয় কর যাঁর কাছে তোমাদেরকে একত্রিত করা হবে।', 'Lawful to you is game from the sea and its food as provision for you and the travelers, but forbidden to you is game from the land as long as you are in the state of ihram. And fear Allah to whom you will be gathered.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005096.mp3', now()),
  (5, 97, '', '[{"id":70343,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"নির্ধারিত করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70344,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70345,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَعْبَةَ","transliteration":"l-kaʿbata","translation_bn":"ক্বাবা","root":"كعب","lemma":"كَعْبَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70346,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَيْتَ","transliteration":"l-bayta","translation_bn":"ঘরকে","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70347,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرَامَ","transliteration":"l-ḥarāma","translation_bn":"সম্মানিত","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَام","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70348,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قِيَـٰمًۭا","transliteration":"qiyāman","translation_bn":"(কল্যাণ) প্রতিষ্ঠার উপকরণ","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَا^ئِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70349,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِّلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"lilnnāsi","translation_bn":"জন্যে মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70350,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلشَّهْرَ","transliteration":"wal-shahra","translation_bn":"ও মাস","root":"شهر","lemma":"شَهْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70351,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرَامَ","transliteration":"l-ḥarāma","translation_bn":"সম্মানিত","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَام","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70352,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْهَدْىَ","transliteration":"wal-hadya","translation_bn":"ও কোরবানির জন্যে কাবায় পাঠানো জন্তু","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدْي","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70353,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْقَلَـٰٓئِدَ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-qalāida","translation_bn":"ও গলায় মালা পরানো পশু","root":"قلد","lemma":"قَلَٰ^ئِد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70355,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":70356,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِتَعْلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"litaʿlamū","translation_bn":"যেন তোমরা জানো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70357,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":70358,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70359,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70360,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70361,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70362,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70363,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"ও যা কিছ","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70364,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70365,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70366,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এও) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70367,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70368,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70369,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70370,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70371,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٩٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'jaʿala l-lahu l-kaʿbata l-bayta l-ḥarāma qiyāman lilnnāsi wal-shahra l-ḥarāma wal-hadya wal-qalāida dhālika litaʿlamū anna l-laha yaʿlamu mā fī l-samāwāti wamā fī l-arḍi wa-anna l-laha bikulli shayin ʿalīmun', 'পবিত্র ক্বা‘বাগৃহকে আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য (জীবনে) প্রতিষ্ঠার উপকরণ করে দিয়েছেন, আর হারাম মাস, কুরবানীর উদ্দেশে ক্বা‘বায় প্রেরিত পশু এবং তাকে চিহ্নিত করার গলার মালাকেও। এটা এজন্য যাতে তোমরা জানতে পার যে, যা কিছু আসমানসমূহে আছে আর যা কিছু যমীনে আছে, আল্লাহ তা জানেন, আর আল্লাহ সকল বিষয়ে সবচেয়ে বেশি অবহিত।', 'Allah has made the Ka''bah, the Sacred House, standing for the people and [has sanctified] the sacred months and the sacrificial animals and the garlands [by which they are identified]. That is so you may know that Allah knows what is in the heavens and what is in the earth and that Allah is Knowing of all things.', 'পবিত্র ক্বা‘বাগৃহকে আল্লাহ তোমাদের জন্য (জীবনে) প্রতিষ্ঠার উপকরণ করে দিয়েছেন, আর হারাম মাস, কুরবানীর উদ্দেশে ক্বা‘বায় প্রেরিত পশু এবং তাকে চিহ্নিত করার গলার মালাকেও। এটা এজন্য যাতে তোমরা জানতে পার যে, যা কিছু আসমানসমূহে আছে আর যা কিছু যমীনে আছে, আল্লাহ তা জানেন, আর আল্লাহ সকল বিষয়ে সবচেয়ে বেশি অবহিত।', 'Allah has made the Ka''bah, the Sacred House, standing for the people and [has sanctified] the sacred months and the sacrificial animals and the garlands [by which they are identified]. That is so you may know that Allah knows what is in the heavens and what is in the earth and that Allah is Knowing of all things.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005097.mp3', now()),
  (5, 98, '', '[{"id":70743,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"iʿ''lamū","translation_bn":"তোমরা জেনে রাখো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70744,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":70745,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70746,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدُ","transliteration":"shadīdu","translation_bn":"কঠোর","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70747,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِقَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿiqābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তি দানে","root":"عقب","lemma":"عِقَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70748,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এও) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70749,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70750,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70751,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":70752,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٩٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'iʿ''lamū anna l-laha shadīdu l-ʿiqābi wa-anna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'জেনে রেখ যে, শাস্তি দানে আল্লাহ অত্যন্ত কঠোর আর আল্লাহ হলেন বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'Know that Allah is severe in penalty and that Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'জেনে রেখ যে, শাস্তি দানে আল্লাহ অত্যন্ত কঠোর আর আল্লাহ হলেন বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'Know that Allah is severe in penalty and that Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005098.mp3', now()),
  (5, 99, '', '[{"id":71010,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":71011,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর (দায়িত্ব)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71012,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","transliteration":"l-rasūli","translation_bn":"রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71013,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":71014,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَلَـٰغُ ۗ","transliteration":"l-balāghu","translation_bn":"প্রচার করা","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَٰغ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71016,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71017,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71018,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":71019,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تُبْدُونَ","transliteration":"tub''dūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রকাশ করো","root":"بدو","lemma":"يُبْدِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71020,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"ও যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71021,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَكْتُمُونَ","transliteration":"taktumūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা গোপন করো","root":"كتم","lemma":"كَتَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71022,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٩٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā ʿalā l-rasūli illā l-balāghu wal-lahu yaʿlamu mā tub''dūna wamā taktumūna', '(আল্লাহর বাণী) পৌঁছে দেয়া ছাড়া রসূলের উপর দায়িত্ব নেই। তোমরা যা প্রকাশ কর আর গোপন কর, আল্লাহ তা জানেন।', 'Not upon the Messenger is [responsibility] except [for] notification. And Allah knows whatever you reveal and whatever you conceal.', '(আল্লাহর বাণী) পৌঁছে দেয়া ছাড়া রসূলের উপর দায়িত্ব নেই। তোমরা যা প্রকাশ কর আর গোপন কর, আল্লাহ তা জানেন।', 'Not upon the Messenger is [responsibility] except [for] notification. And Allah knows whatever you reveal and whatever you conceal.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005099.mp3', now()),
  (5, 100, '', '[{"id":71395,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71396,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":71397,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِى","transliteration":"yastawī","translation_bn":"সমান হয়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71398,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَبِيثُ","transliteration":"l-khabīthu","translation_bn":"অপবিত্র","root":"خبث","lemma":"خَبِيث","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71399,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلطَّيِّبُ","transliteration":"wal-ṭayibu","translation_bn":"ও পবিত্র","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71400,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":71401,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَعْجَبَكَ","transliteration":"aʿjabaka","translation_bn":"চমৎকৃত করে তোমাকে","root":"عجب","lemma":"أَعْجَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71402,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَثْرَةُ","transliteration":"kathratu","translation_bn":"আধিক্য","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثْرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71403,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَبِيثِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-khabīthi","translation_bn":"অপবিত্রের","root":"خبث","lemma":"خَبِيث","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71405,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"অতএব তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71406,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71407,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأُو۟لِى","transliteration":"yāulī","translation_bn":"হে অধিকারী","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":71408,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَلْبَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-albābi","translation_bn":"বিবেক বুদ্ধির","root":"لبب","lemma":"أَلْبَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71409,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"যাতে তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71410,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تُفْلِحُونَ","transliteration":"tuf''liḥūna","translation_bn":"সফলকাম হও\"","root":"فلح","lemma":"أَفْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71411,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٠٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul lā yastawī l-khabīthu wal-ṭayibu walaw aʿjabaka kathratu l-khabīthi fa-ittaqū l-laha yāulī l-albābi laʿallakum tuf''liḥūna', 'বল, অপবিত্র আর পবিত্র সমান নয়, যদিও অপবিত্র বস্তুর প্রাচুর্য তোমাকে আকৃষ্ট করে। কাজেই হে জ্ঞানী সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর যাতে তোমরা সফলকাম হতে পার।', 'Say, "Not equal are the evil and the good, although the abundance of evil might impress you." So fear Allah, O you of understanding, that you may be successful.', 'বল, অপবিত্র আর পবিত্র সমান নয়, যদিও অপবিত্র বস্তুর প্রাচুর্য তোমাকে আকৃষ্ট করে। কাজেই হে জ্ঞানী সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহকে ভয় কর যাতে তোমরা সফলকাম হতে পার।', 'Say, "Not equal are the evil and the good, although the abundance of evil might impress you." So fear Allah, O you of understanding, that you may be successful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005100.mp3', now()),
  (5, 101, '', '[{"id":71473,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":71474,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":71475,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71476,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":71477,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَسْـَٔلُوا۟","transliteration":"tasalū","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রশ্ন করো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71478,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71479,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَشْيَآءَ","transliteration":"ashyāa","translation_bn":"(এমন) বিষয়াদি","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71480,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":71481,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تُبْدَ","transliteration":"tub''da","translation_bn":"প্রকাশ করা হয়","root":"بدو","lemma":"بَدَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71482,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71483,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَسُؤْكُمْ","transliteration":"tasu''kum","translation_bn":"খারাপ লাগবে তোমাদের","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71484,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71485,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَسْـَٔلُوا۟","transliteration":"tasalū","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রশ্ন করো","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71486,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهَا","transliteration":"ʿanhā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে তা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71487,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حِينَ","transliteration":"ḥīna","translation_bn":"যে সময়ে","root":"حين","lemma":"حِين","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71488,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُنَزَّلُ","transliteration":"yunazzalu","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ হয়","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71489,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","transliteration":"l-qur''ānu","translation_bn":"কোরআন","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71490,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تُبْدَ","transliteration":"tub''da","translation_bn":"প্রকাশ করা হবে","root":"بدو","lemma":"بَدَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71491,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71492,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"عَفَا","transliteration":"ʿafā","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা করেছেন","root":"عفو","lemma":"عَفَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71493,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71494,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهَا ۗ","transliteration":"ʿanhā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সে(যা অতীত হয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71496,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71497,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71498,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"حَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥalīmun","translation_bn":"সহনশীল","root":"حلم","lemma":"حَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71499,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"١٠١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū lā tasalū ʿan ashyāa in tub''da lakum tasu''kum wa-in tasalū ʿanhā ḥīna yunazzalu l-qur''ānu tub''da lakum ʿafā l-lahu ʿanhā wal-lahu ghafūrun ḥalīmun', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমরা এমন বিষয়ে প্রশ্ন করো না, যা তোমাদের কাছে প্রকাশ করা হলে তা তোমাদেরকে কষ্ট দিবে। যে কালে কুরআন নাযিল হচ্ছে সে সময় যদি ওসব বিষয়ে প্রশ্ন কর তবে তা তোমাদের জন্য প্রকাশ করে দেয়া হবে। (এ পর্যন্ত যা করেছ) আল্লাহ তা ক্ষমা করেছেন, আর আল্লাহ হলেন বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম সহিষ্ণু।', 'O you who have believed, do not ask about things which, if they are shown to you, will distress you. But if you ask about them while the Qur''an is being revealed, they will be shown to you. Allah has pardoned that which is past; and Allah is Forgiving and Forbearing.', 'হে ঈমানদারগণ! তোমরা এমন বিষয়ে প্রশ্ন করো না, যা তোমাদের কাছে প্রকাশ করা হলে তা তোমাদেরকে কষ্ট দিবে। যে কালে কুরআন নাযিল হচ্ছে সে সময় যদি ওসব বিষয়ে প্রশ্ন কর তবে তা তোমাদের জন্য প্রকাশ করে দেয়া হবে। (এ পর্যন্ত যা করেছ) আল্লাহ তা ক্ষমা করেছেন, আর আল্লাহ হলেন বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম সহিষ্ণু।', 'O you who have believed, do not ask about things which, if they are shown to you, will distress you. But if you ask about them while the Qur''an is being revealed, they will be shown to you. Allah has pardoned that which is past; and Allah is Forgiving and Forbearing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005101.mp3', now()),
  (5, 102, '', '[{"id":71806,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":71807,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سَأَلَهَا","transliteration":"sa-alahā","translation_bn":"প্রশ্ন করেছিলো তা","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71808,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"qawmun","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71809,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71810,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكُمْ","transliteration":"qablikum","translation_bn":"পূর্ব তোমাদের","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71811,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71812,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَصْبَحُوا۟","transliteration":"aṣbaḥū","translation_bn":"তারা হয়ে গিয়েছিলো","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71813,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71814,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"kāfirīna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকারকারী","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71815,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٠٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qad sa-alahā qawmun min qablikum thumma aṣbaḥū bihā kāfirīna', 'তোমাদের পূর্বে এক সম্প্রদায় (অর্থাৎ ইয়াহূদীরা) তা জিজ্ঞেস করেছিল অত:পর (তা অমান্য করে) তারা কাফিরে পরিণত হয়েছিল।', 'A people asked such [questions] before you; then they became thereby disbelievers.', 'তোমাদের পূর্বে এক সম্প্রদায় (অর্থাৎ ইয়াহূদীরা) তা জিজ্ঞেস করেছিল অত:পর (তা অমান্য করে) তারা কাফিরে পরিণত হয়েছিল।', 'A people asked such [questions] before you; then they became thereby disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005102.mp3', now()),
  (5, 103, '', '[{"id":72177,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72178,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"(নির্দিষ্ট) করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72179,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72180,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72181,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَحِيرَةٍۢ","transliteration":"baḥīratin","translation_bn":"’বাহীরা’","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحِيرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72182,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"ও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72183,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَآئِبَةٍۢ","transliteration":"sāibatin","translation_bn":"কোনো ‘সাইবা’","root":"سيب","lemma":"سَا^ئِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72184,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"ও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72185,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَصِيلَةٍۢ","transliteration":"waṣīlatin","translation_bn":"কোনো অসীলা","root":"وصل","lemma":"وَصِيلَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72186,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"ও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72187,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"حَامٍۢ ۙ","transliteration":"ḥāmin","translation_bn":"কোনো ‘হ্যাম’","root":"حمي","lemma":"حَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72189,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72190,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":72191,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72192,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaftarūna","translation_bn":"করে তারা রচনা","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72193,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72194,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72195,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَذِبَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-kadhiba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72197,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَأَكْثَرُهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-aktharuhum","translation_bn":"এবং অধিকাংশই তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":72198,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72199,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","translation_bn":"জ্ঞানবুদ্ধি রাখে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72200,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"١٠٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā jaʿala l-lahu min baḥīratin walā sāibatin walā waṣīlatin walā ḥāmin walākinna alladhīna kafarū yaftarūna ʿalā l-lahi l-kadhiba wa-aktharuhum lā yaʿqilūna', 'আল্লাহ না নির্দিষ্ট করেছেন বাহীরাহ্, না সাইবাহ্, না ওয়াসীলাহ্, না হাম বরং যারা কুফরী করেছে তারাই আল্লাহর নামে মিথ্যা আরোপ করে, তাঁদের অধিকাংশই নির্বোধ।', 'Allah has not appointed [such innovations as] bahirah or sa''ibah or wasilah or ham. But those who disbelieve invent falsehood about Allah, and most of them do not reason.', 'আল্লাহ না নির্দিষ্ট করেছেন বাহীরাহ্, না সাইবাহ্, না ওয়াসীলাহ্, না হাম বরং যারা কুফরী করেছে তারাই আল্লাহর নামে মিথ্যা আরোপ করে, তাঁদের অধিকাংশই নির্বোধ।', 'Allah has not appointed [such innovations as] bahirah or sa''ibah or wasilah or ham. But those who disbelieve invent falsehood about Allah, and most of them do not reason.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005103.mp3', now()),
  (5, 104, '', '[{"id":72431,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72432,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قِيلَ","transliteration":"qīla","translation_bn":"বলা হয়","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72433,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72434,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَعَالَوْا۟","transliteration":"taʿālaw","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা এসো","root":"علو","lemma":"تَعَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72435,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"(তার) দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72436,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":72437,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72438,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72439,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَى","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"ও দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72440,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولِ","transliteration":"l-rasūli","translation_bn":"রাসূলের\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72441,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72442,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَسْبُنَا","transliteration":"ḥasbunā","translation_bn":"\"আমাদের জন্য যথেষ্ট","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72443,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তা সব) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":72444,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَجَدْنَا","transliteration":"wajadnā","translation_bn":"আমরা পেয়েছি (অনুসরণ করতে)","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72445,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72446,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآءَنَآ ۚ","transliteration":"ābāanā","translation_bn":"বাপ-দাদাদেরকে আমাদের\"","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72448,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَوْ","transliteration":"awalaw","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে বলো) তবে কি যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":72449,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72450,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآؤُهُمْ","transliteration":"ābāuhum","translation_bn":"বাপ-দাদারা তাদের","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72451,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72452,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"জানতো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72453,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72454,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72455,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَهْتَدُونَ","transliteration":"yahtadūna","translation_bn":"সঠিক পথে চলতো (তবুও অনুসরণ করবে)","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72456,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"١٠٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā qīla lahum taʿālaw ilā mā anzala l-lahu wa-ilā l-rasūli qālū ḥasbunā mā wajadnā ʿalayhi ābāanā awalaw kāna ābāuhum lā yaʿlamūna shayan walā yahtadūna', 'তাদেরকে যখন বলা হয় আল্লাহ যা অবতীর্ণ করেছেন তার দিকে ও রসূলের দিকে এসো (তখন) তারা বলে, আমরা আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষকে যা করতে দেখেছি (যে পথ ও পন্থা অবলম্বন করতে দেখেছি) আমাদের জন্য তাই যথেষ্ট। যদিও তাদের পিতৃপুরুষরা কিছুই জানত না এবং সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্ত ছিল না (তবুও কি তারা তাদের পথেই চলবে)?', 'And when it is said to them, "Come to what Allah has revealed and to the Messenger," they say, "Sufficient for us is that upon which we found our fathers." Even though their fathers knew nothing, nor were they guided?', 'তাদেরকে যখন বলা হয় আল্লাহ যা অবতীর্ণ করেছেন তার দিকে ও রসূলের দিকে এসো (তখন) তারা বলে, আমরা আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষকে যা করতে দেখেছি (যে পথ ও পন্থা অবলম্বন করতে দেখেছি) আমাদের জন্য তাই যথেষ্ট। যদিও তাদের পিতৃপুরুষরা কিছুই জানত না এবং সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্ত ছিল না (তবুও কি তারা তাদের পথেই চলবে)?', 'And when it is said to them, "Come to what Allah has revealed and to the Messenger," they say, "Sufficient for us is that upon which we found our fathers." Even though their fathers knew nothing, nor were they guided?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005104.mp3', now()),
  (5, 105, '', '[{"id":72825,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":72826,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":72827,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72828,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের(দায়িত্ব)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72829,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"anfusakum","translation_bn":"নিজেদের তোমাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72831,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72832,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَضُرُّكُم","transliteration":"yaḍurrukum","translation_bn":"ক্ষতি করতে পারবে তোমাদের","root":"ضرر","lemma":"يَضُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72833,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":72834,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَّ","transliteration":"ḍalla","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট হবে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72835,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":72836,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱهْتَدَيْتُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ih''tadaytum","translation_bn":"সঠিক পথে থাকবে তোমরা","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72838,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72839,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72840,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَرْجِعُكُمْ","transliteration":"marjiʿukum","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন হবে তোমাদের","root":"رجع","lemma":"مَرْجِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72841,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সবারই","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72842,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","transliteration":"fayunabbi-ukum","translation_bn":"তখন জানিয়ে দিবেন তিনি তোমাদেরকে","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72843,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72844,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72845,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72846,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١٠٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū ʿalaykum anfusakum lā yaḍurrukum man ḍalla idhā ih''tadaytum ilā l-lahi marjiʿukum jamīʿan fayunabbi-ukum bimā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমাদের দায়িত্ব তোমাদের উপর। যখন তোমরা সত্যপথ প্রাপ্ত হয়েছ তখন যারা পথভ্রষ্ট হয়ে গেছে তারা তোমাদের কোন ক্ষতি করতে পারবে না। তোমাদের সকলের প্রত্যাবর্তন আল্লাহর দিকে, অতঃপর তোমরা যা করছিলে সে সম্পর্কে তোমাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেয়া হবে।', 'O you who have believed, upon you is [responsibility for] yourselves. Those who have gone astray will not harm you when you have been guided. To Allah is you return all together; then He will inform you of what you used to do.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! তোমাদের দায়িত্ব তোমাদের উপর। যখন তোমরা সত্যপথ প্রাপ্ত হয়েছ তখন যারা পথভ্রষ্ট হয়ে গেছে তারা তোমাদের কোন ক্ষতি করতে পারবে না। তোমাদের সকলের প্রত্যাবর্তন আল্লাহর দিকে, অতঃপর তোমরা যা করছিলে সে সম্পর্কে তোমাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেয়া হবে।', 'O you who have believed, upon you is [responsibility for] yourselves. Those who have gone astray will not harm you when you have been guided. To Allah is you return all together; then He will inform you of what you used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/005105.mp3', now()),
  (5, 106, '', '[{"id":73120,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":73121,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73122,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো (ওসীয়ত করতে চাইলে)","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73123,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شَهَـٰدَةُ","transliteration":"shahādatu","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী (রাখো)","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهَٰدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73124,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِكُمْ","transliteration":"baynikum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তোমাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73125,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":73126,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَضَرَ","transliteration":"ḥaḍara","translation_bn":"উপস্থিত হয়","root":"حضر","lemma":"حَضَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73127,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدَكُمُ","transliteration":"aḥadakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কারও","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73128,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتُ","transliteration":"l-mawtu","translation_bn":"মৃত্যু","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73129,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حِينَ","transliteration":"ḥīna","translation_bn":"সময়","root":"حين","lemma":"حِين","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":73130,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوَصِيَّةِ","transliteration":"l-waṣiyati","translation_bn":"ওসীয়তের (জোর উপদেশ)","root":"وصي","lemma":"وَصِيَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73131,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱثْنَانِ","transliteration":"ith''nāni","translation