'walaqad kudhibat rusulun min qablika faṣabarū ʿalā mā kudhibū waūdhū ḥattā atāhum naṣrunā walā mubaddila likalimāti l-lahi walaqad jāaka min naba-i l-mur''salīna', 'তোমার পূর্বেও রসূলগণকে মিথ্যে মনে করা হয়েছে কিন্তু তাদেরকে মিথ্যে মনে করা এবং কষ্ট দেয়া সত্ত্বেও তারা ধৈর্যধারণ করেছে, যতক্ষণ না তাদের কাছে আমার সাহায্য এসেছে। আল্লাহর ওয়াদার পরিবর্তন হয় না, নাবীগণের কিছু সংবাদ তো তোমার নিকট পৌঁছেছেই।', 'And certainly were messengers denied before you, but they were patient over [the effects of] denial, and they were harmed until Our victory came to them. And none can alter the words of Allah. And there has certainly come to you some information about the [previous] messengers.', 'তোমার পূর্বেও রসূলগণকে মিথ্যে মনে করা হয়েছে কিন্তু তাদেরকে মিথ্যে মনে করা এবং কষ্ট দেয়া সত্ত্বেও তারা ধৈর্যধারণ করেছে, যতক্ষণ না তাদের কাছে আমার সাহায্য এসেছে। আল্লাহর ওয়াদার পরিবর্তন হয় না, নাবীগণের কিছু সংবাদ তো তোমার নিকট পৌঁছেছেই।', 'And certainly were messengers denied before you, but they were patient over [the effects of] denial, and they were harmed until Our victory came to them. And none can alter the words of Allah. And there has certainly come to you some information about the [previous] messengers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006034.mp3', now()),
  (6, 35, '', '[{"id":37477,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37478,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37479,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَبُرَ","transliteration":"kabura","translation_bn":"কষ্টকর","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبُرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37480,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"তোমার উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37481,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِعْرَاضُهُمْ","transliteration":"iʿ''rāḍuhum","translation_bn":"উপেক্ষা করা তাদের","root":"عرض","lemma":"إِعْرَاض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37482,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنِ","transliteration":"fa-ini","translation_bn":"তবে যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37483,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَطَعْتَ","transliteration":"is''taṭaʿta","translation_bn":"তুমি সমর্থ হও","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37484,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":37485,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَبْتَغِىَ","transliteration":"tabtaghiya","translation_bn":"সন্ধান করো তুমি","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37486,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَفَقًۭا","transliteration":"nafaqan","translation_bn":"কোনো সুড়ঙ্গ","root":"نفق","lemma":"نَفَق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37487,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37488,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"মাটির","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37489,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37490,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"سُلَّمًۭا","transliteration":"sullaman","translation_bn":"সিঁড়ি (চড়ার জন্যে)","root":"سلم","lemma":"سُلَّم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37491,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37492,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37493,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَتَأْتِيَهُم","transliteration":"fatatiyahum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর কাছে আসো তাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37494,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَةٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"biāyatin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে কোনো নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37496,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37497,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37498,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ(তবে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37499,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لَجَمَعَهُمْ","transliteration":"lajamaʿahum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই একত্র করতেন তাদের","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":37500,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37501,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"l-hudā","translation_bn":"সৎপথের","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37503,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37504,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونَنَّ","transliteration":"takūnanna","translation_bn":"তুমি হয়ো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37505,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37506,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَـٰهِلِينَ","transliteration":"l-jāhilīna","translation_bn":"মূর্খদের","root":"جهل","lemma":"جَاهِل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37507,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in kāna kabura ʿalayka iʿ''rāḍuhum fa-ini is''taṭaʿta an tabtaghiya nafaqan fī l-arḍi aw sullaman fī l-samāi fatatiyahum biāyatin walaw shāa l-lahu lajamaʿahum ʿalā l-hudā falā takūnanna mina l-jāhilīna', 'তাদের উপেক্ষা যদি তোমার কাছে কঠিন বলে মনে হয় তাহলে পারলে ভূগর্ভে সুড়ঙ্গের কিংবা আকাশে আরোহণের জন্য সিঁড়ির সন্ধান কর অত:পর তাদের কাছে (নতুন) নিদর্শন হাজির কর। আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে তাদের সকলকে সৎপথে একত্র করতেন। কাজেই তুমি মূর্খদের মত হয়ো না।', 'And if their evasion is difficult for you, then if you are able to seek a tunnel into the earth or a stairway into the sky to bring them a sign, [then do so]. But if Allah had willed, He would have united them upon guidance. So never be of the ignorant.', 'তাদের উপেক্ষা যদি তোমার কাছে কঠিন বলে মনে হয় তাহলে পারলে ভূগর্ভে সুড়ঙ্গের কিংবা আকাশে আরোহণের জন্য সিঁড়ির সন্ধান কর অত:পর তাদের কাছে (নতুন) নিদর্শন হাজির কর। আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে তাদের সকলকে সৎপথে একত্র করতেন। কাজেই তুমি মূর্খদের মত হয়ো না।', 'And if their evasion is difficult for you, then if you are able to seek a tunnel into the earth or a stairway into the sky to bring them a sign, [then do so]. But if Allah had willed, He would have united them upon guidance. So never be of the ignorant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006035.mp3', now()),
  (6, 36, '', '[{"id":38369,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38370,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَجِيبُ","transliteration":"yastajību","translation_bn":"ডাকে সাড়া দেয়","root":"جوب","lemma":"ٱسْتَجَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38371,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারাই) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":38372,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَسْمَعُونَ ۘ","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","translation_bn":"যারা শোনে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38374,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","transliteration":"wal-mawtā","translation_bn":"এবং মৃতদেরকে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38375,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَبْعَثُهُمُ","transliteration":"yabʿathuhumu","translation_bn":"উজ্জীবিত করবেন তাদের","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38376,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38377,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38378,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"দিকে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38379,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُرْجَعُونَ","transliteration":"yur''jaʿūna","translation_bn":"তাদের ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38380,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā yastajību alladhīna yasmaʿūna wal-mawtā yabʿathuhumu l-lahu thumma ilayhi yur''jaʿūna', 'যারা শোনে শুধু তারাই ডাকে সাড়া দেয়। আর মৃতকে আল্লাহ আবার জীবিত করবেন; অতঃপর তাঁর দিকেই তাদেরকে ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে।', 'Only those who hear will respond. But the dead - Allah will resurrect them; then to Him they will be returned.', 'যারা শোনে শুধু তারাই ডাকে সাড়া দেয়। আর মৃতকে আল্লাহ আবার জীবিত করবেন; অতঃপর তাঁর দিকেই তাদেরকে ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে।', 'Only those who hear will respond. But the dead - Allah will resurrect them; then to Him they will be returned.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006036.mp3', now()),
  (6, 37, '', '[{"id":39233,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39234,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَوْلَا","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"\"কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"উৎসাহবাচক (Exhortation)"},{"id":39235,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُزِّلَ","transliteration":"nuzzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করা হয়","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39236,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39237,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَةٌۭ","transliteration":"āyatun","translation_bn":"কোনো নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39238,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39239,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"রবের তার\"","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39241,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39242,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":39243,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39244,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَادِرٌ","transliteration":"qādirun","translation_bn":"সক্ষম","root":"قدر","lemma":"قَادِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39245,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"এর উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39246,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":39247,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يُنَزِّلَ","transliteration":"yunazzila","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করবেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39248,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَةًۭ","transliteration":"āyatan","translation_bn":"কোনো নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39249,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39250,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharahum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশই তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39251,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":39252,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39253,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū lawlā nuzzila ʿalayhi āyatun min rabbihi qul inna l-laha qādirun ʿalā an yunazzila āyatan walākinna aktharahum lā yaʿlamūna', 'তারা বলে, তার কাছে তার রবের নিকট হতে কোন নিদর্শন নাযিল হয় না কেন? বল, অবশ্যই আল্লাহ নিদর্শন অবতীর্ণ করতে সক্ষম। কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশ লোকই অবগত নয়।', 'And they say, "Why has a sign not been sent down to him from his Lord?" Say, "Indeed, Allah is Able to send down a sign, but most of them do not know."', 'তারা বলে, তার কাছে তার রবের নিকট হতে কোন নিদর্শন নাযিল হয় না কেন? বল, অবশ্যই আল্লাহ নিদর্শন অবতীর্ণ করতে সক্ষম। কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশ লোকই অবগত নয়।', 'And they say, "Why has a sign not been sent down to him from his Lord?" Say, "Indeed, Allah is Able to send down a sign, but most of them do not know."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006037.mp3', now()),
  (6, 38, '', '[{"id":40046,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40047,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40048,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"دَآبَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"dābbatin","translation_bn":"বিচরণশীল জন্তু","root":"دبب","lemma":"دَا^بَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40049,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40050,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40051,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40052,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"طَـٰٓئِرٍۢ","transliteration":"ṭāirin","translation_bn":"পাখি (যা)","root":"طير","lemma":"طَٰ^ئِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40053,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَطِيرُ","transliteration":"yaṭīru","translation_bn":"উড়ে","root":"طير","lemma":"يَطِيرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40054,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِجَنَاحَيْهِ","transliteration":"bijanāḥayhi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে দু''ডানা তার","root":"جنح","lemma":"جَنَاح","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40055,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এছাড়া যে (তারাও)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":40056,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أُمَمٌ","transliteration":"umamun","translation_bn":"জাতি (প্রজাতি)","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40057,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَمْثَالُكُم ۚ","transliteration":"amthālukum","translation_bn":"মতো তোমাদের","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":40059,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":40060,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَرَّطْنَا","transliteration":"farraṭnā","translation_bn":"ক্রুটি রেখেছি আমরা (নিয়তি নির্ধারণে)","root":"فرط","lemma":"فَرَّط","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40061,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40062,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40063,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40064,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40066,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40067,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40068,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"রবের তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40069,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يُحْشَرُونَ","transliteration":"yuḥ''sharūna","translation_bn":"তাদের একত্র করা হবে","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40070,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā min dābbatin fī l-arḍi walā ṭāirin yaṭīru bijanāḥayhi illā umamun amthālukum mā farraṭnā fī l-kitābi min shayin thumma ilā rabbihim yuḥ''sharūna', 'ভূপৃষ্টে বিচরণশীল এমন কোন জীব নেই, আর দু’ডানা সহযোগে উড্ডয়নশীল এমন কোন পাখি নেই যারা তোমাদের মত একটি উম্মাত নয়। (লাওহে মাহ্ফুয অথবা আল-কুরআন) কিতাবে আমি কোন কিছুই বাদ দেইনি। অতঃপর তাদের প্রতিপালকের কাছে তাদেরকে একত্রিত করা হবে।', 'And there is no creature on [or within] the earth or bird that flies with its wings except [that they are] communities like you. We have not neglected in the Register a thing. Then unto their Lord they will be gathered.', 'ভূপৃষ্টে বিচরণশীল এমন কোন জীব নেই, আর দু’ডানা সহযোগে উড্ডয়নশীল এমন কোন পাখি নেই যারা তোমাদের মত একটি উম্মাত নয়। (লাওহে মাহ্ফুয অথবা আল-কুরআন) কিতাবে আমি কোন কিছুই বাদ দেইনি। অতঃপর তাদের প্রতিপালকের কাছে তাদেরকে একত্রিত করা হবে।', 'And there is no creature on [or within] the earth or bird that flies with its wings except [that they are] communities like you. We have not neglected in the Register a thing. Then unto their Lord they will be gathered.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006038.mp3', now()),
  (6, 39, '', '[{"id":40814,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40815,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40816,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে নিদর্শনগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40817,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"صُمٌّۭ","transliteration":"ṣummun","translation_bn":"(তারা) বধির","root":"صمم","lemma":"أَصَمّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40818,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَبُكْمٌۭ","transliteration":"wabuk''mun","translation_bn":"ও বোবা","root":"بكم","lemma":"أَبْكَم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40819,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"(তারা আছে) মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40820,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","translation_bn":"অন্ধকারের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلُمَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40822,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":40823,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَشَإِ","transliteration":"yasha-i","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40824,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":40825,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُضْلِلْهُ","transliteration":"yuḍ''lil''hu","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেন তাকে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40826,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40827,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَشَأْ","transliteration":"yasha","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40828,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَجْعَلْهُ","transliteration":"yajʿalhu","translation_bn":"রাখেন তাকে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40829,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40830,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40831,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল-সোজা","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":40832,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna kadhabū biāyātinā ṣummun wabuk''mun fī l-ẓulumāti man yasha-i l-lahu yuḍ''lil''hu waman yasha yajʿalhu ʿalā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin', 'যারা আমার আয়াতকে মিথ্যে জানে তারা বধির ও মুক। তারা আছে গভীর অন্ধকারে, আল্লাহ যাকে চান পথভ্রষ্ট করে দেন, আর যাকে চান সঠিক পথে স্থাপন করেন।', 'But those who deny Our verses are deaf and dumb within darknesses. Whomever Allah wills - He leaves astray; and whomever He wills - He puts him on a straight path.', 'যারা আমার আয়াতকে মিথ্যে জানে তারা বধির ও মুক। তারা আছে গভীর অন্ধকারে, আল্লাহ যাকে চান পথভ্রষ্ট করে দেন, আর যাকে চান সঠিক পথে স্থাপন করেন।', 'But those who deny Our verses are deaf and dumb within darknesses. Whomever Allah wills - He leaves astray; and whomever He wills - He puts him on a straight path.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006039.mp3', now()),
  (6, 40, '', '[{"id":41746,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41747,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتَكُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytakum","translation_bn":"\"কি তোমরা (ভেবে) দেখেছো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":41748,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":41749,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَتَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"atākum","translation_bn":"কাছে আসে তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41750,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابُ","transliteration":"ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41751,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41752,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41753,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَتَتْكُمُ","transliteration":"atatkumu","translation_bn":"কাছে আসে তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41754,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةُ","transliteration":"l-sāʿatu","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":41755,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَغَيْرَ","transliteration":"aghayra","translation_bn":"(তবে) কি ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":41756,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":41757,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"tadʿūna","translation_bn":"ডাকবে তোমরা (অন্য কাউকে)","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41758,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":41759,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"হও তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41760,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী (তবে উত্তর দাও)\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":41761,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytakum in atākum ʿadhābu l-lahi aw atatkumu l-sāʿatu aghayra l-lahi tadʿūna in kuntum ṣādiqīna', 'বল, তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ, তোমাদের উপর যদি আল্লাহর শাস্তি এসে পড়ে কিংবা তোমাদের উপর ক্বিয়ামাত এসে যায় তাহলে কি তোমরা আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্য কাউকে ডাকবে? (বল না) তোমরা যদি সত্যবাদী হও।', 'Say, "Have you considered: if there came to you the punishment of Allah or there came to you the Hour - is it other than Allah you would invoke, if you should be truthful?"', 'বল, তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ, তোমাদের উপর যদি আল্লাহর শাস্তি এসে পড়ে কিংবা তোমাদের উপর ক্বিয়ামাত এসে যায় তাহলে কি তোমরা আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্য কাউকে ডাকবে? (বল না) তোমরা যদি সত্যবাদী হও।', 'Say, "Have you considered: if there came to you the punishment of Allah or there came to you the Hour - is it other than Allah you would invoke, if you should be truthful?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006040.mp3', now()),
  (6, 41, '', '[{"id":42504,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"\"(না) বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":42505,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِيَّاهُ","transliteration":"iyyāhu","translation_bn":"শুধু তাঁকেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِيَّا","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":42506,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"tadʿūna","translation_bn":"ডাকো তোমরা","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42507,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَيَكْشِفُ","transliteration":"fayakshifu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তিনি দূর করেন","root":"كشف","lemma":"كَشَفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42508,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যে জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":42509,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"tadʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ডাকো (দু''আ করো)","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42510,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"কাছে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42511,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":42512,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42513,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَتَنسَوْنَ","transliteration":"watansawna","translation_bn":"এবং (তখন) তোমরা ভুলে যাও","root":"نسي","lemma":"نَسِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42514,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":42515,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"tush''rikūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শিরক করে থাকো\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42516,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'bal iyyāhu tadʿūna fayakshifu mā tadʿūna ilayhi in shāa watansawna mā tush''rikūna', 'বরং (এমন অবস্থায়) তোমরা একমাত্র তাঁকেই ডেকে থাক, অতঃপর ইচ্ছে করলে তিনি তা দূর করে দেন যার জন্য তোমরা তাঁকে ডাক আর তোমরা যাদেরকে তাঁর অংশীদার বানাও তাদের কথা ভুলে যাও।', 'No, it is Him [alone] you would invoke, and He would remove that for which you invoked Him if He willed, and you would forget what you associate [with Him].', 'বরং (এমন অবস্থায়) তোমরা একমাত্র তাঁকেই ডেকে থাক, অতঃপর ইচ্ছে করলে তিনি তা দূর করে দেন যার জন্য তোমরা তাঁকে ডাক আর তোমরা যাদেরকে তাঁর অংশীদার বানাও তাদের কথা ভুলে যাও।', 'No, it is Him [alone] you would invoke, and He would remove that for which you invoked Him if He willed, and you would forget what you associate [with Him].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006041.mp3', now()),
  (6, 42, '', '[{"id":43204,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43205,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْسَلْنَآ","transliteration":"arsalnā","translation_bn":"পাঠিয়েছি আমরা (রাসূলগণকে)","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43206,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43207,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أُمَمٍۢ","transliteration":"umamin","translation_bn":"জাতিগুলোর)","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43208,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43209,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِكَ","transliteration":"qablika","translation_bn":"পূর্ব তোমার","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43210,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَأَخَذْنَـٰهُم","transliteration":"fa-akhadhnāhum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমরা ধরেছি তাদেরকে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43211,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْبَأْسَآءِ","transliteration":"bil-basāi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে অর্থসংকট","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْسَا^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43212,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلضَّرَّآءِ","transliteration":"wal-ḍarāi","translation_bn":"ও দুঃখদৈন্য(দিয়ে)","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضَرَّا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43213,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":43214,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَتَضَرَّعُونَ","transliteration":"yataḍarraʿūna","translation_bn":"বিনীত হয়","root":"ضرع","lemma":"يَتَضَرَّعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43215,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad arsalnā ilā umamin min qablika fa-akhadhnāhum bil-basāi wal-ḍarāi laʿallahum yataḍarraʿūna', 'তোমার পূর্বে আমি অনেক জাতির কাছে রসূল পাঠিয়েছি, কিন্তু তাদের অবাধ্যতার কারণে) অভাব অনটন আর দুঃখ-ক্লেশ দিয়ে তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করেছিলাম যাতে তারা বিনীত হয়।', 'And We have already sent [messengers] to nations before you, [O Muhammad]; then We seized them with poverty and hardship that perhaps they might humble themselves [to Us].', 'তোমার পূর্বে আমি অনেক জাতির কাছে রসূল পাঠিয়েছি, কিন্তু তাদের অবাধ্যতার কারণে) অভাব অনটন আর দুঃখ-ক্লেশ দিয়ে তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করেছিলাম যাতে তারা বিনীত হয়।', 'And We have already sent [messengers] to nations before you, [O Muhammad]; then We seized them with poverty and hardship that perhaps they might humble themselves [to Us].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006042.mp3', now()),
  (6, 43, '', '[{"id":43934,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَوْلَآ","transliteration":"falawlā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43935,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":43936,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُم","transliteration":"jāahum","translation_bn":"এসেছিলো তাদের (কাছে)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43937,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسُنَا","transliteration":"basunā","translation_bn":"শাস্তি আমাদের","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43938,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَضَرَّعُوا۟","transliteration":"taḍarraʿū","translation_bn":"তারা বিনীত হলো","root":"ضرع","lemma":"تَضَرَّعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43939,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43940,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَسَتْ","transliteration":"qasat","translation_bn":"শক্ত হয়ে গেলো","root":"قسو","lemma":"قَسَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43941,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبُهُمْ","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","translation_bn":"অন্তরগুলো তাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":43942,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَزَيَّنَ","transliteration":"wazayyana","translation_bn":"এবং সুশোভিত করেছিলো","root":"زين","lemma":"زَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43943,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43944,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43945,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43946,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43947,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43948,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falawlā idh jāahum basunā taḍarraʿū walākin qasat qulūbuhum wazayyana lahumu l-shayṭānu mā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'আমার শাস্তি যখন তাদের উপর পড়ল তখন তারা বিনয় নম্রতা অবলম্বন করল না কেন? বরং তাদের অন্তর আরো শক্ত হয়ে গেল, আর তারা যা করছিল শয়তান সেগুলোকে তাদের জন্য (খুব ভাল কাজ হিসেবে) সুশোভিত করে দিয়েছিল।', 'Then why, when Our punishment came to them, did they not humble themselves? But their hearts became hardened, and Satan made attractive to them that which they were doing.', 'আমার শাস্তি যখন তাদের উপর পড়ল তখন তারা বিনয় নম্রতা অবলম্বন করল না কেন? বরং তাদের অন্তর আরো শক্ত হয়ে গেল, আর তারা যা করছিল শয়তান সেগুলোকে তাদের জন্য (খুব ভাল কাজ হিসেবে) সুশোভিত করে দিয়েছিল।', 'Then why, when Our punishment came to them, did they not humble themselves? But their hearts became hardened, and Satan made attractive to them that which they were doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006043.mp3', now()),
  (6, 44, '', '[{"id":44745,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44746,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَسُوا۟","transliteration":"nasū","translation_bn":"তারা ভুলে গেল","root":"نسي","lemma":"نَسِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44747,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":44748,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ذُكِّرُوا۟","transliteration":"dhukkirū","translation_bn":"তাদের উপদেশ দেয়া হয়েছিলো","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذُكِّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44749,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44750,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَتَحْنَا","transliteration":"fataḥnā","translation_bn":"তখন খুলে দিলাম আমরা","root":"فتح","lemma":"فَتَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44751,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44752,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَبْوَٰبَ","transliteration":"abwāba","translation_bn":"(স্বচ্ছলতার) দরজাসমূহ","root":"بوب","lemma":"بَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44753,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44754,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44755,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"এমনকি","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":44756,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":44757,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَرِحُوا۟","transliteration":"fariḥū","translation_bn":"তারা উল্লসিত হলো","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44758,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তা যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":44759,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أُوتُوٓا۟","transliteration":"ūtū","translation_bn":"তাদের দেয়া হয়েছিলো","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44760,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَخَذْنَـٰهُم","transliteration":"akhadhnāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা ধরলাম তাদের","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44761,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بَغْتَةًۭ","transliteration":"baghtatan","translation_bn":"হঠাৎ","root":"بغت","lemma":"بَغْتَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44762,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"ফলে তখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44763,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":44764,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مُّبْلِسُونَ","transliteration":"mub''lisūna","translation_bn":"নিরাশ হয়ে পড়লো","root":"بلس","lemma":"مُبْلِسُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44765,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā nasū mā dhukkirū bihi fataḥnā ʿalayhim abwāba kulli shayin ḥattā idhā fariḥū bimā ūtū akhadhnāhum baghtatan fa-idhā hum mub''lisūna', 'তাদেরকে যে নাসীহাত করা হয়েছিল তারা যখন তা ভুলে গেল, তখন আমি তাদের জন্য যাবতীয় নি‘আমাতের দরজা খুলে দিলাম; পরিশেষে, তাদেরকে যা দেয়া হল তাতে তারা যখন আনন্দে মেতে উঠল, হঠাৎ করে তাদেরকে ধরে বসলাম। তখন (যাবতীয় কল্যাণ থেকে) তারা নিরাশ হয়ে গেল।', 'So when they forgot that by which they had been reminded, We opened to them the doors of every [good] thing until, when they rejoiced in that which they were given, We seized them suddenly, and they were [then] in despair.', 'তাদেরকে যে নাসীহাত করা হয়েছিল তারা যখন তা ভুলে গেল, তখন আমি তাদের জন্য যাবতীয় নি‘আমাতের দরজা খুলে দিলাম; পরিশেষে, তাদেরকে যা দেয়া হল তাতে তারা যখন আনন্দে মেতে উঠল, হঠাৎ করে তাদেরকে ধরে বসলাম। তখন (যাবতীয় কল্যাণ থেকে) তারা নিরাশ হয়ে গেল।', 'So when they forgot that by which they had been reminded, We opened to them the doors of every [good] thing until, when they rejoiced in that which they were given, We seized them suddenly, and they were [then] in despair.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006044.mp3', now()),
  (6, 45, '', '[{"id":45402,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَقُطِعَ","transliteration":"faquṭiʿa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর উচ্ছেদ করা হলো","root":"قطع","lemma":"قُطِعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45403,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"دَابِرُ","transliteration":"dābiru","translation_bn":"মূল","root":"دبر","lemma":"دَابِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45404,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"(ঐ)সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45405,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45406,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45408,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْحَمْدُ","transliteration":"wal-ḥamdu","translation_bn":"আর সব প্রশংসা","root":"حمد","lemma":"حَمْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45409,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45410,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"(যিনি) রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45411,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বজগতের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45412,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faquṭiʿa dābiru l-qawmi alladhīna ẓalamū wal-ḥamdu lillahi rabbi l-ʿālamīna', 'অতঃপর যারা যুলম করেছিল তাদের শিকড় কেটে দেয়া হল, আর সমস্ত প্রশংসা বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালকের জন্য।', 'So the people that committed wrong were eliminated. And praise to Allah, Lord of the worlds.', 'অতঃপর যারা যুলম করেছিল তাদের শিকড় কেটে দেয়া হল, আর সমস্ত প্রশংসা বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালকের জন্য।', 'So the people that committed wrong were eliminated. And praise to Allah, Lord of the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006045.mp3', now()),
  (6, 46, '', '[{"id":46168,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46169,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytum","translation_bn":"\"কি (ভেবে) দেখছো তোমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":46170,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":46171,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَخَذَ","transliteration":"akhadha","translation_bn":"কেড়ে নেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46172,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46173,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَمْعَكُمْ","transliteration":"samʿakum","translation_bn":"শ্রবণশক্তি তোমাদের","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46174,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَبْصَـٰرَكُمْ","transliteration":"wa-abṣārakum","translation_bn":"ও দৃষ্টিশক্তি তোমাদের","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46175,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَخَتَمَ","transliteration":"wakhatama","translation_bn":"এবং সিল লাগান","root":"ختم","lemma":"خَتَمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46176,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46177,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِكُم","transliteration":"qulūbikum","translation_bn":"অন্তরগুলোর তোমাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46178,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَّنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":46179,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٌ","transliteration":"ilāhun","translation_bn":"ইলাহ (আছে)","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46180,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرُ","transliteration":"ghayru","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46181,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ (যে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46182,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِيكُم","transliteration":"yatīkum","translation_bn":"কাছে আসবে তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46183,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِهِ ۗ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِ ۗ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46185,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱنظُرْ","transliteration":"unẓur","translation_bn":"দেখো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46186,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমনভাবে","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":46187,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"نُصَرِّفُ","transliteration":"nuṣarrifu","translation_bn":"বারবার বর্ণনা করি আমরা","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَّفْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46188,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনগুলো","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46189,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপরও","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46190,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":46191,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يَصْدِفُونَ","transliteration":"yaṣdifūna","translation_bn":"তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়\"","root":"صدف","lemma":"صَدَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46192,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytum in akhadha l-lahu samʿakum wa-abṣārakum wakhatama ʿalā qulūbikum man ilāhun ghayru l-lahi yatīkum bihi unẓur kayfa nuṣarrifu l-āyāti thumma hum yaṣdifūna', '(হে রাসূল) বল, তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ আল্লাহ যদি তোমাদের শ্রবণশক্তি আর দর্শন শক্তি কেড়ে নেন, আর তোমাদের অন্তরে মোহর লাগিয়ে দেন, তাহলে আল্লাহ ছাড়া আর কে ইলাহ আছে সেগুলো তোমাদেরকে ফিরিয়ে দেবে? লক্ষ্য কর আমি আমার (শক্তি-ক্ষমতার) নিদর্শনগুলোকে কেমন বিশদভাবে বর্ণনা করি কিন্তু তা সত্ত্বেও তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়।', 'Say, "Have you considered: if Allah should take away your hearing and your sight and set a seal upon your hearts, which deity other than Allah could bring them [back] to you?" Look how we diversify the verses; then they [still] turn away.', '(হে রাসূল) বল, তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ আল্লাহ যদি তোমাদের শ্রবণশক্তি আর দর্শন শক্তি কেড়ে নেন, আর তোমাদের অন্তরে মোহর লাগিয়ে দেন, তাহলে আল্লাহ ছাড়া আর কে ইলাহ আছে সেগুলো তোমাদেরকে ফিরিয়ে দেবে? লক্ষ্য কর আমি আমার (শক্তি-ক্ষমতার) নিদর্শনগুলোকে কেমন বিশদভাবে বর্ণনা করি কিন্তু তা সত্ত্বেও তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়।', 'Say, "Have you considered: if Allah should take away your hearing and your sight and set a seal upon your hearts, which deity other than Allah could bring them [back] to you?" Look how we diversify the verses; then they [still] turn away.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006046.mp3', now()),
  (6, 47, '', '[{"id":46788,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46789,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتَكُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytakum","translation_bn":"\"(ভেবে) দেখছো কি তোমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":46790,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":46791,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَتَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"atākum","translation_bn":"কাছে এসে পড়ে তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46792,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابُ","transliteration":"ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46793,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":46794,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَغْتَةً","transliteration":"baghtatan","translation_bn":"হঠাৎ","root":"بغت","lemma":"بَغْتَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46795,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46796,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَهْرَةً","transliteration":"jahratan","translation_bn":"প্রকাশ্যে","root":"جهر","lemma":"جَهْرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46797,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":46798,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُهْلَكُ","transliteration":"yuh''laku","translation_bn":"ধ্বংস করা হবে","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46799,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":46800,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمُ","transliteration":"l-qawmu","translation_bn":"(যারা)সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46801,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46802,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytakum in atākum ʿadhābu l-lahi baghtatan aw jahratan hal yuh''laku illā l-qawmu l-ẓālimūna', 'বল, তোমরা কি চিন্তা করে দেখেছ, যদি তোমাদের কাছে আকস্মিক বা প্রকাশ্যে আল্লাহর শাস্তি নেমে আসে তাহলে যালিম সম্প্রদায় ছাড়া আর কে ধ্বংস হবে?', 'Say, "Have you considered: if the punishment of Allah should come to you unexpectedly or manifestly, will any be destroyed but the wrongdoing people?"', 'বল, তোমরা কি চিন্তা করে দেখেছ, যদি তোমাদের কাছে আকস্মিক বা প্রকাশ্যে আল্লাহর শাস্তি নেমে আসে তাহলে যালিম সম্প্রদায় ছাড়া আর কে ধ্বংস হবে?', 'Say, "Have you considered: if the punishment of Allah should come to you unexpectedly or manifestly, will any be destroyed but the wrongdoing people?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006047.mp3', now()),
  (6, 48, '', '[{"id":47550,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47551,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُرْسِلُ","transliteration":"nur''silu","translation_bn":"আমরা পাঠিয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47552,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","transliteration":"l-mur''salīna","translation_bn":"রাসূলগণকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُّرْسَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47553,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":47554,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُبَشِّرِينَ","transliteration":"mubashirīna","translation_bn":"সুসংবাদদাতা","root":"بشر","lemma":"مُبَشِّر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47555,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمُنذِرِينَ ۖ","transliteration":"wamundhirīna","translation_bn":"ও সতর্ককারী (হিসেবে)","root":"نذر","lemma":"مُنذِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47557,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنْ","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"অতএব যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47558,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47559,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَصْلَحَ","transliteration":"wa-aṣlaḥa","translation_bn":"ও সংশোধন করবে","root":"صلح","lemma":"أَصْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47560,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"সেক্ষেত্রে নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":47561,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"خَوْفٌ","transliteration":"khawfun","translation_bn":"কোনো ভয়","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَوْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47562,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47563,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47564,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":47565,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَحْزَنُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥzanūna","translation_bn":"দুঃখিত হবে","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47566,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā nur''silu l-mur''salīna illā mubashirīna wamundhirīna faman āmana wa-aṣlaḥa falā khawfun ʿalayhim walā hum yaḥzanūna', 'আমি তো রসূলদেরকে কেবল সুসংবাদদাতা ও সতর্ককারী করে পাঠিয়েছি, অতঃপর (রসূলের আনুগত্য করে) যারা ঈমান আনে ও নিজেকে সংশোধন করে তাদের নেই কোন ভয়, নেই তাদের কোন দুঃখ।', 'And We send not the messengers except as bringers of good tidings and warners. So whoever believes and reforms - there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve.', 'আমি তো রসূলদেরকে কেবল সুসংবাদদাতা ও সতর্ককারী করে পাঠিয়েছি, অতঃপর (রসূলের আনুগত্য করে) যারা ঈমান আনে ও নিজেকে সংশোধন করে তাদের নেই কোন ভয়, নেই তাদের কোন দুঃখ।', 'And We send not the messengers except as bringers of good tidings and warners. So whoever believes and reforms - there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006048.mp3', now()),
  (6, 49, '', '[{"id":48227,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48228,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48229,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি নিদর্শনগুলোর আমার","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48230,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَمَسُّهُمُ","transliteration":"yamassuhumu","translation_bn":"স্পর্শ করবে তাদের","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48231,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابُ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48232,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48233,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48234,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَفْسُقُونَ","transliteration":"yafsuqūna","translation_bn":"তারা সত্যত্যাগ করে","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَسَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48235,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna kadhabū biāyātinā yamassuhumu l-ʿadhābu bimā kānū yafsuqūna', 'আর যারা আমার আয়াতসমূহকে মিথ্যে মনে করে, শাস্তি তাদেরকে স্পর্শ করবে, কেননা তারা নাফরমানীতে লিপ্ত ছিল।', 'But those who deny Our verses - the punishment will touch them for their defiant disobedience.', 'আর যারা আমার আয়াতসমূহকে মিথ্যে মনে করে, শাস্তি তাদেরকে স্পর্শ করবে, কেননা তারা নাফরমানীতে লিপ্ত ছিল।', 'But those who deny Our verses - the punishment will touch them for their defiant disobedience.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006049.mp3', now()),
  (6, 50, '', '[{"id":48909,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48910,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":48911,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَقُولُ","transliteration":"aqūlu","translation_bn":"\"আমি বলি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48912,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তোমাদের (যে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48913,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِندِى","transliteration":"ʿindī","translation_bn":"কাছে আমার (আছে)","root":"عند\r","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":48914,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"خَزَآئِنُ","transliteration":"khazāinu","translation_bn":"ধনভান্ডারসমূহ","root":"خزن","lemma":"خَزَا^ئِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48915,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":48916,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48917,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানি আমি","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48918,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبَ","transliteration":"l-ghayba","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্যকে","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48919,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48920,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَقُولُ","transliteration":"aqūlu","translation_bn":"বলি আমি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48921,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তোমাদের (যে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48922,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":48923,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَلَكٌ ۖ","transliteration":"malakun","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48925,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"(প্রকৃতপক্ষে) না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":48926,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَتَّبِعُ","transliteration":"attabiʿu","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করি আমি","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48927,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":48928,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":48929,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يُوحَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yūḥā","translation_bn":"ওহী করা হয়","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48930,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ ۚ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"আমার প্রতি\"","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48932,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48933,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"\"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":48934,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَوِى","transliteration":"yastawī","translation_bn":"সমান হয়","root":"سوي","lemma":"ٱسْتَوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48935,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْمَىٰ","transliteration":"l-aʿmā","translation_bn":"অন্ধ","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48936,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَصِيرُ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-baṣīru","translation_bn":"আর চক্ষুষ্মান\"","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48938,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"কি তবে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":48939,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"تَتَفَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"tatafakkarūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা চিন্তা করো","root":"فكر","lemma":"يَتَفَكَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48940,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul lā aqūlu lakum ʿindī khazāinu l-lahi walā aʿlamu l-ghayba walā aqūlu lakum innī malakun in attabiʿu illā mā yūḥā ilayya qul hal yastawī l-aʿmā wal-baṣīru afalā tatafakkarūna', 'বল, আমি তোমাদেরকে বলি না যে, আমার কাছে আল্লাহর ধন-ভান্ডার আছে, আর আমি অদৃশ্যের খবরও জানি না। আর আমি তোমাদেরকে এ কথাও বলি না যে, আমি ফেরেশতা, আমার প্রতি যা অবতীর্ণ করা হয় তাছাড়া (অন্য কিছুর) আমি অনুসরণ করি না। বল, অন্ধ আর চোখওয়ালা কি সমান, তোমরা কি চিন্তা করে দেখ না?', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "I do not tell you that I have the depositories [containing the provision] of Allah or that I know the unseen, nor do I tell you that I am an angel. I only follow what is revealed to me." Say, "Is the blind equivalent to the seeing? Then will you not give thought?"', 'বল, আমি তোমাদেরকে বলি না যে, আমার কাছে আল্লাহর ধন-ভান্ডার আছে, আর আমি অদৃশ্যের খবরও জানি না। আর আমি তোমাদেরকে এ কথাও বলি না যে, আমি ফেরেশতা, আমার প্রতি যা অবতীর্ণ করা হয় তাছাড়া (অন্য কিছুর) আমি অনুসরণ করি না। বল, অন্ধ আর চোখওয়ালা কি সমান, তোমরা কি চিন্তা করে দেখ না?', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "I do not tell you that I have the depositories [containing the provision] of Allah or that I know the unseen, nor do I tell you that I am an angel. I only follow what is revealed to me." Say, "Is the blind equivalent to the seeing? Then will you not give thought?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006050.mp3', now()),
  (6, 51, '', '[{"id":49428,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنذِرْ","transliteration":"wa-andhir","translation_bn":"আর (হে নাবী) তুমি সতর্ক করো","root":"نذر","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49429,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِهِ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে এ","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49430,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49431,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَخَافُونَ","transliteration":"yakhāfūna","translation_bn":"ভয় করে","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49432,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":49433,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُحْشَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yuḥ''sharū","translation_bn":"একত্র করা হবে","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49434,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49435,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ ۙ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"রবের তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49437,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49438,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49439,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49440,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"دُونِهِۦ","transliteration":"dūnihi","translation_bn":"বাদ তাঁকে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49441,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلِىٌّۭ","transliteration":"waliyyun","translation_bn":"কোনো অভিভাবক","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49442,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49443,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَفِيعٌۭ","transliteration":"shafīʿun","translation_bn":"কোনো সুপারিশকারী","root":"شفع","lemma":"شَفِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49444,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَّعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":49445,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّقُونَ","transliteration":"yattaqūna","translation_bn":"তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49446,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-andhir bihi alladhīna yakhāfūna an yuḥ''sharū ilā rabbihim laysa lahum min dūnihi waliyyun walā shafīʿun laʿallahum yattaqūna', 'তুমি তা দিয়ে (অর্থাৎ কুরআন দিয়ে) তাদেরকে সতর্ক কর যারা ভয় করে যে, তাদেরকে তাদের প্রতিপালকের দিকে একত্রিত করা হবে, যিনি ছাড়া তাদের জন্য কোন অভিভাবক নেই এবং সুপারিশকারী নেই- যাতে তারা সংযত হয়ে চলে।', 'And warn by the Qur''an those who fear that they will be gathered before their Lord - for them besides Him will be no protector and no intercessor - that they might become righteous.', 'তুমি তা দিয়ে (অর্থাৎ কুরআন দিয়ে) তাদেরকে সতর্ক কর যারা ভয় করে যে, তাদেরকে তাদের প্রতিপালকের দিকে একত্রিত করা হবে, যিনি ছাড়া তাদের জন্য কোন অভিভাবক নেই এবং সুপারিশকারী নেই- যাতে তারা সংযত হয়ে চলে।', 'And warn by the Qur''an those who fear that they will be gathered before their Lord - for them besides Him will be no protector and no intercessor - that they might become righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006051.mp3', now()),
  (6, 52, '', '[{"id":50076,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50077,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَطْرُدِ","transliteration":"taṭrudi","translation_bn":"তাড়িয়ে দিও","root":"طرد","lemma":"طَرَد","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50078,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":50079,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50080,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُم","transliteration":"rabbahum","translation_bn":"তাদের রবকে","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50081,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْغَدَوٰةِ","transliteration":"bil-ghadati","translation_bn":"বেলায় সকাল","root":"غدو","lemma":"غَدَوٰة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50082,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْعَشِىِّ","transliteration":"wal-ʿashiyi","translation_bn":"ও সন্ধ্যায়","root":"عشو","lemma":"عَشِىّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50083,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُونَ","transliteration":"yurīdūna","translation_bn":"তারা চায়","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50084,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَجْهَهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"wajhahu","translation_bn":"সন্তুষ্টি তাঁর","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50086,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":50087,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ʿalayka","translation_bn":"উপর তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50088,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50089,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حِسَابِهِم","transliteration":"ḥisābihim","translation_bn":"হিসাব তাদের (দেয়ার দায়িত্ব)","root":"حسب","lemma":"حِسَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50090,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50091,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50092,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50093,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50094,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"حِسَابِكَ","transliteration":"ḥisābika","translation_bn":"তোমার হিসাব","root":"حسب","lemma":"حِسَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50095,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50096,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50097,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50098,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فَتَطْرُدَهُمْ","transliteration":"fataṭrudahum","translation_bn":"অতএব তুমি তাড়িয়ে দিলে তাদেরকে","root":"طرد","lemma":"طَرَد","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":50099,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَتَكُونَ","transliteration":"fatakūna","translation_bn":"তবে হবে তুমি","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50100,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50101,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50102,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā taṭrudi alladhīna yadʿūna rabbahum bil-ghadati wal-ʿashiyi yurīdūna wajhahu mā ʿalayka min ḥisābihim min shayin wamā min ḥisābika ʿalayhim min shayin fataṭrudahum fatakūna mina l-ẓālimīna', 'যারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের সন্তুষ্টি লাভের উদ্দেশ্যে সকাল-সন্ধ্যায় তাঁকে ডাকে তাদেরকে (অর্থাৎ তোমার নিকট সমাগত গরীব মু’মিনদেরকে) তুমি দূরে সরিয়ে দিও না। তাদের কোন ‘আমালের জন্য তোমাকে কোন জবাবদিহি করতে হবে না, আর তোমার কোন ‘আমালের জন্যও তাদেরকে কোন জবাবদিহি করতে হবে না, কাজেই তুমি যদি তাদেরকে অর্থাৎ (গরীব মু’মিনদেরকে) দূরে সরিয়ে দাও তবে তুমি যালিমদের মধ্যে গণ্য হবে।', 'And do not send away those who call upon their Lord morning and afternoon, seeking His countenance. Not upon you is anything of their account and not upon them is anything of your account. So were you to send them away, you would [then] be of the wrongdoers.', 'যারা তাদের প্রতিপালকের সন্তুষ্টি লাভের উদ্দেশ্যে সকাল-সন্ধ্যায় তাঁকে ডাকে তাদেরকে (অর্থাৎ তোমার নিকট সমাগত গরীব মু’মিনদেরকে) তুমি দূরে সরিয়ে দিও না। তাদের কোন ‘আমালের জন্য তোমাকে কোন জবাবদিহি করতে হবে না, আর তোমার কোন ‘আমালের জন্যও তাদেরকে কোন জবাবদিহি করতে হবে না, কাজেই তুমি যদি তাদেরকে অর্থাৎ (গরীব মু’মিনদেরকে) দূরে সরিয়ে দাও তবে তুমি যালিমদের মধ্যে গণ্য হবে।', 'And do not send away those who call upon their Lord morning and afternoon, seeking His countenance. Not upon you is anything of their account and not upon them is anything of your account. So were you to send them away, you would [then] be of the wrongdoers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006052.mp3', now()),
  (6, 53, '', '[{"id":50732,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50733,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَتَنَّا","transliteration":"fatannā","translation_bn":"পরীক্ষা করেছি আমরা","root":"فتن","lemma":"فَتَنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50734,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَهُم","transliteration":"baʿḍahum","translation_bn":"কাউকে তাদের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50735,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِبَعْضٍۢ","transliteration":"bibaʿḍin","translation_bn":"দিয়ে (অন্য) কাউকে","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50736,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِّيَقُولُوٓا۟","transliteration":"liyaqūlū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":50737,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَهَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"ahāulāi","translation_bn":"\"কি এসব লোকদের","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":50738,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَنَّ","transliteration":"manna","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ করেছেন","root":"منن","lemma":"مَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50739,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50740,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50741,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50742,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِنَآ ۗ","transliteration":"bayninā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে আমাদের\"","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":50744,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَلَيْسَ","transliteration":"alaysa","translation_bn":"নন কি","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":50745,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":50746,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِأَعْلَمَ","transliteration":"bi-aʿlama","translation_bn":"অধিক অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50747,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلشَّـٰكِرِينَ","transliteration":"bil-shākirīna","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে কৃতজ্ঞদের","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَاكِر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50748,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika fatannā baʿḍahum bibaʿḍin liyaqūlū ahāulāi manna l-lahu ʿalayhim min bayninā alaysa l-lahu bi-aʿlama bil-shākirīna', 'আর এভাবেই আমি তাদের একদলকে অন্যদলের মাধ্যমে পরীক্ষা করেছি যাতে তারা বলে, এরা কি সেই লোক আমাদের মধ্যে যাদেরকে আল্লাহ অনুগ্রহ করেছেন, আল্লাহ কি তাঁর কৃতজ্ঞ বান্দাহদের সম্পর্কে অধিক অবগত নন?', 'And thus We have tried some of them through others that the disbelievers might say, "Is it these whom Allah has favored among us?" Is not Allah most knowing of those who are grateful?', 'আর এভাবেই আমি তাদের একদলকে অন্যদলের মাধ্যমে পরীক্ষা করেছি যাতে তারা বলে, এরা কি সেই লোক আমাদের মধ্যে যাদেরকে আল্লাহ অনুগ্রহ করেছেন, আল্লাহ কি তাঁর কৃতজ্ঞ বান্দাহদের সম্পর্কে অধিক অবগত নন?', 'And thus We have tried some of them through others that the disbelievers might say, "Is it these whom Allah has favored among us?" Is not Allah most knowing of those who are grateful?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006053.mp3', now()),
  (6, 54, '', '[{"id":51378,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51379,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكَ","transliteration":"jāaka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে আসে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51380,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51381,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51382,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"উপর  নিদর্শনগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51383,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَقُلْ","transliteration":"faqul","translation_bn":"তখন বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":51384,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَلَـٰمٌ","transliteration":"salāmun","translation_bn":"\"শান্তি (বর্ষিত হোক)","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51385,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51387,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَتَبَ","transliteration":"kataba","translation_bn":"নির্ধারিত করে নিয়েছেন","root":"كتب","lemma":"كَتَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51388,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbukum","translation_bn":"রব তোমাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51389,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51390,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسِهِ","transliteration":"nafsihi","translation_bn":"নিজের তাঁর","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51391,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَةَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-raḥmata","translation_bn":"দয়া করা","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51393,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"annahu","translation_bn":"এমন যে তা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":51394,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":51395,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلَ","transliteration":"ʿamila","translation_bn":"কাজ করে বসে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51396,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51397,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"سُوٓءًۢا","transliteration":"sūan","translation_bn":"মন্দ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51398,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِجَهَـٰلَةٍۢ","transliteration":"bijahālatin","translation_bn":"কারণে অজ্ঞতার","root":"جهل","lemma":"جَهَٰلَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51399,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51400,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"تَابَ","transliteration":"tāba","translation_bn":"তওবা করে","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51401,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51402,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِۦ","transliteration":"baʿdihi","translation_bn":"তারপর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51403,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَأَصْلَحَ","transliteration":"wa-aṣlaḥa","translation_bn":"ও সংশোধিত হয়","root":"صلح","lemma":"أَصْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51404,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"fa-annahu","translation_bn":"তবে বাস্তবিকই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":51405,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51406,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু\"","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":51407,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā jāaka alladhīna yu''minūna biāyātinā faqul salāmun ʿalaykum kataba rabbukum ʿalā nafsihi l-raḥmata annahu man ʿamila minkum sūan bijahālatin thumma tāba min baʿdihi wa-aṣlaḥa fa-annahu ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'আমার আয়াতে বিশ্বাসী লোকেরা যখন তোমার কাছে আসে তখন তাদেরকে বল, ‘‘তোমাদের প্রতি সালাম’’। তোমাদের প্রতিপালক দয়া-রহমাতের নীতি নিজের প্রতি অবধারিত করে নিয়েছেন আর তা হচ্ছে যদি তোমাদের কোন ব্যক্তি না জেনে অন্যায় পাপ করে, অতঃপর তাওবাহ করে ও নিজেকে সংশোধন করে, তাহলে আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'And when those come to you who believe in Our verses, say, "Peace be upon you. Your Lord has decreed upon Himself mercy: that any of you who does wrong out of ignorance and then repents after that and corrects himself - indeed, He is Forgiving and Merciful."', 'আমার আয়াতে বিশ্বাসী লোকেরা যখন তোমার কাছে আসে তখন তাদেরকে বল, ‘‘তোমাদের প্রতি সালাম’’। তোমাদের প্রতিপালক দয়া-রহমাতের নীতি নিজের প্রতি অবধারিত করে নিয়েছেন আর তা হচ্ছে যদি তোমাদের কোন ব্যক্তি না জেনে অন্যায় পাপ করে, অতঃপর তাওবাহ করে ও নিজেকে সংশোধন করে, তাহলে আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'And when those come to you who believe in Our verses, say, "Peace be upon you. Your Lord has decreed upon Himself mercy: that any of you who does wrong out of ignorance and then repents after that and corrects himself - indeed, He is Forgiving and Merciful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006054.mp3', now()),
  (6, 55, '', '[{"id":51898,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51899,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُفَصِّلُ","transliteration":"nufaṣṣilu","translation_bn":"বিস্তারিত বর্ণনা করি আমরা","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51900,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনগুলোকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51901,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلِتَسْتَبِينَ","transliteration":"walitastabīna","translation_bn":"এবং যেন সুস্পষ্ট প্রকাশ হয়","root":"بين","lemma":"تَسْتَبِينَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51902,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلُ","transliteration":"sabīlu","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51903,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীদের","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51904,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika nufaṣṣilu l-āyāti walitastabīna sabīlu l-muj''rimīna', 'এভাবেই আমি আমার আয়াতগুলোকে সুস্পষ্টভাবে বর্ণনা করি যাতে অপরাধীদের পথ পরিষ্কাররূপে প্রকাশ পেয়ে যায়।', 'And thus do We detail the verses, and [thus] the way of the criminals will become evident.', 'এভাবেই আমি আমার আয়াতগুলোকে সুস্পষ্টভাবে বর্ণনা করি যাতে অপরাধীদের পথ পরিষ্কাররূপে প্রকাশ পেয়ে যায়।', 'And thus do We detail the verses, and [thus] the way of the criminals will become evident.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006055.mp3', now()),
  (6, 56, '', '[{"id":52430,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52431,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমাকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52432,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نُهِيتُ","transliteration":"nuhītu","translation_bn":"আমাকে নিষেধ করা হয়েছে","root":"نهي","lemma":"نَهَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52433,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":52434,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَعْبُدَ","transliteration":"aʿbuda","translation_bn":"(যেন না) আমি ইবাদাত করি","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52435,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52436,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"tadʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52437,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে\"","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52438,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"বাদ\"","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52439,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52441,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52442,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَّآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52443,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَتَّبِعُ","transliteration":"attabiʿu","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করি আমি","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52444,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَهْوَآءَكُمْ ۙ","transliteration":"ahwāakum","translation_bn":"খেয়ালখুশির তোমাদের","root":"هوي","lemma":"أَهْوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52446,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":52447,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَلْتُ","transliteration":"ḍalaltu","translation_bn":"আমি পথভ্রষ্ট হবো","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52448,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِذًۭا","transliteration":"idhan","translation_bn":"তাহলে","root":"—","lemma":"إِذًا\r","grammar_bn":"উত্তর পদ (Answer)"},{"id":52449,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না (হবো)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52450,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":52451,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52452,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","transliteration":"l-muh''tadīna","translation_bn":"সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্তদের\"","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُّهْتَدُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52453,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul innī nuhītu an aʿbuda alladhīna tadʿūna min dūni l-lahi qul lā attabiʿu ahwāakum qad ḍalaltu idhan wamā anā mina l-muh''tadīna', 'বল, তোমরা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদেরকে ডাকো, তাদের ইবাদত করতে আমাকে নিষেধ করা হয়েছে। বল, আমি তোমাদের খোশ-খেয়ালের অনুসরণ করি না, তা করলে আমি পথভ্রষ্ট হয়ে যাব, সে অবস্থায় আমি আর হিদায়াতপ্রাপ্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত থাকতে পারব না।', 'Say, "Indeed, I have been forbidden to worship those you invoke besides Allah." Say, "I will not follow your desires, for I would then have gone astray, and I would not be of the [rightly] guided."', 'বল, তোমরা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদেরকে ডাকো, তাদের ইবাদত করতে আমাকে নিষেধ করা হয়েছে। বল, আমি তোমাদের খোশ-খেয়ালের অনুসরণ করি না, তা করলে আমি পথভ্রষ্ট হয়ে যাব, সে অবস্থায় আমি আর হিদায়াতপ্রাপ্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত থাকতে পারব না।', 'Say, "Indeed, I have been forbidden to worship those you invoke besides Allah." Say, "I will not follow your desires, for I would then have gone astray, and I would not be of the [rightly] guided."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006056.mp3', now()),
  (6, 57, '', '[{"id":52987,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52988,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52989,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52990,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَةٍۢ","transliteration":"bayyinatin","translation_bn":"স্পষ্ট প্রমাণের (প্রতিষ্ঠিত)","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52991,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52992,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52993,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَّبْتُم","transliteration":"wakadhabtum","translation_bn":"অথচ মিথ্যারোপ করছো তোমরা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52994,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52996,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52997,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عِندِى","transliteration":"ʿindī","translation_bn":"কাছে আমার","root":"عند\r","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":52998,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52999,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ","transliteration":"tastaʿjilūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শীঘ্র চাচ্ছো","root":"عجل","lemma":"ٱسْتَعْجَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53000,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"বিষয় সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53002,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنِ","transliteration":"ini","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":53003,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُكْمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥuk''mu","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ দেয়ার ক্ষমতা","root":"حكم","lemma":"حُكْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53004,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়্","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":53005,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53007,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَقُصُّ","transliteration":"yaquṣṣu","translation_bn":"তিনি বর্ণনা করেন","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53008,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقَّ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","translation_bn":"সত্যকে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53010,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53011,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرُ","transliteration":"khayru","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53012,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰصِلِينَ","transliteration":"l-fāṣilīna","translation_bn":"মীমাংসাকারী\"","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَٰصِلِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53013,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul innī ʿalā bayyinatin min rabbī wakadhabtum bihi mā ʿindī mā tastaʿjilūna bihi ini l-ḥuk''mu illā lillahi yaquṣṣu l-ḥaqa wahuwa khayru l-fāṣilīna', 'বল, আমি আমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে পাওয়া এক উজ্জ্বল প্রমাণের উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত; অথচ তোমরা তা মিথ্যে মনে করেছ। যা তোমরা খুব তাড়াতাড়ি পেতে চাও (অর্থাৎ আল্লাহর আযাব) তা আমার আয়ত্তে নেই। হুকুম বা কর্তৃত্বের মালিকানা আল্লাহ ছাড়া কারো কাছে নেই। তিনিই সত্যকথা বর্ণনা করেন, আর তিনিই সর্বোত্তম ফায়সালাকারী।', 'Say, "Indeed, I am on clear evidence from my Lord, and you have denied it. I do not have that for which you are impatient. The decision is only for Allah. He relates the truth, and He is the best of deciders."', 'বল, আমি আমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে পাওয়া এক উজ্জ্বল প্রমাণের উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত; অথচ তোমরা তা মিথ্যে মনে করেছ। যা তোমরা খুব তাড়াতাড়ি পেতে চাও (অর্থাৎ আল্লাহর আযাব) তা আমার আয়ত্তে নেই। হুকুম বা কর্তৃত্বের মালিকানা আল্লাহ ছাড়া কারো কাছে নেই। তিনিই সত্যকথা বর্ণনা করেন, আর তিনিই সর্বোত্তম ফায়সালাকারী।', 'Say, "Indeed, I am on clear evidence from my Lord, and you have denied it. I do not have that for which you are impatient. The decision is only for Allah. He relates the truth, and He is the best of deciders."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006057.mp3', now()),
  (6, 58, '', '[{"id":53494,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53495,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":53496,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চিত (থাকতো)","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":53497,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عِندِى","transliteration":"ʿindī","translation_bn":"কাছে আমার","root":"عند\r","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":53498,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53499,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ","transliteration":"tastaʿjilūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শীঘ্র চাচ্ছ","root":"عجل","lemma":"ٱسْتَعْجَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53500,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"বিষয় সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53501,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَقُضِىَ","transliteration":"laquḍiya","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মীমাংসা (তাহলে) হয়ে যেতো","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":53502,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرُ","transliteration":"l-amru","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারটির","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53503,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنِى","transliteration":"baynī","translation_bn":"মাঝে আমার","root":"بين\r","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":53504,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"wabaynakum","translation_bn":"ও মাঝে তোমাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53506,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53507,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব অবগত","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53508,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"bil-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53509,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul law anna ʿindī mā tastaʿjilūna bihi laquḍiya l-amru baynī wabaynakum wal-lahu aʿlamu bil-ẓālimīna', 'বল, তোমরা যা তাড়াতাড়ি চাচ্ছ তা যদি আমার কাছে থাকত তাহলে আমার আর তোমাদের মধ্যে যে ব্যাপার তার ফায়সালা হয়ে যেত, অন্যায়কারীদের সম্পর্কে আল্লাহ খুবভাবেই অবহিত।', 'Say, "If I had that for which you are impatient, the matter would have been decided between me and you, but Allah is most knowing of the wrongdoers."', 'বল, তোমরা যা তাড়াতাড়ি চাচ্ছ তা যদি আমার কাছে থাকত তাহলে আমার আর তোমাদের মধ্যে যে ব্যাপার তার ফায়সালা হয়ে যেত, অন্যায়কারীদের সম্পর্কে আল্লাহ খুবভাবেই অবহিত।', 'Say, "If I had that for which you are impatient, the matter would have been decided between me and you, but Allah is most knowing of the wrongdoers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006058.mp3', now()),
  (6, 59, '', '[{"id":54007,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَعِندَهُۥ","transliteration":"waʿindahu","translation_bn":"এবং কাছে তাঁর(আছে)","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54008,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَفَاتِحُ","transliteration":"mafātiḥu","translation_bn":"চাবিসমূহ","root":"فتح","lemma":"مَفَاتِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54009,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"l-ghaybi","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্যের","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54010,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":54011,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُهَآ","transliteration":"yaʿlamuhā","translation_bn":"জানে কেউ ত্","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54012,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":54013,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۚ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۚ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":54015,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"wayaʿlamu","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54016,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54017,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54018,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَرِّ","transliteration":"l-bari","translation_bn":"স্থলভাগের","root":"برر","lemma":"بَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54019,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَحْرِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-baḥri","translation_bn":"ও জলভাগে","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54021,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54022,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَسْقُطُ","transliteration":"tasquṭu","translation_bn":"পড়ে","root":"سقط","lemma":"سُقِطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54023,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোন","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54024,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَرَقَةٍ","transliteration":"waraqatin","translation_bn":"পাতা","root":"ورق","lemma":"وَرَقَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54025,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":54026,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُهَا","transliteration":"yaʿlamuhā","translation_bn":"জানেন তিনি তা","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54027,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54028,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"حَبَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ḥabbatin","translation_bn":"কোনো শস্যকণা","root":"حبب","lemma":"حَبَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54029,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54030,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ظُلُمَـٰتِ","transliteration":"ẓulumāti","translation_bn":"অন্ধকারের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلُمَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54031,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"মাটির","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54032,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54033,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"رَطْبٍۢ","transliteration":"raṭbin","translation_bn":"আর্দ্র","root":"رطب","lemma":"رَطْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54034,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54035,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يَابِسٍ","transliteration":"yābisin","translation_bn":"শুষ্ক","root":"يبس","lemma":"يَابِس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54036,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":54037,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54038,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبٍۢ","transliteration":"kitābin","translation_bn":"এক কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54039,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍۢ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্টভাবে (লিখিত)","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":54040,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waʿindahu mafātiḥu l-ghaybi lā yaʿlamuhā illā huwa wayaʿlamu mā fī l-bari wal-baḥri wamā tasquṭu min waraqatin illā yaʿlamuhā walā ḥabbatin fī ẓulumāti l-arḍi walā raṭbin walā yābisin illā fī kitābin mubīnin', 'সমস্ত গায়বের চাবিকাঠি তাঁর কাছে, তিনি ছাড়া আর কেউ তা জানে না, জলে-স্থলে যা আছে তা তিনি জানেন, এমন একটা পাতাও পড়ে না যা তিনি জানেন না। যমীনের গহীন অন্ধকারে কোন শস্য দানা নেই, নেই কোন ভেজা ও শুকনো জিনিস যা সুস্পষ্ট কিতাবে (লিখিত) নেই।', 'And with Him are the keys of the unseen; none knows them except Him. And He knows what is on the land and in the sea. Not a leaf falls but that He knows it. And no grain is there within the darknesses of the earth and no moist or dry [thing] but that it is [written] in a clear record.', 'সমস্ত গায়বের চাবিকাঠি তাঁর কাছে, তিনি ছাড়া আর কেউ তা জানে না, জলে-স্থলে যা আছে তা তিনি জানেন, এমন একটা পাতাও পড়ে না যা তিনি জানেন না। যমীনের গহীন অন্ধকারে কোন শস্য দানা নেই, নেই কোন ভেজা ও শুকনো জিনিস যা সুস্পষ্ট কিতাবে (লিখিত) নেই।', 'And with Him are the keys of the unseen; none knows them except Him. And He knows what is on the land and in the sea. Not a leaf falls but that He knows it. And no grain is there within the darknesses of the earth and no moist or dry [thing] but that it is [written] in a clear record.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006059.mp3', now()),
  (6, 60, '', '[{"id":54695,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই  (আল্লাহ)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54696,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54697,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَتَوَفَّىٰكُم","transliteration":"yatawaffākum","translation_bn":"মৃত্যু(অর্থাৎ নিদ্রা)দেন তোমাদের","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54698,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّيْلِ","transliteration":"bi-al-layli","translation_bn":"বেলায় রাতের","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54699,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"wayaʿlamu","translation_bn":"ও তিনি জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54700,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54701,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَرَحْتُم","transliteration":"jaraḥtum","translation_bn":"অর্জন করো তোমরা","root":"جرح","lemma":"جَرَحْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54702,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلنَّهَارِ","transliteration":"bil-nahāri","translation_bn":"বেলায় দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54703,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54704,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَبْعَثُكُمْ","transliteration":"yabʿathukum","translation_bn":"জাগান তোমাদের","root":"بعث","lemma":"بَعَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54705,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54706,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِيُقْضَىٰٓ","transliteration":"liyuq''ḍā","translation_bn":"যেন পূর্ণ হয়","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54707,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلٌۭ","transliteration":"ajalun","translation_bn":"একটি মেয়াদ","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54708,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُّسَمًّۭى ۖ","transliteration":"musamman","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট (অর্থাৎ জীবনকাল)","root":"سمو","lemma":"مُّسَمًّى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":54710,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54711,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"দিকে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54712,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَرْجِعُكُمْ","transliteration":"marjiʿukum","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন হবে তোমাদের","root":"رجع","lemma":"مَرْجِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54713,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54714,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يُنَبِّئُكُم","transliteration":"yunabbi-ukum","translation_bn":"তিনি জানিয়ে দিবেন তোমাদের","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54715,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54716,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54717,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54718,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī yatawaffākum bi-al-layli wayaʿlamu mā jaraḥtum bil-nahāri thumma yabʿathukum fīhi liyuq''ḍā ajalun musamman thumma ilayhi marjiʿukum thumma yunabbi-ukum bimā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'তিনিই রাত্রিকালে তোমাদের আত্মাকে নিয়ে নেন, আর দিনের বেলা যা তোমরা কর তা তিনি জানেন। অতঃপর দিনের বেলা তিনি তোমাদের জাগিয়ে দেন, যাতে জীবনের নির্দিষ্টকাল পূর্ণ হয়। অতঃপর তাঁর পানেই তোমাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন, অতঃপর তিনি তোমাদের নিকট বর্ণনা করে দেবেন যা তোমরা করছিলে।', 'And it is He who takes your souls by night and knows what you have committed by day. Then He revives you therein that a specified term may be fulfilled. Then to Him will be your return; then He will inform you about what you used to do.', 'তিনিই রাত্রিকালে তোমাদের আত্মাকে নিয়ে নেন, আর দিনের বেলা যা তোমরা কর তা তিনি জানেন। অতঃপর দিনের বেলা তিনি তোমাদের জাগিয়ে দেন, যাতে জীবনের নির্দিষ্টকাল পূর্ণ হয়। অতঃপর তাঁর পানেই তোমাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন, অতঃপর তিনি তোমাদের নিকট বর্ণনা করে দেবেন যা তোমরা করছিলে।', 'And it is He who takes your souls by night and knows what you have committed by day. Then He revives you therein that a specified term may be fulfilled. Then to Him will be your return; then He will inform you about what you used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006060.mp3', now()),
  (6, 61, '', '[{"id":55289,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55290,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَاهِرُ","transliteration":"l-qāhiru","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"قهر","lemma":"قَاهِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55291,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقَ","transliteration":"fawqa","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":55292,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","translation_bn":"দাসদের তাঁর","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55294,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَيُرْسِلُ","transliteration":"wayur''silu","translation_bn":"এবং পাঠান","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55295,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55296,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَفَظَةً","transliteration":"ḥafaẓatan","translation_bn":"তত্ত্বাবধায়ক","root":"حفظ","lemma":"حَفِيظ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55297,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"এমনকি","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":55298,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":55299,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55300,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدَكُمُ","transliteration":"aḥadakumu","translation_bn":"কারও তোমাদের","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55301,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتُ","transliteration":"l-mawtu","translation_bn":"মৃত্যু","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55302,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَوَفَّتْهُ","transliteration":"tawaffathu","translation_bn":"মৃত্যু ঘটায় তার","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55303,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلُنَا","transliteration":"rusulunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের প্রেরিত (ফেরেশতাগণ)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55304,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":55305,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":55306,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يُفَرِّطُونَ","transliteration":"yufarriṭūna","translation_bn":"ভুল করে","root":"فرط","lemma":"فَرَّط","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55307,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa l-qāhiru fawqa ʿibādihi wayur''silu ʿalaykum ḥafaẓatan ḥattā idhā jāa aḥadakumu l-mawtu tawaffathu rusulunā wahum lā yufarriṭūna', 'তিনি তাঁর বান্দাহদের উপর পূর্ণ কর্তৃত্বশীল, আর তিনি তোমাদের উপর রক্ষক নিযুক্ত করেন। অতঃপর তোমাদের কারো মৃত্যুর সময় উপস্থিত হলে আমার প্রেরিতগণ (ফেরেশতারা) তার মৃত্যু ঘটায়। নিজেদের কর্তব্য পালনে তারা বিন্দুমাত্র ত্রুটি করে না।', 'And He is the subjugator over His servants, and He sends over you guardian-angels until, when death comes to one of you, Our messengers take him, and they do not fail [in their duties].', 'তিনি তাঁর বান্দাহদের উপর পূর্ণ কর্তৃত্বশীল, আর তিনি তোমাদের উপর রক্ষক নিযুক্ত করেন। অতঃপর তোমাদের কারো মৃত্যুর সময় উপস্থিত হলে আমার প্রেরিতগণ (ফেরেশতারা) তার মৃত্যু ঘটায়। নিজেদের কর্তব্য পালনে তারা বিন্দুমাত্র ত্রুটি করে না।', 'And He is the subjugator over His servants, and He sends over you guardian-angels until, when death comes to one of you, Our messengers take him, and they do not fail [in their duties].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006061.mp3', now()),
  (6, 62, '', '[{"id":55809,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":55810,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رُدُّوٓا۟","transliteration":"ruddū","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে আনা হবে","root":"ردد","lemma":"رَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":55811,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55812,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":55813,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَوْلَىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"mawlāhumu","translation_bn":"(যিনি) তাদের মালিক","root":"ولي","lemma":"مَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55814,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55816,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَلَا","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":55817,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":55818,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُكْمُ","transliteration":"l-ḥuk''mu","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ দেয়ার ক্ষমতা","root":"حكم","lemma":"حُكْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55819,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55820,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَسْرَعُ","transliteration":"asraʿu","translation_bn":"দ্রুততর","root":"سرع","lemma":"أَسْرَع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":55821,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَـٰسِبِينَ","transliteration":"l-ḥāsibīna","translation_bn":"হিসাব গ্রহণকারীদের (মধ্যে)","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَٰسِبِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":55822,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma ruddū ilā l-lahi mawlāhumu l-ḥaqi alā lahu l-ḥuk''mu wahuwa asraʿu l-ḥāsibīna', 'অতঃপর তাদেরকে তাদের প্রকৃত প্রতিপালকের নিকট ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে। সাবধান! কর্তৃত্ব তাঁরই, আর তিনি হিসাব গ্রহণে সর্বাপেক্ষা ত্বরিতগতি।', 'Then they His servants are returned to Allah, their true Lord. Unquestionably, His is the judgement, and He is the swiftest of accountants.', 'অতঃপর তাদেরকে তাদের প্রকৃত প্রতিপালকের নিকট ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে। সাবধান! কর্তৃত্ব তাঁরই, আর তিনি হিসাব গ্রহণে সর্বাপেক্ষা ত্বরিতগতি।', 'Then they His servants are returned to Allah, their true Lord. Unquestionably, His is the judgement, and He is the swiftest of accountants.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006062.mp3', now()),
  (6, 63, '', '[{"id":56364,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56365,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"\"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":56366,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُنَجِّيكُم","transliteration":"yunajjīkum","translation_bn":"উদ্ধার করেন তোমাদের","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56367,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56368,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظُلُمَـٰتِ","transliteration":"ẓulumāti","translation_bn":"অন্ধকারসমূহ","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلُمَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56369,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَرِّ","transliteration":"l-bari","translation_bn":"স্হলভাগের","root":"برر","lemma":"بَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56370,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَحْرِ","transliteration":"wal-baḥri","translation_bn":"ও জলভাগের","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56371,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَهُۥ","transliteration":"tadʿūnahu","translation_bn":"(যখন) তোমরা ডাকো তাঁকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56372,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَضَرُّعًۭا","transliteration":"taḍarruʿan","translation_bn":"কাতরভাবে","root":"ضرع","lemma":"تَضَرُّع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56373,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَخُفْيَةًۭ","transliteration":"wakhuf''yatan","translation_bn":"ও গোপনে","root":"خفي","lemma":"خُفْيَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56374,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَّئِنْ","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"\"(এবং বলে থাকো) অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":56375,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَنجَىٰنَا","transliteration":"anjānā","translation_bn":"উদ্ধার করেন আমাদের","root":"نجو","lemma":"أَنجَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56376,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56377,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِۦ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এই (বিপদ)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":56378,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَنَكُونَنَّ","transliteration":"lanakūnanna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই হবো অামরা (তবে)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":56379,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56380,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّـٰكِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-shākirīna","translation_bn":"কৃতজ্ঞদের\"","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَاكِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56381,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul man yunajjīkum min ẓulumāti l-bari wal-baḥri tadʿūnahu taḍarruʿan wakhuf''yatan la-in anjānā min hādhihi lanakūnanna mina l-shākirīna', 'বল, বিনীতভাবে আর সংগোপনে যখন তাঁকে ডাক তখন জল-স্থলের অন্ধকার হতে কে তোমাদেরকে রক্ষা করে। (বিপদে পড়লে বলতে থাক) এত্থেকে তুমি যদি আমাদেরকে রক্ষা কর তাহলে আমরা অবশ্যই কৃতজ্ঞদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হব।', 'Say, "Who rescues you from the darknesses of the land and sea [when] you call upon Him imploring [aloud] and privately, ''If He should save us from this [crisis], we will surely be among the thankful.'' "', 'বল, বিনীতভাবে আর সংগোপনে যখন তাঁকে ডাক তখন জল-স্থলের অন্ধকার হতে কে তোমাদেরকে রক্ষা করে। (বিপদে পড়লে বলতে থাক) এত্থেকে তুমি যদি আমাদেরকে রক্ষা কর তাহলে আমরা অবশ্যই কৃতজ্ঞদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হব।', 'Say, "Who rescues you from the darknesses of the land and sea [when] you call upon Him imploring [aloud] and privately, ''If He should save us from this [crisis], we will surely be among the thankful.'' "', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006063.mp3', now()),
  (6, 64, '', '[{"id":56865,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلِ","transliteration":"quli","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56866,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"\"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56867,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُنَجِّيكُم","transliteration":"yunajjīkum","translation_bn":"উদ্ধার করেন তোমাদের","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56868,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"হতে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56869,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمِن","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56870,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56871,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَرْبٍۢ","transliteration":"karbin","translation_bn":"দুঃখ বিপদ","root":"كرب","lemma":"كَرْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56872,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপরও","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56873,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":56874,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"tush''rikūna","translation_bn":"শিরক করো\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56875,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'quli l-lahu yunajjīkum min''hā wamin kulli karbin thumma antum tush''rikūna', 'বল, আল্লাহই তোমাদেরকে এথেকে আর সমস্ত বিপদ থেকে রক্ষা করেন, অতঃপর তোমরা তাঁর অংশী স্থির কর।', 'Say, "It is Allah who saves you from it and from every distress; then you [still] associate others with Him."', 'বল, আল্লাহই তোমাদেরকে এথেকে আর সমস্ত বিপদ থেকে রক্ষা করেন, অতঃপর তোমরা তাঁর অংশী স্থির কর।', 'Say, "It is Allah who saves you from it and from every distress; then you [still] associate others with Him."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006064.mp3', now()),
