58,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِ","transliteration":"taḥti","translation_bn":"নিচ","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57359,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَرْجُلِكُمْ","transliteration":"arjulikum","translation_bn":"পায়ের তোমাদের","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57360,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57361,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَلْبِسَكُمْ","transliteration":"yalbisakum","translation_bn":"বিভক্ত করতে পারেন তোমাদের","root":"لبس","lemma":"لَبَسْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57362,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شِيَعًۭا","transliteration":"shiyaʿan","translation_bn":"বিভিন্ন দলে","root":"شيع","lemma":"شِيعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57363,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَيُذِيقَ","transliteration":"wayudhīqa","translation_bn":"এবং আস্বাদন করাতে পারেন","root":"ذوق","lemma":"أَذَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57364,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَكُم","transliteration":"baʿḍakum","translation_bn":"কাউকে তোমাদের (দিয়ে)","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57365,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسَ","transliteration":"basa","translation_bn":"সংঘর্ষের (কুফল)","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57366,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضٍ ۗ","transliteration":"baʿḍin","translation_bn":"অন্য কাউকে\"","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57368,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱنظُرْ","transliteration":"unẓur","translation_bn":"দেখো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57369,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কিভাবে","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":57370,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"نُصَرِّفُ","transliteration":"nuṣarrifu","translation_bn":"আমরা বারবার বর্ণনা করি","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَّفْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57371,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"আমার নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57372,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"সম্ভবত তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57373,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يَفْقَهُونَ","transliteration":"yafqahūna","translation_bn":"বুঝে নিবে (নিগুঢ় তথ্য)","root":"فقه","lemma":"يَفْقَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57374,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul huwa l-qādiru ʿalā an yabʿatha ʿalaykum ʿadhāban min fawqikum aw min taḥti arjulikum aw yalbisakum shiyaʿan wayudhīqa baʿḍakum basa baʿḍin unẓur kayfa nuṣarrifu l-āyāti laʿallahum yafqahūna', 'বল, তিনি তোমাদের উপর থেকে অথবা পদতল থেকে ‘আযাব পাঠাতে (সক্ষম) অথবা তোমাদেরকে দলে দলে বিভক্ত করার মাধ্যমে একদলকে অন্যদলের সংঘাত সংঘর্ষ ও হিংসা হানাহানির আস্বাদ গ্রহণ করাতে সক্ষম। লক্ষ্য কর, আমি নিদর্শনাবলী কেমন বিস্তারিত বর্ণনা করছি যাতে তারা উপলব্ধি করতে পারে।', 'Say, "He is the [one] Able to send upon you affliction from above you or from beneath your feet or to confuse you [so you become] sects and make you taste the violence of one another." Look how We diversify the signs that they might understand.', 'বল, তিনি তোমাদের উপর থেকে অথবা পদতল থেকে ‘আযাব পাঠাতে (সক্ষম) অথবা তোমাদেরকে দলে দলে বিভক্ত করার মাধ্যমে একদলকে অন্যদলের সংঘাত সংঘর্ষ ও হিংসা হানাহানির আস্বাদ গ্রহণ করাতে সক্ষম। লক্ষ্য কর, আমি নিদর্শনাবলী কেমন বিস্তারিত বর্ণনা করছি যাতে তারা উপলব্ধি করতে পারে।', 'Say, "He is the [one] Able to send upon you affliction from above you or from beneath your feet or to confuse you [so you become] sects and make you taste the violence of one another." Look how We diversify the signs that they might understand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006065.mp3', now()),
  (6, 66, '', '[{"id":57854,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَّبَ","transliteration":"wakadhaba","translation_bn":"এবং অস্বীকার করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57855,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57856,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمُكَ","transliteration":"qawmuka","translation_bn":"তোমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57857,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"অথচ তা (অর্থাৎ আয়াত)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":57858,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57860,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"তুমি বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57861,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّسْتُ","transliteration":"lastu","translation_bn":"\"আমি নই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57862,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُم","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57863,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِوَكِيلٍۢ","transliteration":"biwakīlin","translation_bn":"কর্মবিধায়ক\"","root":"وكل","lemma":"وَكِيل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57864,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhaba bihi qawmuka wahuwa l-ḥaqu qul lastu ʿalaykum biwakīlin', 'তোমার কওম তা (অর্থাৎ ‘আযাবকে) মিথ্যে মনে করছে কিন্তু তা প্রকৃত সত্য। বল, আমি তোমাদের কর্মবিধায়ক নই।', 'But your people have denied it while it is the truth. Say, "I am not over you a manager."', 'তোমার কওম তা (অর্থাৎ ‘আযাবকে) মিথ্যে মনে করছে কিন্তু তা প্রকৃত সত্য। বল, আমি তোমাদের কর্মবিধায়ক নই।', 'But your people have denied it while it is the truth. Say, "I am not over you a manager."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006066.mp3', now()),
  (6, 67, '', '[{"id":58329,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لِّكُلِّ","transliteration":"likulli","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58330,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَبَإٍۢ","transliteration":"naba-in","translation_bn":"সংবাদ (প্রকাশের)","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَأ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58331,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقَرٌّۭ ۚ","transliteration":"mus''taqarrun","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট সময় (রয়েছে)","root":"قرر","lemma":"مُسْتَقَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58333,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"wasawfa","translation_bn":"এবং শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58334,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58335,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'likulli naba-in mus''taqarrun wasawfa taʿlamūna', 'প্রত্যেক (ভবিষ্যৎ) বাণীর (সত্যরূপে প্রকাশিত হওয়ার) জন্য একটা সময় নির্ধারিত করা আছে আর তা তোমরা শীঘ্রই জানতে পারবে।', 'For every happening is a finality; and you are going to know.', 'প্রত্যেক (ভবিষ্যৎ) বাণীর (সত্যরূপে প্রকাশিত হওয়ার) জন্য একটা সময় নির্ধারিত করা আছে আর তা তোমরা শীঘ্রই জানতে পারবে।', 'For every happening is a finality; and you are going to know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006067.mp3', now()),
