"translation_bn":"(অন্য) কথা","root":"حدث","lemma":"حَدِيث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58783,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"ghayrihi","translation_bn":"ছাড়া তা","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58785,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَإِمَّا","transliteration":"wa-immā","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58786,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُنسِيَنَّكَ","transliteration":"yunsiyannaka","translation_bn":"ভুলিয়ে দেয় তোমাকে","root":"نسي","lemma":"أَنسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58787,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58788,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তবে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":58789,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَقْعُدْ","transliteration":"taqʿud","translation_bn":"তুমি বসবে","root":"قعد","lemma":"قَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58790,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":58791,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلذِّكْرَىٰ","transliteration":"l-dhik''rā","translation_bn":"স্মরণের","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58792,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مَعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":58793,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58794,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"(যারা)সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58795,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā ra-ayta alladhīna yakhūḍūna fī āyātinā fa-aʿriḍ ʿanhum ḥattā yakhūḍū fī ḥadīthin ghayrihi wa-immā yunsiyannaka l-shayṭānu falā taqʿud baʿda l-dhik''rā maʿa l-qawmi l-ẓālimīna', 'যখন তুমি দেখ আমার আয়াত নিয়ে তারা উপহাসপূর্ণ আলোচনা করছে তখন তাদের থেকে সরে পড় যে পর্যন্ত তারা অন্য বিষয়ের আলোচনায় প্রবৃত্ত না হয়। আর যখন শয়ত্বান তোমাকে (আল্লাহর এই নাসীহাত) ভুলিয়ে দেয় তখন স্মরণ হয়ে গেলেই যালিম সম্প্রদায়ের সঙ্গে আর বসবে না।', 'And when you see those who engage in [offensive] discourse concerning Our verses, then turn away from them until they enter into another conversation. And if Satan should cause you to forget, then do not remain after the reminder with the wrongdoing people.', 'যখন তুমি দেখ আমার আয়াত নিয়ে তারা উপহাসপূর্ণ আলোচনা করছে তখন তাদের থেকে সরে পড় যে পর্যন্ত তারা অন্য বিষয়ের আলোচনায় প্রবৃত্ত না হয়। আর যখন শয়ত্বান তোমাকে (আল্লাহর এই নাসীহাত) ভুলিয়ে দেয় তখন স্মরণ হয়ে গেলেই যালিম সম্প্রদায়ের সঙ্গে আর বসবে না।', 'And when you see those who engage in [offensive] discourse concerning Our verses, then turn away from them until they enter into another conversation. And if Satan should cause you to forget, then do not remain after the reminder with the wrongdoing people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006068.mp3', now()),
  (6, 69, '', '[{"id":59284,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নেই (দায়িত্ব)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59285,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59286,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":59287,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّقُونَ","transliteration":"yattaqūna","translation_bn":"ভয় করে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59288,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59289,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حِسَابِهِم","transliteration":"ḥisābihim","translation_bn":"হিসাবের তাদের","root":"حسب","lemma":"حِسَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59290,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59291,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59292,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59293,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرَىٰ","transliteration":"dhik''rā","translation_bn":"উপদেশের (দায়িত্ব আছে)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59294,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":59295,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّقُونَ","transliteration":"yattaqūna","translation_bn":"বিরত থাকে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59296,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā ʿalā alladhīna yattaqūna min ḥisābihim min shayin walākin dhik''rā laʿallahum yattaqūna', 'তাদের কোন কাজের হিসেব দেয়ার দায়-দায়িত্ব মুত্তাকীদের উপর নেই। কিন্তু উপদেশ দেয়া কর্তব্য যাতে ওরাও তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে।', 'And those who fear Allah are not held accountable for the disbelievers at all, but [only for] a reminder - that perhaps they will fear Him.', 'তাদের কোন কাজের হিসেব দেয়ার দায়-দায়িত্ব মুত্তাকীদের উপর নেই। কিন্তু উপদেশ দেয়া কর্তব্য যাতে ওরাও তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে।', 'And those who fear Allah are not held accountable for the disbelievers at all, but [only for] a reminder - that perhaps they will fear Him.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006069.mp3', now()),
