u","translation_bn":"সবিশেষ অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61320,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī khalaqa l-samāwāti wal-arḍa bil-ḥaqi wayawma yaqūlu kun fayakūnu qawluhu l-ḥaqu walahu l-mul''ku yawma yunfakhu fī l-ṣūri ʿālimu l-ghaybi wal-shahādati wahuwa l-ḥakīmu l-khabīru', 'তিনি আসমান আর যমীনকে সত্যিকারভাবে সৃষ্টি করেছেন (খেলা-তামাশার জন্য নয়)। আর যখনই তিনি বলবেন, (কিয়ামাত) ‘হও’, তখনই তা হয়ে যাবে, তাঁর কথাই প্রকৃত সত্য। যেদিন সিঙ্গায় ফুৎকার দেয়া হবে সেদিন কর্তৃত্ব থাকবে তাঁরই হাতে। অদৃশ্য ও দৃশ্য সম্বন্ধে ওয়াকেফহাল, তিনি হিকমাতওয়ালা, সবকিছুর ব্যাপারে তিনি সবিশেষ জ্ঞাত।', 'And it is He who created the heavens and earth in truth. And the day He says, "Be," and it is, His word is the truth. And His is the dominion [on] the Day the Horn is blown. [He is] Knower of the unseen and the witnessed; and He is the Wise, the Acquainted.', 'তিনি আসমান আর যমীনকে সত্যিকারভাবে সৃষ্টি করেছেন (খেলা-তামাশার জন্য নয়)। আর যখনই তিনি বলবেন, (কিয়ামাত) ‘হও’, তখনই তা হয়ে যাবে, তাঁর কথাই প্রকৃত সত্য। যেদিন সিঙ্গায় ফুৎকার দেয়া হবে সেদিন কর্তৃত্ব থাকবে তাঁরই হাতে। অদৃশ্য ও দৃশ্য সম্বন্ধে ওয়াকেফহাল, তিনি হিকমাতওয়ালা, সবকিছুর ব্যাপারে তিনি সবিশেষ জ্ঞাত।', 'And it is He who created the heavens and earth in truth. And the day He says, "Be," and it is, His word is the truth. And His is the dominion [on] the Day the Horn is blown. [He is] Knower of the unseen and the witnessed; and He is the Wise, the Acquainted.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006073.mp3', now()),
  (6, 74, '', '[{"id":61772,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَإِذْ","transliteration":"wa-idh","translation_bn":"এবং (স্মরণ করো) যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61773,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61774,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمُ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīmu","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীম","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61775,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِأَبِيهِ","transliteration":"li-abīhi","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তার পিতার","root":"ابو","lemma":"أَبٌ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61776,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَازَرَ","transliteration":"āzara","translation_bn":"(অর্থাৎ) আজরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ا^زَر","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61777,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَتَتَّخِذُ","transliteration":"atattakhidhu","translation_bn":"\"কি আপনি গ্রহণ করেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":61778,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَصْنَامًا","transliteration":"aṣnāman","translation_bn":"মূর্তিগুলোকে","root":"صنم","lemma":"أَصْنَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61779,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ءَالِهَةً ۖ","transliteration":"ālihatan","translation_bn":"উপাস্যরূপে","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61781,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":61782,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَرَىٰكَ","transliteration":"arāka","translation_bn":"আপনাকে দেখছি","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61783,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَقَوْمَكَ","transliteration":"waqawmaka","translation_bn":"ও আপনার সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61784,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61785,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","transliteration":"ḍalālin","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্টতার","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61786,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٍۢ","transliteration":"mubīnin","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61787,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh qāla ib''rāhīmu li-abīhi āzara atattakhidhu aṣnāman ālihatan innī arāka waqawmaka fī ḍalālin mubīnin', 'আর (স্মরণ কর) যখন ইবরাহীম তার পিতা আজরকে বলেছিল, আপনি কি মূর্তিগুলোকে ‘ইলাহ’রূপে গ্রহণ করেছেন, আমি তো আপনাকে আর আপনার জাতিকে স্পষ্টভাবে পথভ্রষ্টতায় নিমজ্জিত দেখছি।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when Abraham said to his father Azar, "Do you take idols as deities? Indeed, I see you and your people to be in manifest error."', 'আর (স্মরণ কর) যখন ইবরাহীম তার পিতা আজরকে বলেছিল, আপনি কি মূর্তিগুলোকে ‘ইলাহ’রূপে গ্রহণ করেছেন, আমি তো আপনাকে আর আপনার জাতিকে স্পষ্টভাবে পথভ্রষ্টতায় নিমজ্জিত দেখছি।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], when Abraham said to his father Azar, "Do you take idols as deities? Indeed, I see you and your people to be in manifest error."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006074.mp3', now()),
  (6, 75, '', '[{"id":61856,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61857,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُرِىٓ","transliteration":"nurī","translation_bn":"দেখাই আমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61858,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীমকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61859,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَلَكُوتَ","transliteration":"malakūta","translation_bn":"পরিচালনা ব্যবস্হা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكُوت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61860,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61861,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61862,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَكُونَ","transliteration":"waliyakūna","translation_bn":"এবং যেন সে হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61863,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61864,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُوقِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mūqinīna","translation_bn":"দৃঢ় বিশ্বাসীদের","root":"يقن","lemma":"مُّوقِنِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61865,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika nurī ib''rāhīma malakūta l-samāwāti wal-arḍi waliyakūna mina l-mūqinīna', 'এভাবে আমি ইবরাহীমকে আকাশ ও পৃথিবী রাজ্যের ব্যবস্থাপনা দেখিয়েছি যাতে সে নিশ্চিত বিশ্বাসীদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হতে পারে।', 'And thus did We show Abraham the realm of the heavens and the earth that he would be among the certain [in faith]', 'এভাবে আমি ইবরাহীমকে আকাশ ও পৃথিবী রাজ্যের ব্যবস্থাপনা দেখিয়েছি যাতে সে নিশ্চিত বিশ্বাসীদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হতে পারে।', 'And thus did We show Abraham the realm of the heavens and the earth that he would be among the certain [in faith]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006075.mp3', now()),
  (6, 76, '', '[{"id":62699,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62700,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّ","transliteration":"janna","translation_bn":"আচ্ছন্ন হলো","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62701,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62702,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلُ","transliteration":"al-laylu","translation_bn":"রাত","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62703,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَءَا","transliteration":"raā","translation_bn":"(ইবরাহীম) দেখলো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62704,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَوْكَبًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"kawkaban","translation_bn":"একটি তারা (উজ্জ্বল)","root":"كوكب","lemma":"كَوْكَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62706,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62707,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":62708,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى ۖ","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব\"","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62710,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62711,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَ","transliteration":"afala","translation_bn":"তা অস্তমিত হলো","root":"افل","lemma":"أَفَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62712,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62713,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":62714,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أُحِبُّ","transliteration":"uḥibbu","translation_bn":"\"আমি ভালোবাসি","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62715,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔافِلِينَ","transliteration":"l-āfilīna","translation_bn":"অস্তগামীদেরকে\"","root":"افل","lemma":"ءَافِلِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62716,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā janna ʿalayhi al-laylu raā kawkaban qāla hādhā rabbī falammā afala qāla lā uḥibbu l-āfilīna', 'রাতের আঁধার যখন তাকে আচ্ছন্ন করল তখন সে নক্ষত্র দেখতে পেল, (তখন) বলল, এটাই হচ্ছে আমার প্রতিপালক। কিন্তু যখন তা অস্তমিত হল, সে বলল, যা অস্তমিত হয়ে যায় তার প্রতি আমার কোন অনুরাগ নেই।', 'So when the night covered him [with darkness], he saw a star. He said, "This is my lord." But when it set, he said, "I like not those that disappear."', 'রাতের আঁধার যখন তাকে আচ্ছন্ন করল তখন সে নক্ষত্র দেখতে পেল, (তখন) বলল, এটাই হচ্ছে আমার প্রতিপালক। কিন্তু যখন তা অস্তমিত হল, সে বলল, যা অস্তমিত হয়ে যায় তার প্রতি আমার কোন অনুরাগ নেই।', 'So when the night covered him [with darkness], he saw a star. He said, "This is my lord." But when it set, he said, "I like not those that disappear."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006076.mp3', now()),
