সে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63677,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":63678,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":63679,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بَرِىٓءٌۭ","transliteration":"barīon","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কহীন","root":"برا","lemma":"بَرِى^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63680,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"(তা) হতে না","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63681,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"tush''rikūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শিরক করছো\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63682,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā raā l-shamsa bāzighatan qāla hādhā rabbī hādhā akbaru falammā afalat qāla yāqawmi innī barīon mimmā tush''rikūna', 'অতঃপর যখন সে সূর্যকে অতি উজ্জ্বল হয়ে উদিত হতে দেখল তখন বলল, এটাই হচ্ছে আমার প্রতিপালক, এটাই হচ্ছে সব থেকে বড়। অতঃপর যখন তা অস্তমিত হল তখন সে বলল, হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! তোমরা যেগুলোকে (আল্লাহর) অংশীদার স্থির কর সেগুলোর সাথে আমার কোন সম্পর্ক নেই।', 'And when he saw the sun rising, he said, "This is my lord; this is greater." But when it set, he said, "O my people, indeed I am free from what you associate with Allah.', 'অতঃপর যখন সে সূর্যকে অতি উজ্জ্বল হয়ে উদিত হতে দেখল তখন বলল, এটাই হচ্ছে আমার প্রতিপালক, এটাই হচ্ছে সব থেকে বড়। অতঃপর যখন তা অস্তমিত হল তখন সে বলল, হে আমার জাতির লোকেরা! তোমরা যেগুলোকে (আল্লাহর) অংশীদার স্থির কর সেগুলোর সাথে আমার কোন সম্পর্ক নেই।', 'And when he saw the sun rising, he said, "This is my lord; this is greater." But when it set, he said, "O my people, indeed I am free from what you associate with Allah.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006078.mp3', now()),
  (6, 79, '', '[{"id":64022,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64023,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَجَّهْتُ","transliteration":"wajjahtu","translation_bn":"আমি মুখ ফেরাচ্ছি","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجَّهْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64024,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَجْهِىَ","transliteration":"wajhiya","translation_bn":"আমার মুখ (অর্থাৎ কেন্দ্রীভূত করেছি)","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64025,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِى","transliteration":"lilladhī","translation_bn":"(তাঁর) দিকে যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64026,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَطَرَ","transliteration":"faṭara","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"فطر","lemma":"فَطَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64027,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64028,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"wal-arḍa","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64029,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَنِيفًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"ḥanīfan","translation_bn":"একনিষ্ঠভাবে","root":"حنف","lemma":"حَنِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64031,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64032,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":64033,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64034,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"l-mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরিকদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64035,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innī wajjahtu wajhiya lilladhī faṭara l-samāwāti wal-arḍa ḥanīfan wamā anā mina l-mush''rikīna', 'আমি একনিষ্ঠ হয়ে তাঁর দিকে আমার মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিচ্ছি যিনি আকাশমন্ডলী আর পৃথিবীকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন। আর আমি মুশরিকদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত নই।', 'Indeed, I have turned my face toward He who created the heavens and the earth, inclining toward truth, and I am not of those who associate others with Allah."', 'আমি একনিষ্ঠ হয়ে তাঁর দিকে আমার মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিচ্ছি যিনি আকাশমন্ডলী আর পৃথিবীকে সৃষ্টি করেছেন। আর আমি মুশরিকদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত নই।', 'Indeed, I have turned my face toward He who created the heavens and the earth, inclining toward truth, and I am not of those who associate others with Allah."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006079.mp3', now()),
  (6, 80, '', '[{"id":64348,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَحَآجَّهُۥ","transliteration":"waḥājjahu","translation_bn":"কিন্তু তার সাথে বিতর্ক করলো","root":"حجج","lemma":"حَا^جَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64349,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمُهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"qawmuhu","translation_bn":"জাতি তার","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64351,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64352,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَتُحَـٰٓجُّوٓنِّى","transliteration":"atuḥājjūnnī","translation_bn":"\"কি আমার সাথে বিতর্ক করছো","root":"حجج","lemma":"حَا^جَّ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":64353,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64354,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":64355,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"অথচ","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":64356,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَدَىٰنِ ۚ","transliteration":"hadāni","translation_bn":"তিনি সঠিক পথ দেখিয়েছেন আমাকে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64358,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64359,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"আমি ভয় করি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64360,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"তার (যা কিছুর)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":64361,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"tush''rikūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শিরক করো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64362,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সাথে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64363,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":64364,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে (যদি)","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":64365,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءَ","transliteration":"yashāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64366,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64367,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا ۗ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"(অন্য) কিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64369,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَسِعَ","transliteration":"wasiʿa","translation_bn":"পরিব্যাপ্ত করেছেন","root":"وسع","lemma":"وَسِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64370,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64371,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64372,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুকে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64373,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمًا ۗ","transliteration":"ʿil''man","translation_bn":"জ্ঞানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64375,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"কি তবুও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":64376,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"تَتَذَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"tatadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা শিক্ষা গ্রহণ করবে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64377,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waḥājjahu qawmuhu qāla atuḥājjūnnī fī l-lahi waqad hadāni walā akhāfu mā tush''rikūna bihi illā an yashāa rabbī shayan wasiʿa rabbī kulla shayin ʿil''man afalā tatadhakkarūna', 'তার জাতি তার সাথে বাদানুবাদ করল। সে বলল, তোমরা আল্লাহর ব্যাপারে আমার সাথে বাদানুবাদ করছ অথচ তিনি আমাকে সৎপথ দেখিয়েছেন। তোমরা যাদেরকে তার অংশীদার স্থির কর আমি তাদেরকে ভয় করি না। অবশ্য আল্লাহ যদি কিছু ইচ্ছে করেন (তবে সে কথা আলাদা)। প্রতিটি বস্তু সম্পর্কে আমার প্রতিপালকের জ্ঞান পরিব্যাপ্ত, তোমরা কি তা বুঝবে না?', 'And his people argued with him. He said, "Do you argue with me concerning Allah while He has guided me? And I fear not what you associate with Him [and will not be harmed] unless my Lord should will something. My Lord encompasses all things in knowledge; then will you not remember?', 'তার জাতি তার সাথে বাদানুবাদ করল। সে বলল, তোমরা আল্লাহর ব্যাপারে আমার সাথে বাদানুবাদ করছ অথচ তিনি আমাকে সৎপথ দেখিয়েছেন। তোমরা যাদেরকে তার অংশীদার স্থির কর আমি তাদেরকে ভয় করি না। অবশ্য আল্লাহ যদি কিছু ইচ্ছে করেন (তবে সে কথা আলাদা)। প্রতিটি বস্তু সম্পর্কে আমার প্রতিপালকের জ্ঞান পরিব্যাপ্ত, তোমরা কি তা বুঝবে না?', 'And his people argued with him. He said, "Do you argue with me concerning Allah while He has guided me? And I fear not what you associate with Him [and will not be harmed] unless my Lord should will something. My Lord encompasses all things in knowledge; then will you not remember?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006080.mp3', now()),
  (6, 81, '', '[{"id":64481,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَيْفَ","transliteration":"wakayfa","translation_bn":"এবং কিরূপে","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64482,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"আমি ভয় করবো","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64483,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"তার (যা কিছুকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":64484,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكْتُمْ","transliteration":"ashraktum","translation_bn":"শিরক করেছো তোমরা","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64485,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"অথচ না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64486,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَخَافُونَ","transliteration":"takhāfūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় করছো","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64487,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"annakum","translation_bn":"যে তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64488,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكْتُم","transliteration":"ashraktum","translation_bn":"শিরক করেছো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64489,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"সাথে আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64490,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":64491,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":64492,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُنَزِّلْ","transliteration":"yunazzil","translation_bn":"তিনি অবতীর্ণ করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64493,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64494,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64495,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"سُلْطَـٰنًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"sul''ṭānan","translation_bn":"কোনো প্রমাণ","root":"سلط","lemma":"سُلْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64497,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَأَىُّ","transliteration":"fa-ayyu","translation_bn":"সুতরাং কোনো (পক্ষ)","root":"—","lemma":"أَىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64498,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَرِيقَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-farīqayni","translation_bn":"দুই পক্ষের","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرِيق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64499,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَحَقُّ","transliteration":"aḥaqqu","translation_bn":"অধিকযোগ্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"أَحَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64500,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْأَمْنِ ۖ","transliteration":"bil-amni","translation_bn":"নিরাপত্তা লাভের","root":"امن","lemma":"أَمْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64502,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":64503,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা থাকো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64504,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানো(তবে বলো)\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64505,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakayfa akhāfu mā ashraktum walā takhāfūna annakum ashraktum bil-lahi mā lam yunazzil bihi ʿalaykum sul''ṭānan fa-ayyu l-farīqayni aḥaqqu bil-amni in kuntum taʿlamūna', 'তোমরা যাদেরকে (আল্লাহর) অংশীদার স্থির করেছ আমি তাদেরকে কীভাবে ভয় করতে পারি, যেখানে তোমরা আল্লাহর অংশীদার বানিয়ে নিতে ভয় কর না যে সম্পর্কে আল্লাহ কোন প্রমাণই নাযিল করেননি। নিরাপত্তা লাভের ব্যাপারে (এ) দু’টি দলের মধ্যে কোনটি বেশি হকদার? বল, যদি তোমাদের জানা থাকে।', 'And how should I fear what you associate while you do not fear that you have associated with Allah that for which He has not sent down to you any authority? So which of the two parties has more right to security, if you should know?', 'তোমরা যাদেরকে (আল্লাহর) অংশীদার স্থির করেছ আমি তাদেরকে কীভাবে ভয় করতে পারি, যেখানে তোমরা আল্লাহর অংশীদার বানিয়ে নিতে ভয় কর না যে সম্পর্কে আল্লাহ কোন প্রমাণই নাযিল করেননি। নিরাপত্তা লাভের ব্যাপারে (এ) দু’টি দলের মধ্যে কোনটি বেশি হকদার? বল, যদি তোমাদের জানা থাকে।', 'And how should I fear what you associate while you do not fear that you have associated with Allah that for which He has not sent down to you any authority? So which of the two parties has more right to security, if you should know?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006081.mp3', now()),
  (6, 82, '', '[{"id":65210,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":65211,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65212,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"এবং নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65213,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَلْبِسُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yalbisū","translation_bn":"মিশ্রিত করেছে","root":"لبس","lemma":"لَبَسْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65214,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِيمَـٰنَهُم","transliteration":"īmānahum","translation_bn":"ঈমান তাদের","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65215,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِظُلْمٍ","transliteration":"biẓul''min","translation_bn":"সাথে সীমালঙ্ঘনের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65216,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐ সব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":65217,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65218,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْنُ","transliteration":"l-amnu","translation_bn":"নিরাপত্তা","root":"امن","lemma":"أَمْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65219,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَهُم","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65220,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّهْتَدُونَ","transliteration":"muh''tadūna","translation_bn":"সৎপথ প্রাপ্ত","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُّهْتَدُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65221,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna āmanū walam yalbisū īmānahum biẓul''min ulāika lahumu l-amnu wahum muh''tadūna', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে আর যুলম (অর্থাৎ শিরক) দ্বারা তাদের ঈমানকে কলুষিত করেনি, নিরাপত্তা লাভ তারাই করবে আর তারাই হল সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্ত।', 'They who believe and do not mix their belief with injustice - those will have security, and they are [rightly] guided.', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে আর যুলম (অর্থাৎ শিরক) দ্বারা তাদের ঈমানকে কলুষিত করেনি, নিরাপত্তা লাভ তারাই করবে আর তারাই হল সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্ত।', 'They who believe and do not mix their belief with injustice - those will have security, and they are [rightly] guided.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006082.mp3', now()),
  (6, 83, '', '[{"id":65408,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتِلْكَ","transliteration":"watil''ka","translation_bn":"এবং এই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65409,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"حُجَّتُنَآ","transliteration":"ḥujjatunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের যুক্তি","root":"حجج","lemma":"حُجَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65410,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهَآ","transliteration":"ātaynāhā","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছিলাম তা","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65411,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীমের","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":65412,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"মুকাবিলায়","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65413,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"জাতির তার","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65415,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَرْفَعُ","transliteration":"narfaʿu","translation_bn":"উন্নীত আমরা করি","root":"رفع","lemma":"رَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65416,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"دَرَجَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"darajātin","translation_bn":"মর্যাদাসমূহে","root":"درج","lemma":"دَرَجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65417,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":65418,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَّشَآءُ ۗ","transliteration":"nashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করি আমরা","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65420,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":65421,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65422,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65423,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"মহাজ্ঞানী","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":65424,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watil''ka ḥujjatunā ātaynāhā ib''rāhīma ʿalā qawmihi narfaʿu darajātin man nashāu inna rabbaka ḥakīmun ʿalīmun', 'এ হল আমার যুক্তি-প্রমাণ যা আমি ইবরাহীমকে দিয়েছিলাম তার কাওমের বিপক্ষে, আমি যাকে ইচ্ছে মর্যাদায় উন্নীত করি। তোমাদের প্রতিপালক নিশ্চয়ই হিকমাতওয়ালা,সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And that was Our [conclusive] argument which We gave Abraham against his people. We raise by degrees whom We will. Indeed, your Lord is Wise and Knowing.', 'এ হল আমার যুক্তি-প্রমাণ যা আমি ইবরাহীমকে দিয়েছিলাম তার কাওমের বিপক্ষে, আমি যাকে ইচ্ছে মর্যাদায় উন্নীত করি। তোমাদের প্রতিপালক নিশ্চয়ই হিকমাতওয়ালা,সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And that was Our [conclusive] argument which We gave Abraham against his people. We raise by degrees whom We will. Indeed, your Lord is Wise and Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006083.mp3', now()),
  (6, 84, '', '[{"id":65900,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَوَهَبْنَا","transliteration":"wawahabnā","translation_bn":"এবং  দান করেছি আমরা","root":"وهب","lemma":"وَهَبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65901,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65902,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِسْحَـٰقَ","transliteration":"is''ḥāqa","translation_bn":"ইসহাক","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْحَاق","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":65903,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَيَعْقُوبَ ۚ","transliteration":"wayaʿqūba","translation_bn":"ও ইয়াকুবকে","root":"—","lemma":"يَعْقُوب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65905,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُلًّا","transliteration":"kullan","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেককে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65906,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هَدَيْنَا ۚ","transliteration":"hadaynā","translation_bn":"সৎপথ দেখিয়েছি আমরা","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65908,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَنُوحًا","transliteration":"wanūḥan","translation_bn":"এবং নূহকেও","root":"—","lemma":"نُوح","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65909,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَدَيْنَا","transliteration":"hadaynā","translation_bn":"সৎপথ দেখিয়েছি আমরা","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65910,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65911,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۖ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65913,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمِن","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্যে থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65914,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذُرِّيَّتِهِۦ","transliteration":"dhurriyyatihi","translation_bn":"বংশধরদের তার","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65915,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"دَاوُۥدَ","transliteration":"dāwūda","translation_bn":"(যেমন) দাউদ","root":"—","lemma":"دَاوُد","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":65916,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَسُلَيْمَـٰنَ","transliteration":"wasulaymāna","translation_bn":"ও সুলায়মান","root":"—","lemma":"سُلَيْمَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65917,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَأَيُّوبَ","transliteration":"wa-ayyūba","translation_bn":"ও আয়্যুব","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّوب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65918,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَيُوسُفَ","transliteration":"wayūsufa","translation_bn":"ও ইউসুফ","root":"—","lemma":"يُوسُف","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65919,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَمُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"wamūsā","translation_bn":"ও মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65920,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰرُونَ ۚ","transliteration":"wahārūna","translation_bn":"এবং হারুনকে (সৎপথ দেখিয়েছি)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰرُون","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65922,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65923,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"نَجْزِى","transliteration":"najzī","translation_bn":"পুরস্কার দিই আমরা","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65924,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-muḥ''sinīna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মপরায়ণদেরকে","root":"حسن","lemma":"مُحْسِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65925,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wawahabnā lahu is''ḥāqa wayaʿqūba kullan hadaynā wanūḥan hadaynā min qablu wamin dhurriyyatihi dāwūda wasulaymāna wa-ayyūba wayūsufa wamūsā wahārūna wakadhālika najzī l-muḥ''sinīna', 'আমি তাকে দান করেছিলাম ইসহাক আর ইয়াকূব; তাদের প্রত্যেককে সৎ পথ দেখিয়েছিলাম, আর এর পূর্বে নূহকে সৎ পথ দেখিয়েছিলাম আর তার বংশধর থেকে দাঊদ, সুলাইমান, আইঊব, ইউসুফ, মূসা ও হারূনকে (সৎ পথ দেখিয়েছিলাম), সৎ কর্মশীলদের আমি এভাবেই পুরস্কৃত করে থাকি।', 'And We gave to Abraham, Isaac and Jacob - all [of them] We guided. And Noah, We guided before; and among his descendants, David and Solomon and Job and Joseph and Moses and Aaron. Thus do We reward the doers of good.', 'আমি তাকে দান করেছিলাম ইসহাক আর ইয়াকূব; তাদের প্রত্যেককে সৎ পথ দেখিয়েছিলাম, আর এর পূর্বে নূহকে সৎ পথ দেখিয়েছিলাম আর তার বংশধর থেকে দাঊদ, সুলাইমান, আইঊব, ইউসুফ, মূসা ও হারূনকে (সৎ পথ দেখিয়েছিলাম), সৎ কর্মশীলদের আমি এভাবেই পুরস্কৃত করে থাকি।', 'And We gave to Abraham, Isaac and Jacob - all [of them] We guided. And Noah, We guided before; and among his descendants, David and Solomon and Job and Joseph and Moses and Aaron. Thus do We reward the doers of good.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006084.mp3', now()),
  (6, 85, '', '[{"id":66284,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَزَكَرِيَّا","transliteration":"wazakariyyā","translation_bn":"এবং যাকারিয়া","root":"—","lemma":"زَكَرِيَّا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66285,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَيَحْيَىٰ","transliteration":"wayaḥyā","translation_bn":"ও ইয়াহইয়া","root":"—","lemma":"يَحْيَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66286,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعِيسَىٰ","transliteration":"waʿīsā","translation_bn":"ও ঈসা","root":"—","lemma":"عِيسَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66287,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلْيَاسَ ۖ","transliteration":"wa-il''yāsa","translation_bn":"ও ইলয়াস","root":"—","lemma":"إِلْيَاس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66289,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُلٌّۭ","transliteration":"kullun","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেকেই ছিলো","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66290,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66291,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥīna","translation_bn":"সৎলোকদের","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66292,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wazakariyyā wayaḥyā waʿīsā wa-il''yāsa kullun mina l-ṣāliḥīna', 'আর যাকারিয়া, ইয়াহইয়া, ‘ঈসা ও ইলিয়াস- এরা সবাই সৎকর্মশীলদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'And Zechariah and John and Jesus and Elias - and all were of the righteous.', 'আর যাকারিয়া, ইয়াহইয়া, ‘ঈসা ও ইলিয়াস- এরা সবাই সৎকর্মশীলদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'And Zechariah and John and Jesus and Elias - and all were of the righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006085.mp3', now()),
  (6, 86, '', '[{"id":66687,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِسْمَـٰعِيلَ","transliteration":"wa-is''māʿīla","translation_bn":"এবং ইসমাঈল","root":"—","lemma":"إِسْمَاعِيل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66688,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْيَسَعَ","transliteration":"wal-yasaʿa","translation_bn":"ও আল-ইয়াসায়া","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلْيَسَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66689,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَيُونُسَ","transliteration":"wayūnusa","translation_bn":"ও ইউনুস","root":"—","lemma":"يُونُس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66690,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلُوطًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"walūṭan","translation_bn":"ও লুত","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66692,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَكُلًّۭا","transliteration":"wakullan","translation_bn":"এবং প্রত্যেককে","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66693,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَضَّلْنَا","transliteration":"faḍḍalnā","translation_bn":"শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব দিয়েছি আমরা","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66694,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66695,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বজগতের (লোকদের)","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66696,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-is''māʿīla wal-yasaʿa wayūnusa walūṭan wakullan faḍḍalnā ʿalā l-ʿālamīna', 'আর ইসমাঈল, আল ইয়াসা‘আ, ইউনুস ও লূত- এদের প্রত্যেককে আমি বিশ্বজগতে জাতিসমূহের উপর শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব দান করেছিলাম।', 'And Ishmael and Elisha and Jonah and Lot - and all [of them] We preferred over the worlds.', 'আর ইসমাঈল, আল ইয়াসা‘আ, ইউনুস ও লূত- এদের প্রত্যেককে আমি বিশ্বজগতে জাতিসমূহের উপর শ্রেষ্ঠত্ব দান করেছিলাম।', 'And Ishmael and Elisha and Jonah and Lot - and all [of them] We preferred over the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006086.mp3', now()),
  (6, 87, '', '[{"id":66812,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْ","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66813,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآئِهِمْ","transliteration":"ābāihim","translation_bn":"পিতৃপুরুষদের তাদের","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66814,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَذُرِّيَّـٰتِهِمْ","transliteration":"wadhurriyyātihim","translation_bn":"ও বংশধরদের তাদের","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّٰت","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66815,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَإِخْوَٰنِهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"wa-ikh''wānihim","translation_bn":"এবং ভ্রাতাদেরও তাদের","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66817,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱجْتَبَيْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-ij''tabaynāhum","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা মনোনীত করেছি তাদের","root":"جبي","lemma":"ٱجْتَبَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66818,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهَدَيْنَـٰهُمْ","transliteration":"wahadaynāhum","translation_bn":"ও আমরা পথ দেখিয়েছি তাদের","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66819,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66820,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66821,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরলসোজা","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":66822,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamin ābāihim wadhurriyyātihim wa-ikh''wānihim wa-ij''tabaynāhum wahadaynāhum ilā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin', 'তাদের পিতৃপুরুষ, বংশধর ও ভ্রাতৃবর্গ থেকে তাদেরকে বেছে নিয়েছি আর সত্য-সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেছি।', 'And [some] among their fathers and their descendants and their brothers - and We chose them and We guided them to a straight path.', 'তাদের পিতৃপুরুষ, বংশধর ও ভ্রাতৃবর্গ থেকে তাদেরকে বেছে নিয়েছি আর সত্য-সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেছি।', 'And [some] among their fathers and their descendants and their brothers - and We chose them and We guided them to a straight path.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006087.mp3', now()),
  (6, 88, '', '[{"id":67377,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":67378,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هُدَى","transliteration":"hudā","translation_bn":"সৎপথ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67379,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67380,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"তিনি পরিচালনা করেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67381,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67382,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67383,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67384,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67385,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","translation_bn":"দাসদের তাঁর","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67387,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67388,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكُوا۟","transliteration":"ashrakū","translation_bn":"তারা শিরক করতো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67389,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَحَبِطَ","transliteration":"laḥabiṭa","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নষ্ট হতো","root":"حبط","lemma":"حَبِطَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":67390,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُم","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67391,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67392,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67393,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67394,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika hudā l-lahi yahdī bihi man yashāu min ʿibādihi walaw ashrakū laḥabiṭa ʿanhum mā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'এ হচ্ছে আল্লাহর হিদায়াত, তিনি তাঁর বান্দাহদেরকে থেকে যাকে ইচ্ছে হিদায়াত করেন, তারা যদি শিরক করত তবে তাদের সব কৃতকর্ম বিনষ্ট হয়ে যেত।', 'That is the guidance of Allah by which He guides whomever He wills of His servants. But if they had associated others with Allah, then worthless for them would be whatever they were doing.', 'এ হচ্ছে আল্লাহর হিদায়াত, তিনি তাঁর বান্দাহদেরকে থেকে যাকে ইচ্ছে হিদায়াত করেন, তারা যদি শিরক করত তবে তাদের সব কৃতকর্ম বিনষ্ট হয়ে যেত।', 'That is the guidance of Allah by which He guides whomever He wills of His servants. But if they had associated others with Allah, then worthless for them would be whatever they were doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006088.mp3', now()),
  (6, 89, '', '[{"id":67594,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐ সব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":67595,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67596,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ","transliteration":"ātaynāhumu","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছি যাদেরকে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67597,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67598,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْحُكْمَ","transliteration":"wal-ḥuk''ma","translation_bn":"ও হেকমত, প্রজ্ঞা, যোগ্যতা,কর্তৃত্ব","root":"حكم","lemma":"حُكْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67599,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنُّبُوَّةَ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-nubuwata","translation_bn":"ও নবুয়্যত","root":"نبا","lemma":"نُّبُوَّة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67601,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"তারপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67602,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَكْفُرْ","transliteration":"yakfur","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67603,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"প্রতি তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67604,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ","transliteration":"hāulāi","translation_bn":"এ সব (লোক)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":67605,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":67606,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكَّلْنَا","transliteration":"wakkalnā","translation_bn":"ভার অর্পণ করেছি আমরা","root":"وكل","lemma":"وُكِّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67607,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67608,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"(এমন) সম্প্রদায়ের উপর","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67609,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَّيْسُوا۟","transliteration":"laysū","translation_bn":"তারা নয়","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67610,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"তার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67611,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"bikāfirīna","translation_bn":"অস্বীকারকারী","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67612,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ulāika alladhīna ātaynāhumu l-kitāba wal-ḥuk''ma wal-nubuwata fa-in yakfur bihā hāulāi faqad wakkalnā bihā qawman laysū bihā bikāfirīna', 'এরা তারাই যাদেরকে আমি কিতাব, হিকমাত ও নবুওত দান করেছিলাম, এখন যদি তারা (অর্থাৎ বিধর্মীরা) এগুলোকে মেনে নিতে অস্বীকার করে তাহলে আমি এগুলোর ভার এমন সম্প্রদায়ের কাছে সোপর্দ করেছি যারা (অর্থাৎ মু’মিনরা) এগুলোর অস্বীকারকারী হবে না।', 'Those are the ones to whom We gave the Scripture and authority and prophethood. But if the disbelievers deny it, then We have entrusted it to a people who are not therein disbelievers.', 'এরা তারাই যাদেরকে আমি কিতাব, হিকমাত ও নবুওত দান করেছিলাম, এখন যদি তারা (অর্থাৎ বিধর্মীরা) এগুলোকে মেনে নিতে অস্বীকার করে তাহলে আমি এগুলোর ভার এমন সম্প্রদায়ের কাছে সোপর্দ করেছি যারা (অর্থাৎ মু’মিনরা) এগুলোর অস্বীকারকারী হবে না।', 'Those are the ones to whom We gave the Scripture and authority and prophethood. But if the disbelievers deny it, then We have entrusted it to a people who are not therein disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006089.mp3', now()),
  (6, 90, '', '[{"id":67908,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐ সব (নাবী রাসূল)","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":67909,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67910,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَدَى","transliteration":"hadā","translation_bn":"সৎপথে পরিচালনা করেছিলেন","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67911,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67913,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَبِهُدَىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"fabihudāhumu","translation_bn":"সুতরাং প্রতি সঠিক পথের তাদের","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67914,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱقْتَدِهْ ۗ","transliteration":"iq''tadih","translation_bn":"তুমি অনুসরণ করো","root":"قدو","lemma":"ٱقْتَدِهْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67916,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67917,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَّآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":67918,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَسْـَٔلُكُمْ","transliteration":"asalukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে চাই আমি","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67919,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"এর জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67920,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرًا ۖ","transliteration":"ajran","translation_bn":"কোনো পারিশ্রমিক","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67922,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":67923,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":67924,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":67925,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذِكْرَىٰ","transliteration":"dhik''rā","translation_bn":"উপদেশ","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذِكْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67926,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"lil''ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে বিশ্বজগতের\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67927,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٩٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯০)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ulāika alladhīna hadā l-lahu fabihudāhumu iq''tadih qul lā asalukum ʿalayhi ajran in huwa illā dhik''rā lil''ʿālamīna', 'ওরা হল তারা যাদেরকে আল্লাহ হিদায়াত দান করেছিলেন, তুমি তাদের পথ অনুসরণ কর; বল, এর জন্য (অর্থাৎ বাণী পৌঁছে দেয়ার জন্য) আমি তোমাদের কাছে কোন পারিশ্রমিক চাই না। এটা সারা দুনিয়ার মানুষের জন্য উপদেশ বাণী।', 'Those are the ones whom Allah has guided, so from their guidance take an example. Say, "I ask of you for this message no payment. It is not but a reminder for the worlds."', 'ওরা হল তারা যাদেরকে আল্লাহ হিদায়াত দান করেছিলেন, তুমি তাদের পথ অনুসরণ কর; বল, এর জন্য (অর্থাৎ বাণী পৌঁছে দেয়ার জন্য) আমি তোমাদের কাছে কোন পারিশ্রমিক চাই না। এটা সারা দুনিয়ার মানুষের জন্য উপদেশ বাণী।', 'Those are the ones whom Allah has guided, so from their guidance take an example. Say, "I ask of you for this message no payment. It is not but a reminder for the worlds."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006090.mp3', now()),
