 (Pronoun)"},{"id":68304,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68305,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآؤُكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ābāukum","translation_bn":"বাপ দাদারা তোমাদের\"","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68307,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"قُلِ","transliteration":"quli","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68308,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"\"আল্লাহ্‌ই (অবতীর্ণ করেছেন)\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68310,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68311,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"ذَرْهُمْ","transliteration":"dharhum","translation_bn":"ছেড়ে দাও তাদের","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68312,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68313,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"خَوْضِهِمْ","transliteration":"khawḍihim","translation_bn":"অর্থহীন আলোচনার তাদের","root":"خوض","lemma":"خَوْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68314,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"يَلْعَبُونَ","transliteration":"yalʿabūna","translation_bn":"তারা খেলতে থাকুক","root":"لعب","lemma":"يَلْعَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68315,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"٩١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯১)","root":"—","lemma":"٩١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā qadarū l-laha ḥaqqa qadrihi idh qālū mā anzala l-lahu ʿalā basharin min shayin qul man anzala l-kitāba alladhī jāa bihi mūsā nūran wahudan lilnnāsi tajʿalūnahu qarāṭīsa tub''dūnahā watukh''fūna kathīran waʿullim''tum mā lam taʿlamū antum walā ābāukum quli l-lahu thumma dharhum fī khawḍihim yalʿabūna', 'তারা আল্লাহকে যথাযথ মর্যাদা দিতে পারেনি যখন তারা এ কথা বলেছে যে, আল্লাহ কোন মানুষের কাছে কোন কিছুই অবতীর্ণ করেননি। বল, তাহলে ঐ কিতাব কে অবতীর্ণ করেছিলেন যা নিয়ে এসেছিলেন মূসা, যা ছিল মানুষের জন্য আলোকবর্তিকা ও সঠিক পথের দিকদিশারী, কাগজের পৃষ্ঠায় যা তোমরা প্রকাশ কর আর বেশির ভাগই গোপন কর, যার সাহায্যে তোমাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেয়া হয়েছে যা তোমরাও জানতে না, তোমাদের বাপ-দাদারাও জানত না? বল, (মূসার প্রতি ঐ কিতাব) আল্লাহ্ই (নাযিল করেছিলেন), অতঃপর তাদেরকে তাদের নিরর্থক আলোচনায় মত্ত হয়ে থাকতে দাও।', 'And they did not appraise Allah with true appraisal when they said, "Allah did not reveal to a human being anything." Say, "Who revealed the Scripture that Moses brought as light and guidance to the people? You [Jews] make it into pages, disclosing [some of] it and concealing much. And you were taught that which you knew not - neither you nor your fathers." Say, "Allah [revealed it]." Then leave them in their [empty] discourse, amusing themselves.', 'তারা আল্লাহকে যথাযথ মর্যাদা দিতে পারেনি যখন তারা এ কথা বলেছে যে, আল্লাহ কোন মানুষের কাছে কোন কিছুই অবতীর্ণ করেননি। বল, তাহলে ঐ কিতাব কে অবতীর্ণ করেছিলেন যা নিয়ে এসেছিলেন মূসা, যা ছিল মানুষের জন্য আলোকবর্তিকা ও সঠিক পথের দিকদিশারী, কাগজের পৃষ্ঠায় যা তোমরা প্রকাশ কর আর বেশির ভাগই গোপন কর, যার সাহায্যে তোমাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেয়া হয়েছে যা তোমরাও জানতে না, তোমাদের বাপ-দাদারাও জানত না? বল, (মূসার প্রতি ঐ কিতাব) আল্লাহ্ই (নাযিল করেছিলেন), অতঃপর তাদেরকে তাদের নিরর্থক আলোচনায় মত্ত হয়ে থাকতে দাও।', 'And they did not appraise Allah with true appraisal when they said, "Allah did not reveal to a human being anything." Say, "Who revealed the Scripture that Moses brought as light and guidance to the people? You [Jews] make it into pages, disclosing [some of] it and concealing much. And you were taught that which you knew not - neither you nor your fathers." Say, "Allah [revealed it]." Then leave them in their [empty] discourse, amusing themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006091.mp3', now()),
  (6, 92, '', '[{"id":68622,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"wahādhā","translation_bn":"এবং এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68623,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبٌ","transliteration":"kitābun","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68624,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"anzalnāhu","translation_bn":"আমরা অবতীর্ণ করেছি তা","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68625,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُبَارَكٌۭ","transliteration":"mubārakun","translation_bn":"কল্যাণময়","root":"برك","lemma":"مُبَارَك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":68626,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُّصَدِّقُ","transliteration":"muṣaddiqu","translation_bn":"সত্যায়নকারী (হিসেবে)","root":"صدق","lemma":"مُصَدِّق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":68627,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68628,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":68629,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَدَيْهِ","transliteration":"yadayhi","translation_bn":"হাতের তার","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68630,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلِتُنذِرَ","transliteration":"walitundhira","translation_bn":"এবং যেন তুমি সতর্ক করো","root":"نذر","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68631,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّ","transliteration":"umma","translation_bn":"মা","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68632,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرَىٰ","transliteration":"l-qurā","translation_bn":"জনপদসমূহের (অর্থাৎ মক্কার লোকদেরকে)","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68633,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"ও যারা (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68634,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَوْلَهَا ۚ","transliteration":"ḥawlahā","translation_bn":"চারপাশে তার","root":"حول","lemma":"حَوْل","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":68636,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68637,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68638,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","translation_bn":"উপর আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68639,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"তারা ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68640,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68642,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68643,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68644,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"صَلَاتِهِمْ","transliteration":"ṣalātihim","translation_bn":"তাদের সালাতের","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68645,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يُحَافِظُونَ","transliteration":"yuḥāfiẓūna","translation_bn":"রক্ষা করে","root":"حفظ","lemma":"يُحَافِظُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68646,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٩٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯২)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahādhā kitābun anzalnāhu mubārakun muṣaddiqu alladhī bayna yadayhi walitundhira umma l-qurā waman ḥawlahā wa-alladhīna yu''minūna bil-ākhirati yu''minūna bihi wahum ʿalā ṣalātihim yuḥāfiẓūna', 'আর [এখন যা মুহাম্মাদ (সা.)-এর প্রতি নাযিল করা হয়েছে] এ কিতাব বরকতে ভরপুর, তাদের কাছে যে কিতাব আছে তার সত্যতা প্রতিপাদনকারী, আর তা মক্কা ও তার চতুষ্পার্শবস্থ এলাকার লোকেদেরকে সতর্ক করার জন্য প্রেরিত। যারা আখেরাতে বিশ্বাস করে তারা এতে বিশ্বাস করে, আর তারা তাদের সলাতের হিফাযাত করে।', 'And this is a Book which We have sent down, blessed and confirming what was before it, that you may warn the Mother of Cities and those around it. Those who believe in the Hereafter believe in it, and they are maintaining their prayers.', 'আর [এখন যা মুহাম্মাদ (সা.)-এর প্রতি নাযিল করা হয়েছে] এ কিতাব বরকতে ভরপুর, তাদের কাছে যে কিতাব আছে তার সত্যতা প্রতিপাদনকারী, আর তা মক্কা ও তার চতুষ্পার্শবস্থ এলাকার লোকেদেরকে সতর্ক করার জন্য প্রেরিত। যারা আখেরাতে বিশ্বাস করে তারা এতে বিশ্বাস করে, আর তারা তাদের সলাতের হিফাযাত করে।', 'And this is a Book which We have sent down, blessed and confirming what was before it, that you may warn the Mother of Cities and those around it. Those who believe in the Hereafter believe in it, and they are maintaining their prayers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006092.mp3', now()),
  (6, 93, '', '[{"id":69018,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং কে (হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69019,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَظْلَمُ","transliteration":"aẓlamu","translation_bn":"বড় সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"أَظْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69020,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّنِ","transliteration":"mimmani","translation_bn":"(তার) চেয়ে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69021,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","transliteration":"if''tarā","translation_bn":"রচনা করে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69022,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69023,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69024,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَذِبًا","transliteration":"kadhiban","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69025,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69026,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69027,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أُوحِىَ","transliteration":"ūḥiya","translation_bn":"\"ওহী করা হয়েছে","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69028,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"আমার প্রতি\"","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69029,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"অথচ নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69030,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُوحَ","transliteration":"yūḥa","translation_bn":"ওহী করা হয়","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69031,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"প্রতি তার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69032,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٌۭ","transliteration":"shayon","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69033,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69034,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69035,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"سَأُنزِلُ","transliteration":"sa-unzilu","translation_bn":"\"অবতীর্ণ করবো আমিও","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":69036,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مِثْلَ","transliteration":"mith''la","translation_bn":"অনুরূপ","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69037,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69038,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছেন\"","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69039,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69041,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং (হায়) যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69042,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"تَرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"tarā","translation_bn":"তুমি দেখতে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69043,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"إِذِ","transliteration":"idhi","translation_bn":"যখন (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":69044,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69045,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69046,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"غَمَرَٰتِ","transliteration":"ghamarāti","translation_bn":"যন্ত্রণার","root":"غمر","lemma":"غَمَرَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69047,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتِ","transliteration":"l-mawti","translation_bn":"মৃত্যুর","root":"موت","lemma":"مَوْت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69048,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"wal-malāikatu","translation_bn":"এবং ফেরেশতাগণ","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":69049,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"بَاسِطُوٓا۟","transliteration":"bāsiṭū","translation_bn":"প্রসারিত করে","root":"بسط","lemma":"بَٰسِط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69050,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"aydīhim","translation_bn":"তাদের হাতগুলো (এবং বলবে)","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69051,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"أَخْرِجُوٓا۟","transliteration":"akhrijū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা বের করো","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69052,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَكُمُ ۖ","transliteration":"anfusakumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের প্রাণগুলো","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69054,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-yawma","translation_bn":"আজ","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69055,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"تُجْزَوْنَ","transliteration":"tuj''zawna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের পুরস্কার দেওয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69056,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69057,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْهُونِ","transliteration":"l-hūni","translation_bn":"অপমানকর","root":"هون","lemma":"هُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69058,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69059,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69060,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"تَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"taqūlūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বলে এসেছো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69061,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69062,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69063,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69064,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"ন্যায়","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69065,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"وَكُنتُمْ","transliteration":"wakuntum","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69066,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69067,"position":48,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِهِۦ","transliteration":"āyātihi","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাদি তাঁর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69068,"position":49,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَكْبِرُونَ","transliteration":"tastakbirūna","translation_bn":"অহংকার করতে\"","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69069,"position":50,"text_uthmani":"٩٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waman aẓlamu mimmani if''tarā ʿalā l-lahi kadhiban aw qāla ūḥiya ilayya walam yūḥa ilayhi shayon waman qāla sa-unzilu mith''la mā anzala l-lahu walaw tarā idhi l-ẓālimūna fī ghamarāti l-mawti wal-malāikatu bāsiṭū aydīhim akhrijū anfusakumu l-yawma tuj''zawna ʿadhāba l-hūni bimā kuntum taqūlūna ʿalā l-lahi ghayra l-ḥaqi wakuntum ʿan āyātihi tastakbirūna', 'তার থেকে বড় যালিম আর কে যে আল্লাহ সম্পর্কে মিথ্যে কথা রচনা করে অথবা বলে, আমার প্রতি ওয়াহী নাযিল হয়; যদিও তার কাছে কিছুই অবতীর্ণ হয় না। আর যে বলে : আল্লাহ যা নাযিল করেন আমি শীঘ্রই তার অনুরূপ নাযিল করব। হায়! যদি তুমি ঐ যালিমদেরকে দেখতে পেতে যখন তারা মৃত্যু যন্ত্রণায় ছটফট করতে থাকবে, আর ফেরেশতারা হাত বাড়িয়ে দিয়ে বলবে, তোমাদের জানগুলোকে বের করে দাও, আজ তোমাদেরকে অবমাননাকর আযাব দেয়া হবে যেহেতু তোমরা আল্লাহ সম্পর্কে এমন কথা বলতে যা প্রকৃত সত্য নয় আর তাঁর নিদর্শনগুলোর ব্যাপারে ঔদ্ধত্য প্রদর্শন করতে।', 'And who is more unjust than one who invents a lie about Allah or says, "It has been inspired to me," while nothing has been inspired to him, and one who says, "I will reveal [something] like what Allah revealed." And if you could but see when the wrongdoers are in the overwhelming pangs of death while the angels extend their hands, [saying], "Discharge your souls! Today you will be awarded the punishment of [extreme] humiliation for what you used to say against Allah other than the truth and [that] you were, toward His verses, being arrogant."', 'তার থেকে বড় যালিম আর কে যে আল্লাহ সম্পর্কে মিথ্যে কথা রচনা করে অথবা বলে, আমার প্রতি ওয়াহী নাযিল হয়; যদিও তার কাছে কিছুই অবতীর্ণ হয় না। আর যে বলে : আল্লাহ যা নাযিল করেন আমি শীঘ্রই তার অনুরূপ নাযিল করব। হায়! যদি তুমি ঐ যালিমদেরকে দেখতে পেতে যখন তারা মৃত্যু যন্ত্রণায় ছটফট করতে থাকবে, আর ফেরেশতারা হাত বাড়িয়ে দিয়ে বলবে, তোমাদের জানগুলোকে বের করে দাও, আজ তোমাদেরকে অবমাননাকর আযাব দেয়া হবে যেহেতু তোমরা আল্লাহ সম্পর্কে এমন কথা বলতে যা প্রকৃত সত্য নয় আর তাঁর নিদর্শনগুলোর ব্যাপারে ঔদ্ধত্য প্রদর্শন করতে।', 'And who is more unjust than one who invents a lie about Allah or says, "It has been inspired to me," while nothing has been inspired to him, and one who says, "I will reveal [something] like what Allah revealed." And if you could but see when the wrongdoers are in the overwhelming pangs of death while the angels extend their hands, [saying], "Discharge your souls! Today you will be awarded the punishment of [extreme] humiliation for what you used to say against Allah other than the truth and [that] you were, toward His verses, being arrogant."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006093.mp3', now()),
  (6, 94, '', '[{"id":69359,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং (তিনি বলবেন) নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69360,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جِئْتُمُونَا","transliteration":"ji''tumūnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে তোমরা এসেছো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69361,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فُرَٰدَىٰ","transliteration":"furādā","translation_bn":"একাকী","root":"فرد","lemma":"فُرَٰدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69362,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69363,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقْنَـٰكُمْ","transliteration":"khalaqnākum","translation_bn":"আমরা সৃষ্টি করেছি তোমাদের","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69364,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَوَّلَ","transliteration":"awwala","translation_bn":"প্রথম","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":69365,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَرَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"marratin","translation_bn":"বার","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69366,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَتَرَكْتُم","transliteration":"wataraktum","translation_bn":"ও ছেড়ে এসেছো তোমরা","root":"ترك","lemma":"تَرَكَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69367,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69368,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَوَّلْنَـٰكُمْ","transliteration":"khawwalnākum","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছিলাম তোমাদের","root":"خول","lemma":"خَوَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69369,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَرَآءَ","transliteration":"warāa","translation_bn":"পিছনে","root":"وري","lemma":"وَرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":69370,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ظُهُورِكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ẓuhūrikum","translation_bn":"পিঠের তোমাদের","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَهْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69372,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69373,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نَرَىٰ","transliteration":"narā","translation_bn":"দেখছি আমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69374,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَعَكُمْ","transliteration":"maʿakum","translation_bn":"সাথে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":69375,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"شُفَعَآءَكُمُ","transliteration":"shufaʿāakumu","translation_bn":"সুপারিশকারীদেরকে তোমাদের","root":"شفع","lemma":"شَفِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69376,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69377,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"زَعَمْتُمْ","transliteration":"zaʿamtum","translation_bn":"ধারণা করতে তোমরা","root":"زعم","lemma":"زَعَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69378,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":69379,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فِيكُمْ","transliteration":"fīkum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ব্যাপার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69380,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَـٰٓؤُا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"shurakāu","translation_bn":"অংশীদাররা (হবে কার্যোদ্ধারের জন্যে)","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69382,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لَقَد","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":69383,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"تَّقَطَّعَ","transliteration":"taqaṭṭaʿa","translation_bn":"ছিন্ন হয়েছে (সম্পর্ক)","root":"قطع","lemma":"تَّقَطَّعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69384,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَكُمْ","transliteration":"baynakum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তোমাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":69385,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَضَلَّ","transliteration":"waḍalla","translation_bn":"ও হারিয়ে গিয়েছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69386,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"عَنكُم","transliteration":"ʿankum","translation_bn":"থেকে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69387,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69388,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69389,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"تَزْعُمُونَ","transliteration":"tazʿumūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ধারণা করতে\"","root":"زعم","lemma":"زَعَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69390,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"٩٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad ji''tumūnā furādā kamā khalaqnākum awwala marratin wataraktum mā khawwalnākum warāa ẓuhūrikum wamā narā maʿakum shufaʿāakumu alladhīna zaʿamtum annahum fīkum shurakāu laqad taqaṭṭaʿa baynakum waḍalla ʿankum mā kuntum tazʿumūna', '(ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন আল্লাহ বলবেন) তোমরা আমার নিকট তেমনই নিঃসঙ্গ অবস্থায় হাজির হয়েছ যেমনভাবে আমি তোমাদেরকে প্রথমবার সৃষ্টি করেছিলাম, তোমাদেরকে যা (নি‘মাতরাজি) দান করেছিলাম তা তোমরা তোমাদের পেছনে ফেলে রেখে এসেছ, আর তোমাদের সাথে সেই সুপারিশকারীগণকেও দেখছি না যাদের সম্পর্কে তোমরা ধারণা করতে যে তোমাদের কার্য উদ্ধারের ব্যাপারে তাদের অংশ আছে। তোমাদের মধ্যেকার সম্পর্ক একেবারেই ছিন্ন হয়ে গেছে, আর তোমরা যে সব ধারণা করতে সে সব অকার্যকর প্রমাণিত হয়েছে।', '[It will be said to them], "And you have certainly come to Us alone as We created you the first time, and you have left whatever We bestowed upon you behind you. And We do not see with you your ''intercessors'' which you claimed that they were among you associates [of Allah]. It has [all] been severed between you, and lost from you is what you used to claim."', '(ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন আল্লাহ বলবেন) তোমরা আমার নিকট তেমনই নিঃসঙ্গ অবস্থায় হাজির হয়েছ যেমনভাবে আমি তোমাদেরকে প্রথমবার সৃষ্টি করেছিলাম, তোমাদেরকে যা (নি‘মাতরাজি) দান করেছিলাম তা তোমরা তোমাদের পেছনে ফেলে রেখে এসেছ, আর তোমাদের সাথে সেই সুপারিশকারীগণকেও দেখছি না যাদের সম্পর্কে তোমরা ধারণা করতে যে তোমাদের কার্য উদ্ধারের ব্যাপারে তাদের অংশ আছে। তোমাদের মধ্যেকার সম্পর্ক একেবারেই ছিন্ন হয়ে গেছে, আর তোমরা যে সব ধারণা করতে সে সব অকার্যকর প্রমাণিত হয়েছে।', '[It will be said to them], "And you have certainly come to Us alone as We created you the first time, and you have left whatever We bestowed upon you behind you. And We do not see with you your ''intercessors'' which you claimed that they were among you associates [of Allah]. It has [all] been severed between you, and lost from you is what you used to claim."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006094.mp3', now()),
  (6, 95, '', '[{"id":69698,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":69699,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69700,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَالِقُ","transliteration":"fāliqu","translation_bn":"বিদীর্ণকারী","root":"فلق","lemma":"فَالِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69701,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَبِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥabi","translation_bn":"শস্য-বীজ","root":"حبب","lemma":"حَبّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69702,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّوَىٰ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-nawā","translation_bn":"ও আঁটি","root":"نوي","lemma":"نَّوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69704,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُخْرِجُ","transliteration":"yukh''riju","translation_bn":"বের করেন তিনি","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69705,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَىَّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaya","translation_bn":"জীবন্তকে","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69706,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69707,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَيِّتِ","transliteration":"l-mayiti","translation_bn":"মৃতকে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69708,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمُخْرِجُ","transliteration":"wamukh''riju","translation_bn":"ও নির্গতকারী","root":"خرج","lemma":"مُخْرِج","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69709,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَيِّتِ","transliteration":"l-mayiti","translation_bn":"প্রাণহীনকে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69710,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69711,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَىِّ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥayi","translation_bn":"জীবন্ত","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69713,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","transliteration":"dhālikumu","translation_bn":"এই (হচ্ছেন)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":69714,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69716,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنَّىٰ","transliteration":"fa-annā","translation_bn":"অতএব কোথায়","root":"اني\r","lemma":"أَنَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69717,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تُؤْفَكُونَ","transliteration":"tu''fakūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হচ্ছে","root":"افك","lemma":"أُفِكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69718,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٩٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha fāliqu l-ḥabi wal-nawā yukh''riju l-ḥaya mina l-mayiti wamukh''riju l-mayiti mina l-ḥayi dhālikumu l-lahu fa-annā tu''fakūna', 'আল্লাহই হচ্ছেন শস্য দানা ও বীজ বিদীর্ণকারী, তিনি মৃত থেকে জীবন্তকে বের করেন এবং জীবন্ত থেকে মৃতকে। এই হচ্ছেন আল্লাহ; সৎপথ থেকে তোমরা কোথায় চলে যাচ্ছ?', 'Indeed, Allah is the cleaver of grain and date seeds. He brings the living out of the dead and brings the dead out of the living. That is Allah; so how are you deluded?', 'আল্লাহই হচ্ছেন শস্য দানা ও বীজ বিদীর্ণকারী, তিনি মৃত থেকে জীবন্তকে বের করেন এবং জীবন্ত থেকে মৃতকে। এই হচ্ছেন আল্লাহ; সৎপথ থেকে তোমরা কোথায় চলে যাচ্ছ?', 'Indeed, Allah is the cleaver of grain and date seeds. He brings the living out of the dead and brings the dead out of the living. That is Allah; so how are you deluded?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006095.mp3', now()),
  (6, 96, '', '[{"id":70243,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَالِقُ","transliteration":"fāliqu","translation_bn":"তিনিই বিদীর্ণকারী (অন্ধকারের আবরণ)","root":"فلق","lemma":"فَالِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70244,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِصْبَاحِ","transliteration":"l-iṣ''bāḥi","translation_bn":"প্রভাতের (জন্যে)","root":"صبح","lemma":"إِصْبَاح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70245,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"ও সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70246,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70247,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَكَنًۭا","transliteration":"sakanan","translation_bn":"বিশ্রামের (জন্যে)","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70248,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلشَّمْسَ","transliteration":"wal-shamsa","translation_bn":"ও (নির্ধারিত করেছেন) সূর্য","root":"شمس","lemma":"شَمْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70249,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْقَمَرَ","transliteration":"wal-qamara","translation_bn":"ও চাঁদের","root":"قمر","lemma":"قَمَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70250,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حُسْبَانًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ḥus''bānan","translation_bn":"(উদয় অস্তের)গণনার জন্যে","root":"حسب","lemma":"حُسْبَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70252,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":70253,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَقْدِيرُ","transliteration":"taqdīru","translation_bn":"নির্ধারিত","root":"قدر","lemma":"تَقْدِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70254,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَزِيزِ","transliteration":"l-ʿazīzi","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70255,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَلِيمِ","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmi","translation_bn":"মহাজ্ঞানীর (পক্ষ থেকে)","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70256,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٩٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fāliqu l-iṣ''bāḥi wajaʿala al-layla sakanan wal-shamsa wal-qamara ḥus''bānan dhālika taqdīru l-ʿazīzi l-ʿalīmi', 'তিনি ঊষার উন্মেষ ঘটান, তিনি রাত সৃষ্টি করেছেন শান্তি ও আরামের জন্য, সূর্য ও চন্দ্র বানিয়েছেন গণনার জন্য। এসব মহাপরাক্রমশালী সর্বজ্ঞাতা কর্তৃক নির্ধারিত।', '[He is] the cleaver of daybreak and has made the night for rest and the sun and moon for calculation. That is the determination of the Exalted in Might, the Knowing.', 'তিনি ঊষার উন্মেষ ঘটান, তিনি রাত সৃষ্টি করেছেন শান্তি ও আরামের জন্য, সূর্য ও চন্দ্র বানিয়েছেন গণনার জন্য। এসব মহাপরাক্রমশালী সর্বজ্ঞাতা কর্তৃক নির্ধারিত।', '[He is] the cleaver of daybreak and has made the night for rest and the sun and moon for calculation. That is the determination of the Exalted in Might, the Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006096.mp3', now()),
  (6, 97, '', '[{"id":70553,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70554,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70555,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70556,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70557,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنُّجُومَ","transliteration":"l-nujūma","translation_bn":"নক্ষত্রগুলো","root":"نجم","lemma":"نَّجْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70558,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِتَهْتَدُوا۟","transliteration":"litahtadū","translation_bn":"যেন তোমরা পথ পাও","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70559,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"সাহায্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70560,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70561,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ظُلُمَـٰتِ","transliteration":"ẓulumāti","translation_bn":"অন্ধকারে সমূহের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلُمَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70562,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَرِّ","transliteration":"l-bari","translation_bn":"স্থলে","root":"برر","lemma":"بَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70563,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْبَحْرِ ۗ","transliteration":"wal-baḥri","translation_bn":"ও সাগরে","root":"بحر","lemma":"بَحْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70565,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":70566,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَصَّلْنَا","transliteration":"faṣṣalnā","translation_bn":"বিশদ বর্ণনা করেছি আমরা","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70567,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনগুলোকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70568,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70569,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) জ্ঞান রাখে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70570,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٩٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī jaʿala lakumu l-nujūma litahtadū bihā fī ẓulumāti l-bari wal-baḥri qad faṣṣalnā l-āyāti liqawmin yaʿlamūna', 'তিনি তোমাদের জন্য নক্ষত্ররাজি সৃষ্টি করেছেন যাতে তোমরা সেগুলোর সাহায্যে জলে স্থলে অন্ধকারে পথের দিশা লাভ করতে পার। আমি আমার নিদর্শনগুলোকে জ্ঞানীদের জন্য বিশদভাবে বর্ণনা করে দিয়েছি।', 'And it is He who placed for you the stars that you may be guided by them through the darknesses of the land and sea. We have detailed the signs for a people who know.', 'তিনি তোমাদের জন্য নক্ষত্ররাজি সৃষ্টি করেছেন যাতে তোমরা সেগুলোর সাহায্যে জলে স্থলে অন্ধকারে পথের দিশা লাভ করতে পার। আমি আমার নিদর্শনগুলোকে জ্ঞানীদের জন্য বিশদভাবে বর্ণনা করে দিয়েছি।', 'And it is He who placed for you the stars that you may be guided by them through the darknesses of the land and sea. We have detailed the signs for a people who know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006097.mp3', now()),
  (6, 98, '', '[{"id":70609,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70610,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70611,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنشَأَكُم","transliteration":"ansha-akum","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন তোমাদের","root":"نشا","lemma":"أَنشَأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70612,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70613,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَّفْسٍۢ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তি","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70614,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدَةٍۢ","transliteration":"wāḥidatin","translation_bn":"এক","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":70615,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَمُسْتَقَرٌّۭ","transliteration":"famus''taqarrun","translation_bn":"অতঃপর বাসস্হান","root":"قرر","lemma":"مُسْتَقَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70616,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمُسْتَوْدَعٌۭ ۗ","transliteration":"wamus''tawdaʿun","translation_bn":"ও গচ্ছিত রাখার স্থান (নির্ধারিত করেছেন)","root":"ودع","lemma":"مُسْتَوْدَع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70618,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":70619,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَصَّلْنَا","transliteration":"faṣṣalnā","translation_bn":"বিশদ বর্ণনা করেছি আমরা","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70620,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনগুলোকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70621,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70622,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَفْقَهُونَ","transliteration":"yafqahūna","translation_bn":"(যারা)অনুধাবন করে","root":"فقه","lemma":"يَفْقَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70623,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٩٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī ansha-akum min nafsin wāḥidatin famus''taqarrun wamus''tawdaʿun qad faṣṣalnā l-āyāti liqawmin yafqahūna', 'তিনি তোমাদেরকে একটি প্রাণ হতে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তারপর প্রত্যেকের জন্য একটা অবস্থান স্থল আছে আর একটি আছে তাকে গচ্ছিত রাখার জায়গা। জ্ঞান-বুদ্ধি সম্পন্ন লোকেদের জন্য আমি আমার আয়াতগুলোকে বিশদভাবে বর্ণনা করে দিয়েছি।', 'And it is He who produced you from one soul and [gave you] a place of dwelling and of storage. We have detailed the signs for a people who understand.', 'তিনি তোমাদেরকে একটি প্রাণ হতে সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তারপর প্রত্যেকের জন্য একটা অবস্থান স্থল আছে আর একটি আছে তাকে গচ্ছিত রাখার জায়গা। জ্ঞান-বুদ্ধি সম্পন্ন লোকেদের জন্য আমি আমার আয়াতগুলোকে বিশদভাবে বর্ণনা করে দিয়েছি।', 'And it is He who produced you from one soul and [gave you] a place of dwelling and of storage. We have detailed the signs for a people who understand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006098.mp3', now()),
