thamarihi","translation_bn":"তার ফলের","root":"ثمر","lemma":"ثَمَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71094,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"إِذَآ","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71095,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"أَثْمَرَ","transliteration":"athmara","translation_bn":"ফলবান হয়","root":"ثمر","lemma":"أَثْمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71096,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"وَيَنْعِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"wayanʿihi","translation_bn":"ও পাকে তা","root":"ينع","lemma":"يَنْع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71098,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71099,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71100,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُمْ","transliteration":"dhālikum","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":71101,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"laāyātin","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":71102,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71103,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71104,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"٩٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī anzala mina l-samāi māan fa-akhrajnā bihi nabāta kulli shayin fa-akhrajnā min''hu khaḍiran nukh''riju min''hu ḥabban mutarākiban wamina l-nakhli min ṭalʿihā qin''wānun dāniyatun wajannātin min aʿnābin wal-zaytūna wal-rumāna mush''tabihan waghayra mutashābihin unẓurū ilā thamarihi idhā athmara wayanʿihi inna fī dhālikum laāyātin liqawmin yu''minūna', 'তিনিই আকাশ থেকে বৃষ্টি বর্ষণ করেন অতঃপর তা দ্বারা আমি সকল প্রকার উদ্ভিদ উদগত করি, অতঃপর তা থেকে সবুজ পাতা উদ্গত করি, অতঃপর তা থেকে ঘন সন্নিবিষ্ট শস্যদানা উৎপন্ন করি, খেজুর গাছের মোচা থেকে ঝুলন্ত কাঁদি নির্গত করি, আঙ্গুরের বাগান সৃষ্টি করি, আর সৃষ্টি করি জায়তুন ও ডালিম, সেগুলো একই রকম এবং বিভিন্ন রকমও। লক্ষ্য কর তার ফলের প্রতি যখন গাছে ফল আসে আর ফল পাকে। এসবের ভিতরে মু’মিন সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য অবশ্যই নিদর্শন আছে।', 'And it is He who sends down rain from the sky, and We produce thereby the growth of all things. We produce from it greenery from which We produce grains arranged in layers. And from the palm trees - of its emerging fruit are clusters hanging low. And [We produce] gardens of grapevines and olives and pomegranates, similar yet varied. Look at [each of] its fruit when it yields and [at] its ripening. Indeed in that are signs for a people who believe.', 'তিনিই আকাশ থেকে বৃষ্টি বর্ষণ করেন অতঃপর তা দ্বারা আমি সকল প্রকার উদ্ভিদ উদগত করি, অতঃপর তা থেকে সবুজ পাতা উদ্গত করি, অতঃপর তা থেকে ঘন সন্নিবিষ্ট শস্যদানা উৎপন্ন করি, খেজুর গাছের মোচা থেকে ঝুলন্ত কাঁদি নির্গত করি, আঙ্গুরের বাগান সৃষ্টি করি, আর সৃষ্টি করি জায়তুন ও ডালিম, সেগুলো একই রকম এবং বিভিন্ন রকমও। লক্ষ্য কর তার ফলের প্রতি যখন গাছে ফল আসে আর ফল পাকে। এসবের ভিতরে মু’মিন সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য অবশ্যই নিদর্শন আছে।', 'And it is He who sends down rain from the sky, and We produce thereby the growth of all things. We produce from it greenery from which We produce grains arranged in layers. And from the palm trees - of its emerging fruit are clusters hanging low. And [We produce] gardens of grapevines and olives and pomegranates, similar yet varied. Look at [each of] its fruit when it yields and [at] its ripening. Indeed in that are signs for a people who believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006099.mp3', now()),
  (6, 100, '', '[{"id":71412,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلُوا۟","transliteration":"wajaʿalū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বানিয়েছে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71413,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71414,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءَ","transliteration":"shurakāa","translation_bn":"অংশীদার","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71415,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِنَّ","transliteration":"l-jina","translation_bn":"জিনদেরকে","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71416,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَخَلَقَهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"wakhalaqahum","translation_bn":"অথচ সৃষ্টি করেছেন তিনি তাদের","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":71418,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَخَرَقُوا۟","transliteration":"wakharaqū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা রচনা করেছে","root":"خرق","lemma":"خَرَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71419,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71420,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَنِينَ","transliteration":"banīna","translation_bn":"পুত্র","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71421,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَبَنَـٰتٍۭ","transliteration":"wabanātin","translation_bn":"ও কন্যা","root":"بني","lemma":"بَنَات","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71422,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71423,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"কোনো জ্ঞান (মূর্খতাবশত)","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71425,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ","transliteration":"sub''ḥānahu","translation_bn":"মহিমান্বিত তিনি","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71426,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَتَعَـٰلَىٰ","transliteration":"wataʿālā","translation_bn":"এবং সমুন্নত","root":"علو","lemma":"تَعَٰلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71427,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"(তা) হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71428,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَصِفُونَ","transliteration":"yaṣifūna","translation_bn":"তারা রচনা করে","root":"وصف","lemma":"يَصِفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71429,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٠٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajaʿalū lillahi shurakāa l-jina wakhalaqahum wakharaqū lahu banīna wabanātin bighayri ʿil''min sub''ḥānahu wataʿālā ʿammā yaṣifūna', 'তারা জ্বীনকে আল্লাহর অংশীদার স্থির করে অথচ তাদেরকে তিনিই সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তারা না জেনে না বুঝে আল্লাহর জন্য পুত্র-কন্যা স্থির করে, তাদের এসব কথা হতে তিনি পবিত্র ও মহান।', 'But they have attributed to Allah partners - the jinn, while He has created them - and have fabricated for Him sons and daughters. Exalted is He and high above what they describe', 'তারা জ্বীনকে আল্লাহর অংশীদার স্থির করে অথচ তাদেরকে তিনিই সৃষ্টি করেছেন, তারা না জেনে না বুঝে আল্লাহর জন্য পুত্র-কন্যা স্থির করে, তাদের এসব কথা হতে তিনি পবিত্র ও মহান।', 'But they have attributed to Allah partners - the jinn, while He has created them - and have fabricated for Him sons and daughters. Exalted is He and high above what they describe', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006100.mp3', now()),
  (6, 101, '', '[{"id":71555,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"بَدِيعُ","transliteration":"badīʿu","translation_bn":"তিনি স্রষ্টা","root":"بدع","lemma":"بَدِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71556,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71557,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71559,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّىٰ","transliteration":"annā","translation_bn":"কিরূপে","root":"اني\r","lemma":"أَنَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":71560,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونُ","transliteration":"yakūnu","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71561,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71562,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدٌۭ","transliteration":"waladun","translation_bn":"কোনো সন্তান","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71563,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمْ","transliteration":"walam","translation_bn":"অথচ নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71564,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَكُن","transliteration":"takun","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71565,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71566,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰحِبَةٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ṣāḥibatun","translation_bn":"কোনো সঙ্গিনী","root":"صحب","lemma":"صَٰحِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71568,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَخَلَقَ","transliteration":"wakhalaqa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71569,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71570,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71572,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71573,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71574,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71575,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সবিশেষ অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71576,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٠١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'badīʿu l-samāwāti wal-arḍi annā yakūnu lahu waladun walam takun lahu ṣāḥibatun wakhalaqa kulla shayin wahuwa bikulli shayin ʿalīmun', 'তিনি আকাশমন্ডলী ও যমীনের উদ্ভাবক, কীভাবে তাঁর সন্তান হতে পারে যেহেতু তাঁর কোন সঙ্গীণীই নেই, সব কিছু তো তিনিই সৃষ্টি করেছেন, আর প্রতিটি জিনিস সম্পর্কে তিনি পূর্ণ জ্ঞান রাখেন।', '[He is] Originator of the heavens and the earth. How could He have a son when He does not have a companion and He created all things? And He is, of all things, Knowing.', 'তিনি আকাশমন্ডলী ও যমীনের উদ্ভাবক, কীভাবে তাঁর সন্তান হতে পারে যেহেতু তাঁর কোন সঙ্গীণীই নেই, সব কিছু তো তিনিই সৃষ্টি করেছেন, আর প্রতিটি জিনিস সম্পর্কে তিনি পূর্ণ জ্ঞান রাখেন।', '[He is] Originator of the heavens and the earth. How could He have a son when He does not have a companion and He created all things? And He is, of all things, Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006101.mp3', now()),
  (6, 102, '', '[{"id":72006,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُمُ","transliteration":"dhālikumu","translation_bn":"এই (হচ্ছেন)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":72007,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72008,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72010,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72011,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোনো ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72012,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":72013,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۖ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۖ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":72015,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِقُ","transliteration":"khāliqu","translation_bn":"তিনি স্রষ্টা","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَٰلِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72016,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72017,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুরই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72018,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَٱعْبُدُوهُ ۚ","transliteration":"fa-uʿ''budūhu","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা ইবাদাত করো তাঁরই","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72020,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72021,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72022,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72023,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72024,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَكِيلٌۭ","transliteration":"wakīlun","translation_bn":"তত্ত্বাবধায়ক","root":"وكل","lemma":"وَكِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72025,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٠٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālikumu l-lahu rabbukum lā ilāha illā huwa khāliqu kulli shayin fa-uʿ''budūhu wahuwa ʿalā kulli shayin wakīlun', 'এই হলেন তোমাদের প্রতিপালক, তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, সব কিছুর স্রষ্টা; কাজেই তোমরা তাঁরই ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি সমস্ত বিষয়ের র্কমবিধায়ক।', 'That is Allah, your Lord; there is no deity except Him, the Creator of all things, so worship Him. And He is Disposer of all things.', 'এই হলেন তোমাদের প্রতিপালক, তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, সব কিছুর স্রষ্টা; কাজেই তোমরা তাঁরই ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি সমস্ত বিষয়ের র্কমবিধায়ক।', 'That is Allah, your Lord; there is no deity except Him, the Creator of all things, so worship Him. And He is Disposer of all things.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006102.mp3', now()),
  (6, 103, '', '[{"id":72166,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72167,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُدْرِكُهُ","transliteration":"tud''rikuhu","translation_bn":"পেতে পারে তাঁকে","root":"درك","lemma":"أَدْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72168,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-abṣāru","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টিশক্তিসমূহ","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72169,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"বরং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72170,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُدْرِكُ","transliteration":"yud''riku","translation_bn":"অধিকার করে আছেন","root":"درك","lemma":"أَدْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72171,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-abṣāra","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টিশক্তিসমূহকে","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72173,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72174,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّطِيفُ","transliteration":"l-laṭīfu","translation_bn":"সূক্ষ্মদর্শী","root":"لطف","lemma":"لَطِيف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72175,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَبِيرُ","transliteration":"l-khabīru","translation_bn":"সম্যক অবহিত","root":"خبر","lemma":"خَبِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72176,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٠٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā tud''rikuhu l-abṣāru wahuwa yud''riku l-abṣāra wahuwa l-laṭīfu l-khabīru', 'দৃষ্টি তার নাগাল পায় না বরং তিনিই সকল দৃষ্টি নাগালে রাখেন, তিনি অতিশয় সূক্ষ্ণদর্শী, সব বিষয়ে ওয়াকিফহাল।', 'Vision perceives Him not, but He perceives [all] vision; and He is the Subtle, the Acquainted.', 'দৃষ্টি তার নাগাল পায় না বরং তিনিই সকল দৃষ্টি নাগালে রাখেন, তিনি অতিশয় সূক্ষ্ণদর্শী, সব বিষয়ে ওয়াকিফহাল।', 'Vision perceives Him not, but He perceives [all] vision; and He is the Subtle, the Acquainted.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006103.mp3', now()),
  (6, 104, '', '[{"id":72517,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":72518,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكُم","transliteration":"jāakum","translation_bn":"কাছে এসেছে তোমাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72519,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَصَآئِرُ","transliteration":"baṣāiru","translation_bn":"প্রত্যক্ষ প্রমাণ (অন্তর্দৃষ্টির আলো)","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِيرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72520,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72521,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72523,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنْ","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"অতএব যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72524,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَبْصَرَ","transliteration":"abṣara","translation_bn":"দেখবে","root":"بصر","lemma":"أَبْصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72525,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَلِنَفْسِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"falinafsihi","translation_bn":"(তা) তবে জন্যে নিজের তার","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":72527,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَنْ","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72528,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَمِىَ","transliteration":"ʿamiya","translation_bn":"অন্ধ হবে","root":"عمي","lemma":"عَمِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72529,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلَيْهَا ۚ","transliteration":"faʿalayhā","translation_bn":"(তার ক্ষতি) তবে তার বিরুদ্ধে যাবে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":72531,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72532,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":72533,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُم","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"উপর তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72534,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"بِحَفِيظٍۢ","transliteration":"biḥafīẓin","translation_bn":"কোন রক্ষক","root":"حفظ","lemma":"حَفِيظ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72535,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٠٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qad jāakum baṣāiru min rabbikum faman abṣara falinafsihi waman ʿamiya faʿalayhā wamā anā ʿalaykum biḥafīẓin', 'তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে (অন্তরের) আলো এসে পৌঁছেছে, যে লোক (এই আলো দিয়ে) দেখবে তাতে তার নিজেরই কল্যাণ হবে, আর যে অন্ধ থাকবে, তার অকল্যাণ তার ঘাড়েই পড়বে। (বাণী পৌঁছে দেয়ার দায়িত্ব দিয়ে আমাকে পাঠানো হয়েছে) আমি তোমাদেরকে পাহারা দেয়ার জন্য দায়িত্বপাপ্ত হইনি।', 'There has come to you enlightenment from your Lord. So whoever will see does so for [the benefit of] his soul, and whoever is blind [does harm] against it. And [say], "I am not a guardian over you."', 'তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে (অন্তরের) আলো এসে পৌঁছেছে, যে লোক (এই আলো দিয়ে) দেখবে তাতে তার নিজেরই কল্যাণ হবে, আর যে অন্ধ থাকবে, তার অকল্যাণ তার ঘাড়েই পড়বে। (বাণী পৌঁছে দেয়ার দায়িত্ব দিয়ে আমাকে পাঠানো হয়েছে) আমি তোমাদেরকে পাহারা দেয়ার জন্য দায়িত্বপাপ্ত হইনি।', 'There has come to you enlightenment from your Lord. So whoever will see does so for [the benefit of] his soul, and whoever is blind [does harm] against it. And [say], "I am not a guardian over you."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006104.mp3', now()),
  (6, 105, '', '[{"id":72791,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72792,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُصَرِّفُ","transliteration":"nuṣarrifu","translation_bn":"বারবার বর্ণনা করি আমরা","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَّفْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72793,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72794,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"waliyaqūlū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা যেন (না) বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72795,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دَرَسْتَ","transliteration":"darasta","translation_bn":"\"তুমি পড়েছো (কারো কাছে)\"","root":"درس","lemma":"دَرَسُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72796,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلِنُبَيِّنَهُۥ","transliteration":"walinubayyinahu","translation_bn":"এবং যেন আমরা স্পষ্ট বর্ণনা করি তা","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيَّنُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72797,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"(সেসব) জন্যে সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72798,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) জ্ঞান রাখে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72799,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٠٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika nuṣarrifu l-āyāti waliyaqūlū darasta walinubayyinahu liqawmin yaʿlamūna', 'এভাবেই আমি নিদর্শনগুলোকে বার বার নানাভাবে বর্ননা করি। যার ফলে তারা (অর্থাৎ অবিশ্বাসীরা) বলে, তুমি (এসব কথা অন্যের কাছ থেকে) শিখে নিয়েছ, বস্তুত আমি জ্ঞানী লোকদের জন্য তা সুস্পষ্টভাবে বিবৃত করি।', 'And thus do We diversify the verses so the disbelievers will say, "You have studied," and so We may make the Qur''an clear for a people who know.', 'এভাবেই আমি নিদর্শনগুলোকে বার বার নানাভাবে বর্ননা করি। যার ফলে তারা (অর্থাৎ অবিশ্বাসীরা) বলে, তুমি (এসব কথা অন্যের কাছ থেকে) শিখে নিয়েছ, বস্তুত আমি জ্ঞানী লোকদের জন্য তা সুস্পষ্টভাবে বিবৃত করি।', 'And thus do We diversify the verses so the disbelievers will say, "You have studied," and so We may make the Qur''an clear for a people who know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006105.mp3', now()),
  (6, 106, '', '[{"id":72988,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبِعْ","transliteration":"ittabiʿ","translation_bn":"তুমি অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72989,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":72990,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُوحِىَ","transliteration":"ūḥiya","translation_bn":"ওহী করা হয়েছে","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72991,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72992,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72993,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكَ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72995,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":72996,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোনো ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72997,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":72998,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۖ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۖ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":73000,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَعْرِضْ","transliteration":"wa-aʿriḍ","translation_bn":"এবং উপেক্ষা করো (মুখ ফিরাও)","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73001,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73002,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"l-mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরিকদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73003,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٠٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ittabiʿ mā ūḥiya ilayka min rabbika lā ilāha illā huwa wa-aʿriḍ ʿani l-mush''rikīna', 'তুমি তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে যে ওয়াহী পাও তার অনুসরণ কর, তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, তুমি মুশরিকদের দিক থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও।', 'Follow, [O Muhammad], what has been revealed to you from your Lord - there is no deity except Him - and turn away from those who associate others with Allah.', 'তুমি তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে যে ওয়াহী পাও তার অনুসরণ কর, তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, তুমি মুশরিকদের দিক থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নাও।', 'Follow, [O Muhammad], what has been revealed to you from your Lord - there is no deity except Him - and turn away from those who associate others with Allah.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006106.mp3', now()),
  (6, 107, '', '[{"id":73261,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73262,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73263,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":73264,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":73265,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكُوا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"ashrakū","translation_bn":"তাঁর শিরক করতো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73267,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73268,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَـٰكَ","transliteration":"jaʿalnāka","translation_bn":"আমরা নিযুক্ত করেছি তোমাকে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73269,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73270,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"حَفِيظًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"ḥafīẓan","translation_bn":"কোনো সংরক্ষক","root":"حفظ","lemma":"حَفِيظ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73272,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"আর নও","root":"—","lemma":"مَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73273,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَنتَ","transliteration":"anta","translation_bn":"তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":73274,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73275,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِوَكِيلٍۢ","transliteration":"biwakīlin","translation_bn":"কোনো অভিভাবক","root":"وكل","lemma":"وَكِيل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73276,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٠٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw shāa l-lahu mā ashrakū wamā jaʿalnāka ʿalayhim ḥafīẓan wamā anta ʿalayhim biwakīlin', 'আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে তারা আল্লাহর অংশী স্থির করত না, (আসল শিক্ষা তাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেয়া হয়েছে, এখন তারা মানুক বা না মানুক) আমি তোমাকে তাদের উপর পাহারাদার পাঠায়নি (জোর করে আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত করিয়ে নেয়ার জন্য), আর তুমি তাদের পক্ষ থেকে কর্মসম্পাদনকারীও নও।', 'But if Allah had willed, they would not have associated. And We have not appointed you over them as a guardian, nor are you a manager over them.', 'আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে তারা আল্লাহর অংশী স্থির করত না, (আসল শিক্ষা তাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেয়া হয়েছে, এখন তারা মানুক বা না মানুক) আমি তোমাকে তাদের উপর পাহারাদার পাঠায়নি (জোর করে আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত করিয়ে নেয়ার জন্য), আর তুমি তাদের পক্ষ থেকে কর্মসম্পাদনকারীও নও।', 'But if Allah had willed, they would not have associated. And We have not appointed you over them as a guardian, nor are you a manager over them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006107.mp3', now()),
  (6, 108, '', '[{"id":73499,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73500,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَسُبُّوا۟","transliteration":"tasubbū","translation_bn":"তোমরা গালি দিও","root":"سبب","lemma":"يَسُبُّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73501,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73502,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73503,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73504,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"বাদ","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73505,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌কে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":73506,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَيَسُبُّوا۟","transliteration":"fayasubbū","translation_bn":"তবে তারা গালি দিবে","root":"سبب","lemma":"يَسُبُّ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":73507,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌কে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":73508,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَدْوًۢا","transliteration":"ʿadwan","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করে","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدْو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73509,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73510,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍۢ ۗ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"কোনো জ্ঞান (মূর্খতাবশতঃ)","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73512,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73513,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"زَيَّنَّا","transliteration":"zayyannā","translation_bn":"সুশোভিত করেছি আমরা","root":"زين","lemma":"زَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73514,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِكُلِّ","transliteration":"likulli","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73515,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73516,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿamalahum","translation_bn":"কাজকে তাদের","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73517,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73518,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73519,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِم","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"রবের তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73520,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مَّرْجِعُهُمْ","transliteration":"marjiʿuhum","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন তাদের (হবে)","root":"رجع","lemma":"مَرْجِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73521,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فَيُنَبِّئُهُم","transliteration":"fayunabbi-uhum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তাদের জানিয়ে দিবেন","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73522,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"সে সম্বন্ধে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73523,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73524,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73525,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"١٠٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā tasubbū alladhīna yadʿūna min dūni l-lahi fayasubbū l-laha ʿadwan bighayri ʿil''min kadhālika zayyannā likulli ummatin ʿamalahum thumma ilā rabbihim marjiʿuhum fayunabbi-uhum bimā kānū yaʿmalūna', '(ওহে মুমিনগণ!) আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদেরকে তারা ডাকে তোমরা তাদেরকে গালি দিও না, কেননা তারা তাদের অজ্ঞতাপ্রসূত শত্রুতার বশবর্তী হয়ে আল্লাহকে গালি দেবে। আর এভাবেই আমি প্রত্যেক জাতির জন্য তাদের কার্যকলাপকে তাদের দৃষ্টিতে চাকচিক্যময় করে দিয়েছি, অতঃপর তাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন (ঘটবে) তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট, তখন তিনি তাদেরকে জানিয়ে দিবেন যা কিছু তারা করতো।', 'And do not insult those they invoke other than Allah, lest they insult Allah in enmity without knowledge. Thus We have made pleasing to every community their deeds. Then to their Lord is their return, and He will inform them about what they used to do.', '(ওহে মুমিনগণ!) আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাদেরকে তারা ডাকে তোমরা তাদেরকে গালি দিও না, কেননা তারা তাদের অজ্ঞতাপ্রসূত শত্রুতার বশবর্তী হয়ে আল্লাহকে গালি দেবে। আর এভাবেই আমি প্রত্যেক জাতির জন্য তাদের কার্যকলাপকে তাদের দৃষ্টিতে চাকচিক্যময় করে দিয়েছি, অতঃপর তাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন (ঘটবে) তাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট, তখন তিনি তাদেরকে জানিয়ে দিবেন যা কিছু তারা করতো।', 'And do not insult those they invoke other than Allah, lest they insult Allah in enmity without knowledge. Thus We have made pleasing to every community their deeds. Then to their Lord is their return, and He will inform them about what they used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006108.mp3', now()),
  (6, 109, '', '[{"id":73904,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقْسَمُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqsamū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা শপথ করে বলে","root":"قسم","lemma":"أَقْسَمُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73905,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"নামে আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73906,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَهْدَ","transliteration":"jahda","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَهْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73907,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْمَـٰنِهِمْ","transliteration":"aymānihim","translation_bn":"শপথগুলো তাদের","root":"يمن","lemma":"يَمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73908,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَئِن","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":73909,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْهُمْ","transliteration":"jāathum","translation_bn":"কাছে আসে তাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73910,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَةٌۭ","transliteration":"āyatun","translation_bn":"কোনো নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73911,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَّيُؤْمِنُنَّ","transliteration":"layu''minunna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তারা ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":73912,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا ۚ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73914,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73915,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":73916,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتُ","transliteration":"l-āyātu","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73917,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":73918,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌রই\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":73920,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং কিসে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73921,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُشْعِرُكُمْ","transliteration":"yush''ʿirukum","translation_bn":"বোধগম্য করাবে তোমাদের","root":"شعر","lemma":"يُشْعِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73922,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهَآ","transliteration":"annahā","translation_bn":"যে তা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":73923,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":73924,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْ","transliteration":"jāat","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73925,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":73926,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"তারা ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73927,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"١٠٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-aqsamū bil-lahi jahda aymānihim la-in jāathum āyatun layu''minunna bihā qul innamā l-āyātu ʿinda l-lahi wamā yush''ʿirukum annahā idhā jāat lā yu''minūna', 'তারা আল্লাহর নামে কঠিন শপথ করে বলে- তাদের নিকট যদি কোন নিদর্শন আসত তবে তারা অবশ্যই তাঁর প্রতি ঈমান আনত। বল, নিদর্শন (আনার ব্যাপারটি) হল আল্লাহর ইখতিয়ারভুক্ত। নিদর্শন আসলেও তারা যে ঈমান আনবে না, এ কথা কীভাবে তোমাদেরকে বুঝানো যাবে?', 'And they swear by Allah their strongest oaths that if a sign came to them, they would surely believe in it. Say, "The signs are only with Allah." And what will make you perceive that even if a sign came, they would not believe.', 'তারা আল্লাহর নামে কঠিন শপথ করে বলে- তাদের নিকট যদি কোন নিদর্শন আসত তবে তারা অবশ্যই তাঁর প্রতি ঈমান আনত। বল, নিদর্শন (আনার ব্যাপারটি) হল আল্লাহর ইখতিয়ারভুক্ত। নিদর্শন আসলেও তারা যে ঈমান আনবে না, এ কথা কীভাবে তোমাদেরকে বুঝানো যাবে?', 'And they swear by Allah their strongest oaths that if a sign came to them, they would surely believe in it. Say, "The signs are only with Allah." And what will make you perceive that even if a sign came, they would not believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006109.mp3', now()),
  (6, 110, '', '[{"id":74095,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَنُقَلِّبُ","transliteration":"wanuqallibu","translation_bn":"এবং ফিরিয়ে দিবো আমরা","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلَّبُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74096,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَفْـِٔدَتَهُمْ","transliteration":"afidatahum","translation_bn":"অন্তরগুলোকে তাদের","root":"فاد","lemma":"فُؤَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74097,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَأَبْصَـٰرَهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-abṣārahum","translation_bn":"ও দৃষ্টিগুলোকে তাদের","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74098,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَمَا","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74099,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":74100,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُوا۟","transliteration":"yu''minū","translation_bn":"তারা ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74101,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74102,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَوَّلَ","transliteration":"awwala","translation_bn":"প্রথম","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":74103,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَرَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"marratin","translation_bn":"বার","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74104,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَنَذَرُهُمْ","transliteration":"wanadharuhum","translation_bn":"ও ছেড়ে দিবো আমরা তাদের","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74105,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74106,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"طُغْيَـٰنِهِمْ","transliteration":"ṭugh''yānihim","translation_bn":"অবাধ্যতার তাদের","root":"طغي","lemma":"طُغْيَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74107,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَهُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmahūna","translation_bn":"তারা উদ্ভ্রান্ত হয়ে ঘুরে বেড়াবে","root":"عمه","lemma":"يَعْمَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74108,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wanuqallibu afidatahum wa-abṣārahum kamā lam yu''minū bihi awwala marratin wanadharuhum fī ṭugh''yānihim yaʿmahūna', 'আর আমিও এদের অন্তর ও দৃষ্টিসমূহকে (অন্য দিকে) ফিরিয়ে দেব, আর তাদেরকে তাদের অবাধ্যতার ঘূর্ণিপাকে অন্ধের মত ঘুরে মরার সুযোগ দেব।', 'And We will turn away their hearts and their eyes just as they refused to believe in it the first time. And We will leave them in their transgression, wandering blindly.', 'আর আমিও এদের অন্তর ও দৃষ্টিসমূহকে (অন্য দিকে) ফিরিয়ে দেব, আর তাদেরকে তাদের অবাধ্যতার ঘূর্ণিপাকে অন্ধের মত ঘুরে মরার সুযোগ দেব।', 'And We will turn away their hearts and their eyes just as they refused to believe in it the first time. And We will leave them in their transgression, wandering blindly.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006110.mp3', now()),
  (6, 111, '', '[{"id":74583,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি (হতো)","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74584,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّنَا","transliteration":"annanā","translation_bn":"যে আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":74585,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَزَّلْنَآ","transliteration":"nazzalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা অবতীর্ণ করতাম","root":"نزل","lemma":"نَزَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74586,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمُ","transliteration":"ilayhimu","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74587,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةَ","transliteration":"l-malāikata","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতাদেরকে","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74588,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَكَلَّمَهُمُ","transliteration":"wakallamahumu","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের সাথে কথাও বলত","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلَّمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74589,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَوْتَىٰ","transliteration":"l-mawtā","translation_bn":"মৃতরা","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74590,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَحَشَرْنَا","transliteration":"waḥasharnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা একত্র করতাম","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74591,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"সামনে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74592,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74593,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74594,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قُبُلًۭا","transliteration":"qubulan","translation_bn":"সামনাসামনি","root":"قبل","lemma":"قُبُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74595,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তবুও) না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":74596,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74597,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِيُؤْمِنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"liyu''minū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74598,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":74599,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":74600,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءَ","transliteration":"yashāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করতেন (তবে ভিন্ন কথা)","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74601,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":74602,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74603,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharahum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশই তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74604,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَجْهَلُونَ","transliteration":"yajhalūna","translation_bn":"মূর্খতা করে","root":"جهل","lemma":"يَجْهَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74605,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١١١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১১)","root":"—","lemma":"١١١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw annanā nazzalnā ilayhimu l-malāikata wakallamahumu l-mawtā waḥasharnā ʿalayhim kulla shayin qubulan mā kānū liyu''minū illā an yashāa l-lahu walākinna aktharahum yajhalūna', 'আমি যদি তাদের কাছে ফেরেশতা অবতীর্ণ করতাম আর মৃতরা তাদের সাথে কথা বলত আর আমি তাদের সামনে যাবতীয় বস্তু হাজির করে দিতাম তবুও আল্লাহর ইচ্ছে ব্যতীত তারা ঈমান আনত না, মূলতঃ তাদের অধিকাংশই অজ্ঞতাপূর্ণ কাজ করে।', 'And even if We had sent down to them the angels [with the message] and the dead spoke to them [of it] and We gathered together every [created] thing in front of them, they would not believe unless Allah should will. But most of them, [of that], are ignorant.', 'আমি যদি তাদের কাছে ফেরেশতা অবতীর্ণ করতাম আর মৃতরা তাদের সাথে কথা বলত আর আমি তাদের সামনে যাবতীয় বস্তু হাজির করে দিতাম তবুও আল্লাহর ইচ্ছে ব্যতীত তারা ঈমান আনত না, মূলতঃ তাদের অধিকাংশই অজ্ঞতাপূর্ণ কাজ করে।', 'And even if We had sent down to them the angels [with the message] and the dead spoke to them [of it] and We gathered together every [created] thing in front of them, they would not believe unless Allah should will. But most of them, [of that], are ignorant.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006111.mp3', now()),
  (6, 112, '', '[{"id":74781,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74782,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা বানিয়েছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74783,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِكُلِّ","transliteration":"likulli","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74784,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَبِىٍّ","transliteration":"nabiyyin","translation_bn":"নাবীর","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74785,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوًّۭا","transliteration":"ʿaduwwan","translation_bn":"শত্রু","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74786,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شَيَـٰطِينَ","transliteration":"shayāṭīna","translation_bn":"শয়তানদেরকে","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74787,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسِ","transliteration":"l-insi","translation_bn":"(মধ্য হতে) মানুষের","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74788,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْجِنِّ","transliteration":"wal-jini","translation_bn":"ও জিনদের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74789,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُوحِى","transliteration":"yūḥī","translation_bn":"উস্কানি দিতে থাকে","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74790,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُهُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","translation_bn":"কিছু অংশ তাদের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74791,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74792,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضٍۢ","transliteration":"baʿḍin","translation_bn":"(অন্য) কিছু অংশের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74793,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"زُخْرُفَ","transliteration":"zukh''rufa","translation_bn":"চাকচিক্য (দ্বারা)","root":"زخرف","lemma":"زُخْرُف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74794,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْلِ","transliteration":"l-qawli","translation_bn":"কথার","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74795,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"غُرُورًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ghurūran","translation_bn":"ধোঁকার (উদ্দেশ্যে)","root":"غرر","lemma":"غُرُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74797,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74798,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74799,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74800,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":74801,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلُوهُ ۖ","transliteration":"faʿalūhu","translation_bn":"তারা করতো তা","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74803,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فَذَرْهُمْ","transliteration":"fadharhum","translation_bn":"অতএব ছেড়ে দাও তাদেরকে (তাদের অবস্থায়)","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74804,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74805,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaftarūna","translation_bn":"তারা রচনা করছে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74806,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"١١٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১২)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika jaʿalnā likulli nabiyyin ʿaduwwan shayāṭīna l-insi wal-jini yūḥī baʿḍuhum ilā baʿḍin zukh''rufa l-qawli ghurūran walaw shāa rabbuka mā faʿalūhu fadharhum wamā yaftarūna', 'এভাবে আমি প্রত্যেক নাবীর জন্য মানুষ আর জ্বীন শয়তানদের মধ্য হতে শত্রু বানিয়ে দিয়েছি, প্রতারণা করার উদ্দেশ্যে তারা একে অপরের কাছে চিত্তাকর্ষক কথাবার্তা বলে। তোমার প্রতিপালক ইচ্ছে করলে তারা তা করত না, কাজেই তাদেরকে আর তাদের মিথ্যে চর্চাকে উপেক্ষা করে চল।', 'And thus We have made for every prophet an enemy - devils from mankind and jinn, inspiring to one another decorative speech in delusion. But if your Lord had willed, they would not have done it, so leave them and that which they invent.', 'এভাবে আমি প্রত্যেক নাবীর জন্য মানুষ আর জ্বীন শয়তানদের মধ্য হতে শত্রু বানিয়ে দিয়েছি, প্রতারণা করার উদ্দেশ্যে তারা একে অপরের কাছে চিত্তাকর্ষক কথাবার্তা বলে। তোমার প্রতিপালক ইচ্ছে করলে তারা তা করত না, কাজেই তাদেরকে আর তাদের মিথ্যে চর্চাকে উপেক্ষা করে চল।', 'And thus We have made for every prophet an enemy - devils from mankind and jinn, inspiring to one another decorative speech in delusion. But if your Lord had willed, they would not have done it, so leave them and that which they invent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006112.mp3', now()),
  (6, 113, '', '[{"id":75043,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِتَصْغَىٰٓ","transliteration":"walitaṣghā","translation_bn":"এবং (তারা এজন্যে করে) যেন ঝুঁকে","root":"صغو","lemma":"صَغَتْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75044,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ilayhi","translation_bn":"প্রতি তার (অর্থাৎ চাকচিক্যের)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75045,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَفْـِٔدَةُ","transliteration":"afidatu","translation_bn":"(তাদের) অন্তর","root":"فاد","lemma":"فُؤَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75046,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75047,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":75048,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75049,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","translation_bn":"উপর আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75050,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَرْضَوْهُ","transliteration":"waliyarḍawhu","translation_bn":"এবং যেন তাতে তারা পরিতুষ্ট হয়","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75051,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَقْتَرِفُوا۟","transliteration":"waliyaqtarifū","translation_bn":"এবং যেন তারা অপকর্ম করে","root":"قرف","lemma":"ٱقْتَرَفْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75052,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75053,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"هُم","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":75054,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مُّقْتَرِفُونَ","transliteration":"muq''tarifūna","translation_bn":"অপকর্ম করছে","root":"قرف","lemma":"مُّقْتَرِفُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75055,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١١٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walitaṣghā ilayhi afidatu alladhīna lā yu''minūna bil-ākhirati waliyarḍawhu waliyaqtarifū mā hum muq''tarifūna', 'তার দিকে (অর্থাৎ চিত্তাকর্ষক প্রতারণার দিকে) সে সব লোকের অন্তর আকৃষ্ট হতে দাও যারা আখেরাতের প্রতি ঈমান আনে না, আর তাতেই তাদেরকে সন্তুষ্ট থাকতে দাও আর যে পাপকাজ তারা করতে চায় তা তাদেরকে করতে দাও।', 'And [it is] so the hearts of those who disbelieve in the Hereafter will incline toward it and that they will be satisfied with it and that they will commit that which they are committing.', 'তার দিকে (অর্থাৎ চিত্তাকর্ষক প্রতারণার দিকে) সে সব লোকের অন্তর আকৃষ্ট হতে দাও যারা আখেরাতের প্রতি ঈমান আনে না, আর তাতেই তাদেরকে সন্তুষ্ট থাকতে দাও আর যে পাপকাজ তারা করতে চায় তা তাদেরকে করতে দাও।', 'And [it is] so the hearts of those who disbelieve in the Hereafter will incline toward it and that they will be satisfied with it and that they will commit that which they are committing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006113.mp3', now()),
  (6, 114, '', '[{"id":75255,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَغَيْرَ","transliteration":"afaghayra","translation_bn":"\"কি তবে ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":75256,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75257,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَبْتَغِى","transliteration":"abtaghī","translation_bn":"খোঁজ করবো আমি","root":"بغي","lemma":"ٱبْتَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75258,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَكَمًۭا","transliteration":"ḥakaman","translation_bn":"বিচারক (অন্য কাউকে)","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75259,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"অথচ তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75260,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75261,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75262,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُمُ","transliteration":"ilaykumu","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75263,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75264,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُفَصَّلًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"mufaṣṣalan","translation_bn":"বিস্তারিত\"","root":"فصل","lemma":"مُفَصَّل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75266,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যাদেরকে (তোমার পূর্বে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75267,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ","transliteration":"ātaynāhumu","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছি তাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75268,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75269,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75270,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"annahu","translation_bn":"যে তা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":75271,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُنَزَّلٌۭ","transliteration":"munazzalun","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে","root":"نزل","lemma":"مُنَزَّل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75272,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75273,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75274,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ ۖ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সহকারে সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75276,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75277,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونَنَّ","transliteration":"takūnanna","translation_bn":"তুমি হয়ো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75278,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75279,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُمْتَرِينَ","transliteration":"l-mum''tarīna","translation_bn":"সন্দেহকারীদের","root":"مري","lemma":"مُمْتَرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75280,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"١١٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afaghayra l-lahi abtaghī ḥakaman wahuwa alladhī anzala ilaykumu l-kitāba mufaṣṣalan wa-alladhīna ātaynāhumu l-kitāba yaʿlamūna annahu munazzalun min rabbika bil-ḥaqi falā takūnanna mina l-mum''tarīna', 'বল, আমি কি আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্যকে বিচারক মানব, যখন তিনি সেই (সত্তা) যিনি তোমাদের নিকট কিতাব নাযিল করেছেন, যা বিশদভাবে বিবৃত। আমি যাদেরকে (পূর্বে) কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম তারা জানে যে, তা সত্যতা সহকারে তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে। কাজেই কিছুতেই তুমি সন্দেহ পোষণকারীদের মধ্যে শামিল হয়ো না।', '[Say], "Then is it other than Allah I should seek as judge while it is He who has revealed to you the Book explained in detail?" And those to whom We [previously] gave the Scripture know that it is sent down from your Lord in truth, so never be among the doubters.', 'বল, আমি কি আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্যকে বিচারক মানব, যখন তিনি সেই (সত্তা) যিনি তোমাদের নিকট কিতাব নাযিল করেছেন, যা বিশদভাবে বিবৃত। আমি যাদেরকে (পূর্বে) কিতাব দিয়েছিলাম তারা জানে যে, তা সত্যতা সহকারে তোমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে অবতীর্ণ হয়েছে। কাজেই কিছুতেই তুমি সন্দেহ পোষণকারীদের মধ্যে শামিল হয়ো না।', '[Say], "Then is it other than Allah I should seek as judge while it is He who has revealed to you the Book explained in detail?" And those to whom We [previously] gave the Scripture know that it is sent down from your Lord in truth, so never be among the doubters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006114.mp3', now()),
  (6, 115, '', '[{"id":75295,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَتَمَّتْ","transliteration":"watammat","translation_bn":"এবং পরিপূর্ণ হয়েছে","root":"تمم","lemma":"تَمَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75296,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَتُ","transliteration":"kalimatu","translation_bn":"কথাগুলো","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75297,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75298,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"صِدْقًۭا","transliteration":"ṣid''qan","translation_bn":"সত্যতায়","root":"صدق","lemma":"صِدْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75299,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدْلًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"waʿadlan","translation_bn":"ও ন্যায়পরায়ণতায়","root":"عدل","lemma":"عَدْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75301,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":75302,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُبَدِّلَ","transliteration":"mubaddila","translation_bn":"কোনো পরিবর্তনকারী","root":"بدل","lemma":"مُبَدِّل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75303,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِكَلِمَـٰتِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"likalimātihi","translation_bn":"কথাগুলোকে তাঁর","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَٰت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75305,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75306,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمِيعُ","transliteration":"l-samīʿu","translation_bn":"সবকিছুই শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75307,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","translation_bn":"সবকিছুই জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75308,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'watammat kalimatu rabbika ṣid''qan waʿadlan lā mubaddila likalimātihi wahuwa l-samīʿu l-ʿalīmu', 'সত্যতা ও ইনসাফের দিক দিয়ে তোমার প্রতিপালকের বাণী পরিপূর্ণ। তাঁর বাণী পরিবর্তন করার কেউ নেই। আর তিনি হলেন সর্বশ্রোতা ও সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And the word of your Lord has been fulfilled in truth and in justice. None can alter His words, and He is the Hearing, the Knowing.', 'সত্যতা ও ইনসাফের দিক দিয়ে তোমার প্রতিপালকের বাণী পরিপূর্ণ। তাঁর বাণী পরিবর্তন করার কেউ নেই। আর তিনি হলেন সর্বশ্রোতা ও সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And the word of your Lord has been fulfilled in truth and in justice. None can alter His words, and He is the Hearing, the Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006115.mp3', now()),
  (6, 116, '', '[{"id":75523,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75524,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُطِعْ","transliteration":"tuṭiʿ","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করো","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75525,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَ","transliteration":"akthara","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75526,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75527,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75528,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75529,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُضِلُّوكَ","transliteration":"yuḍillūka","translation_bn":"তারা তোমাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করবে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75530,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75531,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75532,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75534,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":75535,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّبِعُونَ","transliteration":"yattabiʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75536,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":75537,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّنَّ","transliteration":"l-ẓana","translation_bn":"অনুমানের","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75538,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنْ","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75539,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":75540,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":75541,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَخْرُصُونَ","transliteration":"yakhruṣūna","translation_bn":"অনুমান করে","root":"خرص","lemma":"يَخْرُصُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75542,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in tuṭiʿ akthara man fī l-arḍi yuḍillūka ʿan sabīli l-lahi in yattabiʿūna illā l-ẓana wa-in hum illā yakhruṣūna', 'তুমি যদি পৃথিবীর অধিকাংশ লোকের অনুসরণ কর তাহলে তারা তোমাকে আল্লাহর পথ হতে বিচ্যুত করে ফেলবে, তারা তো কেবল আন্দাজ-অনুমানের অনুসরণ করে চলে, তারা মিথ্যাচার ছাড়া কিছু করে না।', 'And if you obey most of those upon the earth, they will mislead you from the way of Allah. They follow not except assumption, and they are not but falsifying.', 'তুমি যদি পৃথিবীর অধিকাংশ লোকের অনুসরণ কর তাহলে তারা তোমাকে আল্লাহর পথ হতে বিচ্যুত করে ফেলবে, তারা তো কেবল আন্দাজ-অনুমানের অনুসরণ করে চলে, তারা মিথ্যাচার ছাড়া কিছু করে না।', 'And if you obey most of those upon the earth, they will mislead you from the way of Allah. They follow not except assumption, and they are not but falsifying.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006116.mp3', now()),
  (6, 117, '', '[{"id":75716,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":75717,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75718,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":75719,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জ্ঞাত","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75720,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75721,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَضِلُّ","transliteration":"yaḍillu","translation_bn":"ভ্রষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75722,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75723,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"sabīlihi","translation_bn":"পথ তাঁর","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75725,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75726,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জ্ঞাত","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75727,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمُهْتَدِينَ","transliteration":"bil-muh''tadīna","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সঠিক পথ প্রাপ্তদের","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُّهْتَدُون","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75728,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna rabbaka huwa aʿlamu man yaḍillu ʿan sabīlihi wahuwa aʿlamu bil-muh''tadīna', 'তোমার রব্ব খুব ভাল করেই জানেন কে তাঁর পথ থেকে ভ্রষ্ট হয়ে গেছে আর তিনি হিদায়াতপ্রাপ্তদের সম্পর্কেও সর্বাধিক অবহিত।', 'Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who strays from His way, and He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.', 'তোমার রব্ব খুব ভাল করেই জানেন কে তাঁর পথ থেকে ভ্রষ্ট হয়ে গেছে আর তিনি হিদায়াতপ্রাপ্তদের সম্পর্কেও সর্বাধিক অবহিত।', 'Indeed, your Lord is most knowing of who strays from His way, and He is most knowing of the [rightly] guided.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006117.mp3', now()),
  (6, 118, '', '[{"id":76021,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَكُلُوا۟","transliteration":"fakulū","translation_bn":"অতএব তোমরা খাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76022,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে (যার উপর)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76023,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذُكِرَ","transliteration":"dhukira","translation_bn":"নেয়া হয়েছে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76024,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْمُ","transliteration":"us''mu","translation_bn":"নাম","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76025,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76026,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76027,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":76028,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"হও তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76029,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِهِۦ","transliteration":"biāyātihi","translation_bn":"প্রতি আয়াতসমূহের তাঁর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76030,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"mu''minīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাসী","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76031,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fakulū mimmā dhukira us''mu l-lahi ʿalayhi in kuntum biāyātihi mu''minīna', 'কাজেই যে পশু যবেহ করার সময় আল্লাহর নাম নেয়া হয়েছে তা তোমরা খাও যদি তাঁর নিদর্শনাবলীতে তোমরা বিশ্বাসী হয়ে থাক।', 'So eat of that [meat] upon which the name of Allah has been mentioned, if you are believers in His verses.', 'কাজেই যে পশু যবেহ করার সময় আল্লাহর নাম নেয়া হয়েছে তা তোমরা খাও যদি তাঁর নিদর্শনাবলীতে তোমরা বিশ্বাসী হয়ে থাক।', 'So eat of that [meat] upon which the name of Allah has been mentioned, if you are believers in His verses.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006118.mp3', now()),
  (6, 119, '', '[{"id":76147,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং কি হয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76148,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76149,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":76150,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"تَأْكُلُوا۟","transliteration":"takulū","translation_bn":"তোমরা খাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76151,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে (যার উপর)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76152,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذُكِرَ","transliteration":"dhukira","translation_bn":"হয়েছে নেয়া","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76153,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْمُ","transliteration":"us''mu","translation_bn":"নাম","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76154,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76155,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76156,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"অথচ নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76157,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَصَّلَ","transliteration":"faṣṣala","translation_bn":"তিনি বিস্তারিত বিবৃত করেছেন","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76158,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্য