য়াল খুশী দ্বারা","root":"هوي","lemma":"أَهْوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76171,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76172,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍ ۗ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"কোনো জ্ঞান (অর্থাৎ অজ্ঞতাবশত)","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76174,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76175,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76176,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":76177,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76178,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمُعْتَدِينَ","transliteration":"bil-muʿ''tadīna","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"عدو","lemma":"مُعْتَدِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76179,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"١١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā lakum allā takulū mimmā dhukira us''mu l-lahi ʿalayhi waqad faṣṣala lakum mā ḥarrama ʿalaykum illā mā uḍ''ṭurir''tum ilayhi wa-inna kathīran layuḍillūna bi-ahwāihim bighayri ʿil''min inna rabbaka huwa aʿlamu bil-muʿ''tadīna', 'তোমাদের কী হয়েছে যে, যাতে আল্লাহর নাম নেয়া হয়েছে তা তোমরা খাবে না? তোমাদের জন্য যা হারাম করা হয়েছে তা তোমাদের জন্য বিশদভাবে বাতলে দেয়া হয়েছে, তবে যদি তোমরা নিরুপায় হও (তবে ততটুকু নিষিদ্ধ বস্তু খেতে পার যাতে প্রাণে বাঁচতে পার), কিন্তু অনেক লোকই অজ্ঞানতাবশতঃ তাদের খেয়াল খুশী দ্বারা অবশ্যই (অন্যদেরকে) পথভ্রষ্ট করে, তোমার প্রতিপালক সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের সম্পর্কে সবচেয়ে বেশি অবগত।', 'And why should you not eat of that upon which the name of Allah has been mentioned while He has explained in detail to you what He has forbidden you, excepting that to which you are compelled. And indeed do many lead [others] astray through their [own] inclinations without knowledge. Indeed, your Lord - He is most knowing of the transgressors.', 'তোমাদের কী হয়েছে যে, যাতে আল্লাহর নাম নেয়া হয়েছে তা তোমরা খাবে না? তোমাদের জন্য যা হারাম করা হয়েছে তা তোমাদের জন্য বিশদভাবে বাতলে দেয়া হয়েছে, তবে যদি তোমরা নিরুপায় হও (তবে ততটুকু নিষিদ্ধ বস্তু খেতে পার যাতে প্রাণে বাঁচতে পার), কিন্তু অনেক লোকই অজ্ঞানতাবশতঃ তাদের খেয়াল খুশী দ্বারা অবশ্যই (অন্যদেরকে) পথভ্রষ্ট করে, তোমার প্রতিপালক সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের সম্পর্কে সবচেয়ে বেশি অবগত।', 'And why should you not eat of that upon which the name of Allah has been mentioned while He has explained in detail to you what He has forbidden you, excepting that to which you are compelled. And indeed do many lead [others] astray through their [own] inclinations without knowledge. Indeed, your Lord - He is most knowing of the transgressors.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006119.mp3', now()),
  (6, 120, '', '[{"id":76404,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَذَرُوا۟","transliteration":"wadharū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা বর্জন করো","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76405,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ظَـٰهِرَ","transliteration":"ẓāhira","translation_bn":"প্রকাশ্য","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَٰهِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76406,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِثْمِ","transliteration":"l-ith''mi","translation_bn":"পাপের কাজ","root":"اثم","lemma":"إِثْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76407,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَبَاطِنَهُۥٓ ۚ","transliteration":"wabāṭinahu","translation_bn":"এবং গোপন তার(কাজও)","root":"بطن","lemma":"بَاطِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76409,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76410,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":76411,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَكْسِبُونَ","transliteration":"yaksibūna","translation_bn":"উপার্জন করে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76412,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِثْمَ","transliteration":"l-ith''ma","translation_bn":"পাপ","root":"اثم","lemma":"إِثْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76413,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"سَيُجْزَوْنَ","transliteration":"sayuj''zawna","translation_bn":"অচিরেই তাদের প্রতিদান দেয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":76414,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"বিনিময়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76415,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76416,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَقْتَرِفُونَ","transliteration":"yaqtarifūna","translation_bn":"তারা কুকর্ম করতে","root":"قرف","lemma":"ٱقْتَرَفْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76417,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wadharū ẓāhira l-ith''mi wabāṭinahu inna alladhīna yaksibūna l-ith''ma sayuj''zawna bimā kānū yaqtarifūna', 'তোমরা প্রকাশ্য ও গোপন পাপ বর্জন কর, যারা পাপ অর্জন করে তারা তাদের অর্জনের যথোচিত প্রতিফল পাবে।', 'And leave what is apparent of sin and what is concealed thereof. Indeed, those who earn [blame for] sin will be recompensed for that which they used to commit.', 'তোমরা প্রকাশ্য ও গোপন পাপ বর্জন কর, যারা পাপ অর্জন করে তারা তাদের অর্জনের যথোচিত প্রতিফল পাবে।', 'And leave what is apparent of sin and what is concealed thereof. Indeed, those who earn [blame for] sin will be recompensed for that which they used to commit.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006120.mp3', now()),
  (6, 121, '', '[{"id":76513,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76514,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَأْكُلُوا۟","transliteration":"takulū","translation_bn":"তোমরা খেয়ো","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76515,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে (যার উপর)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76516,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":76517,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُذْكَرِ","transliteration":"yudh''kari","translation_bn":"নেয়া হয়","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76518,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْمُ","transliteration":"us''mu","translation_bn":"নাম","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76519,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76520,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76521,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"wa-innahu","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76522,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَفِسْقٌۭ ۗ","transliteration":"lafis''qun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই পাপ","root":"فسق","lemma":"فِسْق","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":76524,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّ","transliteration":"wa-inna","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76525,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيَـٰطِينَ","transliteration":"l-shayāṭīna","translation_bn":"শয়তানরা","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76526,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَيُوحُونَ","transliteration":"layūḥūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই উস্কানি দেয়","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":76527,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76528,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآئِهِمْ","transliteration":"awliyāihim","translation_bn":"তাদের বন্ধুদের","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76529,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِيُجَـٰدِلُوكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"liyujādilūkum","translation_bn":"যেন তারা ঝগড়া করে তোমাদের (সাথে)","root":"جدل","lemma":"جَٰدَلُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76531,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنْ","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76532,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَطَعْتُمُوهُمْ","transliteration":"aṭaʿtumūhum","translation_bn":"তোমরা আনুগত্য করো তাদের","root":"طوع","lemma":"أَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76533,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"innakum","translation_bn":"(তবে)তোমরাও নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76534,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَمُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"lamush''rikūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মুশরিক","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":76535,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"١٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā takulū mimmā lam yudh''kari us''mu l-lahi ʿalayhi wa-innahu lafis''qun wa-inna l-shayāṭīna layūḥūna ilā awliyāihim liyujādilūkum wa-in aṭaʿtumūhum innakum lamush''rikūna', 'যাতে (যবহ করার সময়) আল্লাহর নাম নেয়া হয়নি তা তোমরা মোটেই খাবে না, তা হচ্ছে পাপাচার, শায়ত্বনেরা তাদের বন্ধুদেরকে তোমাদের সঙ্গে তর্ক-ঝগড়া করার জন্য প্ররোচিত করে; যদি তোমরা তাদের কথা মান্য করে চল তাহলে তোমরা অবশ্যই মুশরিক হয়ে যাবে।', 'And do not eat of that upon which the name of Allah has not been mentioned, for indeed, it is grave disobedience. And indeed do the devils inspire their allies [among men] to dispute with you. And if you were to obey them, indeed, you would be associators [of others with Him].', 'যাতে (যবহ করার সময়) আল্লাহর নাম নেয়া হয়নি তা তোমরা মোটেই খাবে না, তা হচ্ছে পাপাচার, শায়ত্বনেরা তাদের বন্ধুদেরকে তোমাদের সঙ্গে তর্ক-ঝগড়া করার জন্য প্ররোচিত করে; যদি তোমরা তাদের কথা মান্য করে চল তাহলে তোমরা অবশ্যই মুশরিক হয়ে যাবে।', 'And do not eat of that upon which the name of Allah has not been mentioned, for indeed, it is grave disobedience. And indeed do the devils inspire their allies [among men] to dispute with you. And if you were to obey them, indeed, you would be associators [of others with Him].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006121.mp3', now()),
  (6, 122, '', '[{"id":76659,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَمَن","transliteration":"awaman","translation_bn":"কি যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":76660,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76661,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَيْتًۭا","transliteration":"maytan","translation_bn":"মৃত","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76662,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَأَحْيَيْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"fa-aḥyaynāhu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমরা জীবিত করেছি তাকে","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76663,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"wajaʿalnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা দিয়েছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76664,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76665,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نُورًۭا","transliteration":"nūran","translation_bn":"আলো","root":"نور","lemma":"نُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76666,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَمْشِى","transliteration":"yamshī","translation_bn":"সে চলে","root":"مشي","lemma":"مَّشَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76667,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76668,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76669,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76670,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَمَن","transliteration":"kaman","translation_bn":"মতো সেই ব্যক্তির","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76671,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَّثَلُهُۥ","transliteration":"mathaluhu","translation_bn":"উদাহরণ যার","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76672,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76673,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظُّلُمَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ẓulumāti","translation_bn":"অন্ধকারসমূহের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلُمَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76674,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76675,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِخَارِجٍۢ","transliteration":"bikhārijin","translation_bn":"সে বের হবার","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَارِج","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76676,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهَا ۚ","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76678,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76679,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"زُيِّنَ","transliteration":"zuyyina","translation_bn":"শোভন করা হয়েছে","root":"زين","lemma":"زَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76680,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لِلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"lil''kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাছে কাফিরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76681,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":76682,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76683,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76684,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"١٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awaman kāna maytan fa-aḥyaynāhu wajaʿalnā lahu nūran yamshī bihi fī l-nāsi kaman mathaluhu fī l-ẓulumāti laysa bikhārijin min''hā kadhālika zuyyina lil''kāfirīna mā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'যে ব্যক্তি মৃত ছিল, তাকে আমি জীবিত করলাম, তার জন্য আলোর ব্যবস্থা করলাম যার সাহায্যে সে মানুষের মাঝে চলাফেরা করে, সে কি তার মত যে অন্ধকারে নিমজ্জিত, যাত্থেকে সে কক্ষনো বেরিয়ে আসতে পারবে না। এটা এজন্য যে, কাফিররা যা করছে তা তাদের জন্য চাকচিক্যময় করে দেয়া হয়েছে।', 'And is one who was dead and We gave him life and made for him light by which to walk among the people like one who is in darkness, never to emerge therefrom? Thus it has been made pleasing to the disbelievers that which they were doing.', 'যে ব্যক্তি মৃত ছিল, তাকে আমি জীবিত করলাম, তার জন্য আলোর ব্যবস্থা করলাম যার সাহায্যে সে মানুষের মাঝে চলাফেরা করে, সে কি তার মত যে অন্ধকারে নিমজ্জিত, যাত্থেকে সে কক্ষনো বেরিয়ে আসতে পারবে না। এটা এজন্য যে, কাফিররা যা করছে তা তাদের জন্য চাকচিক্যময় করে দেয়া হয়েছে।', 'And is one who was dead and We gave him life and made for him light by which to walk among the people like one who is in darkness, never to emerge therefrom? Thus it has been made pleasing to the disbelievers that which they were doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006122.mp3', now()),
  (6, 123, '', '[{"id":76902,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76903,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلْنَا","transliteration":"jaʿalnā","translation_bn":"আমরা নিযুক্ত করেছি","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76904,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76905,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76906,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَةٍ","transliteration":"qaryatin","translation_bn":"জনপদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76907,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَكَـٰبِرَ","transliteration":"akābira","translation_bn":"বড় বড়","root":"كبر","lemma":"أَكْبَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76908,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُجْرِمِيهَا","transliteration":"muj''rimīhā","translation_bn":"অপরাধীদেরকে তার","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76909,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِيَمْكُرُوا۟","transliteration":"liyamkurū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা চক্রান্ত করে","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76910,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا ۖ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76912,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76913,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَمْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"yamkurūna","translation_bn":"তারা চক্রান্ত করে","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76914,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":76915,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"bi-anfusihim","translation_bn":"সাথে  নিজেদের তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76916,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"অথচ না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76917,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَشْعُرُونَ","transliteration":"yashʿurūna","translation_bn":"তারা অনুভব করে","root":"شعر","lemma":"يَشْعُرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76918,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika jaʿalnā fī kulli qaryatin akābira muj''rimīhā liyamkurū fīhā wamā yamkurūna illā bi-anfusihim wamā yashʿurūna', 'এভাবে আমি প্রত্যেক জনপদে সেখানকার অপরাধী প্রধানদেরকে চক্রান্তজাল বিস্তার করার সুযোগ দিয়েছি, কিন্তু এ চক্রান্তের ফাঁদে তারা নিজেরাই পতিত হয়, কিন্তু সেটা তারা উপলব্ধিই করতে পারে না।', 'And thus We have placed within every city the greatest of its criminals to conspire therein. But they conspire not except against themselves, and they perceive [it] not.', 'এভাবে আমি প্রত্যেক জনপদে সেখানকার অপরাধী প্রধানদেরকে চক্রান্তজাল বিস্তার করার সুযোগ দিয়েছি, কিন্তু এ চক্রান্তের ফাঁদে তারা নিজেরাই পতিত হয়, কিন্তু সেটা তারা উপলব্ধিই করতে পারে না।', 'And thus We have placed within every city the greatest of its criminals to conspire therein. But they conspire not except against themselves, and they perceive [it] not.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006123.mp3', now()),
  (6, 124, '', '[{"id":77037,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77038,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْهُمْ","transliteration":"jāathum","translation_bn":"কাছে আসে তাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77039,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَةٌۭ","transliteration":"āyatun","translation_bn":"কোনো নিদর্শন","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77040,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77041,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"\"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":77042,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نُّؤْمِنَ","transliteration":"nu''mina","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবো আমরা","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77043,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77044,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نُؤْتَىٰ","transliteration":"nu''tā","translation_bn":"দেয়া হবে আমাদেরকেও","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77045,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِثْلَ","transliteration":"mith''la","translation_bn":"তেমনই","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77046,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77047,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أُوتِىَ","transliteration":"ūtiya","translation_bn":"দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77048,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلُ","transliteration":"rusulu","translation_bn":"রাসূলদেরকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77049,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۘ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77051,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌ই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77052,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77053,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"حَيْثُ","transliteration":"ḥaythu","translation_bn":"যেখানে","root":"حيث\r","lemma":"حَيْث","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":77054,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَجْعَلُ","transliteration":"yajʿalu","translation_bn":"অর্পণ করবেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77055,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رِسَالَتَهُۥ ۗ","transliteration":"risālatahu","translation_bn":"রিসালাতের তাঁর (দায়িত্বভার)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رِسَالَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77057,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"سَيُصِيبُ","transliteration":"sayuṣību","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই পৌঁছবে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":77058,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের উপর) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77059,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ajramū","translation_bn":"অপরাধ করেছে","root":"جرم","lemma":"أَجْرَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77060,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"صَغَارٌ","transliteration":"ṣaghārun","translation_bn":"অপমান","root":"صغر","lemma":"صَغَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77061,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকট (হতে)","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":77062,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77063,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَعَذَابٌۭ","transliteration":"waʿadhābun","translation_bn":"ও শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77064,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"شَدِيدٌۢ","transliteration":"shadīdun","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"شدد","lemma":"شَدِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":77065,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77066,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77067,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"يَمْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"yamkurūna","translation_bn":"তারা চক্রান্ত করতে","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77068,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"١٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā jāathum āyatun qālū lan nu''mina ḥattā nu''tā mith''la mā ūtiya rusulu l-lahi l-lahu aʿlamu ḥaythu yajʿalu risālatahu sayuṣību alladhīna ajramū ṣaghārun ʿinda l-lahi waʿadhābun shadīdun bimā kānū yamkurūna', 'যখন তাদের কাছে কোন নিদর্শন আসে তখন তারা বলে, ‘আমরা কক্ষনো বিশ্বাস করব না যতক্ষণ না আমাদেরকে তা দেয়া হয় যা আল্লাহর রসূলগণকে দেয়া হয়েছিল। (নির্বোধেরা এ আবদার করলেও) আল্লাহ খুব ভালভাবেই জানেন তাঁর রিসালাতের দায়িত্ব কোথায় দিতে হবে, অপরাধীরা শীঘ্রই তাদের চক্রান্তের প্রতিফল হিসেবে আল্লাহর পক্ষ হতে লাঞ্ছনা ও কঠিন শাস্তির সম্মুখীন হবে।', 'And when a sign comes to them, they say, "Never will we believe until we are given like that which was given to the messengers of Allah." Allah is most knowing of where He places His message. There will afflict those who committed crimes debasement before Allah and severe punishment for what they used to conspire.', 'যখন তাদের কাছে কোন নিদর্শন আসে তখন তারা বলে, ‘আমরা কক্ষনো বিশ্বাস করব না যতক্ষণ না আমাদেরকে তা দেয়া হয় যা আল্লাহর রসূলগণকে দেয়া হয়েছিল। (নির্বোধেরা এ আবদার করলেও) আল্লাহ খুব ভালভাবেই জানেন তাঁর রিসালাতের দায়িত্ব কোথায় দিতে হবে, অপরাধীরা শীঘ্রই তাদের চক্রান্তের প্রতিফল হিসেবে আল্লাহর পক্ষ হতে লাঞ্ছনা ও কঠিন শাস্তির সম্মুখীন হবে।', 'And when a sign comes to them, they say, "Never will we believe until we are given like that which was given to the messengers of Allah." Allah is most knowing of where He places His message. There will afflict those who committed crimes debasement before Allah and severe punishment for what they used to conspire.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006124.mp3', now()),
  (6, 125, '', '[{"id":77201,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَمَن","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"অতএব যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77202,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُرِدِ","transliteration":"yuridi","translation_bn":"চান","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77203,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77204,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":77205,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِيَهُۥ","transliteration":"yahdiyahu","translation_bn":"সৎপথে পরিচালিত করবেন তাকে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77206,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَشْرَحْ","transliteration":"yashraḥ","translation_bn":"প্রশস্ত করে দেন","root":"شرح","lemma":"شَرَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77207,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَدْرَهُۥ","transliteration":"ṣadrahu","translation_bn":"হৃদয়কে তার","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77208,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِلْإِسْلَـٰمِ ۖ","transliteration":"lil''is''lāmi","translation_bn":"জন্যে ইসলামের","root":"سلم","lemma":"إِسْلَٰم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77210,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77211,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُرِدْ","transliteration":"yurid","translation_bn":"চান","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77212,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":77213,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُضِلَّهُۥ","transliteration":"yuḍillahu","translation_bn":"বিপথগামী করবেন তাকে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77214,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَجْعَلْ","transliteration":"yajʿal","translation_bn":"করেছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77215,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"صَدْرَهُۥ","transliteration":"ṣadrahu","translation_bn":"হৃদয়কে তার","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77216,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ضَيِّقًا","transliteration":"ḍayyiqan","translation_bn":"ইসলামের অনুসরণে","root":"ضيق","lemma":"ضَيِّق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77217,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"حَرَجًۭا","transliteration":"ḥarajan","translation_bn":"অতিশয় সংকীর্ণ","root":"حرج","lemma":"حَرَج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":77218,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَأَنَّمَا","transliteration":"ka-annamā","translation_bn":"যেন (তার মনে হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":77219,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَصَّعَّدُ","transliteration":"yaṣṣaʿʿadu","translation_bn":"সে আরোহণ করছে","root":"صعد","lemma":"يَصَّعَّدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77220,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77221,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77223,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77224,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَجْعَلُ","transliteration":"yajʿalu","translation_bn":"রাখেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77225,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77226,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّجْسَ","transliteration":"l-rij''sa","translation_bn":"অপবিত্রতা","root":"رجس","lemma":"رِجْس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77227,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77228,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77229,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":77230,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77231,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"١٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faman yuridi l-lahu an yahdiyahu yashraḥ ṣadrahu lil''is''lāmi waman yurid an yuḍillahu yajʿal ṣadrahu ḍayyiqan ḥarajan ka-annamā yaṣṣaʿʿadu fī l-samāi kadhālika yajʿalu l-lahu l-rij''sa ʿalā alladhīna lā yu''minūna', 'আল্লাহ যাকে সৎপথ দেখাতে চান, তার অন্তরকে ইসলামের জন্য খুলে দেন, আর যাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করতে চান তার অন্তরকে সংকীর্ণ সংকুচিত করে দেন, (তার জন্য ইসলাম মান্য করা এমনি কঠিন) যেন সে আকাশে আরোহণ করছে। যারা ঈমান আনে না তাদের উপর আল্লাহ এভাবে লাঞ্ছনা চাপিয়ে দেন।', 'So whoever Allah wants to guide - He expands his breast to [contain] Islam; and whoever He wants to misguide - He makes his breast tight and constricted as though he were climbing into the sky. Thus does Allah place defilement upon those who do not believe.', 'আল্লাহ যাকে সৎপথ দেখাতে চান, তার অন্তরকে ইসলামের জন্য খুলে দেন, আর যাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করতে চান তার অন্তরকে সংকীর্ণ সংকুচিত করে দেন, (তার জন্য ইসলাম মান্য করা এমনি কঠিন) যেন সে আকাশে আরোহণ করছে। যারা ঈমান আনে না তাদের উপর আল্লাহ এভাবে লাঞ্ছনা চাপিয়ে দেন।', 'So whoever Allah wants to guide - He expands his breast to [contain] Islam; and whoever He wants to misguide - He makes his breast tight and constricted as though he were climbing into the sky. Thus does Allah place defilement upon those who do not believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006125.mp3', now()),
  (6, 126, '', '[{"id":77312,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"wahādhā","translation_bn":"এবং এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77313,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطُ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭu","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77314,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77315,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مُسْتَقِيمًۭا ۗ","transliteration":"mus''taqīman","translation_bn":"সরল-সঠিক (পথ)","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77317,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":77318,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَصَّلْنَا","transliteration":"faṣṣalnā","translation_bn":"বিশদ বর্ণনা করেছি আমরা","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77319,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনগুলোকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77320,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77321,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَذَّكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) উপদেশ গ্রহণ করে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77322,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahādhā ṣirāṭu rabbika mus''taqīman qad faṣṣalnā l-āyāti liqawmin yadhakkarūna', 'অথচ (ইসলামের) এ পথই তোমার প্রতিপালকের সরল-সঠিক পথ, যারা নাসীহাত গ্রহণ করে আমি তাদের জন্য নিদর্শনাবলী বিশদভাবে বিবৃত করে দিয়েছি।', 'And this is the path of your Lord, [leading] straight. We have detailed the verses for a people who remember.', 'অথচ (ইসলামের) এ পথই তোমার প্রতিপালকের সরল-সঠিক পথ, যারা নাসীহাত গ্রহণ করে আমি তাদের জন্য নিদর্শনাবলী বিশদভাবে বিবৃত করে দিয়েছি।', 'And this is the path of your Lord, [leading] straight. We have detailed the verses for a people who remember.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006126.mp3', now()),
  (6, 127, '', '[{"id":77586,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"۞ لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77587,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"دَارُ","transliteration":"dāru","translation_bn":"ঘর","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77588,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّلَـٰمِ","transliteration":"l-salāmi","translation_bn":"শান্তির","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77589,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":77590,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"রবের তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77592,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77593,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيُّهُم","transliteration":"waliyyuhum","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক তাদের","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77594,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77595,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77596,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77597,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lahum dāru l-salāmi ʿinda rabbihim wahuwa waliyyuhum bimā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'তাদের জন্য তাদের প্রতিপালকের কাছে আছে শান্তিধাম, তিনিই তাদের পৃষ্ঠপোষক এজন্য যে তারা (সঠিক) ‘আমাল করেছিল।', 'For them will be the Home of Peace with their Lord. And He will be their protecting friend because of what they used to do.', 'তাদের জন্য তাদের প্রতিপালকের কাছে আছে শান্তিধাম, তিনিই তাদের পৃষ্ঠপোষক এজন্য যে তারা (সঠিক) ‘আমাল করেছিল।', 'For them will be the Home of Peace with their Lord. And He will be their protecting friend because of what they used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006127.mp3', now()),
  (6, 128, '', '[{"id":77598,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77599,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَحْشُرُهُمْ","transliteration":"yaḥshuruhum","translation_bn":"একত্র করবেন তাদের (আল্লাহ্‌)","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77600,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সকলকে (এবং বলবেন)","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77601,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمَعْشَرَ","transliteration":"yāmaʿshara","translation_bn":"হে সম্প্রদায়","root":"عشر","lemma":"مَعْشَر","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":77602,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِنِّ","transliteration":"l-jini","translation_bn":"জিনদের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77603,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَدِ","transliteration":"qadi","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":77604,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَكْثَرْتُم","transliteration":"is''takthartum","translation_bn":"অনেককে অনুগামী করেছো তোমরা","root":"كثر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْثَرْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77605,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77606,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-insi","translation_bn":"মানুষের\"","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77608,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77609,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآؤُهُم","transliteration":"awliyāuhum","translation_bn":"(যারা ছিলো) বন্ধুরা তাদের","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77610,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77611,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْإِنسِ","transliteration":"l-insi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77612,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَا","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"\"হে আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77613,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَمْتَعَ","transliteration":"is''tamtaʿa","translation_bn":"লাভবান হয়েছে","root":"متع","lemma":"ٱسْتَمْتَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77614,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُنَا","transliteration":"baʿḍunā","translation_bn":"অনেকে আমাদের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77615,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِبَعْضٍۢ","transliteration":"bibaʿḍin","translation_bn":"দ্বারা (অন্য) অনেকের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77616,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَبَلَغْنَآ","transliteration":"wabalaghnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা পৌঁছেছি","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَلَغَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77617,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلَنَا","transliteration":"ajalanā","translation_bn":"নির্ধারিত মেয়াদে আমাদের","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77618,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77619,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَجَّلْتَ","transliteration":"ajjalta","translation_bn":"তুমি নির্ধারিত করেছিলে","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77620,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لَنَا ۚ","transliteration":"lanā","translation_bn":"জন্যে আমাদের\"","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَا ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77622,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বলবেন তিনি","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77623,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارُ","transliteration":"l-nāru","translation_bn":"\"(জাহান্নামের) আগুনই","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77624,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مَثْوَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"mathwākum","translation_bn":"বাসস্থান তোমাদের","root":"ثوي","lemma":"مَثْوًى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77625,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"তোমরা চিরদিন থাকবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77626,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَآ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77627,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"তবে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":77628,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77629,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করবেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77630,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌ (সেটা ভিন্ন কথা)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77632,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":77633,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77634,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77635,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"মহাজ্ঞানী","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":77636,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"١٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma yaḥshuruhum jamīʿan yāmaʿshara l-jini qadi is''takthartum mina l-insi waqāla awliyāuhum mina l-insi rabbanā is''tamtaʿa baʿḍunā bibaʿḍin wabalaghnā ajalanā alladhī ajjalta lanā qāla l-nāru mathwākum khālidīna fīhā illā mā shāa l-lahu inna rabbaka ḥakīmun ʿalīmun', 'যেদিন তাদের সবাইকে একত্রিত করা হবে, (সেদিন আল্লাহ বলবেন) হে জ্বিন সমাজ! তোমরা মানব সমাজের উপর খুব বাড়াবাড়ি করেছ। মানব সমাজের মধ্য থেকে তাদের বন্ধুরা বলবে, হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমরা পরস্পরে পরস্পরের নিকট হতে লাভবান হয়েছি আর আমরা আমাদের নির্ধারিত সময়ে পৌঁছে গেছি যা তুমি আমাদের জন্য নির্ধারিত করেছিলে। আল্লাহ বলবেন, জাহান্নামই হল তোমাদের বাসস্থান, তার মধ্যেই হবে তোমাদের চিরবাস, তবে আল্লাহ যদি অন্যরূপ ইচ্ছে করেন (তবে তাই হবে)। তোমার প্রতিপালক কুশলী এবং সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], the Day when He will gather them together [and say], "O company of jinn, you have [misled] many of mankind." And their allies among mankind will say, "Our Lord, some of us made use of others, and we have [now] reached our term, which you appointed for us." He will say, "The Fire is your residence, wherein you will abide eternally, except for what Allah wills. Indeed, your Lord is Wise and Knowing."', 'যেদিন তাদের সবাইকে একত্রিত করা হবে, (সেদিন আল্লাহ বলবেন) হে জ্বিন সমাজ! তোমরা মানব সমাজের উপর খুব বাড়াবাড়ি করেছ। মানব সমাজের মধ্য থেকে তাদের বন্ধুরা বলবে, হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমরা পরস্পরে পরস্পরের নিকট হতে লাভবান হয়েছি আর আমরা আমাদের নির্ধারিত সময়ে পৌঁছে গেছি যা তুমি আমাদের জন্য নির্ধারিত করেছিলে। আল্লাহ বলবেন, জাহান্নামই হল তোমাদের বাসস্থান, তার মধ্যেই হবে তোমাদের চিরবাস, তবে আল্লাহ যদি অন্যরূপ ইচ্ছে করেন (তবে তাই হবে)। তোমার প্রতিপালক কুশলী এবং সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], the Day when He will gather them together [and say], "O company of jinn, you have [misled] many of mankind." And their allies among mankind will say, "Our Lord, some of us made use of others, and we have [now] reached our term, which you appointed for us." He will say, "The Fire is your residence, wherein you will abide eternally, except for what Allah wills. Indeed, your Lord is Wise and Knowing."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006128.mp3', now()),
  (6, 129, '', '[{"id":77851,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77852,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُوَلِّى","transliteration":"nuwallī","translation_bn":"বন্ধু বানাবো আমরা","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77853,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَ","transliteration":"baʿḍa","translation_bn":"কিছু অংশকে (অর্থাৎ একদলকে)","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77854,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77855,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضًۢا","transliteration":"baʿḍan","translation_bn":"কোনো অংশ (অর্থাৎ অন্য দল) দ্বারা","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77856,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77857,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77858,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَكْسِبُونَ","transliteration":"yaksibūna","translation_bn":"তারা অর্জন করতে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77859,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika nuwallī baʿḍa l-ẓālimīna baʿḍan bimā kānū yaksibūna', 'এভাবেই আমি (পরকালে) যালিমদেরকে পরস্পরের সঙ্গী বানিয়ে দেব সেই উপার্জনের বিনিময়ে যা তারা (দুনিয়াতে পরস্পরে এক সঙ্গে মিলে) করছিল।', 'And thus will We make some of the wrongdoers allies of others for what they used to earn.', 'এভাবেই আমি (পরকালে) যালিমদেরকে পরস্পরের সঙ্গী বানিয়ে দেব সেই উপার্জনের বিনিময়ে যা তারা (দুনিয়াতে পরস্পরে এক সঙ্গে মিলে) করছিল।', 'And thus will We make some of the wrongdoers allies of others for what they used to earn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006129.mp3', now()),
  (6, 130, '', '[{"id":77922,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰمَعْشَرَ","transliteration":"yāmaʿshara","translation_bn":"(বলা হবে) হে সসম্প্রদায়","root":"عشر","lemma":"مَعْشَر","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":77923,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِنِّ","transliteration":"l-jini","translation_bn":"জিনদের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77924,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْإِنسِ","transliteration":"wal-insi","translation_bn":"ও মানুষের","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77925,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"কি নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":77926,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِكُمْ","transliteration":"yatikum","translation_bn":"কাছে আসে তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77927,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رُسُلٌۭ","transliteration":"rusulun","translation_bn":"রাসূলগণ","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77928,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"মধ্যে হতে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77929,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَقُصُّونَ","transliteration":"yaquṣṣūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) বর্ণনা করতো","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77930,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77931,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِى","transliteration":"āyātī","translation_bn":"আমার নিদর্শনসমূহকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77932,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَيُنذِرُونَكُمْ","transliteration":"wayundhirūnakum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা সতর্ক করতো তোমাদেরকে","root":"نذر","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77933,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِقَآءَ","transliteration":"liqāa","translation_bn":"সাক্ষাতের","root":"لقي","lemma":"لِقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77934,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمِكُمْ","transliteration":"yawmikum","translation_bn":"দিনের তোমাদের (অর্থাৎ আখিরাতের)\"","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77935,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا ۚ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই\"","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":77937,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77938,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"شَهِدْنَا","transliteration":"shahid''nā","translation_bn":"\"সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছি আমরা","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77939,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77940,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِنَا ۖ","transliteration":"anfusinā","translation_bn":"নিজেদের আমাদের\"","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77942,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَغَرَّتْهُمُ","transliteration":"wagharrathumu","translation_bn":"কিন্তু প্রতারিত করেছে তাদেরকে","root":"غرر","lemma":"غَرَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77943,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","transliteration":"l-ḥayatu","translation_bn":"জীবন","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77944,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77945,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَشَهِدُوا۟","transliteration":"washahidū","translation_bn":"এবং (তখন) তারা সাক্ষ্য দিবে","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77946,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77947,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"নিজেদের তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77948,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":77949,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77950,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফির","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77951,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"١٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāmaʿshara l-jini wal-insi alam yatikum rusulun minkum yaquṣṣūna ʿalaykum āyātī wayundhirūnakum liqāa yawmikum hādhā qālū shahid''nā ʿalā anfusinā wagharrathumu l-ḥayatu l-dun''yā washahidū ʿalā anfusihim annahum kānū kāfirīna', '(আল্লাহ জিজ্ঞেস করবেন) হে জ্বিন ও মানব সমাজ! তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের মধ্য হতে কি রসূলগণ আসেননি যারা তোমাদের কাছে আমার আয়াত বর্ণনা করত আর এ দিনের সাথে যে সাক্ষাৎ ঘটবে সে ব্যাপারে তোমাদেরকে ভয় প্রদর্শন করত? তারা বলবে, আমরা আমাদের বিরুদ্ধে সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছি; মূলতঃ এ দুনিয়ার জীবন তাদেরকে প্রতারিত করেছে, তারা নিজেদের বিরুদ্ধে সাক্ষ্য দেবে যে তারা কাফির ছিল।', '"O company of jinn and mankind, did there not come to you messengers from among you, relating to you My verses and warning you of the meeting of this Day of yours?" They will say, "We bear witness against ourselves"; and the worldly life had deluded them, and they will bear witness against themselves that they were disbelievers.', '(আল্লাহ জিজ্ঞেস করবেন) হে জ্বিন ও মানব সমাজ! তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের মধ্য হতে কি রসূলগণ আসেননি যারা তোমাদের কাছে আমার আয়াত বর্ণনা করত আর এ দিনের সাথে যে সাক্ষাৎ ঘটবে সে ব্যাপারে তোমাদেরকে ভয় প্রদর্শন করত? তারা বলবে, আমরা আমাদের বিরুদ্ধে সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছি; মূলতঃ এ দুনিয়ার জীবন তাদেরকে প্রতারিত করেছে, তারা নিজেদের বিরুদ্ধে সাক্ষ্য দেবে যে তারা কাফির ছিল।', '"O company of jinn and mankind, did there not come to you messengers from among you, relating to you My verses and warning you of the meeting of this Day of yours?" They will say, "We bear witness against ourselves"; and the worldly life had deluded them, and they will bear witness against themselves that they were disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006130.mp3', now()),
  (6, 131, '', '[{"id":78069,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা (এ জন্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":78070,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":78071,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":78072,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَكُن","transliteration":"yakun","translation_bn":"ছিলেন","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78073,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَّبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78074,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مُهْلِكَ","transliteration":"muh''lika","translation_bn":"ধ্বংসকারী","root":"هلك","lemma":"مُهْلِك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78075,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرَىٰ","transliteration":"l-qurā","translation_bn":"কোনো জনপদকে","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78076,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِظُلْمٍۢ","transliteration":"biẓul''min","translation_bn":"অন্যায় দ্বারা","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظُلْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78077,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَهْلُهَا","transliteration":"wa-ahluhā","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় তার অধিবাসী (ছিলো)","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":78078,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"غَـٰفِلُونَ","transliteration":"ghāfilūna","translation_bn":"(পরিণতি সম্পর্কে) অনবহিত","root":"غفل","lemma":"غَٰفِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78079,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'dhālika an lam yakun rabbuka muh''lika l-qurā biẓul''min wa-ahluhā ghāfilūna', 'এটা এজন্য যে আল্লাহ কোন জনপদকে ধ্বংস করেন না অন্যায়ভাবে এবং (সত্যপথ কোনটি আর ভুলপথ কোনটি সে সম্পর্কে) যখন তারা থাকে অনবহিত।', 'That is because your Lord would not destroy the cities for wrongdoing while their people were unaware.', 'এটা এজন্য যে আল্লাহ কোন জনপদকে ধ্বংস করেন না অন্যায়ভাবে এবং (সত্যপথ কোনটি আর ভুলপথ কোনটি সে সম্পর্কে) যখন তারা থাকে অনবহিত।', 'That is because your Lord would not destroy the cities for wrongdoing while their people were unaware.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006131.mp3', now()),
  (6, 132, '', '[{"id":78147,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِكُلٍّۢ","transliteration":"walikullin","translation_bn":"এবং সবার জন্য (রয়েছে)","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78148,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"دَرَجَـٰتٌۭ","transliteration":"darajātun","translation_bn":"মর্যাদাসমূহ","root":"درج","lemma":"دَرَجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78149,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"সে অনুসারে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78150,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَمِلُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿamilū","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78152,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78153,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78154,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِغَـٰفِلٍ","transliteration":"bighāfilin","translation_bn":"অনবহিত","root":"غفل","lemma":"غَٰفِل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78155,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78156,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78157,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walikullin darajātun mimmā ʿamilū wamā rabbuka bighāfilin ʿammā yaʿmalūna', 'প্রত্যেককে তার ‘আমাল অনুযায়ী মর্যাদা দেয়া হবে আর তারা যা করে সে ব্যাপারে তোমার প্রতিপালক বে-খবর নন।', 'And for all are degrees from what they have done. And your Lord is not unaware of what they do.', 'প্রত্যেককে তার ‘আমাল অনুযায়ী মর্যাদা দেয়া হবে আর তারা যা করে সে ব্যাপারে তোমার প্রতিপালক বে-খবর নন।', 'And for all are degrees from what they have done. And your Lord is not unaware of what they do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006132.mp3', now()),
  (6, 133, '', '[{"id":78297,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَرَبُّكَ","transliteration":"warabbuka","translation_bn":"এবং তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78298,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَنِىُّ","transliteration":"l-ghaniyu","translation_bn":"অভাবমুক্ত","root":"غني","lemma":"غَنِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78299,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ذُو","transliteration":"dhū","translation_bn":"অধিকারী","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78300,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحْمَةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-raḥmati","translation_bn":"দয়ার","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78302,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":78303,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَشَأْ","transliteration":"yasha","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন তিনি","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78304,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُذْهِبْكُمْ","transliteration":"yudh''hib''kum","translation_bn":"অপসারিত করতে পারেন তোমাদের","root":"ذهب","lemma":"أَذْهَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78305,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَيَسْتَخْلِفْ","transliteration":"wayastakhlif","translation_bn":"ও স্থলাভিষিক্ত করতে পারেন","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱسْتَخْلَفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78306,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78307,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِكُم","transliteration":"baʿdikum","translation_bn":"পর তোমাদের","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78308,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":78309,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করবেন তিনি","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78310,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَمَآ","transliteration":"kamā","translation_bn":"যেমন","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78311,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنشَأَكُم","transliteration":"ansha-akum","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন তোমাদের","root":"نشا","lemma":"أَنشَأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78312,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78313,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ذُرِّيَّةِ","transliteration":"dhurriyyati","translation_bn":"বংশধরদের","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78314,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٍ","transliteration":"qawmin","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78315,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ءَاخَرِينَ","transliteration":"ākharīna","translation_bn":"অন্যান্য","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":78316,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'warabbuka l-ghaniyu dhū l-raḥmati in yasha yudh''hib''kum wayastakhlif min baʿdikum mā yashāu kamā ansha-akum min dhurriyyati qawmin ākharīna', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক অমুখাপেক্ষী, অত্যন্ত দয়াশীল। তিনি ইচ্ছে করলে তোমাদেরকে অপসারিত করবেন এবং যাকে ইচ্ছে তোমাদের স্থলাভিষিক্ত করবেন যেমন তিনি তোমাদেরকে অন্য সম্প্রদায়ের বংশ হতে সৃষ্টি করেছেন।', 'And your Lord is the Free of need, the possessor of mercy. If He wills, he can do away with you and give succession after you to whomever He wills, just as He produced you from the descendants of another people.', 'তোমার প্রতিপালক অমুখাপেক্ষী, অত্যন্ত দয়াশীল। তিনি ইচ্ছে করলে তোমাদেরকে অপসারিত করবেন এবং যাকে ইচ্ছে তোমাদের স্থলাভিষিক্ত করবেন যেমন তিনি তোমাদেরকে অন্য সম্প্রদায়ের বংশ হতে সৃষ্টি করেছেন।', 'And your Lord is the Free of need, the possessor of mercy. If He wills, he can do away with you and give succession after you to whomever He wills, just as He produced you from the descendants of another people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006133.mp3', now()),
  (6, 134, '', '[{"id":78346,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":78347,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":78348,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تُوعَدُونَ","transliteration":"tūʿadūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের প্রতিশ্রুতি দেয়া হচ্ছে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78349,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔاتٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"laātin","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تِي","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":78351,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78352,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُم","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা (সমর্থ হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":78353,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِمُعْجِزِينَ","transliteration":"bimuʿ''jizīna","translation_bn":"অক্ষম করতে (আল্লাহ্‌কে)","root":"عجز","lemma":"مُعْجِز","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78354,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna mā tūʿadūna laātin wamā antum bimuʿ''jizīna', 'যা ঘটবে বলে তোমাদেরকে ওয়াদা দেয়া হয়েছে তা ঘটবেই, তা ব্যর্থ করে দেয়ার ক্ষমতা তোমাদের নেই।', 'Indeed, what you are promised is coming, and you will not cause failure [to Allah].', 'যা ঘটবে বলে তোমাদেরকে ওয়াদা দেয়া হয়েছে তা ঘটবেই, তা ব্যর্থ করে দেয়ার ক্ষমতা তোমাদের নেই।', 'Indeed, what you are promised is coming, and you will not cause failure [to Allah].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006134.mp3', now()),
  (6, 135, '', '[{"id":78480,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78481,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":78482,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْمَلُوا۟","transliteration":"iʿ''malū","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78483,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78484,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَكَانَتِكُمْ","transliteration":"makānatikum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের জায়গায়","root":"كون","lemma":"مَكَانَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78485,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّى","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":78486,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَامِلٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿāmilun","translation_bn":"কর্মসম্পাদনকারী (নিজের স্হানে)","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَٰمِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78488,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78489,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78490,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":78491,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَكُونُ","transliteration":"takūnu","translation_bn":"হবে (এমন যে)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78492,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার (থাকবে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78493,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণামে","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78494,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدَّارِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-dāri","translation_bn":"(কল্যাণকর) আবাসস্থল","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78496,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তা (এমন সত্য যে)","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":78497,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":78498,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يُفْلِحُ","transliteration":"yuf''liḥu","translation_bn":"সফল হয়","root":"فلح","lemma":"أَفْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78499,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীরা\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78500,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul yāqawmi iʿ''malū ʿalā makānatikum innī ʿāmilun fasawfa taʿlamūna man takūnu lahu ʿāqibatu l-dāri innahu lā yuf''liḥu l-ẓālimūna', 'বল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা তোমাদের (ধর্মীয়) অবস্থানে থেকে যা করছ করে যাও, আমিও আমার কাজ করছি, তোমরা শীঘ্রই জানতে পারবে কল্যাণময় পরিণতি কার হবে। যালিমগণ কখনও সফলকাম হয় না।', 'Say, "O my people, work according to your position; [for] indeed, I am working. And you are going to know who will have succession in the home. Indeed, the wrongdoers will not succeed.', 'বল, ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা তোমাদের (ধর্মীয়) অবস্থানে থেকে যা করছ করে যাও, আমিও আমার কাজ করছি, তোমরা শীঘ্রই জানতে পারবে কল্যাণময় পরিণতি কার হবে। যালিমগণ কখনও সফলকাম হয় না।', 'Say, "O my people, work according to your position; [for] indeed, I am working. And you are going to know who will have succession in the home. Indeed, the wrongdoers will not succeed.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006135.mp3', now()),
  (6, 136, '', '[{"id":78703,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلُوا۟","transliteration":"wajaʿalū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা নির্দিষ্ট করেছে","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78704,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78705,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78706,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ذَرَأَ","transliteration":"dhara-a","translation_bn":"তিনি সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"ذرا","lemma":"ذَرَأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78707,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78708,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرْثِ","transliteration":"l-ḥarthi","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত ফসলের","root":"حرث","lemma":"حَرْث","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78709,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","transliteration":"wal-anʿāmi","translation_bn":"ও গবাদি পশুর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78710,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَصِيبًۭا","transliteration":"naṣīban","translation_bn":"এক অংশ","root":"نصب","lemma":"نَصِيب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78711,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"faqālū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78712,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"\"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":78713,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহ্‌র\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78714,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِزَعْمِهِمْ","transliteration":"bizaʿmihim","translation_bn":"অনুযায়ী ধারণা তাদের","root":"زعم","lemma":"زَعْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78715,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰذَا","transliteration":"wahādhā","translation_bn":"\"এবং (বল) এই (অন্য অংশটা)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78716,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِشُرَكَآئِنَا ۖ","transliteration":"lishurakāinā","translation_bn":"জন্যে আমাদের শরিকদের\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78718,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78719,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78720,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لِشُرَكَآئِهِمْ","transliteration":"lishurakāihim","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের শরিকদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78721,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তবে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":78722,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَصِلُ","transliteration":"yaṣilu","translation_bn":"পৌঁছায়","root":"وصل","lemma":"يَصِلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78723,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78724,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":78726,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"অথচ যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78727,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78728,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78729,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَهُوَ","transliteration":"fahuwa","translation_bn":"পরে তা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":78730,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يَصِلُ","transliteration":"yaṣilu","translation_bn":"পৌঁছায়","root":"وصل","lemma":"يَصِلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78731,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78732,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآئِهِمْ ۗ","transliteration":"shurakāihim","translation_bn":"শরিকদের তাদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78734,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"سَآءَ","transliteration":"sāa","translation_bn":"নিকৃষ্ট","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78735,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":78736,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"يَحْكُمُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥkumūna","translation_bn":"তারা মীমাংসা করে","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78737,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"١٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajaʿalū lillahi mimmā dhara-a mina l-ḥarthi wal-anʿāmi naṣīban faqālū hādhā lillahi bizaʿmihim wahādhā lishurakāinā famā kāna lishurakāihim falā yaṣilu ilā l-lahi wamā kāna lillahi fahuwa yaṣilu ilā shurakāihim sāa mā yaḥkumūna', 'আল্লাহ যে শস্য ও গবাদি পশু সৃষ্টি করেছেন তাত্থেকে তারা আল্লাহর জন্য একটা অংশ নির্দিষ্ট করে আর তারা তাদের ধারণামত বলে এ অংশ আল্লাহর জন্য, আর এ অংশ আমাদের দেবদেবীদের জন্য। যে অংশ তাদের দেবদেবীদের জন্য তা আল্লাহর নিকট পৌঁছে না, কিন্তু যে অংশ আল্লাহর তা তাদের দেবদেবীদের নিকট পৌঁছে। কতই না নিকৃষ্ট এই লোকদের ফায়সালা!', 'And the polytheists assign to Allah from that which He created of crops and livestock a share and say, "This is for Allah," by their claim, "and this is for our partners [associated with Him]." But what is for their "partners" does not reach Allah, while what is for Allah - this reaches their "partners." Evil is that which they rule.', 'আল্লাহ যে শস্য ও গবাদি পশু সৃষ্টি করেছেন তাত্থেকে তারা আল্লাহর জন্য একটা অংশ নির্দিষ্ট করে আর তারা তাদের ধারণামত বলে এ অংশ আল্লাহর জন্য, আর এ অংশ আমাদের দেবদেবীদের জন্য। যে অংশ তাদের দেবদেবীদের জন্য তা আল্লাহর নিকট পৌঁছে না, কিন্তু যে অংশ আল্লাহর তা তাদের দেবদেবীদের নিকট পৌঁছে। কতই না নিকৃষ্ট এই লোকদের ফায়সালা!', 'And the polytheists assign to Allah from that which He created of crops and livestock a share and say, "This is for Allah," by their claim, "and this is for our partners [associated with Him]." But what is for their "partners" does not reach Allah, while what is for Allah - this reaches their "partners." Evil is that which they rule.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006136.mp3', now()),
  (6, 137, '', '[{"id":78738,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78739,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"زَيَّنَ","transliteration":"zayyana","translation_bn":"শোভন করা করেছে","root":"زين","lemma":"زَيَّنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78740,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِكَثِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"likathīrin","translation_bn":"জন্যে অনেকের","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78741,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78742,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"l-mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরিকদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78743,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَتْلَ","transliteration":"qatla","translation_bn":"হত্যা করাকে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78744,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلَـٰدِهِمْ","transliteration":"awlādihim","translation_bn":"সন্তানদের তাদের","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78745,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآؤُهُمْ","transliteration":"shurakāuhum","translation_bn":"শরিকরা তাদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78746,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِيُرْدُوهُمْ","transliteration":"liyur''dūhum","translation_bn":"যেন তারা ধ্বংস করে তাদেরকে","root":"ردي","lemma":"أَرْدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78747,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيَلْبِسُوا۟","transliteration":"waliyalbisū","translation_bn":"এবং যেন তারা দুর্বোধ্য করে","root":"لبس","lemma":"لَبَسْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78748,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78749,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"دِينَهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"dīnahum","translation_bn":"দীনকে তাদের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78751,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78752,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78753,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":78754,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":78755,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلُوهُ ۖ","transliteration":"faʿalūhu","translation_bn":"তারা করত তা","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78757,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَذَرْهُمْ","transliteration":"fadharhum","translation_bn":"অতএব ছেড়ে দাও তাদেরকে","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78758,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78759,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaftarūna","translation_bn":"তারা রচনা করেছে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78760,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"١٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika zayyana likathīrin mina l-mush''rikīna qatla awlādihim shurakāuhum liyur''dūhum waliyalbisū ʿalayhim dīnahum walaw shāa l-lahu mā faʿalūhu fadharhum wamā yaftarūna', 'আর এভাবে তাদের দেবদেবীরা বহু মুশরিকদের চোখে নিজেদের সন্তান হত্যাকে আকর্ষণীয় করে দিয়েছে তাদেরকে ধ্বংস করার জন্য এবং তাদের দ্বীনকে সন্দেহপূর্ণ করার জন্য। আল্লাহ যদি ইচ্ছে করতেন তবে তারা তা করতে পারত না, কাজেই তাদেরকে ছেড়ে দাও, তারা তাদের মিথ্যে নিয়ে মগ্ন থাকুক।', 'And likewise, to many of the polytheists their partners have made [to seem] pleasing the killing of their children in order to bring about their destruction and to cover them with confusion in their religion. And if Allah had willed, they would not have done so. So leave them and that which they invent.', 'আর এভাবে তাদের দেবদেবীরা বহু মুশরিকদের চোখে নিজেদের সন্তান হত্যাকে আকর্ষণীয় করে দিয়েছে তাদেরকে ধ্বংস করার জন্য এবং তাদের দ্বীনকে সন্দেহপূর্ণ করার জন্য। আল্লাহ যদি ইচ্ছে করতেন তবে তারা তা করতে পারত না, কাজেই তাদেরকে ছেড়ে দাও, তারা তাদের মিথ্যে নিয়ে মগ্ন থাকুক।', 'And likewise, to many of the polytheists their partners have made [to seem] pleasing the killing of their children in order to bring about their destruction and to cover them with confusion in their religion. And if Allah had willed, they would not have done so. So leave them and that which they invent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006137.mp3', now()),
  (6, 138, '', '[{"id":78892,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78893,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"\"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":78894,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنْعَـٰمٌۭ","transliteration":"anʿāmun","translation_bn":"গবাদিপশুগুলো","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78895,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَحَرْثٌ","transliteration":"waḥarthun","translation_bn":"ও ক্ষেত ফসল","root":"حرث","lemma":"حَرْث","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78896,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"حِجْرٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥij''run","translation_bn":"সুরক্ষিত","root":"حجر","lemma":"حِجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":78897,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":78898,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَطْعَمُهَآ","transliteration":"yaṭʿamuhā","translation_bn":"খাবে তা","root":"طعم","lemma":"طَعِمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78899,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":78900,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":78901,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَّشَآءُ","transliteration":"nashāu","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছা করিবো আমরা\"","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78902,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِزَعْمِهِمْ","transliteration":"bizaʿmihim","translation_bn":"অনুযায়ী ধারণা তাদের","root":"زعم","lemma":"زَعْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78903,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنْعَـٰمٌ","transliteration":"wa-anʿāmun","translation_bn":"এবং (কিছু) গবাদিপশু","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78904,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حُرِّمَتْ","transliteration":"ḥurrimat","translation_bn":"নিষিদ্ধ করা হয়েছে","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78905,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ظُهُورُهَا","transliteration":"ẓuhūruhā","translation_bn":"পিঠগুলোতে তাদের(কিছু উঠাতে)","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَهْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78906,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنْعَـٰمٌۭ","transliteration":"wa-anʿāmun","translation_bn":"ও (কিছু) গবাদিপশু","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78907,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":78908,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَذْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"yadhkurūna","translation_bn":"তারা উচ্চারণ করে (জবাই করার সময়)","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78909,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْمَ","transliteration":"is''ma","translation_bn":"নাম","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78910,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":78911,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78912,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱفْتِرَآءً","transliteration":"if''tirāan","translation_bn":"তারা মিথ্যা রচনা করে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتِرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78913,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78915,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"سَيَجْزِيهِم","transliteration":"sayajzīhim","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই প্রতিফল দিবেন তাদের","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":78916,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78917,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78918,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaftarūna","translation_bn":"তারা মিথ্যা রচনা করতে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78919,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"١٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū hādhihi anʿāmun waḥarthun ḥij''run lā yaṭʿamuhā illā man nashāu bizaʿmihim wa-anʿāmun ḥurrimat ẓuhūruhā wa-anʿāmun lā yadhkurūna is''ma l-lahi ʿalayhā if''tirāan ʿalayhi sayajzīhim bimā kānū yaftarūna', 'তারা তাদের ধারণা অনুসারে বলে, এই এই গবাদি পশু ও ফসল সুরক্ষিত। আমরা যার জন্য ইচ্ছে করব সে ছাড়া কেউ এগুলো খেতে পারবে না। এ সব তাদের কল্পিত। কতক গবাদি পশুর পিঠে চড়া নিষিদ্ধ করা হয়েছে, কতক গবাদি পশু যবহ করার সময় তারা আল্লাহর নাম নেয় না, (এসব বাধা-নিষেধ) আল্লাহর প্রতি মিথ্যে রচনা স্বরূপ করে থাকে। এসব মিথ্যে রচনার প্রতিফল তিনি শীঘ্রই তাদেরকে প্রদান করবেন।', 'And they say, "These animals and crops are forbidden; no one may eat from them except whom we will," by their claim. And there are those [camels] whose backs are forbidden [by them] and those upon which the name of Allah is not mentioned - [all of this] an invention of untruth about Him. He will punish them for what they were inventing.', 'তারা তাদের ধারণা অনুসারে বলে, এই এই গবাদি পশু ও ফসল সুরক্ষিত। আমরা যার জন্য ইচ্ছে করব সে ছাড়া কেউ এগুলো খেতে পারবে না। এ সব তাদের কল্পিত। কতক গবাদি পশুর পিঠে চড়া নিষিদ্ধ করা হয়েছে, কতক গবাদি পশু যবহ করার সময় তারা আল্লাহর নাম নেয় না, (এসব বাধা-নিষেধ) আল্লাহর প্রতি মিথ্যে রচনা স্বরূপ করে থাকে। এসব মিথ্যে রচনার প্রতিফল তিনি শীঘ্রই তাদেরকে প্রদান করবেন।', 'And they say, "These animals and crops are forbidden; no one may eat from them except whom we will," by their claim. And there are those [camels] whose backs are forbidden [by them] and those upon which the name of Allah is not mentioned - [all of this] an invention of untruth about Him. He will punish them for what they were inventing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006138.mp3', now()),
  (6, 139, '', '[{"id":78968,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78969,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":78970,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78971,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بُطُونِ","transliteration":"buṭūni","translation_bn":"পেটের","root":"بطن","lemma":"بَطْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78972,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":78973,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","transliteration":"l-anʿāmi","translation_bn":"গবাদিপশুগুলোর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":78974,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"خَالِصَةٌۭ","transliteration":"khāliṣatun","translation_bn":"বিশেষভাবে (নির্দিষ্ট)","root":"خلص","lemma":"خَالِصَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78975,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِّذُكُورِنَا","transliteration":"lidhukūrinā","translation_bn":"জন্যে পুরুষদের আমাদের","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78976,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمُحَرَّمٌ","transliteration":"wamuḥarramun","translation_bn":"ও নিষিদ্ধ","root":"حرم","lemma":"مُحَرَّم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78977,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"জন্য","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78978,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَزْوَٰجِنَا ۖ","transliteration":"azwājinā","translation_bn":"স্ত্রীদের আমাদের","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78980,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":78981,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَكُن","transliteration":"yakun","translation_bn":"তা হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":78982,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَّيْتَةًۭ","transliteration":"maytatan","translation_bn":"মৃত","root":"موت","lemma":"مَيْتَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78983,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَهُمْ","transliteration":"fahum","translation_bn":"তবে তারা (নারী পুরুষ উভয়)","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":78984,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার\"","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":78985,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"shurakāu","translation_bn":"(খাওয়ায়) অংশীদার হবে\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78987,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"سَيَجْزِيهِمْ","transliteration":"sayajzīhim","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই প্রতিফল দিবেন তিনি তাদের","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":78988,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَصْفَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"waṣfahum","translation_bn":"(এরূপ)বিশ্লেষণের তাদের","root":"وصف","lemma":"وَصْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78990,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":78991,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":78992,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"মহাজ্ঞানী","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":78993,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqālū mā fī buṭūni hādhihi l-anʿāmi khāliṣatun lidhukūrinā wamuḥarramun ʿalā azwājinā wa-in yakun maytatan fahum fīhi shurakāu sayajzīhim waṣfahum innahu ḥakīmun ʿalīmun', 'তারা আরো বলে, এসব গবাদি পশুর গর্ভে যা আছে তা আমাদের পুরুষদের জন্য নির্দিষ্ট, আর আমাদের স্ত্রীলোকদের জন্য নিষিদ্ধ, কিন্তু তা (অর্থাৎ গর্ভস্থিত বাচ্চা) যদি মৃত হয় তবে সকলের তাতে অংশ আছে। তাদের এই মিথ্যে রচনার প্রতিফল অচিরেই তিনি তাদেরকে দেবেন, তিনি বড়ই হিকমাতওয়ালা, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And they say, "What is in the bellies of these animals is exclusively for our males and forbidden to our females. But if it is [born] dead, then all of them have shares therein." He will punish them for their description. Indeed, He is Wise and Knowing.', 'তারা আরো বলে, এসব গবাদি পশুর গর্ভে যা আছে তা আমাদের পুরুষদের জন্য নির্দিষ্ট, আর আমাদের স্ত্রীলোকদের জন্য নিষিদ্ধ, কিন্তু তা (অর্থাৎ গর্ভস্থিত বাচ্চা) যদি মৃত হয় তবে সকলের তাতে অংশ আছে। তাদের এই মিথ্যে রচনার প্রতিফল অচিরেই তিনি তাদেরকে দেবেন, তিনি বড়ই হিকমাতওয়ালা, সর্বজ্ঞ।', 'And they say, "What is in the bellies of these animals is exclusively for our males and forbidden to our females. But if it is [born] dead, then all of them have shares therein." He will punish them for their description. Indeed, He is Wise and Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006139.mp3', now()),
  (6, 140, '', '[{"id":79131,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":79132,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خَسِرَ","transliteration":"khasira","translation_bn":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়েছে","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَسِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79133,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":79134,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَتَلُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qatalū","translation_bn":"হত্যা করেছে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79135,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلَـٰدَهُمْ","transliteration":"awlādahum","translation_bn":"সন্তানদেরকে তাদের","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79136,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَفَهًۢا","transliteration":"safahan","translation_bn":"নির্বুদ্ধিতার কারণে","root":"سفه","lemma":"سَفَه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79137,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79138,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"কোনো জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79139,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَحَرَّمُوا۟","transliteration":"waḥarramū","translation_bn":"ও তারা নিষিদ্ধ করেছে","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79140,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":79141,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقَهُمُ","transliteration":"razaqahumu","translation_bn":"জীবিকা‌ দিয়েছেন তাদের","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79142,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":79143,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱفْتِرَآءً","transliteration":"if''tirāan","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা রচনা করে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتِرَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79144,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79145,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":79147,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":79148,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ضَلُّوا۟","transliteration":"ḍallū","translation_bn":"তারা পথভ্রষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79149,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79150,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79151,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مُهْتَدِينَ","transliteration":"muh''tadīna","translation_bn":"সৎপথ প্রাপ্ত","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُّهْتَدُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79152,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"١٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qad khasira alladhīna qatalū awlādahum safahan bighayri ʿil''min waḥarramū mā razaqahumu l-lahu if''tirāan ʿalā l-lahi qad ḍallū wamā kānū muh''tadīna', 'যারা মূর্খের মত না জেনে তাদের সন্তানদের হত্যা করেছে আর আল্লাহর নামে মিথ্যে কথা বানিয়ে নেয়ার মাধ্যমে আল্লাহর দেয়া জীবিকাকে হারাম করে নিয়েছে, তারা নিশ্চিতরূপে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়েছে। তারা পথভ্রষ্ট হয়ে গেছে আর তারা কস্মিনকালেও হিদায়াতপ্রাপ্ত ছিল না।', 'Those will have lost who killed their children in foolishness without knowledge and prohibited what Allah had provided for them, inventing untruth about Allah. They have gone astray and were not [rightly] guided.', 'যারা মূর্খের মত না জেনে তাদের সন্তানদের হত্যা করেছে আর আল্লাহর নামে মিথ্যে কথা বানিয়ে নেয়ার মাধ্যমে আল্লাহর দেয়া জীবিকাকে হারাম করে নিয়েছে, তারা নিশ্চিতরূপে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়েছে। তারা পথভ্রষ্ট হয়ে গেছে আর তারা কস্মিনকালেও হিদায়াতপ্রাপ্ত ছিল না।', 'Those will have lost who killed their children in foolishness without knowledge and prohibited what Allah had provided for them, inventing untruth about Allah. They have gone astray and were not [rightly] guided.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006140.mp3', now()),
  (6, 141, '', '[{"id":79259,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"۞ وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79260,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":79261,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنشَأَ","transliteration":"ansha-a","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"نشا","lemma":"أَنشَأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79262,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"jannātin","translation_bn":"বাগানসমূহ","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79263,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّعْرُوشَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"maʿrūshātin","translation_bn":"মাচার উপর চড়ান (অর্থাৎ লতা জাতীয়)","root":"عرش","lemma":"مَّعْرُوشَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":79264,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَغَيْرَ","transliteration":"waghayra","translation_bn":"ও নয়","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79265,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَعْرُوشَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"maʿrūshātin","translation_bn":"মাচার উপর চড়ান (অর্থাৎ কান্ড বিশিষ্ট)","root":"عرش","lemma":"مَّعْرُوشَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79266,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّخْلَ","transliteration":"wal-nakhla","translation_bn":"এবং খেজুর গাছ","root":"نخل","lemma":"نَخْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79267,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلزَّرْعَ","transliteration":"wal-zarʿa","translation_bn":"ও ফসল","root":"زرع","lemma":"زَرْع","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79268,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُخْتَلِفًا","transliteration":"mukh''talifan","translation_bn":"বিভিন্ন","root":"خلف","lemma":"مُّخْتَلِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79269,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أُكُلُهُۥ","transliteration":"ukuluhu","translation_bn":"স্বাদ তার","root":"اكل","lemma":"أُكُل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79270,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلزَّيْتُونَ","transliteration":"wal-zaytūna","translation_bn":"ও জলপাই","root":"زيت","lemma":"زَّيْتُون","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79271,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلرُّمَّانَ","transliteration":"wal-rumāna","translation_bn":"ও আনার","root":"رمن","lemma":"رُّمَّان","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79272,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُتَشَـٰبِهًۭا","transliteration":"mutashābihan","translation_bn":"সদৃশ","root":"شبه","lemma":"مُتَشَٰبِه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79273,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَغَيْرَ","transliteration":"waghayra","translation_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79274,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُتَشَـٰبِهٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"mutashābihin","translation_bn":"সদৃশ","root":"شبه","lemma":"مُتَشَٰبِه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79276,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كُلُوا۟","transliteration":"kulū","translation_bn":"তোমরা খাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79277,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79278,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ثَمَرِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"thamarihi","translation_bn":"ফল তার","root":"ثمر","lemma":"ثَمَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79279,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِذَآ","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":79280,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَثْمَرَ","transliteration":"athmara","translation_bn":"ফলবান হয়","root":"ثمر","lemma":"أَثْمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79281,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاتُوا۟","transliteration":"waātū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা দাও","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79282,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّهُۥ","transliteration":"ḥaqqahu","translation_bn":"অধিকার তার (অর্থাৎ ওশর)","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79283,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":79284,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"حَصَادِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"ḥaṣādihi","translation_bn":"কাটার তার","root":"حصد","lemma":"حَصَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79286,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79287,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"تُسْرِفُوٓا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"tus''rifū","translation_bn":"তোমরা অপব্যয় করো","root":"سرف","lemma":"أَسْرَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79289,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":79290,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":79291,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"ভালোবাসেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79292,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُسْرِفِينَ","transliteration":"l-mus''rifīna","translation_bn":"অপব্যয়কারীদেরকে","root":"سرف","lemma":"مُسْرِف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79293,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"١٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī ansha-a jannātin maʿrūshātin waghayra maʿrūshātin wal-nakhla wal-zarʿa mukh''talifan ukuluhu wal-zaytūna wal-rumāna mutashābihan waghayra mutashābihin kulū min thamarihi idhā athmara waātū ḥaqqahu yawma ḥaṣādihi walā tus''rifū innahu lā yuḥibbu l-mus''rifīna', 'আর তিনি (আল্লাহ) যিনি লতাগুল্ম বিশিষ্ট আর লতা-বিশিষ্ট নয় এমন উদ্যানরাজি, খেজুর গাছ ও বিভিন্ন স্বাদের খাদ্যশস্য, একই ধরনের ও আলাদা ধরনের যায়তুন ও ডালিম সৃষ্টি করেছেন। যখন ফল ধরে তখন ফল খাও, আর ফসল তোলার দিন (নির্ধারিত ওশর ও অনির্ধারিত দানের মাধ্যমে) হক আদায় কর, অপচয় করো না, নিশ্চয় তিনি অপচয়কারীদের পছন্দ করেন না।', 'And He it is who causes gardens to grow, [both] trellised and untrellised, and palm trees and crops of different [kinds of] food and olives and pomegranates, similar and dissimilar. Eat of [each of] its fruit when it yields and give its due [zakah] on the day of its harvest. And be not excessive. Indeed, He does not like those who commit excess.', 'আর তিনি (আল্লাহ) যিনি লতাগুল্ম বিশিষ্ট আর লতা-বিশিষ্ট নয় এমন উদ্যানরাজি, খেজুর গাছ ও বিভিন্ন স্বাদের খাদ্যশস্য, একই ধরনের ও আলাদা ধরনের যায়তুন ও ডালিম সৃষ্টি করেছেন। যখন ফল ধরে তখন ফল খাও, আর ফসল তোলার দিন (নির্ধারিত ওশর ও অনির্ধারিত দানের মাধ্যমে) হক আদায় কর, অপচয় করো না, নিশ্চয় তিনি অপচয়কারীদের পছন্দ করেন না।', 'And He it is who causes gardens to grow, [both] trellised and untrellised, and palm trees and crops of different [kinds of] food and olives and pomegranates, similar and dissimilar. Eat of [each of] its fruit when it yields and give its due [zakah] on the day of its harvest. And be not excessive. Indeed, He does not like those who commit excess.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006141.mp3', now()),
  (6, 142, '', '[{"id":79392,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"এবং (তিনিই সৃষ্টি করেছেন) মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79393,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","transliteration":"l-anʿāmi","translation_bn":"গবাদিপশুর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79394,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"حَمُولَةًۭ","transliteration":"ḥamūlatan","translation_bn":"ভারবাহী পশু (যেমন উট, গরু)","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمُولَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79395,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَفَرْشًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"wafarshan","translation_bn":"আবার ছোট আকারের পশু (যেমন ছাগল, ভেড়া)","root":"فرش","lemma":"فَرْش","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79397,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُلُوا۟","transliteration":"kulū","translation_bn":"তোমরা খাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79398,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79399,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَزَقَكُمُ","transliteration":"razaqakumu","translation_bn":"জীবিকা‌ দিয়েছেন তোমাদের","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79400,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":79401,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79402,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّبِعُوا۟","transliteration":"tattabiʿū","translation_bn":"তোমরা অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79403,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"خُطُوَٰتِ","transliteration":"khuṭuwāti","translation_bn":"পদাঙ্কসমূহের","root":"خطو","lemma":"خُطُوَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79404,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-shayṭāni","translation_bn":"শয়তানের","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79406,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই সে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":79407,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79408,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوٌّۭ","transliteration":"ʿaduwwun","translation_bn":"শত্রু","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79409,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌۭ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"প্রকাশ্য","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":79410,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamina l-anʿāmi ḥamūlatan wafarshan kulū mimmā razaqakumu l-lahu walā tattabiʿū khuṭuwāti l-shayṭāni innahu lakum ʿaduwwun mubīnun', 'গবাদি পশুর মধ্যে কতক আছে ভারবাহী আর কতক আছে গোশত ও আচ্ছাদনের সামগ্রী দানকারী, আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে যে রিয্ক্ব দিয়েছেন তাত্থেকে ভক্ষণ কর আর শায়ত্বনের পদাঙ্ক অনুসরণ করো না, সে তোমাদের খোলাখুলি দুশমন।', 'And of the grazing livestock are carriers [of burdens] and those [too] small. Eat of what Allah has provided for you and do not follow the footsteps of Satan. Indeed, he is to you a clear enemy.', 'গবাদি পশুর মধ্যে কতক আছে ভারবাহী আর কতক আছে গোশত ও আচ্ছাদনের সামগ্রী দানকারী, আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে যে রিয্ক্ব দিয়েছেন তাত্থেকে ভক্ষণ কর আর শায়ত্বনের পদাঙ্ক অনুসরণ করো না, সে তোমাদের খোলাখুলি দুশমন।', 'And of the grazing livestock are carriers [of burdens] and those [too] small. Eat of what Allah has provided for you and do not follow the footsteps of Satan. Indeed, he is to you a clear enemy.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006142.mp3', now()),
  (6, 143, '', '[{"id":79573,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثَمَـٰنِيَةَ","transliteration":"thamāniyata","translation_bn":"(এসব পশু) আট","root":"ثمن","lemma":"ثَمَٰنِيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79574,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَزْوَٰجٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"azwājin","translation_bn":"প্রকার","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79576,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"(যেমন) মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79577,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضَّأْنِ","transliteration":"l-ḍani","translation_bn":"মেষ (শ্রেণীর)","root":"ضان","lemma":"ضَّأْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79578,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱثْنَيْنِ","transliteration":"ith''nayni","translation_bn":"দু''টি (অর্থাৎ নর ও মাদী)","root":"ثني","lemma":"ٱثْنَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79579,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79580,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَعْزِ","transliteration":"l-maʿzi","translation_bn":"ছাগল (শ্রেণীর)","root":"معز","lemma":"مَعْز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79581,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱثْنَيْنِ ۗ","transliteration":"ith''nayni","translation_bn":"দু''টি (অর্থাৎ নর ও মাদী)","root":"ثني","lemma":"ٱثْنَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79583,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79584,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ءَآلذَّكَرَيْنِ","transliteration":"āldhakarayni","translation_bn":"\"কি নর দু''টিকে","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَر","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":79585,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمَ","transliteration":"ḥarrama","translation_bn":"নিষিদ্ধ করেছেন (আল্লাহ্‌)","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79586,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَمِ","transliteration":"ami","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79587,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُنثَيَيْنِ","transliteration":"l-unthayayni","translation_bn":"মাদি দু''টিকে","root":"انث","lemma":"أُنثَيَيْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79588,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَمَّا","transliteration":"ammā","translation_bn":"অথবা যা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79589,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱشْتَمَلَتْ","transliteration":"ish''tamalat","translation_bn":"ধারণ করেছে","root":"شمل","lemma":"ٱشْتَمَلَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79590,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"কাছে তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79591,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَرْحَامُ","transliteration":"arḥāmu","translation_bn":"গর্ভসমূহ (অর্থাৎ বাচ্চা)","root":"رحم","lemma":"أَرْحَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79592,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأُنثَيَيْنِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-unthayayni","translation_bn":"মাদি দু''টির","root":"انث","lemma":"أُنثَيَيْن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79594,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"نَبِّـُٔونِى","transliteration":"nabbiūnī","translation_bn":"আমাকে তোমরা জানাও","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79595,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِعِلْمٍ","transliteration":"biʿil''min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79596,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":79597,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"হও তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79598,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79599,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"١٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thamāniyata azwājin mina l-ḍani ith''nayni wamina l-maʿzi ith''nayni qul āldhakarayni ḥarrama ami l-unthayayni ammā ish''tamalat ʿalayhi arḥāmu l-unthayayni nabbiūnī biʿil''min in kuntum ṣādiqīna', '(নর-মাদী চার) জোড়ায় আট প্রকার, মেষের দু’টি, ছাগলের দু’টি। বল, তিনি কি নর দু’টি হারাম করেছেন, না মাদী দু’টি কিংবা মাদী দু’টির গর্ভে যা আছে তা? এ সম্পর্কিত জ্ঞানের ভিত্তিতে জবাব দাও যদি তোমরা সত্যবাদী হয়ে থাক।', '[They are] eight mates - of the sheep, two and of the goats, two. Say, "Is it the two males He has forbidden or the two females or that which the wombs of the two females contain? Inform me with knowledge, if you should be truthful."', '(নর-মাদী চার) জোড়ায় আট প্রকার, মেষের দু’টি, ছাগলের দু’টি। বল, তিনি কি নর দু’টি হারাম করেছেন, না মাদী দু’টি কিংবা মাদী দু’টির গর্ভে যা আছে তা? এ সম্পর্কিত জ্ঞানের ভিত্তিতে জবাব দাও যদি তোমরা সত্যবাদী হয়ে থাক।', '[They are] eight mates - of the sheep, two and of the goats, two. Say, "Is it the two males He has forbidden or the two females or that which the wombs of the two females contain? Inform me with knowledge, if you should be truthful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006143.mp3', now()),
