oot":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79626,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنْ","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"অতএব কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79627,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"أَظْلَمُ","transliteration":"aẓlamu","translation_bn":"বড় সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী (হতে পারে)","root":"ظلم","lemma":"أَظْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79628,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّنِ","transliteration":"mimmani","translation_bn":"তার চেয়ে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79629,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","transliteration":"if''tarā","translation_bn":"রচনা করে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79630,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79631,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":79632,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"كَذِبًۭا","transliteration":"kadhiban","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79633,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"لِّيُضِلَّ","transliteration":"liyuḍilla","translation_bn":"জন্যে পথভ্রষ্ট করার","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79634,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79635,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"بِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"bighayri","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79636,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍ ۗ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"কোনো জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79638,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":79639,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":79640,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":79641,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"সৎপথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79642,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-qawma","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে\"","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79643,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"(যারা) সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী\"","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79644,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"١٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamina l-ibili ith''nayni wamina l-baqari ith''nayni qul āldhakarayni ḥarrama ami l-unthayayni ammā ish''tamalat ʿalayhi arḥāmu l-unthayayni am kuntum shuhadāa idh waṣṣākumu l-lahu bihādhā faman aẓlamu mimmani if''tarā ʿalā l-lahi kadhiban liyuḍilla l-nāsa bighayri ʿil''min inna l-laha lā yahdī l-qawma l-ẓālimīna', 'আর উটের দু’টি, আর গরুর দু’টি। বল, এদের নর দু’টি কি তিনি হারাম করেছেন, না মাদী দু’টি অথবা মাদী দু’টির গর্ভে যা আছে তা? তোমরা কি তখন উপস্থিত ছিলে যখন আল্লাহ এ রকম নির্দেশ দিয়েছিলেন? যে ব্যক্তি মানুষদেরকে পথভ্রষ্ট করার উদ্দেশ্যে কোন রকম ‘ইলম ছাড়াই আল্লাহর সম্বন্ধে মিথ্যে রচনা করে তার থেকে বড় যালিম আর কে হতে পারে? বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ যালিম সম্প্রদায়কে হিদায়াত দান করেন না।', 'And of the camels, two and of the cattle, two. Say, "Is it the two males He has forbidden or the two females or that which the wombs of the two females contain? Or were you witnesses when Allah charged you with this? Then who is more unjust than one who invents a lie about Allah to mislead the people by [something] other than knowledge? Indeed, Allah does not guide the wrongdoing people."', 'আর উটের দু’টি, আর গরুর দু’টি। বল, এদের নর দু’টি কি তিনি হারাম করেছেন, না মাদী দু’টি অথবা মাদী দু’টির গর্ভে যা আছে তা? তোমরা কি তখন উপস্থিত ছিলে যখন আল্লাহ এ রকম নির্দেশ দিয়েছিলেন? যে ব্যক্তি মানুষদেরকে পথভ্রষ্ট করার উদ্দেশ্যে কোন রকম ‘ইলম ছাড়াই আল্লাহর সম্বন্ধে মিথ্যে রচনা করে তার থেকে বড় যালিম আর কে হতে পারে? বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ যালিম সম্প্রদায়কে হিদায়াত দান করেন না।', 'And of the camels, two and of the cattle, two. Say, "Is it the two males He has forbidden or the two females or that which the wombs of the two females contain? Or were you witnesses when Allah charged you with this? Then who is more unjust than one who invents a lie about Allah to mislead the people by [something] other than knowledge? Indeed, Allah does not guide the wrongdoing people."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006144.mp3', now()),
  (6, 145, '', '[{"id":79829,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79830,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":79831,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَجِدُ","transliteration":"ajidu","translation_bn":"\"পাই আমি","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79832,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79833,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(তার) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":79834,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُوحِىَ","transliteration":"ūḥiya","translation_bn":"ওহী করা হয়েছে","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79835,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"আমার প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79836,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مُحَرَّمًا","transliteration":"muḥarraman","translation_bn":"নিষিদ্ধ হিসেবে","root":"حرم","lemma":"مُحَرَّم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79837,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79838,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"طَاعِمٍۢ","transliteration":"ṭāʿimin","translation_bn":"খাদ্য গ্রহণকারীর","root":"طعم","lemma":"طَاعِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79839,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَطْعَمُهُۥٓ","transliteration":"yaṭʿamuhu","translation_bn":"সে খায় যা","root":"طعم","lemma":"طَعِمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79840,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":79841,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":79842,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونَ","transliteration":"yakūna","translation_bn":"(যা কিছু) হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79843,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَيْتَةً","transliteration":"maytatan","translation_bn":"মৃত","root":"موت","lemma":"مَيْتَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79844,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79845,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"دَمًۭا","transliteration":"daman","translation_bn":"রক্ত","root":"دمو","lemma":"دَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79846,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مَّسْفُوحًا","transliteration":"masfūḥan","translation_bn":"বহমান","root":"سفح","lemma":"مَّسْفُوح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":79847,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79848,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَحْمَ","transliteration":"laḥma","translation_bn":"মাংস","root":"لحم","lemma":"لَحْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79849,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"خِنزِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"khinzīrin","translation_bn":"শুকরের","root":"خنزر","lemma":"خِنزِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79850,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"fa-innahu","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79851,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"رِجْسٌ","transliteration":"rij''sun","translation_bn":"অপবিত্র","root":"رجس","lemma":"رِجْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79852,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79853,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فِسْقًا","transliteration":"fis''qan","translation_bn":"অবৈধ (হওয়ার কারণ)","root":"فسق","lemma":"فِسْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79854,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"أُهِلَّ","transliteration":"uhilla","translation_bn":"(জবাই করার সময়) নাম নেয়া হয়েছে","root":"هلل","lemma":"أُهِلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79855,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لِغَيْرِ","transliteration":"lighayri","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে (অন্যের)ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79856,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":79857,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79859,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنِ","transliteration":"famani","translation_bn":"তবে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79860,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"ٱضْطُرَّ","transliteration":"uḍ''ṭurra","translation_bn":"নিরুপায় হয়ে (খায়)","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ٱضْطُرَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79861,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرَ","transliteration":"ghayra","translation_bn":"না","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79862,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"بَاغٍۢ","transliteration":"bāghin","translation_bn":"অবাধ্য হয়ে","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَاغ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79863,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79864,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"عَادٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿādin","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করে","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَاد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79865,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":79866,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব (সে ক্ষেত্রে)","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79867,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79868,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু\"","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":79869,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"١٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul lā ajidu fī mā ūḥiya ilayya muḥarraman ʿalā ṭāʿimin yaṭʿamuhu illā an yakūna maytatan aw daman masfūḥan aw laḥma khinzīrin fa-innahu rij''sun aw fis''qan uhilla lighayri l-lahi bihi famani uḍ''ṭurra ghayra bāghin walā ʿādin fa-inna rabbaka ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'বল, আমার প্রতি যে ওয়াহী করা হয়েছে তাতে মানুষ যা আহার করে তার কিছুই নিষিদ্ধ পাই না মৃত, প্রবহমান রক্ত ও শূকরের মাংস ছাড়া। কারণ তা অপবিত্র অথবা আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্যের নামে যবহ করা ফাসিকী কাজ। তবে যে ব্যক্তি নিরুপায় হয়ে পড়ে কিন্তু সে নাফরমান ও সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী নয়, তাহলে তোমার প্রতিপালক বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'Say, "I do not find within that which was revealed to me [anything] forbidden to one who would eat it unless it be a dead animal or blood spilled out or the flesh of swine - for indeed, it is impure - or it be [that slaughtered in] disobedience, dedicated to other than Allah. But whoever is forced [by necessity], neither desiring [it] nor transgressing [its limit], then indeed, your Lord is Forgiving and Merciful."', 'বল, আমার প্রতি যে ওয়াহী করা হয়েছে তাতে মানুষ যা আহার করে তার কিছুই নিষিদ্ধ পাই না মৃত, প্রবহমান রক্ত ও শূকরের মাংস ছাড়া। কারণ তা অপবিত্র অথবা আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্যের নামে যবহ করা ফাসিকী কাজ। তবে যে ব্যক্তি নিরুপায় হয়ে পড়ে কিন্তু সে নাফরমান ও সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী নয়, তাহলে তোমার প্রতিপালক বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'Say, "I do not find within that which was revealed to me [anything] forbidden to one who would eat it unless it be a dead animal or blood spilled out or the flesh of swine - for indeed, it is impure - or it be [that slaughtered in] disobedience, dedicated to other than Allah. But whoever is forced [by necessity], neither desiring [it] nor transgressing [its limit], then indeed, your Lord is Forgiving and Merciful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006145.mp3', now()),
  (6, 146, '', '[{"id":79931,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَى","transliteration":"waʿalā","translation_bn":"এবং (তাদের) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79932,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":79933,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَادُوا۟","transliteration":"hādū","translation_bn":"ইয়াহুদী হয়েছে","root":"هود","lemma":"هَادُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79934,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمْنَا","transliteration":"ḥarramnā","translation_bn":"নিষিদ্ধ করেছিলাম আমরা","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79935,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كُلَّ","transliteration":"kulla","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79936,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذِى","transliteration":"dhī","translation_bn":"বিশিষ্ট","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79937,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ظُفُرٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"ẓufurin","translation_bn":"নখর (জন্তু)","root":"ظفر","lemma":"ظُفُر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79939,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79940,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَقَرِ","transliteration":"l-baqari","translation_bn":"গরু","root":"بقر","lemma":"بَقَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79941,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْغَنَمِ","transliteration":"wal-ghanami","translation_bn":"ও ছাগলের","root":"غنم","lemma":"غَنَم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79942,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمْنَا","transliteration":"ḥarramnā","translation_bn":"হারাম করেছিলাম আমরা","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79943,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79944,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"شُحُومَهُمَآ","transliteration":"shuḥūmahumā","translation_bn":"চর্বিগুলো উভয়ের","root":"شحم","lemma":"شُحُوم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79945,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"তবে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":79946,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":79947,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"حَمَلَتْ","transliteration":"ḥamalat","translation_bn":"বহন করে","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79948,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ظُهُورُهُمَآ","transliteration":"ẓuhūruhumā","translation_bn":"পিঠগুলো উভয়ের","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَهْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":79949,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَوِ","transliteration":"awi","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79950,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَوَايَآ","transliteration":"l-ḥawāyā","translation_bn":"অন্ত্রগুলো","root":"حوي","lemma":"حَوَايَا^","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79951,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":79952,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":79953,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱخْتَلَطَ","transliteration":"ikh''talaṭa","translation_bn":"মিলিত হয়ে থাকে","root":"خلط","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79954,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"بِعَظْمٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"biʿaẓmin","translation_bn":"সাথে হাড়ের (সেটা ভিন্ন কথা)","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79956,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":79957,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"جَزَيْنَـٰهُم","transliteration":"jazaynāhum","translation_bn":"আমরা প্রতিফল দিয়েছি তাদেরকে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":79958,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"بِبَغْيِهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"bibaghyihim","translation_bn":"কারণে অবাধ্যতার তাদের","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَغْي","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":79960,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّا","transliteration":"wa-innā","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":79961,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"لَصَـٰدِقُونَ","transliteration":"laṣādiqūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সত্যবাদী","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":79962,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"١٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waʿalā alladhīna hādū ḥarramnā kulla dhī ẓufurin wamina l-baqari wal-ghanami ḥarramnā ʿalayhim shuḥūmahumā illā mā ḥamalat ẓuhūruhumā awi l-ḥawāyā aw mā ikh''talaṭa biʿaẓmin dhālika jazaynāhum bibaghyihim wa-innā laṣādiqūna', 'যারা ইয়াহূদী হয়েছে তাদের জন্য আমি যাবতীয় তীক্ষ্ণধার নখযুক্ত পশু হারাম করেছিলাম আর তাদের জন্য গরু-ছাগলের চর্বিও হারাম করেছিলাম, এগুলোর পিঠের কিংবা নাড়িভুড়ির বা হাড়ের সাথে লেগে থাকা চর্বি ছাড়া। তাদের অবাধ্যতার শাস্তি এভাবে তাদেরকে দিয়েছিলাম, আমি অবশ্যই সত্য কথা বলছি।', 'And to those who are Jews We prohibited every animal of uncloven hoof; and of the cattle and the sheep We prohibited to them their fat, except what adheres to their backs or the entrails or what is joined with bone. [By] that We repaid them for their injustice. And indeed, We are truthful.', 'যারা ইয়াহূদী হয়েছে তাদের জন্য আমি যাবতীয় তীক্ষ্ণধার নখযুক্ত পশু হারাম করেছিলাম আর তাদের জন্য গরু-ছাগলের চর্বিও হারাম করেছিলাম, এগুলোর পিঠের কিংবা নাড়িভুড়ির বা হাড়ের সাথে লেগে থাকা চর্বি ছাড়া। তাদের অবাধ্যতার শাস্তি এভাবে তাদেরকে দিয়েছিলাম, আমি অবশ্যই সত্য কথা বলছি।', 'And to those who are Jews We prohibited every animal of uncloven hoof; and of the cattle and the sheep We prohibited to them their fat, except what adheres to their backs or the entrails or what is joined with bone. [By] that We repaid them for their injustice. And indeed, We are truthful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006146.mp3', now()),
  (6, 147, '', '[{"id":80121,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80122,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوكَ","transliteration":"kadhabūka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে তারা মিথ্যা প্রতিপন্ন করে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80123,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَقُل","transliteration":"faqul","translation_bn":"তবে বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":80124,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَّبُّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbukum","translation_bn":"\"রব তোমাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80125,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ذُو","transliteration":"dhū","translation_bn":"অধিকারী","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80126,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَةٍۢ","transliteration":"raḥmatin","translation_bn":"দয়ার","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80127,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٰسِعَةٍۢ","transliteration":"wāsiʿatin","translation_bn":"সুপ্রশস্ত ও ব্যাপক","root":"وسع","lemma":"وَٰسِعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":80128,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"কিন্তু না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80129,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُرَدُّ","transliteration":"yuraddu","translation_bn":"ফিরানো যায়","root":"ردد","lemma":"رَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80130,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسُهُۥ","transliteration":"basuhu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি তাঁর","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80131,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80132,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80133,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"(যারা) অপরাধী\"","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80134,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-in kadhabūka faqul rabbukum dhū raḥmatin wāsiʿatin walā yuraddu basuhu ʿani l-qawmi l-muj''rimīna', 'অতঃপর যদি তারা তোমাকে মিথ্যে মনে করে তবে তাদেরকে বল, তোমাদের প্রতিপালক প্রশস্ত দয়ার মালিক, (কিন্তু তাওবা না করে অপরাধীই থেকে গেলে) তবে অপরাধী সম্প্রদায়ের উপর হতে তাঁর শাস্তি রদ হয় না।', 'So if they deny you, [O Muhammad], say, "Your Lord is the possessor of vast mercy; but His punishment cannot be repelled from the people who are criminals."', 'অতঃপর যদি তারা তোমাকে মিথ্যে মনে করে তবে তাদেরকে বল, তোমাদের প্রতিপালক প্রশস্ত দয়ার মালিক, (কিন্তু তাওবা না করে অপরাধীই থেকে গেলে) তবে অপরাধী সম্প্রদায়ের উপর হতে তাঁর শাস্তি রদ হয় না।', 'So if they deny you, [O Muhammad], say, "Your Lord is the possessor of vast mercy; but His punishment cannot be repelled from the people who are criminals."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006147.mp3', now()),
  (6, 148, '', '[{"id":80201,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"سَيَقُولُ","transliteration":"sayaqūlu","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":80202,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":80203,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكُوا۟","transliteration":"ashrakū","translation_bn":"শিরক করেছে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80204,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":80205,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80206,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":80207,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":80208,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكْنَا","transliteration":"ashraknā","translation_bn":"শিরক করতাম আমরা","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80209,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80210,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآؤُنَا","transliteration":"ābāunā","translation_bn":"পূর্ব পুরুষরা আমাদের","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80211,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80212,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمْنَا","transliteration":"ḥarramnā","translation_bn":"নিষিদ্ধ করতাম আমরা","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80213,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80214,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুই\"","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80216,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80217,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبَ","transliteration":"kadhaba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা বলেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80218,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারাও) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":80219,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80220,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"পূর্ব তাদের  (ছিলো)","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80221,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":80222,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ذَاقُوا۟","transliteration":"dhāqū","translation_bn":"তারা স্বাদ নিয়েছে","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80223,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بَأْسَنَا ۗ","transliteration":"basanā","translation_bn":"শাস্তির আমাদের","root":"باس","lemma":"بَأْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80225,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80226,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"\"কি (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":80227,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"عِندَكُم","transliteration":"ʿindakum","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমাদের","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":80228,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80229,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿil''min","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80230,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فَتُخْرِجُوهُ","transliteration":"fatukh''rijūhu","translation_bn":"তবে তোমরা পেশ করো তা","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":80231,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"لَنَآ ۖ","transliteration":"lanā","translation_bn":"কাছে আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَآ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80233,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"(প্রকৃতপক্ষে) না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":80234,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّبِعُونَ","transliteration":"tattabiʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80235,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":80236,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّنَّ","transliteration":"l-ẓana","translation_bn":"অনুমানের","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80237,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنْ","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80238,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":80239,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":80240,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"تَخْرُصُونَ","transliteration":"takhruṣūna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা রচনা করো\"","root":"خرص","lemma":"يَخْرُصُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80241,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"١٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sayaqūlu alladhīna ashrakū law shāa l-lahu mā ashraknā walā ābāunā walā ḥarramnā min shayin kadhālika kadhaba alladhīna min qablihim ḥattā dhāqū basanā qul hal ʿindakum min ʿil''min fatukh''rijūhu lanā in tattabiʿūna illā l-ẓana wa-in antum illā takhruṣūna', 'যারা শিরক করেছে তারা বলবে, আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে আমরা শিরক করতাম না, আর আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষরাও করত না, আর কোন কিছুই (আমাদের উপর) হারাম করে নিতাম না, এভাবে তাদের আগের লোকেরাও সত্যকে মিথ্যে গণ্য করেছিল, অবশেষে তারা আমার শাস্তি আস্বাদন করেছিল। বল, তোমাদের কাছে কি প্রকৃত জ্ঞান আছে, থাকলে তা আমাদের কাছে পেশ কর, তোমরা তো কেবল ধারণা-অনুমানের অনুসরণ করে চলেছ, তোমরা তো মিথ্যাচারই করে যাচ্ছ।', 'Those who associated with Allah will say, "If Allah had willed, we would not have associated [anything] and neither would our fathers, nor would we have prohibited anything." Likewise did those before deny until they tasted Our punishment. Say, "Do you have any knowledge that you can produce for us? You follow not except assumption, and you are not but falsifying."', 'যারা শিরক করেছে তারা বলবে, আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে আমরা শিরক করতাম না, আর আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষরাও করত না, আর কোন কিছুই (আমাদের উপর) হারাম করে নিতাম না, এভাবে তাদের আগের লোকেরাও সত্যকে মিথ্যে গণ্য করেছিল, অবশেষে তারা আমার শাস্তি আস্বাদন করেছিল। বল, তোমাদের কাছে কি প্রকৃত জ্ঞান আছে, থাকলে তা আমাদের কাছে পেশ কর, তোমরা তো কেবল ধারণা-অনুমানের অনুসরণ করে চলেছ, তোমরা তো মিথ্যাচারই করে যাচ্ছ।', 'Those who associated with Allah will say, "If Allah had willed, we would not have associated [anything] and neither would our fathers, nor would we have prohibited anything." Likewise did those before deny until they tasted Our punishment. Say, "Do you have any knowledge that you can produce for us? You follow not except assumption, and you are not but falsifying."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006148.mp3', now()),
  (6, 149, '', '[{"id":80283,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80284,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فَلِلَّهِ","transliteration":"falillahi","translation_bn":"\"কেবল জন্যে আল্লাহ্‌রই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":80285,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُجَّةُ","transliteration":"l-ḥujatu","translation_bn":"যুক্তিপ্রমাণ","root":"حجج","lemma":"حُجَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80286,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبَـٰلِغَةُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-bālighatu","translation_bn":"পরিপূর্ণ ও চূড়ান্ত","root":"بلغ","lemma":"بَٰلِغَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80288,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَلَوْ","transliteration":"falaw","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80289,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80290,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَهَدَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"lahadākum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সৎপথে পরিচালিত করতেন তোমাদের","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":80291,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَجْمَعِينَ","transliteration":"ajmaʿīna","translation_bn":"সকলকে\"","root":"جمع","lemma":"أَجْمَعِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80292,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul falillahi l-ḥujatu l-bālighatu falaw shāa lahadākum ajmaʿīna', 'চূড়ান্ত সত্য-নির্ভর প্রমাণ তো আল্লাহর কাছে আছে, আল্লাহ যদি চাইতেন তাহলে তিনি অবশ্যই তোমাদের সকলকে সত্যপথে পরিচালিত করতেন।', 'Say, "With Allah is the far-reaching argument. If He had willed, He would have guided you all."', 'চূড়ান্ত সত্য-নির্ভর প্রমাণ তো আল্লাহর কাছে আছে, আল্লাহ যদি চাইতেন তাহলে তিনি অবশ্যই তোমাদের সকলকে সত্যপথে পরিচালিত করতেন।', 'Say, "With Allah is the far-reaching argument. If He had willed, He would have guided you all."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006149.mp3', now()),
  (6, 150, '', '[{"id":80434,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80435,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَلُمَّ","transliteration":"halumma","translation_bn":"\"উপস্হিত করো","root":"لمم","lemma":"لُمَّ","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":80436,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"شُهَدَآءَكُمُ","transliteration":"shuhadāakumu","translation_bn":"সাক্ষীদেরকে তোমাদের","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80437,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":80438,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَشْهَدُونَ","transliteration":"yashhadūna","translation_bn":"সাক্ষ্য দেয়","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80439,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":80440,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":80441,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمَ","transliteration":"ḥarrama","translation_bn":"নিষিদ্ধ করেছেন","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80442,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا ۖ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা\"","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":80444,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80445,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَهِدُوا۟","transliteration":"shahidū","translation_bn":"তারা সাক্ষ্য দেয়ও","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80446,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তবুও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":80447,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَشْهَدْ","transliteration":"tashhad","translation_bn":"সাক্ষ্য দিও তুমি","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80448,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَعَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"maʿahum","translation_bn":"সাথে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":80450,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80451,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّبِعْ","transliteration":"tattabiʿ","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করো","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80452,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَهْوَآءَ","transliteration":"ahwāa","translation_bn":"(তাদের) খেয়ালখুশির","root":"هوي","lemma":"أَهْوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80453,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":80454,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা প্রতিপন্ন করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80455,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমাদের আয়াতগুলোর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80456,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80457,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":80458,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80459,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"bil-ākhirati","translation_bn":"উপর আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80460,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"وَهُم","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80461,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"بِرَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"birabbihim","translation_bn":"সাথে রবের তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80462,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يَعْدِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿdilūna","translation_bn":"সমতুল্য করেছে (অন্যান্যকেও)","root":"عدل","lemma":"عَدَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80463,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"١٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul halumma shuhadāakumu alladhīna yashhadūna anna l-laha ḥarrama hādhā fa-in shahidū falā tashhad maʿahum walā tattabiʿ ahwāa alladhīna kadhabū biāyātinā wa-alladhīna lā yu''minūna bil-ākhirati wahum birabbihim yaʿdilūna', 'বল, আল্লাহ যে এটা হারাম করেছেন সে ব্যাপারে যারা সাক্ষ্য দেবে তাদেরকে হাজির কর। তারা সাক্ষ্য দিলেও তুমি তাদের সাথে সাক্ষ্য দিও না। যারা আমার আয়াতগুলোকে অমান্য করে, আর যারা আখেরাতে বিশ্বাস করে না আর তাদের প্রতিপালকের সমকক্ষ দাঁড় করায় তুমি কক্ষনো তাদের খেয়ালখুশির অনুসরণ করো না।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Bring forward your witnesses who will testify that Allah has prohibited this." And if they testify, do not testify with them. And do not follow the desires of those who deny Our verses and those who do not believe in the Hereafter, while they equate [others] with their Lord.', 'বল, আল্লাহ যে এটা হারাম করেছেন সে ব্যাপারে যারা সাক্ষ্য দেবে তাদেরকে হাজির কর। তারা সাক্ষ্য দিলেও তুমি তাদের সাথে সাক্ষ্য দিও না। যারা আমার আয়াতগুলোকে অমান্য করে, আর যারা আখেরাতে বিশ্বাস করে না আর তাদের প্রতিপালকের সমকক্ষ দাঁড় করায় তুমি কক্ষনো তাদের খেয়ালখুশির অনুসরণ করো না।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "Bring forward your witnesses who will testify that Allah has prohibited this." And if they testify, do not testify with them. And do not follow the desires of those who deny Our verses and those who do not believe in the Hereafter, while they equate [others] with their Lord.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006150.mp3', now()),
