"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81374,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَصَدَفَ","transliteration":"waṣadafa","translation_bn":"ও মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়","root":"صدف","lemma":"صَدَفَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81375,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهَا ۗ","transliteration":"ʿanhā","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81377,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"سَنَجْزِى","transliteration":"sanajzī","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই প্রতিফল দিবো আমরা","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":81378,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":81379,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يَصْدِفُونَ","transliteration":"yaṣdifūna","translation_bn":"মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিয়েছে","root":"صدف","lemma":"صَدَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81380,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81381,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"āyātinā","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81382,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"سُوٓءَ","transliteration":"sūa","translation_bn":"নিকৃষ্ট","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81383,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81384,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81385,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81386,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"يَصْدِفُونَ","transliteration":"yaṣdifūna","translation_bn":"তারা মুখ ফিরাতো","root":"صدف","lemma":"صَدَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81387,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"١٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'aw taqūlū law annā unzila ʿalaynā l-kitābu lakunnā ahdā min''hum faqad jāakum bayyinatun min rabbikum wahudan waraḥmatun faman aẓlamu mimman kadhaba biāyāti l-lahi waṣadafa ʿanhā sanajzī alladhīna yaṣdifūna ʿan āyātinā sūa l-ʿadhābi bimā kānū yaṣdifūna', 'অথবা তোমরা না বলতে পার যে আমাদের উপর যদি কিতাব অবতীর্ণ হত তাহলে আমরা তাদের চেয়ে বেশি হিদায়াতপ্রাপ্ত হতাম। তাই এখন তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ থেকে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ, হিদায়াত ও রহমত এসেছে। অতঃপর যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহর (এ সব) আয়াতসমূহকে মিথ্যে মনে ক’রে তাত্থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেবে তার চেয়ে বড় যালিম আর কে আছে? আমার আয়াতসমূহ থেকে যারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়, তাদেরকে অচিরেই আমি তাদের মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়ার কারণে নিকৃষ্টতম শাস্তি প্রদান করব।', 'Or lest you say, "If only the Scripture had been revealed to us, we would have been better guided than they." So there has [now] come to you a clear evidence from your Lord and a guidance and mercy. Then who is more unjust than one who denies the verses of Allah and turns away from them? We will recompense those who turn away from Our verses with the worst of punishment for their having turned away.', 'অথবা তোমরা না বলতে পার যে আমাদের উপর যদি কিতাব অবতীর্ণ হত তাহলে আমরা তাদের চেয়ে বেশি হিদায়াতপ্রাপ্ত হতাম। তাই এখন তোমাদের কাছে তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ থেকে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ, হিদায়াত ও রহমত এসেছে। অতঃপর যে ব্যক্তি আল্লাহর (এ সব) আয়াতসমূহকে মিথ্যে মনে ক’রে তাত্থেকে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেবে তার চেয়ে বড় যালিম আর কে আছে? আমার আয়াতসমূহ থেকে যারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়, তাদেরকে অচিরেই আমি তাদের মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয়ার কারণে নিকৃষ্টতম শাস্তি প্রদান করব।', 'Or lest you say, "If only the Scripture had been revealed to us, we would have been better guided than they." So there has [now] come to you a clear evidence from your Lord and a guidance and mercy. Then who is more unjust than one who denies the verses of Allah and turns away from them? We will recompense those who turn away from Our verses with the worst of punishment for their having turned away.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006157.mp3', now()),
  (6, 158, '', '[{"id":81567,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":81568,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنظُرُونَ","transliteration":"yanẓurūna","translation_bn":"তারা অপেক্ষা করছে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81569,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":81570,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":81571,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيَهُمُ","transliteration":"tatiyahumu","translation_bn":"কাছে আসবে তাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81572,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَـٰٓئِكَةُ","transliteration":"l-malāikatu","translation_bn":"ফেরেশতারা","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81573,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81574,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِىَ","transliteration":"yatiya","translation_bn":"আসবেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81575,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81576,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81577,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِىَ","transliteration":"yatiya","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81578,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُ","transliteration":"baʿḍu","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81579,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81580,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ ۗ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81582,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"যে দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":81583,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِى","transliteration":"yatī","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81584,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُ","transliteration":"baʿḍu","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81585,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81586,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81587,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":81588,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَنفَعُ","transliteration":"yanfaʿu","translation_bn":"উপকার করবে","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81589,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسًا","transliteration":"nafsan","translation_bn":"কোনো ব্যক্তিকে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81590,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"إِيمَـٰنُهَا","transliteration":"īmānuhā","translation_bn":"(সে সব দেখে) ঈমান গ্রহণের তান","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81591,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":81592,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"تَكُنْ","transliteration":"takun","translation_bn":"তা হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81593,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَتْ","transliteration":"āmanat","translation_bn":"সে ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81594,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81595,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81596,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81597,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"كَسَبَتْ","transliteration":"kasabat","translation_bn":"সে অর্জন করে (নাই)","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81598,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মাধ্যমে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81599,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"إِيمَـٰنِهَا","transliteration":"īmānihā","translation_bn":"ঈমানের তার","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81600,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا ۗ","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"কোনো কল্যাণ","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81602,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"قُلِ","transliteration":"quli","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81603,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"ٱنتَظِرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"intaẓirū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা অপেক্ষা করো","root":"نظر","lemma":"يَنتَظِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81604,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":81605,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"مُنتَظِرُونَ","transliteration":"muntaẓirūna","translation_bn":"অপেক্ষাকারী\"","root":"نظر","lemma":"مُنتَظِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81606,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"١٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hal yanẓurūna illā an tatiyahumu l-malāikatu aw yatiya rabbuka aw yatiya baʿḍu āyāti rabbika yawma yatī baʿḍu āyāti rabbika lā yanfaʿu nafsan īmānuhā lam takun āmanat min qablu aw kasabat fī īmānihā khayran quli intaẓirū innā muntaẓirūna', 'তারা কি এই অপেক্ষায় আছে যে, তাদের কাছে ফেরেশতারা আসবে অথবা তোমার প্রতিপালক (স্বয়ং) আসবেন কিংবা তোমার রবের কিছু নিদর্শন আসবে (তখন তারা ঈমান আনবে)? যে দিন তোমার রবের কতক নিদর্শন এসে যাবে সে দিন ঐ ব্যক্তির ঈমান কোন সুফল দিবে না যে পূর্বে ঈমান আনেনি বা ঈমানের মাধ্যমে কল্যাণ অর্জন করেনি। বল, তোমরা অপেক্ষা কর (তাহলে দেখতে পাবে তোমাদের কুফরীর পরিণাম কী দাঁড়ায়), আমরাও অপেক্ষায় থাকলাম (আমাদের পুরস্কার প্রাপ্তি ও তোমাদের পরিণতি দেখার জন্য)।', 'Do they [then] wait for anything except that the angels should come to them or your Lord should come or that there come some of the signs of your Lord? The Day that some of the signs of your Lord will come no soul will benefit from its faith as long as it had not believed before or had earned through its faith some good. Say, "Wait. Indeed, we [also] are waiting."', 'তারা কি এই অপেক্ষায় আছে যে, তাদের কাছে ফেরেশতারা আসবে অথবা তোমার প্রতিপালক (স্বয়ং) আসবেন কিংবা তোমার রবের কিছু নিদর্শন আসবে (তখন তারা ঈমান আনবে)? যে দিন তোমার রবের কতক নিদর্শন এসে যাবে সে দিন ঐ ব্যক্তির ঈমান কোন সুফল দিবে না যে পূর্বে ঈমান আনেনি বা ঈমানের মাধ্যমে কল্যাণ অর্জন করেনি। বল, তোমরা অপেক্ষা কর (তাহলে দেখতে পাবে তোমাদের কুফরীর পরিণাম কী দাঁড়ায়), আমরাও অপেক্ষায় থাকলাম (আমাদের পুরস্কার প্রাপ্তি ও তোমাদের পরিণতি দেখার জন্য)।', 'Do they [then] wait for anything except that the angels should come to them or your Lord should come or that there come some of the signs of your Lord? The Day that some of the signs of your Lord will come no soul will benefit from its faith as long as it had not believed before or had earned through its faith some good. Say, "Wait. Indeed, we [also] are waiting."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006158.mp3', now()),
  (6, 159, '', '[{"id":81636,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":81637,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":81638,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَرَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"farraqū","translation_bn":"খন্ড বিখন্ড করেছে","root":"فرق","lemma":"فَرَّقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81639,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"دِينَهُمْ","transliteration":"dīnahum","translation_bn":"দীনকে তাদের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81640,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"ও তারা হয়েছে (বিভক্ত)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81641,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شِيَعًۭا","transliteration":"shiyaʿan","translation_bn":"(বিভিন্ন) উপদলে","root":"شيع","lemma":"شِيعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81642,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّسْتَ","transliteration":"lasta","translation_bn":"নও তুমি","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81643,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81644,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81645,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ ۚ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81647,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":81648,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرُهُمْ","transliteration":"amruhum","translation_bn":"বিষয় তাদের(ন্যস্ত)","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81649,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81650,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌র","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81651,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81652,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُنَبِّئُهُم","transliteration":"yunabbi-uhum","translation_bn":"তিনি জানিয়ে দিবেন তাদের","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81653,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81654,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81655,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَفْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"yafʿalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করতে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81656,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna farraqū dīnahum wakānū shiyaʿan lasta min''hum fī shayin innamā amruhum ilā l-lahi thumma yunabbi-uhum bimā kānū yafʿalūna', 'যারা নিজেদের (পূর্ণ পরিণত) দ্বীনকে খন্ডে খন্ডে বিভক্ত করে নিয়েছে আর (আপন আপন অংশ নিয়ে) দলে দলে ভাগ হয়ে গেছে তাদের কোন কাজের সাথে তোমার কোন সম্পর্ক নেই। তাদের ব্যাপারটি পুরোপুরি আল্লাহর ইখতিয়ারভুক্ত। (সময় হলেই) তিনি তাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেবেন তাদের কৃতকর্ম সম্পর্কে।', 'Indeed, those who have divided their religion and become sects - you, [O Muhammad], are not [associated] with them in anything. Their affair is only [left] to Allah; then He will inform them about what they used to do.', 'যারা নিজেদের (পূর্ণ পরিণত) দ্বীনকে খন্ডে খন্ডে বিভক্ত করে নিয়েছে আর (আপন আপন অংশ নিয়ে) দলে দলে ভাগ হয়ে গেছে তাদের কোন কাজের সাথে তোমার কোন সম্পর্ক নেই। তাদের ব্যাপারটি পুরোপুরি আল্লাহর ইখতিয়ারভুক্ত। (সময় হলেই) তিনি তাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেবেন তাদের কৃতকর্ম সম্পর্কে।', 'Indeed, those who have divided their religion and become sects - you, [O Muhammad], are not [associated] with them in anything. Their affair is only [left] to Allah; then He will inform them about what they used to do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006159.mp3', now()),
  (6, 160, '', '[{"id":81746,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":81747,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসবে (আল্লাহ্‌র কাছে)","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81748,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَسَنَةِ","transliteration":"bil-ḥasanati","translation_bn":"নিয়ে  সৎকর্ম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حَسَنَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81749,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَلَهُۥ","transliteration":"falahu","translation_bn":"তবে জন্যে তার (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فَلَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":81750,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَشْرُ","transliteration":"ʿashru","translation_bn":"দশ (গুণ সওয়াব)","root":"عشر","lemma":"عَشْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81751,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَمْثَالِهَا ۖ","transliteration":"amthālihā","translation_bn":"পরিমাণের তার","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81753,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":81754,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81755,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلسَّيِّئَةِ","transliteration":"bil-sayi-ati","translation_bn":"নিয়ে অসৎকর্ম","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّئَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81756,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"তবে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":81757,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُجْزَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yuj''zā","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81758,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":81759,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِثْلَهَا","transliteration":"mith''lahā","translation_bn":"সমপরিমাণ তার","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81760,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":81761,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":81762,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُظْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yuẓ''lamūna","translation_bn":"অবিচার করা হবে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81763,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'man jāa bil-ḥasanati falahu ʿashru amthālihā waman jāa bil-sayi-ati falā yuj''zā illā mith''lahā wahum lā yuẓ''lamūna', 'যে ব্যক্তি সৎকর্ম করবে তার জন্য আছে দশ গুণ পুরস্কার, আর যে ব্যক্তি অসৎকাজ করবে তাকে শুধু কৃতকর্মের তুল্য প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে, তাদের উপর অত্যাচার করা হবে না।', 'Whoever comes [on the Day of Judgement] with a good deed will have ten times the like thereof [to his credit], and whoever comes with an evil deed will not be recompensed except the like thereof; and they will not be wronged.', 'যে ব্যক্তি সৎকর্ম করবে তার জন্য আছে দশ গুণ পুরস্কার, আর যে ব্যক্তি অসৎকাজ করবে তাকে শুধু কৃতকর্মের তুল্য প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে, তাদের উপর অত্যাচার করা হবে না।', 'Whoever comes [on the Day of Judgement] with a good deed will have ten times the like thereof [to his credit], and whoever comes with an evil deed will not be recompensed except the like thereof; and they will not be wronged.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006160.mp3', now()),
  (6, 161, '', '[{"id":81896,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81897,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّنِى","transliteration":"innanī","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমাকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":81898,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَدَىٰنِى","transliteration":"hadānī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখিয়েছেন আমাকে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81899,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّىٓ","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81900,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81901,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81902,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল-সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":81903,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"دِينًۭا","transliteration":"dīnan","translation_bn":"(তাই) দীন","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81904,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قِيَمًۭا","transliteration":"qiyaman","translation_bn":"সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":81905,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّلَّةَ","transliteration":"millata","translation_bn":"পথপন্থা","root":"ملل","lemma":"مِلَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81906,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِبْرَٰهِيمَ","transliteration":"ib''rāhīma","translation_bn":"ইবরাহীমের","root":"—","lemma":"إِبْرَاهِيم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":81907,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَنِيفًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ḥanīfan","translation_bn":"যে ছিলো (একনিষ্ঠ)","root":"حنف","lemma":"حَنِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":81909,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":81910,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"সে ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":81911,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":81912,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُشْرِكِينَ","transliteration":"l-mush''rikīna","translation_bn":"মুশরিকদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":81913,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٦١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul innanī hadānī rabbī ilā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin dīnan qiyaman millata ib''rāhīma ḥanīfan wamā kāna mina l-mush''rikīna', 'বল, আমাকে আমার রব্ব সরল সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেছেন (যা) সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত দ্বীন, একনিষ্ঠ ইবরাহীমের পথ। সে মুশরিকদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত ছিল না।', 'Say, "Indeed, my Lord has guided me to a straight path - a correct religion - the way of Abraham, inclining toward truth. And he was not among those who associated others with Allah."', 'বল, আমাকে আমার রব্ব সরল সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেছেন (যা) সুপ্রতিষ্ঠিত দ্বীন, একনিষ্ঠ ইবরাহীমের পথ। সে মুশরিকদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত ছিল না।', 'Say, "Indeed, my Lord has guided me to a straight path - a correct religion - the way of Abraham, inclining toward truth. And he was not among those who associated others with Allah."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006161.mp3', now()),
  (6, 162, '', '[{"id":82052,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82053,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":82054,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"صَلَاتِى","transliteration":"ṣalātī","translation_bn":"আমার সালাত","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82055,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَنُسُكِى","transliteration":"wanusukī","translation_bn":"এবং আমার কুরবানি (বা উপাসনার পদ্ধতি)","root":"نسك","lemma":"نُسُك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82056,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمَحْيَاىَ","transliteration":"wamaḥyāya","translation_bn":"ও আমার জীবন","root":"حيي","lemma":"مَّحْيَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82057,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَمَاتِى","transliteration":"wamamātī","translation_bn":"ও আমার মরণ","root":"موت","lemma":"مَمَات","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82058,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহ্‌রই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82059,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"(যিনি) রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82060,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বজগতের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82061,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٦٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul inna ṣalātī wanusukī wamaḥyāya wamamātī lillahi rabbi l-ʿālamīna', 'বল, আমার নামায, আমার যাবতীয় ‘ইবাদাত, আমার জীবন, আমার মরণ (সব কিছুই) বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালক আল্লাহর জন্যই (নিবেদিত)।', 'Say, "Indeed, my prayer, my rites of sacrifice, my living and my dying are for Allah, Lord of the worlds.', 'বল, আমার নামায, আমার যাবতীয় ‘ইবাদাত, আমার জীবন, আমার মরণ (সব কিছুই) বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালক আল্লাহর জন্যই (নিবেদিত)।', 'Say, "Indeed, my prayer, my rites of sacrifice, my living and my dying are for Allah, Lord of the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006162.mp3', now()),
  (6, 163, '', '[{"id":82106,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":82107,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"شَرِيكَ","transliteration":"sharīka","translation_bn":"কোনো শরিক","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82108,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82110,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَبِذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wabidhālika","translation_bn":"এবং বিষয়ে এ","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82111,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أُمِرْتُ","transliteration":"umir''tu","translation_bn":"আমাকে আদেশ করা হয়েছে","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82112,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَا۠","transliteration":"wa-anā","translation_bn":"এবং আমি","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82113,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوَّلُ","transliteration":"awwalu","translation_bn":"প্রথম","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82114,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُسْلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-mus''limīna","translation_bn":"আত্নসমর্পণকারীদের (মধ্যে)","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82115,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā sharīka lahu wabidhālika umir''tu wa-anā awwalu l-mus''limīna', 'তাঁর কোন শরীক নেই, আমাকে এরই নির্দেশ দেয়া হয়েছে আর আমিই সর্বপ্রথম আত্মসমর্পণকারী।', 'No partner has He. And this I have been commanded, and I am the first [among you] of the Muslims."', 'তাঁর কোন শরীক নেই, আমাকে এরই নির্দেশ দেয়া হয়েছে আর আমিই সর্বপ্রথম আত্মসমর্পণকারী।', 'No partner has He. And this I have been commanded, and I am the first [among you] of the Muslims."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006163.mp3', now()),
  (6, 164, '', '[{"id":82167,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82168,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَغَيْرَ","transliteration":"aghayra","translation_bn":"\"কি ছাড়া","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":82169,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ্‌","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":82170,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَبْغِى","transliteration":"abghī","translation_bn":"খুঁজবো আমি","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82171,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَبًّۭا","transliteration":"rabban","translation_bn":"রব (অন্য কোনো)","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82172,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"অথচ তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82173,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّ","transliteration":"rabbu","translation_bn":"রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82174,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82175,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর\"","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82177,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82178,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَكْسِبُ","transliteration":"taksibu","translation_bn":"অর্জন করে (কোনো পাপ বা পূণ্য)","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82179,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82180,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তি","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82181,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":82182,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهَا ۚ","transliteration":"ʿalayhā","translation_bn":"তারই উপর (তা বর্তাবে)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82184,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82185,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَزِرُ","transliteration":"taziru","translation_bn":"বোঝা উঠাবে","root":"وزر","lemma":"يَزِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82186,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَازِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"wāziratun","translation_bn":"কোনো বোঝা বহনকারী","root":"وزر","lemma":"وَازِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82187,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وِزْرَ","transliteration":"wiz''ra","translation_bn":"বোঝা","root":"وزر","lemma":"وِزْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82188,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أُخْرَىٰ ۚ","transliteration":"ukh''rā","translation_bn":"অন্যের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82190,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82191,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82192,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكُم","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"রবের তোমাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82193,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مَّرْجِعُكُمْ","transliteration":"marjiʿukum","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন তোমাদের(হবে)","root":"رجع","lemma":"مَرْجِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82194,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","transliteration":"fayunabbi-ukum","translation_bn":"তখন তিনি জানিয়ে দিবেন তোমাদের","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82195,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82196,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82197,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে যার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82198,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"تَخْتَلِفُونَ","transliteration":"takhtalifūna","translation_bn":"মতবিরোধ করতে","root":"خلف","lemma":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82199,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"١٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul aghayra l-lahi abghī rabban wahuwa rabbu kulli shayin walā taksibu kullu nafsin illā ʿalayhā walā taziru wāziratun wiz''ra ukh''rā thumma ilā rabbikum marjiʿukum fayunabbi-ukum bimā kuntum fīhi takhtalifūna', 'আমি কি আল্লাহকে ছেড়ে অন্য প্রতিপালক তালাশ করব? (অথচ প্রকৃতপক্ষে) তিনিই সব কিছুর প্রতিপালক। প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তি যা অর্জন করে তার জন্য সে নিজেই দায়ী হবে। কোন ভারবহনকারীই অন্যের গুনাহের ভার বহন করবে না। অবশেষে তোমাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন স্থল তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকটেই, তখন তিনি তোমাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেবেন যে সকল বিষয়ে তোমরা মতভেদে লিপ্ত ছিলে (সে সব বিষয়ে প্রকৃত সত্য কোনটি)।', 'Say, "Is it other than Allah I should desire as a lord while He is the Lord of all things? And every soul earns not [blame] except against itself, and no bearer of burdens will bear the burden of another. Then to your Lord is your return, and He will inform you concerning that over which you used to differ."', 'আমি কি আল্লাহকে ছেড়ে অন্য প্রতিপালক তালাশ করব? (অথচ প্রকৃতপক্ষে) তিনিই সব কিছুর প্রতিপালক। প্রত্যেক ব্যক্তি যা অর্জন করে তার জন্য সে নিজেই দায়ী হবে। কোন ভারবহনকারীই অন্যের গুনাহের ভার বহন করবে না। অবশেষে তোমাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন স্থল তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকটেই, তখন তিনি তোমাদেরকে জানিয়ে দেবেন যে সকল বিষয়ে তোমরা মতভেদে লিপ্ত ছিলে (সে সব বিষয়ে প্রকৃত সত্য কোনটি)।', 'Say, "Is it other than Allah I should desire as a lord while He is the Lord of all things? And every soul earns not [blame] except against itself, and no bearer of burdens will bear the burden of another. Then to your Lord is your return, and He will inform you concerning that over which you used to differ."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006164.mp3', now()),
  (6, 165, '', '[{"id":82403,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82404,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":82405,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَكُمْ","transliteration":"jaʿalakum","translation_bn":"বানিয়েছেন তোমাদের","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82406,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خَلَـٰٓئِفَ","transliteration":"khalāifa","translation_bn":"প্রতিনিধি","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَلِيفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82407,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82408,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَرَفَعَ","transliteration":"warafaʿa","translation_bn":"ও উন্নীত করেছেন","root":"رفع","lemma":"رَفَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82409,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَكُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍakum","translation_bn":"কাউকে তোমাদের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82410,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقَ","transliteration":"fawqa","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":82411,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضٍۢ","transliteration":"baʿḍin","translation_bn":"কারও","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82412,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"دَرَجَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"darajātin","translation_bn":"মর্যাদাসমূহে","root":"درج","lemma":"دَرَجَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82413,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لِّيَبْلُوَكُمْ","transliteration":"liyabluwakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে পরীক্ষা করার তোমাদের","root":"بلو","lemma":"بَلَوْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82414,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (তার)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82415,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":82416,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَىٰكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"ātākum","translation_bn":"দান করেছেন তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82418,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":82419,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّكَ","transliteration":"rabbaka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82420,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"سَرِيعُ","transliteration":"sarīʿu","translation_bn":"দ্রুত","root":"سرع","lemma":"سَرِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82421,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِقَابِ","transliteration":"l-ʿiqābi","translation_bn":"শাস্তিদানের (ব্যাপারে)","root":"عقب","lemma":"عِقَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82422,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"wa-innahu","translation_bn":"এবং  নিশ্চয়ই তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82423,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَغَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"laghafūrun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":82424,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۢ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালুও","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":82425,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"١٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wahuwa alladhī jaʿalakum khalāifa l-arḍi warafaʿa baʿḍakum fawqa baʿḍin darajātin liyabluwakum fī mā ātākum inna rabbaka sarīʿu l-ʿiqābi wa-innahu laghafūrun raḥīmun', 'তিনিই তোমাদেরকে পৃথিবীতে পরস্পরের স্থলাভিষিক্ত বানিয়েছেন, মর্যাদায় তোমাদের কতককে কতকের উপরে স্থান দিয়েছেন, আমি তোমাদেরকে যা দিয়েছি ওগুলোর মাধ্যমে তোমাদেরকে পরীক্ষা করার জন্য, তোমার রব তো শাস্তি দানে দ্রুত (ব্যবস্থা গ্রহণ করেন) আর তিনি অবশ্যই বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'And it is He who has made you successors upon the earth and has raised some of you above others in degrees [of rank] that He may try you through what He has given you. Indeed, your Lord is swift in penalty; but indeed, He is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'তিনিই তোমাদেরকে পৃথিবীতে পরস্পরের স্থলাভিষিক্ত বানিয়েছেন, মর্যাদায় তোমাদের কতককে কতকের উপরে স্থান দিয়েছেন, আমি তোমাদেরকে যা দিয়েছি ওগুলোর মাধ্যমে তোমাদেরকে পরীক্ষা করার জন্য, তোমার রব তো শাস্তি দানে দ্রুত (ব্যবস্থা গ্রহণ করেন) আর তিনি অবশ্যই বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'And it is He who has made you successors upon the earth and has raised some of you above others in degrees [of rank] that He may try you through what He has given you. Indeed, your Lord is swift in penalty; but indeed, He is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/006165.mp3', now())
