ansliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35164,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هِىَ","transliteration":"hiya","translation_bn":"\"তা","root":"—","lemma":"هِىَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":35165,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) জন্যে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35166,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35167,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (প্রতি)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35168,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35169,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35170,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"خَالِصَةًۭ","transliteration":"khāliṣatan","translation_bn":"বিশেষ করে","root":"خلص","lemma":"خَالِصَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35171,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":35172,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35174,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35175,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"نُفَصِّلُ","transliteration":"nufaṣṣilu","translation_bn":"বিস্তারিত বর্ণনা করি আমরা","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35176,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":35177,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35178,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) জ্ঞান রাখে\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35179,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul man ḥarrama zīnata l-lahi allatī akhraja liʿibādihi wal-ṭayibāti mina l-riz''qi qul hiya lilladhīna āmanū fī l-ḥayati l-dun''yā khāliṣatan yawma l-qiyāmati kadhālika nufaṣṣilu l-āyāti liqawmin yaʿlamūna', 'বল, ‘যে সব সৌন্দর্য-শোভামন্ডিত বস্তু ও পবিত্র জীবিকা তিনি তাঁর বান্দাদের জন্য সৃষ্টি করেছেন কে তা হারাম করল’? বল, ‘সে সব হচ্ছে ঈমানদারদের জন্য দুনিয়ার জীবনে বিশেষতঃ ক্বিয়ামাতের দিনে। এভাবে আমি জ্ঞানী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য নিদর্শনসমূহ বিশদভাবে বিবৃত করি।’', 'Say, "Who has forbidden the adornment of Allah which He has produced for His servants and the good [lawful] things of provision?" Say, "They are for those who believe during the worldly life [but] exclusively for them on the Day of Resurrection." Thus do We detail the verses for a people who know.', 'বল, ‘যে সব সৌন্দর্য-শোভামন্ডিত বস্তু ও পবিত্র জীবিকা তিনি তাঁর বান্দাদের জন্য সৃষ্টি করেছেন কে তা হারাম করল’? বল, ‘সে সব হচ্ছে ঈমানদারদের জন্য দুনিয়ার জীবনে বিশেষতঃ ক্বিয়ামাতের দিনে। এভাবে আমি জ্ঞানী সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য নিদর্শনসমূহ বিশদভাবে বিবৃত করি।’', 'Say, "Who has forbidden the adornment of Allah which He has produced for His servants and the good [lawful] things of provision?" Say, "They are for those who believe during the worldly life [but] exclusively for them on the Day of Resurrection." Thus do We detail the verses for a people who know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007032.mp3', now()),
