mar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61220,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"فَذَرُوهَا","transliteration":"fadharūhā","translation_bn":"সুতরাং তোমরা ছেড়ে দাও তাকে","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61221,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"تَأْكُلْ","transliteration":"takul","translation_bn":"সে খাবে","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61222,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61223,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"أَرْضِ","transliteration":"arḍi","translation_bn":"জমিনের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61224,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61226,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61227,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"تَمَسُّوهَا","transliteration":"tamassūhā","translation_bn":"তোমরা স্পর্শ করবে তাকে","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61228,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"بِسُوٓءٍۢ","transliteration":"bisūin","translation_bn":"ভাবে মন্দ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61229,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"فَيَأْخُذَكُمْ","transliteration":"fayakhudhakum","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে ধরবে তোমাদের","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":61230,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61231,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ\"","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61232,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ilā thamūda akhāhum ṣāliḥan qāla yāqawmi uʿ''budū l-laha mā lakum min ilāhin ghayruhu qad jāatkum bayyinatun min rabbikum hādhihi nāqatu l-lahi lakum āyatan fadharūhā takul fī arḍi l-lahi walā tamassūhā bisūin fayakhudhakum ʿadhābun alīmun', 'আমি সামুদ জাতির কাছে তাদের ভাই সালিহকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। সে বলেছিল, হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি ছাড়া তোমাদের কোন ইলাহ নেই। তোমাদের নিকট তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ হতে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ এসেছে। এটি হল আল্লাহর উটনী, তোমাদের জন্য নিদর্শন, তাকে আল্লাহর যমীনে চরে খেতে দাও, মন্দ উদ্দেশ্যে একে স্পর্শ করবে না, করলে পীড়াদায়ক শাস্তি তোমাদেরকে গ্রাস করবে।', 'And to the Thamud [We sent] their brother Salih. He said, "O my people, worship Allah; you have no deity other than Him. There has come to you clear evidence from your Lord. This is the she-camel of Allah [sent] to you as a sign. So leave her to eat within Allah ''s land and do not touch her with harm, lest there seize you a painful punishment.', 'আমি সামুদ জাতির কাছে তাদের ভাই সালিহকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। সে বলেছিল, হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি ছাড়া তোমাদের কোন ইলাহ নেই। তোমাদের নিকট তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের পক্ষ হতে সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ এসেছে। এটি হল আল্লাহর উটনী, তোমাদের জন্য নিদর্শন, তাকে আল্লাহর যমীনে চরে খেতে দাও, মন্দ উদ্দেশ্যে একে স্পর্শ করবে না, করলে পীড়াদায়ক শাস্তি তোমাদেরকে গ্রাস করবে।', 'And to the Thamud [We sent] their brother Salih. He said, "O my people, worship Allah; you have no deity other than Him. There has come to you clear evidence from your Lord. This is the she-camel of Allah [sent] to you as a sign. So leave her to eat within Allah ''s land and do not touch her with harm, lest there seize you a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007073.mp3', now()),
  (7, 74, '', '[{"id":61586,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-udh''kurū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা স্মরণ করো","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61587,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":61588,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَكُمْ","transliteration":"jaʿalakum","translation_bn":"বানিয়েছিলেন তোমাদের","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61589,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خُلَفَآءَ","transliteration":"khulafāa","translation_bn":"স্থলাভিষিক্ত","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَلِيفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61590,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61591,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61592,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَادٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿādin","translation_bn":"আ''দের","root":"عود","lemma":"عَاد2","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61593,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَبَوَّأَكُمْ","transliteration":"wabawwa-akum","translation_bn":"ও প্রতিষ্ঠিত করেছিলেন তোমাদের","root":"بوا","lemma":"بَوَّأَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61594,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61595,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61596,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّخِذُونَ","transliteration":"tattakhidhūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা নির্মাণ করছো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61597,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61598,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سُهُولِهَا","transliteration":"suhūlihā","translation_bn":"সমতল ভূমির তার","root":"سهل","lemma":"سُهُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61599,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قُصُورًۭا","transliteration":"quṣūran","translation_bn":"প্রাসাদসমূহ","root":"قصر","lemma":"قَصْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61600,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَتَنْحِتُونَ","transliteration":"watanḥitūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা খোদাই করে তৈরী করেছো","root":"نحت","lemma":"يَنْحِتُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61601,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِبَالَ","transliteration":"l-jibāla","translation_bn":"পাহাড়গুলোতে","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61602,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بُيُوتًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"buyūtan","translation_bn":"বসতঘরসমূহ","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61604,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"fa-udh''kurū","translation_bn":"অতএব তোমরা স্মরণ করো","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61605,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ءَالَآءَ","transliteration":"ālāa","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহগুলোকে","root":"الو","lemma":"ءَالَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61606,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61607,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61608,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"تَعْثَوْا۟","transliteration":"taʿthaw","translation_bn":"অনাচার সৃষ্টি করো","root":"عثو","lemma":"تَعْثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61609,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61610,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61611,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مُفْسِدِينَ","transliteration":"muf''sidīna","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টিকারী হয়ে","root":"فسد","lemma":"مُفْسِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61612,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-udh''kurū idh jaʿalakum khulafāa min baʿdi ʿādin wabawwa-akum fī l-arḍi tattakhidhūna min suhūlihā quṣūran watanḥitūna l-jibāla buyūtan fa-udh''kurū ālāa l-lahi walā taʿthaw fī l-arḍi muf''sidīna', 'স্মরণ কর, ‘আদ জাতির পরে তিনি তোমাদেরকে তাদের স্থলাভিষিক্ত করেছেন আর তোমাদেরকে যমীনে বসতি দান করেছেন, তোমরা তার সমতলে প্রাসাদ নির্মাণ করছ আর পাহাড় কেটে ঘর তৈরি করছ, কাজেই আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহের কথা স্মরণ কর, পৃথিবীতে ফাসাদ সৃষ্টি কর না।', 'And remember when He made you successors after the ''Aad and settled you in the land, [and] you take for yourselves palaces from its plains and carve from the mountains, homes. Then remember the favors of Allah and do not commit abuse on the earth, spreading corruption."', 'স্মরণ কর, ‘আদ জাতির পরে তিনি তোমাদেরকে তাদের স্থলাভিষিক্ত করেছেন আর তোমাদেরকে যমীনে বসতি দান করেছেন, তোমরা তার সমতলে প্রাসাদ নির্মাণ করছ আর পাহাড় কেটে ঘর তৈরি করছ, কাজেই আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহের কথা স্মরণ কর, পৃথিবীতে ফাসাদ সৃষ্টি কর না।', 'And remember when He made you successors after the ''Aad and settled you in the land, [and] you take for yourselves palaces from its plains and carve from the mountains, homes. Then remember the favors of Allah and do not commit abuse on the earth, spreading corruption."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007074.mp3', now()),
  (7, 75, '', '[{"id":62167,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62168,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَأُ","transliteration":"l-mala-u","translation_bn":"(সেই জাতির) প্রধান ব্যক্তিরা","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62169,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":62170,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"is''takbarū","translation_bn":"অহংকার করেছিলো","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62171,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62172,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"জাতির তার","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62173,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62174,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتُضْعِفُوا۟","transliteration":"us''tuḍ''ʿifū","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে দুর্বল করে রাখা হয়েছিলো","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ٱسْتَضْعَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62175,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِمَنْ","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"(তাদের)কে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62176,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছিলো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62177,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62178,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَتَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"ataʿlamūna","translation_bn":"\"কি তোমরা জানো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":62179,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62180,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"সালেহ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح2","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":62181,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مُّرْسَلٌۭ","transliteration":"mur''salun","translation_bn":"(সত্যিই) প্রেরিত হয়েছে","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُّرْسَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62182,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62183,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"rabbihi","translation_bn":"তার রবের\"","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62185,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62186,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62187,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62188,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أُرْسِلَ","transliteration":"ur''sila","translation_bn":"তাকে পাঠানো হয়েছে","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62189,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62190,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"mu''minūna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাসী\"","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62191,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla l-mala-u alladhīna is''takbarū min qawmihi lilladhīna us''tuḍ''ʿifū liman āmana min''hum ataʿlamūna anna ṣāliḥan mur''salun min rabbihi qālū innā bimā ur''sila bihi mu''minūna', 'তার জাতির গর্বিত প্রধানগণ ঐসব লোকদেরকে বলেছিল যাদেরকে দুর্বল করে রাখা হয়েছিল, যারা তাদের মধ্যে ঈমান এনেছিল- ‘‘তোমরা কি জান যে সালিহ তার প্রতিপালক কর্তৃক প্রেরিত? তারা বলেছিল, ‘তিনি যে বাণী নিয়ে প্রেরিত হয়েছেন তাতে আমরা বিশ্বাসী’।', 'Said the eminent ones who were arrogant among his people to those who were oppressed - to those who believed among them, "Do you [actually] know that Salih is sent from his Lord?" They said, "Indeed we, in that with which he was sent, are believers."', 'তার জাতির গর্বিত প্রধানগণ ঐসব লোকদেরকে বলেছিল যাদেরকে দুর্বল করে রাখা হয়েছিল, যারা তাদের মধ্যে ঈমান এনেছিল- ‘‘তোমরা কি জান যে সালিহ তার প্রতিপালক কর্তৃক প্রেরিত? তারা বলেছিল, ‘তিনি যে বাণী নিয়ে প্রেরিত হয়েছেন তাতে আমরা বিশ্বাসী’।', 'Said the eminent ones who were arrogant among his people to those who were oppressed - to those who believed among them, "Do you [actually] know that Salih is sent from his Lord?" They said, "Indeed we, in that with which he was sent, are believers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007075.mp3', now()),
  (7, 76, '', '[{"id":62499,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62500,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":62501,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"is''takbarū","translation_bn":"অহংকার করেছিলো","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62502,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62503,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"bi-alladhī","translation_bn":"উপর যার","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62504,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنتُم","transliteration":"āmantum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62505,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"প্রতি তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62506,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"kāfirūna","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাখ্যানকারী\"","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62507,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla alladhīna is''takbarū innā bi-alladhī āmantum bihi kāfirūna', 'যারা অহঙ্কার করেছিল তারা বলেছিল, ‘তোমরা যাতে বিশ্বাস করেছ আমরা তা অস্বীকার করছি।’', 'Said those who were arrogant, "Indeed we, in that which you have believed, are disbelievers."', 'যারা অহঙ্কার করেছিল তারা বলেছিল, ‘তোমরা যাতে বিশ্বাস করেছ আমরা তা অস্বীকার করছি।’', 'Said those who were arrogant, "Indeed we, in that which you have believed, are disbelievers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007076.mp3', now()),
  (7, 77, '', '[{"id":62774,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَعَقَرُوا۟","transliteration":"faʿaqarū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা হত্যা করলো","root":"عقر","lemma":"عَقَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62775,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاقَةَ","transliteration":"l-nāqata","translation_bn":"মাদি উটটিকে","root":"نوق","lemma":"نَاقَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62776,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَعَتَوْا۟","transliteration":"waʿataw","translation_bn":"ও তারা অমান্য করলো","root":"عتو","lemma":"عَتَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62777,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62778,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَمْرِ","transliteration":"amri","translation_bn":"নির্দেশ (পালন করা)","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62779,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّهِمْ","transliteration":"rabbihim","translation_bn":"রবের তাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62780,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62781,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰصَـٰلِحُ","transliteration":"yāṣāliḥu","translation_bn":"\"হে সালেহ","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح2","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":62782,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱئْتِنَا","transliteration":"i''tinā","translation_bn":"কাছে এসো আমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62783,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"নিয়ে ঐ বিষয় যার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62784,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَعِدُنَآ","transliteration":"taʿidunā","translation_bn":"তুমি ধমক দিচ্ছো আমাদেরকে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62785,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":62786,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كُنتَ","transliteration":"kunta","translation_bn":"হও তুমি","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62787,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62788,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ","transliteration":"l-mur''salīna","translation_bn":"রাসূলদের\"","root":"رسل","lemma":"مُّرْسَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62789,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faʿaqarū l-nāqata waʿataw ʿan amri rabbihim waqālū yāṣāliḥu i''tinā bimā taʿidunā in kunta mina l-mur''salīna', 'অতঃপর তারা উষ্ট্রীটিকে মেরে ফেলল এবং তাদের প্রতিপালকের স্পষ্ট বিরোধিতা করে চলল আর বলল, ‘হে সালিহ! তুমি যদি রসূল হয়েই থাক তাহলে তা নিয়ে এসো আমাদেরকে যার ওয়াদা করছ (ভয় দেখাচ্ছ)।’', 'So they hamstrung the she-camel and were insolent toward the command of their Lord and said, "O Salih, bring us what you promise us, if you should be of the messengers."', 'অতঃপর তারা উষ্ট্রীটিকে মেরে ফেলল এবং তাদের প্রতিপালকের স্পষ্ট বিরোধিতা করে চলল আর বলল, ‘হে সালিহ! তুমি যদি রসূল হয়েই থাক তাহলে তা নিয়ে এসো আমাদেরকে যার ওয়াদা করছ (ভয় দেখাচ্ছ)।’', 'So they hamstrung the she-camel and were insolent toward the command of their Lord and said, "O Salih, bring us what you promise us, if you should be of the messengers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007077.mp3', now()),
  (7, 78, '', '[{"id":63475,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَخَذَتْهُمُ","transliteration":"fa-akhadhathumu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর গ্রাস করলো তাদেরকে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63476,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّجْفَةُ","transliteration":"l-rajfatu","translation_bn":"ভূমিকম্প","root":"رجف","lemma":"رَّجْفَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63477,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَأَصْبَحُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-aṣbaḥū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা হয়ে গেলো","root":"صبح","lemma":"أَصْبَحَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63478,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63479,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دَارِهِمْ","transliteration":"dārihim","translation_bn":"ঘরের তাদের","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63480,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَـٰثِمِينَ","transliteration":"jāthimīna","translation_bn":"উপুড় হয়ে পড়ে থাকা অবস্থায় অর্থাৎ মৃত পড়ে রইলো)","root":"جثم","lemma":"جَٰثِمِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63481,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-akhadhathumu l-rajfatu fa-aṣbaḥū fī dārihim jāthimīna', 'অতঃপর ভূমিকম্প তাদেরকে হঠাৎ পাকড়াও করল আর তারা তাদের ঘরগুলোতে মুখ থুবড়ে পড়ে রইল।', 'So the earthquake seized them, and they became within their home [corpses] fallen prone.', 'অতঃপর ভূমিকম্প তাদেরকে হঠাৎ পাকড়াও করল আর তারা তাদের ঘরগুলোতে মুখ থুবড়ে পড়ে রইল।', 'So the earthquake seized them, and they became within their home [corpses] fallen prone.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007078.mp3', now()),
  (7, 79, '', '[{"id":63880,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَتَوَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"fatawallā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে মুখ ফিরালো","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63881,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63882,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63883,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":63884,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":63885,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَبْلَغْتُكُمْ","transliteration":"ablaghtukum","translation_bn":"পৌঁছেছিলাম তোমাদেরকে","root":"بلغ","lemma":"أَبْلَغُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63886,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رِسَالَةَ","transliteration":"risālata","translation_bn":"রিসালাত (বাণী)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رِسَالَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63887,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63888,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَنَصَحْتُ","transliteration":"wanaṣaḥtu","translation_bn":"এবং আমি উপদেশ দিয়েছিলাম","root":"نصح","lemma":"نَصَحُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63889,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63890,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63891,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":63892,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تُحِبُّونَ","transliteration":"tuḥibbūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা পছন্দ করো","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63893,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّـٰصِحِينَ","transliteration":"l-nāṣiḥīna","translation_bn":"উপদেশকারীদেরকে\"","root":"نصح","lemma":"نَاصِح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63894,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fatawallā ʿanhum waqāla yāqawmi laqad ablaghtukum risālata rabbī wanaṣaḥtu lakum walākin lā tuḥibbūna l-nāṣiḥīna', 'আর সালিহ এ কথা বলে তাদেরকে পরিত্যাগ করল যে, হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! ‘আমি তোমাদের কাছে আমার প্রতিপালকের বাণী পৌঁছে দিয়েছি, আর তোমাদেরকে সদুপদেশ দিয়েছি কিন্তু সদুপদেশ দানকারীদেরকে তোমরা পছন্দ কর না।’', 'And he turned away from them and said, "O my people, I had certainly conveyed to you the message of my Lord and advised you, but you do not like advisors."', 'আর সালিহ এ কথা বলে তাদেরকে পরিত্যাগ করল যে, হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! ‘আমি তোমাদের কাছে আমার প্রতিপালকের বাণী পৌঁছে দিয়েছি, আর তোমাদেরকে সদুপদেশ দিয়েছি কিন্তু সদুপদেশ দানকারীদেরকে তোমরা পছন্দ কর না।’', 'And he turned away from them and said, "O my people, I had certainly conveyed to you the message of my Lord and advised you, but you do not like advisors."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007079.mp3', now()),
  (7, 80, '', '[{"id":64148,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلُوطًا","transliteration":"walūṭan","translation_bn":"এবং লুতকে (পাঠিয়েছিলাম)","root":"—","lemma":"لُوط","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64149,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"(স্মরণ করো) যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":64150,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64151,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِقَوْمِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"liqawmihi","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে জাতির তার","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64152,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَتَأْتُونَ","transliteration":"atatūna","translation_bn":"\"কি তোমরা আসো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":64153,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰحِشَةَ","transliteration":"l-fāḥishata","translation_bn":"(এমন) অশ্লীলকাজে","root":"فحش","lemma":"فَٰحِشَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64154,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(যা) না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":64155,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سَبَقَكُم","transliteration":"sabaqakum","translation_bn":"পূর্বে করেছে তোমাদের","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَبَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64156,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে সে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64157,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64158,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدٍۢ","transliteration":"aḥadin","translation_bn":"একজন","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64159,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64160,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"সারা বিশ্বের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64161,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walūṭan idh qāla liqawmihi atatūna l-fāḥishata mā sabaqakum bihā min aḥadin mina l-ʿālamīna', 'আর আমি লূতকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। যখন সে তার জাতিকে বলেছিল, ‘তোমরা এমন নির্লজ্জতার কাজ করছ যা বিশ্বজগতে তোমাদের পূর্বে কোন একজনও করেনি।’', 'And [We had sent] Lot when he said to his people, "Do you commit such immorality as no one has preceded you with from among the worlds?', 'আর আমি লূতকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। যখন সে তার জাতিকে বলেছিল, ‘তোমরা এমন নির্লজ্জতার কাজ করছ যা বিশ্বজগতে তোমাদের পূর্বে কোন একজনও করেনি।’', 'And [We had sent] Lot when he said to his people, "Do you commit such immorality as no one has preceded you with from among the worlds?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007080.mp3', now()),
  (7, 81, '', '[{"id":64658,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"innakum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64659,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَتَأْتُونَ","transliteration":"latatūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তোমরা আসো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":64660,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرِّجَالَ","transliteration":"l-rijāla","translation_bn":"পুরুষদের (কাছে)","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجَال","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64661,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شَهْوَةًۭ","transliteration":"shahwatan","translation_bn":"যৌন-তৃপ্তির জন্যে","root":"شهو","lemma":"شَهْوَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64662,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64663,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"বাদ","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64664,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنِّسَآءِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-nisāi","translation_bn":"স্ত্রীলোকদের","root":"نسو","lemma":"نِسَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64666,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":64667,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":64668,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"qawmun","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64669,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْرِفُونَ","transliteration":"mus''rifūna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী\"","root":"سرف","lemma":"مُسْرِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":64670,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innakum latatūna l-rijāla shahwatan min dūni l-nisāi bal antum qawmun mus''rifūna', 'তোমরা যৌন তাড়নায় স্ত্রীদের বাদ দিয়ে পুরুষদের নিকট গমন করছ, তোমরা হচ্ছ এক সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী সম্প্রদায়।', 'Indeed, you approach men with desire, instead of women. Rather, you are a transgressing people."', 'তোমরা যৌন তাড়নায় স্ত্রীদের বাদ দিয়ে পুরুষদের নিকট গমন করছ, তোমরা হচ্ছ এক সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী সম্প্রদায়।', 'Indeed, you approach men with desire, instead of women. Rather, you are a transgressing people."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007081.mp3', now()),
  (7, 82, '', '[{"id":64882,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64883,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64884,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَوَابَ","transliteration":"jawāba","translation_bn":"উত্তর","root":"جوب","lemma":"جَوَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64885,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"জাতির তার","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64886,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":64887,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":64888,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64889,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَخْرِجُوهُم","transliteration":"akhrijūhum","translation_bn":"\"বের করে দাও তাদের","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64890,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64891,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَتِكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"qaryatikum","translation_bn":"জনপদ তোমাদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64893,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64894,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أُنَاسٌۭ","transliteration":"unāsun","translation_bn":"(এমন) লোক","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنسَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64895,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَتَطَهَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yataṭahharūna","translation_bn":"যারা অতি পবিত্র থাকতে চায়\"","root":"طهر","lemma":"تَطَهَّرْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64896,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kāna jawāba qawmihi illā an qālū akhrijūhum min qaryatikum innahum unāsun yataṭahharūna', 'তার জাতির এ ছাড়া আর কোন জবাব ছিল না যে, ‘তোমাদের জনপদ থেকে এদেরকে বের করে দাও, এরা এমন লোক যারা খুব পবিত্র হতে চায়।’', 'But the answer of his people was only that they said, "Evict them from your city! Indeed, they are men who keep themselves pure."', 'তার জাতির এ ছাড়া আর কোন জবাব ছিল না যে, ‘তোমাদের জনপদ থেকে এদেরকে বের করে দাও, এরা এমন লোক যারা খুব পবিত্র হতে চায়।’', 'But the answer of his people was only that they said, "Evict them from your city! Indeed, they are men who keep themselves pure."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007082.mp3', now()),
  (7, 83, '', '[{"id":65242,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنجَيْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"fa-anjaynāhu","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আমরা উদ্ধার করলাম তাকে","root":"نجو","lemma":"أَنجَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65243,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"wa-ahlahu","translation_bn":"ও তার পরিবারকে","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65244,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":65245,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱمْرَأَتَهُۥ","transliteration":"im''ra-atahu","translation_bn":"স্ত্রী তার","root":"مرا","lemma":"ٱمْرَأَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65246,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَانَتْ","transliteration":"kānat","translation_bn":"সে ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65247,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65248,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَـٰبِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-ghābirīna","translation_bn":"পিছনে অবস্থানকারীদের","root":"غبر","lemma":"غَٰبِرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65249,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-anjaynāhu wa-ahlahu illā im''ra-atahu kānat mina l-ghābirīna', 'অতঃপর আমি তাকে আর তার পরিবার-পরিজনকে রক্ষা করলাম কিন্তু তার স্ত্রী ছাড়া, কেননা সে ছিল পেছনে অবস্থানকারীদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'So We saved him and his family, except for his wife; she was of those who remained [with the evildoers].', 'অতঃপর আমি তাকে আর তার পরিবার-পরিজনকে রক্ষা করলাম কিন্তু তার স্ত্রী ছাড়া, কেননা সে ছিল পেছনে অবস্থানকারীদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত।', 'So We saved him and his family, except for his wife; she was of those who remained [with the evildoers].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007083.mp3', now()),
  (7, 84, '', '[{"id":65669,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمْطَرْنَا","transliteration":"wa-amṭarnā","translation_bn":"এবং বৃষ্টিবর্ষণ করেছিলাম আমরা","root":"مطر","lemma":"أُمْطِرَتْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65670,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِم","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65671,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَّطَرًۭا ۖ","transliteration":"maṭaran","translation_bn":"(পাথর) বৃষ্টি","root":"مطر","lemma":"مَّطَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65673,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنظُرْ","transliteration":"fa-unẓur","translation_bn":"অতঃপর লক্ষ্য করো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65674,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":65675,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65676,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65677,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীদের","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65678,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-amṭarnā ʿalayhim maṭaran fa-unẓur kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu l-muj''rimīna', 'তাদের উপর এক পাথরের বৃষ্টি বর্ষিয়ে দিলাম। তারপর দেখ, অপরাধীদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছিল!', 'And We rained upon them a rain [of stones]. Then see how was the end of the criminals.', 'তাদের উপর এক পাথরের বৃষ্টি বর্ষিয়ে দিলাম। তারপর দেখ, অপরাধীদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছিল!', 'And We rained upon them a rain [of stones]. Then see how was the end of the criminals.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007084.mp3', now()),
  (7, 85, '', '[{"id":66028,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَىٰ","transliteration":"wa-ilā","translation_bn":"এবং দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66029,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَدْيَنَ","transliteration":"madyana","translation_bn":"মাদইয়ানের","root":"—","lemma":"مَدْيَن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66030,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَخَاهُمْ","transliteration":"akhāhum","translation_bn":"তাদের ভাই","root":"اخو","lemma":"أَخ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66031,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شُعَيْبًۭا ۗ","transliteration":"shuʿayban","translation_bn":"শুয়াইবকে","root":"—","lemma":"شُعَيْب","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66033,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66034,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","transliteration":"yāqawmi","translation_bn":"\"হে আমার জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":66035,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْبُدُوا۟","transliteration":"uʿ''budū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ইবাদত করো","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66036,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66037,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":66038,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66039,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66040,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهٍ","transliteration":"ilāhin","translation_bn":"ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66041,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"غَيْرُهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"ghayruhu","translation_bn":"ছাড়া তিনি","root":"غير","lemma":"غَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66043,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":66044,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْكُم","transliteration":"jāatkum","translation_bn":"কাছে এসেছে তোমাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66045,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَيِّنَةٌۭ","transliteration":"bayyinatun","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট প্রমাণ","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيِّنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66046,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66047,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"রবের তোমাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66049,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَأَوْفُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-awfū","translation_bn":"অতএব তোমরা পূর্ণ করো","root":"وفي","lemma":"أَوْفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66050,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَيْلَ","transliteration":"l-kayla","translation_bn":"মাপ","root":"كيل","lemma":"كَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66051,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمِيزَانَ","transliteration":"wal-mīzāna","translation_bn":"ও ওজন","root":"وزن","lemma":"مِيزَان","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66052,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66053,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"تَبْخَسُوا۟","transliteration":"tabkhasū","translation_bn":"তোমরা কম দিও","root":"بخس","lemma":"يَبْخَسْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66054,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষদেরকে","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66055,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"أَشْيَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"ashyāahum","translation_bn":"তাদের (প্রাপ্য) দ্রব্যে","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66056,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66057,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"تُفْسِدُوا۟","transliteration":"tuf''sidū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিপর্যয় করো","root":"فسد","lemma":"أَفْسَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66058,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66059,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66060,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরেও","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":66061,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"إِصْلَـٰحِهَا ۚ","transliteration":"iṣ''lāḥihā","translation_bn":"সংস্কারের তার","root":"صلح","lemma":"إِصْلَٰح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66063,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكُمْ","transliteration":"dhālikum","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":66064,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66065,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"لَّكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66066,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":66067,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"হও তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66068,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"مُّؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66069,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ilā madyana akhāhum shuʿayban qāla yāqawmi uʿ''budū l-laha mā lakum min ilāhin ghayruhu qad jāatkum bayyinatun min rabbikum fa-awfū l-kayla wal-mīzāna walā tabkhasū l-nāsa ashyāahum walā tuf''sidū fī l-arḍi baʿda iṣ''lāḥihā dhālikum khayrun lakum in kuntum mu''minīna', 'আমি মাদইয়ানবাসীদের কাছে তাদের ভাই শু‘আয়বকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। (সে বলেছিল) ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি ছাড়া তোমাদের কোন ইলাহ নেই, তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে তোমাদের কাছে তো স্পষ্ট নিদর্শন এসে গেছে, কাজেই মাপ ও ওজন সঠিকভাবে কর, লোকেদেরকে তাদের প্রাপ্য বিষয়ে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত করো না, পৃথিবীর সংশোধনের পর তাতে বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টি কর না, এটাই তোমাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর যদি তোমরা সত্যিই মু’মিন হয়ে থাক।’', 'And to [the people of] Madyan [We sent] their brother Shu''ayb. He said, "O my people, worship Allah; you have no deity other than Him. There has come to you clear evidence from your Lord. So fulfill the measure and weight and do not deprive people of their due and cause not corruption upon the earth after its reformation. That is better for you, if you should be believers.', 'আমি মাদইয়ানবাসীদের কাছে তাদের ভাই শু‘আয়বকে পাঠিয়েছিলাম। (সে বলেছিল) ‘হে আমার সম্প্রদায়! তোমরা আল্লাহর ‘ইবাদাত কর, তিনি ছাড়া তোমাদের কোন ইলাহ নেই, তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে তোমাদের কাছে তো স্পষ্ট নিদর্শন এসে গেছে, কাজেই মাপ ও ওজন সঠিকভাবে কর, লোকেদেরকে তাদের প্রাপ্য বিষয়ে ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত করো না, পৃথিবীর সংশোধনের পর তাতে বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টি কর না, এটাই তোমাদের জন্য কল্যাণকর যদি তোমরা সত্যিই মু’মিন হয়ে থাক।’', 'And to [the people of] Madyan [We sent] their brother Shu''ayb. He said, "O my people, worship Allah; you have no deity other than Him. There has come to you clear evidence from your Lord. So fulfill the measure and weight and do not deprive people of their due and cause not corruption upon the earth after its reformation. That is better for you, if you should be believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007085.mp3', now()),
  (7, 86, '', '[{"id":66466,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66467,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَقْعُدُوا۟","transliteration":"taqʿudū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বসবে","root":"قعد","lemma":"قَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66468,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"উপর প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66469,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"রাস্তার","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66470,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تُوعِدُونَ","transliteration":"tūʿidūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় দেখাবে (না)","root":"وعد","lemma":"تُوعِدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66471,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَتَصُدُّونَ","transliteration":"wataṣuddūna","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা বাধা দিবে (না)","root":"صدد","lemma":"صَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66472,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66473,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66474,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66475,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তাকে) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":66476,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَ","transliteration":"āmana","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66477,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66478,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَتَبْغُونَهَا","transliteration":"watabghūnahā","translation_bn":"এবং (না) তোমরা অনুসন্ধান করবে তাতে","root":"بغي","lemma":"بَغَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66479,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عِوَجًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ʿiwajan","translation_bn":"বক্রতা","root":"عوج","lemma":"عِوَج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66481,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱذْكُرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-udh''kurū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা স্মরণ করো","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66482,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":66483,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66484,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلًۭا","transliteration":"qalīlan","translation_bn":"(সংখ্যায়) অল্প","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66485,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَكَثَّرَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"fakatharakum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আধিক্য দিয়েছেন তোমাদেরকে","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثَّرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66487,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَٱنظُرُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-unẓurū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা লক্ষ্য করো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66488,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কিরূপ","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":66489,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66490,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66491,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-muf''sidīna","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টিকারীদের","root":"فسد","lemma":"مُفْسِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66492,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā taqʿudū bikulli ṣirāṭin tūʿidūna wataṣuddūna ʿan sabīli l-lahi man āmana bihi watabghūnahā ʿiwajan wa-udh''kurū idh kuntum qalīlan fakatharakum wa-unẓurū kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu l-muf''sidīna', '‘যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদেরকে ভয় দেখানোর জন্য আর আল্লাহর পথ থেকে বাধা দেয়ার জন্য প্রতিটি পথে পাহারা বসিও না, আর তাতে (অর্থাৎ আল্লাহর সহজ-সরল পথে) বক্রতা অনুসন্ধান কর না।’ স্মরণ কর, ‘তোমরা সংখ্যায় অল্প ছিলে, অতঃপর আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে সংখ্যাধিক্য করে দিয়েছেন। লক্ষ্য কর, বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টিকারীদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছিল।’', 'And do not sit on every path, threatening and averting from the way of Allah those who believe in Him, seeking to make it [seem] deviant. And remember when you were few and He increased you. And see how was the end of the corrupters.', '‘যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদেরকে ভয় দেখানোর জন্য আর আল্লাহর পথ থেকে বাধা দেয়ার জন্য প্রতিটি পথে পাহারা বসিও না, আর তাতে (অর্থাৎ আল্লাহর সহজ-সরল পথে) বক্রতা অনুসন্ধান কর না।’ স্মরণ কর, ‘তোমরা সংখ্যায় অল্প ছিলে, অতঃপর আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে সংখ্যাধিক্য করে দিয়েছেন। লক্ষ্য কর, বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টিকারীদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছিল।’', 'And do not sit on every path, threatening and averting from the way of Allah those who believe in Him, seeking to make it [seem] deviant. And remember when you were few and He increased you. And see how was the end of the corrupters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007086.mp3', now()),
  (7, 87, '', '[{"id":67027,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67028,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"(এমন) হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67029,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"طَآئِفَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ṭāifatun","translation_bn":"একদল","root":"طوف","lemma":"طَا^ئِفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67030,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67031,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"(যারা) ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67032,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"bi-alladhī","translation_bn":"প্রতি ঐ বিষয়ের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67033,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أُرْسِلْتُ","transliteration":"ur''sil''tu","translation_bn":"আমি প্রেরিত হয়েছি","root":"رسل","lemma":"أَرْسَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67034,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67035,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَطَآئِفَةٌۭ","transliteration":"waṭāifatun","translation_bn":"এবং (অন্য) একদল","root":"طوف","lemma":"طَا^ئِفَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67036,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":67037,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُوا۟","transliteration":"yu''minū","translation_bn":"তারা ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67038,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَٱصْبِرُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-iṣ''birū","translation_bn":"তবে তোমরা ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":67039,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67040,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَحْكُمَ","transliteration":"yaḥkuma","translation_bn":"মীমাংসা করেন","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67041,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67042,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَنَا ۚ","transliteration":"baynanā","translation_bn":"মাঝে আমাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":67044,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67045,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرُ","transliteration":"khayru","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67046,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَـٰكِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ḥākimīna","translation_bn":"মীমাংসাকারীদের\"","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَٰكِمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67047,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in kāna ṭāifatun minkum āmanū bi-alladhī ur''sil''tu bihi waṭāifatun lam yu''minū fa-iṣ''birū ḥattā yaḥkuma l-lahu baynanā wahuwa khayru l-ḥākimīna', '‘আমি যা নিয়ে প্রেরিত হয়েছি তাতে যদি তোমাদের একদল ঈমান আনে আর একদল ঈমান না আনে, তাহলে ধৈর্য ধারণ কর যে পর্যন্ত না আল্লাহ আমাদের আর তোমাদের মাঝে মীমাংসা করে দেন, তিনি হলেন সর্বোত্তম মীমাংসাকারী।’', 'And if there should be a group among you who has believed in that with which I have been sent and a group that has not believed, then be patient until Allah judges between us. And He is the best of judges."', '‘আমি যা নিয়ে প্রেরিত হয়েছি তাতে যদি তোমাদের একদল ঈমান আনে আর একদল ঈমান না আনে, তাহলে ধৈর্য ধারণ কর যে পর্যন্ত না আল্লাহ আমাদের আর তোমাদের মাঝে মীমাংসা করে দেন, তিনি হলেন সর্বোত্তম মীমাংসাকারী।’', 'And if there should be a group among you who has believed in that with which I have been sent and a group that has not believed, then be patient until Allah judges between us. And He is the best of judges."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007087.mp3', now()),
  (7, 88, '', '[{"id":67407,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67408,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَأُ","transliteration":"l-mala-u","translation_bn":"প্রধানরা","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67409,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":67410,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَكْبَرُوا۟","transliteration":"is''takbarū","translation_bn":"অহংকার করেছিলো","root":"كبر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْبَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67411,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67412,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"জাতি তার","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67413,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَنُخْرِجَنَّكَ","transliteration":"lanukh''rijannaka","translation_bn":"\"অবশ্যই আমরা বের করবো তোমাকে","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":67414,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰشُعَيْبُ","transliteration":"yāshuʿaybu","translation_bn":"হে শুয়াইব","root":"—","lemma":"شُعَيْب","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":67415,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67416,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67417,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَعَكَ","transliteration":"maʿaka","translation_bn":"সাথে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":67418,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67419,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَرْيَتِنَآ","transliteration":"qaryatinā","translation_bn":"জনপদ আমাদের","root":"قري","lemma":"قَرْيَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67420,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67421,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَتَعُودُنَّ","transliteration":"lataʿūdunna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তোমরা ফিরে আসবে","root":"عود","lemma":"عَادَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":67422,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67423,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِلَّتِنَا ۚ","transliteration":"millatinā","translation_bn":"দীনের আমাদের\"","root":"ملل","lemma":"مِلَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67425,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67426,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَوْ","transliteration":"awalaw","translation_bn":"\"কি যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":67427,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"আমরা হলাম (তোমাদের দীনকে)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67428,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰرِهِينَ","transliteration":"kārihīna","translation_bn":"অপছন্দকারী","root":"كره","lemma":"كَٰرِهُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67429,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla l-mala-u alladhīna is''takbarū min qawmihi lanukh''rijannaka yāshuʿaybu wa-alladhīna āmanū maʿaka min qaryatinā aw lataʿūdunna fī millatinā qāla awalaw kunnā kārihīna', 'তার জাতির উদ্ধত সর্দারগণ বলল, ‘ওহে শু‘আয়ব! আমরা তোমাকে আর তোমার সঙ্গে যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদেরকে আমাদের জনপদ থেকে বের করে দেবই, অথবা তুমি আমাদের ধর্মবিশ্বাসে অবশ্যই ফিরে আসবে।’ সে বলল, ‘আমরা যদি তাতে রাজী না হই তবুও?’', 'Said the eminent ones who were arrogant among his people, "We will surely evict you, O Shu''ayb, and those who have believed with you from our city, or you must return to our religion." He said, "Even if we were unwilling?"', 'তার জাতির উদ্ধত সর্দারগণ বলল, ‘ওহে শু‘আয়ব! আমরা তোমাকে আর তোমার সঙ্গে যারা ঈমান এনেছে তাদেরকে আমাদের জনপদ থেকে বের করে দেবই, অথবা তুমি আমাদের ধর্মবিশ্বাসে অবশ্যই ফিরে আসবে।’ সে বলল, ‘আমরা যদি তাতে রাজী না হই তবুও?’', 'Said the eminent ones who were arrogant among his people, "We will surely evict you, O Shu''ayb, and those who have believed with you from our city, or you must return to our religion." He said, "Even if we were unwilling?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007088.mp3', now()),
