 "O Moses, either you throw [your staff], or we will be the ones to throw [first]."', 'তারা বলল, ‘হে মূসা! তুমিই কি (প্রথমে যাদু) ছুঁড়বে, না আমরাই ছুঁড়ব?’', 'They said, "O Moses, either you throw [your staff], or we will be the ones to throw [first]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007115.mp3', now()),
  (7, 116, '', '[{"id":75464,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75465,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَلْقُوا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"alqū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ছোঁড়ো\"","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75467,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75468,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَلْقَوْا۟","transliteration":"alqaw","translation_bn":"তারা ছুঁড়লো","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75469,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَحَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"saḥarū","translation_bn":"তারা জাদু করলো","root":"سحر","lemma":"سَحَرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75470,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَعْيُنَ","transliteration":"aʿyuna","translation_bn":"চোখগুলোকে","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75471,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75472,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱسْتَرْهَبُوهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-is''tarhabūhum","translation_bn":"ও তারা সন্ত্রস্ত করলো তাদেরকে","root":"رهب","lemma":"ٱسْتَرْهَبُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75473,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَجَآءُو","transliteration":"wajāū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75474,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِسِحْرٍ","transliteration":"bisiḥ''rin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে জাদু","root":"سحر","lemma":"سِحْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75475,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","translation_bn":"বড় (ধরনের)","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":75476,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla alqū falammā alqaw saḥarū aʿyuna l-nāsi wa-is''tarhabūhum wajāū bisiḥ''rin ʿaẓīmin', 'সে বলল, ‘তোমরাই ছুঁড়’। যখন তারা বান ছুঁড়ল তখন লোকজনের চোখ যাদুগ্রস্ত হয়ে গেল, তারা ভীত সন্ত্রস্ত হয়ে পড়ল। তারা বড়ই সাংঘাতিক এক যাদু দেখাল।', 'He said, "Throw," and when they threw, they bewitched the eyes of the people and struck terror into them, and they presented a great [feat of] magic.', 'সে বলল, ‘তোমরাই ছুঁড়’। যখন তারা বান ছুঁড়ল তখন লোকজনের চোখ যাদুগ্রস্ত হয়ে গেল, তারা ভীত সন্ত্রস্ত হয়ে পড়ল। তারা বড়ই সাংঘাতিক এক যাদু দেখাল।', 'He said, "Throw," and when they threw, they bewitched the eyes of the people and struck terror into them, and they presented a great [feat of] magic.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007116.mp3', now()),
  (7, 117, '', '[{"id":75842,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَأَوْحَيْنَآ","transliteration":"wa-awḥaynā","translation_bn":"এবং ওহী করলাম আমরা","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75843,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":75844,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসার","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":75845,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যবাচক (Intention)"},{"id":75846,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَلْقِ","transliteration":"alqi","translation_bn":"\"ছোঁড়ো","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75847,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَصَاكَ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿaṣāka","translation_bn":"তোমার লাঠি\"","root":"عصو","lemma":"عَصَا2","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":75849,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا2\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75850,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هِىَ","transliteration":"hiya","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"هِىَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":75851,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَلْقَفُ","transliteration":"talqafu","translation_bn":"গিলে ফেলতে লাগলো","root":"لقف","lemma":"تَلْقَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75852,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75853,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَأْفِكُونَ","transliteration":"yafikūna","translation_bn":"তারা কৃত্রিম সৃষ্টি করে","root":"افك","lemma":"أُفِكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75854,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-awḥaynā ilā mūsā an alqi ʿaṣāka fa-idhā hiya talqafu mā yafikūna', 'আমি মূসার কাছে ওয়াহী করলাম, ‘তোমার লাঠি ছুঁড়ে দাও’। তখন তা তাদের অলীক বস্তুগুলোকে গ্রাস করতে শুরু করল।', 'And We inspired to Moses, "Throw your staff," and at once it devoured what they were falsifying.', 'আমি মূসার কাছে ওয়াহী করলাম, ‘তোমার লাঠি ছুঁড়ে দাও’। তখন তা তাদের অলীক বস্তুগুলোকে গ্রাস করতে শুরু করল।', 'And We inspired to Moses, "Throw your staff," and at once it devoured what they were falsifying.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007117.mp3', now()),
  (7, 118, '', '[{"id":75913,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَوَقَعَ","transliteration":"fawaqaʿa","translation_bn":"ফলে প্রতিষ্ঠিত হলো","root":"وقع","lemma":"وَقَعَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75914,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":75915,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَبَطَلَ","transliteration":"wabaṭala","translation_bn":"ও অসত্য হলো","root":"بطل","lemma":"بَطَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":75916,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":75917,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75918,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":75919,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"١١٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fawaqaʿa l-ḥaqu wabaṭala mā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'প্রকৃত সত্য প্রকাশ হয়ে গেল, তারা যা সাজিয়েছিল তা নিস্ফল হয়ে গেল।', 'So the truth was established, and abolished was what they were doing.', 'প্রকৃত সত্য প্রকাশ হয়ে গেল, তারা যা সাজিয়েছিল তা নিস্ফল হয়ে গেল।', 'So the truth was established, and abolished was what they were doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007118.mp3', now()),
  (7, 119, '', '[{"id":76203,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَغُلِبُوا۟","transliteration":"faghulibū","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তারা পরাজিত হলো","root":"غلب","lemma":"غَلَبُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76204,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هُنَالِكَ","transliteration":"hunālika","translation_bn":"সেখানে","root":"—","lemma":"هُنَالِك\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":76205,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَٱنقَلَبُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-inqalabū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ফিরে গেলো","root":"قلب","lemma":"ٱنقَلَبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76206,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰغِرِينَ","transliteration":"ṣāghirīna","translation_bn":"লাঞ্ছিত হয়ে","root":"صغر","lemma":"صَٰغِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76207,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"١١٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faghulibū hunālika wa-inqalabū ṣāghirīna', 'তারা সেখানে পরাজিত হল আর লাঞ্ছিত অবস্থায় ফিরে গেল।', 'And Pharaoh and his people were overcome right there and became debased.', 'তারা সেখানে পরাজিত হল আর লাঞ্ছিত অবস্থায় ফিরে গেল।', 'And Pharaoh and his people were overcome right there and became debased.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007119.mp3', now()),
  (7, 120, '', '[{"id":76486,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأُلْقِىَ","transliteration":"wa-ul''qiya","translation_bn":"এবং নত করে দিলো","root":"لقي","lemma":"أَلْقَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76487,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّحَرَةُ","transliteration":"l-saḥaratu","translation_bn":"জাদুকরদেরকে","root":"سحر","lemma":"سَٰحِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76488,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سَـٰجِدِينَ","transliteration":"sājidīna","translation_bn":"সিজদাকারী (হিসেবে)","root":"سجد","lemma":"سَاجِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76489,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"١٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ul''qiya l-saḥaratu sājidīna', 'আর যাদুকররা সাজদায় লুটিয়ে পড়ল।', 'And the magicians fell down in prostration [to Allah].', 'আর যাদুকররা সাজদায় লুটিয়ে পড়ল।', 'And the magicians fell down in prostration [to Allah].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007120.mp3', now()),
  (7, 121, '', '[{"id":76583,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76584,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَّا","transliteration":"āmannā","translation_bn":"\"ঈমান আনলাম আমরা","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76585,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِرَبِّ","transliteration":"birabbi","translation_bn":"উপর রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76586,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বজগতের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76587,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"١٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū āmannā birabbi l-ʿālamīna', 'তারা বলল, ‘আমরা বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালকের প্রতি ঈমান আনলাম।', 'They said, "We have believed in the Lord of the worlds,', 'তারা বলল, ‘আমরা বিশ্বজগতের প্রতিপালকের প্রতি ঈমান আনলাম।', 'They said, "We have believed in the Lord of the worlds,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007121.mp3', now()),
  (7, 122, '', '[{"id":76655,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76656,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসার","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76657,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَهَـٰرُونَ","transliteration":"wahārūna","translation_bn":"ও হারূনের\"","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰرُون","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76658,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"١٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'rabbi mūsā wahārūna', 'মূসা আর হারূনের প্রতিপালকের প্রতি।’', 'The Lord of Moses and Aaron."', 'মূসা আর হারূনের প্রতিপালকের প্রতি।’', 'The Lord of Moses and Aaron."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007122.mp3', now()),
  (7, 123, '', '[{"id":76806,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76807,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنُ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawnu","translation_bn":"ফিরাউন","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76808,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنتُم","transliteration":"āmantum","translation_bn":"\"ঈমান আনলে তোমরা","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76809,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76810,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلَ","transliteration":"qabla","translation_bn":"(এর) পূর্বেই","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":76811,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":76812,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَاذَنَ","transliteration":"ādhana","translation_bn":"অনুমতি দিবো আমি","root":"اذن","lemma":"أَذِنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76813,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76815,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76816,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":76817,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَمَكْرٌۭ","transliteration":"lamakrun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই ষড়যন্ত্র","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكْر","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":76818,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَّكَرْتُمُوهُ","transliteration":"makartumūhu","translation_bn":"তোমরা ষড়যন্ত্র এঁটেছো যা","root":"مكر","lemma":"مَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76819,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76820,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَدِينَةِ","transliteration":"l-madīnati","translation_bn":"শহরের","root":"مدن","lemma":"مَدِينَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76821,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لِتُخْرِجُوا۟","transliteration":"litukh''rijū","translation_bn":"যেন তোমরা বের করতে পারো","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76822,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَآ","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76823,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلَهَا ۖ","transliteration":"ahlahā","translation_bn":"অধিবাসীদেরকে তার","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76825,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"অতএব শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76826,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানতে পারবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76827,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla fir''ʿawnu āmantum bihi qabla an ādhana lakum inna hādhā lamakrun makartumūhu fī l-madīnati litukh''rijū min''hā ahlahā fasawfa taʿlamūna', 'ফির‘আওন বলল, ‘আমি হুকুম দেয়ার আগেই তোমরা তার প্রতি ঈমান আনল? অবশ্যই এটা তোমাদের ষড়যন্ত্র যেটা নগরে বসে তোমরা পাকিয়েছ, এর বাসিন্দাদের বহিস্কৃত করার উদ্দেশে। এর পরিণাম শীঘ্রই টের পাবে।', 'Said Pharaoh, "You believed in him before I gave you permission. Indeed, this is a conspiracy which you conspired in the city to expel therefrom its people. But you are going to know.', 'ফির‘আওন বলল, ‘আমি হুকুম দেয়ার আগেই তোমরা তার প্রতি ঈমান আনল? অবশ্যই এটা তোমাদের ষড়যন্ত্র যেটা নগরে বসে তোমরা পাকিয়েছ, এর বাসিন্দাদের বহিস্কৃত করার উদ্দেশে। এর পরিণাম শীঘ্রই টের পাবে।', 'Said Pharaoh, "You believed in him before I gave you permission. Indeed, this is a conspiracy which you conspired in the city to expel therefrom its people. But you are going to know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007123.mp3', now()),
  (7, 124, '', '[{"id":76984,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَأُقَطِّعَنَّ","transliteration":"la-uqaṭṭiʿanna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই কাটবো আমি","root":"قطع","lemma":"قَطَّعَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":76985,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيَكُمْ","transliteration":"aydiyakum","translation_bn":"হাতগুলোকে তোমাদের","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76986,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَأَرْجُلَكُم","transliteration":"wa-arjulakum","translation_bn":"ও পাগুলোকে তোমাদের","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجْل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76987,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76988,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خِلَـٰفٍۢ","transliteration":"khilāfin","translation_bn":"বিপরীত দিক","root":"خلف","lemma":"خِلَٰف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76989,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76990,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَأُصَلِّبَنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"la-uṣallibannakum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই শুলে চড়াবো আমি তোমাদেরকে","root":"صلب","lemma":"يُصَلَّبُ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":76991,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَجْمَعِينَ","transliteration":"ajmaʿīna","translation_bn":"সবাইকে\"","root":"جمع","lemma":"أَجْمَعِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76992,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'la-uqaṭṭiʿanna aydiyakum wa-arjulakum min khilāfin thumma la-uṣallibannakum ajmaʿīna', 'তোমাদের হাত পা গুলোকে বিপরীত দিক থেকে অবশ্যই আমি কেটে দেব, তারপর তোমাদের সব্বাইকে শূলে চড়াব।', 'I will surely cut off your hands and your feet on opposite sides; then I will surely crucify you all."', 'তোমাদের হাত পা গুলোকে বিপরীত দিক থেকে অবশ্যই আমি কেটে দেব, তারপর তোমাদের সব্বাইকে শূলে চড়াব।', 'I will surely cut off your hands and your feet on opposite sides; then I will surely crucify you all."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007124.mp3', now()),
  (7, 125, '', '[{"id":77271,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77272,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّآ","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":77273,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77274,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّنَا","transliteration":"rabbinā","translation_bn":"রবের আমাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77275,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُنقَلِبُونَ","transliteration":"munqalibūna","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন কারী","root":"قلب","lemma":"مُنقَلِبُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77276,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū innā ilā rabbinā munqalibūna', 'তারা বলল, আমরা অবশ্যই আমাদের প্রতিপালকের দিকে প্রত্যাবর্তন করব।', 'They said, "Indeed, to our Lord we will return.', 'তারা বলল, আমরা অবশ্যই আমাদের প্রতিপালকের দিকে প্রত্যাবর্তন করব।', 'They said, "Indeed, to our Lord we will return.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007125.mp3', now()),
  (7, 126, '', '[{"id":77333,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77334,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَنقِمُ","transliteration":"tanqimu","translation_bn":"প্রতিশোধ নিচ্ছো তুমি","root":"نقم","lemma":"نَقَمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77335,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنَّآ","transliteration":"minnā","translation_bn":"হতে আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77336,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া (অন্য কোনো কারণে)","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":77337,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":77338,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنَّا","transliteration":"āmannā","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছি আমরা","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77339,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"biāyāti","translation_bn":"প্রতি নিদর্শনগুলোর","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77340,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّنَا","transliteration":"rabbinā","translation_bn":"রবের আমাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77341,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":77342,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْنَا ۚ","transliteration":"jāatnā","translation_bn":"কাছে এসেছে তা আমাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77344,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّنَآ","transliteration":"rabbanā","translation_bn":"হে আমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77345,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَفْرِغْ","transliteration":"afrigh","translation_bn":"তুমি ঢেলে দাও","root":"فرغ","lemma":"أَفْرِغْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77346,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْنَا","transliteration":"ʿalaynā","translation_bn":"উপর আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77347,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"صَبْرًۭا","transliteration":"ṣabran","translation_bn":"ধৈর্য","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77348,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَتَوَفَّنَا","transliteration":"watawaffanā","translation_bn":"ও মৃত্যু দাও আমাদের","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77349,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مُسْلِمِينَ","transliteration":"mus''limīna","translation_bn":"(অনুগত) মুসলমান হিসেবে\"","root":"سلم","lemma":"مُسْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77350,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā tanqimu minnā illā an āmannā biāyāti rabbinā lammā jāatnā rabbanā afrigh ʿalaynā ṣabran watawaffanā mus''limīna', 'তুমি আমাদের উপর প্রতিশোধ নিচ্ছ শুধু এ কারণে যে, আমাদের কাছে যখন আমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিদর্শন এসেছে তখন আমরা তাতে বিশ্বাস স্থাপন করেছি। হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমাদেরকে ধৈর্য ও দৃঢ়তা অবলম্বনের গুণে অভিষিক্ত কর আর মুসলমান হিসেবে আমাদের মৃত্যু দান কর।', 'And you do not resent us except because we believed in the signs of our Lord when they came to us. Our Lord, pour upon us patience and let us die as Muslims [in submission to You]."', 'তুমি আমাদের উপর প্রতিশোধ নিচ্ছ শুধু এ কারণে যে, আমাদের কাছে যখন আমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিদর্শন এসেছে তখন আমরা তাতে বিশ্বাস স্থাপন করেছি। হে আমাদের প্রতিপালক! আমাদেরকে ধৈর্য ও দৃঢ়তা অবলম্বনের গুণে অভিষিক্ত কর আর মুসলমান হিসেবে আমাদের মৃত্যু দান কর।', 'And you do not resent us except because we believed in the signs of our Lord when they came to us. Our Lord, pour upon us patience and let us die as Muslims [in submission to You]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007126.mp3', now()),
  (7, 127, '', '[{"id":77519,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77520,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَلَأُ","transliteration":"l-mala-u","translation_bn":"প্রধানরা","root":"ملا","lemma":"مَلَأ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77521,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77522,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِ","transliteration":"qawmi","translation_bn":"জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77523,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِرْعَوْنَ","transliteration":"fir''ʿawna","translation_bn":"ফিরাউনের","root":"—","lemma":"فِرْعَوْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77524,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَتَذَرُ","transliteration":"atadharu","translation_bn":"\"কি ছেড়ে দিবেন","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":77525,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77526,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَقَوْمَهُۥ","transliteration":"waqawmahu","translation_bn":"ও জাতিকে তার","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77527,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِيُفْسِدُوا۟","transliteration":"liyuf''sidū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টি করে","root":"فسد","lemma":"أَفْسَدُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77528,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77529,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"দেশের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77530,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَيَذَرَكَ","transliteration":"wayadharaka","translation_bn":"ও আপনাকে পরিত্যাগ করবে","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77531,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَءَالِهَتَكَ ۚ","transliteration":"waālihataka","translation_bn":"এবং আপনার দেবতাদেরকে\"","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77533,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77534,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"سَنُقَتِّلُ","transliteration":"sanuqattilu","translation_bn":"\"অচিরেই আমরা হত্যা করবো","root":"قتل","lemma":"قُتِّلُ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":77535,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَبْنَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"abnāahum","translation_bn":"পুত্রদেরকে তাদের","root":"بني","lemma":"ٱبْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77536,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَنَسْتَحْىِۦ","transliteration":"wanastaḥyī","translation_bn":"ও জীবিত রাখবো","root":"حيي","lemma":"يَسْتَحْىِ.^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77537,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"نِسَآءَهُمْ","transliteration":"nisāahum","translation_bn":"নারীদেরকে তাদের","root":"نسو","lemma":"نِسَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77538,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنَّا","transliteration":"wa-innā","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":77539,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقَهُمْ","transliteration":"fawqahum","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":77540,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"قَـٰهِرُونَ","transliteration":"qāhirūna","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী\"","root":"قهر","lemma":"قَاهِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77541,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"١٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waqāla l-mala-u min qawmi fir''ʿawna atadharu mūsā waqawmahu liyuf''sidū fī l-arḍi wayadharaka waālihataka qāla sanuqattilu abnāahum wanastaḥyī nisāahum wa-innā fawqahum qāhirūna', 'ফির‘আওন গোষ্ঠীর সরদারগণ বলল, ‘আপনি কি মূসা আর তার জাতির লোকেদেরকে যমীনে বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টি করার জন্য ছেড়ে দেবেন আর দেবেন আপনাকে আর আপনার মা‘বূদদেরকে বর্জন করতে?’ সে বলল, ‘আমি তাদের পুত্র সন্তানদেরকে হত্যা করব আর তাদের নারীদেরকে জীবিত রাখব, আমরা তাদের উপর অপ্রতিরোধ্য।’', 'And the eminent among the people of Pharaoh said," Will you leave Moses and his people to cause corruption in the land and abandon you and your gods?" [Pharaoh] said, "We will kill their sons and keep their women alive; and indeed, we are subjugators over them."', 'ফির‘আওন গোষ্ঠীর সরদারগণ বলল, ‘আপনি কি মূসা আর তার জাতির লোকেদেরকে যমীনে বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টি করার জন্য ছেড়ে দেবেন আর দেবেন আপনাকে আর আপনার মা‘বূদদেরকে বর্জন করতে?’ সে বলল, ‘আমি তাদের পুত্র সন্তানদেরকে হত্যা করব আর তাদের নারীদেরকে জীবিত রাখব, আমরা তাদের উপর অপ্রতিরোধ্য।’', 'And the eminent among the people of Pharaoh said," Will you leave Moses and his people to cause corruption in the land and abandon you and your gods?" [Pharaoh] said, "We will kill their sons and keep their women alive; and indeed, we are subjugators over them."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007127.mp3', now()),
  (7, 128, '', '[{"id":77637,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77638,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77639,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِقَوْمِهِ","transliteration":"liqawmihi","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে জাতির তার","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77640,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَعِينُوا۟","transliteration":"is''taʿīnū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা সাহায্য চাও","root":"عون","lemma":"ٱسْتَعِينُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77641,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"কাছে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77642,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱصْبِرُوٓا۟ ۖ","transliteration":"wa-iṣ''birū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা ধৈর্য ধরো","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَبَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77644,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":77645,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضَ","transliteration":"l-arḍa","translation_bn":"পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77646,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77647,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُورِثُهَا","transliteration":"yūrithuhā","translation_bn":"তার উত্তরাধীকারী করেন","root":"ورث","lemma":"أَوْرَثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77648,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(তাকে) যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77649,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করবেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77650,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77651,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","translation_bn":"তার দাসদের","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77653,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْعَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"wal-ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"এবং (উত্তম) পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77654,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لِلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"lil''muttaqīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে মুত্তাকীদের\"","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77655,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla mūsā liqawmihi is''taʿīnū bil-lahi wa-iṣ''birū inna l-arḍa lillahi yūrithuhā man yashāu min ʿibādihi wal-ʿāqibatu lil''muttaqīna', 'মূসা তার সম্প্রদায়কে বলল, ‘তোমরা আল্লাহর সাহায্য কামনা কর আর ধৈর্য অবলম্বন কর, যমীনের মালিক হলেন আল্লাহ, তিনি তাঁর বান্দাহদের মধ্য হতে যাকে ইচ্ছে করবেন তার উত্তরাধিকারী বানাবেন, কল্যাণময় পরিণাম হচ্ছে মুত্তাকীদের জন্য।’', 'Said Moses to his people, "Seek help through Allah and be patient. Indeed, the earth belongs to Allah. He causes to inherit it whom He wills of His servants. And the [best] outcome is for the righteous."', 'মূসা তার সম্প্রদায়কে বলল, ‘তোমরা আল্লাহর সাহায্য কামনা কর আর ধৈর্য অবলম্বন কর, যমীনের মালিক হলেন আল্লাহ, তিনি তাঁর বান্দাহদের মধ্য হতে যাকে ইচ্ছে করবেন তার উত্তরাধিকারী বানাবেন, কল্যাণময় পরিণাম হচ্ছে মুত্তাকীদের জন্য।’', 'Said Moses to his people, "Seek help through Allah and be patient. Indeed, the earth belongs to Allah. He causes to inherit it whom He wills of His servants. And the [best] outcome is for the righteous."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007128.mp3', now()),
  (7, 129, '', '[{"id":77775,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77776,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُوذِينَا","transliteration":"ūdhīnā","translation_bn":"\"নির্যাতিত হয়েছি আমরা","root":"اذي","lemma":"أُوذِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77777,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77778,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِ","transliteration":"qabli","translation_bn":"(এর) পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77779,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":77780,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيَنَا","transliteration":"tatiyanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে তুমি আসবে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77781,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنۢ","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77782,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77783,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"তার","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":77784,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جِئْتَنَا ۚ","transliteration":"ji''tanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের কাছে তুমি এসেছো\"","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77786,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77787,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَسَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿasā","translation_bn":"\"শীঘ্রই","root":"عسي","l