,"lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80007,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaraw","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80008,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلَ","transliteration":"sabīla","translation_bn":"পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80009,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَىِّ","transliteration":"l-ghayi","translation_bn":"ভ্রান্ত","root":"غوي","lemma":"غَيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80010,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّخِذُوهُ","transliteration":"yattakhidhūhu","translation_bn":"তারা গ্রহণ করবে তা","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80011,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"sabīlan","translation_bn":"পথ হিসেবে","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80013,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":80014,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"এজন্যে যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80015,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80016,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি নিদর্শনগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80017,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80018,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهَا","transliteration":"ʿanhā","translation_bn":"সে সব হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80019,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"غَـٰفِلِينَ","transliteration":"ghāfilīna","translation_bn":"উদাসীন","root":"غفل","lemma":"غَٰفِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80020,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"١٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sa-aṣrifu ʿan āyātiya alladhīna yatakabbarūna fī l-arḍi bighayri l-ḥaqi wa-in yaraw kulla āyatin lā yu''minū bihā wa-in yaraw sabīla l-rush''di lā yattakhidhūhu sabīlan wa-in yaraw sabīla l-ghayi yattakhidhūhu sabīlan dhālika bi-annahum kadhabū biāyātinā wakānū ʿanhā ghāfilīna', 'যারা অন্যায়ভাবে পৃথিবীতে অহঙ্কার করে বেড়ায় আমি শীঘ্রই তাদের দৃষ্টিকে আমার নিদর্শন হতে ফিরিয়ে দেব। তারা আমার নিদর্শন দেখলেও তাতে বিশ্বাস করবে না। তারা সত্যপথ দেখলেও তাকে পথ হিসেবে গ্রহণ করবে না। তারা বক্র পথ দেখলে তাকে পথ হিসেবে গ্রহণ করবে। তার কারণ হল তারা আমার নিদর্শনগুলোকে মিথ্যে বলে উড়িয়ে দিয়েছে আর এগুলোর ব্যাপারে তারা ছিল একেবারে চিন্তা ভাবনাহীন।', 'I will turn away from My signs those who are arrogant upon the earth without right; and if they should see every sign, they will not believe in it. And if they see the way of consciousness, they will not adopt it as a way; but if they see the way of error, they will adopt it as a way. That is because they have denied Our signs and they were heedless of them.', 'যারা অন্যায়ভাবে পৃথিবীতে অহঙ্কার করে বেড়ায় আমি শীঘ্রই তাদের দৃষ্টিকে আমার নিদর্শন হতে ফিরিয়ে দেব। তারা আমার নিদর্শন দেখলেও তাতে বিশ্বাস করবে না। তারা সত্যপথ দেখলেও তাকে পথ হিসেবে গ্রহণ করবে না। তারা বক্র পথ দেখলে তাকে পথ হিসেবে গ্রহণ করবে। তার কারণ হল তারা আমার নিদর্শনগুলোকে মিথ্যে বলে উড়িয়ে দিয়েছে আর এগুলোর ব্যাপারে তারা ছিল একেবারে চিন্তা ভাবনাহীন।', 'I will turn away from My signs those who are arrogant upon the earth without right; and if they should see every sign, they will not believe in it. And if they see the way of consciousness, they will not adopt it as a way; but if they see the way of error, they will adopt it as a way. That is because they have denied Our signs and they were heedless of them.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007146.mp3', now()),
  (7, 147, '', '[{"id":80060,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80061,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাররোপ করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80062,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি নিদর্শনগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80063,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلِقَآءِ","transliteration":"waliqāi","translation_bn":"ও সাক্ষাত","root":"لقي","lemma":"لِقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80064,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখেরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80065,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حَبِطَتْ","transliteration":"ḥabiṭat","translation_bn":"নষ্ট হয়েছে","root":"حبط","lemma":"حَبِطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80066,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"aʿmāluhum","translation_bn":"আমলগুলো তাদের","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80068,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":80069,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُجْزَوْنَ","transliteration":"yuj''zawna","translation_bn":"তাদের পুরষ্কার দেয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80070,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":80071,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":80072,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80073,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করে আসছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80074,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna kadhabū biāyātinā waliqāi l-ākhirati ḥabiṭat aʿmāluhum hal yuj''zawna illā mā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'যারা আমার নিদর্শনগুলোকে আর আখেরাতের সাক্ষাৎকে মিথ্যে জেনে অস্বীকার করে তাদের ‘আমালগুলো নিস্ফল। তারা যা করত সে অনুযায়ী প্রতিফল ছাড়া তারা কী আর আশা করতে পারে?', 'Those who denied Our signs and the meeting of the Hereafter - their deeds have become worthless. Are they recompensed except for what they used to do?', 'যারা আমার নিদর্শনগুলোকে আর আখেরাতের সাক্ষাৎকে মিথ্যে জেনে অস্বীকার করে তাদের ‘আমালগুলো নিস্ফল। তারা যা করত সে অনুযায়ী প্রতিফল ছাড়া তারা কী আর আশা করতে পারে?', 'Those who denied Our signs and the meeting of the Hereafter - their deeds have become worthless. Are they recompensed except for what they used to do?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007147.mp3', now()),
  (7, 148, '', '[{"id":80142,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّخَذَ","transliteration":"wa-ittakhadha","translation_bn":"এবং বানালো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80143,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمُ","transliteration":"qawmu","translation_bn":"জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80144,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসার","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":80145,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80146,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِۦ","transliteration":"baʿdihi","translation_bn":"পর তার","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80147,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দ্বারা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80148,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"حُلِيِّهِمْ","transliteration":"ḥuliyyihim","translation_bn":"অলংকারগুলো তাদের","root":"حلي","lemma":"حُلِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80149,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عِجْلًۭا","transliteration":"ʿij''lan","translation_bn":"বাছুর","root":"عجل","lemma":"عِجْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80150,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"جَسَدًۭا","transliteration":"jasadan","translation_bn":"অবয়ব (সম্পন্ন)","root":"جسد","lemma":"جَسَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80151,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"ছিলো তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80152,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"خُوَارٌ ۚ","transliteration":"khuwārun","translation_bn":"হাম্বারব","root":"خور","lemma":"خُوَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80154,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":80155,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْا۟","transliteration":"yaraw","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80156,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"annahu","translation_bn":"যে তা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":80157,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":80158,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُكَلِّمُهُمْ","transliteration":"yukallimuhum","translation_bn":"তাদের সাথে কথা বলে","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80159,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80160,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"yahdīhim","translation_bn":"পরিচালনা করে তাদের","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80161,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلًا ۘ","transliteration":"sabīlan","translation_bn":"(সঠিক) পথে","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80163,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذُوهُ","transliteration":"ittakhadhūhu","translation_bn":"তারা গ্রহণ করলো তা (উপাস্যরূপে)","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80164,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":80165,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ظَـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80166,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ittakhadha qawmu mūsā min baʿdihi min ḥuliyyihim ʿij''lan jasadan lahu khuwārun alam yaraw annahu lā yukallimuhum walā yahdīhim sabīlan ittakhadhūhu wakānū ẓālimīna', 'মূসার অনুপস্থিতিতে তার জাতির লোকেরা তাদের অলঙ্কারের সাহায্যে গো-বৎসের একটা অবয়ব তৈরি করল যা গরুর ন্যায় ‘হাম্বা’ আওয়াজ করত। তারা কি দেখল না যে তা তাদের সঙ্গে কথা বলে না, আর তাদেরকে পথও দেখায় না। কিন্তু তা সত্ত্বেও তারা তাকে মা‘বূদ হিসেবে গ্রহণ করল। তারা ছিল যালিম।', 'And the people of Moses made, after [his departure], from their ornaments a calf - an image having a lowing sound. Did they not see that it could neither speak to them nor guide them to a way? They took it [for worship], and they were wrongdoers.', 'মূসার অনুপস্থিতিতে তার জাতির লোকেরা তাদের অলঙ্কারের সাহায্যে গো-বৎসের একটা অবয়ব তৈরি করল যা গরুর ন্যায় ‘হাম্বা’ আওয়াজ করত। তারা কি দেখল না যে তা তাদের সঙ্গে কথা বলে না, আর তাদেরকে পথও দেখায় না। কিন্তু তা সত্ত্বেও তারা তাকে মা‘বূদ হিসেবে গ্রহণ করল। তারা ছিল যালিম।', 'And the people of Moses made, after [his departure], from their ornaments a calf - an image having a lowing sound. Did they not see that it could neither speak to them nor guide them to a way? They took it [for worship], and they were wrongdoers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007148.mp3', now()),
  (7, 149, '', '[{"id":80293,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80294,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"سُقِطَ","transliteration":"suqiṭa","translation_bn":"পতিত হলো","root":"سقط","lemma":"سُقِطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80295,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80296,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيهِمْ","transliteration":"aydīhim","translation_bn":"হাতের তাদের","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80297,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَرَأَوْا۟","transliteration":"wara-aw","translation_bn":"ও তারা দেখলো","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80298,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":80299,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":80300,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ضَلُّوا۟","transliteration":"ḍallū","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট হয়ে গিয়েছিলো","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80301,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80302,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَئِن","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"\"অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":80303,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":80304,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَرْحَمْنَا","transliteration":"yarḥamnā","translation_bn":"আমাদের উপর অনুগ্রহ করেন","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80305,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّنَا","transliteration":"rabbunā","translation_bn":"আমাদের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80306,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَيَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"wayaghfir","translation_bn":"ও ক্ষমা (না) করেন","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80307,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَنَا","transliteration":"lanā","translation_bn":"আমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَنَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80308,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَنَكُونَنَّ","transliteration":"lanakūnanna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমরা হবো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":80309,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80310,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَـٰسِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-khāsirīna","translation_bn":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্তদের\"","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَٰسِرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":80311,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walammā suqiṭa fī aydīhim wara-aw annahum qad ḍallū qālū la-in lam yarḥamnā rabbunā wayaghfir lanā lanakūnanna mina l-khāsirīna', 'অতঃপর যখন তারা অনুতপ্ত হল আর বুঝতে পারল যে তারা পথহারা হয়ে গেছে, তারা বলল, ‘আমাদের প্রতিপালক যদি আমাদের উপর দয়া না করেন আর আমাদেরকে ক্ষমা না করেন তাহলে আমরা অবশ্যই ক্ষতিগ্রস্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয়ে যাব।’', 'And when regret overcame them and they saw that they had gone astray, they said, "If our Lord does not have mercy upon us and forgive us, we will surely be among the losers."', 'অতঃপর যখন তারা অনুতপ্ত হল আর বুঝতে পারল যে তারা পথহারা হয়ে গেছে, তারা বলল, ‘আমাদের প্রতিপালক যদি আমাদের উপর দয়া না করেন আর আমাদেরকে ক্ষমা না করেন তাহলে আমরা অবশ্যই ক্ষতিগ্রস্তদের অন্তর্ভুক্ত হয়ে যাব।’', 'And when regret overcame them and they saw that they had gone astray, they said, "If our Lord does not have mercy upon us and forgive us, we will surely be among the losers."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007149.mp3', now()),
  (7, 150, '', '[{"id":80464,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":80465,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَجَعَ","transliteration":"rajaʿa","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন করলো","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80466,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":80467,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"নিকট","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80468,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"qawmihi","translation_bn":"তার জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80469,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"غَضْبَـٰنَ","transliteration":"ghaḍbāna","translation_bn":"রাগান্বিত হয়ে","root":"غضب","lemma":"غَضْبَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80470,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَسِفًۭا","transliteration":"asifan","translation_bn":"দুঃখিত অবস্হায়","root":"اسف","lemma":"أَسِف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":80471,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"সে বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80472,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِئْسَمَا","transliteration":"bi''samā","translation_bn":"\"কত নিকৃষ্টই","root":"باس","lemma":"بِئْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80473,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"خَلَفْتُمُونِى","transliteration":"khalaftumūnī","translation_bn":"তোমরা আমার প্রতিনিধিত্ব করেছো","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَلَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":80474,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":80475,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِىٓ ۖ","transliteration":