anslation_bn":"আখেরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82801,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82802,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"لِّلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) জন্যে যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82803,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّقُونَ ۗ","transliteration":"yattaqūna","translation_bn":"তাক্বওয়া অবলম্বন করে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82805,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"কি তবে না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":82806,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"تَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বুঝো","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82807,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"١٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fakhalafa min baʿdihim khalfun warithū l-kitāba yakhudhūna ʿaraḍa hādhā l-adnā wayaqūlūna sayugh''faru lanā wa-in yatihim ʿaraḍun mith''luhu yakhudhūhu alam yu''khadh ʿalayhim mīthāqu l-kitābi an lā yaqūlū ʿalā l-lahi illā l-ḥaqa wadarasū mā fīhi wal-dāru l-ākhiratu khayrun lilladhīna yattaqūna afalā taʿqilūna', 'তাদের পরে (পাপিষ্ঠ) বংশধরগণ তাদের স্থলাভিষিক্ত হয়ে কিতাবের উত্তরাধিকারী হয় যারা দুনিয়ার নিকৃষ্ট স্বার্থ গ্রহণ করে আর বলে, ‘(আমরা যা কিছুই করি না কেন) আমাদেরকে ক্ষমা করা হবে’। আর দুনিয়ার স্বার্থ তাদের সামনে আসলে আবার তা গ্রহণ করে নেয়। (তাওরাত) কিতাবে কি তাদের নিকট থেকে এ অঙ্গীকার নেয়া হয়নি যে তারা আল্লাহ সম্বন্ধে প্রকৃত সত্য ছাড়া বলবে না? তারা তো ঐ কিতাবে যা আছে তা পাঠ করেও থাকে। যারা তাক্বওয়া অবলম্বন করে তাদের জন্য পরকালের আবাসই উত্তম, তোমরা কি বুঝবে না?', 'And there followed them successors who inherited the Scripture [while] taking the commodities of this lower life and saying, "It will be forgiven for us." And if an offer like it comes to them, they will [again] take it. Was not the covenant of the Scripture taken from them that they would not say about Allah except the truth, and they studied what was in it? And the home of the Hereafter is better for those who fear Allah, so will you not use reason?', 'তাদের পরে (পাপিষ্ঠ) বংশধরগণ তাদের স্থলাভিষিক্ত হয়ে কিতাবের উত্তরাধিকারী হয় যারা দুনিয়ার নিকৃষ্ট স্বার্থ গ্রহণ করে আর বলে, ‘(আমরা যা কিছুই করি না কেন) আমাদেরকে ক্ষমা করা হবে’। আর দুনিয়ার স্বার্থ তাদের সামনে আসলে আবার তা গ্রহণ করে নেয়। (তাওরাত) কিতাবে কি তাদের নিকট থেকে এ অঙ্গীকার নেয়া হয়নি যে তারা আল্লাহ সম্বন্ধে প্রকৃত সত্য ছাড়া বলবে না? তারা তো ঐ কিতাবে যা আছে তা পাঠ করেও থাকে। যারা তাক্বওয়া অবলম্বন করে তাদের জন্য পরকালের আবাসই উত্তম, তোমরা কি বুঝবে না?', 'And there followed them successors who inherited the Scripture [while] taking the commodities of this lower life and saying, "It will be forgiven for us." And if an offer like it comes to them, they will [again] take it. Was not the covenant of the Scripture taken from them that they would not say about Allah except the truth, and they studied what was in it? And the home of the Hereafter is better for those who fear Allah, so will you not use reason?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007169.mp3', now()),
  (7, 170, '', '[{"id":82808,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82809,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُمَسِّكُونَ","transliteration":"yumassikūna","translation_bn":"আঁকড়ে থাকে","root":"مسك","lemma":"يُمَسِّكُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82810,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"bil-kitābi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":82811,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَقَامُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-aqāmū","translation_bn":"ও প্রতিষ্ঠা করে","root":"قوم","lemma":"أَقَامَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":82812,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","transliteration":"l-ṣalata","translation_bn":"সালাতকে","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82813,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":82814,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":82815,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نُضِيعُ","transliteration":"nuḍīʿu","translation_bn":"আমরা নষ্ট করি","root":"ضيع","lemma":"أَضَاعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":82816,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَ","transliteration":"ajra","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":82817,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُصْلِحِينَ","transliteration":"l-muṣ''liḥīna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মশীলদের","root":"صلح","lemma":"مُصْلِح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":82818,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna yumassikūna bil-kitābi wa-aqāmū l-ṣalata innā lā nuḍīʿu ajra l-muṣ''liḥīna', 'যারা কিতাবকে শক্তভাবে আঁকড়ে ধরে, নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করে, আমি (এসব) সৎকর্মশীলদের কর্মফল কখনো বিনষ্ট করি না।', 'But those who hold fast to the Book and establish prayer - indeed, We will not allow to be lost the reward of the reformers.', 'যারা কিতাবকে শক্তভাবে আঁকড়ে ধরে, নামায প্রতিষ্ঠা করে, আমি (এসব) সৎকর্মশীলদের কর্মফল কখনো বিনষ্ট করি না।', 'But those who hold fast to the Book and establish prayer - indeed, We will not allow to be lost the reward of the reformers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007170.mp3', now()),
  (7, 171, '', '[{"id":83006,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَإِذْ","transliteration":"wa-idh","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83007,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَتَقْنَا","transliteration":"nataqnā","translation_bn":"উপরে তুলে ধরেছিলাম আমরা","root":"نتق","lemma":"نَتَقْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83008,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَبَلَ","transliteration":"l-jabala","translation_bn":"পাহাড়কে","root":"جبل","lemma":"جَبَل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83009,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَوْقَهُمْ","transliteration":"fawqahum","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"فوق","lemma":"فَوْق","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":83010,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَأَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"ka-annahu","translation_bn":"যেন তা (হলো)","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83011,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ظُلَّةٌۭ","transliteration":"ẓullatun","translation_bn":"(সামিয়ানা) ছায়া","root":"ظلل","lemma":"ظُلَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83012,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَظَنُّوٓا۟","transliteration":"waẓannū","translation_bn":"ও তারা মনে করলো","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83013,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"annahu","translation_bn":"যেন তা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83014,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَاقِعٌۢ","transliteration":"wāqiʿun","translation_bn":"পড়বে","root":"وقع","lemma":"وَاقِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83015,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِمْ","transliteration":"bihim","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83016,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"خُذُوا۟","transliteration":"khudhū","translation_bn":"(বললাম) তোমরা আঁকড়ে ধরো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83017,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83018,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰكُم","transliteration":"ātaynākum","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছি তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83019,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِقُوَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"biquwwatin","translation_bn":"ভাবে দৃঢ়","root":"قوي","lemma":"قُوَّة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83020,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱذْكُرُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-udh''kurū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা স্মরণ রাখো","root":"ذكر","lemma":"ذَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83021,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83022,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83023,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallakum","translation_bn":"যাতে তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83024,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّقُونَ","transliteration":"tattaqūna","translation_bn":"(ভুল আচরণ হতে) বেঁচে চলতে পারো\"","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83025,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"١٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh nataqnā l-jabala fawqahum ka-annahu ẓullatun waẓannū annahu wāqiʿun bihim khudhū mā ātaynākum biquwwatin wa-udh''kurū mā fīhi laʿallakum tattaqūna', 'স্মরণ কর, আমি যখন পাহাড়কে বানী ইসরাঈলদের উপর তুলে ধরলাম তা যেন একটা সামিয়ানা। তারা ভাবল, ওটা তাদের উপর বুঝি পতিত হবে। (এমত অবস্থায় তাদেরকে বললাম) ‘তোমাদেরকে যা দিলাম তা শক্তভাবে ধারণ কর আর তাতে যা আছে তা মনে রেখ, যাতে তোমরা তাক্বওয়া লাভ করতে পার’।', 'And [mention] when We raised the mountain above them as if it was a dark cloud and they were certain that it would fall upon them, [and Allah said], "Take what We have given you with determination and remember what is in it that you might fear Allah."', 'স্মরণ কর, আমি যখন পাহাড়কে বানী ইসরাঈলদের উপর তুলে ধরলাম তা যেন একটা সামিয়ানা। তারা ভাবল, ওটা তাদের উপর বুঝি পতিত হবে। (এমত অবস্থায় তাদেরকে বললাম) ‘তোমাদেরকে যা দিলাম তা শক্তভাবে ধারণ কর আর তাতে যা আছে তা মনে রেখ, যাতে তোমরা তাক্বওয়া লাভ করতে পার’।', 'And [mention] when We raised the mountain above them as if it was a dark cloud and they were certain that it would fall upon them, [and Allah said], "Take what We have given you with determination and remember what is in it that you might fear Allah."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007171.mp3', now()),
  (7, 172, '', '[{"id":83030,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذْ","transliteration":"wa-idh","translation_bn":"এবং (স্মরণ করিয়ে দাও) যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83031,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَخَذَ","transliteration":"akhadha","translation_bn":"বের করেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83032,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكَ","transliteration":"rabbuka","translation_bn":"তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83033,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83034,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَنِىٓ","transliteration":"banī","translation_bn":"সন্তানদের","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنَىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83035,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَادَمَ","transliteration":"ādama","translation_bn":"আদমের","root":"—","lemma":"ا^دَم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83036,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83037,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ظُهُورِهِمْ","transliteration":"ẓuhūrihim","translation_bn":"পিঠসমূহ তাদের","root":"ظهر","lemma":"ظَهْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83038,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ذُرِّيَّتَهُمْ","transliteration":"dhurriyyatahum","translation_bn":"বংশধরদেরকে তাদের","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83039,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَأَشْهَدَهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-ashhadahum","translation_bn":"ও স্বাক্ষ্য নিলেন তাদের","root":"شهد","lemma":"أَشْهَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83040,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83041,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"anfusihim","translation_bn":"নিজেদের তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83042,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَلَسْتُ","transliteration":"alastu","translation_bn":"\"(আল্লাহ বলেছিলেন) কি আমি নই","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":83043,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِرَبِّكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"birabbikum","translation_bn":"রব তোমাদের\"","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83045,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83046,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بَلَىٰ ۛ","transliteration":"balā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"بَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"উত্তর পদ (Answer)"},{"id":83048,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شَهِدْنَآ ۛ","transliteration":"shahid''nā","translation_bn":"সাক্ষ্য দিলাম আমরা (এ কথার)\"","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83050,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যেন","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":83051,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"تَقُولُوا۟","transliteration":"taqūlū","translation_bn":"(না) বলো তোমরা","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83052,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":83053,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83054,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّا","transliteration":"innā","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83055,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83056,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83057,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":83058,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"غَـٰفِلِينَ","transliteration":"ghāfilīna","translation_bn":"অমনোযোগী\"","root":"غفل","lemma":"غَٰفِل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83059,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"١٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idh akhadha rabbuka min banī ādama min ẓuhūrihim dhurriyyatahum wa-ashhadahum ʿalā anfusihim alastu birabbikum qālū balā shahid''nā an taqūlū yawma l-qiyāmati innā kunnā ʿan hādhā ghāfilīna', 'স্মরণ কর, যখন তোমার প্রতিপালক আদম সন্তানদের পৃষ্ঠ হতে তাদের বংশধরদের বের করলেন আর তাদেরকেই সাক্ষী বানিয়ে জিজ্ঞেস করলেন, ‘আমি কি তোমাদের প্রতিপালক নই?’ তারা বলল, ‘হ্যাঁ; এ ব্যাপারে আমরা সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছি।’ (এটা এজন্য করা হয়েছিল) যাতে তোমরা ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন না বল যে, ‘এ সম্পর্কে আমরা একেবারেই বে-খবর ছিলাম’।', 'And [mention] when your Lord took from the children of Adam - from their loins - their descendants and made them testify of themselves, [saying to them], "Am I not your Lord?" They said, "Yes, we have testified." [This] - lest you should say on the day of Resurrection, "Indeed, we were of this unaware."', 'স্মরণ কর, যখন তোমার প্রতিপালক আদম সন্তানদের পৃষ্ঠ হতে তাদের বংশধরদের বের করলেন আর তাদেরকেই সাক্ষী বানিয়ে জিজ্ঞেস করলেন, ‘আমি কি তোমাদের প্রতিপালক নই?’ তারা বলল, ‘হ্যাঁ; এ ব্যাপারে আমরা সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছি।’ (এটা এজন্য করা হয়েছিল) যাতে তোমরা ক্বিয়ামাতের দিন না বল যে, ‘এ সম্পর্কে আমরা একেবারেই বে-খবর ছিলাম’।', 'And [mention] when your Lord took from the children of Adam - from their loins - their descendants and made them testify of themselves, [saying to them], "Am I not your Lord?" They said, "Yes, we have testified." [This] - lest you should say on the day of Resurrection, "Indeed, we were of this unaware."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007172.mp3', now()),
  (7, 173, '', '[{"id":83144,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83145,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَقُولُوٓا۟","transliteration":"taqūlū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83146,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَآ","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83147,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكَ","transliteration":"ashraka","translation_bn":"শিরক করেছিলো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83148,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآؤُنَا","transliteration":"ābāunā","translation_bn":"পিতৃপুরুষরা আমাদের","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83149,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83150,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"(আমাদের) পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83151,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَكُنَّا","transliteration":"wakunnā","translation_bn":"এবং আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83152,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ذُرِّيَّةًۭ","transliteration":"dhurriyyatan","translation_bn":"বংশধর","root":"ذرر","lemma":"ذُرِّيَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83153,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83154,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"baʿdihim","translation_bn":"পর তাদের","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83156,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَفَتُهْلِكُنَا","transliteration":"afatuh''likunā","translation_bn":"কি তবে আপনি ধ্বংস করবেন আমাদেরকে","root":"هلك","lemma":"أَهْلَكَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":83157,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83158,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فَعَلَ","transliteration":"faʿala","translation_bn":"করেছে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83159,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُبْطِلُونَ","transliteration":"l-mub''ṭilūna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যাশ্রয়ীরা\"","root":"بطل","lemma":"مُبْطِلُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83160,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'aw taqūlū innamā ashraka ābāunā min qablu wakunnā dhurriyyatan min baʿdihim afatuh''likunā bimā faʿala l-mub''ṭilūna', 'অথবা তোমরা এ কথা না বল যে, ‘পূর্বে আমাদের পিতৃ-পুরুষরাই শিরক করেছে আর তাদের পরে আমরা তাদেরই সন্তানাদি (যা করতে দেখেছি তাই করছি) তাহলে ভ্রান্ত পথের অনুসারীরা যা করেছে তার জন্য কি আপনি আমাদেরকে ধ্বংস করবেন?’', 'Or [lest] you say, "It was only that our fathers associated [others in worship] with Allah before, and we were but descendants after them. Then would You destroy us for what the falsifiers have done?"', 'অথবা তোমরা এ কথা না বল যে, ‘পূর্বে আমাদের পিতৃ-পুরুষরাই শিরক করেছে আর তাদের পরে আমরা তাদেরই সন্তানাদি (যা করতে দেখেছি তাই করছি) তাহলে ভ্রান্ত পথের অনুসারীরা যা করেছে তার জন্য কি আপনি আমাদেরকে ধ্বংস করবেন?’', 'Or [lest] you say, "It was only that our fathers associated [others in worship] with Allah before, and we were but descendants after them. Then would You destroy us for what the falsifiers have done?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007173.mp3', now()),
  (7, 174, '', '[{"id":83220,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wakadhālika","translation_bn":"এবং এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83221,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُفَصِّلُ","transliteration":"nufaṣṣilu","translation_bn":"বিস্তারিত বর্ণনা করি আমরা","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83222,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনগুলোকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83223,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"walaʿallahum","translation_bn":"এবং যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83224,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَرْجِعُونَ","transliteration":"yarjiʿūna","translation_bn":"ফিরে আসে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83225,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wakadhālika nufaṣṣilu l-āyāti walaʿallahum yarjiʿūna', 'এভাবে আমি নিদর্শনসমূহ বিশদভাবে বিবৃত করছি, আর হয়ত তারা (আমার পথে) ফিরে আসবে।', 'And thus do We [explain in] detail the verses, and perhaps they will return.', 'এভাবে আমি নিদর্শনসমূহ বিশদভাবে বিবৃত করছি, আর হয়ত তারা (আমার পথে) ফিরে আসবে।', 'And thus do We [explain in] detail the verses, and perhaps they will return.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007174.mp3', now()),
  (7, 175, '', '[{"id":83323,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتْلُ","transliteration":"wa-ut''lu","translation_bn":"এবং (হে নাবী) তিলাওয়াত করো","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83324,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"নিকট তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83325,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَبَأَ","transliteration":"naba-a","translation_bn":"বৃত্তান্ত","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَأ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83326,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"(ঐ ব্যক্তির) যে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83327,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُ","transliteration":"ātaynāhu","translation_bn":"আমরা দিয়েছিলাম তাকে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83328,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"āyātinā","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনগুলো আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83329,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنسَلَخَ","transliteration":"fa-insalakha","translation_bn":"কিন্তু সে এড়িয়ে যায়","root":"سلخ","lemma":"ٱنسَلَخَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83330,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83331,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَأَتْبَعَهُ","transliteration":"fa-atbaʿahu","translation_bn":"ফলে পিছনে লাগে তার","root":"تبع","lemma":"أَتْبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83332,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّيْطَـٰنُ","transliteration":"l-shayṭānu","translation_bn":"শয়তান","root":"شطن","lemma":"شَيْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83333,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَكَانَ","transliteration":"fakāna","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83334,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83335,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَاوِينَ","transliteration":"l-ghāwīna","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্টদের","root":"غوي","lemma":"غَٰوِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83336,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"١٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ut''lu ʿalayhim naba-a alladhī ātaynāhu āyātinā fa-insalakha min''hā fa-atbaʿahu l-shayṭānu fakāna mina l-ghāwīna', 'তাদেরকে ঐ লোকের সংবাদ পড়ে শোনাও যাকে আমি আমার নিদর্শনসমূহ প্রদান করেছিলাম। কিন্তু সে সেগুলোকে এড়িয়ে যায়। অতঃপর শয়ত্বান তাকে অনুসরণ করে, ফলে সে পথভ্রষ্টদের দলে শামিল হয়ে যায়।', 'And recite to them, [O Muhammad], the news of him to whom we gave [knowledge of] Our signs, but he detached himself from them; so Satan pursued him, and he became of the deviators.', 'তাদেরকে ঐ লোকের সংবাদ পড়ে শোনাও যাকে আমি আমার নিদর্শনসমূহ প্রদান করেছিলাম। কিন্তু সে সেগুলোকে এড়িয়ে যায়। অতঃপর শয়ত্বান তাকে অনুসরণ করে, ফলে সে পথভ্রষ্টদের দলে শামিল হয়ে যায়।', 'And recite to them, [O Muhammad], the news of him to whom we gave [knowledge of] Our signs, but he detached himself from them; so Satan pursued him, and he became of the deviators.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007175.mp3', now()),
