,"grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83467,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83468,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83469,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا ۚ","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি নিদর্শনগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83471,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"فَٱقْصُصِ","transliteration":"fa-uq''ṣuṣi","translation_bn":"সুতরাং বর্ণনা করো","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83472,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَصَصَ","transliteration":"l-qaṣaṣa","translation_bn":"এই কাহিনীগুলোকে","root":"قصص","lemma":"قَصَص","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83473,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":83474,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatafakkarūna","translation_bn":"চিন্তা করে","root":"فكر","lemma":"يَتَفَكَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83475,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"١٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw shi''nā larafaʿnāhu bihā walākinnahu akhlada ilā l-arḍi wa-ittabaʿa hawāhu famathaluhu kamathali l-kalbi in taḥmil ʿalayhi yalhath aw tatruk''hu yalhath dhālika mathalu l-qawmi alladhīna kadhabū biāyātinā fa-uq''ṣuṣi l-qaṣaṣa laʿallahum yatafakkarūna', 'আমি ইচ্ছে করলে আমার নিদর্শনের মাধ্যমে তাকে অবশ্যই উচ্চতর মর্যাদা দিতাম। কিন্তু সে দুনিয়ার প্রতিই ঝুঁকে পড়ল আর তার প্রবৃত্তির অনুসরণ করল। তাই তার দৃষ্টান্ত হল কুকুরের দৃষ্টান্তের মত। যদি তুমি তার উপর বোঝা চাপাও তাহলে জিভ বের করে হাঁপাতে থাকে এবং তাকে ছেড়ে দিলেও জিভ বের করে হাঁপাতে থাকে। এটাই হল ঐ সম্প্রদায়ের উদাহরণ যারা আমার আয়াতসমূহকে মিথ্যে মনে করে অমান্য করে। তুমি এ কাহিনী শুনিয়ে দাও যাতে তারা চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে।', 'And if We had willed, we could have elevated him thereby, but he adhered [instead] to the earth and followed his own desire. So his example is like that of the dog: if you chase him, he pants, or if you leave him, he [still] pants. That is the example of the people who denied Our signs. So relate the stories that perhaps they will give thought.', 'আমি ইচ্ছে করলে আমার নিদর্শনের মাধ্যমে তাকে অবশ্যই উচ্চতর মর্যাদা দিতাম। কিন্তু সে দুনিয়ার প্রতিই ঝুঁকে পড়ল আর তার প্রবৃত্তির অনুসরণ করল। তাই তার দৃষ্টান্ত হল কুকুরের দৃষ্টান্তের মত। যদি তুমি তার উপর বোঝা চাপাও তাহলে জিভ বের করে হাঁপাতে থাকে এবং তাকে ছেড়ে দিলেও জিভ বের করে হাঁপাতে থাকে। এটাই হল ঐ সম্প্রদায়ের উদাহরণ যারা আমার আয়াতসমূহকে মিথ্যে মনে করে অমান্য করে। তুমি এ কাহিনী শুনিয়ে দাও যাতে তারা চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে।', 'And if We had willed, we could have elevated him thereby, but he adhered [instead] to the earth and followed his own desire. So his example is like that of the dog: if you chase him, he pants, or if you leave him, he [still] pants. That is the example of the people who denied Our signs. So relate the stories that perhaps they will give thought.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007176.mp3', now()),
  (7, 177, '', '[{"id":83590,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"سَآءَ","transliteration":"sāa","translation_bn":"বড়ই খারাপ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83591,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَثَلًا","transliteration":"mathalan","translation_bn":"দৃষ্টান্ত","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83592,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمُ","transliteration":"l-qawmu","translation_bn":"(ঐ) সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83593,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83594,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83595,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি আয়াতগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83596,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفُسَهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-anfusahum","translation_bn":"ও নিজেদের তাদের(উপর)","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83597,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83598,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَظْلِمُونَ","transliteration":"yaẓlimūna","translation_bn":"অনাচার করে চলেছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83599,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"١٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sāa mathalan l-qawmu alladhīna kadhabū biāyātinā wa-anfusahum kānū yaẓlimūna', 'যে সম্প্রদায় আমার আয়াতগুলোকে মিথ্যে মনে করে প্রত্যাখ্যান করে আর নিজেদের উপর যুলম করতে থাকে তাদের উদাহরণ কতই না মন্দ!', 'How evil an example [is that of] the people who denied Our signs and used to wrong themselves.', 'যে সম্প্রদায় আমার আয়াতগুলোকে মিথ্যে মনে করে প্রত্যাখ্যান করে আর নিজেদের উপর যুলম করতে থাকে তাদের উদাহরণ কতই না মন্দ!', 'How evil an example [is that of] the people who denied Our signs and used to wrong themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007177.mp3', now()),
  (7, 178, '', '[{"id":83652,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":83653,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِ","transliteration":"yahdi","translation_bn":"পথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83654,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":83655,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَهُوَ","transliteration":"fahuwa","translation_bn":"তখন সেই","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":83656,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُهْتَدِى ۖ","transliteration":"l-muh''tadī","translation_bn":"পথপ্রাপ্ত","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُهْتَدِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83658,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83659,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُضْلِلْ","transliteration":"yuḍ''lil","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83660,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"অতঃপর ঐসব (লোক)","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":83661,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":83662,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَـٰسِرُونَ","transliteration":"l-khāsirūna","translation_bn":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَٰسِرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83663,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'man yahdi l-lahu fahuwa l-muh''tadī waman yuḍ''lil fa-ulāika humu l-khāsirūna', 'আল্লাহ যাকে হিদায়াত করেন সেই হিদায়াত লাভ করে, আর যাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেন তারাই হয় ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত।', 'Whoever Allah guides - he is the [rightly] guided; and whoever He sends astray - it is those who are the losers.', 'আল্লাহ যাকে হিদায়াত করেন সেই হিদায়াত লাভ করে, আর যাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেন তারাই হয় ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত।', 'Whoever Allah guides - he is the [rightly] guided; and whoever He sends astray - it is those who are the losers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007178.mp3', now()),
  (7, 179, '', '[{"id":83737,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ","transliteration":"walaqad","translation_bn":"এবং নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83738,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ذَرَأْنَا","transliteration":"dharanā","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছি আমরা","root":"ذرا","lemma":"ذَرَأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83739,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِجَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"lijahannama","translation_bn":"জন্যে জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83740,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"অনেককে","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83741,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্যে হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83742,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِنِّ","transliteration":"l-jini","translation_bn":"জিন","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83743,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْإِنسِ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-insi","translation_bn":"ও মানুষের","root":"انس","lemma":"إِنس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83745,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"রয়েছে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83746,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبٌۭ","transliteration":"qulūbun","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহ","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83747,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"(কিন্তু) না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":83748,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَفْقَهُونَ","transliteration":"yafqahūna","translation_bn":"তারা চিন্তা ভাবনা করে","root":"فقه","lemma":"يَفْقَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83749,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83750,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং রয়েছে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83751,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَعْيُنٌۭ","transliteration":"aʿyunun","translation_bn":"চোখসমূহ","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83752,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"(কিন্তু) না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":83753,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُبْصِرُونَ","transliteration":"yub''ṣirūna","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"بصر","lemma":"أَبْصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83754,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83755,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং রয়েছে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83756,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ءَاذَانٌۭ","transliteration":"ādhānun","translation_bn":"কানসমূহ","root":"اذن","lemma":"أُذُنٌ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83757,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"(কিন্তু) না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":83758,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَسْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা শুনে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83759,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِهَآ ۚ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَآ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83761,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব (লোক)","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":83762,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"كَٱلْأَنْعَـٰمِ","transliteration":"kal-anʿāmi","translation_bn":"(যেন) মতো পশুর","root":"نعم","lemma":"نَّعَم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83763,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":83764,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":83765,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"أَضَلُّ ۚ","transliteration":"aḍallu","translation_bn":"অধিক বিভ্রান্ত","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83767,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব (লোক)","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":83768,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":83769,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَـٰفِلُونَ","transliteration":"l-ghāfilūna","translation_bn":"উদাসীন","root":"غفل","lemma":"غَٰفِل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83770,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"١٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaqad dharanā lijahannama kathīran mina l-jini wal-insi lahum qulūbun lā yafqahūna bihā walahum aʿyunun lā yub''ṣirūna bihā walahum ādhānun lā yasmaʿūna bihā ulāika kal-anʿāmi bal hum aḍallu ulāika humu l-ghāfilūna', 'আমি বহু সংখ্যক জ্বীন আর মানুষকে জাহান্নামের জন্য সৃষ্টি করেছি, তাদের হৃদয় আছে কিন্তু তা দিয়ে উপলব্ধি করে না, তাদের চোখ আছে কিন্তু তা দিয়ে দেখে না, তাদের কান আছে কিন্তু তা দিয়ে শোনে না, তারা জন্তু-জানোয়ারের মত, বরং তার চেয়েও পথভ্রষ্ট, তারা একেবারে বে-খবর।', 'And We have certainly created for Hell many of the jinn and mankind. They have hearts with which they do not understand, they have eyes with which they do not see, and they have ears with which they do not hear. Those are like livestock; rather, they are more astray. It is they who are the heedless.', 'আমি বহু সংখ্যক জ্বীন আর মানুষকে জাহান্নামের জন্য সৃষ্টি করেছি, তাদের হৃদয় আছে কিন্তু তা দিয়ে উপলব্ধি করে না, তাদের চোখ আছে কিন্তু তা দিয়ে দেখে না, তাদের কান আছে কিন্তু তা দিয়ে শোনে না, তারা জন্তু-জানোয়ারের মত, বরং তার চেয়েও পথভ্রষ্ট, তারা একেবারে বে-খবর।', 'And We have certainly created for Hell many of the jinn and mankind. They have hearts with which they do not understand, they have eyes with which they do not see, and they have ears with which they do not hear. Those are like livestock; rather, they are more astray. It is they who are the heedless.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007179.mp3', now()),
  (7, 180, '', '[{"id":83775,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِلَّهِ","transliteration":"walillahi","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে আল্লাহর (রয়েছে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83776,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَسْمَآءُ","transliteration":"l-asmāu","translation_bn":"নামসমূহ","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83777,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","transliteration":"l-ḥus''nā","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83778,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَٱدْعُوهُ","transliteration":"fa-id''ʿūhu","translation_bn":"অতএব তাঁকে ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83779,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا ۖ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83781,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَذَرُوا۟","transliteration":"wadharū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা বর্জন করো","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83782,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83783,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُلْحِدُونَ","transliteration":"yul''ḥidūna","translation_bn":"বিকৃত করে","root":"لحد","lemma":"يُلْحِدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83784,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83785,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَسْمَـٰٓئِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"asmāihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর নামসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"ٱسْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83787,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"سَيُجْزَوْنَ","transliteration":"sayuj''zawna","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই তাদেরকে প্রতিফল দেওয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":83788,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":83789,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83790,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করে চলেছে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83791,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walillahi l-asmāu l-ḥus''nā fa-id''ʿūhu bihā wadharū alladhīna yul''ḥidūna fī asmāihi sayuj''zawna mā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'সুন্দর যত নাম সবই আল্লাহর জন্য। কাজেই তাঁকে ডাক ঐ সব নামের মাধ্যমে। যারা তার নামের মধ্যে বিকৃতি ঘটায় তাদেরকে পরিত্যাগ কর। তারা যা করছে তার ফল তারা শীঘ্র পাবে।', 'And to Allah belong the best names, so invoke Him by them. And leave [the company of] those who practice deviation concerning His names. They will be recompensed for what they have been doing.', 'সুন্দর যত নাম সবই আল্লাহর জন্য। কাজেই তাঁকে ডাক ঐ সব নামের মাধ্যমে। যারা তার নামের মধ্যে বিকৃতি ঘটায় তাদেরকে পরিত্যাগ কর। তারা যা করছে তার ফল তারা শীঘ্র পাবে।', 'And to Allah belong the best names, so invoke Him by them. And leave [the company of] those who practice deviation concerning His names. They will be recompensed for what they have been doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007180.mp3', now()),
  (7, 181, '', '[{"id":83905,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِمَّنْ","transliteration":"wamimman","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের মধ্যে হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83906,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقْنَآ","transliteration":"khalaqnā","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছি আমরা","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83907,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٌۭ","transliteration":"ummatun","translation_bn":"(এমনও) একদল","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83908,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدُونَ","transliteration":"yahdūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) পথ দেখায়","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83909,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"দিকে সত্যের","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83910,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَبِهِۦ","transliteration":"wabihi","translation_bn":"এবং দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"وَبِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":83911,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَعْدِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿdilūna","translation_bn":"তারা ন্যায় বিচার করে","root":"عدل","lemma":"عَدَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83912,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamimman khalaqnā ummatun yahdūna bil-ḥaqi wabihi yaʿdilūna', 'আমি যাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছি তাদের মধ্যে একদল আছে যারা সঠিকভাবে পথ নির্দেশ দেয়, আর তার মাধ্যমেই সুবিচার করে।', 'And among those We created is a community which guides by truth and thereby establishes justice.', 'আমি যাদেরকে সৃষ্টি করেছি তাদের মধ্যে একদল আছে যারা সঠিকভাবে পথ নির্দেশ দেয়, আর তার মাধ্যমেই সুবিচার করে।', 'And among those We created is a community which guides by truth and thereby establishes justice.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007181.mp3', now()),
  (7, 182, '', '[{"id":83947,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":83948,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83949,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَا","transliteration":"biāyātinā","translation_bn":"প্রতি নিদর্শনগুলোর আমাদের","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83950,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَنَسْتَدْرِجُهُم","transliteration":"sanastadrijuhum","translation_bn":"অচিরেই ক্রমান্বয়ে নিয়ে যাবো আমরা তাদের (ধ্বংসের দিকে)","root":"درج","lemma":"نَسْتَدْرِجُ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":83951,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":83952,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"حَيْثُ","transliteration":"ḥaythu","translation_bn":"যেখান","root":"حيث","lemma":"حَيْث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":83953,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":83954,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানতেও পারবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":83955,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"١٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna kadhabū biāyātinā sanastadrijuhum min ḥaythu lā yaʿlamūna', 'যারা আমার আয়াতগুলোকে প্রত্যাখ্যান করে আমি তাদেরকে ধাপে ধাপে এমনভাবে ধ্বংসের দিকে নিয়ে যাই যে, তারা টেরও করতে পারে না।', 'But those who deny Our signs - We will progressively lead them [to destruction] from where they do not know.', 'যারা আমার আয়াতগুলোকে প্রত্যাখ্যান করে আমি তাদেরকে ধাপে ধাপে এমনভাবে ধ্বংসের দিকে নিয়ে যাই যে, তারা টেরও করতে পারে না।', 'But those who deny Our signs - We will progressively lead them [to destruction] from where they do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007182.mp3', now()),
  (7, 183, '', '[{"id":84026,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأُمْلِى","transliteration":"wa-um''lī","translation_bn":"এবং অবকাশ দিচ্ছি আমি","root":"ملو","lemma":"أَمْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84027,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84029,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":84030,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَيْدِى","transliteration":"kaydī","translation_bn":"আমার কৌশল","root":"كيد","lemma":"كَيْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84031,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَتِينٌ","transliteration":"matīnun","translation_bn":"বলিষ্ঠ","root":"متن","lemma":"مَتِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84032,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"١٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-um''lī lahum inna kaydī matīnun', 'আমি তাদেরকে অবকাশ ও সুযোগ দেই, আমার কুশলী ব্যবস্থাপনা অত্যন্ত মযবুত।', 'And I will give them time. Indeed, my plan is firm.', 'আমি তাদেরকে অবকাশ ও সুযোগ দেই, আমার কুশলী ব্যবস্থাপনা অত্যন্ত মযবুত।', 'And I will give them time. Indeed, my plan is firm.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007183.mp3', now()),
  (7, 184, '', '[{"id":84039,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":84040,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَتَفَكَّرُوا۟ ۗ","transliteration":"yatafakkarū","translation_bn":"তারা চিন্তা করে","root":"فكر","lemma":"يَتَفَكَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84042,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(যে) নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":84043,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِصَاحِبِهِم","transliteration":"biṣāḥibihim","translation_bn":"মধ্যে সাথীর তাদের","root":"صحب","lemma":"صَاحِب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84044,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84045,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جِنَّةٍ ۚ","transliteration":"jinnatin","translation_bn":"উন্মাদ","root":"جنن","lemma":"جِنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84047,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":84048,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সে","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":84049,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":84050,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نَذِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"nadhīrun","translation_bn":"একজন সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84051,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":84052,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"١٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalam yatafakkarū mā biṣāḥibihim min jinnatin in huwa illā nadhīrun mubīnun', 'তারা কি চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে না সে তাদের সঙ্গী (আমার রসূল) তো উম্মাদ নয়, সে তো প্রকাশ্য এক সতর্ককারী।', 'Then do they not give thought? There is in their companion [Muhammad] no madness. He is not but a clear warner.', 'তারা কি চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে না সে তাদের সঙ্গী (আমার রসূল) তো উম্মাদ নয়, সে তো প্রকাশ্য এক সতর্ককারী।', 'Then do they not give thought? There is in their companion [Muhammad] no madness. He is not but a clear warner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007184.mp3', now()),
  (7, 185, '', '[{"id":84185,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَمْ","transliteration":"awalam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":84186,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَنظُرُوا۟","transliteration":"yanẓurū","translation_bn":"তারা লক্ষ্য করে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84187,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84188,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَلَكُوتِ","transliteration":"malakūti","translation_bn":"সার্বভৌম কর্তৃত্বের","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكُوت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84189,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84190,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"এবং পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84191,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84192,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَ","transliteration":"khalaqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84193,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":84194,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"সব","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84195,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍۢ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুর","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84196,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنْ","transliteration":"wa-an","translation_bn":"এবং (এ সম্পর্কেও) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84197,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿasā","translation_bn":"হয়তো","root":"عسي","lemma":"عَسَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84198,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":84199,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونَ","transliteration":"yakūna","translation_bn":"হতে পারে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84200,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَدِ","transliteration":"qadi","translation_bn":"নিশ্চিত","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":84201,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱقْتَرَبَ","transliteration":"iq''taraba","translation_bn":"নিকটবর্তী হয়েছে","root":"قرب","lemma":"ٱقْتَرَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84202,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلُهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ajaluhum","translation_bn":"মেয়াদ তাদের","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84204,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَبِأَىِّ","transliteration":"fabi-ayyi","translation_bn":"অতএব আর কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"أَىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84205,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"حَدِيثٍۭ","transliteration":"ḥadīthin","translation_bn":"কথায়","root":"حدث","lemma":"حَدِيث","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84206,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَهُۥ","transliteration":"baʿdahu","translation_bn":"পর এর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":84207,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"তারা ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84208,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalam yanẓurū fī malakūti l-samāwāti wal-arḍi wamā khalaqa l-lahu min shayin wa-an ʿasā an yakūna qadi iq''taraba ajaluhum fabi-ayyi ḥadīthin baʿdahu yu''minūna', 'তারা কি আসমান-যমীনের রাজত্বে আর আল্লাহ যে সব বস্তু সৃষ্টি করেছেন তাতে কিছুই দেখে না? তারা কি চিন্তা করে না যে হয়ত তাদের জীবনের মেয়াদ নিকটেই এসে গেছে? এরপর তারা কোন বাণীর উপর ঈমান আনবে?', 'Do they not look into the realm of the heavens and the earth and everything that Allah has created and [think] that perhaps their appointed time has come near? So in what statement hereafter will they believe?', 'তারা কি আসমান-যমীনের রাজত্বে আর আল্লাহ যে সব বস্তু সৃষ্টি করেছেন তাতে কিছুই দেখে না? তারা কি চিন্তা করে না যে হয়ত তাদের জীবনের মেয়াদ নিকটেই এসে গেছে? এরপর তারা কোন বাণীর উপর ঈমান আনবে?', 'Do they not look into the realm of the heavens and the earth and everything that Allah has created and [think] that perhaps their appointed time has come near? So in what statement hereafter will they believe?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007185.mp3', now()),
  (7, 186, '', '[{"id":84246,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":84247,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُضْلِلِ","transliteration":"yuḍ''lili","translation_bn":"পথভ্রষ্ট করেন","root":"ضلل","lemma":"أَضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84248,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":84249,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":84250,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هَادِىَ","transliteration":"hādiya","translation_bn":"কোনো পথ প্রদর্শক","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَادِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84251,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84253,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيَذَرُهُمْ","transliteration":"wayadharuhum","translation_bn":"এবং  তিনি ছেড়ে দেন তাদেরকে","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84254,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84255,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"طُغْيَـٰنِهِمْ","transliteration":"ṭugh''yānihim","translation_bn":"বিদ্রোহিতার তাদের","root":"طغي","lemma":"طُغْيَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84256,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَهُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmahūna","translation_bn":"তারা উদভ্রান্ত হয়ে ফিরবে","root":"عمه","lemma":"يَعْمَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84257,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"١٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'man yuḍ''lili l-lahu falā hādiya lahu wayadharuhum fī ṭugh''yānihim yaʿmahūna', 'আল্লাহ যাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেন তার জন্য কোন হিদায়াত নেই। তিনি তাদেরকে তাদের বিদ্রোহী ভূমিকায় বিভ্রান্ত হয়ে ঘুরপাক খেতে ছেড়ে দেন।', 'Whoever Allah sends astray - there is no guide for him. And He leaves them in their transgression, wandering blindly.', 'আল্লাহ যাকে পথভ্রষ্ট করেন তার জন্য কোন হিদায়াত নেই। তিনি তাদেরকে তাদের বিদ্রোহী ভূমিকায় বিভ্রান্ত হয়ে ঘুরপাক খেতে ছেড়ে দেন।', 'Whoever Allah sends astray - there is no guide for him. And He leaves them in their transgression, wandering blindly.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007186.mp3', now()),
  (7, 187, '', '[{"id":84311,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ","transliteration":"yasalūnaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে তারা জিজ্ঞাসা করে","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84312,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84313,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّاعَةِ","transliteration":"l-sāʿati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাত","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84314,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَيَّانَ","transliteration":"ayyāna","translation_bn":"কখন","root":"—","lemma":"أَيَّان\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":84315,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُرْسَىٰهَا ۖ","transliteration":"mur''sāhā","translation_bn":"ঘটবে তা","root":"رسو","lemma":"مُرْسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84317,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84318,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":84319,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمُهَا","transliteration":"ʿil''muhā","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান তার","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84320,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":84321,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى ۖ","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84323,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":84324,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُجَلِّيهَا","transliteration":"yujallīhā","translation_bn":"কেউ প্রকাশ করে তা","root":"جلو","lemma":"جَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84325,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِوَقْتِهَآ","transliteration":"liwaqtihā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে সময়ের তার (অন্য কারো কাছে)","root":"وقت","lemma":"وَقْت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84326,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":84327,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۚ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۚ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":84329,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ثَقُلَتْ","transliteration":"thaqulat","translation_bn":"ভারী হবে","root":"ثقل","lemma":"ثَقُلَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84330,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84331,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশমন্ডলীর","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84332,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর (উপর)","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84334,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":84335,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"تَأْتِيكُمْ","transliteration":"tatīkum","translation_bn":"কাছে তা আসবে তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84336,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":84337,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"بَغْتَةًۭ ۗ","transliteration":"baghtatan","translation_bn":"হঠাৎ\"","root":"بغت","lemma":"بَغْتَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84339,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ","transliteration":"yasalūnaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে তারা প্রশ্ন করে","root":"سال","lemma":"سَأَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84340,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"كَأَنَّكَ","transliteration":"ka-annaka","translation_bn":"যেন তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":84341,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"حَفِىٌّ","transliteration":"ḥafiyyun","translation_bn":"সবিশেষ অবহিত","root":"حفو","lemma":"حَفِيّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84342,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهَا ۖ","transliteration":"ʿanhā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে তা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84344,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84345,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"\"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":84346,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"عِلْمُهَا","transliteration":"ʿil''muhā","translation_bn":"জ্ঞান তার(রয়েছে)","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84347,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":84348,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":84349,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84350,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَ","transliteration":"akthara","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84351,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84352,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":84353,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে\"","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84354,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"١٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yasalūnaka ʿani l-sāʿati ayyāna mur''sāhā qul innamā ʿil''muhā ʿinda rabbī lā yujallīhā liwaqtihā illā huwa thaqulat fī l-samāwāti wal-arḍi lā tatīkum illā baghtatan yasalūnaka ka-annaka ḥafiyyun ʿanhā qul innamā ʿil''muhā ʿinda l-lahi walākinna akthara l-nāsi lā yaʿlamūna', 'তারা তোমাকে ক্বিয়ামাত সম্পর্কে জিজ্ঞেস করে কখন তা সংঘটিত হবে। বল, ‘এ বিষয়ে জ্ঞান রয়েছে আমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট। তিনি ছাড়া কেউ প্রকাশ করতে পারে না কখন তা ঘটবে। আসমান ও যমীনে তা হবে বড় এক কঠিন দিন। আকস্মিকভাবে তা তোমাদের উপর এসে পড়বে।’ লোকেরা তোমাকে এ সম্পর্কে এমনভাবে জিজ্ঞেস করছে যেন তুমি আগ্রহ সহকারে এটার খোঁজে ব্যস্ত আছ। বল, ‘এ বিষয়ের জ্ঞান তো শুধু আল্লাহরই নিকট আছে। কিন্তু (এ সত্যটা) অধিকাংশ লোকই জানে না।’', 'They ask you, [O Muhammad], about the Hour: when is its arrival? Say, "Its knowledge is only with my Lord. None will reveal its time except Him. It lays heavily upon the heavens and the earth. It will not come upon you except unexpectedly." They ask you as if you are familiar with it. Say, "Its knowledge is only with Allah, but most of the people do not know."', 'তারা তোমাকে ক্বিয়ামাত সম্পর্কে জিজ্ঞেস করে কখন তা সংঘটিত হবে। বল, ‘এ বিষয়ে জ্ঞান রয়েছে আমার প্রতিপালকের নিকট। তিনি ছাড়া কেউ প্রকাশ করতে পারে না কখন তা ঘটবে। আসমান ও যমীনে তা হবে বড় এক কঠিন দিন। আকস্মিকভাবে তা তোমাদের উপর এসে পড়বে।’ লোকেরা তোমাকে এ সম্পর্কে এমনভাবে জিজ্ঞেস করছে যেন তুমি আগ্রহ সহকারে এটার খোঁজে ব্যস্ত আছ। বল, ‘এ বিষয়ের জ্ঞান তো শুধু আল্লাহরই নিকট আছে। কিন্তু (এ সত্যটা) অধিকাংশ লোকই জানে না।’', 'They ask you, [O Muhammad], about the Hour: when is its arrival? Say, "Its knowledge is only with my Lord. None will reveal its time except Him. It lays heavily upon the heavens and the earth. It will not come upon you except unexpectedly." They ask you as if you are familiar with it. Say, "Its knowledge is only with Allah, but most of the people do not know."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007187.mp3', now()),
  (7, 188, '', '[{"id":84475,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84476,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":84477,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْلِكُ","transliteration":"amliku","translation_bn":"\"ক্ষমতা রাখি আমি","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84478,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِنَفْسِى","transliteration":"linafsī","translation_bn":"জন্যে আমার নিজের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84479,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَفْعًۭا","transliteration":"nafʿan","translation_bn":"কোনো লাভের","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84480,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84481,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ضَرًّا","transliteration":"ḍarran","translation_bn":"কোনো ক্ষতির","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84482,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":84483,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":84484,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84485,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":84487,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84488,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُ","transliteration":"kuntu","translation_bn":"আমি ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84489,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"আমি জানি","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84490,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبَ","transliteration":"l-ghayba","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্যকে","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84491,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَٱسْتَكْثَرْتُ","transliteration":"la-is''takthartu","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমি অনেক নিতাম","root":"كثر","lemma":"ٱسْتَكْثَرْ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":84492,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84493,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَيْرِ","transliteration":"l-khayri","translation_bn":"কল্যাণ","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84494,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84495,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مَسَّنِىَ","transliteration":"massaniya","translation_bn":"আমাকে স্পর্শ করতো","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84496,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسُّوٓءُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-sūu","translation_bn":"কোনো অকল্যাণ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سُو^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84498,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"(প্রকৃতপক্ষে) নই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":84499,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أَنَا۠","transliteration":"anā","translation_bn":"আমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":84500,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":84501,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"نَذِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"nadhīrun","translation_bn":"একজন সতর্ককারী","root":"نذر","lemma":"نَذِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84502,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَبَشِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"wabashīrun","translation_bn":"ও সুসংবাদদাতা","root":"بشر","lemma":"بَشِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84503,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে ঐ সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84504,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) ঈমান আনে\"","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84505,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"١٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul lā amliku linafsī nafʿan walā ḍarran illā mā shāa l-lahu walaw kuntu aʿlamu l-ghayba la-is''takthartu mina l-khayri wamā massaniya l-sūu in anā illā nadhīrun wabashīrun liqawmin yu''minūna', 'বল, আল্লাহ যা ইচ্ছে করেন তা ছাড়া আমার নিজের ভাল বা মন্দ করার কোন ক্ষমতা আমার নেই। আমি যদি অদৃশ্যের খবর জানতাম তাহলে নিজের জন্য অনেক বেশি ফায়দা হাসিল করে নিতাম, আর কোন প্রকার অকল্যাণই আমাকে স্পর্শ করত না। যারা ঈমান আনবে আমি সেই সম্প্রদায়ের প্রতি সতর্ককারী ও সুসংবাদদাতা ছাড়া অন্য কিছু নই।', 'Say, "I hold not for myself [the power of] benefit or harm, except what Allah has willed. And if I knew the unseen, I could have acquired much wealth, and no harm would have touched me. I am not except a warner and a bringer of good tidings to a people who believe."', 'বল, আল্লাহ যা ইচ্ছে করেন তা ছাড়া আমার নিজের ভাল বা মন্দ করার কোন ক্ষমতা আমার নেই। আমি যদি অদৃশ্যের খবর জানতাম তাহলে নিজের জন্য অনেক বেশি ফায়দা হাসিল করে নিতাম, আর কোন প্রকার অকল্যাণই আমাকে স্পর্শ করত না। যারা ঈমান আনবে আমি সেই সম্প্রদায়ের প্রতি সতর্ককারী ও সুসংবাদদাতা ছাড়া অন্য কিছু নই।', 'Say, "I hold not for myself [the power of] benefit or harm, except what Allah has willed. And if I knew the unseen, I could have acquired much wealth, and no harm would have touched me. I am not except a warner and a bringer of good tidings to a people who believe."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007188.mp3', now()),
  (7, 189, '', '[{"id":84551,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"(আল্লাহ) তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"۞ هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":84552,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":84553,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خَلَقَكُم","transliteration":"khalaqakum","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করেছেন তোমাদেরকে","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84554,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84555,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَّفْسٍۢ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তি","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84556,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٰحِدَةٍۢ","transliteration":"wāḥidatin","translation_bn":"একই","root":"وحد","lemma":"وَٰحِدَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":84557,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَجَعَلَ","transliteration":"wajaʿala","translation_bn":"এবং বানিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84558,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهَا","transliteration":"min''hā","translation_bn":"হতে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84559,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"زَوْجَهَا","transliteration":"zawjahā","translation_bn":"জোড়া তার","root":"زوج","lemma":"زَوْج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84560,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِيَسْكُنَ","transliteration":"liyaskuna","translation_bn":"যেন সে শান্তি পায়","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84561,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهَا ۖ","transliteration":"ilayhā","translation_bn":"কাছে তার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84563,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর  যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84564,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَغَشَّىٰهَا","transliteration":"taghashāhā","translation_bn":"সে তাকে ঢেকে নেয় (সংগত হয়)","root":"غشو","lemma":"تَغَشَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84565,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حَمَلَتْ","transliteration":"ḥamalat","translation_bn":"(স্ত্রী) গর্ভধারণ করে","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84566,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حَمْلًا","transliteration":"ḥamlan","translation_bn":"গর্ভ","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84567,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"خَفِيفًۭا","transliteration":"khafīfan","translation_bn":"লঘু","root":"خفف","lemma":"خَفِيف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":84568,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَمَرَّتْ","transliteration":"famarrat","translation_bn":"অতঃপর সে চলাচল করে","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84569,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84571,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84572,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَثْقَلَت","transliteration":"athqalat","translation_bn":"ভারী হয়","root":"ثقل","lemma":"أَثْقَلَت","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84573,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"دَّعَوَا","transliteration":"daʿawā","translation_bn":"দু''জনেই দোয়া করে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84574,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (কাছে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":84575,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"رَبَّهُمَا","transliteration":"rabbahumā","translation_bn":"(যিনি) তাদের উভয়ের রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84576,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَئِنْ","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"\"অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":84577,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَيْتَنَا","transliteration":"ātaytanā","translation_bn":"দাও তুমি আমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84578,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"পূর্ণাঙ্গ ও সন্তান","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84579,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لَّنَكُونَنَّ","transliteration":"lanakūnanna","translation_bn":"আবশ্যই আমরা হবো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":84580,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84581,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"ٱلشَّـٰكِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-shākirīna","translation_bn":"কৃতজ্ঞদের\"","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَاكِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84582,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"١٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa alladhī khalaqakum min nafsin wāḥidatin wajaʿala min''hā zawjahā liyaskuna ilayhā falammā taghashāhā ḥamalat ḥamlan khafīfan famarrat bihi falammā athqalat daʿawā l-laha rabbahumā la-in ātaytanā ṣāliḥan lanakūnanna mina l-shākirīna', 'তিনিই তোমাদেরকে এক ব্যক্তি হতে সৃষ্টি করেছেন আর তাত্থেকে তার জোড়া সৃষ্টি করেছেন যাতে সে তার কাছে শান্তি পায়। যখন সে স্ত্রীর সাথে সঙ্গত হয় তখন সে লঘু গর্ভধারণ করে আর তা নিয়ে চলাফেরা করে। গর্ভ যখন ভারী হয়ে যায় তখন উভয়ে তাদের প্রতিপালক আল্লাহকে ডেকে বলে, ‘যদি তুমি আমাদেরকে (গঠন ও স্বভাবে) ভাল সন্তান দান কর তাহলে আমরা কৃতজ্ঞ থাকব।’', 'It is He who created you from one soul and created from it its mate that he might dwell in security with her. And when he covers her, she carries a light burden and continues therein. And when it becomes heavy, they both invoke Allah, their Lord, "If You should give us a good [child], we will surely be among the grateful."', 'তিনিই তোমাদেরকে এক ব্যক্তি হতে সৃষ্টি করেছেন আর তাত্থেকে তার জোড়া সৃষ্টি করেছেন যাতে সে তার কাছে শান্তি পায়। যখন সে স্ত্রীর সাথে সঙ্গত হয় তখন সে লঘু গর্ভধারণ করে আর তা নিয়ে চলাফেরা করে। গর্ভ যখন ভারী হয়ে যায় তখন উভয়ে তাদের প্রতিপালক আল্লাহকে ডেকে বলে, ‘যদি তুমি আমাদেরকে (গঠন ও স্বভাবে) ভাল সন্তান দান কর তাহলে আমরা কৃতজ্ঞ থাকব।’', 'It is He who created you from one soul and created from it its mate that he might dwell in security with her. And when he covers her, she carries a light burden and continues therein. And when it becomes heavy, they both invoke Allah, their Lord, "If You should give us a good [child], we will surely be among the grateful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007189.mp3', now()),
  (7, 190, '', '[{"id":84595,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অত:পর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84596,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَىٰهُمَا","transliteration":"ātāhumā","translation_bn":"দু’জনকে দিলেন তাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84597,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"পূর্ণাঙ্গ সন্তান","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84598,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَا","transliteration":"jaʿalā","translation_bn":"দু''জনে নির্ধারণ করলো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84599,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84600,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءَ","transliteration":"shurakāa","translation_bn":"শরিক","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84601,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَآ","transliteration":"fīmā","translation_bn":"তার ব্যাপারে যা","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84602,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَىٰهُمَا ۚ","transliteration":"ātāhumā","translation_bn":"দু’জনকে (আল্লাহ) দিলেন তাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84604,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَتَعَـٰلَى","transliteration":"fataʿālā","translation_bn":"অথচ বহু ঊর্দ্ধে","root":"علو","lemma":"تَعَٰلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84605,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":84606,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84607,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"yush''rikūna","translation_bn":"তারা শিরক করে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84608,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٩٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā ātāhumā ṣāliḥan jaʿalā lahu shurakāa fīmā ātāhumā fataʿālā l-lahu ʿammā yush''rikūna', 'যখন তিনি তাদেরকে সর্বাঙ্গ-সুন্দর সন্তান দান করেন, তখন তারা তাদেরকে যা দেয়া হয় তাতে অন্যকে আল্লাহর শরীক গণ্য করে। তারা যাদেরকে শরীক গণ্য করে আল্লাহ তাদের থেকে অনেক ঊর্ধ্বে।', 'But when He gives them a good [child], they ascribe partners to Him concerning that which He has given them. Exalted is Allah above what they associate with Him.', 'যখন তিনি তাদেরকে সর্বাঙ্গ-সুন্দর সন্তান দান করেন, তখন তারা তাদেরকে যা দেয়া হয় তাতে অন্যকে আল্লাহর শরীক গণ্য করে। তারা যাদেরকে শরীক গণ্য করে আল্লাহ তাদের থেকে অনেক ঊর্ধ্বে।', 'But when He gives them a good [child], they ascribe partners to Him concerning that which He has given them. Exalted is Allah above what they associate with Him.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007190.mp3', now()),
  (7, 191, '', '[{"id":84704,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَيُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"ayush''rikūna","translation_bn":"কি তারা শিরক করে","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":84705,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":84706,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":84707,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَخْلُقُ","transliteration":"yakhluqu","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করতে পারে","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84708,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কোনো কিছু","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84709,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"অথচ তাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":84710,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يُخْلَقُونَ","transliteration":"yukh''laqūna","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টি করা হয়","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84711,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٩١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'ayush''rikūna mā lā yakhluqu shayan wahum yukh''laqūna', 'তারা কি এমন কিছুকে শরীক করে যারা কিছুই সৃষ্টি করে না? বরং তাদেরকেই সৃষ্টি করা হয়েছে।', 'Do they associate with Him those who create nothing and they are [themselves] created?', 'তারা কি এমন কিছুকে শরীক করে যারা কিছুই সৃষ্টি করে না? বরং তাদেরকেই সৃষ্টি করা হয়েছে।', 'Do they associate with Him those who create nothing and they are [themselves] created?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007191.mp3', now()),
  (7, 192, '', '[{"id":84737,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84738,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَطِيعُونَ","transliteration":"yastaṭīʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা সামর্থ্য রাখে","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84739,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84740,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَصْرًۭا","transliteration":"naṣran","translation_bn":"সাহায্য করতে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84741,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84742,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَهُمْ","transliteration":"anfusahum","translation_bn":"তাদের নিজেদের জন্যে","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84743,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَنصُرُونَ","transliteration":"yanṣurūna","translation_bn":"তারা সাহায্য করতে পারর","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84744,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"١٩٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā yastaṭīʿūna lahum naṣran walā anfusahum yanṣurūna', 'তারা না পারে তাদেরকে (অর্থাৎ তাদের ‘ইবাদাতকারীদেরকে) সাহায্য করতে, না পারে নিজেদেরকে সাহায্য করতে।', 'And the false deities are unable to [give] them help, nor can they help themselves.', 'তারা না পারে তাদেরকে (অর্থাৎ তাদের ‘ইবাদাতকারীদেরকে) সাহায্য করতে, না পারে নিজেদেরকে সাহায্য করতে।', 'And the false deities are unable to [give] them help, nor can they help themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007192.mp3', now()),
  (7, 193, '', '[{"id":84789,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84790,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُوهُمْ","transliteration":"tadʿūhum","translation_bn":"ডাকো তাদেরকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84791,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84792,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْهُدَىٰ","transliteration":"l-hudā","translation_bn":"সঠিকপথের","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84793,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":84794,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّبِعُوكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"yattabiʿūkum","translation_bn":"তারা অনুসরণ করবে তোমাদেরকে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84796,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَوَآءٌ","transliteration":"sawāon","translation_bn":"সমানই","root":"سوي","lemma":"سَوَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84797,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84798,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَدَعَوْتُمُوهُمْ","transliteration":"adaʿawtumūhum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ডাকো তাদেরকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"সমতাবাচক (Equalization)"},{"id":84799,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84800,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":84801,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰمِتُونَ","transliteration":"ṣāmitūna","translation_bn":"নিরবতা অবলম্বনকারী হও","root":"صمت","lemma":"صَٰمِتُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84802,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٩٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in tadʿūhum ilā l-hudā lā yattabiʿūkum sawāon ʿalaykum adaʿawtumūhum am antum ṣāmitūna', 'তোমরা তাদেরকে যদি সত্যপথে চলার জন্য ডাক, তারা তোমাদের অনুসরণ করবে না। তাদেরকে ডাক কিংবা চুপচাপ থাক, তোমাদের জন্য উভয়ই সমান।', 'And if you [believers] invite them to guidance, they will not follow you. It is all the same for you whether you invite them or you are silent.', 'তোমরা তাদেরকে যদি সত্যপথে চলার জন্য ডাক, তারা তোমাদের অনুসরণ করবে না। তাদেরকে ডাক কিংবা চুপচাপ থাক, তোমাদের জন্য উভয়ই সমান।', 'And if you [believers] invite them to guidance, they will not follow you. It is all the same for you whether you invite them or you are silent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007193.mp3', now()),
  (7, 194, '', '[{"id":84825,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":84826,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদের (কাছে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":84827,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"تَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"tadʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রার্থনা করো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84828,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84829,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"ছেড়ে","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84830,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":84831,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادٌ","transliteration":"ʿibādun","translation_bn":"তারা দাস","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84832,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَمْثَالُكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"amthālukum","translation_bn":"মতো তোমাদেরই","root":"مثل","lemma":"مَثَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84834,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَٱدْعُوهُمْ","transliteration":"fa-id''ʿūhum","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে তোমরা ডেকে দেখো তাদেরকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84835,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَسْتَجِيبُوا۟","transliteration":"falyastajībū","translation_bn":"তখন তারা সাড়া দিক","root":"جوب","lemma":"ٱسْتَجَابَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84836,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84837,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":84838,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা হও","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84839,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84840,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٩٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna tadʿūna min dūni l-lahi ʿibādun amthālukum fa-id''ʿūhum falyastajībū lakum in kuntum ṣādiqīna', 'আল্লাহ ছাড়া যাদেরকে তোমরা ডাক তারা তোমাদের মতই বান্দাহ্। (ঠিক আছে) তাদেরকে ডাকতে থাক, তোমরা যদি সত্যবাদী হয়ে থাক তাহলে তারা তোমাদের ডাকে সাড়া দিক।', 'Indeed, those you [polytheists] call upon besides Allah are servants like you. So call upon them and let them respond to you, if you should be truthful.', 'আল্লাহ ছাড়া যাদেরকে তোমরা ডাক তারা তোমাদের মতই বান্দাহ্। (ঠিক আছে) তাদেরকে ডাকতে থাক, তোমরা যদি সত্যবাদী হয়ে থাক তাহলে তারা তোমাদের ডাকে সাড়া দিক।', 'Indeed, those you [polytheists] call upon besides Allah are servants like you. So call upon them and let them respond to you, if you should be truthful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007194.mp3', now()),
  (7, 195, '', '[{"id":84883,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"alahum","translation_bn":"কি আছে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":84884,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرْجُلٌۭ","transliteration":"arjulun","translation_bn":"পাসমূহ","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84885,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَمْشُونَ","transliteration":"yamshūna","translation_bn":"তারা চলে","root":"مشي","lemma":"مَّشَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84886,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِهَآ ۖ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَآ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84888,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84889,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"আছে তাদের (কি)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84890,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدٍۢ","transliteration":"aydin","translation_bn":"হাতসমূহ","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84891,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَبْطِشُونَ","transliteration":"yabṭishūna","translation_bn":"তারা ধরতে পারে","root":"بطش","lemma":"بَطَشْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84892,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهَآ ۖ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَآ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84894,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84895,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"আছে তাদের(কি)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84896,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَعْيُنٌۭ","transliteration":"aʿyunun","translation_bn":"চোখসমূহ","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84897,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُبْصِرُونَ","transliteration":"yub''ṣirūna","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"بصر","lemma":"أَبْصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84898,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِهَآ ۖ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَآ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84900,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84901,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"আছে তাদের(কি)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84902,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ءَاذَانٌۭ","transliteration":"ādhānun","translation_bn":"কানসমূহ","root":"اذن","lemma":"أُذُنٌ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84903,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَسْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা শুনে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84904,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا ۗ","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا ۗ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":84906,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"قُلِ","transliteration":"quli","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84907,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"id''ʿū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84908,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءَكُمْ","transliteration":"shurakāakum","translation_bn":"শরিকদেরকে তোমাদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":84909,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":84910,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"كِيدُونِ","transliteration":"kīdūni","translation_bn":"ষড়যন্ত্র করো আমার বিরুদ্ধে","root":"كيد","lemma":"كِيدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84911,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অত:পর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":84912,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"تُنظِرُونِ","transliteration":"tunẓirūni","translation_bn":"আমাকে তোমরা অবকাশ দিও\"","root":"نظر","lemma":"يُنظَرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":84913,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"١٩٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৯৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٩٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alahum arjulun yamshūna bihā am lahum aydin yabṭishūna bihā am lahum aʿyunun yub''ṣirūna bihā am lahum ādhānun yasmaʿūna bihā quli id''ʿū shurakāakum thumma kīdūni falā tunẓirūni', 'তাদের কি পা আছে যা দিয়ে তারা চলাফেরা করে? তাদের কি হাত আছে যা দিয়ে তারা ধরে? তাদের কি চোখ আছে যা দিয়ে তারা দেখে? তাদের কি কান আছে যা দিয়ে তারা শোনে? বল, তোমরা যাদেরকে আল্লাহর শরীক করছ তাদেরকে আহবান কর, আর আমার বিরুদ্ধে ষড়যন্ত্র কর এবং আমাকে অবকাশ দিও না।', 'Do they have feet by which they walk? Or do they have hands by which they strike? Or do they have eyes by which they see? Or do they have ears by which they hear? Say, [O Muhammad], "Call your ''partners'' and then conspire against me and give me no respite.', 'তাদের কি পা আছে যা দিয়ে তারা চলাফেরা করে? তাদের কি হাত আছে যা দিয়ে তারা ধরে? তাদের কি চোখ আছে যা দিয়ে তারা দেখে? তাদের কি কান আছে যা দিয়ে তারা শোনে? বল, তোমরা যাদেরকে আল্লাহর শরীক করছ তাদেরকে আহবান কর, আর আমার বিরুদ্ধে ষড়যন্ত্র কর এবং আমাকে অবকাশ দিও না।', 'Do they have feet by which they walk? Or do they have hands by which they strike? Or do they have eyes by which they see? Or do they have ears by which they hear? Say, [O Muhammad], "Call your ''partners'' and then conspire against me and give me no respite.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/007195.mp3', now()),
