ma":"غَلَبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57110,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِا۟ئَتَيْنِ ۚ","transliteration":"mi-atayni","translation_bn":"দু''শতের (উপর)","root":"ماي","lemma":"مِائَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57112,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57113,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَكُن","transliteration":"yakun","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57114,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكُم","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57115,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِّا۟ئَةٌۭ","transliteration":"mi-atun","translation_bn":"একশত","root":"ماي","lemma":"مِائَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57116,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَغْلِبُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yaghlibū","translation_bn":"তারা বিজয়ী হবে","root":"غلب","lemma":"غَلَبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57117,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَلْفًۭا","transliteration":"alfan","translation_bn":"এক হাজারের (উপর)","root":"الف","lemma":"أَلْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57118,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"(তাদের) হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57119,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":57120,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57121,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"একারণে যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57122,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"qawmun","translation_bn":"(এমন)সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57123,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"(যারা) না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":57124,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يَفْقَهُونَ","transliteration":"yafqahūna","translation_bn":"তারা বুঝে","root":"فقه","lemma":"يَفْقَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57125,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nabiyu ḥarriḍi l-mu''minīna ʿalā l-qitāli in yakun minkum ʿish''rūna ṣābirūna yaghlibū mi-atayni wa-in yakun minkum mi-atun yaghlibū alfan mina alladhīna kafarū bi-annahum qawmun lā yafqahūna', 'হে নাবী! যুদ্ধের ব্যাপারে মু’মিনদেরকে উদ্বুদ্ধ কর। তোমাদের মধ্যে বিশজন ধৈর্যশীল থাকলে তারা দু’শ জনের উপর জয়ী হবে এবং তোমাদের মধ্যে (ঐরূপ) একশ’ জন থাকলে তারা একহাজার কাফিরের উপর বিজয়ী হবে। কেননা তারা হচ্ছে এমন লোক যারা (ন্যায়-অন্যায় সম্পর্কে) কোন বোধ রাখে না।', 'O Prophet, urge the believers to battle. If there are among you twenty [who are] steadfast, they will overcome two hundred. And if there are among you one hundred [who are] steadfast, they will overcome a thousand of those who have disbelieved because they are a people who do not understand.', 'হে নাবী! যুদ্ধের ব্যাপারে মু’মিনদেরকে উদ্বুদ্ধ কর। তোমাদের মধ্যে বিশজন ধৈর্যশীল থাকলে তারা দু’শ জনের উপর জয়ী হবে এবং তোমাদের মধ্যে (ঐরূপ) একশ’ জন থাকলে তারা একহাজার কাফিরের উপর বিজয়ী হবে। কেননা তারা হচ্ছে এমন লোক যারা (ন্যায়-অন্যায় সম্পর্কে) কোন বোধ রাখে না।', 'O Prophet, urge the believers to battle. If there are among you twenty [who are] steadfast, they will overcome two hundred. And if there are among you one hundred [who are] steadfast, they will overcome a thousand of those who have disbelieved because they are a people who do not understand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008065.mp3', now()),
  (8, 66, '', '[{"id":57574,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔـٰنَ","transliteration":"al-āna","translation_bn":"এখন","root":"—","lemma":"ـ#َٰن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57575,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"خَفَّفَ","transliteration":"khaffafa","translation_bn":"(বোঝা) হালকা করেছেন","root":"خفف","lemma":"خَفَّفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57576,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57577,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَنكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿankum","translation_bn":"হতে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57578,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلِمَ","transliteration":"waʿalima","translation_bn":"এবং তিনি জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57579,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57580,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيكُمْ","transliteration":"fīkum","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে) তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57581,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ضَعْفًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ḍaʿfan","translation_bn":"দুর্বলতা","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ضَعْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57583,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতএব যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57584,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَكُن","transliteration":"yakun","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57585,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكُم","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57586,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مِّا۟ئَةٌۭ","transliteration":"mi-atun","translation_bn":"একশত (জন)","root":"ماي","lemma":"مِائَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57587,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"صَابِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ṣābiratun","translation_bn":"ধৈর্যশীল","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَابِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":57588,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَغْلِبُوا۟","transliteration":"yaghlibū","translation_bn":"তারা বিজয়ী হবে","root":"غلب","lemma":"غَلَبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57589,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِا۟ئَتَيْنِ ۚ","transliteration":"mi-atayni","translation_bn":"দু''শতের (উপর)","root":"ماي","lemma":"مِائَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57591,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57592,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَكُن","transliteration":"yakun","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57593,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِّنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57594,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَلْفٌۭ","transliteration":"alfun","translation_bn":"এক হাজার (জন)","root":"الف","lemma":"أَلْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57595,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَغْلِبُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yaghlibū","translation_bn":"তারা বিজয়ী হবে","root":"غلب","lemma":"غَلَبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57596,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَلْفَيْنِ","transliteration":"alfayni","translation_bn":"দু''হাজারের (উপর)","root":"الف","lemma":"أَلْف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57597,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"بِإِذْنِ","transliteration":"bi-idh''ni","translation_bn":"সাহায্যে অনুমতির","root":"اذن","lemma":"إِذْن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57598,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57600,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57601,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"مَعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে (আছেন)","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":57602,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰبِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-ṣābirīna","translation_bn":"ধৈর্যশীলদের","root":"صبر","lemma":"صَابِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57603,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-āna khaffafa l-lahu ʿankum waʿalima anna fīkum ḍaʿfan fa-in yakun minkum mi-atun ṣābiratun yaghlibū mi-atayni wa-in yakun minkum alfun yaghlibū alfayni bi-idh''ni l-lahi wal-lahu maʿa l-ṣābirīna', '(তবে) এখন আল্লাহ তোমাদের দায়িত্বভার কমিয়ে দিয়েছেন। আল্লাহ তো জানেন যে তোমাদের ভিতর দুর্বলতা রয়ে গেছে, কাজেই তোমাদের মাঝে যদি একশ’ জন ধৈর্যশীল হয় তবে তারা দু’শ জনের উপর বিজয়ী হবে। আর যদি তোমাদের মাঝে এক হাজার (ঐ রকম) লোক পাওয়া যায় তাহলে তারা আল্লাহর হুকুমে দু’হাজার লোকের উপর জয়ী হবে। আর আল্লাহ ধৈর্যশীলদের সাথে (আছেন)।', 'Now, Allah has lightened [the hardship] for you, and He knows that among you is weakness. So if there are from you one hundred [who are] steadfast, they will overcome two hundred. And if there are among you a thousand, they will overcome two thousand by permission of Allah. And Allah is with the steadfast.', '(তবে) এখন আল্লাহ তোমাদের দায়িত্বভার কমিয়ে দিয়েছেন। আল্লাহ তো জানেন যে তোমাদের ভিতর দুর্বলতা রয়ে গেছে, কাজেই তোমাদের মাঝে যদি একশ’ জন ধৈর্যশীল হয় তবে তারা দু’শ জনের উপর বিজয়ী হবে। আর যদি তোমাদের মাঝে এক হাজার (ঐ রকম) লোক পাওয়া যায় তাহলে তারা আল্লাহর হুকুমে দু’হাজার লোকের উপর জয়ী হবে। আর আল্লাহ ধৈর্যশীলদের সাথে (আছেন)।', 'Now, Allah has lightened [the hardship] for you, and He knows that among you is weakness. So if there are from you one hundred [who are] steadfast, they will overcome two hundred. And if there are among you a thousand, they will overcome two thousand by permission of Allah. And Allah is with the steadfast.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008066.mp3', now()),
  (8, 67, '', '[{"id":58358,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58359,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"শোভা পায়","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58360,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِنَبِىٍّ","transliteration":"linabiyyin","translation_bn":"জন্যে নাবীর","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58361,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":58362,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونَ","transliteration":"yakūna","translation_bn":"হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58363,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥٓ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"কাছে তার","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥٓ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58364,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَسْرَىٰ","transliteration":"asrā","translation_bn":"কোনো বন্দি","root":"اسر","lemma":"أَسِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58365,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58366,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُثْخِنَ","transliteration":"yuth''khina","translation_bn":"(শত্রুবাহিনীকে)সম্পূর্ণরূপে নিঃশেষ করবে","root":"ثخن","lemma":"أَثْخَن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58367,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58368,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"জমিনের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58370,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تُرِيدُونَ","transliteration":"turīdūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা চাও","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58371,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَرَضَ","transliteration":"ʿaraḍa","translation_bn":"সম্পদ","root":"عرض","lemma":"عَرَض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58372,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58373,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58374,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"yurīdu","translation_bn":"চান","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58375,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ ۗ","transliteration":"l-ākhirata","translation_bn":"আখেরাত","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58377,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58378,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"পরাক্রমশালী","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58379,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":58380,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā kāna linabiyyin an yakūna lahu asrā ḥattā yuth''khina fī l-arḍi turīdūna ʿaraḍa l-dun''yā wal-lahu yurīdu l-ākhirata wal-lahu ʿazīzun ḥakīmun', 'কোন নাবীর জন্য এটা সঠিক কাজ নয় যে, দেশে (আল্লাহর দুশমনদেরকে) পুরোমাত্রায় পরাভূত না করা পর্যন্ত তার (হাতে) যুদ্ধ-বন্দী থাকবে। তোমরা দুনিয়ার স্বার্থ চাও আর আল্লাহ চান আখিরাত (এর সাফল্য), আল্লাহ প্রবল পরাক্রান্ত, মহাবিজ্ঞানী।', 'It is not for a prophet to have captives [of war] until he inflicts a massacre [upon Allah ''s enemies] in the land. Some Muslims desire the commodities of this world, but Allah desires [for you] the Hereafter. And Allah is Exalted in Might and Wise.', 'কোন নাবীর জন্য এটা সঠিক কাজ নয় যে, দেশে (আল্লাহর দুশমনদেরকে) পুরোমাত্রায় পরাভূত না করা পর্যন্ত তার (হাতে) যুদ্ধ-বন্দী থাকবে। তোমরা দুনিয়ার স্বার্থ চাও আর আল্লাহ চান আখিরাত (এর সাফল্য), আল্লাহ প্রবল পরাক্রান্ত, মহাবিজ্ঞানী।', 'It is not for a prophet to have captives [of war] until he inflicts a massacre [upon Allah ''s enemies] in the land. Some Muslims desire the commodities of this world, but Allah desires [for you] the Hereafter. And Allah is Exalted in Might and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008067.mp3', now()),
  (8, 68, '', '[{"id":58796,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْلَا","transliteration":"lawlā","translation_bn":"যদি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":58797,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبٌۭ","transliteration":"kitābun","translation_bn":"লিখিত বিধান (থাকতো)","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58798,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"পক্ষ থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58799,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58800,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَبَقَ","transliteration":"sabaqa","translation_bn":"যা পূর্ব হতে নির্ধারিত হয়ে আছে","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَبَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58801,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَمَسَّكُمْ","transliteration":"lamassakum","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই তোমাদেরকে স্পর্শ করতো","root":"مسس","lemma":"مَسَّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":58802,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيمَآ","transliteration":"fīmā","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে যা","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58803,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَخَذْتُمْ","transliteration":"akhadhtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা গ্রহণ করেছো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58804,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58805,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmun","translation_bn":"কঠিন","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":58806,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lawlā kitābun mina l-lahi sabaqa lamassakum fīmā akhadhtum ʿadhābun ʿaẓīmun', 'আল্লাহর লেখন যদি পূর্বেই লেখা না হত তাহলে তোমরা যা (মুক্তিপণ হিসেবে) গ্রহণ করেছ তজ্জন্য তোমাদের উপর মহাশাস্তি পতিত হত।', 'If not for a decree from Allah that preceded, you would have been touched for what you took by a great punishment.', 'আল্লাহর লেখন যদি পূর্বেই লেখা না হত তাহলে তোমরা যা (মুক্তিপণ হিসেবে) গ্রহণ করেছ তজ্জন্য তোমাদের উপর মহাশাস্তি পতিত হত।', 'If not for a decree from Allah that preceded, you would have been touched for what you took by a great punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008068.mp3', now()),
  (8, 69, '', '[{"id":59017,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَكُلُوا۟","transliteration":"fakulū","translation_bn":"অতএব তোমরা খাও","root":"اكل","lemma":"أَكَلَ","grammar_bn":"কারণবাচক (Cause)"},{"id":59018,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"(তা) হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59019,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"غَنِمْتُمْ","transliteration":"ghanim''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা গণীমত পেয়েছো","root":"غنم","lemma":"غَنِمْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59020,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَلَـٰلًۭا","transliteration":"ḥalālan","translation_bn":"হালাল","root":"حلل","lemma":"حَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59021,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"طَيِّبًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ṭayyiban","translation_bn":"পবিত্র (হিসেবে)","root":"طيب","lemma":"طَيِّب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":59023,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱتَّقُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ittaqū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59024,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59026,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":59027,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59028,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59029,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":59030,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٦٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fakulū mimmā ghanim''tum ḥalālan ṭayyiban wa-ittaqū l-laha inna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'এক্ষণে, যুদ্ধে গানীমাত হিসেবে যা তোমরা লাভ করেছ তা ভোগ কর, তা বৈধ ও পবিত্র। আল্লাহকে ভয় করে চলো, নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'So consume what you have taken of war booty [as being] lawful and good, and fear Allah. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'এক্ষণে, যুদ্ধে গানীমাত হিসেবে যা তোমরা লাভ করেছ তা ভোগ কর, তা বৈধ ও পবিত্র। আল্লাহকে ভয় করে চলো, নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'So consume what you have taken of war booty [as being] lawful and good, and fear Allah. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008069.mp3', now()),
  (8, 70, '', '[{"id":59697,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":59698,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّبِىُّ","transliteration":"l-nabiyu","translation_bn":"নাবী","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَّبِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59699,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59700,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَن","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে (তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59701,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِىٓ","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59702,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَيْدِيكُم","transliteration":"aydīkum","translation_bn":"হাতে তোমাদের","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59703,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59704,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَسْرَىٰٓ","transliteration":"l-asrā","translation_bn":"বন্দিদের","root":"اسر","lemma":"أَسِير","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":59705,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":59706,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمِ","transliteration":"yaʿlami","translation_bn":"জানেন (দেখেন)","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59707,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":59708,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59709,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِكُمْ","transliteration":"qulūbikum","translation_bn":"অন্তরের তোমাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59710,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"কোনো কল্যাণ","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59711,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْتِكُمْ","transliteration":"yu''tikum","translation_bn":"তিনি দিবেন তোমাদের","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59712,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرًۭا","transliteration":"khayran","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59713,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّآ","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"(তা) হতেও যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59714,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أُخِذَ","transliteration":"ukhidha","translation_bn":"নেয়া হয়েছে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":59715,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"থেকে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59716,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَيَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"wayaghfir","translation_bn":"ও ক্ষমা করবেন","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59717,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۗ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":59719,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":59720,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":59721,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু\"","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":59722,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"٧٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭০)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nabiyu qul liman fī aydīkum mina l-asrā in yaʿlami l-lahu fī qulūbikum khayran yu''tikum khayran mimmā ukhidha minkum wayaghfir lakum wal-lahu ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'হে নাবী! তোমাদের হাতে যে সব যুদ্ধবন্দী আছে তাদেরকে বল, ‘আল্লাহ যদি তোমাদের অন্তরে ভাল কিছু দেখেন তাহলে তোমাদের কাছ থেকে (মুক্তিপণ) যা নেয়া হয়েছে তাত্থেকে উত্তম কিছু তোমাদেরকে তিনি দান করবেন আর তোমাদেরকে ক্ষমা করে দেবেন। আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।’', 'O Prophet, say to whoever is in your hands of the captives, "If Allah knows [any] good in your hearts, He will give you [something] better than what was taken from you, and He will forgive you; and Allah is Forgiving and Merciful."', 'হে নাবী! তোমাদের হাতে যে সব যুদ্ধবন্দী আছে তাদেরকে বল, ‘আল্লাহ যদি তোমাদের অন্তরে ভাল কিছু দেখেন তাহলে তোমাদের কাছ থেকে (মুক্তিপণ) যা নেয়া হয়েছে তাত্থেকে উত্তম কিছু তোমাদেরকে তিনি দান করবেন আর তোমাদেরকে ক্ষমা করে দেবেন। আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।’', 'O Prophet, say to whoever is in your hands of the captives, "If Allah knows [any] good in your hearts, He will give you [something] better than what was taken from you, and He will forgive you; and Allah is Forgiving and Merciful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008070.mp3', now()),
  (8, 71, '', '[{"id":60194,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60195,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُوا۟","transliteration":"yurīdū","translation_bn":"তারা চায়","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60196,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"خِيَانَتَكَ","transliteration":"khiyānataka","translation_bn":"তোমার সাথে বিশ্বাসভঙ্গ করতে","root":"خون","lemma":"خِيَانَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60197,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":60198,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"خَانُوا۟","transliteration":"khānū","translation_bn":"তারা বিশ্বাসভঙ্গ করেছে","root":"خون","lemma":"خَانُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60199,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর সাথে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":60200,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60201,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60202,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَأَمْكَنَ","transliteration":"fa-amkana","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শক্তিশালী করে দিয়েছেন","root":"مكن","lemma":"أَمْكَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60203,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের  (তোমাদেরকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60205,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60206,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60207,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":60208,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٧١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭১)","root":"—","lemma":"٧١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in yurīdū khiyānataka faqad khānū l-laha min qablu fa-amkana min''hum wal-lahu ʿalīmun ḥakīmun', 'আর যদি তারা তোমার সাথে খিয়ানাত করার ইচ্ছে করে (তবে সেটা অসম্ভব কিছু নয়, কারণ এর থেকেও গুরুতর যে) তারা পূর্বে আল্লাহর সাথে খিয়ানাত করেছে, কাজেই আল্লাহ তাদেরকে তোমার অধীন করে দিয়েছেন। আল্লাহ সর্ববিষয়ে বিশেষভাবে অবগত, সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ প্রজ্ঞাবান।', 'But if they intend to betray you - then they have already betrayed Allah before, and He empowered [you] over them. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', 'আর যদি তারা তোমার সাথে খিয়ানাত করার ইচ্ছে করে (তবে সেটা অসম্ভব কিছু নয়, কারণ এর থেকেও গুরুতর যে) তারা পূর্বে আল্লাহর সাথে খিয়ানাত করেছে, কাজেই আল্লাহ তাদেরকে তোমার অধীন করে দিয়েছেন। আল্লাহ সর্ববিষয়ে বিশেষভাবে অবগত, সর্বশ্রেষ্ঠ প্রজ্ঞাবান।', 'But if they intend to betray you - then they have already betrayed Allah before, and He empowered [you] over them. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008071.mp3', now()),
