mar_bn":"ফলাফল পদ (Result)"},{"id":60503,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّصْرُ","transliteration":"l-naṣru","translation_bn":"সাহায্য করা","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60504,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"ব্যাখ্যামূলক (Explanation)"},{"id":60505,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60506,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٍۭ","transliteration":"qawmin","translation_bn":"কোনো জাতির","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60507,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَكُمْ","transliteration":"baynakum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তোমাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":60508,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَهُم","transliteration":"wabaynahum","translation_bn":"ও মাঝে তাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":60509,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"مِّيثَـٰقٌۭ ۗ","transliteration":"mīthāqun","translation_bn":"সন্ধিচুক্তি (থাকে)","root":"وثق","lemma":"مِّيثَٰق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60511,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":60512,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ সম্বন্ধে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":60513,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":60514,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"بَصِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"baṣīrun","translation_bn":"খুব ভালো করে দেখছেন","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":60515,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"٧٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭২)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna alladhīna āmanū wahājarū wajāhadū bi-amwālihim wa-anfusihim fī sabīli l-lahi wa-alladhīna āwaw wanaṣarū ulāika baʿḍuhum awliyāu baʿḍin wa-alladhīna āmanū walam yuhājirū mā lakum min walāyatihim min shayin ḥattā yuhājirū wa-ini is''tanṣarūkum fī l-dīni faʿalaykumu l-naṣru illā ʿalā qawmin baynakum wabaynahum mīthāqun wal-lahu bimā taʿmalūna baṣīrun', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে, হিজরাত করেছে, নিজেদের মাল দিয়ে জান দিয়ে আল্লাহর রাস্তায় জিহাদ করেছে আর যারা তাদেরকে আশ্রয় দিয়েছে, সাহায্য করেছে, এরা পরস্পর পরস্পরের বন্ধু। আর যারা ঈমান এনেছে কিন্তু হিজরাত করেনি তারা হিজরাত না করা পর্যন্ত তাদের পৃষ্ঠপোষকতা করার কোন দায়-দায়িত্ব তোমার উপর নেই, তবে তারা যদি দ্বীনের ব্যাপারে তোমাদের সাহায্য চায় তাহলে তাদেরকে সাহায্য করা তোমাদের কর্তব্য, তবে তাদের বিরুদ্ধে নয় যাদের সঙ্গে তোমাদের মৈত্রী চুক্তি রয়েছে। তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ তা দেখেন।', 'Indeed, those who have believed and emigrated and fought with their wealth and lives in the cause of Allah and those who gave shelter and aided - they are allies of one another. But those who believed and did not emigrate - for you there is no guardianship of them until they emigrate. And if they seek help of you for the religion, then you must help, except against a people between yourselves and whom is a treaty. And Allah is Seeing of what you do.', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে, হিজরাত করেছে, নিজেদের মাল দিয়ে জান দিয়ে আল্লাহর রাস্তায় জিহাদ করেছে আর যারা তাদেরকে আশ্রয় দিয়েছে, সাহায্য করেছে, এরা পরস্পর পরস্পরের বন্ধু। আর যারা ঈমান এনেছে কিন্তু হিজরাত করেনি তারা হিজরাত না করা পর্যন্ত তাদের পৃষ্ঠপোষকতা করার কোন দায়-দায়িত্ব তোমার উপর নেই, তবে তারা যদি দ্বীনের ব্যাপারে তোমাদের সাহায্য চায় তাহলে তাদেরকে সাহায্য করা তোমাদের কর্তব্য, তবে তাদের বিরুদ্ধে নয় যাদের সঙ্গে তোমাদের মৈত্রী চুক্তি রয়েছে। তোমরা যা কর আল্লাহ তা দেখেন।', 'Indeed, those who have believed and emigrated and fought with their wealth and lives in the cause of Allah and those who gave shelter and aided - they are allies of one another. But those who believed and did not emigrate - for you there is no guardianship of them until they emigrate. And if they seek help of you for the religion, then you must help, except against a people between yourselves and whom is a treaty. And Allah is Seeing of what you do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008072.mp3', now()),
  (8, 73, '', '[{"id":61081,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61082,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61083,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُهُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","translation_bn":"একে তারা","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61084,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلِيَآءُ","transliteration":"awliyāu","translation_bn":"বন্ধু","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61085,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضٍ ۚ","transliteration":"baʿḍin","translation_bn":"অপরের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61087,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"যদি না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":61088,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَفْعَلُوهُ","transliteration":"tafʿalūhu","translation_bn":"তোমরা করো তা","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61089,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَكُن","transliteration":"takun","translation_bn":"(তবে) হবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61090,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فِتْنَةٌۭ","transliteration":"fit''natun","translation_bn":"ফিতনা","root":"فتن","lemma":"فِتْنَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61091,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61092,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61093,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَفَسَادٌۭ","transliteration":"wafasādun","translation_bn":"ও বিপর্যয়","root":"فسد","lemma":"فَسَاد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61094,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَبِيرٌۭ","transliteration":"kabīrun","translation_bn":"বড়","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61095,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٧٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna kafarū baʿḍuhum awliyāu baʿḍin illā tafʿalūhu takun fit''natun fī l-arḍi wafasādun kabīrun', 'আর যারা কুফরী করে তারা একে অপরের বন্ধু। যদি তোমরা তা না কর (অর্থাৎ তোমরা পরস্পর পরস্পরের সাহায্যে এগিয়ে না আস) তাহলে দুনিয়াতে ফিতনা ও মহাবিপর্যয় দেখা দিবে।', 'And those who disbelieved are allies of one another. If you do not do so, there will be fitnah on earth and great corruption.', 'আর যারা কুফরী করে তারা একে অপরের বন্ধু। যদি তোমরা তা না কর (অর্থাৎ তোমরা পরস্পর পরস্পরের সাহায্যে এগিয়ে না আস) তাহলে দুনিয়াতে ফিতনা ও মহাবিপর্যয় দেখা দিবে।', 'And those who disbelieved are allies of one another. If you do not do so, there will be fitnah on earth and great corruption.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008073.mp3', now()),
  (8, 74, '', '[{"id":61497,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61498,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61499,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَهَاجَرُوا۟","transliteration":"wahājarū","translation_bn":"ও হিজরত করেছে","root":"هجر","lemma":"هَاجَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61500,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَجَـٰهَدُوا۟","transliteration":"wajāhadū","translation_bn":"ও জিহাদ করেছে","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61501,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61502,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61503,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61504,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61505,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ءَاوَوا۟","transliteration":"āwaw","translation_bn":"আশ্রয় দিয়েছে","root":"اوي","lemma":"ءَاوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61506,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَّنَصَرُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wanaṣarū","translation_bn":"ও সাহায্য করেছে","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61507,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":61508,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":61509,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minūna","translation_bn":"মু''মিন","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61510,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حَقًّۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ḥaqqan","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61512,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61513,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَّغْفِرَةٌۭ","transliteration":"maghfiratun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা","root":"غفر","lemma":"مَّغْفِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61514,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَرِزْقٌۭ","transliteration":"wariz''qun","translation_bn":"ও জীবিকা","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61515,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَرِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"karīmun","translation_bn":"সম্মানজনক","root":"كرم","lemma":"كَرِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61516,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna āmanū wahājarū wajāhadū fī sabīli l-lahi wa-alladhīna āwaw wanaṣarū ulāika humu l-mu''minūna ḥaqqan lahum maghfiratun wariz''qun karīmun', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে, হিজরাত করেছে, আল্লাহর রাস্তায় জিহাদ করেছে আর যারা তাদেরকে আশ্রয় দিয়েছে, সাহায্য-সহযোগিতা করেছে- তারাই প্রকৃত ঈমানদার। তাদের জন্য আছে ক্ষমা আর সম্মানজনক জীবিকা।', 'But those who have believed and emigrated and fought in the cause of Allah and those who gave shelter and aided - it is they who are the believers, truly. For them is forgiveness and noble provision.', 'যারা ঈমান এনেছে, হিজরাত করেছে, আল্লাহর রাস্তায় জিহাদ করেছে আর যারা তাদেরকে আশ্রয় দিয়েছে, সাহায্য-সহযোগিতা করেছে- তারাই প্রকৃত ঈমানদার। তাদের জন্য আছে ক্ষমা আর সম্মানজনক জীবিকা।', 'But those who have believed and emigrated and fought in the cause of Allah and those who gave shelter and aided - it is they who are the believers, truly. For them is forgiveness and noble provision.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008074.mp3', now()),
  (8, 75, '', '[{"id":61959,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61960,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":61961,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61962,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدُ","transliteration":"baʿdu","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61963,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَهَاجَرُوا۟","transliteration":"wahājarū","translation_bn":"এবং হিজরত করেছে","root":"هجر","lemma":"هَاجَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61964,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَجَـٰهَدُوا۟","transliteration":"wajāhadū","translation_bn":"ও জিহাদ করেছে","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61965,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَعَكُمْ","transliteration":"maʿakum","translation_bn":"সাথে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":61966,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"fa-ulāika","translation_bn":"তবে ঐসবলোকও","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"সম্পূরক পদ (Supplemental)"},{"id":61967,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِنكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"minkum","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61969,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَأُو۟لُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-ulū","translation_bn":"এবং সম্পন্নরা","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61970,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْحَامِ","transliteration":"l-arḥāmi","translation_bn":"গর্ভ","root":"رحم","lemma":"أَرْحَام","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61971,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُهُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","translation_bn":"একে তাদের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61972,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَوْلَىٰ","transliteration":"awlā","translation_bn":"অধিক অধিকারী","root":"ولي","lemma":"أَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61973,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِبَعْضٍۢ","transliteration":"bibaʿḍin","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে অপরের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61974,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"অনুযায়ী","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61975,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"kitābi","translation_bn":"বিধান","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61976,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61978,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":61979,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":61980,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِكُلِّ","transliteration":"bikulli","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সব","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61981,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"شَىْءٍ","transliteration":"shayin","translation_bn":"কিছুরই","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61982,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۢ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61983,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna āmanū min baʿdu wahājarū wajāhadū maʿakum fa-ulāika minkum wa-ulū l-arḥāmi baʿḍuhum awlā bibaʿḍin fī kitābi l-lahi inna l-laha bikulli shayin ʿalīmun', 'যারা পরে ঈমান এনেছে, হিজরাত করেছে আর তোমাদের সাথে মিলিত হয়ে জিহাদ করেছে, এসব লোক তোমাদেরই মধ্যে গণ্য। কিন্তু আল্লাহর বিধানে রক্ত সম্পর্কীয়গণ পরস্পর পরস্পরের নিকট অগ্রগণ্য। আল্লাহ সকল বিষয়ে সবচেয়ে বেশী অবগত।', 'And those who believed after [the initial emigration] and emigrated and fought with you - they are of you. But those of [blood] relationship are more entitled [to inheritance] in the decree of Allah. Indeed, Allah is Knowing of all things.', 'যারা পরে ঈমান এনেছে, হিজরাত করেছে আর তোমাদের সাথে মিলিত হয়ে জিহাদ করেছে, এসব লোক তোমাদেরই মধ্যে গণ্য। কিন্তু আল্লাহর বিধানে রক্ত সম্পর্কীয়গণ পরস্পর পরস্পরের নিকট অগ্রগণ্য। আল্লাহ সকল বিষয়ে সবচেয়ে বেশী অবগত।', 'And those who believed after [the initial emigration] and emigrated and fought with you - they are of you. But those of [blood] relationship are more entitled [to inheritance] in the decree of Allah. Indeed, Allah is Knowing of all things.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/008075.mp3', now())
