"lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26938,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِهِۦ","transliteration":"sabīlihi","translation_bn":"পথের তাঁর","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":26939,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"فَتَرَبَّصُوا۟","transliteration":"fatarabbaṣū","translation_bn":"তবে তোমরা অপেক্ষা করো","root":"ربص","lemma":"تَرَبَّصْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26940,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26941,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِىَ","transliteration":"yatiya","translation_bn":"আসেন","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26942,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":26943,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْرِهِۦ ۗ","transliteration":"bi-amrihi","translation_bn":"নিয়ে তাঁর নির্দেশ","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26945,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":26946,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":26947,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"পথে দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26948,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-qawma","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26949,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","transliteration":"l-fāsiqīna","translation_bn":"(যারা) সত্যত্যাগী\"","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26950,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul in kāna ābāukum wa-abnāukum wa-ikh''wānukum wa-azwājukum waʿashīratukum wa-amwālun iq''taraftumūhā watijāratun takhshawna kasādahā wamasākinu tarḍawnahā aḥabba ilaykum mina l-lahi warasūlihi wajihādin fī sabīlihi fatarabbaṣū ḥattā yatiya l-lahu bi-amrihi wal-lahu lā yahdī l-qawma l-fāsiqīna', 'বল, ‘যদি তোমাদের পিতারা, আর তোমাদের সন্তানেরা, আর তোমাদের ভাইয়েরা, আর তোমাদের স্ত্রীরা, আর তোমাদের গোষ্ঠীর লোকেরা আর ধন-সম্পদ যা তোমরা অর্জন করেছ, আর ব্যবসা তোমরা যার মন্দার ভয় কর, আর বাসস্থান যা তোমরা ভালবাস (এসব) যদি তোমাদের নিকট প্রিয়তর হয় আল্লাহ, তাঁর রসূল ও তাঁর পথে জিহাদ করা হতে, তাহলে অপেক্ষা কর যতক্ষণ না আল্লাহ তাঁর চূড়ান্ত ফয়সালা তোমাদের কাছে নিয়ে আসেন।’ আর আল্লাহ অবাধ্য আচরণকারীদেরকে সঠিক পথ প্রদর্শন করেন না।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "If your fathers, your sons, your brothers, your wives, your relatives, wealth which you have obtained, commerce wherein you fear decline, and dwellings with which you are pleased are more beloved to you than Allah and His Messenger and jihad in His cause, then wait until Allah executes His command. And Allah does not guide the defiantly disobedient people."', 'বল, ‘যদি তোমাদের পিতারা, আর তোমাদের সন্তানেরা, আর তোমাদের ভাইয়েরা, আর তোমাদের স্ত্রীরা, আর তোমাদের গোষ্ঠীর লোকেরা আর ধন-সম্পদ যা তোমরা অর্জন করেছ, আর ব্যবসা তোমরা যার মন্দার ভয় কর, আর বাসস্থান যা তোমরা ভালবাস (এসব) যদি তোমাদের নিকট প্রিয়তর হয় আল্লাহ, তাঁর রসূল ও তাঁর পথে জিহাদ করা হতে, তাহলে অপেক্ষা কর যতক্ষণ না আল্লাহ তাঁর চূড়ান্ত ফয়সালা তোমাদের কাছে নিয়ে আসেন।’ আর আল্লাহ অবাধ্য আচরণকারীদেরকে সঠিক পথ প্রদর্শন করেন না।', 'Say, [O Muhammad], "If your fathers, your sons, your brothers, your wives, your relatives, wealth which you have obtained, commerce wherein you fear decline, and dwellings with which you are pleased are more beloved to you than Allah and His Messenger and jihad in His cause, then wait until Allah executes His command. And Allah does not guide the defiantly disobedient people."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009024.mp3', now()),
  (9, 25, '', '[{"id":28069,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":28070,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَصَرَكُمُ","transliteration":"naṣarakumu","translation_bn":"সাহায্য করেছেন তোমাদের","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28071,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28072,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28073,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَوَاطِنَ","transliteration":"mawāṭina","translation_bn":"জায়গায়","root":"وطن","lemma":"مَوَاطِن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28074,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرَةٍۢ ۙ","transliteration":"kathīratin","translation_bn":"অনেক","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِيرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":28076,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"ও দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28077,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حُنَيْنٍ ۙ","transliteration":"ḥunaynin","translation_bn":"হুনায়নের (যুদ্ধে)","root":"—","lemma":"حُنَيْن","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28079,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِذْ","transliteration":"idh","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذ\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":28080,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَعْجَبَتْكُمْ","transliteration":"aʿjabatkum","translation_bn":"উৎফুল্ল করেছিলো তোমাদের","root":"عجب","lemma":"أَعْجَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28081,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَثْرَتُكُمْ","transliteration":"kathratukum","translation_bn":"সংখ্যাধিক্য তোমাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثْرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28082,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمْ","transliteration":"falam","translation_bn":"অতঃপর নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28083,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تُغْنِ","transliteration":"tugh''ni","translation_bn":"কাজে আসে","root":"غني","lemma":"أَغْنَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28084,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَنكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿankum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28085,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্র (সংখ্যাধিক্য)","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28086,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَضَاقَتْ","transliteration":"waḍāqat","translation_bn":"এবং সংকীর্ণ হয়েছিলো","root":"ضيق","lemma":"ضَاقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28087,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمُ","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28088,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضُ","transliteration":"l-arḍu","translation_bn":"পৃথিবী","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28089,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ সত্ত্বেও যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28090,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"رَحُبَتْ","transliteration":"raḥubat","translation_bn":"প্রশস্ত ছিলো","root":"رحب","lemma":"رَحُبَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28091,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28092,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَلَّيْتُم","transliteration":"wallaytum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ফিরে গেলে","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28093,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مُّدْبِرِينَ","transliteration":"mud''birīna","translation_bn":"পিঠ প্রদর্শনকারী হয়ে","root":"دبر","lemma":"مُدْبِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28094,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad naṣarakumu l-lahu fī mawāṭina kathīratin wayawma ḥunaynin idh aʿjabatkum kathratukum falam tugh''ni ʿankum shayan waḍāqat ʿalaykumu l-arḍu bimā raḥubat thumma wallaytum mud''birīna', 'বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে বহু যুদ্ধ ক্ষেত্রে সাহায্য করেছেন আর হুনায়নের যুদ্ধের দিন, তোমাদের সংখ্যার আধিক্য তোমাদেরকে গর্বে মাতোয়ারা করে দিয়েছিল, কিন্তু তা তোমাদের কোন কাজে আসেনি, যমীন সুপ্রশস্ত হওয়া সত্বেও তা তোমাদের নিকট সংকীর্ণই হয়ে গিয়েছিল, আর তোমরা পিছন ফিরে পালিয়ে গিয়েছিলে।', 'Allah has already given you victory in many regions and [even] on the day of Hunayn, when your great number pleased you, but it did not avail you at all, and the earth was confining for you with its vastness; then you turned back, fleeing.', 'বস্তুতঃ আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে বহু যুদ্ধ ক্ষেত্রে সাহায্য করেছেন আর হুনায়নের যুদ্ধের দিন, তোমাদের সংখ্যার আধিক্য তোমাদেরকে গর্বে মাতোয়ারা করে দিয়েছিল, কিন্তু তা তোমাদের কোন কাজে আসেনি, যমীন সুপ্রশস্ত হওয়া সত্বেও তা তোমাদের নিকট সংকীর্ণই হয়ে গিয়েছিল, আর তোমরা পিছন ফিরে পালিয়ে গিয়েছিলে।', 'Allah has already given you victory in many regions and [even] on the day of Hunayn, when your great number pleased you, but it did not avail you at all, and the earth was confining for you with its vastness; then you turned back, fleeing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009025.mp3', now()),
  (9, 26, '', '[{"id":28970,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28971,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করলেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28972,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":28973,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سَكِينَتَهُۥ","transliteration":"sakīnatahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর প্রশান্তি","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكِينَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28974,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":28975,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولِهِۦ","transliteration":"rasūlihi","translation_bn":"তাঁর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28976,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَعَلَى","transliteration":"waʿalā","translation_bn":"ও উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28977,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28978,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنزَلَ","transliteration":"wa-anzala","translation_bn":"ও অবতীর্ণ করলেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28979,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"جُنُودًۭا","transliteration":"junūdan","translation_bn":"(এমন) বাহিনী","root":"جند","lemma":"جُند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28980,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":28981,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"تَرَوْهَا","transliteration":"tarawhā","translation_bn":"তা তোমরা দেখতে পাও","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28982,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَعَذَّبَ","transliteration":"waʿadhaba","translation_bn":"ও শাস্তি দিলেন","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28983,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদেরকে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":28984,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছিলো","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":28986,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"wadhālika","translation_bn":"ও এটা (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":28987,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآءُ","transliteration":"jazāu","translation_bn":"কর্মফল","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":28988,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَـٰفِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-kāfirīna","translation_bn":"কাফেরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":28989,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma anzala l-lahu sakīnatahu ʿalā rasūlihi waʿalā l-mu''minīna wa-anzala junūdan lam tarawhā waʿadhaba alladhīna kafarū wadhālika jazāu l-kāfirīna', 'তারপর আল্লাহ তাঁর রসূলের উপর, আর মু’মিনদের উপর তাঁর প্রশান্তির অমিয়ধারা বর্ষণ করলেন, আর পাঠালেন এমন এক সেনাবাহিনী যা তোমরা দেখতে পাওনি, আর তিনি কাফিরদেরকে শাস্তি প্রদান করলেন। এভাবেই আল্লাহ কাফিরদেরকে প্রতিফল দিয়ে থাকেন।', 'Then Allah sent down His tranquillity upon His Messenger and upon the believers and sent down soldiers angels whom you did not see and punished those who disbelieved. And that is the recompense of the disbelievers.', 'তারপর আল্লাহ তাঁর রসূলের উপর, আর মু’মিনদের উপর তাঁর প্রশান্তির অমিয়ধারা বর্ষণ করলেন, আর পাঠালেন এমন এক সেনাবাহিনী যা তোমরা দেখতে পাওনি, আর তিনি কাফিরদেরকে শাস্তি প্রদান করলেন। এভাবেই আল্লাহ কাফিরদেরকে প্রতিফল দিয়ে থাকেন।', 'Then Allah sent down His tranquillity upon His Messenger and upon the believers and sent down soldiers angels whom you did not see and punished those who disbelieved. And that is the recompense of the disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009026.mp3', now()),
  (9, 27, '', '[{"id":29745,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"অতঃপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29746,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَتُوبُ","transliteration":"yatūbu","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাপরায়ণ হলেন","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29747,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29748,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنۢ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকেও","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29749,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدِ","transliteration":"baʿdi","translation_bn":"পর","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29750,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":29751,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(তারা) প্রতি","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29752,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":29753,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ ۗ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29755,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29756,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":29757,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":29758,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma yatūbu l-lahu min baʿdi dhālika ʿalā man yashāu wal-lahu ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'এরপরও আল্লাহ যার জন্য ইচ্ছে করবেন তাকে ক্ষমার দৃষ্টিতে দেখবেন, আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'Then Allah will accept repentance after that for whom He wills; and Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'এরপরও আল্লাহ যার জন্য ইচ্ছে করবেন তাকে ক্ষমার দৃষ্টিতে দেখবেন, আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'Then Allah will accept repentance after that for whom He wills; and Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009027.mp3', now()),
  (9, 28, '', '[{"id":30819,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":30820,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":30821,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30822,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"মূলতঃ","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":30823,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُشْرِكُونَ","transliteration":"l-mush''rikūna","translation_bn":"মুশরিকরা","root":"شرك","lemma":"مُشْرِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30824,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"نَجَسٌۭ","transliteration":"najasun","translation_bn":"অপবিত্র","root":"نجس","lemma":"نَجَس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30825,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতএব না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30826,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَقْرَبُوا۟","transliteration":"yaqrabū","translation_bn":"তারা নিকটবর্তী হবে","root":"قرب","lemma":"يَقْرَبُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30827,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَسْجِدَ","transliteration":"l-masjida","translation_bn":"মাসজিদে","root":"سجد","lemma":"مَسْجِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30828,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرَامَ","transliteration":"l-ḥarāma","translation_bn":"হারামের","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَام","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30829,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":30830,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَامِهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿāmihim","translation_bn":"বছরের তাদের","root":"عوم","lemma":"عَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30831,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا ۚ","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":30833,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنْ","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":30834,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"خِفْتُمْ","transliteration":"khif''tum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ভয় করো","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30835,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَيْلَةًۭ","transliteration":"ʿaylatan","translation_bn":"দারিদ্র্যের","root":"عيل","lemma":"عَيْلَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30836,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَسَوْفَ","transliteration":"fasawfa","translation_bn":"তবে শীঘ্রই","root":"—","lemma":"سَوْف\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":30837,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يُغْنِيكُمُ","transliteration":"yugh''nīkumu","translation_bn":"অভাবমুক্ত করবেন তোমাদের","root":"غني","lemma":"أَغْنَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30838,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30839,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":30840,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ তাঁর","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":30841,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":30842,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ ۚ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"তিনি ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":30844,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":30845,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":30846,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সর্বজ্ঞ","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30847,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"মহাবিজ্ঞ","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":30848,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū innamā l-mush''rikūna najasun falā yaqrabū l-masjida l-ḥarāma baʿda ʿāmihim hādhā wa-in khif''tum ʿaylatan fasawfa yugh''nīkumu l-lahu min faḍlihi in shāa inna l-laha ʿalīmun ḥakīmun', 'ওহে বিশ্বাসীগণ! মুশরিকরা হল অপবিত্র, কাজেই এ বছরের পর তারা যেন মাসজিদে হারামের নিকট না আসে। তোমরা যদি দরিদ্রতার ভয় কর, তবে আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে অচিরেই তাঁর অনুগ্রহের মাধ্যমে তোমাদেরকে অভাব-মুক্ত করে দেবেন। নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, মহাবিজ্ঞানী।', 'O you who have believed, indeed the polytheists are unclean, so let them not approach al-Masjid al-Haram after this, their [final] year. And if you fear privation, Allah will enrich you from His bounty if He wills. Indeed, Allah is Knowing and Wise.', 'ওহে বিশ্বাসীগণ! মুশরিকরা হল অপবিত্র, কাজেই এ বছরের পর তারা যেন মাসজিদে হারামের নিকট না আসে। তোমরা যদি দরিদ্রতার ভয় কর, তবে আল্লাহ ইচ্ছে করলে অচিরেই তাঁর অনুগ্রহের মাধ্যমে তোমাদেরকে অভাব-মুক্ত করে দেবেন। নিশ্চয়ই আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, মহাবিজ্ঞানী।', 'O you who have believed, indeed the polytheists are unclean, so let them not approach al-Masjid al-Haram after this, their [final] year. And if you fear privation, Allah will enrich you from His bounty if He wills. Indeed, Allah is Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009028.mp3', now()),
  (9, 29, '', '[{"id":31875,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَـٰتِلُوا۟","transliteration":"qātilū","translation_bn":"তোমরা যুদ্ধ করো","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَٰتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31876,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের বিরুদ্ধে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":31877,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":31878,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31879,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"উপর আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31880,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31881,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْيَوْمِ","transliteration":"bil-yawmi","translation_bn":"উপর দিনের","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31882,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","translation_bn":"আখেরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31883,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31884,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُحَرِّمُونَ","transliteration":"yuḥarrimūna","translation_bn":"নিষিদ্ধ করে","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31885,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":31886,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَرَّمَ","transliteration":"ḥarrama","translation_bn":"নিষিদ্ধ করেছেন","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَّمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31887,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":31888,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولُهُۥ","transliteration":"warasūluhu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31889,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31890,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَدِينُونَ","transliteration":"yadīnūna","translation_bn":"আনুগত্য করে","root":"دين","lemma":"يَدِينُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31891,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"دِينَ","transliteration":"dīna","translation_bn":"দ্বীনের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31892,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্যকে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31893,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31894,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদেরকে","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":31895,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أُوتُوا۟","transliteration":"ūtū","translation_bn":"দেয়া হয়েছে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31896,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","transliteration":"l-kitāba","translation_bn":"কিতাব","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31897,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"حَتَّىٰ","transliteration":"ḥattā","translation_bn":"যতক্ষণ না","root":"—","lemma":"حَتَّىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31898,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"يُعْطُوا۟","transliteration":"yuʿ''ṭū","translation_bn":"তারা দেয়","root":"عطو","lemma":"أَعْطَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31899,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجِزْيَةَ","transliteration":"l-jiz''yata","translation_bn":"(জিযিয়া) কর","root":"جزي","lemma":"جِزْيَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31900,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"عَن","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31901,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يَدٍۢ","transliteration":"yadin","translation_bn":"(নিজেদের) হাত","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31902,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":31903,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰغِرُونَ","transliteration":"ṣāghirūna","translation_bn":"ছোট (হয়ে থাকে)","root":"صغر","lemma":"صَٰغِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31904,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qātilū alladhīna lā yu''minūna bil-lahi walā bil-yawmi l-ākhiri walā yuḥarrimūna mā ḥarrama l-lahu warasūluhu walā yadīnūna dīna l-ḥaqi mina alladhīna ūtū l-kitāba ḥattā yuʿ''ṭū l-jiz''yata ʿan yadin wahum ṣāghirūna', 'যাদেরকে কিতাব দেয়া হয়েছে তাদের মধ্যে যারা আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান আনে না, আর শেষ দিনের প্রতিও না, আর আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূল যা হারাম করেছেন তাকে হারাম গণ্য করে না, আর সত্য দ্বীনকে নিজেদের দ্বীন হিসেবে গ্রহণ করে না তাদের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ কর যে পর্যন্ত না তারা বশ্যতা সহকারে স্বেচ্ছায় ট্যাক্স দেয়।', 'Fight those who do not believe in Allah or in the Last Day and who do not consider unlawful what Allah and His Messenger have made unlawful and who do not adopt the religion of truth from those who were given the Scripture - [fight] until they give the jizyah willingly while they are humbled.', 'যাদেরকে কিতাব দেয়া হয়েছে তাদের মধ্যে যারা আল্লাহর প্রতি ঈমান আনে না, আর শেষ দিনের প্রতিও না, আর আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূল যা হারাম করেছেন তাকে হারাম গণ্য করে না, আর সত্য দ্বীনকে নিজেদের দ্বীন হিসেবে গ্রহণ করে না তাদের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ কর যে পর্যন্ত না তারা বশ্যতা সহকারে স্বেচ্ছায় ট্যাক্স দেয়।', 'Fight those who do not believe in Allah or in the Last Day and who do not consider unlawful what Allah and His Messenger have made unlawful and who do not adopt the religion of truth from those who were given the Scripture - [fight] until they give the jizyah willingly while they are humbled.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009029.mp3', now()),
