يمًۭا","transliteration":"alīman","translation_bn":"অতি কষ্টদায়ক","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":61709,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61710,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61711,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۚ","transliteration":"wal-ākhirati","translation_bn":"ও আখেরাতে","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61713,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61714,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61715,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61716,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":61717,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":61718,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"وَلِىٍّۢ","transliteration":"waliyyin","translation_bn":"বন্ধু","root":"ولي","lemma":"وَلِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61719,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":61720,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"نَصِيرٍۢ","transliteration":"naṣīrin","translation_bn":"কোনো সাহায্যকারী","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":61721,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"٧٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yaḥlifūna bil-lahi mā qālū walaqad qālū kalimata l-kuf''ri wakafarū baʿda is''lāmihim wahammū bimā lam yanālū wamā naqamū illā an aghnāhumu l-lahu warasūluhu min faḍlihi fa-in yatūbū yaku khayran lahum wa-in yatawallaw yuʿadhib''humu l-lahu ʿadhāban alīman fī l-dun''yā wal-ākhirati wamā lahum fī l-arḍi min waliyyin walā naṣīrin', 'তারা আল্লাহর নামে শপথ করে বলে যে তারা (অন্যায়) কিছু বলেনি, কিন্তু তারা তো কুফরী কথা বলেছে আর ইসলাম গ্রহণ করার পরও কুফরী করেছে। তারা ষড়যন্ত্র করেছিল কিন্তু তাতে সফল হয়নি, তাদের এ প্রতিশোধ স্পৃহার কারণ এছাড়া আর কিছু ছিল না যে আল্লাহ করুণাবশতঃ ও তাঁর রসূল তাদেরকে সম্পদশালী করে দিয়েছেন। এখন যদি তারা অনুশোচনাভরে এ পথ থেকে ফিরে আসে তবে তা তাদের জন্যই কল্যাণকর। আর যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় তবে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দুনিয়া ও আখেরাতে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি দিবেন। পৃথিবীতে রক্ষক আর সাহায্যকারী হিসেবে কাউকে তারা পাবে না।', 'They swear by Allah that they did not say [anything against the Prophet] while they had said the word of disbelief and disbelieved after their [pretense of] Islam and planned that which they were not to attain. And they were not resentful except [for the fact] that Allah and His Messenger had enriched them of His bounty. So if they repent, it is better for them; but if they turn away, Allah will punish them with a painful punishment in this world and the Hereafter. And there will not be for them on earth any protector or helper.', 'তারা আল্লাহর নামে শপথ করে বলে যে তারা (অন্যায়) কিছু বলেনি, কিন্তু তারা তো কুফরী কথা বলেছে আর ইসলাম গ্রহণ করার পরও কুফরী করেছে। তারা ষড়যন্ত্র করেছিল কিন্তু তাতে সফল হয়নি, তাদের এ প্রতিশোধ স্পৃহার কারণ এছাড়া আর কিছু ছিল না যে আল্লাহ করুণাবশতঃ ও তাঁর রসূল তাদেরকে সম্পদশালী করে দিয়েছেন। এখন যদি তারা অনুশোচনাভরে এ পথ থেকে ফিরে আসে তবে তা তাদের জন্যই কল্যাণকর। আর যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় তবে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে দুনিয়া ও আখেরাতে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি দিবেন। পৃথিবীতে রক্ষক আর সাহায্যকারী হিসেবে কাউকে তারা পাবে না।', 'They swear by Allah that they did not say [anything against the Prophet] while they had said the word of disbelief and disbelieved after their [pretense of] Islam and planned that which they were not to attain. And they were not resentful except [for the fact] that Allah and His Messenger had enriched them of His bounty. So if they repent, it is better for them; but if they turn away, Allah will punish them with a painful punishment in this world and the Hereafter. And there will not be for them on earth any protector or helper.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009074.mp3', now()),
  (9, 75, '', '[{"id":62091,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"wamin''hum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62092,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَّنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":62093,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰهَدَ","transliteration":"ʿāhada","translation_bn":"অঙ্গীকার করেছিলো","root":"عهد","lemma":"عَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62094,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর কাছে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":62095,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَئِنْ","transliteration":"la-in","translation_bn":"\"অবশ্যই যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":62096,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَىٰنَا","transliteration":"ātānā","translation_bn":"আমাদের দেন (আল্লাহ)","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62097,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62098,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ তাঁর","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62099,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَنَصَّدَّقَنَّ","transliteration":"lanaṣṣaddaqanna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই আমরা সদকা করবোই","root":"صدق","lemma":"تَصَدَّقَ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":62100,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَنَكُونَنَّ","transliteration":"walanakūnanna","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই আমরা হবো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62101,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"অন্তর্ভুক্ত","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62102,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّـٰلِحِينَ","transliteration":"l-ṣāliḥīna","translation_bn":"সৎলোকদের\"","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62103,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamin''hum man ʿāhada l-laha la-in ātānā min faḍlihi lanaṣṣaddaqanna walanakūnanna mina l-ṣāliḥīna', 'তাদের মধ্যেকার কিছুলোক আল্লাহর সঙ্গে ওয়া‘দা করেছিল, ‘যদি তিনি আমাদেরকে তাঁর অনুগ্রহ হতে দান করেন তবে আমরা অবশ্যই দান করব আর অবশ্যই সৎ লোকদের মধ্যে শামিল থাকব।’', 'And among them are those who made a covenant with Allah, [saying], "If He should give us from His bounty, we will surely spend in charity, and we will surely be among the righteous."', 'তাদের মধ্যেকার কিছুলোক আল্লাহর সঙ্গে ওয়া‘দা করেছিল, ‘যদি তিনি আমাদেরকে তাঁর অনুগ্রহ হতে দান করেন তবে আমরা অবশ্যই দান করব আর অবশ্যই সৎ লোকদের মধ্যে শামিল থাকব।’', 'And among them are those who made a covenant with Allah, [saying], "If He should give us from His bounty, we will surely spend in charity, and we will surely be among the righteous."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009075.mp3', now()),
  (9, 76, '', '[{"id":62568,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّآ","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62569,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَاتَىٰهُم","transliteration":"ātāhum","translation_bn":"তিনি দান করলেন তাদেরকে","root":"اتي","lemma":"ا^تَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62570,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62571,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"faḍlihi","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহ তাঁর","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62572,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَخِلُوا۟","transliteration":"bakhilū","translation_bn":"তারা কৃপণতা করলো","root":"بخل","lemma":"بَخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62573,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সাথে তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62574,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَتَوَلَّوا۟","transliteration":"watawallaw","translation_bn":"ও তারা বিমুখ হলো","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62575,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَّهُم","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এমতাবস্হায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَّهُم","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":62576,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُّعْرِضُونَ","transliteration":"muʿ''riḍūna","translation_bn":"বিরুদ্ধভাবাপন্ন (হয়ে গেলো)","root":"عرض","lemma":"مُّعْرِضُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62577,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā ātāhum min faḍlihi bakhilū bihi watawallaw wahum muʿ''riḍūna', 'অতঃপর আল্লাহ যখন তাদেরকে স্বীয় করুণার দানে ধন্য করলেন, তখন তারা দান করার ব্যাপারে কার্পণ্য করল আর বে-পরোয়াভাবে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিল।', 'But when he gave them from His bounty, they were stingy with it and turned away while they refused.', 'অতঃপর আল্লাহ যখন তাদেরকে স্বীয় করুণার দানে ধন্য করলেন, তখন তারা দান করার ব্যাপারে কার্পণ্য করল আর বে-পরোয়াভাবে মুখ ফিরিয়ে নিল।', 'But when he gave them from His bounty, they were stingy with it and turned away while they refused.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009076.mp3', now()),
  (9, 77, '', '[{"id":63168,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَأَعْقَبَهُمْ","transliteration":"fa-aʿqabahum","translation_bn":"তাই তিনি সাজা দিলেন তাদেরকে","root":"عقب","lemma":"أَعْقَبَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63169,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نِفَاقًۭا","transliteration":"nifāqan","translation_bn":"মুনাফেকী (দিয়ে)","root":"نفق","lemma":"نِفَاق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63170,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63171,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"অন্তরে তাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63172,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"পর্যন্ত","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63173,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمِ","transliteration":"yawmi","translation_bn":"সেদিন করবে তারা","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63174,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ","transliteration":"yalqawnahu","translation_bn":"তাঁর সাথে সাক্ষাত","root":"لقي","lemma":"لَقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63175,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِمَآ","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"এ কারণে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63176,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَخْلَفُوا۟","transliteration":"akhlafū","translation_bn":"তারা ভঙ্গ করেছিলো","root":"خلف","lemma":"أَخْلَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63177,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর (সাথে)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63178,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":63179,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَعَدُوهُ","transliteration":"waʿadūhu","translation_bn":"তারা প্রতিশ্রুতি দিয়েছিলো তাঁকে","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63180,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَبِمَا","transliteration":"wabimā","translation_bn":"এবং এ কারণেও (সাজা পেলো) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63181,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63182,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَكْذِبُونَ","transliteration":"yakdhibūna","translation_bn":"তারা মিথ্যা বলতে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63183,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-aʿqabahum nifāqan fī qulūbihim ilā yawmi yalqawnahu bimā akhlafū l-laha mā waʿadūhu wabimā kānū yakdhibūna', 'পরিণামে আল্লাহর সঙ্গে কৃত তাদের ওয়াদা ভঙ্গের কারণে এবং মিথ্যাচারে লিপ্ত থাকার কারণে তাদের অন্তরে মুনাফিকী বদ্ধমূল করে দিলেন; ঐ দিন পর্যন্ত যেদিন তারা তাঁর সাথে সাক্ষাৎ করবে।', 'So He penalized them with hypocrisy in their hearts until the Day they will meet Him - because they failed Allah in what they promised Him and because they [habitually] used to lie.', 'পরিণামে আল্লাহর সঙ্গে কৃত তাদের ওয়াদা ভঙ্গের কারণে এবং মিথ্যাচারে লিপ্ত থাকার কারণে তাদের অন্তরে মুনাফিকী বদ্ধমূল করে দিলেন; ঐ দিন পর্যন্ত যেদিন তারা তাঁর সাথে সাক্ষাৎ করবে।', 'So He penalized them with hypocrisy in their hearts until the Day they will meet Him - because they failed Allah in what they promised Him and because they [habitually] used to lie.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009077.mp3', now()),
  (9, 78, '', '[{"id":63370,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":63371,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yaʿlamū","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63372,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":63373,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63374,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","translation_bn":"জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63375,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"سِرَّهُمْ","transliteration":"sirrahum","translation_bn":"তাদের গোপন (কথা)","root":"سرر","lemma":"سِرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63376,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَنَجْوَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"wanajwāhum","translation_bn":"ও তাদের গোপন পরামর্শ","root":"نجو","lemma":"نَجْوَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63377,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (তারা জানে না) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63378,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63379,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَّـٰمُ","transliteration":"ʿallāmu","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلَّٰم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":63380,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغُيُوبِ","transliteration":"l-ghuyūbi","translation_bn":"গোপন বিষয়গুলো","root":"غيب","lemma":"غُيُوب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63381,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam yaʿlamū anna l-laha yaʿlamu sirrahum wanajwāhum wa-anna l-laha ʿallāmu l-ghuyūbi', 'তারা কি জানে না যে, আল্লাহ তাদের গোপন কথাবার্তা আর গোপন পরামর্শ সম্পর্কে অবহিত আছেন আর আল্লাহ তো যাবতীয় অদৃশ্য সম্পর্কে সবচেয়ে বেশি অবগত আছেন।', 'Did they not know that Allah knows their secrets and their private conversations and that Allah is the Knower of the unseen?', 'তারা কি জানে না যে, আল্লাহ তাদের গোপন কথাবার্তা আর গোপন পরামর্শ সম্পর্কে অবহিত আছেন আর আল্লাহ তো যাবতীয় অদৃশ্য সম্পর্কে সবচেয়ে বেশি অবগত আছেন।', 'Did they not know that Allah knows their secrets and their private conversations and that Allah is the Knower of the unseen?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009078.mp3', now()),
  (9, 79, '', '[{"id":63788,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":63789,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَلْمِزُونَ","transliteration":"yalmizūna","translation_bn":"দোষারোপ করে","root":"لمز","lemma":"يَلْمِزُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63790,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُطَّوِّعِينَ","transliteration":"l-muṭawiʿīna","translation_bn":"স্বতঃস্ফুর্তভাবে দানকারীদেরকে","root":"طوع","lemma":"مُطَّوِّعِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63791,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63792,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63793,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63794,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّدَقَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣadaqāti","translation_bn":"দানের","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَقَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63795,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং (তাদেরকেও) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63796,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":63797,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَجِدُونَ","transliteration":"yajidūna","translation_bn":"পায় (কোনো কিছু দান করতে)","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63798,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":63799,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"جُهْدَهُمْ","transliteration":"juh''dahum","translation_bn":"শ্রম তাদের","root":"جهد","lemma":"جُهْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63800,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَيَسْخَرُونَ","transliteration":"fayaskharūna","translation_bn":"তাই তারা ঠাট্টা করে","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخِرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63801,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ ۙ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63803,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"سَخِرَ","transliteration":"sakhira","translation_bn":"ঠাট্টা করেন","root":"سخر","lemma":"سَخِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63804,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63805,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে তাদের (বিদ্রুপকারীদেরকে)","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63806,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَلَهُمْ","transliteration":"walahum","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63807,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63808,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":63809,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٧٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna yalmizūna l-muṭawiʿīna mina l-mu''minīna fī l-ṣadaqāti wa-alladhīna lā yajidūna illā juh''dahum fayaskharūna min''hum sakhira l-lahu min''hum walahum ʿadhābun alīmun', 'মু’মিনদের মধ্যে যারা মুক্ত হস্তে দান করে, তাদেরকে যারা দোষারোপ করে আর সীমাহীন কষ্টে দানকারীদেরকে যারা বিদ্রূপ করে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে জবাবে বিদ্রূপ করেন আর তাদের জন্য রয়েছে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।', 'Those who criticize the contributors among the believers concerning [their] charities and [criticize] the ones who find nothing [to spend] except their effort, so they ridicule them - Allah will ridicule them, and they will have a painful punishment.', 'মু’মিনদের মধ্যে যারা মুক্ত হস্তে দান করে, তাদেরকে যারা দোষারোপ করে আর সীমাহীন কষ্টে দানকারীদেরকে যারা বিদ্রূপ করে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে জবাবে বিদ্রূপ করেন আর তাদের জন্য রয়েছে ভয়াবহ শাস্তি।', 'Those who criticize the contributors among the believers concerning [their] charities and [criticize] the ones who find nothing [to spend] except their effort, so they ridicule them - Allah will ridicule them, and they will have a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009079.mp3', now()),
  (9, 80, '', '[{"id":64390,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"is''taghfir","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করো তুমি","root":"غفر","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64391,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64392,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64393,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":64394,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"tastaghfir","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করো","root":"غفر","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64395,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের(একই কথা)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64396,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"(এমনকি) যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":64397,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَغْفِرْ","transliteration":"tastaghfir","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করো তুমি","root":"غفر","lemma":"ٱسْتَغْفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64398,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64399,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"سَبْعِينَ","transliteration":"sabʿīna","translation_bn":"সত্তর","root":"سبع","lemma":"سَبْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64400,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَرَّةًۭ","transliteration":"marratan","translation_bn":"বারও","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64401,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَلَن","transliteration":"falan","translation_bn":"তারপরও কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64402,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَغْفِرَ","transliteration":"yaghfira","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা করবেন","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64403,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":64404,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64406,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":64407,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"এজন্যে যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64408,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64409,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"প্রতি আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64410,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۗ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64412,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64413,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":64414,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"সঠিক পথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64415,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-qawma","translation_bn":"(এমন) সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64416,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","transliteration":"l-fāsiqīna","translation_bn":"(যারা) সত্যত্যাগী","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64417,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٨٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮০)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'is''taghfir lahum aw lā tastaghfir lahum in tastaghfir lahum sabʿīna marratan falan yaghfira l-lahu lahum dhālika bi-annahum kafarū bil-lahi warasūlihi wal-lahu lā yahdī l-qawma l-fāsiqīna', 'তুমি তাদের জন্য ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর বা না কর (উভয়ই সমান), তুমি তাদের জন্য সত্তর বার ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করলেও আল্লাহ কক্ষনো তাদেরকে ক্ষমা করবেন না। এটা এজন্য যে, তারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের সাথে কুফুরী করেছে। আর আল্লাহ ফাসিক লোকদেরকে সঠিক পথ প্রদর্শন করেন না।', 'Ask forgiveness for them, [O Muhammad], or do not ask forgiveness for them. If you should ask forgiveness for them seventy times - never will Allah forgive them. That is because they disbelieved in Allah and His Messenger, and Allah does not guide the defiantly disobedient people.', 'তুমি তাদের জন্য ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা কর বা না কর (উভয়ই সমান), তুমি তাদের জন্য সত্তর বার ক্ষমা প্রার্থনা করলেও আল্লাহ কক্ষনো তাদেরকে ক্ষমা করবেন না। এটা এজন্য যে, তারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের সাথে কুফুরী করেছে। আর আল্লাহ ফাসিক লোকদেরকে সঠিক পথ প্রদর্শন করেন না।', 'Ask forgiveness for them, [O Muhammad], or do not ask forgiveness for them. If you should ask forgiveness for them seventy times - never will Allah forgive them. That is because they disbelieved in Allah and His Messenger, and Allah does not guide the defiantly disobedient people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009080.mp3', now()),
  (9, 81, '', '[{"id":64506,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَرِحَ","transliteration":"fariḥa","translation_bn":"খুশি হয়েছে","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64507,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُخَلَّفُونَ","transliteration":"l-mukhalafūna","translation_bn":"পিছনে থাকা লোকেরা","root":"خلف","lemma":"مُخَلَّفُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64508,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِمَقْعَدِهِمْ","transliteration":"bimaqʿadihim","translation_bn":"নিয়ে বসে থাকা তাদের","root":"قعد","lemma":"مَقْعَد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64509,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خِلَـٰفَ","transliteration":"khilāfa","translation_bn":"বিরোধিতা করে","root":"خلف","lemma":"خِلَٰف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64510,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولِ","transliteration":"rasūli","translation_bn":"রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64511,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":64512,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَكَرِهُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wakarihū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা অপছন্দ করেছে","root":"كره","lemma":"كَرِهَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64513,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":64514,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُجَـٰهِدُوا۟","transliteration":"yujāhidū","translation_bn":"তারা জেহাদ করবে","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64515,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","transliteration":"bi-amwālihim","translation_bn":"দিয়ে ধনসসম্পদ তাদের","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64516,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفُسِهِمْ","transliteration":"wa-anfusihim","translation_bn":"ও প্রাণ(দিয়ে)তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64517,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64518,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64519,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":64520,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":64521,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":64522,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَنفِرُوا۟","transliteration":"tanfirū","translation_bn":"তোমরা অভিযানে যেও","root":"نفر","lemma":"نَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64523,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":64524,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَرِّ ۗ","transliteration":"l-ḥari","translation_bn":"গরমের\"","root":"حرر","lemma":"حَرّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64526,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64527,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"نَارُ","transliteration":"nāru","translation_bn":"\"আগুন","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64528,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":64529,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أَشَدُّ","transliteration":"ashaddu","translation_bn":"প্রচন্ডতম","root":"شدد","lemma":"أَشَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":64530,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"حَرًّۭا ۚ","transliteration":"ḥarran","translation_bn":"গরম\"","root":"حرر","lemma":"حَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64532,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":64533,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা থাকতো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64534,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"يَفْقَهُونَ","transliteration":"yafqahūna","translation_bn":"তারা বুঝে","root":"فقه","lemma":"يَفْقَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64535,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fariḥa l-mukhalafūna bimaqʿadihim khilāfa rasūli l-lahi wakarihū an yujāhidū bi-amwālihim wa-anfusihim fī sabīli l-lahi waqālū lā tanfirū fī l-ḥari qul nāru jahannama ashaddu ḥarran law kānū yafqahūna', '(তাবুক অভিযানে) যারা পিছনে থেকে গিয়েছিল তারা রসূলের বিরোধিতায় বসে থাকাতেই আনন্দ প্রকাশ করেছিল আর তাদের ধন-সম্পদ ও জান দিয়ে আল্লাহর পথে জিহাদ করতে তারা অপছন্দ করেছিল। তারা বলেছিল, ‘গরমের মধ্যে অভিযানে বেরিও না’। বল, ‘জাহান্নামের আগুনই তাপে প্রচন্ডতম’। তারা যদি বুঝত!', 'Those who remained behind rejoiced in their staying [at home] after [the departure of] the Messenger of Allah and disliked to strive with their wealth and their lives in the cause of Allah and said, "Do not go forth in the heat." Say, "The fire of Hell is more intensive in heat" - if they would but understand.', '(তাবুক অভিযানে) যারা পিছনে থেকে গিয়েছিল তারা রসূলের বিরোধিতায় বসে থাকাতেই আনন্দ প্রকাশ করেছিল আর তাদের ধন-সম্পদ ও জান দিয়ে আল্লাহর পথে জিহাদ করতে তারা অপছন্দ করেছিল। তারা বলেছিল, ‘গরমের মধ্যে অভিযানে বেরিও না’। বল, ‘জাহান্নামের আগুনই তাপে প্রচন্ডতম’। তারা যদি বুঝত!', 'Those who remained behind rejoiced in their staying [at home] after [the departure of] the Messenger of Allah and disliked to strive with their wealth and their lives in the cause of Allah and said, "Do not go forth in the heat." Say, "The fire of Hell is more intensive in heat" - if they would but understand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009081.mp3', now()),
  (9, 82, '', '[{"id":65061,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَضْحَكُوا۟","transliteration":"falyaḍḥakū","translation_bn":"অতএব হাসা উচিৎ তাদের","root":"ضحك","lemma":"ضَحِكَتْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65062,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قَلِيلًۭا","transliteration":"qalīlan","translation_bn":"অল্প","root":"قلل","lemma":"قَلِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65063,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَلْيَبْكُوا۟","transliteration":"walyabkū","translation_bn":"ও কাঁদা উচিৎ তাদের","root":"بكي","lemma":"بَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65064,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"كَثِيرًۭا","transliteration":"kathīran","translation_bn":"বেশি","root":"كثر","lemma":"كَثِير","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65065,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآءًۢ","transliteration":"jazāan","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65066,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"পরিবর্তে যাকিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65067,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65068,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَكْسِبُونَ","transliteration":"yaksibūna","translation_bn":"অর্জন করে আসছে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65069,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falyaḍḥakū qalīlan walyabkū kathīran jazāan bimā kānū yaksibūna', 'তারা যেন কম হাসে এবং বেশী কাঁদে, তারা যে (পাপ) কামাই করছে তার ফলস্বরূপ।', 'So let them laugh a little and [then] weep much as recompense for what they used to earn.', 'তারা যেন কম হাসে এবং বেশী কাঁদে, তারা যে (পাপ) কামাই করছে তার ফলস্বরূপ।', 'So let them laugh a little and [then] weep much as recompense for what they used to earn.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009082.mp3', now()),
  (9, 83, '', '[{"id":65480,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65481,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"رَّجَعَكَ","transliteration":"rajaʿaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে ফিরিয়ে আনেন","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65482,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":65483,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65484,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"طَآئِفَةٍۢ","transliteration":"ṭāifatin","translation_bn":"কোনো দলের","root":"طوف","lemma":"طَا^ئِفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65485,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65486,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَٱسْتَـْٔذَنُوكَ","transliteration":"fa-is''tadhanūka","translation_bn":"তবে তোমার কাছে তারা অনুমতি চাইবে","root":"اذن","lemma":"ٱسْتَـ#ْذَنَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65487,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لِلْخُرُوجِ","transliteration":"lil''khurūji","translation_bn":"জন্যে বের হওয়ার","root":"خرج","lemma":"خُرُوج","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65488,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَقُل","transliteration":"faqul","translation_bn":"তখন বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65489,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَّن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"\"না কিছুতেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":65490,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَخْرُجُوا۟","transliteration":"takhrujū","translation_bn":"তোমরা বের হবে","root":"خرج","lemma":"خَرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65491,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَعِىَ","transliteration":"maʿiya","translation_bn":"আমার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":65492,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَبَدًۭا","transliteration":"abadan","translation_bn":"কখনও","root":"ابد","lemma":"أَبَدًا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":65493,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَن","transliteration":"walan","translation_bn":"এবং কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65494,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تُقَـٰتِلُوا۟","transliteration":"tuqātilū","translation_bn":"তোমরা যুদ্ধ করবে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَٰتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65495,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَعِىَ","transliteration":"maʿiya","translation_bn":"আমার সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":65496,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوًّا ۖ","transliteration":"ʿaduwwan","translation_bn":"কোনো শত্রুর (বিরুদ্ধে)","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65498,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّكُمْ","transliteration":"innakum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":65499,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"رَضِيتُم","transliteration":"raḍītum","translation_bn":"তোমরাই পছন্দ করেছিলে","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65500,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْقُعُودِ","transliteration":"bil-quʿūdi","translation_bn":"বিষয়কে বসে থাকার","root":"قعد","lemma":"قُعُود","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65501,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"أَوَّلَ","transliteration":"awwala","translation_bn":"প্রথম","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":65502,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مَرَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"marratin","translation_bn":"বার","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65503,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَٱقْعُدُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-uq''ʿudū","translation_bn":"অতএব তোমরা বসে থাকো","root":"قعد","lemma":"قَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65504,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"مَعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":65505,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَـٰلِفِينَ","transliteration":"l-khālifīna","translation_bn":"বসে থাকা লোকদের\"","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَٰلِفِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65506,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٨٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-in rajaʿaka l-lahu ilā ṭāifatin min''hum fa-is''tadhanūka lil''khurūji faqul lan takhrujū maʿiya abadan walan tuqātilū maʿiya ʿaduwwan innakum raḍītum bil-quʿūdi awwala marratin fa-uq''ʿudū maʿa l-khālifīna', 'আল্লাহ যদি তোমাকে তাদের কোন দলের কাছে ফিরিয়ে নিয়ে আসেন আর যদি তারা (তোমার সঙ্গে) অভিযানে বের হবার জন্য অনুমতি প্রার্থনা করে তখন বলবে, ‘আমার সাথে কক্ষনো বের হতে পারবে না আর কক্ষনো আমার সঙ্গে গিয়ে শত্রুর বিরুদ্ধে লড়তে পারবে না, তোমরা প্রথমবারেই নিস্ক্রিয় হয়ে বসে থাকাকেই বেশি পছন্দ করে নিয়েছো, কাজেই (এখন) পিছ-পড়াদের সাথেই বসে থাক’।', 'If Allah should return you to a faction of them [after the expedition] and then they ask your permission to go out [to battle], say, "You will not go out with me, ever, and you will never fight with me an enemy. Indeed, you were satisfied with sitting [at home] the first time, so sit [now] with those who stay behind."', 'আল্লাহ যদি তোমাকে তাদের কোন দলের কাছে ফিরিয়ে নিয়ে আসেন আর যদি তারা (তোমার সঙ্গে) অভিযানে বের হবার জন্য অনুমতি প্রার্থনা করে তখন বলবে, ‘আমার সাথে কক্ষনো বের হতে পারবে না আর কক্ষনো আমার সঙ্গে গিয়ে শত্রুর বিরুদ্ধে লড়তে পারবে না, তোমরা প্রথমবারেই নিস্ক্রিয় হয়ে বসে থাকাকেই বেশি পছন্দ করে নিয়েছো, কাজেই (এখন) পিছ-পড়াদের সাথেই বসে থাক’।', 'If Allah should return you to a faction of them [after the expedition] and then they ask your permission to go out [to battle], say, "You will not go out with me, ever, and you will never fight with me an enemy. Indeed, you were satisfied with sitting [at home] the first time, so sit [now] with those who stay behind."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009083.mp3', now()),
  (9, 84, '', '[{"id":65698,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65699,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُصَلِّ","transliteration":"tuṣalli","translation_bn":"তুমি সালাত পড়বে","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65700,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65701,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدٍۢ","transliteration":"aḥadin","translation_bn":"কারও","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65702,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُم","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65703,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّاتَ","transliteration":"māta","translation_bn":"মরে গেলে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65704,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَبَدًۭا","transliteration":"abadan","translation_bn":"কখনও","root":"ابد","lemma":"أَبَدًا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":65705,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65706,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَقُمْ","transliteration":"taqum","translation_bn":"দাঁড়াবে তুমি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65707,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"পাশে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65708,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قَبْرِهِۦٓ ۖ","transliteration":"qabrihi","translation_bn":"কবরের তার","root":"قبر","lemma":"قَبْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65710,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":65711,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাস করেছে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65712,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"প্রতি আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65713,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65714,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَمَاتُوا۟","transliteration":"wamātū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা মরে গেছে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65715,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এ অবস্থায় যে তারা (ছিলো)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":65716,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَـٰسِقُونَ","transliteration":"fāsiqūna","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগী","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":65717,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٨٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā tuṣalli ʿalā aḥadin min''hum māta abadan walā taqum ʿalā qabrihi innahum kafarū bil-lahi warasūlihi wamātū wahum fāsiqūna', 'তাদের কেউ মারা গেলে তুমি কক্ষনো তাদের জন্য (জানাযার) নামায পড়বে না, আর তাদের কবরের পাশে দন্ডায়মান হবে না। তারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের সঙ্গে কুফুরী করেছে আর বিদ্রোহী পাপাচারী অবস্থায় তাদের মৃত্যু হয়েছে।', 'And do not pray [the funeral prayer, O Muhammad], over any of them who has died - ever - or stand at his grave. Indeed, they disbelieved in Allah and His Messenger and died while they were defiantly disobedient.', 'তাদের কেউ মারা গেলে তুমি কক্ষনো তাদের জন্য (জানাযার) নামায পড়বে না, আর তাদের কবরের পাশে দন্ডায়মান হবে না। তারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের সঙ্গে কুফুরী করেছে আর বিদ্রোহী পাপাচারী অবস্থায় তাদের মৃত্যু হয়েছে।', 'And do not pray [the funeral prayer, O Muhammad], over any of them who has died - ever - or stand at his grave. Indeed, they disbelieved in Allah and His Messenger and died while they were defiantly disobedient.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009084.mp3', now()),
  (9, 85, '', '[{"id":66342,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না (যেন)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66343,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تُعْجِبْكَ","transliteration":"tuʿ''jib''ka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে বিস্মিত করে","root":"عجب","lemma":"أَعْجَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66344,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلُهُمْ","transliteration":"amwāluhum","translation_bn":"ধনসম্পদ তাদের","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66345,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَأَوْلَـٰدُهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"wa-awlāduhum","translation_bn":"ও সন্তান-সন্তুতি তাদের","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66347,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":66348,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُرِيدُ","transliteration":"yurīdu","translation_bn":"চান","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66349,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":66350,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":66351,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُعَذِّبَهُم","transliteration":"yuʿadhibahum","translation_bn":"শাস্তি দিবেন তাদেরকে","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66352,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66353,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66354,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66355,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَتَزْهَقَ","transliteration":"watazhaqa","translation_bn":"ও চলে যাবে","root":"زهق","lemma":"زَهَقَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66356,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسُهُمْ","transliteration":"anfusuhum","translation_bn":"আত্মা তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66357,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এ অবস্থায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":66358,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"kāfirūna","translation_bn":"কাফের (থাকবে)","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66359,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٨٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā tuʿ''jib''ka amwāluhum wa-awlāduhum innamā yurīdu l-lahu an yuʿadhibahum bihā fī l-dun''yā watazhaqa anfusuhum wahum kāfirūna', 'তাদের মালধন আর সন্তান-সন্ততি তোমার যেন চোখ ধাঁধিয়ে না দেয়, দুনিয়াতে আল্লাহ সে সব দিয়েই তাদেরকে শাস্তি দেয়ার ইচ্ছে করেন আর কাফির অবস্থায় যেন তাদের প্রাণবায়ু নির্গত হয়।', 'And let not their wealth and their children impress you. Allah only intends to punish them through them in this world and that their souls should depart [at death] while they are disbelievers.', 'তাদের মালধন আর সন্তান-সন্ততি তোমার যেন চোখ ধাঁধিয়ে না দেয়, দুনিয়াতে আল্লাহ সে সব দিয়েই তাদেরকে শাস্তি দেয়ার ইচ্ছে করেন আর কাফির অবস্থায় যেন তাদের প্রাণবায়ু নির্গত হয়।', 'And let not their wealth and their children impress you. Allah only intends to punish them through them in this world and that their souls should depart [at death] while they are disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009085.mp3', now()),
  (9, 86, '', '[{"id":66638,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَآ","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66639,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَتْ","transliteration":"unzilat","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ হয়","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66640,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"سُورَةٌ","transliteration":"sūratun","translation_bn":"কোনো সূরাহ","root":"سور","lemma":"سُورَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66641,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنْ","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যবাচক (Intention)"},{"id":66642,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامِنُوا۟","transliteration":"āminū","translation_bn":"তোমরা ঈমান আনো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66643,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"উপর আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66644,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَجَـٰهِدُوا۟","transliteration":"wajāhidū","translation_bn":"ও তোমরা জিহাদ করো","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66645,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":66646,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولِهِ","transliteration":"rasūlihi","translation_bn":"রাসূলের তাঁর","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66647,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَـْٔذَنَكَ","transliteration":"is''tadhanaka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে অব্যাহতি চায়","root":"اذن","lemma":"ٱسْتَـ#ْذَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66648,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لُوا۟","transliteration":"ulū","translation_bn":"সম্পন্নরা","root":"اول","lemma":"أُولِى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":66649,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلطَّوْلِ","transliteration":"l-ṭawli","translation_bn":"শক্তি-সামর্থ্য","root":"طول","lemma":"طَوْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66650,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66651,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالُوا۟","transliteration":"waqālū","translation_bn":"ও তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":66652,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ذَرْنَا","transliteration":"dharnā","translation_bn":"\"আমাদের ছেড়ে দিন","root":"وذر","lemma":"يَذَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66653,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَكُن","transliteration":"nakun","translation_bn":"আমরা থাকবো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66654,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَّعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":66655,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَـٰعِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-qāʿidīna","translation_bn":"বসে থাকা লোকদের\"","root":"قعد","lemma":"قَاعِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":66656,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٨٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā unzilat sūratun an āminū bil-lahi wajāhidū maʿa rasūlihi is''tadhanaka ulū l-ṭawli min''hum waqālū dharnā nakun maʿa l-qāʿidīna', 'যখন কোন সূরাহ অবতীর্ণ করা হয় যে, ‘আল্লাহর প্রতি বিশ্বাস স্থাপন কর আর তাঁর রসূলের সঙ্গে থেকে জিহাদ কর’- তখন শক্তি-সামর্থ্য সম্পন্ন লোকেরা তোমার নিকট অব্যাহতি প্রার্থনা করে আর বলে, ‘আমাদেরকে রেহাই দিন, যারা (ঘরে) বসে থাকে আমরা তাদের সঙ্গেই থাকব।’', 'And when a surah was revealed [enjoining them] to believe in Allah and to fight with His Messenger, those of wealth among them asked your permission [to stay back] and said, "Leave us to be with them who sit [at home]."', 'যখন কোন সূরাহ অবতীর্ণ করা হয় যে, ‘আল্লাহর প্রতি বিশ্বাস স্থাপন কর আর তাঁর রসূলের সঙ্গে থেকে জিহাদ কর’- তখন শক্তি-সামর্থ্য সম্পন্ন লোকেরা তোমার নিকট অব্যাহতি প্রার্থনা করে আর বলে, ‘আমাদেরকে রেহাই দিন, যারা (ঘরে) বসে থাকে আমরা তাদের সঙ্গেই থাকব।’', 'And when a surah was revealed [enjoining them] to believe in Allah and to fight with His Messenger, those of wealth among them asked your permission [to stay back] and said, "Leave us to be with them who sit [at home]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009086.mp3', now()),
  (9, 87, '', '[{"id":66995,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"رَضُوا۟","transliteration":"raḍū","translation_bn":"তারা পছন্দ করেছে","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66996,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِأَن","transliteration":"bi-an","translation_bn":"নিয়ে যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":66997,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونُوا۟","transliteration":"yakūnū","translation_bn":"তারা থাকবে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":66998,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":66999,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَوَالِفِ","transliteration":"l-khawālifi","translation_bn":"অন্তঃপুরবাসিনীদের","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَوَالِف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67000,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَطُبِعَ","transliteration":"waṭubiʿa","translation_bn":"ও সীল করা হয়েছে","root":"طبع","lemma":"طَبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67001,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67002,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের তাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67003,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَهُمْ","transliteration":"fahum","translation_bn":"অতএব তারা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67004,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":67005,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَفْقَهُونَ","transliteration":"yafqahūna","translation_bn":"তারা বুঝে","root":"فقه","lemma":"يَفْقَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67006,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٨٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'raḍū bi-an yakūnū maʿa l-khawālifi waṭubiʿa ʿalā qulūbihim fahum lā yafqahūna', 'তারা পিছনে (ঘরে বসে) থাকা স্ত্রীলোকদের সাথে থাকাকেই পছন্দ করে, তাদের হৃদয়কে সীল করে দেয়া হয়েছে, কাজেই তারা কিছুই বুঝতে পারে না।', 'They were satisfied to be with those who stay behind, and their hearts were sealed over, so they do not understand.', 'তারা পিছনে (ঘরে বসে) থাকা স্ত্রীলোকদের সাথে থাকাকেই পছন্দ করে, তাদের হৃদয়কে সীল করে দেয়া হয়েছে, কাজেই তারা কিছুই বুঝতে পারে না।', 'They were satisfied to be with those who stay behind, and their hearts were sealed over, so they do not understand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009087.mp3', now()),
  (9, 88, '', '[{"id":67093,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَـٰكِنِ","transliteration":"lākini","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংশোধন পদ (Amendment)"},{"id":67094,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولُ","transliteration":"l-rasūlu","translation_bn":"রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67095,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67096,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67097,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَعَهُۥ","transliteration":"maʿahu","translation_bn":"সাথে তার","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":67098,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَـٰهَدُوا۟","transliteration":"jāhadū","translation_bn":"জিহাদ করেছে","root":"جهد","lemma":"جَٰهَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67099,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","transliteration":"bi-amwālihim","translation_bn":"দিয়ে ধনসম্পদ তাদের","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67100,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنفُسِهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"wa-anfusihim","translation_bn":"ও প্রাণ (দিয়ে)তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67102,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","translation_bn":"ও ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67103,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67104,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَيْرَٰتُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-khayrātu","translation_bn":"সব কল্যাণ","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْرَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67106,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","translation_bn":"ও ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":67107,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هُمُ","transliteration":"humu","translation_bn":"তারাই","root":"—","lemma":"هُمُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":67108,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","transliteration":"l-muf''liḥūna","translation_bn":"সফলকাম","root":"فلح","lemma":"مُفْلِحُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67109,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٨٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lākini l-rasūlu wa-alladhīna āmanū maʿahu jāhadū bi-amwālihim wa-anfusihim wa-ulāika lahumu l-khayrātu wa-ulāika humu l-muf''liḥūna', 'কিন্তু রসূল আর তার সাথে যারা ঈমান এনেছে তারা তাদের মাল দিয়ে এবং জান দিয়ে জিহাদ করে। যাবতীয় কল্যাণ তো তাদেরই জন্য। সফলকাম তো তারাই।', 'But the Messenger and those who believed with him fought with their wealth and their lives. Those will have [all that is] good, and it is those who are the successful.', 'কিন্তু রসূল আর তার সাথে যারা ঈমান এনেছে তারা তাদের মাল দিয়ে এবং জান দিয়ে জিহাদ করে। যাবতীয় কল্যাণ তো তাদেরই জন্য। সফলকাম তো তারাই।', 'But the Messenger and those who believed with him fought with their wealth and their lives. Those will have [all that is] good, and it is those who are the successful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009088.mp3', now()),
  (9, 89, '', '[{"id":67801,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَعَدَّ","transliteration":"aʿadda","translation_bn":"প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন","root":"عدد","lemma":"أَعَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67802,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":67803,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67804,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"jannātin","translation_bn":"জান্নাত","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67805,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত হয়","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":67806,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67807,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتِهَا","transliteration":"taḥtihā","translation_bn":"নিচ তার","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67808,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্ণাধারা","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67809,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"তারা চিরিস্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":67810,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا ۚ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":67812,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":67813,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَوْزُ","transliteration":"l-fawzu","translation_bn":"সাফল্য","root":"فوز","lemma":"فَوْز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67814,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَظِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmu","translation_bn":"মহা","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":67815,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٨٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'aʿadda l-lahu lahum jannātin tajrī min taḥtihā l-anhāru khālidīna fīhā dhālika l-fawzu l-ʿaẓīmu', 'আল্লাহ তাদের জন্য জান্নাত প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন যার নিম্নদেশে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত যাতে তারা চিরকাল থাকবে। এটাই হল বিরাট সফলতা।', 'Allah has prepared for them gardens beneath which rivers flow, wherein they will abide eternally. That is the great attainment.', 'আল্লাহ তাদের জন্য জান্নাত প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন যার নিম্নদেশে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত যাতে তারা চিরকাল থাকবে। এটাই হল বিরাট সফলতা।', 'Allah has prepared for them gardens beneath which rivers flow, wherein they will abide eternally. That is the great attainment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009089.mp3', now()),
  (9, 90, '', '[{"id":68159,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَجَآءَ","transliteration":"wajāa","translation_bn":"এবং আসলো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68160,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُعَذِّرُونَ","transliteration":"l-muʿadhirūna","translation_bn":"অজুহাত পেশকারীরা","root":"عذر","lemma":"مُعَذِّرُون","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68161,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্যে হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68162,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْرَابِ","transliteration":"l-aʿrābi","translation_bn":"বেদুঈনদের","root":"عرب","lemma":"أَعْرَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68163,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لِيُؤْذَنَ","transliteration":"liyu''dhana","translation_bn":"অব্যাহতি দেয়া হয়","root":"اذن","lemma":"أَذِنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68164,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68165,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَقَعَدَ","transliteration":"waqaʿada","translation_bn":"এবং (এভাবে) বসে থাকলো","root":"قعد","lemma":"قَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68166,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(এসব লোক) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68167,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَذَبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা বলেছিলো (ঈমানের ওয়াদায়)","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68168,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহকে","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":68169,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলকে","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68171,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سَيُصِيبُ","transliteration":"sayuṣību","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই পৌঁছবে","root":"صوب","lemma":"أَصَابَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":68172,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68173,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"كَفَرُوا۟","transliteration":"kafarū","translation_bn":"অস্বীকার করেছিলো","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68174,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68175,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٌ","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68176,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"alīmun","translation_bn":"নিদারুণ","root":"الم","lemma":"أَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":68177,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٩٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯০)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wajāa l-muʿadhirūna mina l-aʿrābi liyu''dhana lahum waqaʿada alladhīna kadhabū l-laha warasūlahu sayuṣību alladhīna kafarū min''hum ʿadhābun alīmun', 'বেদুইনদের মধ্যেও ওজর-আপত্তি পেশকারীরা এসে অব্যাহতির আবেদন জানালো। যারা (নিজেদের ঈমান থাকার ব্যাপারে) আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের নিকট মিথ্যা বলেছিল তারাও পিছনে রয়ে গেল। তাদের (অর্থাৎ বেদুইনদের) মধ্যে যারা কুফুরী করেছে শীঘ্রই এক ভয়ঙ্কর ‘আযাব তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবে।', 'And those with excuses among the bedouins came to be permitted [to remain], and they who had lied to Allah and His Messenger sat [at home]. There will strike those who disbelieved among them a painful punishment.', 'বেদুইনদের মধ্যেও ওজর-আপত্তি পেশকারীরা এসে অব্যাহতির আবেদন জানালো। যারা (নিজেদের ঈমান থাকার ব্যাপারে) আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের নিকট মিথ্যা বলেছিল তারাও পিছনে রয়ে গেল। তাদের (অর্থাৎ বেদুইনদের) মধ্যে যারা কুফুরী করেছে শীঘ্রই এক ভয়ঙ্কর ‘আযাব তাদেরকে পাকড়াও করবে।', 'And those with excuses among the bedouins came to be permitted [to remain], and they who had lied to Allah and His Messenger sat [at home]. There will strike those who disbelieved among them a painful punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009090.mp3', now()),
  (9, 91, '', '[{"id":68443,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَّيْسَ","transliteration":"laysa","translation_bn":"নেই (কোনো অপরাধ)","root":"ليس","lemma":"لَّيْسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68444,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68445,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضُّعَفَآءِ","transliteration":"l-ḍuʿafāi","translation_bn":"দুর্বলদের","root":"ضعف","lemma":"ضَعِيف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68446,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"ও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68447,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68448,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَرْضَىٰ","transliteration":"l-marḍā","translation_bn":"রোগীদের","root":"مرض","lemma":"مَّرِيض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68449,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68450,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68451,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68452,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":68453,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَجِدُونَ","transliteration":"yajidūna","translation_bn":"(এমন সম্বল) পায়","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68454,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68455,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُنفِقُونَ","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","translation_bn":"তারা ব্যয় করবে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68456,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"حَرَجٌ","transliteration":"ḥarajun","translation_bn":"কোনো অপরাধ (নাই তাদেরও)","root":"حرج","lemma":"حَرَج","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68457,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":68458,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"نَصَحُوا۟","transliteration":"naṣaḥū","translation_bn":"তারা কল্যাণ কামনা করে","root":"نصح","lemma":"نَصَحُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68459,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68460,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"warasūlihi","translation_bn":"ও রাসূলের তাঁর(জন্যে)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68462,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":68463,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68464,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-muḥ''sinīna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মশীলদের","root":"حسن","lemma":"مُحْسِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68465,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68466,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلٍۢ ۚ","transliteration":"sabīlin","translation_bn":"পথ (অভিযোগের)","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68468,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68469,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":68470,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":68471,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"٩١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯১)","root":"—","lemma":"٩١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laysa ʿalā l-ḍuʿafāi walā ʿalā l-marḍā walā ʿalā alladhīna lā yajidūna mā yunfiqūna ḥarajun idhā naṣaḥū lillahi warasūlihi mā ʿalā l-muḥ''sinīna min sabīlin wal-lahu ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'দুর্বলের উপর, পীড়িতের উপর আর ব্যয় করার মত কোন সম্বল যাদের নেই তাদের উপর কোন অভিযোগ নেই, যদি তারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের প্রতি বিশ্বস্ত হয়ে থাকে। সৎ কর্মপরায়ণদের বিরুদ্ধে অভিযোগ উত্থাপন করার কোন সুযোগ নেই, আর আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'There is not upon the weak or upon the ill or upon those who do not find anything to spend any discomfort when they are sincere to Allah and His Messenger. There is not upon the doers of good any cause [for blame]. And Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'দুর্বলের উপর, পীড়িতের উপর আর ব্যয় করার মত কোন সম্বল যাদের নেই তাদের উপর কোন অভিযোগ নেই, যদি তারা আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের প্রতি বিশ্বস্ত হয়ে থাকে। সৎ কর্মপরায়ণদের বিরুদ্ধে অভিযোগ উত্থাপন করার কোন সুযোগ নেই, আর আল্লাহ বড়ই ক্ষমাশীল, পরম দয়ালু।', 'There is not upon the weak or upon the ill or upon those who do not find anything to spend any discomfort when they are sincere to Allah and His Messenger. There is not upon the doers of good any cause [for blame]. And Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009091.mp3', now()),
  (9, 92, '', '[{"id":68715,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং নেই(দোষ)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68716,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68717,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68718,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":68719,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68720,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَتَوْكَ","transliteration":"atawka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে এসেছিলো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68721,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِتَحْمِلَهُمْ","transliteration":"litaḥmilahum","translation_bn":"যেন তুমি তাদের বাহনের ব্যবস্হা করে দাও","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68722,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُلْتَ","transliteration":"qul''ta","translation_bn":"তুমি বলেছিলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68723,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":68724,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَجِدُ","transliteration":"ajidu","translation_bn":"পাচ্ছি","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68725,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(এমন কিছু) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68726,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَحْمِلُكُمْ","transliteration":"aḥmilukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদেরকে বহন করার আমি","root":"حمل","lemma":"حَمَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68727,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68728,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّوا۟","transliteration":"tawallaw","translation_bn":"তারা ফিরে গিয়েছে","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68729,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَّأَعْيُنُهُمْ","transliteration":"wa-aʿyunuhum","translation_bn":"এ অবস্থায় যে তাদের চোখগুলো","root":"عين","lemma":"عَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":68730,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَفِيضُ","transliteration":"tafīḍu","translation_bn":"ঝরাচ্ছিলো","root":"فيض","lemma":"تَفِيضُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68731,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":68732,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدَّمْعِ","transliteration":"l-damʿi","translation_bn":"অশ্রু","root":"دمع","lemma":"دَّمْع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":68733,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"حَزَنًا","transliteration":"ḥazanan","translation_bn":"দুঃখে","root":"حزن","lemma":"حَزَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":68734,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":68735,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَجِدُوا۟","transliteration":"yajidū","translation_bn":"তারা পাচ্ছে (এমন কিছু)","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68736,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":68737,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"يُنفِقُونَ","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","translation_bn":"তারা ব্যয় করবে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":68738,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"٩٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯২)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā ʿalā alladhīna idhā mā atawka litaḥmilahum qul''ta lā ajidu mā aḥmilukum ʿalayhi tawallaw wa-aʿyunuhum tafīḍu mina l-damʿi ḥazanan allā yajidū mā yunfiqūna', 'তাদের বিরুদ্ধেও কোন অভিযোগ নেই যারা তোমার কাছে যখন বাহন চাওয়ার জন্য এসেছিল তখন তুমি বলেছিলে, ‘আমি তো তোমাদের জন্য কোন বাহন পাচ্ছি না’। তখন তারা ফিরে গেল, আর সে সময় তাদের চোখ থেকে অশ্রু ঝরে পড়ছিল- এ দুঃখে যে, ব্যয় বহন করার মত কোন কিছু তাদের ছিল না।', 'Nor [is there blame] upon those who, when they came to you that you might give them mounts, you said, "I can find nothing for you to ride upon." They turned back while their eyes overflowed with tears out of grief that they could not find something to spend [for the cause of Allah].', 'তাদের বিরুদ্ধেও কোন অভিযোগ নেই যারা তোমার কাছে যখন বাহন চাওয়ার জন্য এসেছিল তখন তুমি বলেছিলে, ‘আমি তো তোমাদের জন্য কোন বাহন পাচ্ছি না’। তখন তারা ফিরে গেল, আর সে সময় তাদের চোখ থেকে অশ্রু ঝরে পড়ছিল- এ দুঃখে যে, ব্যয় বহন করার মত কোন কিছু তাদের ছিল না।', 'Nor [is there blame] upon those who, when they came to you that you might give them mounts, you said, "I can find nothing for you to ride upon." They turned back while their eyes overflowed with tears out of grief that they could not find something to spend [for the cause of Allah].', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009092.mp3', now()),
  (9, 93, '', '[{"id":69146,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّمَا","transliteration":"innamā","translation_bn":"প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":69147,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّبِيلُ","transliteration":"l-sabīlu","translation_bn":"(অভিযোগের)পথ","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69148,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"(তাদের) উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69149,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":69150,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَـْٔذِنُونَكَ","transliteration":"yastadhinūnaka","translation_bn":"তোমার কাছে অব্যাহতি চায়","root":"اذن","lemma":"ٱسْتَـ#ْذَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69151,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এ অবস্থায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":69152,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَغْنِيَآءُ ۚ","transliteration":"aghniyāu","translation_bn":"ধনী লোক","root":"غني","lemma":"غَنِىّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69154,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رَضُوا۟","transliteration":"raḍū","translation_bn":"তারা পছন্দ করেছে","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69155,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِأَن","transliteration":"bi-an","translation_bn":"নিয়ে যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69156,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَكُونُوا۟","transliteration":"yakūnū","translation_bn":"তারা থাকবে (বসে)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69157,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":69158,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَوَالِفِ","transliteration":"l-khawālifi","translation_bn":"অন্তঃপুরবাসিনীদের","root":"خلف","lemma":"خَوَالِف","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69159,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَطَبَعَ","transliteration":"waṭabaʿa","translation_bn":"ও সীল মেরে দিয়েছেন","root":"طبع","lemma":"طَبَعَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69160,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69161,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69162,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"অন্তরের তাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69163,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"فَهُمْ","transliteration":"fahum","translation_bn":"তাই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"فَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69164,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না (কিছুই)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":69165,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"জানতে পারে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69166,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٩٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā l-sabīlu ʿalā alladhīna yastadhinūnaka wahum aghniyāu raḍū bi-an yakūnū maʿa l-khawālifi waṭabaʿa l-lahu ʿalā qulūbihim fahum lā yaʿlamūna', 'অভিযোগ তো তাদের বিরুদ্ধে যারা সম্পদশালী হওয়া সত্ত্বেও (যুদ্ধে যাওয়া হতে) তোমার কাছে অব্যাহতি প্রার্থনা করেছিল, যারা ঘরে বসা থাকা (স্ত্রী লোকদের) সঙ্গে থাকতেই পছন্দ করেছিল, আল্লাহ তাদের হৃদয়কে সীল করে দিয়েছেন আর এজন্য (কিসে নিজেদের কল্যাণ আছে আর কিসে অকল্যাণ) তা তারা জানে না।', 'The cause [for blame] is only upon those who ask permission of you while they are rich. They are satisfied to be with those who stay behind, and Allah has sealed over their hearts, so they do not know.', 'অভিযোগ তো তাদের বিরুদ্ধে যারা সম্পদশালী হওয়া সত্ত্বেও (যুদ্ধে যাওয়া হতে) তোমার কাছে অব্যাহতি প্রার্থনা করেছিল, যারা ঘরে বসা থাকা (স্ত্রী লোকদের) সঙ্গে থাকতেই পছন্দ করেছিল, আল্লাহ তাদের হৃদয়কে সীল করে দিয়েছেন আর এজন্য (কিসে নিজেদের কল্যাণ আছে আর কিসে অকল্যাণ) তা তারা জানে না।', 'The cause [for blame] is only upon those who ask permission of you while they are rich. They are satisfied to be with those who stay behind, and Allah has sealed over their hearts, so they do not know.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009093.mp3', now()),
  (9, 94, '', '[{"id":69481,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَعْتَذِرُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿtadhirūna","translation_bn":"তারা অজুহাত পেশ করবে","root":"عذر","lemma":"يَعْتَذِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69482,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ilaykum","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69483,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":69484,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَجَعْتُمْ","transliteration":"rajaʿtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ফিরে যাবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69485,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"নিকট তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69487,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69488,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":69489,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"تَعْتَذِرُوا۟","transliteration":"taʿtadhirū","translation_bn":"তোমরা অজুহাত পেশ করো","root":"عذر","lemma":"يَعْتَذِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69490,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَن","transliteration":"lan","translation_bn":"কখনও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":69491,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"نُّؤْمِنَ","transliteration":"nu''mina","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাস করব আমরা","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69492,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69493,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","tran