তাঁর) দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69506,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰلِمِ","transliteration":"ʿālimi","translation_bn":"(যিনি) খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69507,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"l-ghaybi","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্যের","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69508,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ","transliteration":"wal-shahādati","translation_bn":"ও দৃশ্যের","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهَٰدَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69509,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","transliteration":"fayunabbi-ukum","translation_bn":"তখন জানিয়ে দিবেন তোমাদের","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69510,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69511,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69512,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69513,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"٩٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yaʿtadhirūna ilaykum idhā rajaʿtum ilayhim qul lā taʿtadhirū lan nu''mina lakum qad nabba-anā l-lahu min akhbārikum wasayarā l-lahu ʿamalakum warasūluhu thumma turaddūna ilā ʿālimi l-ghaybi wal-shahādati fayunabbi-ukum bimā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'তোমরা তাদের কাছে (যুদ্ধ শেষে) ফিরে আসলে তারা তোমাদের কাছে ওজর পেশ করবে। বল- ওজর পেশ করো না, তোমাদেরকে আমরা কক্ষনো বিশ্বাস করব না। আল্লাহ তোমাদের খবর আমাদের কাছে জানিয়ে দিয়েছেন। আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূল অবশ্যই তোমাদের কাজকর্মের প্রতি দৃষ্টি রাখবেন। অতঃপর দৃশ্য ও অদৃশ্য সম্পর্কে যিনি জ্ঞাত তাঁর কাছে তোমাদেরকে ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে, অতঃপর তোমরা যা করতে সে সম্পর্কে তিনি তোমাদের জানিয়ে দিবেন।', 'They will make excuses to you when you have returned to them. Say, "Make no excuse - never will we believe you. Allah has already informed us of your news. And Allah will observe your deeds, and [so will] His Messenger; then you will be taken back to the Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, and He will inform you of what you used to do."', 'তোমরা তাদের কাছে (যুদ্ধ শেষে) ফিরে আসলে তারা তোমাদের কাছে ওজর পেশ করবে। বল- ওজর পেশ করো না, তোমাদেরকে আমরা কক্ষনো বিশ্বাস করব না। আল্লাহ তোমাদের খবর আমাদের কাছে জানিয়ে দিয়েছেন। আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূল অবশ্যই তোমাদের কাজকর্মের প্রতি দৃষ্টি রাখবেন। অতঃপর দৃশ্য ও অদৃশ্য সম্পর্কে যিনি জ্ঞাত তাঁর কাছে তোমাদেরকে ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে, অতঃপর তোমরা যা করতে সে সম্পর্কে তিনি তোমাদের জানিয়ে দিবেন।', 'They will make excuses to you when you have returned to them. Say, "Make no excuse - never will we believe you. Allah has already informed us of your news. And Allah will observe your deeds, and [so will] His Messenger; then you will be taken back to the Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, and He will inform you of what you used to do."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009094.mp3', now()),
  (9, 95, '', '[{"id":69794,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"سَيَحْلِفُونَ","transliteration":"sayaḥlifūna","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই তারা শপথ করে বলবে","root":"حلف","lemma":"حَلَفْ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":69795,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"নামে আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69796,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69797,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":69798,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱنقَلَبْتُمْ","transliteration":"inqalabtum","translation_bn":"ফিরে যাবে তোমরা","root":"قلب","lemma":"ٱنقَلَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69799,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"দিকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69800,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لِتُعْرِضُوا۟","transliteration":"lituʿ''riḍū","translation_bn":"যেন তোমরা উপেক্ষা করো","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69801,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69803,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَأَعْرِضُوا۟","transliteration":"fa-aʿriḍū","translation_bn":"তাই তোমরা উপেক্ষা করো","root":"عرض","lemma":"أَعْرَضَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":69804,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69806,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":69807,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"رِجْسٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"rij''sun","translation_bn":"অপবিত্র","root":"رجس","lemma":"رِجْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69809,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَأْوَىٰهُمْ","transliteration":"wamawāhum","translation_bn":"এবং আবাসস্থল তাদের","root":"اوي","lemma":"مَأْوَىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":69810,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمُ","transliteration":"jahannamu","translation_bn":"জাহান্নাম","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":69811,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآءًۢ","transliteration":"jazāan","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল (স্বরূপ)","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":69812,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ের যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":69813,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69814,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَكْسِبُونَ","transliteration":"yaksibūna","translation_bn":"তারা উপার্জন করে আসতে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":69815,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٩٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'sayaḥlifūna bil-lahi lakum idhā inqalabtum ilayhim lituʿ''riḍū ʿanhum fa-aʿriḍū ʿanhum innahum rij''sun wamawāhum jahannamu jazāan bimā kānū yaksibūna', 'তোমরা তাদের কাছে ফিরে আসলে তারা তোমাদের নিকট আল্লাহর নামে শপথ করবে যাতে তোমরা তাদেরকে উপেক্ষা কর। কাজেই তোমরা তাদেরকে উপেক্ষা কর, তারা অপবিত্র, তাদের বাসস্থান জাহান্নাম, তারা যা করেছে এটাই তার ন্যায্য প্রাপ্য।', 'They will swear by Allah to you when you return to them that you would leave them alone. So leave them alone; indeed they are evil; and their refuge is Hell as recompense for what they had been earning.', 'তোমরা তাদের কাছে ফিরে আসলে তারা তোমাদের নিকট আল্লাহর নামে শপথ করবে যাতে তোমরা তাদেরকে উপেক্ষা কর। কাজেই তোমরা তাদেরকে উপেক্ষা কর, তারা অপবিত্র, তাদের বাসস্থান জাহান্নাম, তারা যা করেছে এটাই তার ন্যায্য প্রাপ্য।', 'They will swear by Allah to you when you return to them that you would leave them alone. So leave them alone; indeed they are evil; and their refuge is Hell as recompense for what they had been earning.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009095.mp3', now()),
  (9, 96, '', '[{"id":70110,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَحْلِفُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥlifūna","translation_bn":"শপথ করে তারা বলবে","root":"حلف","lemma":"حَلَفْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70111,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70112,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِتَرْضَوْا۟","transliteration":"litarḍaw","translation_bn":"যেন তোমরা সন্তুষ্ট হও","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70113,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70115,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70116,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَرْضَوْا۟","transliteration":"tarḍaw","translation_bn":"তোমরা সন্তুষ্ট হও","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70117,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70118,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَإِنَّ","transliteration":"fa-inna","translation_bn":"তবে নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70119,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70120,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":70121,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَرْضَىٰ","transliteration":"yarḍā","translation_bn":"সন্তুষ্ট হন","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70122,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَنِ","transliteration":"ʿani","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70123,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمِ","transliteration":"l-qawmi","translation_bn":"(এমন)সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70124,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","transliteration":"l-fāsiqīna","translation_bn":"(যারা)সত্যত্যাগী","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَاسِق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70125,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٩٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yaḥlifūna lakum litarḍaw ʿanhum fa-in tarḍaw ʿanhum fa-inna l-laha lā yarḍā ʿani l-qawmi l-fāsiqīna', 'তারা তোমাদের কাছে শপথ করবে যাতে তোমরা তাদের উপর খুশি হয়ে যাও, কিন্তু তোমরা তাদের উপর খুশি হলেও, আল্লাহ অবাধ্য সম্প্রদায়ের প্রতি সন্তুষ্ট হবেন না।', 'They swear to you so that you might be satisfied with them. But if you should be satisfied with them - indeed, Allah is not satisfied with a defiantly disobedient people.', 'তারা তোমাদের কাছে শপথ করবে যাতে তোমরা তাদের উপর খুশি হয়ে যাও, কিন্তু তোমরা তাদের উপর খুশি হলেও, আল্লাহ অবাধ্য সম্প্রদায়ের প্রতি সন্তুষ্ট হবেন না।', 'They swear to you so that you might be satisfied with them. But if you should be satisfied with them - indeed, Allah is not satisfied with a defiantly disobedient people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009096.mp3', now()),
  (9, 97, '', '[{"id":70257,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْرَابُ","transliteration":"al-aʿrābu","translation_bn":"বেদুঈনরা","root":"عرب","lemma":"أَعْرَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70258,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَشَدُّ","transliteration":"ashaddu","translation_bn":"কঠোরতর","root":"شدد","lemma":"أَشَدّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":70259,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُفْرًۭا","transliteration":"kuf''ran","translation_bn":"অবিশ্বাসে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70260,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَنِفَاقًۭا","transliteration":"wanifāqan","translation_bn":"ও কপটতায়","root":"نفق","lemma":"نِفَاق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70261,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَأَجْدَرُ","transliteration":"wa-ajdaru","translation_bn":"এবং বেশি উপযুক্ত","root":"جدر","lemma":"أَجْدَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70262,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَلَّا","transliteration":"allā","translation_bn":"যে না","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":70263,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"yaʿlamū","translation_bn":"তারা জানবে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70264,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"حُدُودَ","transliteration":"ḥudūda","translation_bn":"সীমারেখা","root":"حدد","lemma":"حُدُود","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70265,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70266,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70267,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":70268,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70269,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولِهِۦ ۗ","transliteration":"rasūlihi","translation_bn":"রাসূলের তাঁর","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70271,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70272,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"মহাজ্ঞানী","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":70273,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"মহাবিজ্ঞ","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":70274,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٩٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'al-aʿrābu ashaddu kuf''ran wanifāqan wa-ajdaru allā yaʿlamū ḥudūda mā anzala l-lahu ʿalā rasūlihi wal-lahu ʿalīmun ḥakīmun', 'বেদুঈন আরবরা কুফুরী আর মুনাফিকীতে সবচেয়ে কঠোর, আর আল্লাহ তাঁর রসূলের প্রতি যা অবতীর্ণ করেছেন তার সীমারেখার ব্যাপারে অজ্ঞ থাকার তারা অধিক উপযুক্ত, আর আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, মহা প্রজ্ঞাবান।', 'The bedouins are stronger in disbelief and hypocrisy and more likely not to know the limits of what [laws] Allah has revealed to His Messenger. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', 'বেদুঈন আরবরা কুফুরী আর মুনাফিকীতে সবচেয়ে কঠোর, আর আল্লাহ তাঁর রসূলের প্রতি যা অবতীর্ণ করেছেন তার সীমারেখার ব্যাপারে অজ্ঞ থাকার তারা অধিক উপযুক্ত, আর আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, মহা প্রজ্ঞাবান।', 'The bedouins are stronger in disbelief and hypocrisy and more likely not to know the limits of what [laws] Allah has revealed to His Messenger. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009097.mp3', now()),
  (9, 98, '', '[{"id":70701,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্য থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70702,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْرَابِ","transliteration":"l-aʿrābi","translation_bn":"বেদুঈনদের","root":"عرب","lemma":"أَعْرَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70703,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70704,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّخِذُ","transliteration":"yattakhidhu","translation_bn":"মনর করে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70705,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":70706,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُنفِقُ","transliteration":"yunfiqu","translation_bn":"ব্যয় করে (আল্লাহর পথে)","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":70707,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَغْرَمًۭا","transliteration":"maghraman","translation_bn":"জরিমানাস্বরূপ","root":"غرم","lemma":"مَّغْرَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70708,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَيَتَرَبَّصُ","transliteration":"wayatarabbaṣu","translation_bn":"ও অপেক্ষা করে","root":"ربص","lemma":"تَرَبَّصْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70709,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِكُمُ","transliteration":"bikumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"بِكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70710,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدَّوَآئِرَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-dawāira","translation_bn":"ভাগ্যচক্রের পরিবর্তনের (অর্থাৎ অমঙ্গলের)","root":"دور","lemma":"دَّوَا^ئِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70712,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"তাদের  উপর (আসছে)","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":70713,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"دَآئِرَةُ","transliteration":"dāiratu","translation_bn":"ভাগ্য বিপর্যয়","root":"دور","lemma":"دَا^ئِرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":70714,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّوْءِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-sawi","translation_bn":"খারাপ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَوْء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":70716,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":70717,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"سَمِيعٌ","transliteration":"samīʿun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":70718,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":70719,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٩٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamina l-aʿrābi man yattakhidhu mā yunfiqu maghraman wayatarabbaṣu bikumu l-dawāira ʿalayhim dāiratu l-sawi wal-lahu samīʿun ʿalīmun', 'কতক বেদুঈন যা তারা আল্লাহর পথে ব্যয় করে তাকে জরিমানা বলে গণ্য করে আর তোমাদের দুঃখ মুসিবতের জন্য অপেক্ষা করতে থাকে, মন্দের চক্র তাদেরকেই ঘিরে ধরুক। আর আল্লাহ তো সব কিছুই শুনেন, সব কিছু জানেন।', 'And among the bedouins are some who consider what they spend as a loss and await for you turns of misfortune. Upon them will be a misfortune of evil. And Allah is Hearing and Knowing.', 'কতক বেদুঈন যা তারা আল্লাহর পথে ব্যয় করে তাকে জরিমানা বলে গণ্য করে আর তোমাদের দুঃখ মুসিবতের জন্য অপেক্ষা করতে থাকে, মন্দের চক্র তাদেরকেই ঘিরে ধরুক। আর আল্লাহ তো সব কিছুই শুনেন, সব কিছু জানেন।', 'And among the bedouins are some who consider what they spend as a loss and await for you turns of misfortune. Upon them will be a misfortune of evil. And Allah is Hearing and Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009098.mp3', now()),
  (9, 99, '', '[{"id":71105,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنَ","transliteration":"wamina","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71106,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْرَابِ","transliteration":"l-aʿrābi","translation_bn":"বেদুঈনদের","root":"عرب","lemma":"أَعْرَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71107,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":71108,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُ","transliteration":"yu''minu","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাস করে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71109,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"উপর আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71110,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","translation_bn":"এবং দিনে","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71111,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","translation_bn":"আখেরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71112,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَيَتَّخِذُ","transliteration":"wayattakhidhu","translation_bn":"ও মনে করে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71113,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":71114,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُنفِقُ","transliteration":"yunfiqu","translation_bn":"ব্যয় করে (আল্লাহর পথে)","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71115,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"قُرُبَـٰتٍ","transliteration":"qurubātin","translation_bn":"সান্নিধ্য লাভের উপায়","root":"قرب","lemma":"قُرُبَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71116,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"عِندَ","transliteration":"ʿinda","translation_bn":"কাছে","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":71117,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71118,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَصَلَوَٰتِ","transliteration":"waṣalawāti","translation_bn":"ও দোয়ার (মাধ্যম হিসেবে)","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71119,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّسُولِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-rasūli","translation_bn":"রাসূলের","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71121,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"জেনে রাখো","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":71122,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهَا","transliteration":"innahā","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71123,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قُرْبَةٌۭ","transliteration":"qur''batun","translation_bn":"সান্নিধ্য লাভের মাধ্যম","root":"قرب","lemma":"قُرْبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71124,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71126,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"سَيُدْخِلُهُمُ","transliteration":"sayud''khiluhumu","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই প্রবেশ করাবেন তাদের","root":"دخل","lemma":"أُدْخِلَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":71127,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71128,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71129,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"رَحْمَتِهِۦٓ ۗ","transliteration":"raḥmatihi","translation_bn":"দয়ার তাঁর","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71131,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71132,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71133,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71134,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71135,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٩٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৯৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٩٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamina l-aʿrābi man yu''minu bil-lahi wal-yawmi l-ākhiri wayattakhidhu mā yunfiqu qurubātin ʿinda l-lahi waṣalawāti l-rasūli alā innahā qur''batun lahum sayud''khiluhumu l-lahu fī raḥmatihi inna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'কতক বেদুঈন আল্লাহতে ও শেষ দিবসে বিশ্বাস করে আর তারা যা আল্লাহর পথে ব্যয় করে তাকে তারা আল্লাহর নৈকট্য ও রসূলের দু‘আ লাভের মাধ্যম মনে করে, সত্যিই তা তাদের (আল্লাহর) নৈকট্য লাভের মাধ্যম, অচিরেই আল্লাহ তাদেরকে তাঁর রহমাতের মধ্যে প্রবিষ্ট করবেন, অবশ্যই আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'But among the bedouins are some who believe in Allah and the Last Day and consider what they spend as means of nearness to Allah and of [obtaining] invocations of the Messenger. Unquestionably, it is a means of nearness for them. Allah will admit them to His mercy. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'কতক বেদুঈন আল্লাহতে ও শেষ দিবসে বিশ্বাস করে আর তারা যা আল্লাহর পথে ব্যয় করে তাকে তারা আল্লাহর নৈকট্য ও রসূলের দু‘আ লাভের মাধ্যম মনে করে, সত্যিই তা তাদের (আল্লাহর) নৈকট্য লাভের মাধ্যম, অচিরেই আল্লাহ তাদেরকে তাঁর রহমাতের মধ্যে প্রবিষ্ট করবেন, অবশ্যই আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, অতি দয়ালু।', 'But among the bedouins are some who believe in Allah and the Last Day and consider what they spend as means of nearness to Allah and of [obtaining] invocations of the Messenger. Unquestionably, it is a means of nearness for them. Allah will admit them to His mercy. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009099.mp3', now()),
  (9, 100, '', '[{"id":71221,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلسَّـٰبِقُونَ","transliteration":"wal-sābiqūna","translation_bn":"ও অগ্রগামীরা","root":"سبق","lemma":"سَابِق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71222,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَوَّلُونَ","transliteration":"l-awalūna","translation_bn":"প্রথম","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71223,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71224,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُهَـٰجِرِينَ","transliteration":"l-muhājirīna","translation_bn":"মুহাজেরদের","root":"هجر","lemma":"مُهَاجِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71225,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَنصَارِ","transliteration":"wal-anṣāri","translation_bn":"ও আনসারদের","root":"نصر","lemma":"نَصِير","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71226,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"ও যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71227,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّبَعُوهُم","transliteration":"ittabaʿūhum","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করেছে তাদের","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71228,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِإِحْسَـٰنٍۢ","transliteration":"bi-iḥ''sānin","translation_bn":"সাথে সততার","root":"حسن","lemma":"إِحْسَٰن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71229,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رَّضِىَ","transliteration":"raḍiya","translation_bn":"সন্তুষ্ট হয়েছেন","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71230,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71231,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُمْ","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"উপর তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71232,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَرَضُوا۟","transliteration":"waraḍū","translation_bn":"ও তারা খুশি হয়েছে","root":"رضو","lemma":"رَّضِىَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71233,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُ","transliteration":"ʿanhu","translation_bn":"উপর তাঁর","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71234,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَأَعَدَّ","transliteration":"wa-aʿadda","translation_bn":"ও প্রস্তুত করে তিনি রেখেছেন","root":"عدد","lemma":"أَعَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71235,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71236,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"جَنَّـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"jannātin","translation_bn":"জান্নাত","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71237,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تَجْرِى","transliteration":"tajrī","translation_bn":"প্রবাহিত হয়","root":"جري","lemma":"جَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71238,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَحْتَهَا","transliteration":"taḥtahā","translation_bn":"নিচে তার","root":"تحت","lemma":"تَحْت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71239,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ","transliteration":"l-anhāru","translation_bn":"ঝর্নাধারা","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71240,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدِينَ","transliteration":"khālidīna","translation_bn":"তারা স্হায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71241,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَآ","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71242,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أَبَدًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"abadan","translation_bn":"চিরকাল","root":"ابد","lemma":"أَبَدًا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":71244,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটাই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":71245,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَوْزُ","transliteration":"l-fawzu","translation_bn":"সফলতা","root":"فوز","lemma":"فَوْز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71246,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَظِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmu","translation_bn":"মহা","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71247,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"١٠٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-sābiqūna l-awalūna mina l-muhājirīna wal-anṣāri wa-alladhīna ittabaʿūhum bi-iḥ''sānin raḍiya l-lahu ʿanhum waraḍū ʿanhu wa-aʿadda lahum jannātin tajrī taḥtahā l-anhāru khālidīna fīhā abadan dhālika l-fawzu l-ʿaẓīmu', 'মুহাজির ও আনসারদের মধ্যে যারা প্রথম সারির অগ্রণী আর যারা তাদেরকে যাবতীয় সৎকর্মে অনুসরণ করেছে, আল্লাহ তাদের প্রতি সন্তুষ্ট আর তারাও তাঁর প্রতি সন্তুষ্ট, তাদের জন্য তিনি প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন জান্নাত যার তলদেশে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত, সেখানে তারা চিরকাল থাকবে। এটাই হল মহান সফলতা।', 'And the first forerunners [in the faith] among the Muhajireen and the Ansar and those who followed them with good conduct - Allah is pleased with them and they are pleased with Him, and He has prepared for them gardens beneath which rivers flow, wherein they will abide forever. That is the great attainment.', 'মুহাজির ও আনসারদের মধ্যে যারা প্রথম সারির অগ্রণী আর যারা তাদেরকে যাবতীয় সৎকর্মে অনুসরণ করেছে, আল্লাহ তাদের প্রতি সন্তুষ্ট আর তারাও তাঁর প্রতি সন্তুষ্ট, তাদের জন্য তিনি প্রস্তুত করে রেখেছেন জান্নাত যার তলদেশে ঝর্ণাধারা প্রবাহিত, সেখানে তারা চিরকাল থাকবে। এটাই হল মহান সফলতা।', 'And the first forerunners [in the faith] among the Muhajireen and the Ansar and those who followed them with good conduct - Allah is pleased with them and they are pleased with Him, and He has prepared for them gardens beneath which rivers flow, wherein they will abide forever. That is the great attainment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009100.mp3', now()),
  (9, 101, '', '[{"id":71639,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِمَّنْ","transliteration":"wamimman","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্যে তাদের যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71640,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"حَوْلَكُم","transliteration":"ḥawlakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের আশপাশে(আছে)","root":"حول","lemma":"حَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71641,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71642,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَعْرَابِ","transliteration":"l-aʿrābi","translation_bn":"বেদুঈনদের","root":"عرب","lemma":"أَعْرَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71643,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مُنَـٰفِقُونَ ۖ","transliteration":"munāfiqūna","translation_bn":"(অনেকেই) মুনাফেক","root":"نفق","lemma":"مُنَٰفِقُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71645,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْ","transliteration":"wamin","translation_bn":"এবং কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71646,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَهْلِ","transliteration":"ahli","translation_bn":"অধিবাসী","root":"اهل","lemma":"أَهْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71647,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَدِينَةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-madīnati","translation_bn":"মাদীনাহ","root":"مدن","lemma":"مَدِينَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71649,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَرَدُوا۟","transliteration":"maradū","translation_bn":"তারা চরমে পৌঁছে গিয়েছে","root":"مرد","lemma":"مَرَدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71650,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71651,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنِّفَاقِ","transliteration":"l-nifāqi","translation_bn":"কপটতার","root":"نفق","lemma":"نِفَاق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":71652,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":71653,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"taʿlamuhum","translation_bn":"জানো তুমি তাদের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71655,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":71656,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"نَعْلَمُهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"naʿlamuhum","translation_bn":"জানি তাদের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71658,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"سَنُعَذِّبُهُم","transliteration":"sanuʿadhibuhum","translation_bn":"শীঘ্রই আমরা শাস্তি দিবো তাদের","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ভবিষ্যদ্বাচক (Future)"},{"id":71659,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مَّرَّتَيْنِ","transliteration":"marratayni","translation_bn":"দু''বার","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71660,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71661,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يُرَدُّونَ","transliteration":"yuraddūna","translation_bn":"তাদের ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে","root":"ردد","lemma":"رَدَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71662,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71663,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابٍ","transliteration":"ʿadhābin","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71664,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","translation_bn":"কঠোর","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71665,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٠١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamimman ḥawlakum mina l-aʿrābi munāfiqūna wamin ahli l-madīnati maradū ʿalā l-nifāqi lā taʿlamuhum naḥnu naʿlamuhum sanuʿadhibuhum marratayni thumma yuraddūna ilā ʿadhābin ʿaẓīmin', 'তোমাদের চতুষ্পার্শ্বে কতক বেদুঈন হল মুনাফিক, আর মাদীনাবাসীদের কেউ কেউ মুনাফিকীতে অনঢ়, তুমি তাদেরকে চেন না, আমি তাদেরকে চিনি, আমি তাদেরকে দ্বিগুণ শাস্তি দেব, (ক্ষুধা বা নিহত হওয়া এবং কবরের শাস্তি) অতঃপর তাদেরকে মহা শাস্তির পানে ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে।', 'And among those around you of the bedouins are hypocrites, and [also] from the people of Madinah. They have become accustomed to hypocrisy. You, [O Muhammad], do not know them, [but] We know them. We will punish them twice [in this world]; then they will be returned to a great punishment.', 'তোমাদের চতুষ্পার্শ্বে কতক বেদুঈন হল মুনাফিক, আর মাদীনাবাসীদের কেউ কেউ মুনাফিকীতে অনঢ়, তুমি তাদেরকে চেন না, আমি তাদেরকে চিনি, আমি তাদেরকে দ্বিগুণ শাস্তি দেব, (ক্ষুধা বা নিহত হওয়া এবং কবরের শাস্তি) অতঃপর তাদেরকে মহা শাস্তির পানে ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে।', 'And among those around you of the bedouins are hypocrites, and [also] from the people of Madinah. They have become accustomed to hypocrisy. You, [O Muhammad], do not know them, [but] We know them. We will punish them twice [in this world]; then they will be returned to a great punishment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009101.mp3', now()),
  (9, 102, '', '[{"id":71875,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاخَرُونَ","transliteration":"waākharūna","translation_bn":"এবং আরো কিছু লোক (আছে)","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71876,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْتَرَفُوا۟","transliteration":"iʿ''tarafū","translation_bn":"তারা স্বীকার করেছে","root":"عرف","lemma":"ٱعْتَرَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71877,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِذُنُوبِهِمْ","transliteration":"bidhunūbihim","translation_bn":"অপরাধ তাদের","root":"ذنب","lemma":"ذَنب","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71878,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"خَلَطُوا۟","transliteration":"khalaṭū","translation_bn":"তারা মিশিয়ে ফেলেছে","root":"خلط","lemma":"خَلَطُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71879,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلًۭا","transliteration":"ʿamalan","translation_bn":"(কিছু) কাজ","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71880,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحًۭا","transliteration":"ṣāliḥan","translation_bn":"ভালো","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":71881,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاخَرَ","transliteration":"waākhara","translation_bn":"ও অন্য কিছু","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":71882,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّئًا","transliteration":"sayyi-an","translation_bn":"(কাজ) মন্দ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّئ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71883,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَسَى","transliteration":"ʿasā","translation_bn":"আশা করা যায়","root":"عسي","lemma":"عَسَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71884,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71885,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":71886,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَتُوبَ","transliteration":"yatūba","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা করবেন","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":71887,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ ۚ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":71889,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":71890,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":71891,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"غَفُورٌۭ","transliteration":"ghafūrun","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"غفر","lemma":"غَفُور","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71892,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":71893,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"١٠٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waākharūna iʿ''tarafū bidhunūbihim khalaṭū ʿamalan ṣāliḥan waākhara sayyi-an ʿasā l-lahu an yatūba ʿalayhim inna l-laha ghafūrun raḥīmun', 'আর অন্য কতক লোক তাদের অপরাধ স্বীকার করেছে, তারা একটি সৎ কাজের সাথে আরেকটি মন্দ কাজকে মিশ্রিত করেছে, আশা করা যায় আল্লাহ তাদের তাওবা কবুল করবেন, অবশ্যই আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, অতীব দয়ালু।', 'And [there are] others who have acknowledged their sins. They had mixed a righteous deed with another that was bad. Perhaps Allah will turn to them in forgiveness. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', 'আর অন্য কতক লোক তাদের অপরাধ স্বীকার করেছে, তারা একটি সৎ কাজের সাথে আরেকটি মন্দ কাজকে মিশ্রিত করেছে, আশা করা যায় আল্লাহ তাদের তাওবা কবুল করবেন, অবশ্যই আল্লাহ অতি ক্ষমাশীল, অতীব দয়ালু।', 'And [there are] others who have acknowledged their sins. They had mixed a righteous deed with another that was bad. Perhaps Allah will turn to them in forgiveness. Indeed, Allah is Forgiving and Merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009102.mp3', now()),
  (9, 103, '', '[{"id":72271,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"خُذْ","transliteration":"khudh","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করো","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72272,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72273,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","transliteration":"amwālihim","translation_bn":"ধনসম্পদ তাদের","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72274,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"صَدَقَةًۭ","transliteration":"ṣadaqatan","translation_bn":"সদকা","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَقَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72275,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تُطَهِّرُهُمْ","transliteration":"tuṭahhiruhum","translation_bn":"তুমি পবিত্র করবে তাদের","root":"طهر","lemma":"طَهَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72276,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَتُزَكِّيهِم","transliteration":"watuzakkīhim","translation_bn":"ও পরিশুদ্ধি করবে তাদের","root":"زكو","lemma":"زَكَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72277,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بِهَا","transliteration":"bihā","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72278,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَصَلِّ","transliteration":"waṣalli","translation_bn":"ও দোয়া করো তুমি","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72279,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72281,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":72282,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"صَلَوٰتَكَ","transliteration":"ṣalataka","translation_bn":"দোয়া তোমার","root":"صلو","lemma":"صَلَوٰة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72283,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"سَكَنٌۭ","transliteration":"sakanun","translation_bn":"প্রশান্তি","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72284,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَّهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَّهُمْ ۗ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72286,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72287,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"سَمِيعٌ","transliteration":"samīʿun","translation_bn":"সব শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":72288,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":72289,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٠٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'khudh min amwālihim ṣadaqatan tuṭahhiruhum watuzakkīhim bihā waṣalli ʿalayhim inna ṣalataka sakanun lahum wal-lahu samīʿun ʿalīmun', 'তাদের সম্পদ থেকে সদাকাহ গ্রহণ করবে যাতে তা দিয়ে তাদেরকে পবিত্র ও পরিশুদ্ধ করতে পার। তুমি তাদের জন্য দু‘আ করবে, বস্তুতঃ তোমার দু‘আ তাদের জন্য স্বস্তিদায়ক, আর আল্লাহ সবকিছু শোনেন সব কিছু জানেন।', 'Take, [O, Muhammad], from their wealth a charity by which you purify them and cause them increase, and invoke [Allah ''s blessings] upon them. Indeed, your invocations are reassurance for them. And Allah is Hearing and Knowing.', 'তাদের সম্পদ থেকে সদাকাহ গ্রহণ করবে যাতে তা দিয়ে তাদেরকে পবিত্র ও পরিশুদ্ধ করতে পার। তুমি তাদের জন্য দু‘আ করবে, বস্তুতঃ তোমার দু‘আ তাদের জন্য স্বস্তিদায়ক, আর আল্লাহ সবকিছু শোনেন সব কিছু জানেন।', 'Take, [O, Muhammad], from their wealth a charity by which you purify them and cause them increase, and invoke [Allah ''s blessings] upon them. Indeed, your invocations are reassurance for them. And Allah is Hearing and Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009103.mp3', now()),
  (9, 104, '', '[{"id":72645,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَمْ","transliteration":"alam","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":72646,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yaʿlamū","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72647,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":72648,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72649,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই (যিনি)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":72650,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَقْبَلُ","transliteration":"yaqbalu","translation_bn":"গ্রহণ করেন","root":"قبل","lemma":"يَقْبَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72651,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّوْبَةَ","transliteration":"l-tawbata","translation_bn":"তওবা","root":"توب","lemma":"تَوْبَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72652,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72653,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادِهِۦ","transliteration":"ʿibādihi","translation_bn":"দাসদের তাঁর","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72654,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَيَأْخُذُ","transliteration":"wayakhudhu","translation_bn":"ও গ্রহণ করেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"أَخَذَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72655,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصَّدَقَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-ṣadaqāti","translation_bn":"সদকা","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَدَقَٰت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72656,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَّ","transliteration":"wa-anna","translation_bn":"এবং (এও) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72657,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72658,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":72659,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّوَّابُ","transliteration":"l-tawābu","translation_bn":"ক্ষমাশীল","root":"توب","lemma":"تَوَّاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72660,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلرَّحِيمُ","transliteration":"l-raḥīmu","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72661,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٠٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alam yaʿlamū anna l-laha huwa yaqbalu l-tawbata ʿan ʿibādihi wayakhudhu l-ṣadaqāti wa-anna l-laha huwa l-tawābu l-raḥīmu', 'তারা কি জানে না যে, আল্লাহ তাঁর বান্দাদের (অনুশোচনাপূর্ণ) ক্ষমাপ্রার্থনা কবুল করে থাকেন আর সদাকাহ গ্রহণ করেন। আর আল্লাহই তো তাওবাহ কবূলকারী, অতি দয়ালু।', 'Do they not know that it is Allah who accepts repentance from His servants and receives charities and that it is Allah who is the Accepting of repentance, the Merciful?', 'তারা কি জানে না যে, আল্লাহ তাঁর বান্দাদের (অনুশোচনাপূর্ণ) ক্ষমাপ্রার্থনা কবুল করে থাকেন আর সদাকাহ গ্রহণ করেন। আর আল্লাহই তো তাওবাহ কবূলকারী, অতি দয়ালু।', 'Do they not know that it is Allah who accepts repentance from His servants and receives charities and that it is Allah who is the Accepting of repentance, the Merciful?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009104.mp3', now()),
  (9, 105, '', '[{"id":72864,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَقُلِ","transliteration":"waquli","translation_bn":"এবং বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72865,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱعْمَلُوا۟","transliteration":"iʿ''malū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা কাজ করো","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72866,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَسَيَرَى","transliteration":"fasayarā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর শীঘ্রই দেখবেন","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72867,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72868,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلَكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿamalakum","translation_bn":"কাজ তোমাদের","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72869,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولُهُۥ","transliteration":"warasūluhu","translation_bn":"এবং  রাসূল তাঁর","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72870,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ ۖ","transliteration":"wal-mu''minūna","translation_bn":"এবং মু''মিনরাও (দেখবে)","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72872,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَسَتُرَدُّونَ","transliteration":"wasaturaddūna","translation_bn":"এবং অচিরেই তোমাদের ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে","root":"ردد","lemma":"رَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72873,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"(তাঁর) দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72874,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰلِمِ","transliteration":"ʿālimi","translation_bn":"(যিনি) অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72875,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَيْبِ","transliteration":"l-ghaybi","translation_bn":"অদৃশ্য(সম্পর্কে)","root":"غيب","lemma":"غَيْب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72876,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلشَّهَـٰدَةِ","transliteration":"wal-shahādati","translation_bn":"এবং দৃশ্য (সম্পর্কেও)","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهَٰدَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72877,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَيُنَبِّئُكُم","transliteration":"fayunabbi-ukum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর জানাবেন তোমাদেরকে","root":"نبا","lemma":"نَبَّأَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72878,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72879,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72880,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"কাজ করতে\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72881,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٠٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waquli iʿ''malū fasayarā l-lahu ʿamalakum warasūluhu wal-mu''minūna wasaturaddūna ilā ʿālimi l-ghaybi wal-shahādati fayunabbi-ukum bimā kuntum taʿmalūna', 'বল, তোমরা আমল করতে থাক। অচিরেই আল্লাহ তোমাদের আমালের প্রতি লক্ষ্য রাখবেন এবং তাঁর রসূল ও মু’মিনগণও (লক্ষ্য রাখবে), আর অচিরেই তোমাদেরকে দৃশ্য ও অদৃশ্যের পরিজ্ঞাতার দিকে ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে, আর তিনি তখন তোমরা যে আমল করছিলে তা তোমাদের জানিয়ে দিবেন।', 'And say, "Do [as you will], for Allah will see your deeds, and [so, will] His Messenger and the believers. And you will be returned to the Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, and He will inform you of what you used to do."', 'বল, তোমরা আমল করতে থাক। অচিরেই আল্লাহ তোমাদের আমালের প্রতি লক্ষ্য রাখবেন এবং তাঁর রসূল ও মু’মিনগণও (লক্ষ্য রাখবে), আর অচিরেই তোমাদেরকে দৃশ্য ও অদৃশ্যের পরিজ্ঞাতার দিকে ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে, আর তিনি তখন তোমরা যে আমল করছিলে তা তোমাদের জানিয়ে দিবেন।', 'And say, "Do [as you will], for Allah will see your deeds, and [so, will] His Messenger and the believers. And you will be returned to the Knower of the unseen and the witnessed, and He will inform you of what you used to do."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009105.mp3', now()),
  (9, 106, '', '[{"id":72919,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَءَاخَرُونَ","transliteration":"waākharūna","translation_bn":"এবং অন্যকিছু (লোক)","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72920,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُرْجَوْنَ","transliteration":"mur''jawna","translation_bn":"অপেক্ষামান","root":"رجو","lemma":"مُرْجَوْن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":72921,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِأَمْرِ","transliteration":"li-amri","translation_bn":"জন্যে নির্দেশের","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72922,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":72923,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِمَّا","transliteration":"immā","translation_bn":"হয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":72924,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُعَذِّبُهُمْ","transliteration":"yuʿadhibuhum","translation_bn":"তিনি শাস্তি দিবেন তাদের","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72925,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَإِمَّا","transliteration":"wa-immā","translation_bn":"আর না হয়","root":"—","lemma":"إِمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72926,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَتُوبُ","transliteration":"yatūbu","translation_bn":"ক্ষমা করবেন","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":72927,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِمْ ۗ","transliteration":"ʿalayhim","translation_bn":"প্রতি তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":72929,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":72930,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":72931,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"প্রজ্ঞাময়","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":72932,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٠٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'waākharūna mur''jawna li-amri l-lahi immā yuʿadhibuhum wa-immā yatūbu ʿalayhim wal-lahu ʿalīmun ḥakīmun', 'আর কতক আল্লাহর ফায়সালার অপেক্ষায় থাকল, তিনি তাদেরকে শাস্তি দিবেন অথবা তাদের তাওবাহ কবূল করবেন; আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, বড়ই প্রজ্ঞাময়।', 'And [there are] others deferred until the command of Allah - whether He will punish them or whether He will forgive them. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', 'আর কতক আল্লাহর ফায়সালার অপেক্ষায় থাকল, তিনি তাদেরকে শাস্তি দিবেন অথবা তাদের তাওবাহ কবূল করবেন; আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, বড়ই প্রজ্ঞাময়।', 'And [there are] others deferred until the command of Allah - whether He will punish them or whether He will forgive them. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009106.mp3', now()),
  (9, 107, '', '[{"id":73234,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73235,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذُوا۟","transliteration":"ittakhadhū","translation_bn":"নির্মাণ করেছে","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73236,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَسْجِدًۭا","transliteration":"masjidan","translation_bn":"মাসজিদকে","root":"سجد","lemma":"مَسْجِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73237,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ضِرَارًۭا","transliteration":"ḍirāran","translation_bn":"ক্ষতি করার","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضِرَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73238,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَكُفْرًۭا","transliteration":"wakuf''ran","translation_bn":"ও সত্য প্রত্যাখ্যানের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كُفْر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73239,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَتَفْرِيقًۢا","transliteration":"watafrīqan","translation_bn":"ও বিভেদ সৃষ্টির উদ্দেশ্যে","root":"فرق","lemma":"تَفْرِيق","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73240,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":73241,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73242,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَإِرْصَادًۭا","transliteration":"wa-ir''ṣādan","translation_bn":"ও ঘাঁটি হিসেবে (ব্যবহারের জন্যে)","root":"رصد","lemma":"إِرْصَاد","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73243,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَنْ","transliteration":"liman","translation_bn":"জন্যে তার যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73244,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"حَارَبَ","transliteration":"ḥāraba","translation_bn":"যুদ্ধ করেছে","root":"حرب","lemma":"حَارَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73245,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":73246,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ","transliteration":"warasūlahu","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর রাসূলের (বিরুদ্ধে)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73247,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73248,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلُ ۚ","transliteration":"qablu","translation_bn":"পূর্ব","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73250,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَيَحْلِفُنَّ","transliteration":"walayaḥlifunna","translation_bn":"এবং অবশ্যই তারা শপথ করবেই","root":"حلف","lemma":"حَلَفْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73251,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":73252,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَرَدْنَآ","transliteration":"aradnā","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেছিলাম আমরা","root":"رود","lemma":"أَرَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73253,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":73254,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ḥus''nā","translation_bn":"উত্তম\"","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73256,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73257,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَشْهَدُ","transliteration":"yashhadu","translation_bn":"সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছেন","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73258,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"innahum","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তারা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":73259,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَكَـٰذِبُونَ","transliteration":"lakādhibūna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মিথ্যাবাদী","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَٰذِب","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":73260,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"١٠٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna ittakhadhū masjidan ḍirāran wakuf''ran watafrīqan bayna l-mu''minīna wa-ir''ṣādan liman ḥāraba l-laha warasūlahu min qablu walayaḥlifunna in aradnā illā l-ḥus''nā wal-lahu yashhadu innahum lakādhibūna', 'আর যারা মাসজিদ তৈরী করেছে ক্ষতিসাধন, কুফুরী আর মু’মিনদের মধ্যে বিভেদ সৃষ্টির উদ্দেশ্যে, আর যে ব্যক্তি ইতোপূর্বে আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ করেছে তার ঘাঁটি হিসেবে ব্যবহারের নিমিত্তে, তারা অবশ্য অবশ্যই শপথ করবে যে, আমাদের উদ্দেশ্য সৎ ব্যতীত নয়। আল্লাহ সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছেন যে তারা অবশ্যই মিথ্যাবাদী।', 'And [there are] those [hypocrites] who took for themselves a mosque for causing harm and disbelief and division among the believers and as a station for whoever had warred against Allah and His Messenger before. And they will surely swear, "We intended only the best." And Allah testifies that indeed they are liars.', 'আর যারা মাসজিদ তৈরী করেছে ক্ষতিসাধন, কুফুরী আর মু’মিনদের মধ্যে বিভেদ সৃষ্টির উদ্দেশ্যে, আর যে ব্যক্তি ইতোপূর্বে আল্লাহ ও তাঁর রসূলের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ করেছে তার ঘাঁটি হিসেবে ব্যবহারের নিমিত্তে, তারা অবশ্য অবশ্যই শপথ করবে যে, আমাদের উদ্দেশ্য সৎ ব্যতীত নয়। আল্লাহ সাক্ষ্য দিচ্ছেন যে তারা অবশ্যই মিথ্যাবাদী।', 'And [there are] those [hypocrites] who took for themselves a mosque for causing harm and disbelief and division among the believers and as a station for whoever had warred against Allah and His Messenger before. And they will surely swear, "We intended only the best." And Allah testifies that indeed they are liars.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009107.mp3', now()),
  (9, 108, '', '[{"id":73555,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"নিষেধবাচক (Prohibition)"},{"id":73556,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَقُمْ","transliteration":"taqum","translation_bn":"তুমি দাঁড়াবে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73557,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73558,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَبَدًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"abadan","translation_bn":"কখনও","root":"ابد","lemma":"أَبَدًا","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":73560,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَّمَسْجِدٌ","transliteration":"lamasjidun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই যে মাসজিদের","root":"سجد","lemma":"مَسْجِد","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":73561,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أُسِّسَ","transliteration":"ussisa","translation_bn":"ভিত্তি স্হাপিত হয়েছে","root":"اسس","lemma":"أَسَّسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73562,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73563,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلتَّقْوَىٰ","transliteration":"l-taqwā","translation_bn":"তাকওয়ার","root":"وقي","lemma":"تَقْوَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73564,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73565,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَوَّلِ","transliteration":"awwali","translation_bn":"প্রথম","root":"اول","lemma":"أَوَّل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73566,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٍ","transliteration":"yawmin","translation_bn":"দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73567,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَحَقُّ","transliteration":"aḥaqqu","translation_bn":"অধিকযোগ্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"أَحَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":73568,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":73569,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"تَقُومَ","transliteration":"taqūma","translation_bn":"তুমি দাঁড়াবে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَامَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73570,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ ۚ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার (সালাতের জন্যে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73572,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73573,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"رِجَالٌۭ","transliteration":"rijālun","translation_bn":"(এমন) লোক","root":"رجل","lemma":"رِجَال","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73574,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّونَ","transliteration":"yuḥibbūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) পছন্দ করে","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73575,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":73576,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"يَتَطَهَّرُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"yataṭahharū","translation_bn":"তারা ভালোভাবে পবিত্রতা অর্জন করবে","root":"طهر","lemma":"تَطَهَّرْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73578,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73579,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يُحِبُّ","transliteration":"yuḥibbu","translation_bn":"পছন্দ করেন","root":"حبب","lemma":"أَحْبَبْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73580,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُطَّهِّرِينَ","transliteration":"l-muṭahirīna","translation_bn":"পবিত্রতা অর্জনকারীদেরকে","root":"طهر","lemma":"مُطَّهِّرِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73581,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"١٠٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā taqum fīhi abadan lamasjidun ussisa ʿalā l-taqwā min awwali yawmin aḥaqqu an taqūma fīhi fīhi rijālun yuḥibbūna an yataṭahharū wal-lahu yuḥibbu l-muṭahirīna', 'তুমি ওর ভিতরে কক্ষনো দাঁড়াবে না। প্রথম দিন থেকেই যে মাসজিদের ভিত্তি তাকওয়ার উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত, তোমার দাঁড়ানোর জন্য সেটাই অধিক উপযুক্ত, সেখানে এমন সব লোক আছে যারা পবিত্রতা লাভ করতে ভালবাসে, আর আল্লাহ পবিত্রতা লাভকারীদের ভালবাসেন।', 'Do not stand [for prayer] within it - ever. A mosque founded on righteousness from the first day is more worthy for you to stand in. Within it are men who love to purify themselves; and Allah loves those who purify themselves.', 'তুমি ওর ভিতরে কক্ষনো দাঁড়াবে না। প্রথম দিন থেকেই যে মাসজিদের ভিত্তি তাকওয়ার উপর প্রতিষ্ঠিত, তোমার দাঁড়ানোর জন্য সেটাই অধিক উপযুক্ত, সেখানে এমন সব লোক আছে যারা পবিত্রতা লাভ করতে ভালবাসে, আর আল্লাহ পবিত্রতা লাভকারীদের ভালবাসেন।', 'Do not stand [for prayer] within it - ever. A mosque founded on righteousness from the first day is more worthy for you to stand in. Within it are men who love to purify themselves; and Allah loves those who purify themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009108.mp3', now()),
  (9, 109, '', '[{"id":73751,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَفَمَنْ","transliteration":"afaman","translation_bn":"কি তবে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":73752,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَسَّسَ","transliteration":"assasa","translation_bn":"ভিত্তি স্হাপন করেছে","root":"اسس","lemma":"أَسَّسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73753,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بُنْيَـٰنَهُۥ","transliteration":"bun''yānahu","translation_bn":"ঘরের তার","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنْيَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73754,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73755,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تَقْوَىٰ","transliteration":"taqwā","translation_bn":"তাকওয়ার","root":"وقي","lemma":"تَقْوَى","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73756,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73757,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":73758,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَرِضْوَٰنٍ","transliteration":"wariḍ''wānin","translation_bn":"ও তাঁর সন্তুষ্টির (জন্যে)","root":"رضو","lemma":"رِضْوَٰن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73759,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":73760,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَم","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"না কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73761,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مَّنْ","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":73762,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَسَّسَ","transliteration":"assasa","translation_bn":"ভিত্তি স্হাপন করেছে","root":"اسس","lemma":"أَسَّسَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73763,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بُنْيَـٰنَهُۥ","transliteration":"bun''yānahu","translation_bn":"ঘরের তার","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنْيَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73764,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73765,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"شَفَا","transliteration":"shafā","translation_bn":"কিনারার","root":"شفو","lemma":"شَفَا","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73766,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"جُرُفٍ","transliteration":"jurufin","translation_bn":"খাদের","root":"جرف","lemma":"جُرُف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73767,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"هَارٍۢ","transliteration":"hārin","translation_bn":"পড়ন্ত","root":"هور","lemma":"هَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73768,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنْهَارَ","transliteration":"fa-in''hāra","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তা পড়লো","root":"هور","lemma":"ٱنْهَارَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73769,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সহ তাকে","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73770,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":73771,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"نَارِ","transliteration":"nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":73772,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"جَهَنَّمَ ۗ","transliteration":"jahannama","translation_bn":"জাহান্নামের","root":"—","lemma":"جَهَنَّم","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":73774,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"এবং আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":73775,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":73776,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":73777,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","transliteration":"l-qawma","translation_bn":"(এমন)সম্প্রদায়কে","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73778,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"(যারা)সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":73779,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"١٠٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১০৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٠٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'afaman assasa bun''yānahu ʿalā taqwā mina l-lahi wariḍ''wānin khayrun am man assasa bun''yānahu ʿalā shafā jurufin hārin fa-in''hāra bihi fī nāri jahannama wal-lahu lā yahdī l-qawma l-ẓālimīna', 'কে উত্তম যে তার ভিত্তি আল্লাহভীরুতা ও আল্লাহর সন্তুষ্টির উপর স্থাপন করে সে, না ঐ ব্যক্তি যে তার ভিত্তি স্থাপন করে পতনোম্মুখ একটি ধসের কিনারায় যা তাকে নিয়ে জাহান্নামের আগুনে ধসে পড়বে? আল্লাহ যালিমদের সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন না।', 'Then is one who laid the foundation of his building on righteousness [with fear] from Allah and [seeking] His approval better or one who laid the foundation of his building on the edge of a bank about to collapse, so it collapsed with him into the fire of Hell? And Allah does not guide the wrongdoing people.', 'কে উত্তম যে তার ভিত্তি আল্লাহভীরুতা ও আল্লাহর সন্তুষ্টির উপর স্থাপন করে সে, না ঐ ব্যক্তি যে তার ভিত্তি স্থাপন করে পতনোম্মুখ একটি ধসের কিনারায় যা তাকে নিয়ে জাহান্নামের আগুনে ধসে পড়বে? আল্লাহ যালিমদের সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন না।', 'Then is one who laid the foundation of his building on righteousness [with fear] from Allah and [seeking] His approval better or one who laid the foundation of his building on the edge of a bank about to collapse, so it collapsed with him into the fire of Hell? And Allah does not guide the wrongdoing people.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009109.mp3', now()),
  (9, 110, '', '[{"id":74145,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":74146,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَزَالُ","transliteration":"yazālu","translation_bn":"সর্বদা হয়ে থাকবে","root":"زيل","lemma":"زَالَت","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74147,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بُنْيَـٰنُهُمُ","transliteration":"bun''yānuhumu","translation_bn":"ঘর তাদের","root":"بني","lemma":"بُنْيَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74148,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":74149,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"بَنَوْا۟","transliteration":"banaw","translation_bn":"তারা বানিয়েছে","root":"بني","lemma":"بَنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74150,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رِيبَةًۭ","transliteration":"rībatan","translation_bn":"সন্দেহের কারণ (বীজ)","root":"ريب","lemma":"رِيبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74151,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74152,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"অন্তরের তাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74153,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"যে পর্যন্ত না","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":74154,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":74155,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَقَطَّعَ","transliteration":"taqaṭṭaʿa","translation_bn":"ছিন্নভিন্ন হবে","root":"قطع","lemma":"تَّقَطَّعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74156,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبُهُمْ ۗ","transliteration":"qulūbuhum","translation_bn":"অন্তর তাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74158,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74159,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"সবকিছু জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":74160,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"حَكِيمٌ","transliteration":"ḥakīmun","translation_bn":"মহাবিজ্ঞ","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":74161,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١١٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১১০)","root":"—","lemma":"١١٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lā yazālu bun''yānuhumu alladhī banaw rībatan fī qulūbihim illā an taqaṭṭaʿa qulūbuhum wal-lahu ʿalīmun ḥakīmun', 'তাদের তৈরি ঘরটি তাদের অন্তরে সদা-সর্বদা সন্দেহের উদ্রেক করে যাবে যে পর্যন্ত না তাদের হৃদয়গুলো ছিন্ন ভিন্ন হয়ে যায়। আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, মহা প্রজ্ঞাময়।', 'Their building which they built will not cease to be a [cause of] skepticism in their hearts until their hearts are stopped. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', 'তাদের তৈরি ঘরটি তাদের অন্তরে সদা-সর্বদা সন্দেহের উদ্রেক করে যাবে যে পর্যন্ত না তাদের হৃদয়গুলো ছিন্ন ভিন্ন হয়ে যায়। আল্লাহ সর্বজ্ঞ, মহা প্রজ্ঞাময়।', 'Their building which they built will not cease to be a [cause of] skepticism in their hearts until their hearts are stopped. And Allah is Knowing and Wise.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009110.mp3', now()),
  (9, 111, '', '[{"id":74514,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":74515,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":74516,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱشْتَرَىٰ","transliteration":"ish''tarā","translation_bn":"কিনে নিয়েছেন","root":"شري","lemma":"ٱشْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74517,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74518,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74519,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَهُمْ","transliteration":"anfusahum","translation_bn":"জীবনকে তাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":74520,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمْوَٰلَهُم","transliteration":"wa-amwālahum","translation_bn":"ও ধনসম্পদকে তাদের","root":"مول","lemma":"مَال","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":74521,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّ","transliteration":"bi-anna","translation_bn":"বিনিময়ে যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74522,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":74523,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-janata","translation_bn":"জান্নাত","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":74525,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُقَـٰتِلُونَ","transliteration":"yuqātilūna","translation_bn":"তারা লড়াই করে","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَٰتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":74526,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فِى","tran