oun)"},{"id":76455,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"ও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76456,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"نَصَبٌۭ","transliteration":"naṣabun","translation_bn":"(এমন)ক্লান্তি","root":"نصب","lemma":"نَصَب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76457,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76458,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"مَخْمَصَةٌۭ","transliteration":"makhmaṣatun","translation_bn":"(এমন) ক্ষুধা","root":"خمص","lemma":"مَخْمَصَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76459,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76460,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"سَبِيلِ","transliteration":"sabīli","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"سبل","lemma":"سَبِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76461,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76462,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76463,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"يَطَـُٔونَ","transliteration":"yaṭaūna","translation_bn":"পদক্ষেপ নেয়","root":"وطا","lemma":"يَطَـ#ُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76464,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"مَوْطِئًۭا","transliteration":"mawṭi-an","translation_bn":"(এমন) পদক্ষেপ","root":"وطا","lemma":"مَوْطِئ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76465,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"يَغِيظُ","transliteration":"yaghīẓu","translation_bn":"(যা) রাগান্বিত করে","root":"غيظ","lemma":"يَغِيظُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76466,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكُفَّارَ","transliteration":"l-kufāra","translation_bn":"কাফেরদেরকে","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَافِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76467,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76468,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"يَنَالُونَ","transliteration":"yanālūna","translation_bn":"তারা পায়","root":"نيل","lemma":"يَنَالُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76469,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76470,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"عَدُوٍّۢ","transliteration":"ʿaduwwin","translation_bn":"শত্রুর","root":"عدو","lemma":"عَدُوّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76471,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"نَّيْلًا","transliteration":"naylan","translation_bn":"কোনো প্রাপ্তি","root":"نيل","lemma":"نَّيْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76472,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":76473,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"كُتِبَ","transliteration":"kutiba","translation_bn":"লেখা হয়","root":"كتب","lemma":"كَتَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76474,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76475,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"বিনিময়ে এর","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76476,"position":45,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلٌۭ","transliteration":"ʿamalun","translation_bn":"কাজ","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76477,"position":46,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰلِحٌ ۚ","transliteration":"ṣāliḥun","translation_bn":"ভালো","root":"صلح","lemma":"صَٰلِح","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":76479,"position":47,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"লিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76480,"position":48,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76481,"position":49,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":76482,"position":50,"text_uthmani":"يُضِيعُ","transliteration":"yuḍīʿu","translation_bn":"নষ্ট করেন","root":"ضيع","lemma":"أَضَاعُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76483,"position":51,"text_uthmani":"أَجْرَ","transliteration":"ajra","translation_bn":"প্রতিফল","root":"اجر","lemma":"أَجْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76484,"position":52,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ","transliteration":"l-muḥ''sinīna","translation_bn":"সৎকর্মশীলদের","root":"حسن","lemma":"مُحْسِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76485,"position":53,"text_uthmani":"١٢٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২০)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'mā kāna li-ahli l-madīnati waman ḥawlahum mina l-aʿrābi an yatakhallafū ʿan rasūli l-lahi walā yarghabū bi-anfusihim ʿan nafsihi dhālika bi-annahum lā yuṣībuhum ẓama-on walā naṣabun walā makhmaṣatun fī sabīli l-lahi walā yaṭaūna mawṭi-an yaghīẓu l-kufāra walā yanālūna min ʿaduwwin naylan illā kutiba lahum bihi ʿamalun ṣāliḥun inna l-laha lā yuḍīʿu ajra l-muḥ''sinīna', 'মাদীনাবাসী ও তার চতুষ্পার্শ্বস্থ বেদুঈনদের জন্য উচিত নয় আল্লাহর রসূলের (সঙ্গ বাদ দিয়ে) পেছনে থেকে যাওয়া আর নিজেদের জীবনকে তাঁর জীবনের চেয়ে প্রিয় জ্ঞান করা। কেননা এমন কক্ষনো হবে না যে, তারা আল্লাহর পথে তৃষ্ণা, দৈহিক ক্লেশ ও ক্ষুধা ভোগ করবে, আর কাফিরদের ক্রোধ উদ্রেককারী কোন পদক্ষেপ গ্রহণ করবে আর শত্রুদের নিকট থেকে কিছু লাভ করবে আর তার বিনিময়ে তাদের জন্য কোন নেক ‘আমাল লেখা হবে না (অবশ্যই লেখা হবে)। নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ সৎকর্মশীলদের প্রতিফল বিনষ্ট করেন না।', 'It was not [proper] for the people of Madinah and those surrounding them of the bedouins that they remain behind after [the departure of] the Messenger of Allah or that they prefer themselves over his self. That is because they are not afflicted by thirst or fatigue or hunger in the cause of Allah, nor do they tread on any ground that enrages the disbelievers, nor do they inflict upon an enemy any infliction but that is registered for them as a righteous deed. Indeed, Allah does not allow to be lost the reward of the doers of good.', 'মাদীনাবাসী ও তার চতুষ্পার্শ্বস্থ বেদুঈনদের জন্য উচিত নয় আল্লাহর রসূলের (সঙ্গ বাদ দিয়ে) পেছনে থেকে যাওয়া আর নিজেদের জীবনকে তাঁর জীবনের চেয়ে প্রিয় জ্ঞান করা। কেননা এমন কক্ষনো হবে না যে, তারা আল্লাহর পথে তৃষ্ণা, দৈহিক ক্লেশ ও ক্ষুধা ভোগ করবে, আর কাফিরদের ক্রোধ উদ্রেককারী কোন পদক্ষেপ গ্রহণ করবে আর শত্রুদের নিকট থেকে কিছু লাভ করবে আর তার বিনিময়ে তাদের জন্য কোন নেক ‘আমাল লেখা হবে না (অবশ্যই লেখা হবে)। নিশ্চয় আল্লাহ সৎকর্মশীলদের প্রতিফল বিনষ্ট করেন না।', 'It was not [proper] for the people of Madinah and those surrounding them of the bedouins that they remain behind after [the departure of] the Messenger of Allah or that they prefer themselves over his self. That is because they are not afflicted by thirst or fatigue or hunger in the cause of Allah, nor do they tread on any ground that enrages the disbelievers, nor do they inflict upon an enemy any infliction but that is registered for them as a righteous deed. Indeed, Allah does not allow to be lost the reward of the doers of good.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009120.mp3', now()),
  (9, 121, '', '[{"id":76630,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76631,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُنفِقُونَ","transliteration":"yunfiqūna","translation_bn":"তারা ব্যয় করে","root":"نفق","lemma":"أَنفَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76632,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"نَفَقَةًۭ","transliteration":"nafaqatan","translation_bn":"(এমন) কোনো ব্যয়","root":"نفق","lemma":"نَفَقَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76633,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"صَغِيرَةًۭ","transliteration":"ṣaghīratan","translation_bn":"ছোট","root":"صغر","lemma":"صَغِيرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":76634,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76635,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَبِيرَةًۭ","transliteration":"kabīratan","translation_bn":"বড়","root":"كبر","lemma":"كَبِيرَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76636,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76637,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَقْطَعُونَ","transliteration":"yaqṭaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা অতিক্রম করে","root":"قطع","lemma":"قُطِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76638,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَادِيًا","transliteration":"wādiyan","translation_bn":"(এমন) উপত্যকা","root":"ودي","lemma":"وَادِي","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76639,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া যে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":76640,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كُتِبَ","transliteration":"kutiba","translation_bn":"লেখা হয়","root":"كتب","lemma":"كَتَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76641,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمْ","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76642,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِيَجْزِيَهُمُ","transliteration":"liyajziyahumu","translation_bn":"যেন প্রতিফল দেন তাদেরকে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76643,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76644,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَحْسَنَ","transliteration":"aḥsana","translation_bn":"অতি উত্তম","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76645,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":76646,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76647,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তারা কাজ করতে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76648,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٢١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২১)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā yunfiqūna nafaqatan ṣaghīratan walā kabīratan walā yaqṭaʿūna wādiyan illā kutiba lahum liyajziyahumu l-lahu aḥsana mā kānū yaʿmalūna', 'আর এটাও হবে না যে, তারা কম বা বেশী মাল (আল্লাহর পথে) খরচ করবে আর (জিহাদে) তারা কোন উপত্যকা অতিক্রম করবে অথচ তা তাদের নামে লেখা হবে না (অবশ্যই লেখা হবে) যাতে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে তাদের কাজের উৎকৃষ্ট প্রতিদান দিতে পারেন।', 'Nor do they spend an expenditure, small or large, or cross a valley but that it is registered for them that Allah may reward them for the best of what they were doing.', 'আর এটাও হবে না যে, তারা কম বা বেশী মাল (আল্লাহর পথে) খরচ করবে আর (জিহাদে) তারা কোন উপত্যকা অতিক্রম করবে অথচ তা তাদের নামে লেখা হবে না (অবশ্যই লেখা হবে) যাতে আল্লাহ তাদেরকে তাদের কাজের উৎকৃষ্ট প্রতিদান দিতে পারেন।', 'Nor do they spend an expenditure, small or large, or cross a valley but that it is registered for them that Allah may reward them for the best of what they were doing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009121.mp3', now()),
  (9, 122, '', '[{"id":76733,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76734,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"সঙ্গত (ছিলো)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76735,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"l-mu''minūna","translation_bn":"মু''মিনদের (জন্যে যে)","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76736,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِيَنفِرُوا۟","transliteration":"liyanfirū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা বের হবে","root":"نفر","lemma":"نَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76737,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"كَآفَّةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"kāffatan","translation_bn":"সবাই (একযোগে)","root":"كفف","lemma":"كَا^فَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76739,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلَوْلَا","transliteration":"falawlā","translation_bn":"আর কেন না","root":"—","lemma":"لَوْلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76740,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَفَرَ","transliteration":"nafara","translation_bn":"বের হলো","root":"نفر","lemma":"نَفَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76741,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76742,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76743,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِرْقَةٍۢ","transliteration":"fir''qatin","translation_bn":"দলের","root":"فرق","lemma":"فِرْقَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76744,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُمْ","transliteration":"min''hum","translation_bn":"মধ্য থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76745,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"طَآئِفَةٌۭ","transliteration":"ṭāifatun","translation_bn":"একটি অংশ","root":"طوف","lemma":"طَا^ئِفَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76746,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لِّيَتَفَقَّهُوا۟","transliteration":"liyatafaqqahū","translation_bn":"যেন তারা গভীর জ্ঞান অনুশীলন করতো","root":"فقه","lemma":"يَتَفَقَّهُ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76747,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"ব্যাপারে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76748,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"l-dīni","translation_bn":"দীনের","root":"دين","lemma":"دِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76749,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلِيُنذِرُوا۟","transliteration":"waliyundhirū","translation_bn":"এবং যেন তারা সতর্ক করে","root":"نذر","lemma":"أَنذَرَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76750,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمَهُمْ","transliteration":"qawmahum","translation_bn":"সম্প্রদায়কে তাদের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76751,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":76752,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"رَجَعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"rajaʿū","translation_bn":"তারা ফিরে যায়","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76753,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْهِمْ","transliteration":"ilayhim","translation_bn":"দিকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76754,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَعَلَّهُمْ","transliteration":"laʿallahum","translation_bn":"যাতে তারা(এভাবে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَعَلّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76755,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَحْذَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaḥdharūna","translation_bn":"(ইসলাম বিরোধী কাজ থেকে) সতর্ক থাকে","root":"حذر","lemma":"يَحْذَرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76756,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"١٢٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২২)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kāna l-mu''minūna liyanfirū kāffatan falawlā nafara min kulli fir''qatin min''hum ṭāifatun liyatafaqqahū fī l-dīni waliyundhirū qawmahum idhā rajaʿū ilayhim laʿallahum yaḥdharūna', 'মু’মিনদের সকলের একসঙ্গে অভিযানে বের হওয়া ঠিক নয়। তাদের প্রত্যেক দল থেকে একটি অংশ কেন বের হয় না যাতে তারা দ্বীন সম্পর্কে জ্ঞানের অনুশীলন করতে পারে এবং ফিরে আসার পর তাদের সম্প্রদায়কে সতর্ক করতে পারে যাতে তারা (অসদাচরণ) থেকে বিরত হয়?', 'And it is not for the believers to go forth [to battle] all at once. For there should separate from every division of them a group [remaining] to obtain understanding in the religion and warn their people when they return to them that they might be cautious.', 'মু’মিনদের সকলের একসঙ্গে অভিযানে বের হওয়া ঠিক নয়। তাদের প্রত্যেক দল থেকে একটি অংশ কেন বের হয় না যাতে তারা দ্বীন সম্পর্কে জ্ঞানের অনুশীলন করতে পারে এবং ফিরে আসার পর তাদের সম্প্রদায়কে সতর্ক করতে পারে যাতে তারা (অসদাচরণ) থেকে বিরত হয়?', 'And it is not for the believers to go forth [to battle] all at once. For there should separate from every division of them a group [remaining] to obtain understanding in the religion and warn their people when they return to them that they might be cautious.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009122.mp3', now()),
  (9, 123, '', '[{"id":76884,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":76885,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":76886,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছো","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76887,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قَـٰتِلُوا۟","transliteration":"qātilū","translation_bn":"তোমরা যুদ্ধ করো","root":"قتل","lemma":"قَٰتَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76888,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের বিরুদ্ধে) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":76889,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَلُونَكُم","transliteration":"yalūnakum","translation_bn":"কাছাকাছি আছে তোমাদের","root":"ولي","lemma":"يَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":76890,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"মধ্যে হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76891,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكُفَّارِ","transliteration":"l-kufāri","translation_bn":"কাফেরদের","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَافِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76892,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلْيَجِدُوا۟","transliteration":"walyajidū","translation_bn":"ও যেন তারা পায়","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76893,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِيكُمْ","transliteration":"fīkum","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":76894,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"غِلْظَةًۭ ۚ","transliteration":"ghil''ẓatan","translation_bn":"কঠোরতা","root":"غلظ","lemma":"غِلْظَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":76896,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟","transliteration":"wa-iʿ''lamū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা জেনে রাখো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":76897,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":76898,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":76899,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَعَ","transliteration":"maʿa","translation_bn":"সাথে (আছেন)","root":"—","lemma":"مَع","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":76900,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُتَّقِينَ","transliteration":"l-mutaqīna","translation_bn":"মুত্তাকীদের","root":"وقي","lemma":"مُتَّقِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":76901,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٢٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৩)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā alladhīna āmanū qātilū alladhīna yalūnakum mina l-kufāri walyajidū fīkum ghil''ẓatan wa-iʿ''lamū anna l-laha maʿa l-mutaqīna', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! যে সব কাফির তোমাদের নিকটবর্তী তাদের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ কর, যাতে তারা তোমাদের মধ্যে দৃঢ়তা দেখতে পায়, আর জেনে রেখ যে, আল্লাহ মুত্তাকীদের সঙ্গে আছেন।', 'O you who have believed, fight those adjacent to you of the disbelievers and let them find in you harshness. And know that Allah is with the righteous.', 'হে মু’মিনগণ! যে সব কাফির তোমাদের নিকটবর্তী তাদের বিরুদ্ধে যুদ্ধ কর, যাতে তারা তোমাদের মধ্যে দৃঢ়তা দেখতে পায়, আর জেনে রেখ যে, আল্লাহ মুত্তাকীদের সঙ্গে আছেন।', 'O you who have believed, fight those adjacent to you of the disbelievers and let them find in you harshness. And know that Allah is with the righteous.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009123.mp3', now()),
  (9, 124, '', '[{"id":77101,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77102,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77103,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَتْ","transliteration":"unzilat","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করা হয়","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77104,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سُورَةٌۭ","transliteration":"sūratun","translation_bn":"কোনো সূরাহ","root":"سور","lemma":"سُورَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77105,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"famin''hum","translation_bn":"তখন মধ্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77106,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77107,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُ","transliteration":"yaqūlu","translation_bn":"বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77108,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَيُّكُمْ","transliteration":"ayyukum","translation_bn":"\"মধ্যে কার তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"أَىّ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":77109,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"زَادَتْهُ","transliteration":"zādathu","translation_bn":"বৃদ্ধি করেছে তার","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77110,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"hādhihi","translation_bn":"এটা (দিয়ে)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":77111,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِيمَـٰنًۭا ۚ","transliteration":"īmānan","translation_bn":"ঈমান\"","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77113,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"فَأَمَّا","transliteration":"fa-ammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর আর বাস্তবিকই","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77114,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":77115,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77116,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَزَادَتْهُمْ","transliteration":"fazādathum","translation_bn":"তখন তা তাদের বৃদ্ধি করেছে","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77117,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"إِيمَـٰنًۭا","transliteration":"īmānan","translation_bn":"ঈমান","root":"امن","lemma":"إِيمَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77118,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77119,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَبْشِرُونَ","transliteration":"yastabshirūna","translation_bn":"আনন্দিত হয়","root":"بشر","lemma":"يَسْتَبْشِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77120,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā mā unzilat sūratun famin''hum man yaqūlu ayyukum zādathu hādhihi īmānan fa-ammā alladhīna āmanū fazādathum īmānan wahum yastabshirūna', 'যখনই কোন সূরাহ নাযিল হয় তখন তাদের কতক লোক (বিদ্রূপ করে) বলে- ‘‘এতে তোমাদের কার ঈমান বৃদ্ধি হল?’’(মুনাফিকরা জেনে রাখুক) যারাই ঈমান এনেছে তাদের ঈমান বৃদ্ধি হয় আর তারা এতে আনন্দিত হয়।', 'And whenever a surah is revealed, there are among the hypocrites those who say, "Which of you has this increased faith?" As for those who believed, it has increased them in faith, while they are rejoicing.', 'যখনই কোন সূরাহ নাযিল হয় তখন তাদের কতক লোক (বিদ্রূপ করে) বলে- ‘‘এতে তোমাদের কার ঈমান বৃদ্ধি হল?’’(মুনাফিকরা জেনে রাখুক) যারাই ঈমান এনেছে তাদের ঈমান বৃদ্ধি হয় আর তারা এতে আনন্দিত হয়।', 'And whenever a surah is revealed, there are among the hypocrites those who say, "Which of you has this increased faith?" As for those who believed, it has increased them in faith, while they are rejoicing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009124.mp3', now()),
  (9, 125, '', '[{"id":77232,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَأَمَّا","transliteration":"wa-ammā","translation_bn":"আর পক্ষান্তরে","root":"—","lemma":"أَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77233,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যাদের","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":77234,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77235,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبِهِم","transliteration":"qulūbihim","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহে তাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77236,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّرَضٌۭ","transliteration":"maraḍun","translation_bn":"রোগ","root":"مرض","lemma":"مَّرَض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77237,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَزَادَتْهُمْ","transliteration":"fazādathum","translation_bn":"তখন তা তাদের বৃদ্ধি করেছে","root":"زيد","lemma":"زَادَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77238,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رِجْسًا","transliteration":"rij''san","translation_bn":"কলুষতার","root":"رجس","lemma":"رِجْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77239,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"সাথে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77240,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"رِجْسِهِمْ","transliteration":"rij''sihim","translation_bn":"কলুষতা তাদের","root":"رجس","lemma":"رِجْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77241,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَاتُوا۟","transliteration":"wamātū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা মারা গিয়েছে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّاتَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77242,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এ অবস্থায় যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"অবস্থাবাচক (Circumstantial)"},{"id":77243,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كَـٰفِرُونَ","transliteration":"kāfirūna","translation_bn":"কাফের (থাকবে)","root":"كفر","lemma":"كَٰفِرُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77244,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"١٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-ammā alladhīna fī qulūbihim maraḍun fazādathum rij''san ilā rij''sihim wamātū wahum kāfirūna', 'আর যাদের অন্তরে ব্যাধি আছে তাদের নাপাকীর উপর আরো নাপাকী বাড়িয়ে দেয় (প্রতিটি নতুন সূরা), আর তাদের মৃত্যু হয় কাফির অবস্থায়।', 'But as for those in whose hearts is disease, it has [only] increased them in evil [in addition] to their evil. And they will have died while they are disbelievers.', 'আর যাদের অন্তরে ব্যাধি আছে তাদের নাপাকীর উপর আরো নাপাকী বাড়িয়ে দেয় (প্রতিটি নতুন সূরা), আর তাদের মৃত্যু হয় কাফির অবস্থায়।', 'But as for those in whose hearts is disease, it has [only] increased them in evil [in addition] to their evil. And they will have died while they are disbelievers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009125.mp3', now()),
  (9, 126, '', '[{"id":77295,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَوَلَا","transliteration":"awalā","translation_bn":"কি না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":77296,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَرَوْنَ","transliteration":"yarawna","translation_bn":"তারা দেখে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77297,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":77298,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يُفْتَنُونَ","transliteration":"yuf''tanūna","translation_bn":"পরীক্ষায় নিক্ষিপ্ত হয়","root":"فتن","lemma":"فَتَنُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77299,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77300,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُلِّ","transliteration":"kulli","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77301,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَامٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿāmin","translation_bn":"বছরে","root":"عوم","lemma":"عَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77302,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَّرَّةً","transliteration":"marratan","translation_bn":"একবার","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77303,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77304,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَرَّتَيْنِ","transliteration":"marratayni","translation_bn":"দু''বার","root":"مرر","lemma":"مَرَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77305,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপরও","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77306,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":77307,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَتُوبُونَ","transliteration":"yatūbūna","translation_bn":"তারা তওবা করে","root":"توب","lemma":"تَابَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77308,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77309,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":77310,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَذَّكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yadhakkarūna","translation_bn":"শিক্ষা নেয়","root":"ذكر","lemma":"تَذَكَّرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77311,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"١٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'awalā yarawna annahum yuf''tanūna fī kulli ʿāmin marratan aw marratayni thumma lā yatūbūna walā hum yadhakkarūna', 'তারা কি দেখে না যে, প্রতি বছরই তাদেরকে একবার বা দু’বার পরীক্ষায় ফেলা হয়; তারপরেও তারা তাওবাও করে না, আর শিক্ষাও গ্রহণ করে না।', 'Do they not see that they are tried every year once or twice but then they do not repent nor do they remember?', 'তারা কি দেখে না যে, প্রতি বছরই তাদেরকে একবার বা দু’বার পরীক্ষায় ফেলা হয়; তারপরেও তারা তাওবাও করে না, আর শিক্ষাও গ্রহণ করে না।', 'Do they not see that they are tried every year once or twice but then they do not repent nor do they remember?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009126.mp3', now()),
  (9, 127, '', '[{"id":77433,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِذَا","transliteration":"wa-idhā","translation_bn":"এবং যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77434,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77435,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أُنزِلَتْ","transliteration":"unzilat","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ হয়","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77436,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"سُورَةٌۭ","transliteration":"sūratun","translation_bn":"কোনো সূরাহ","root":"سور","lemma":"سُورَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77437,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَّظَرَ","transliteration":"naẓara","translation_bn":"দেখে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77438,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضُهُمْ","transliteration":"baʿḍuhum","translation_bn":"একে তাদের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77439,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77440,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضٍ","transliteration":"baʿḍin","translation_bn":"অন্যের","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77441,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"\"(তারা ইশারায় বলে) কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":77442,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَرَىٰكُم","transliteration":"yarākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের দেখছে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77443,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77444,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَحَدٍۢ","transliteration":"aḥadin","translation_bn":"একজন\"","root":"احد","lemma":"أَحَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77445,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77446,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱنصَرَفُوا۟ ۚ","transliteration":"inṣarafū","translation_bn":"তারা সরে পড়ে","root":"صرف","lemma":"ٱنصَرَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77448,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"صَرَفَ","transliteration":"ṣarafa","translation_bn":"ফিরিয়ে দিয়েছেন","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77449,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77450,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"قُلُوبَهُم","transliteration":"qulūbahum","translation_bn":"অন্তরগুলোকে তাদের","root":"قلب","lemma":"قَلْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77451,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"bi-annahum","translation_bn":"কারণ তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77452,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمٌۭ","transliteration":"qawmun","translation_bn":"(এমন)সম্প্রদায়","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77453,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"(যে) না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":77454,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يَفْقَهُونَ","transliteration":"yafqahūna","translation_bn":"তারা বুঝে","root":"فقه","lemma":"يَفْقَهُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77455,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"١٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā mā unzilat sūratun naẓara baʿḍuhum ilā baʿḍin hal yarākum min aḥadin thumma inṣarafū ṣarafa l-lahu qulūbahum bi-annahum qawmun lā yafqahūna', 'যখনই কোন সূরাহ নাযিল হয় তখনই তারা পরস্পরে চোখ চাওয়া-চাওয়ি করে আর (ইঙ্গিতে জিজ্ঞেস করে) ‘তোমাদেরকে কেউ দেখছে না তো?’’ অতঃপর তারা চুপিসারে সরে পড়ে। আল্লাহ তাদের অন্তরকে (সত্য পথ থেকে) ফিরিয়ে দিয়েছেন, কেননা তারা এমনই এক সম্প্রদায় যারা বুঝে না।', 'And whenever a surah is revealed, they look at each other, [saying], "Does anyone see you?" and then they dismiss themselves. Allah has dismissed their hearts because they are a people who do not understand.', 'যখনই কোন সূরাহ নাযিল হয় তখনই তারা পরস্পরে চোখ চাওয়া-চাওয়ি করে আর (ইঙ্গিতে জিজ্ঞেস করে) ‘তোমাদেরকে কেউ দেখছে না তো?’’ অতঃপর তারা চুপিসারে সরে পড়ে। আল্লাহ তাদের অন্তরকে (সত্য পথ থেকে) ফিরিয়ে দিয়েছেন, কেননা তারা এমনই এক সম্প্রদায় যারা বুঝে না।', 'And whenever a surah is revealed, they look at each other, [saying], "Does anyone see you?" and then they dismiss themselves. Allah has dismissed their hearts because they are a people who do not understand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009127.mp3', now()),
  (9, 128, '', '[{"id":77689,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَقَدْ","transliteration":"laqad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":77690,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكُمْ","transliteration":"jāakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে এসেছে তোমাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77691,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولٌۭ","transliteration":"rasūlun","translation_bn":"একজন রাসূল","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77692,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77693,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسِكُمْ","transliteration":"anfusikum","translation_bn":"নিজেদের তোমাদের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77694,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَزِيزٌ","transliteration":"ʿazīzun","translation_bn":"কষ্টদায়ক","root":"عزز","lemma":"عَزِيز","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":77695,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"কাছে তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77696,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":77697,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عَنِتُّمْ","transliteration":"ʿanittum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হও","root":"عنت","lemma":"عَنِ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77698,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"حَرِيصٌ","transliteration":"ḥarīṣun","translation_bn":"সে কল্যাণকামী","root":"حرص","lemma":"حَرِيص","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77699,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُم","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77700,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"bil-mu''minīna","translation_bn":"সাথে মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77701,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَءُوفٌۭ","transliteration":"raūfun","translation_bn":"স্নেহশীল","root":"راف","lemma":"رَءُوف","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":77702,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَّحِيمٌۭ","transliteration":"raḥīmun","translation_bn":"পরম দয়ালু","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَّحِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":77703,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'laqad jāakum rasūlun min anfusikum ʿazīzun ʿalayhi mā ʿanittum ḥarīṣun ʿalaykum bil-mu''minīna raūfun raḥīmun', 'তোমাদের মধ্য থেকেই তোমাদের নিকট একজন রসূল এসেছেন, তোমাদেরকে যা কিছু কষ্ট দেয় তা তার নিকট খুবই কষ্টদায়ক। সে তোমাদের কল্যাণকামী, মু’মিনদের প্রতি করুণাসিক্ত, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'There has certainly come to you a Messenger from among yourselves. Grievous to him is what you suffer; [he is] concerned over you and to the believers is kind and merciful.', 'তোমাদের মধ্য থেকেই তোমাদের নিকট একজন রসূল এসেছেন, তোমাদেরকে যা কিছু কষ্ট দেয় তা তার নিকট খুবই কষ্টদায়ক। সে তোমাদের কল্যাণকামী, মু’মিনদের প্রতি করুণাসিক্ত, বড়ই দয়ালু।', 'There has certainly come to you a Messenger from among yourselves. Grievous to him is what you suffer; [he is] concerned over you and to the believers is kind and merciful.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009128.mp3', now()),
  (9, 129, '', '[{"id":77833,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَإِن","transliteration":"fa-in","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77834,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَوَلَّوْا۟","transliteration":"tawallaw","translation_bn":"তারা ফিরে যায়","root":"ولي","lemma":"تَوَلَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77835,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَقُلْ","transliteration":"faqul","translation_bn":"তবে বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77836,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"حَسْبِىَ","transliteration":"ḥasbiya","translation_bn":"\"আমরা জন্যে যথেষ্ট","root":"حسب","lemma":"حَسْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77837,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":77838,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":77839,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَـٰهَ","transliteration":"ilāha","translation_bn":"কোনো ইলাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"إِلَٰه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77840,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":77841,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۖ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۖ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":77843,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":77844,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَوَكَّلْتُ ۖ","transliteration":"tawakkaltu","translation_bn":"আমি নির্ভর করেছি","root":"وكل","lemma":"تَوَكَّلْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":77846,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَهُوَ","transliteration":"wahuwa","translation_bn":"এবং তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُوَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":77847,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّ","transliteration":"rabbu","translation_bn":"রব/অধিপতি","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":77848,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَرْشِ","transliteration":"l-ʿarshi","translation_bn":"আরশের","root":"عرش","lemma":"عَرْش","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77849,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَظِيمِ","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmi","translation_bn":"মহান\"","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":77850,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"١٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"١٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fa-in tawallaw faqul ḥasbiya l-lahu lā ilāha illā huwa ʿalayhi tawakkaltu wahuwa rabbu l-ʿarshi l-ʿaẓīmi', 'এ সত্ত্বেও যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় তাহলে বলে দাও- আল্লাহ্ই আমার জন্য যথেষ্ট, তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, তাঁর উপরই আমি ভরসা করি, তিনি হলেন মহান আরশের মালিক।', 'But if they turn away, [O Muhammad], say, "Sufficient for me is Allah; there is no deity except Him. On Him I have relied, and He is the Lord of the Great Throne."', 'এ সত্ত্বেও যদি তারা মুখ ফিরিয়ে নেয় তাহলে বলে দাও- আল্লাহ্ই আমার জন্য যথেষ্ট, তিনি ছাড়া সত্যিকারের কোন ইলাহ নেই, তাঁর উপরই আমি ভরসা করি, তিনি হলেন মহান আরশের মালিক।', 'But if they turn away, [O Muhammad], say, "Sufficient for me is Allah; there is no deity except Him. On Him I have relied, and He is the Lord of the Great Throne."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/009129.mp3', now())
