"transliteration":"til''qāi","translation_bn":"পক্ষ","root":"لقي","lemma":"تِلْقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17528,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسِىٓ ۖ","transliteration":"nafsī","translation_bn":"নিজের আমার","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17530,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":17531,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"أَتَّبِعُ","transliteration":"attabiʿu","translation_bn":"আমি অনুসরণ করি","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17532,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":17533,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":17534,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"يُوحَىٰٓ","transliteration":"yūḥā","translation_bn":"ওহী করা হয়","root":"وحي","lemma":"أَوْحَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17535,"position":31,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىَّ ۖ","transliteration":"ilayya","translation_bn":"প্রতি আমার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":17537,"position":32,"text_uthmani":"إِنِّىٓ","transliteration":"innī","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই আমি","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":17538,"position":33,"text_uthmani":"أَخَافُ","transliteration":"akhāfu","translation_bn":"ভয় করি","root":"خوف","lemma":"خَافَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17539,"position":34,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":17540,"position":35,"text_uthmani":"عَصَيْتُ","transliteration":"ʿaṣaytu","translation_bn":"আমি অবাধ্যতা করি","root":"عصي","lemma":"عَصَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":17541,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّى","transliteration":"rabbī","translation_bn":"আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17542,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17543,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمٍ","transliteration":"yawmin","translation_bn":"দিনের\"","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":17544,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"عَظِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","translation_bn":"মহা\"","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":17545,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"١٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৫)","root":"—","lemma":"١٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-idhā tut''lā ʿalayhim āyātunā bayyinātin qāla alladhīna lā yarjūna liqāanā i''ti biqur''ānin ghayri hādhā aw baddil''hu qul mā yakūnu lī an ubaddilahu min til''qāi nafsī in attabiʿu illā mā yūḥā ilayya innī akhāfu in ʿaṣaytu rabbī ʿadhāba yawmin ʿaẓīmin', 'যখন আমার সুস্পষ্ট আয়াতগুলো তাদের কাছে পঠিত হয়, তখন যারা আমার সাক্ষাতের আশা রাখে না তারা বলে, ‘এটা বাদে অন্য আরেকটা কুরআন আন কিংবা ওটাকে বদলাও’। বল, ‘‘আমার নিজের ইচ্ছেমত ওটা বদলানো আমার কাজ নয়, আমার কাছে যা ওয়াহী করা হয় আমি কেবল সেটারই অনুসরণ করে থাকি। আমি আমার প্রতিপালকের অবাধ্যতা করলে এক অতি বড় বিভীষিকার দিনে আমি শাস্তির ভয় করি’’।', 'And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, those who do not expect the meeting with Us say, "Bring us a Qur''an other than this or change it." Say, [O Muhammad], "It is not for me to change it on my own accord. I only follow what is revealed to me. Indeed I fear, if I should disobey my Lord, the punishment of a tremendous Day."', 'যখন আমার সুস্পষ্ট আয়াতগুলো তাদের কাছে পঠিত হয়, তখন যারা আমার সাক্ষাতের আশা রাখে না তারা বলে, ‘এটা বাদে অন্য আরেকটা কুরআন আন কিংবা ওটাকে বদলাও’। বল, ‘‘আমার নিজের ইচ্ছেমত ওটা বদলানো আমার কাজ নয়, আমার কাছে যা ওয়াহী করা হয় আমি কেবল সেটারই অনুসরণ করে থাকি। আমি আমার প্রতিপালকের অবাধ্যতা করলে এক অতি বড় বিভীষিকার দিনে আমি শাস্তির ভয় করি’’।', 'And when Our verses are recited to them as clear evidences, those who do not expect the meeting with Us say, "Bring us a Qur''an other than this or change it." Say, [O Muhammad], "It is not for me to change it on my own accord. I only follow what is revealed to me. Indeed I fear, if I should disobey my Lord, the punishment of a tremendous Day."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010015.mp3', now()),
  (10, 16, '', '[{"id":18566,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18567,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّوْ","transliteration":"law","translation_bn":"\"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":18568,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"চাইতেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18569,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":18570,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":18571,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَلَوْتُهُۥ","transliteration":"talawtuhu","translation_bn":"আমি তিলাওয়াত করতাম তা","root":"تلو","lemma":"تَلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18572,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿalaykum","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18573,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَآ","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":18574,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَدْرَىٰكُم","transliteration":"adrākum","translation_bn":"তিনি জানাতেন তোমাদের","root":"دري","lemma":"أَدْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18575,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۖ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18577,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَقَدْ","transliteration":"faqad","translation_bn":"অতঃপর নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":18578,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَبِثْتُ","transliteration":"labith''tu","translation_bn":"আমি অবস্থান করেছি","root":"لبث","lemma":"لَبِثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18579,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِيكُمْ","transliteration":"fīkum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18580,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عُمُرًۭا","transliteration":"ʿumuran","translation_bn":"এক বয়স","root":"عمر","lemma":"عُمُر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18581,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":18582,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"qablihi","translation_bn":"পূর্ব এর","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":18584,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"কি তবুও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":18585,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿqilūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বুঝবে\"","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":18586,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"١٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৬)","root":"—","lemma":"١٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul law shāa l-lahu mā talawtuhu ʿalaykum walā adrākum bihi faqad labith''tu fīkum ʿumuran min qablihi afalā taʿqilūna', 'বল, ‘‘আল্লাহর ইচ্ছে হলে আমি তোমাদের কাছে তা তিলাওয়াত করতাম না, আর আল্লাহও তোমাদেরকে তার খবর দিতেন না। আমি তো এর পূর্বে একটা দীর্ঘ সময় তোমাদের মাঝে অতিবাহিত করেছি, তা সত্ত্বেও তোমরা কি বুঝবে না?', 'Say, "If Allah had willed, I would not have recited it to you, nor would He have made it known to you, for I had remained among you a lifetime before it. Then will you not reason?"', 'বল, ‘‘আল্লাহর ইচ্ছে হলে আমি তোমাদের কাছে তা তিলাওয়াত করতাম না, আর আল্লাহও তোমাদেরকে তার খবর দিতেন না। আমি তো এর পূর্বে একটা দীর্ঘ সময় তোমাদের মাঝে অতিবাহিত করেছি, তা সত্ত্বেও তোমরা কি বুঝবে না?', 'Say, "If Allah had willed, I would not have recited it to you, nor would He have made it known to you, for I had remained among you a lifetime before it. Then will you not reason?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010016.mp3', now()),
  (10, 17, '', '[{"id":19581,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَمَنْ","transliteration":"faman","translation_bn":"অতএব কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19582,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَظْلَمُ","transliteration":"aẓlamu","translation_bn":"অধিক সীমালঙ্ঘনকারী (হতে পারে)","root":"ظلم","lemma":"أَظْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19583,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّنِ","transliteration":"mimmani","translation_bn":"(তার) চেয়ে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19584,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","transliteration":"if''tarā","translation_bn":"রচনা করে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19585,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19586,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":19587,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كَذِبًا","transliteration":"kadhiban","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":19588,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":19589,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبَ","transliteration":"kadhaba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19590,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِـَٔايَـٰتِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"biāyātihi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে তাঁর নিদর্শনগুলো","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":19592,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":19593,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":19594,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يُفْلِحُ","transliteration":"yuf''liḥu","translation_bn":"সফলকাম হয়","root":"فلح","lemma":"أَفْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":19595,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimūna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীরা","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":19596,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"١٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(১৭)","root":"—","lemma":"١٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'faman aẓlamu mimmani if''tarā ʿalā l-lahi kadhiban aw kadhaba biāyātihi innahu lā yuf''liḥu l-muj''rimūna', 'তার চেয়ে বড় যালিম আর কে হতে পারে যে মিথ্যা রচনা ক’রে আল্লাহর নামে চালিয়ে দেয় অথবা আল্লাহর আয়াতসমূহকে মিথ্যা বলে ঘোষণা করে; নিশ্চিতই অপরাধীরা সাফল্য লাভ করতে পারে না।', 'So who is more unjust than he who invents a lie about Allah or denies His signs? Indeed, the criminals will not succeed', 'তার চেয়ে বড় যালিম আর কে হতে পারে যে মিথ্যা রচনা ক’রে আল্লাহর নামে চালিয়ে দেয় অথবা আল্লাহর আয়াতসমূহকে মিথ্যা বলে ঘোষণা করে; নিশ্চিতই অপরাধীরা সাফল্য লাভ করতে পারে না।', 'So who is more unjust than he who invents a lie about Allah or denies His signs? Indeed, the criminals will not succeed', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010017.mp3', now()),
