grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26531,"position":36,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"ছিলোই না","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":26532,"position":37,"text_uthmani":"تَغْنَ","transliteration":"taghna","translation_bn":"অবস্থিত","root":"غني","lemma":"أَغْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26533,"position":38,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْأَمْسِ ۚ","transliteration":"bil-amsi","translation_bn":"গতকাল (কোনো ফসল)","root":"—","lemma":"أَمْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26535,"position":39,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26536,"position":40,"text_uthmani":"نُفَصِّلُ","transliteration":"nufaṣṣilu","translation_bn":"বিশদ বর্ণনা করি আমরা","root":"فصل","lemma":"فَصَّلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26537,"position":41,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔايَـٰتِ","transliteration":"l-āyāti","translation_bn":"নিদর্শনগুলোকে","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":26538,"position":42,"text_uthmani":"لِقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":26539,"position":43,"text_uthmani":"يَتَفَكَّرُونَ","transliteration":"yatafakkarūna","translation_bn":"(যারা) চিন্তা-ভাবনা করে","root":"فكر","lemma":"يَتَفَكَّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":26540,"position":44,"text_uthmani":"٢٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'innamā mathalu l-ḥayati l-dun''yā kamāin anzalnāhu mina l-samāi fa-ikh''talaṭa bihi nabātu l-arḍi mimmā yakulu l-nāsu wal-anʿāmu ḥattā idhā akhadhati l-arḍu zukh''rufahā wa-izzayyanat waẓanna ahluhā annahum qādirūna ʿalayhā atāhā amrunā laylan aw nahāran fajaʿalnāhā ḥaṣīdan ka-an lam taghna bil-amsi kadhālika nufaṣṣilu l-āyāti liqawmin yatafakkarūna', 'দুনিয়ার জীবনের দৃষ্টান্ত হচ্ছে যেমন আকাশ থেকে আমি পানি বর্ষণ করি যার সংস্পর্শে ঘন সন্নিবিষ্ট ভূমি জাত উদ্ভিদ উৎপন্ন হয়। যাত্থেকে ভক্ষণ করে মানুষ আর জীবজন্তু। অবশেষে যমীন যখন সোনালীরূপ ধারণ করে আর শোভামন্ডিত হয়, আর তার মালিকগণ ভাবতে থাকে যে, ওগুলো তাদের হাতের মুঠোয় তখন রাত্রিকালে কিংবা দিনের বেলা আমার নির্দেশ এসে পড়ে আর আমি ওগুলো এমনভাবে ধ্বংস করে দেই মনে হয় যেন গতকাল সেখানে কোন কিছুই ছিল না। এভাবে আমি আমার নিদর্শনগুলোকে বিশদভাবে বর্ণনা করি ঐ সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য যারা চিন্তাভাবনা করে বুঝতে চেষ্টা করে।', 'The example of [this] worldly life is but like rain which We have sent down from the sky that the plants of the earth absorb - [those] from which men and livestock eat - until, when the earth has taken on its adornment and is beautified and its people suppose that they have capability over it, there comes to it Our command by night or by day, and We make it as a harvest, as if it had not flourished yesterday. Thus do We explain in detail the signs for a people who give thought.', 'দুনিয়ার জীবনের দৃষ্টান্ত হচ্ছে যেমন আকাশ থেকে আমি পানি বর্ষণ করি যার সংস্পর্শে ঘন সন্নিবিষ্ট ভূমি জাত উদ্ভিদ উৎপন্ন হয়। যাত্থেকে ভক্ষণ করে মানুষ আর জীবজন্তু। অবশেষে যমীন যখন সোনালীরূপ ধারণ করে আর শোভামন্ডিত হয়, আর তার মালিকগণ ভাবতে থাকে যে, ওগুলো তাদের হাতের মুঠোয় তখন রাত্রিকালে কিংবা দিনের বেলা আমার নির্দেশ এসে পড়ে আর আমি ওগুলো এমনভাবে ধ্বংস করে দেই মনে হয় যেন গতকাল সেখানে কোন কিছুই ছিল না। এভাবে আমি আমার নিদর্শনগুলোকে বিশদভাবে বর্ণনা করি ঐ সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য যারা চিন্তাভাবনা করে বুঝতে চেষ্টা করে।', 'The example of [this] worldly life is but like rain which We have sent down from the sky that the plants of the earth absorb - [those] from which men and livestock eat - until, when the earth has taken on its adornment and is beautified and its people suppose that they have capability over it, there comes to it Our command by night or by day, and We make it as a harvest, as if it had not flourished yesterday. Thus do We explain in detail the signs for a people who give thought.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010024.mp3', now()),
  (10, 25, '', '[{"id":27714,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"wal-lahu","translation_bn":"আর আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27715,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yadʿū","translation_bn":"ডাকেন","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27716,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27717,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"دَارِ","transliteration":"dāri","translation_bn":"আবাসের","root":"دور","lemma":"دَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27718,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّلَـٰمِ","transliteration":"l-salāmi","translation_bn":"শান্তির","root":"سلم","lemma":"سَلَٰم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":27719,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَيَهْدِى","transliteration":"wayahdī","translation_bn":"ও পথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":27720,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":27721,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَشَآءُ","transliteration":"yashāu","translation_bn":"তিনিই ইচ্ছা করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":27722,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِلَىٰ","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":27723,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","translation_bn":"পথের","root":"صرط","lemma":"صِرَٰط","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27724,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍۢ","transliteration":"mus''taqīmin","translation_bn":"সরল সঠিক","root":"قوم","lemma":"مُّسْتَقِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":27725,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٢٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wal-lahu yadʿū ilā dāri l-salāmi wayahdī man yashāu ilā ṣirāṭin mus''taqīmin', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে শান্তির কেন্দ্রভূমির দিকে আহবান জানান আর যাকে তিনি চান সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন।', 'And Allah invites to the Home of Peace and guides whom He wills to a straight path', 'আল্লাহ তোমাদেরকে শান্তির কেন্দ্রভূমির দিকে আহবান জানান আর যাকে তিনি চান সঠিক পথে পরিচালিত করেন।', 'And Allah invites to the Home of Peace and guides whom He wills to a straight path', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010025.mp3', now()),
  (10, 26, '', '[{"id":29060,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ لِّلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29061,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَحْسَنُوا۟","transliteration":"aḥsanū","translation_bn":"(যারা) ভালো কাজ করে","root":"حسن","lemma":"أَحْسَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29062,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحُسْنَىٰ","transliteration":"l-ḥus''nā","translation_bn":"উত্তম ফল","root":"حسن","lemma":"حُسْنَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29063,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَزِيَادَةٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"waziyādatun","translation_bn":"এবং আরও বেশি (অনুগ্রহ)","root":"زيد","lemma":"زِيَادَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29065,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29066,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَرْهَقُ","transliteration":"yarhaqu","translation_bn":"আচ্ছন্ন করবে","root":"رهق","lemma":"يَرْهَقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29067,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وُجُوهَهُمْ","transliteration":"wujūhahum","translation_bn":"মুখমন্ডলসমূহকে তাদের","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29068,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"قَتَرٌۭ","transliteration":"qatarun","translation_bn":"কালিমা","root":"قتر","lemma":"قَتَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29069,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29070,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ذِلَّةٌ ۚ","transliteration":"dhillatun","translation_bn":"লাঞ্ছনা","root":"ذلل","lemma":"ذِلَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29072,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসব লোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":29073,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"অধিবাসী (হবে)","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29074,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْجَنَّةِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-janati","translation_bn":"জান্নাতের","root":"جنن","lemma":"جَنَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29076,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":29077,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29078,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","transliteration":"khālidūna","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29079,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٢٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lilladhīna aḥsanū l-ḥus''nā waziyādatun walā yarhaqu wujūhahum qatarun walā dhillatun ulāika aṣḥābu l-janati hum fīhā khālidūna', 'যারা কল্যাণকর কাজ করে তাদের জন্য রয়েছে কল্যাণ এবং আরো অতিরিক্ত (পুরস্কার), কলংক ও লাঞ্ছনা তাদের মুখমন্ডলকে মলিন করবে না, তারাই হল জান্নাতের অধিবাসী, সেখানে তারা থাকবে চিরকাল।', 'For them who have done good is the best [reward] and extra. No darkness will cover their faces, nor humiliation. Those are companions of Paradise; they will abide therein eternally', 'যারা কল্যাণকর কাজ করে তাদের জন্য রয়েছে কল্যাণ এবং আরো অতিরিক্ত (পুরস্কার), কলংক ও লাঞ্ছনা তাদের মুখমন্ডলকে মলিন করবে না, তারাই হল জান্নাতের অধিবাসী, সেখানে তারা থাকবে চিরকাল।', 'For them who have done good is the best [reward] and extra. No darkness will cover their faces, nor humiliation. Those are companions of Paradise; they will abide therein eternally', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010026.mp3', now()),
  (10, 27, '', '[{"id":29915,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29916,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَسَبُوا۟","transliteration":"kasabū","translation_bn":"অর্জন করেছে","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29917,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّيِّـَٔاتِ","transliteration":"l-sayiāti","translation_bn":"মন্দ কাজ","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّـ#َات","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29918,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَزَآءُ","transliteration":"jazāu","translation_bn":"(তারা পাবে) প্রতিফল","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَا^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29919,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سَيِّئَةٍۭ","transliteration":"sayyi-atin","translation_bn":"মন্দ কাজের","root":"سوا","lemma":"سَيِّئَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29920,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِمِثْلِهَا","transliteration":"bimith''lihā","translation_bn":"অনুরূপ তার","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29921,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَتَرْهَقُهُمْ","transliteration":"watarhaquhum","translation_bn":"ও আচ্ছন্ন করবে তাদের","root":"رهق","lemma":"يَرْهَقُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":29922,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ذِلَّةٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"dhillatun","translation_bn":"লাঞ্ছনা","root":"ذلل","lemma":"ذِلَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29924,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":29925,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَهُم","transliteration":"lahum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29926,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29927,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":29928,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29929,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَاصِمٍۢ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿāṣimin","translation_bn":"রক্ষাকারী","root":"عصم","lemma":"عَاصِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29931,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَأَنَّمَآ","transliteration":"ka-annamā","translation_bn":"যেন প্রকৃতপক্ষে","root":"—","lemma":"كَأَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":29932,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"أُغْشِيَتْ","transliteration":"ugh''shiyat","translation_bn":"ঢেকে ফেলেছে","root":"غشو","lemma":"أُغْشِيَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":29933,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"وُجُوهُهُمْ","transliteration":"wujūhuhum","translation_bn":"মুখমন্ডলগুলো তাদের","root":"وجه","lemma":"وَجْه","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29934,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"قِطَعًۭا","transliteration":"qiṭaʿan","translation_bn":"টুকরা","root":"قطع","lemma":"قِطَع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29935,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29936,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلِ","transliteration":"al-layli","translation_bn":"রাত","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29937,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"مُظْلِمًا ۚ","transliteration":"muẓ''liman","translation_bn":"অন্ধকার","root":"ظلم","lemma":"مُظْلِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29939,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","transliteration":"ulāika","translation_bn":"ঐসবলোক","root":"—","lemma":"أُولَٰ^ئِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":29940,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"أَصْحَـٰبُ","transliteration":"aṣḥābu","translation_bn":"অধিবাসী (হবে)","root":"صحب","lemma":"أَصْحَٰب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29941,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّارِ ۖ","transliteration":"l-nāri","translation_bn":"আগুনের","root":"نور","lemma":"نَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":29943,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":29944,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فِيهَا","transliteration":"fīhā","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":29945,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"خَـٰلِدُونَ","transliteration":"khālidūna","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী হবে","root":"خلد","lemma":"خَٰلِد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":29946,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٢٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-alladhīna kasabū l-sayiāti jazāu sayyi-atin bimith''lihā watarhaquhum dhillatun mā lahum mina l-lahi min ʿāṣimin ka-annamā ugh''shiyat wujūhuhum qiṭaʿan mina al-layli muẓ''liman ulāika aṣḥābu l-nāri hum fīhā khālidūna', 'পক্ষান্তরে যারা মন্দ কাজ করে, তারা তাদের মন্দ কাজের শাস্তি পাবে কাজের অনুপাতে এবং অপমান তাদেরকে আচ্ছাদিত করবে, আল্লাহর (শাস্তি) হতে কেউই তাদেরকে রক্ষা করতে পারবে না- যেন তাদের মুখমন্ডলকে আচ্ছাদিত করে দেয়া হয়েছে গাঢ় অন্ধকার রাত্রির টুকরো দিয়ে; তারা জাহান্নামের অধিবাসী, তারা তার মধ্যে চিরকাল থাকবে।', 'But they who have earned [blame for] evil doings - the recompense of an evil deed is its equivalent, and humiliation will cover them. They will have from Allah no protector. It will be as if their faces are covered with pieces of the night - so dark [are they]. Those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide therein eternally.', 'পক্ষান্তরে যারা মন্দ কাজ করে, তারা তাদের মন্দ কাজের শাস্তি পাবে কাজের অনুপাতে এবং অপমান তাদেরকে আচ্ছাদিত করবে, আল্লাহর (শাস্তি) হতে কেউই তাদেরকে রক্ষা করতে পারবে না- যেন তাদের মুখমন্ডলকে আচ্ছাদিত করে দেয়া হয়েছে গাঢ় অন্ধকার রাত্রির টুকরো দিয়ে; তারা জাহান্নামের অধিবাসী, তারা তার মধ্যে চিরকাল থাকবে।', 'But they who have earned [blame for] evil doings - the recompense of an evil deed is its equivalent, and humiliation will cover them. They will have from Allah no protector. It will be as if their faces are covered with pieces of the night - so dark [are they]. Those are the companions of the Fire; they will abide therein eternally.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010027.mp3', now()),
  (10, 28, '', '[{"id":31011,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31012,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نَحْشُرُهُمْ","transliteration":"naḥshuruhum","translation_bn":"একত্র করবো আমরা তাদের","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31013,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًۭا","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সকলকে (আমার আদালতে)","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31014,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31015,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَقُولُ","transliteration":"naqūlu","translation_bn":"আমরা বলবো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31016,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তাদের (যারা)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":31017,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَشْرَكُوا۟","transliteration":"ashrakū","translation_bn":"শিরক করেছিলো","root":"شرك","lemma":"أَشْرَكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31018,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مَكَانَكُمْ","transliteration":"makānakum","translation_bn":"\"তোমাদের স্থানে (অবস্হান করো)","root":"كون","lemma":"مَّكَان","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31019,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُمْ","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":31020,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَشُرَكَآؤُكُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"washurakāukum","translation_bn":"ও তোমাদের শরীকরা\"","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31022,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فَزَيَّلْنَا","transliteration":"fazayyalnā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর পৃথক করে দিবো আমরা","root":"زيل","lemma":"زَيَّلْ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":31023,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":31025,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَقَالَ","transliteration":"waqāla","translation_bn":"এবং বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":31026,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآؤُهُم","transliteration":"shurakāuhum","translation_bn":"শরীকেরা তাদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":31027,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":31028,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31029,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"إِيَّانَا","transliteration":"iyyānā","translation_bn":"আমাদেরকে\"","root":"—","lemma":"إِيَّا","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":31030,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"تَعْبُدُونَ","transliteration":"taʿbudūna","translation_bn":"উপাসনা করতে\"","root":"عبد","lemma":"عَبَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":31031,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"٢٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma naḥshuruhum jamīʿan thumma naqūlu lilladhīna ashrakū makānakum antum washurakāukum fazayyalnā baynahum waqāla shurakāuhum mā kuntum iyyānā taʿbudūna', 'সেদিন আমি তাদের সবাইকে একত্রিত করে যারা শিরক করেছিল তাদেরকে বলব, ‘‘তোমরা এবং তোমরা যাদেরকে শরীক করেছিলে তারা নিজ নিজ জায়গায় থাক।’’ আমি তাদেরকে পরস্পর থেকে পৃথক করে দেব আর তারা যাদেরকে শরীক করেছিল তারা বলবে, ‘তোমরা তো আমাদের ‘ইবাদাত করতে না।’', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], the Day We will gather them all together - then We will say to those who associated others with Allah, "[Remain in] your place, you and your ''partners.'' " Then We will separate them, and their "partners" will say, "You did not used to worship us,', 'সেদিন আমি তাদের সবাইকে একত্রিত করে যারা শিরক করেছিল তাদেরকে বলব, ‘‘তোমরা এবং তোমরা যাদেরকে শরীক করেছিলে তারা নিজ নিজ জায়গায় থাক।’’ আমি তাদেরকে পরস্পর থেকে পৃথক করে দেব আর তারা যাদেরকে শরীক করেছিল তারা বলবে, ‘তোমরা তো আমাদের ‘ইবাদাত করতে না।’', 'And [mention, O Muhammad], the Day We will gather them all together - then We will say to those who associated others with Allah, "[Remain in] your place, you and your ''partners.'' " Then We will separate them, and their "partners" will say, "You did not used to worship us,', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010028.mp3', now()),
  (10, 29, '', '[{"id":32015,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَكَفَىٰ","transliteration":"fakafā","translation_bn":"অতএব যথেষ্ট","root":"كفي","lemma":"كَفَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32016,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"bil-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32017,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدًۢا","transliteration":"shahīdan","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী হিসেবে","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":32018,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَنَا","transliteration":"baynanā","translation_bn":"মাঝে আমাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":32019,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَبَيْنَكُمْ","transliteration":"wabaynakum","translation_bn":"ও মাঝে তোমাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32020,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":32021,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"كُنَّا","transliteration":"kunnā","translation_bn":"আমরা ছিলাম","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32022,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"عَنْ","transliteration":"ʿan","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32023,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"عِبَادَتِكُمْ","transliteration":"ʿibādatikum","translation_bn":"উপাসনা তোমাদের","root":"عبد","lemma":"عِبَادَت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32024,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَغَـٰفِلِينَ","transliteration":"laghāfilīna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই উদাসীন","root":"غفل","lemma":"غَٰفِل","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":32025,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٢٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(২৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٢٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fakafā bil-lahi shahīdan baynanā wabaynakum in kunnā ʿan ʿibādatikum laghāfilīna', 'এখন আল্লাহই আমাদের আর তোমাদের মাঝে সাক্ষী হিসেবে যথেষ্ট, আমরা তোমাদের ‘ইবাদাতের ব্যাপারে সম্পূর্ণ বেখবর ছিলাম।’', 'And sufficient is Allah as a witness between us and you that we were of your worship unaware."', 'এখন আল্লাহই আমাদের আর তোমাদের মাঝে সাক্ষী হিসেবে যথেষ্ট, আমরা তোমাদের ‘ইবাদাতের ব্যাপারে সম্পূর্ণ বেখবর ছিলাম।’', 'And sufficient is Allah as a witness between us and you that we were of your worship unaware."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010029.mp3', now()),
  (10, 30, '', '[{"id":32893,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُنَالِكَ","transliteration":"hunālika","translation_bn":"সেখানে","root":"—","lemma":"هُنَالِك\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":32894,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"تَبْلُوا۟","transliteration":"tablū","translation_bn":"যাচাই করে নিতে পারবে","root":"بلو","lemma":"بَلَوْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32895,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كُلُّ","transliteration":"kullu","translation_bn":"প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32896,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍۢ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তি","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32897,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":32898,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَسْلَفَتْ ۚ","transliteration":"aslafat","translation_bn":"অতীতে করেছে","root":"سلف","lemma":"أَسْلَفَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32900,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَرُدُّوٓا۟","transliteration":"waruddū","translation_bn":"এবং তাদেরকে ফিরিয়ে নেয়া হবে","root":"ردد","lemma":"رَدَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32901,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32902,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":32903,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مَوْلَىٰهُمُ","transliteration":"mawlāhumu","translation_bn":"অভিভাবক তাদের","root":"ولي","lemma":"مَوْلَىٰ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":32904,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":32906,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَضَلَّ","transliteration":"waḍalla","translation_bn":"এবং সরে যাবে","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":32907,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَنْهُم","transliteration":"ʿanhum","translation_bn":"থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":32908,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَّا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":32909,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32910,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaftarūna","translation_bn":"তারা রচনা করতে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":32911,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩০)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'hunālika tablū kullu nafsin mā aslafat waruddū ilā l-lahi mawlāhumu l-ḥaqi waḍalla ʿanhum mā kānū yaftarūna', 'সেখানে প্রতিটি আত্মা তার পূর্বকৃত কাজ (এর ফলাফল) দেখতে পাবে। তাদেরকে তাদের প্রকৃত অভিভাবক আল্লাহর নিকট ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে, আর তাদের রচিত সকল মিথ্যা তাদের থেকে বিলীন হয়ে যাবে।', 'There, [on that Day], every soul will be put to trial for what it did previously, and they will be returned to Allah, their master, the Truth, and lost from them is whatever they used to invent.', 'সেখানে প্রতিটি আত্মা তার পূর্বকৃত কাজ (এর ফলাফল) দেখতে পাবে। তাদেরকে তাদের প্রকৃত অভিভাবক আল্লাহর নিকট ফিরিয়ে আনা হবে, আর তাদের রচিত সকল মিথ্যা তাদের থেকে বিলীন হয়ে যাবে।', 'There, [on that Day], every soul will be put to trial for what it did previously, and they will be returned to Allah, their master, the Truth, and lost from them is whatever they used to invent.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010030.mp3', now()),
  (10, 31, '', '[{"id":33749,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33750,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"\"কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":33751,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَرْزُقُكُم","transliteration":"yarzuqukum","translation_bn":"জীবিকা দেন তোমাদের","root":"رزق","lemma":"رَزَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33752,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33753,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَآءِ","transliteration":"l-samāi","translation_bn":"আকাশ","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33754,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবী (থেকে)","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33755,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَمَّن","transliteration":"amman","translation_bn":"অথবা কে","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33756,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَمْلِكُ","transliteration":"yamliku","translation_bn":"কর্তৃত্ব রাখেন","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33757,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمْعَ","transliteration":"l-samʿa","translation_bn":"শ্রবণশক্তির","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمْع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33758,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَبْصَـٰرَ","transliteration":"wal-abṣāra","translation_bn":"ও দৃষ্টিশক্তিসমূহের","root":"بصر","lemma":"بَصَر","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33759,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33760,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُخْرِجُ","transliteration":"yukh''riju","translation_bn":"বের করেন","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33761,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَىَّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaya","translation_bn":"জীবন্তকে","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33762,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33763,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَيِّتِ","transliteration":"l-mayiti","translation_bn":"মৃত","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33764,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَيُخْرِجُ","transliteration":"wayukh''riju","translation_bn":"এবং (কে) বের করেন","root":"خرج","lemma":"أَخْرَجَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33765,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمَيِّتَ","transliteration":"l-mayita","translation_bn":"মৃতকে","root":"موت","lemma":"مَّيِّت","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33766,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":33767,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَىِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥayi","translation_bn":"জীবন্ত","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33768,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং কে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":33769,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يُدَبِّرُ","transliteration":"yudabbiru","translation_bn":"পরিচালনা করেন","root":"دبر","lemma":"يُدَبِّرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33770,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَمْرَ ۚ","transliteration":"l-amra","translation_bn":"(বিশ্ব ব্যবস্থার সকল) কাজ\"","root":"امر","lemma":"أَمْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33772,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"فَسَيَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"fasayaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তখন অচিরেই তারা বলবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33773,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"\"আল্লাহই\"","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":33775,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"فَقُلْ","transliteration":"faqul","translation_bn":"তাহলে বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":33776,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"أَفَلَا","transliteration":"afalā","translation_bn":"\"কি তবুও না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":33777,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"تَتَّقُونَ","transliteration":"tattaqūna","translation_bn":"(সত্য বিরোধিতায়) তোমরা বিরত থাকবে\"","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":33778,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"٣١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩১)","root":"—","lemma":"٣١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul man yarzuqukum mina l-samāi wal-arḍi amman yamliku l-samʿa wal-abṣāra waman yukh''riju l-ḥaya mina l-mayiti wayukh''riju l-mayita mina l-ḥayi waman yudabbiru l-amra fasayaqūlūna l-lahu faqul afalā tattaqūna', 'তাদের জিজ্ঞেস কর, ‘আকাশ আর যমীন হতে কে তাদের জীবিকার ব্যবস্থা করে? কিংবা শ্রবণশক্তি ও দর্শনশক্তি কার মালিকানাধীন? আর মৃত থেকে জীবিতকে কে বের করেন আর কে মৃতকে জীবিত থেকে বের করেন? যাবতীয় বিষয়ের শাসন ও নিয়ন্ত্রণ কার অধীনস্থ?’ তারা বলে উঠবে, ‘‘আল্লাহ’’। তাহলে তাদেরকে বল, ‘তবুও তোমরা তাক্বওয়াহ অবলম্বন করবে না?’', 'Say, "Who provides for you from the heaven and the earth? Or who controls hearing and sight and who brings the living out of the dead and brings the dead out of the living and who arranges [every] matter?" They will say, "Allah," so say, "Then will you not fear Him?"', 'তাদের জিজ্ঞেস কর, ‘আকাশ আর যমীন হতে কে তাদের জীবিকার ব্যবস্থা করে? কিংবা শ্রবণশক্তি ও দর্শনশক্তি কার মালিকানাধীন? আর মৃত থেকে জীবিতকে কে বের করেন আর কে মৃতকে জীবিত থেকে বের করেন? যাবতীয় বিষয়ের শাসন ও নিয়ন্ত্রণ কার অধীনস্থ?’ তারা বলে উঠবে, ‘‘আল্লাহ’’। তাহলে তাদেরকে বল, ‘তবুও তোমরা তাক্বওয়াহ অবলম্বন করবে না?’', 'Say, "Who provides for you from the heaven and the earth? Or who controls hearing and sight and who brings the living out of the dead and brings the dead out of the living and who arranges [every] matter?" They will say, "Allah," so say, "Then will you not fear Him?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010031.mp3', now()),
  (10, 32, '', '[{"id":34907,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَذَٰلِكُمُ","transliteration":"fadhālikumu","translation_bn":"অতএব এই","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34908,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":34909,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَبُّكُمُ","transliteration":"rabbukumu","translation_bn":"রব তোমাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":34910,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34912,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَمَاذَا","transliteration":"famādhā","translation_bn":"তাহ''লে কি (থাকতে পারে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَاذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34913,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَعْدَ","transliteration":"baʿda","translation_bn":"পরে","root":"بعد","lemma":"بَعْد","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":34914,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"মহাসত্যের","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34915,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":34916,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلضَّلَـٰلُ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ḍalālu","translation_bn":"বিভ্রান্তি","root":"ضلل","lemma":"ضَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34918,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنَّىٰ","transliteration":"fa-annā","translation_bn":"অতএব কোথায়","root":"اني\r","lemma":"أَنَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":34919,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تُصْرَفُونَ","transliteration":"tuṣ''rafūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা চালিত হচ্ছো","root":"صرف","lemma":"صَرَفَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":34920,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٣٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩২)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'fadhālikumu l-lahu rabbukumu l-ḥaqu famādhā baʿda l-ḥaqi illā l-ḍalālu fa-annā tuṣ''rafūna', 'তিনিই আল্লাহ, তোমাদের প্রকৃত প্রতিপালক। প্রকৃত সত্যের পর গুমারাহী ছাড়া আর কী থাকতে পারে? তোমাদেরকে কোনদিকে ঘুরানো হচ্ছে?', 'For that is Allah, your Lord, the Truth. And what can be beyond truth except error? So how are you averted?', 'তিনিই আল্লাহ, তোমাদের প্রকৃত প্রতিপালক। প্রকৃত সত্যের পর গুমারাহী ছাড়া আর কী থাকতে পারে? তোমাদেরকে কোনদিকে ঘুরানো হচ্ছে?', 'For that is Allah, your Lord, the Truth. And what can be beyond truth except error? So how are you averted?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010032.mp3', now()),
  (10, 33, '', '[{"id":35190,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35191,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"حَقَّتْ","transliteration":"ḥaqqat","translation_bn":"সত্য প্রমাণিত হলো","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقَّ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35192,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَلِمَتُ","transliteration":"kalimatu","translation_bn":"বাণী","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35193,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"رَبِّكَ","transliteration":"rabbika","translation_bn":"তোমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":35194,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":35195,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তাদের) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":35196,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فَسَقُوٓا۟","transliteration":"fasaqū","translation_bn":"সত্যত্যাগ করেছে","root":"فسق","lemma":"فَسَقَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35197,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّهُمْ","transliteration":"annahum","translation_bn":"যে তারা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":35198,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":35199,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","transliteration":"yu''minūna","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":35200,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٣٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'kadhālika ḥaqqat kalimatu rabbika ʿalā alladhīna fasaqū annahum lā yu''minūna', 'এভাবে সত্য প্রত্যাখ্যানকারীদের ব্যাপারে তোমার প্রতিপালকের কথা সত্য সাব্যস্ত হয়েছে যে, তারা ঈমান আনবে না।', 'Thus the word of your Lord has come into effect upon those who defiantly disobeyed - that they will not believe.', 'এভাবে সত্য প্রত্যাখ্যানকারীদের ব্যাপারে তোমার প্রতিপালকের কথা সত্য সাব্যস্ত হয়েছে যে, তারা ঈমান আনবে না।', 'Thus the word of your Lord has come into effect upon those who defiantly disobeyed - that they will not believe.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010033.mp3', now()),
  (10, 34, '', '[{"id":36534,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36535,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"\"(আছে) কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":36536,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্যে হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":36537,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآئِكُم","transliteration":"shurakāikum","translation_bn":"শরীকদের তোমাদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":36538,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(এমন কেউ) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":36539,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَبْدَؤُا۟","transliteration":"yabda-u","translation_bn":"সূচনা করে","root":"بدا","lemma":"بَدَأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36540,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَلْقَ","transliteration":"l-khalqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টির","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36541,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36542,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُعِيدُهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"yuʿīduhu","translation_bn":"পুনরাবর্তন ঘটায় তার\"","root":"عود","lemma":"أُعِيدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36544,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"قُلِ","transliteration":"quli","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36545,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"\"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":36546,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يَبْدَؤُا۟","transliteration":"yabda-u","translation_bn":"সূচনা করেন","root":"بدا","lemma":"بَدَأَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36547,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخَلْقَ","transliteration":"l-khalqa","translation_bn":"সৃষ্টির","root":"خلق","lemma":"خَلْق","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36548,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":36549,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُعِيدُهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"yuʿīduhu","translation_bn":"পুনরাবর্তন ঘটান তার","root":"عود","lemma":"أُعِيدُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36551,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"فَأَنَّىٰ","transliteration":"fa-annā","translation_bn":"অতএব কোথায়","root":"اني\r","lemma":"أَنَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":36552,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"تُؤْفَكُونَ","transliteration":"tu''fakūna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের ফিরানো হচ্ছে\"","root":"افك","lemma":"أُفِكَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":36553,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٣٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul hal min shurakāikum man yabda-u l-khalqa thumma yuʿīduhu quli l-lahu yabda-u l-khalqa thumma yuʿīduhu fa-annā tu''fakūna', 'বল ‘‘তোমরা যাদেরকে শরীক কর তাদের মধ্যে এমন কেউ আছে কি যে সৃষ্টির সূচনা করে এবং তার পুনরাবর্তনও ঘটাতে পারে?’’ বল ‘‘আল্লাহই সৃষ্টির সূচনা করেন এবং তার পুনরাবর্তন ঘটান।’’ তাহলে কীভাবে তোমরা বিচ্যুত হয়ে যাচ্ছ (সত্য পথ থেকে)?', 'Say, "Are there of your ''partners'' any who begins creation and then repeats it?" Say, "Allah begins creation and then repeats it, so how are you deluded?"', 'বল ‘‘তোমরা যাদেরকে শরীক কর তাদের মধ্যে এমন কেউ আছে কি যে সৃষ্টির সূচনা করে এবং তার পুনরাবর্তনও ঘটাতে পারে?’’ বল ‘‘আল্লাহই সৃষ্টির সূচনা করেন এবং তার পুনরাবর্তন ঘটান।’’ তাহলে কীভাবে তোমরা বিচ্যুত হয়ে যাচ্ছ (সত্য পথ থেকে)?', 'Say, "Are there of your ''partners'' any who begins creation and then repeats it?" Say, "Allah begins creation and then repeats it, so how are you deluded?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010034.mp3', now()),
  (10, 35, '', '[{"id":37307,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37308,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"\"(আছে) কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":37309,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"মধ্য হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37310,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآئِكُم","transliteration":"shurakāikum","translation_bn":"শরীকদের তোমাদের","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":37311,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"(এমন কেউ) যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":37312,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِىٓ","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখায়","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37313,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37314,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্যের\"","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37316,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"قُلِ","transliteration":"quli","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37317,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"\"আল্লাহই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":37318,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِى","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখান","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37319,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِلْحَقِّ ۗ","transliteration":"lil''ḥaqqi","translation_bn":"দিকে সত্যের","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37321,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أَفَمَن","transliteration":"afaman","translation_bn":"কি তবে যে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":37322,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَهْدِىٓ","transliteration":"yahdī","translation_bn":"সঠিকপথ দেখায়","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37323,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِلَى","transliteration":"ilā","translation_bn":"দিকে","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37324,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্যের","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37325,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَحَقُّ","transliteration":"aḥaqqu","translation_bn":"অধিক যোগ্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"أَحَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":37326,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":37327,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يُتَّبَعَ","transliteration":"yuttabaʿa","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করা হবে (তাঁর)","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37328,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَمَّن","transliteration":"amman","translation_bn":"অথবা যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":37329,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":37330,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَهِدِّىٓ","transliteration":"yahiddī","translation_bn":"সঠিকপথ পায়","root":"هدي","lemma":"ٱهْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37331,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّآ","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":37332,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":37333,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يُهْدَىٰ ۖ","transliteration":"yuh''dā","translation_bn":"পথ প্রদর্শিত হয়","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37335,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"فَمَا","transliteration":"famā","translation_bn":"অতএব কি হয়েছে","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":37336,"position":27,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":37337,"position":28,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":37338,"position":29,"text_uthmani":"تَحْكُمُونَ","transliteration":"taḥkumūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা বিচার করো\"","root":"حكم","lemma":"حَكَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":37339,"position":30,"text_uthmani":"٣٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul hal min shurakāikum man yahdī ilā l-ḥaqi quli l-lahu yahdī lil''ḥaqqi afaman yahdī ilā l-ḥaqi aḥaqqu an yuttabaʿa amman lā yahiddī illā an yuh''dā famā lakum kayfa taḥkumūna', 'বল ‘‘তোমরা যাদেরকে শরীক কর তাদের কেউ কি সত্যের পথ দেখাতে পারে?’’ বল, ‘আল্লাহই সত্যের পথ দেখান।’ তবে যিনি সত্য পথে পরিচালিত করেন আনুগত্য লাভের তিনিই বেশি হাকদার, না কি সেই যাকে পথ না দেখালে পথ পায় না? তোমাদের হয়েছে কী? তোমরা কীভাবে সিদ্ধান্ত নিচ্ছ?', 'Say, "Are there of your ''partners'' any who guides to the truth?" Say, "Allah guides to the truth. So is He who guides to the truth more worthy to be followed or he who guides not unless he is guided? Then what is [wrong] with you - how do you judge?"', 'বল ‘‘তোমরা যাদেরকে শরীক কর তাদের কেউ কি সত্যের পথ দেখাতে পারে?’’ বল, ‘আল্লাহই সত্যের পথ দেখান।’ তবে যিনি সত্য পথে পরিচালিত করেন আনুগত্য লাভের তিনিই বেশি হাকদার, না কি সেই যাকে পথ না দেখালে পথ পায় না? তোমাদের হয়েছে কী? তোমরা কীভাবে সিদ্ধান্ত নিচ্ছ?', 'Say, "Are there of your ''partners'' any who guides to the truth?" Say, "Allah guides to the truth. So is He who guides to the truth more worthy to be followed or he who guides not unless he is guided? Then what is [wrong] with you - how do you judge?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010035.mp3', now()),
  (10, 36, '', '[{"id":38202,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":38203,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّبِعُ","transliteration":"yattabiʿu","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38204,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرُهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharuhum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশ তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38205,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":38206,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَنًّا ۚ","transliteration":"ẓannan","translation_bn":"অনুমানের","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38208,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38209,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّنَّ","transliteration":"l-ẓana","translation_bn":"অনুমান","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38210,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":38211,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"يُغْنِى","transliteration":"yugh''nī","translation_bn":"কাজে আসে","root":"غني","lemma":"أَغْنَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38212,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"ক্ষেত্রে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38213,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","translation_bn":"সত্য (পথ লাভের)","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":38214,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًٔا ۚ","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্র","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":38216,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":38217,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":38218,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"عَلِيمٌۢ","transliteration":"ʿalīmun","translation_bn":"খুব অবহিত","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":38219,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":38220,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"يَفْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"yafʿalūna","translation_bn":"তারা করছে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":38221,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٣٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā yattabiʿu aktharuhum illā ẓannan inna l-ẓana lā yugh''nī mina l-ḥaqi shayan inna l-laha ʿalīmun bimā yafʿalūna', 'তাদের অধিকাংশই কেবল ধারণার অনুসরণ করে, সত্যের মুকাবালায় ধারণা কোন কাজে আসে না। তোমরা যা কর সে সম্পর্কে আল্লাহ সর্বাধিক অবগত।', 'And most of them follow not except assumption. Indeed, assumption avails not against the truth at all. Indeed, Allah is Knowing of what they do.', 'তাদের অধিকাংশই কেবল ধারণার অনুসরণ করে, সত্যের মুকাবালায় ধারণা কোন কাজে আসে না। তোমরা যা কর সে সম্পর্কে আল্লাহ সর্বাধিক অবগত।', 'And most of them follow not except assumption. Indeed, assumption avails not against the truth at all. Indeed, Allah is Knowing of what they do.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010036.mp3', now()),
  (10, 37, '', '[{"id":39065,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নয়","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39066,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"হওয়ার","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39067,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":39068,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقُرْءَانُ","transliteration":"l-qur''ānu","translation_bn":"কুর''আন","root":"قرا","lemma":"قُرْءَان","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39069,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَن","transliteration":"an","translation_bn":"(এমন) যে","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অধীনস্থ যোজক (Subordinating)"},{"id":39070,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"يُفْتَرَىٰ","transliteration":"yuf''tarā","translation_bn":"রচনা করা যেতে পারে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39071,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39072,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"বাদ","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39073,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39074,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِن","transliteration":"walākin","translation_bn":"বরং (এটা)","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39075,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَصْدِيقَ","transliteration":"taṣdīqa","translation_bn":"সত্যায়ন","root":"صدق","lemma":"تَصْدِيق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39076,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"(তার) যা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39077,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَ","transliteration":"bayna","translation_bn":"মাঝে","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":39078,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"يَدَيْهِ","transliteration":"yadayhi","translation_bn":"হাতের তার","root":"يدي","lemma":"يَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39079,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"وَتَفْصِيلَ","transliteration":"watafṣīla","translation_bn":"ও বিস্তারিত বর্ণনা","root":"فصل","lemma":"تَفْصِيل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39080,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","transliteration":"l-kitābi","translation_bn":"সেই কিতাবের","root":"كتب","lemma":"كِتَٰب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39081,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":39082,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"رَيْبَ","transliteration":"rayba","translation_bn":"কোনো সন্দেহ","root":"ريب","lemma":"رَيْب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39083,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার(যে এটা)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39084,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"(এসেছে) পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39085,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّ","transliteration":"rabbi","translation_bn":"রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39086,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَـٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ʿālamīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বজগতের","root":"علم","lemma":"عَٰلَمِين","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39087,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٣٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā kāna hādhā l-qur''ānu an yuf''tarā min dūni l-lahi walākin taṣdīqa alladhī bayna yadayhi watafṣīla l-kitābi lā rayba fīhi min rabbi l-ʿālamīna', 'এ কুরআন আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্য কারো রচিত নয়। উপরন্তু তা পূর্বে যা নাযিল হয়েছিল তার সমর্থক আর বিস্তারিত ব্যাখ্যাকৃত কিতাব, এতে কোন সন্দেহ নেই, জগৎসমূহের প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে (নাযিলকৃত)।', 'And it was not [possible] for this Qur''an to be produced by other than Allah, but [it is] a confirmation of what was before it and a detailed explanation of the [former] Scripture, about which there is no doubt, from the Lord of the worlds.', 'এ কুরআন আল্লাহ ছাড়া অন্য কারো রচিত নয়। উপরন্তু তা পূর্বে যা নাযিল হয়েছিল তার সমর্থক আর বিস্তারিত ব্যাখ্যাকৃত কিতাব, এতে কোন সন্দেহ নেই, জগৎসমূহের প্রতিপালকের নিকট হতে (নাযিলকৃত)।', 'And it was not [possible] for this Qur''an to be produced by other than Allah, but [it is] a confirmation of what was before it and a detailed explanation of the [former] Scripture, about which there is no doubt, from the Lord of the worlds.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010037.mp3', now()),
  (10, 38, '', '[{"id":39640,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা কি","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39641,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"yaqūlūna","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39642,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱفْتَرَىٰهُ ۖ","transliteration":"if''tarāhu","translation_bn":"\"সে রচনা করেছে তা\"","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39644,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"(হে নাবী) বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39645,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَأْتُوا۟","transliteration":"fatū","translation_bn":"\"তা হলে তোমরা আসো","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":39646,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِسُورَةٍۢ","transliteration":"bisūratin","translation_bn":"নিয়ে একটি সূরাহ (রচনা করে)","root":"سور","lemma":"سُورَة","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39647,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّثْلِهِۦ","transliteration":"mith''lihi","translation_bn":"মতো তার","root":"مثل","lemma":"مِثْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39648,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱدْعُوا۟","transliteration":"wa-id''ʿū","translation_bn":"এবং তোমরা ডাকো","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":39649,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَنِ","transliteration":"mani","translation_bn":"যাকে","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":39650,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱسْتَطَعْتُم","transliteration":"is''taṭaʿtum","translation_bn":"তোমরা পারো","root":"طوع","lemma":"ٱسْتَطَاعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39651,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":39652,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"বাদ","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39653,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":39654,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":39655,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"হও তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":39656,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":39657,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٣٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'am yaqūlūna if''tarāhu qul fatū bisūratin mith''lihi wa-id''ʿū mani is''taṭaʿtum min dūni l-lahi in kuntum ṣādiqīna', 'তারা কি এ কথা বলে যে, সে [অর্থাৎ মুহাম্মাদ (সা.)] এটা রচনা করেছে? বল, তাহলে তোমরাও এর মত একটা সূরাহ (রচনা করে) নিয়ে এসো আর আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাকে পার তাকে ডেকে নাও যদি তোমরা সত্যবাদী হয়ে থাক [যে মুহাম্মাদ (সাঃ)-ই তা রচনা করেছেন]।', 'Or do they say [about the Prophet], "He invented it?" Say, "Then bring forth a surah like it and call upon [for assistance] whomever you can besides Allah, if you should be truthful."', 'তারা কি এ কথা বলে যে, সে [অর্থাৎ মুহাম্মাদ (সা.)] এটা রচনা করেছে? বল, তাহলে তোমরাও এর মত একটা সূরাহ (রচনা করে) নিয়ে এসো আর আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে যাকে পার তাকে ডেকে নাও যদি তোমরা সত্যবাদী হয়ে থাক [যে মুহাম্মাদ (সাঃ)-ই তা রচনা করেছেন]।', 'Or do they say [about the Prophet], "He invented it?" Say, "Then bring forth a surah like it and call upon [for assistance] whomever you can besides Allah, if you should be truthful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010038.mp3', now()),
  (10, 39, '', '[{"id":40599,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"بَلْ","transliteration":"bal","translation_bn":"বরং","root":"—","lemma":"بَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রত্যাহার পদ (Retraction)"},{"id":40600,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"তারা মিথ্যা মনে করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40601,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐবিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40602,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":40603,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يُحِيطُوا۟","transliteration":"yuḥīṭū","translation_bn":"তারা আয়ত্ত করতে পারে","root":"حوط","lemma":"أَحَاطَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40604,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِعِلْمِهِۦ","transliteration":"biʿil''mihi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে জ্ঞান তা","root":"علم","lemma":"عِلْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40605,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَمَّا","transliteration":"walammā","translation_bn":"এবং এখনও নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":40606,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَأْتِهِمْ","transliteration":"yatihim","translation_bn":"তাদের কাছে আসে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40607,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَأْوِيلُهُۥ ۚ","transliteration":"tawīluhu","translation_bn":"ব্যাখ্যা তার","root":"اول","lemma":"تَأْوِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40609,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"كَذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"kadhālika","translation_bn":"এভাবে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40610,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبَ","transliteration":"kadhaba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করেছিলো","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40611,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":40612,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":40613,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"قَبْلِهِمْ ۖ","transliteration":"qablihim","translation_bn":"পূর্ব তাদের(ছিলো)","root":"قبل","lemma":"قَبْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40615,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"فَٱنظُرْ","transliteration":"fa-unẓur","translation_bn":"অতএব দেখো","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40616,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"كَيْفَ","transliteration":"kayfa","translation_bn":"কেমন","root":"كيف\r","lemma":"كَيْف","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":40617,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"كَانَ","transliteration":"kāna","translation_bn":"ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":40618,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَـٰقِبَةُ","transliteration":"ʿāqibatu","translation_bn":"পরিণাম","root":"عقب","lemma":"عَٰقِبَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":40619,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘনকারীদের","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَالِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":40620,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٣٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৩৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٣٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'bal kadhabū bimā lam yuḥīṭū biʿil''mihi walammā yatihim tawīluhu kadhālika kadhaba alladhīna min qablihim fa-unẓur kayfa kāna ʿāqibatu l-ẓālimīna', 'বরং যে বিষয় তাদের জ্ঞানের সীমার মধ্যে আসে না, আর যার পরিণাম ফল এখনও উপস্থিত হয়নি তা তারা অস্বীকার করে। এভাবে তাদের পূর্ববর্তী লোকেরাও মিথ্যা মনে ক’রে অমান্য করেছিল। এখন দেখ, এই যালিমদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছে!', 'Rather, they have denied that which they encompass not in knowledge and whose interpretation has not yet come to them. Thus did those before them deny. Then observe how was the end of the wrongdoers.', 'বরং যে বিষয় তাদের জ্ঞানের সীমার মধ্যে আসে না, আর যার পরিণাম ফল এখনও উপস্থিত হয়নি তা তারা অস্বীকার করে। এভাবে তাদের পূর্ববর্তী লোকেরাও মিথ্যা মনে ক’রে অমান্য করেছিল। এখন দেখ, এই যালিমদের পরিণতি কী হয়েছে!', 'Rather, they have denied that which they encompass not in knowledge and whose interpretation has not yet come to them. Thus did those before them deny. Then observe how was the end of the wrongdoers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010039.mp3', now()),
  (10, 40, '', '[{"id":41478,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"wamin''hum","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্য হতে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41479,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41480,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُ","transliteration":"yu''minu","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41481,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41482,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"wamin''hum","translation_bn":"আবার মধ্য হতে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41483,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":41484,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"لَّا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":41485,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يُؤْمِنُ","transliteration":"yu''minu","translation_bn":"ঈমান আনবে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":41486,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۚ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41488,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَرَبُّكَ","transliteration":"warabbuka","translation_bn":"এবং তোমার রব","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":41489,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَعْلَمُ","transliteration":"aʿlamu","translation_bn":"খুব জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"أَعْلَم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":41490,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","transliteration":"bil-muf''sidīna","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে বিপর্যয় সৃষ্টকারীদের","root":"فسد","lemma":"مُفْسِد","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":41491,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٤٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪০)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamin''hum man yu''minu bihi wamin''hum man lā yu''minu bihi warabbuka aʿlamu bil-muf''sidīna', 'এদের কিছু লোক এতে বিশ্বাস করে আর কতক এতে বিশ্বাস করে না। তোমার প্রতিপালক এই ফাসাদ সৃষ্টিকারী লোকদের সম্পর্কে সবচেয়ে বেশি অবহিত।', 'And of them are those who believe in it, and of them are those who do not believe in it. And your Lord is most knowing of the corrupters', 'এদের কিছু লোক এতে বিশ্বাস করে আর কতক এতে বিশ্বাস করে না। তোমার প্রতিপালক এই ফাসাদ সৃষ্টিকারী লোকদের সম্পর্কে সবচেয়ে বেশি অবহিত।', 'And of them are those who believe in it, and of them are those who do not believe in it. And your Lord is most knowing of the corrupters', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010040.mp3', now()),
  (10, 41, '', '[{"id":42263,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِن","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42264,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوكَ","transliteration":"kadhabūka","translation_bn":"তোমার প্রতি মিথ্যারোপ করে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42265,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فَقُل","transliteration":"faqul","translation_bn":"তবে বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":42266,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِّى","transliteration":"lī","translation_bn":"\"জন্যে আমার","root":"—","lemma":"لِّى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42267,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلِى","transliteration":"ʿamalī","translation_bn":"আমার কাজের (পরিণতি)","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42268,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَكُمْ","transliteration":"walakum","translation_bn":"আর জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"وَلَكُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42269,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلُكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"ʿamalukum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাজের (পরিণতি)","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42271,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُم","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":42272,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بَرِيٓـُٔونَ","transliteration":"barīūna","translation_bn":"দায়িত্বমুক্ত","root":"برا","lemma":"بَرِى^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42273,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِمَّآ","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42274,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"أَعْمَلُ","transliteration":"aʿmalu","translation_bn":"আমি কাজ করি","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42275,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَأَنَا۠","transliteration":"wa-anā","translation_bn":"এবং আমি","root":"—","lemma":"وَأَنَا۠","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":42276,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"بَرِىٓءٌۭ","transliteration":"barīon","translation_bn":"দায়িত্বমুক্ত","root":"برا","lemma":"بَرِى^ء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":42277,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":42278,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"تَعْمَلُونَ","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা কাজ করো\"","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمِلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":42279,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪১)","root":"—","lemma":"٤١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-in kadhabūka faqul lī ʿamalī walakum ʿamalukum antum barīūna mimmā aʿmalu wa-anā barīon mimmā taʿmalūna', 'যদি তারা তোমাকে মিথ্যা জেনে অমান্য ক’রে তাহলে বল, ‘আমার কাজের জন্য আমি দায়ী, আর তোমাদের কাজের জন্য তোমরা দায়ী, আমি যা করি তার দায়-দায়িত্ব থেকে তোমরা মুক্ত, আর তোমরা যা কর তার দায়-দায়িত্ব থেকে আমি মুক্ত।’', 'And if they deny you, [O Muhammad], then say, "For me are my deeds, and for you are your deeds. You are disassociated from what I do, and I am disassociated from what you do."', 'যদি তারা তোমাকে মিথ্যা জেনে অমান্য ক’রে তাহলে বল, ‘আমার কাজের জন্য আমি দায়ী, আর তোমাদের কাজের জন্য তোমরা দায়ী, আমি যা করি তার দায়-দায়িত্ব থেকে তোমরা মুক্ত, আর তোমরা যা কর তার দায়-দায়িত্ব থেকে আমি মুক্ত।’', 'And if they deny you, [O Muhammad], then say, "For me are my deeds, and for you are your deeds. You are disassociated from what I do, and I am disassociated from what you do."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010041.mp3', now()),
  (10, 42, '', '[{"id":43059,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"wamin''hum","translation_bn":"এবং  মধ্যে থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43060,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43061,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَمِعُونَ","transliteration":"yastamiʿūna","translation_bn":"মনোযোগ দিয়ে শোনে","root":"سمع","lemma":"ٱسْتَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43062,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ ۚ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"দিকে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43064,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَفَأَنتَ","transliteration":"afa-anta","translation_bn":"কি তবে তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَفَأَنتَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":43065,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تُسْمِعُ","transliteration":"tus''miʿu","translation_bn":"শুনাবে","root":"سمع","lemma":"أَسْمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43066,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّمَّ","transliteration":"l-ṣuma","translation_bn":"বধিরদেরকে","root":"صمم","lemma":"أَصَمّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43067,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43068,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা হলো (এমন যে)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43069,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":43070,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَعْقِلُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿqilūna","translation_bn":"তারা বুঝতে পারে","root":"عقل","lemma":"عَقَلُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43071,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪২)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamin''hum man yastamiʿūna ilayka afa-anta tus''miʿu l-ṣuma walaw kānū lā yaʿqilūna', 'এদের মধ্যে কেউ কেউ তোমার কথা শুনার ভান করে। তাহলে তুমি কি বধিরকে শুনাবে, তারা না বুঝলেও?', 'And among them are those who listen to you. But can you cause the deaf to hear, although they will not use reason?', 'এদের মধ্যে কেউ কেউ তোমার কথা শুনার ভান করে। তাহলে তুমি কি বধিরকে শুনাবে, তারা না বুঝলেও?', 'And among them are those who listen to you. But can you cause the deaf to hear, although they will not use reason?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010042.mp3', now()),
  (10, 43, '', '[{"id":43697,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمِنْهُم","transliteration":"wamin''hum","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্যে থেকে তাদের","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43698,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَّن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"কেউ কেউ","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":43699,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"يَنظُرُ","transliteration":"yanẓuru","translation_bn":"তাকিয়ে থাকে","root":"نظر","lemma":"نَّظَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43700,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِلَيْكَ ۚ","transliteration":"ilayka","translation_bn":"দিকে তোমার","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":43702,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"أَفَأَنتَ","transliteration":"afa-anta","translation_bn":"কি তবে তুমি","root":"—","lemma":"أَفَأَنتَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":43703,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"تَهْدِى","transliteration":"tahdī","translation_bn":"পথ দেখাবে","root":"هدي","lemma":"هَدَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43704,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعُمْىَ","transliteration":"l-ʿum''ya","translation_bn":"অন্ধকে","root":"عمي","lemma":"أَعْمَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":43705,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":43706,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা হলো (এমন যে)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43707,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":43708,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يُبْصِرُونَ","transliteration":"yub''ṣirūna","translation_bn":"দেখতে পায়","root":"بصر","lemma":"أَبْصَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":43709,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٤٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamin''hum man yanẓuru ilayka afa-anta tahdī l-ʿum''ya walaw kānū lā yub''ṣirūna', 'তাদের মধ্যে কেউ কেউ তোমার দিকে তাকায়, তুমি কি অন্ধকে পথ দেখাবে, তারা না দেখলেও?', 'And among them are those who look at you. But can you guide the blind although they will not [attempt to] see?', 'তাদের মধ্যে কেউ কেউ তোমার দিকে তাকায়, তুমি কি অন্ধকে পথ দেখাবে, তারা না দেখলেও?', 'And among them are those who look at you. But can you guide the blind although they will not [attempt to] see?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010043.mp3', now()),
  (10, 44, '', '[{"id":44498,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":44499,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":44500,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":44501,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَظْلِمُ","transliteration":"yaẓlimu","translation_bn":"অবিচার করেন","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44502,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষের (উপর)","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44503,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"شَيْـًۭٔا","transliteration":"shayan","translation_bn":"কিছুমাত্রও","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَىْء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44504,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":44505,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسَ","transliteration":"l-nāsa","translation_bn":"মানুষ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":44506,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"أَنفُسَهُمْ","transliteration":"anfusahum","translation_bn":"নিজেদের তাদের (উপর)","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":44507,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَظْلِمُونَ","transliteration":"yaẓlimūna","translation_bn":"তারা অবিচার করে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":44508,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٤٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'inna l-laha lā yaẓlimu l-nāsa shayan walākinna l-nāsa anfusahum yaẓlimūna', 'অবশ্যই আল্লাহ মানুষদের প্রতি কোন যুলম করেন না, কিন্তু মানুষ নিজেদের প্রতি যুলম ক’রে থাকে।', 'Indeed, Allah does not wrong the people at all, but it is the people who are wronging themselves.', 'অবশ্যই আল্লাহ মানুষদের প্রতি কোন যুলম করেন না, কিন্তু মানুষ নিজেদের প্রতি যুলম ক’রে থাকে।', 'Indeed, Allah does not wrong the people at all, but it is the people who are wronging themselves.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010044.mp3', now()),
  (10, 45, '', '[{"id":45169,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَوْمَ","transliteration":"wayawma","translation_bn":"এবং যেদিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45170,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَحْشُرُهُمْ","transliteration":"yaḥshuruhum","translation_bn":"একত্র করবেন তিনি তাদেরকে","root":"حشر","lemma":"حَشَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45171,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"كَأَن","transliteration":"ka-an","translation_bn":"(তারা ভাববে) যেন","root":"—","lemma":"أَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45172,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَّمْ","transliteration":"lam","translation_bn":"নি","root":"—","lemma":"لَم\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":45173,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"يَلْبَثُوٓا۟","transliteration":"yalbathū","translation_bn":"তারা অবস্হান করে","root":"لبث","lemma":"لَبِثَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45174,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":45175,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"سَاعَةًۭ","transliteration":"sāʿatan","translation_bn":"(মাত্র)এক মুহূর্তকাল","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45176,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"مِّنَ","transliteration":"mina","translation_bn":"থেকে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45177,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّهَارِ","transliteration":"l-nahāri","translation_bn":"দিনের","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45178,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَتَعَارَفُونَ","transliteration":"yataʿārafūna","translation_bn":"তারা পরস্পরে চিনবে","root":"عرف","lemma":"يَتَعَارَفُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45179,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُمْ ۚ","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"তাদের মাঝের (লোকদেরকে)","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":45181,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":45182,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"خَسِرَ","transliteration":"khasira","translation_bn":"ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়েছে","root":"خسر","lemma":"خَسِرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45183,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45184,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"كَذَّبُوا۟","transliteration":"kadhabū","translation_bn":"মিথ্যারোপ করেছে","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذَّبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45185,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِلِقَآءِ","transliteration":"biliqāi","translation_bn":"প্রতি সাক্ষাতের","root":"لقي","lemma":"لِقَا^ء","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45186,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45187,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45188,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"كَانُوا۟","transliteration":"kānū","translation_bn":"তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45189,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"مُهْتَدِينَ","transliteration":"muh''tadīna","translation_bn":"সৎপথ প্রাপ্ত","root":"هدي","lemma":"مُّهْتَدُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45190,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٤٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayawma yaḥshuruhum ka-an lam yalbathū illā sāʿatan mina l-nahāri yataʿārafūna baynahum qad khasira alladhīna kadhabū biliqāi l-lahi wamā kānū muh''tadīna', 'যে দিন তাদেরকে একত্রিত করা হবে (সেদিন তারা মনে করবে যে) দিনের এক মুহূর্তের বেশি তারা (দুনিয়াতে) অবস্থান করেনি। তারা পরস্পরকে চিনতে পারবে। যারা আল্লাহর সাক্ষাৎকে অস্বীকার করে তারা ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়েছে আর তারা কখনই সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্ত ছিল না।', 'And on the Day when He will gather them, [it will be] as if they had not remained [in the world] but an hour of the day, [and] they will know each other. Those will have lost who denied the meeting with Allah and were not guided', 'যে দিন তাদেরকে একত্রিত করা হবে (সেদিন তারা মনে করবে যে) দিনের এক মুহূর্তের বেশি তারা (দুনিয়াতে) অবস্থান করেনি। তারা পরস্পরকে চিনতে পারবে। যারা আল্লাহর সাক্ষাৎকে অস্বীকার করে তারা ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত হয়েছে আর তারা কখনই সঠিক পথপ্রাপ্ত ছিল না।', 'And on the Day when He will gather them, [it will be] as if they had not remained [in the world] but an hour of the day, [and] they will know each other. Those will have lost who denied the meeting with Allah and were not guided', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010045.mp3', now()),
  (10, 46, '', '[{"id":45889,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَإِمَّا","transliteration":"wa-immā","translation_bn":"এবং যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45890,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"نُرِيَنَّكَ","transliteration":"nuriyannaka","translation_bn":"তোমাকে দেখাই আমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"أَرَيْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45891,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"بَعْضَ","transliteration":"baʿḍa","translation_bn":"কিছু অংশ","root":"بعض","lemma":"بَعْض","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45892,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যার","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45893,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"نَعِدُهُمْ","transliteration":"naʿiduhum","translation_bn":"ভয় দেখাচ্ছি তাদের","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45894,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45895,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَتَوَفَّيَنَّكَ","transliteration":"natawaffayannaka","translation_bn":"তোমার মৃত্যু ঘটাই আমরা","root":"وفي","lemma":"تَوَفَّىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45896,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فَإِلَيْنَا","transliteration":"fa-ilaynā","translation_bn":"তবুও দিকে আমাদেরই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":45897,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَرْجِعُهُمْ","transliteration":"marjiʿuhum","translation_bn":"প্রত্যাবর্তন তাদের (হবে)","root":"رجع","lemma":"مَرْجِع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":45898,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":45899,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":45900,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"شَهِيدٌ","transliteration":"shahīdun","translation_bn":"সাক্ষী (আছেন)","root":"شهد","lemma":"شَهِيد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":45901,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"عَلَىٰ","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":45902,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"(ঐ বিষয়ের) যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":45903,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَفْعَلُونَ","transliteration":"yafʿalūna","translation_bn":"তারা করছে","root":"فعل","lemma":"فَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":45904,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٤٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wa-immā nuriyannaka baʿḍa alladhī naʿiduhum aw natawaffayannaka fa-ilaynā marjiʿuhum thumma l-lahu shahīdun ʿalā mā yafʿalūna', 'আমি তাদেরকে যে পরিণতির ভয় দেখিয়েছি তার কিছু অংশ আমি যদি তোমাকে দেখিয়ে দেই, কিংবা (তার পূর্বেই) তোমাকে যদি উঠিয়ে দেই, (অবস্থা যেটাই হোক না কেন) তাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন তো আমার কাছেই, (সর্বোপরি) তারা যা কিছু করছে আল্লাহ হচ্ছেন তার সাক্ষী।', 'And whether We show you some of what We promise them, [O Muhammad], or We take you in death, to Us is their return; then, [either way], Allah is a witness concerning what they are doing', 'আমি তাদেরকে যে পরিণতির ভয় দেখিয়েছি তার কিছু অংশ আমি যদি তোমাকে দেখিয়ে দেই, কিংবা (তার পূর্বেই) তোমাকে যদি উঠিয়ে দেই, (অবস্থা যেটাই হোক না কেন) তাদের প্রত্যাবর্তন তো আমার কাছেই, (সর্বোপরি) তারা যা কিছু করছে আল্লাহ হচ্ছেন তার সাক্ষী।', 'And whether We show you some of what We promise them, [O Muhammad], or We take you in death, to Us is their return; then, [either way], Allah is a witness concerning what they are doing', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010046.mp3', now()),
  (10, 47, '', '[{"id":46390,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلِكُلِّ","transliteration":"walikulli","translation_bn":"এবং জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46391,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍۢ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"জাতির","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46392,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"رَّسُولٌۭ ۖ","transliteration":"rasūlun","translation_bn":"একজন রাসূল(রয়েছে)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46394,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"فَإِذَا","transliteration":"fa-idhā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":46395,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46396,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"رَسُولُهُمْ","transliteration":"rasūluhum","translation_bn":"রাসূল তাদের(রয়েছে)","root":"رسل","lemma":"رَسُول","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":46397,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"قُضِىَ","transliteration":"quḍiya","translation_bn":"মীমাংসা করা হয়েছে","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46398,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُم","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":46399,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْقِسْطِ","transliteration":"bil-qis''ṭi","translation_bn":"সাথে ন্যায়বিচারের","root":"قسط","lemma":"قِسْط","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":46400,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের (উপর)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":46401,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":46402,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"يُظْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yuẓ''lamūna","translation_bn":"অবিচার করা হয়েছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":46403,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٤٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walikulli ummatin rasūlun fa-idhā jāa rasūluhum quḍiya baynahum bil-qis''ṭi wahum lā yuẓ''lamūna', 'প্রত্যেক জাতির জন্য (পাঠানো হয়েছে) একজন রসূল। তাদের রসূল যখন এসেছে তখন ন্যায়পরায়ণতার সঙ্গে তাদের মাঝে ফায়সালা করা হয়েছে। তাদের প্রতি কোন যুলম করা হয়নি।', 'And for every nation is a messenger. So when their messenger comes, it will be judged between them in justice, and they will not be wronged', 'প্রত্যেক জাতির জন্য (পাঠানো হয়েছে) একজন রসূল। তাদের রসূল যখন এসেছে তখন ন্যায়পরায়ণতার সঙ্গে তাদের মাঝে ফায়সালা করা হয়েছে। তাদের প্রতি কোন যুলম করা হয়নি।', 'And for every nation is a messenger. So when their messenger comes, it will be judged between them in justice, and they will not be wronged', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010047.mp3', now()),
  (10, 48, '', '[{"id":47182,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"wayaqūlūna","translation_bn":"এবং তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47183,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مَتَىٰ","transliteration":"matā","translation_bn":"\"কখন (বাস্তবায়িত হবে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَتَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":47184,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এই","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":47185,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْوَعْدُ","transliteration":"l-waʿdu","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47186,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":47187,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"হও তোমরা","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47188,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"صَـٰدِقِينَ","transliteration":"ṣādiqīna","translation_bn":"সত্যবাদী\"","root":"صدق","lemma":"صَادِق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47189,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٤٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayaqūlūna matā hādhā l-waʿdu in kuntum ṣādiqīna', 'তারা বলে, ‘‘তোমরা সত্যবাদী হলে (বল তো) এই প্রতিশ্রুতি কখন সত্য হয়ে দেখা দিবে?’’', 'And they say, "When is [the fulfillment of] this promise, if you should be truthful?"', 'তারা বলে, ‘‘তোমরা সত্যবাদী হলে (বল তো) এই প্রতিশ্রুতি কখন সত্য হয়ে দেখা দিবে?’’', 'And they say, "When is [the fulfillment of] this promise, if you should be truthful?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010048.mp3', now()),
  (10, 49, '', '[{"id":47703,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُل","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47704,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"لَّآ","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"\"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":47705,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَمْلِكُ","transliteration":"amliku","translation_bn":"অধিকার রাখি আমি","root":"ملك","lemma":"مَلَكَتْ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47706,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِنَفْسِى","transliteration":"linafsī","translation_bn":"(এমনকি) জন্যও নিজের","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47707,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ضَرًّۭا","transliteration":"ḍarran","translation_bn":"কোনো ক্ষতির","root":"ضرر","lemma":"ضَرّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47708,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47709,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"نَفْعًا","transliteration":"nafʿan","translation_bn":"কোনো উপকারের","root":"نفع","lemma":"نَفْع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47710,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":47711,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":47712,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"شَآءَ","transliteration":"shāa","translation_bn":"ইচ্ছে করেন","root":"شيا","lemma":"شَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47713,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ ۗ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":47715,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لِكُلِّ","transliteration":"likulli","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":47716,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"أُمَّةٍ","transliteration":"ummatin","translation_bn":"জাতির","root":"امم","lemma":"أُمَّة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47717,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلٌ ۚ","transliteration":"ajalun","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট সময় (রয়েছে)","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47719,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":47720,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَ","transliteration":"jāa","translation_bn":"আসবে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47721,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَجَلُهُمْ","transliteration":"ajaluhum","translation_bn":"নির্দিষ্ট সময় তার","root":"اجل","lemma":"أَجَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47722,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"فَلَا","transliteration":"falā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":47723,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَـْٔخِرُونَ","transliteration":"yastakhirūna","translation_bn":"পিছাতে পারবে","root":"اخر","lemma":"يَسْتَأْخِرُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47724,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"سَاعَةًۭ ۖ","transliteration":"sāʿatan","translation_bn":"মুহূর্তকালও","root":"سوع","lemma":"سَاعَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":47726,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":47727,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَقْدِمُونَ","transliteration":"yastaqdimūna","translation_bn":"এগিয়ে নিতে পারবে\"","root":"قدم","lemma":"يَسْتَقْدِمُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":47728,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"٤٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৪৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٤٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul lā amliku linafsī ḍarran walā nafʿan illā mā shāa l-lahu likulli ummatin ajalun idhā jāa ajaluhum falā yastakhirūna sāʿatan walā yastaqdimūna', 'বল, ‘আল্লাহর ইচ্ছে ব্যতীত আমার নিজেরও কোন ক্ষতি বা লাভ করার ক্ষমতা নেই।’ প্রত্যেক সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য একটা নির্দিষ্ট সময় নির্ধারিত আছে। তাদের সেই নির্দিষ্ট সময় চলে আসলে তারা এক মুহূর্তও আগ-পাছ করতে পারবে না।', 'Say, "I possess not for myself any harm or benefit except what Allah should will. For every nation is a [specified] term. When their time has come, then they will not remain behind an hour, nor will they precede [it]."', 'বল, ‘আল্লাহর ইচ্ছে ব্যতীত আমার নিজেরও কোন ক্ষতি বা লাভ করার ক্ষমতা নেই।’ প্রত্যেক সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য একটা নির্দিষ্ট সময় নির্ধারিত আছে। তাদের সেই নির্দিষ্ট সময় চলে আসলে তারা এক মুহূর্তও আগ-পাছ করতে পারবে না।', 'Say, "I possess not for myself any harm or benefit except what Allah should will. For every nation is a [specified] term. When their time has come, then they will not remain behind an hour, nor will they precede [it]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010049.mp3', now()),
  (10, 50, '', '[{"id":48538,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48539,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","transliteration":"ara-aytum","translation_bn":"\"কি (ভেবে) দেখেছো তোমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":48540,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"যদি","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"শর্তবাচক (Conditional)"},{"id":48541,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَتَىٰكُمْ","transliteration":"atākum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের উপর আসে","root":"اتي","lemma":"أَتَى","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48542,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابُهُۥ","transliteration":"ʿadhābuhu","translation_bn":"শাস্তি তাঁর(সহসা)","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48543,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بَيَـٰتًا","transliteration":"bayātan","translation_bn":"রাতে","root":"بيت","lemma":"بَيَٰت","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48544,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَوْ","transliteration":"aw","translation_bn":"বা","root":"—","lemma":"أَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":48545,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"نَهَارًۭا","transliteration":"nahāran","translation_bn":"দিনে (তবে তোমরা কি করবে)","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":48546,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَّاذَا","transliteration":"mādhā","translation_bn":"কি (কারণ আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"مَاذَا\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":48547,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَسْتَعْجِلُ","transliteration":"yastaʿjilu","translation_bn":"তাড়াহুড়া করতে চায়","root":"عجل","lemma":"ٱسْتَعْجَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":48548,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"مِنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"থেকে তা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":48549,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimūna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীরা\"","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":48550,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"٥٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫০)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytum in atākum ʿadhābuhu bayātan aw nahāran mādhā yastaʿjilu min''hu l-muj''rimūna', 'বল, ‘তোমরা কি চিন্তা করে দেখেছ যদি তাঁর ‘আযাব হঠাৎ করে রাতে বা দিনে তোমাদের উপর এসে পড়ে (তাহলে তো তোমাদের করার কিছুই নেই) অপরাধীরা তার কোনটা তাড়াহুড়ো করে আনতে চায়?', 'Say, "Have you considered: if His punishment should come to you by night or by day - for which [aspect] of it would the criminals be impatient?"', 'বল, ‘তোমরা কি চিন্তা করে দেখেছ যদি তাঁর ‘আযাব হঠাৎ করে রাতে বা দিনে তোমাদের উপর এসে পড়ে (তাহলে তো তোমাদের করার কিছুই নেই) অপরাধীরা তার কোনটা তাড়াহুড়ো করে আনতে চায়?', 'Say, "Have you considered: if His punishment should come to you by night or by day - for which [aspect] of it would the criminals be impatient?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010050.mp3', now()),
  (10, 51, '', '[{"id":49151,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَثُمَّ","transliteration":"athumma","translation_bn":"কি এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":49152,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِذَا","transliteration":"idhā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"إِذَا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":49153,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"তা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":49154,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَقَعَ","transliteration":"waqaʿa","translation_bn":"ঘটে যাবে","root":"وقع","lemma":"وَقَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49155,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنتُم","transliteration":"āmantum","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাস করবে তোমরা","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49156,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦٓ ۚ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦٓ ۚ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49158,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَآلْـَٔـٰنَ","transliteration":"āl''āna","translation_bn":"কি এখন (রক্ষা পেতে চাও)","root":"—","lemma":"ـ#َٰن","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":49159,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَقَدْ","transliteration":"waqad","translation_bn":"অথচ নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49160,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُم","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49161,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49162,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"تَسْتَعْجِلُونَ","transliteration":"tastaʿjilūna","translation_bn":"তাড়াহুড়া করতে চাইতে","root":"عجل","lemma":"ٱسْتَعْجَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49163,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫১)","root":"—","lemma":"٥١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'athumma idhā mā waqaʿa āmantum bihi āl''āna waqad kuntum bihi tastaʿjilūna', 'তাহলে ওটা বাস্তবে ঘটে যাওয়ার পরই কি তোমরা তাতে বিশ্বাস করতে চাও? (ঘটে যাওয়ার পর বলা হবে) ‘এখন, (বিশ্বাস করলে) এটার জন্য তোমরা তাড়াহুড়ো করছিলে!’', 'Then is it that when it has [actually] occurred you will believe in it? Now? And you were [once] for it impatient', 'তাহলে ওটা বাস্তবে ঘটে যাওয়ার পরই কি তোমরা তাতে বিশ্বাস করতে চাও? (ঘটে যাওয়ার পর বলা হবে) ‘এখন, (বিশ্বাস করলে) এটার জন্য তোমরা তাড়াহুড়ো করছিলে!’', 'Then is it that when it has [actually] occurred you will believe in it? Now? And you were [once] for it impatient', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010051.mp3', now()),
  (10, 52, '', '[{"id":49890,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ثُمَّ","transliteration":"thumma","translation_bn":"এরপর","root":"—","lemma":"ثُمّ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":49891,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"قِيلَ","transliteration":"qīla","translation_bn":"বলা হবে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49892,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"lilladhīna","translation_bn":"উদ্দেশ্যে তাদের (যারা)","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49893,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمُوا۟","transliteration":"ẓalamū","translation_bn":"সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছিলো","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49894,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ذُوقُوا۟","transliteration":"dhūqū","translation_bn":"\"তোমরা স্বাদ নাও","root":"ذوق","lemma":"ذَاقُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49895,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَذَابَ","transliteration":"ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তির","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":49896,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْخُلْدِ","transliteration":"l-khul''di","translation_bn":"স্থায়ী","root":"خلد","lemma":"خُلْد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":49897,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَلْ","transliteration":"hal","translation_bn":"কি","root":"—","lemma":"هَل\r","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":49898,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تُجْزَوْنَ","transliteration":"tuj''zawna","translation_bn":"তোমাদের প্রতিফল দেয়া হবে","root":"جزي","lemma":"جَزَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49899,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":49900,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِمَا","transliteration":"bimā","translation_bn":"ঐ বিষয়ে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":49901,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"كُنتُمْ","transliteration":"kuntum","translation_bn":"তোমরা ছিলে","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49902,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"تَكْسِبُونَ","transliteration":"taksibūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা অর্জন করতে\"","root":"كسب","lemma":"كَسَبَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":49903,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"٥٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫২)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma qīla lilladhīna ẓalamū dhūqū ʿadhāba l-khul''di hal tuj''zawna illā bimā kuntum taksibūna', 'অবশেষে যালিমদেরকে বলা হবে- ‘স্থায়ী শাস্তির স্বাদ গ্রহণ কর, তোমরা যা কিছু উপার্জন করেছিলে তার প্রতিফল ছাড়া তোমাদের আর কী দেয়া যেতে পারে!', 'Then it will be said to those who had wronged, "Taste the punishment of eternity; are you being recompensed except for what you used to earn?"', 'অবশেষে যালিমদেরকে বলা হবে- ‘স্থায়ী শাস্তির স্বাদ গ্রহণ কর, তোমরা যা কিছু উপার্জন করেছিলে তার প্রতিফল ছাড়া তোমাদের আর কী দেয়া যেতে পারে!', 'Then it will be said to those who had wronged, "Taste the punishment of eternity; are you being recompensed except for what you used to earn?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010052.mp3', now()),
  (10, 53, '', '[{"id":50449,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"۞ وَيَسْتَنۢبِـُٔونَكَ","transliteration":"wayastanbiūnaka","translation_bn":"এবং তোমার কাছে তারা জানতে চায়","root":"نبا","lemma":"يَسْتَن[بِـ#ُ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50450,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَحَقٌّ","transliteration":"aḥaqqun","translation_bn":"\"কি সত্য\"","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":50451,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ ۖ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"\"তা\"","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ ۖ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":50453,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":50454,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"إِى","transliteration":"ī","translation_bn":"\"হ্যাঁ","root":"—","lemma":"إِى\r","grammar_bn":"উত্তর পদ (Answer)"},{"id":50455,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَرَبِّىٓ","transliteration":"warabbī","translation_bn":"শপথ আমার রবের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50456,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّهُۥ","transliteration":"innahu","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই তা","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":50457,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَحَقٌّۭ ۖ","transliteration":"laḥaqqun","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":50459,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَمَآ","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নও","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50460,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"أَنتُم","transliteration":"antum","translation_bn":"তোমরা","root":"—","lemma":"أَنتُم","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":50461,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"بِمُعْجِزِينَ","transliteration":"bimuʿ''jizīna","translation_bn":"ব্যর্থকারী\"","root":"عجز","lemma":"مُعْجِز","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50462,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٥٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayastanbiūnaka aḥaqqun huwa qul ī warabbī innahu laḥaqqun wamā antum bimuʿ''jizīna', 'তারা তোমার কাছে জানতে চায় (তুমি যা বলছ) সেগুলো কি প্রকৃতই সঠিক? বল-‘হাঁ, আমার রবের কসম! তা একবারেই সত্য। তোমরা তা বানচাল করতে পারবে না।', 'And they ask information of you, [O Muhammad], "Is it true?" Say, "Yes, by my Lord. Indeed, it is truth; and you will not cause failure [to Allah]."', 'তারা তোমার কাছে জানতে চায় (তুমি যা বলছ) সেগুলো কি প্রকৃতই সঠিক? বল-‘হাঁ, আমার রবের কসম! তা একবারেই সত্য। তোমরা তা বানচাল করতে পারবে না।', 'And they ask information of you, [O Muhammad], "Is it true?" Say, "Yes, by my Lord. Indeed, it is truth; and you will not cause failure [to Allah]."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010053.mp3', now()),
  (10, 54, '', '[{"id":50996,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদি (এমন হতো)","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":50997,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَنَّ","transliteration":"anna","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই","root":"—","lemma":"أَنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":50998,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِكُلِّ","transliteration":"likulli","translation_bn":"জন্যে প্রত্যেক","root":"كلل","lemma":"كُلّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":50999,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"نَفْسٍۢ","transliteration":"nafsin","translation_bn":"ব্যক্তির","root":"نفس","lemma":"نَفْس","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":51000,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ظَلَمَتْ","transliteration":"ẓalamat","translation_bn":"(যে) সীমালঙ্ঘন করেছে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51001,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":51002,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51003,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর (সব তারই)","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51004,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَٱفْتَدَتْ","transliteration":"la-if''tadat","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই মুক্তিপণ হিসেবে দিতো(বাঁচার জন্য)","root":"فدي","lemma":"ٱفْتَدَىٰ","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":51005,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"بِهِۦ ۗ","transliteration":"bihi","translation_bn":"দিয়ে তা","root":"—","lemma":"بِهِۦ ۗ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51007,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"وَأَسَرُّوا۟","transliteration":"wa-asarrū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা গোপনে করবে","root":"سرر","lemma":"أَسَرَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51008,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّدَامَةَ","transliteration":"l-nadāmata","translation_bn":"অনুতাপ","root":"ندم","lemma":"نَّدَامَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51009,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":51010,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"رَأَوُا۟","transliteration":"ra-awū","translation_bn":"দেখবে","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51011,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَذَابَ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ʿadhāba","translation_bn":"শাস্তি","root":"عذب","lemma":"عَذَاب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":51013,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَقُضِىَ","transliteration":"waquḍiya","translation_bn":"এবং মীমাংসা করা হবে","root":"قضي","lemma":"قَضَىٰ^","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51014,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"بَيْنَهُم","transliteration":"baynahum","translation_bn":"মাঝে তাদের","root":"بين","lemma":"بَيْن","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":51015,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"بِٱلْقِسْطِ ۚ","transliteration":"bil-qis''ṭi","translation_bn":"সাথে ন্যায়বিচারের","root":"قسط","lemma":"قِسْط","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":51017,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"وَهُمْ","transliteration":"wahum","translation_bn":"এবং তাদের (উপর)","root":"—","lemma":"وَهُمْ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":51018,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":51019,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"يُظْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yuẓ''lamūna","translation_bn":"অবিচার করা হবে","root":"ظلم","lemma":"ظَلَمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":51020,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"٥٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walaw anna likulli nafsin ẓalamat mā fī l-arḍi la-if''tadat bihi wa-asarrū l-nadāmata lammā ra-awū l-ʿadhāba waquḍiya baynahum bil-qis''ṭi wahum lā yuẓ''lamūna', 'যুলম করেছে এমন প্রত্যেকেই দুনিয়াতে যা কিছু আছে যদি তা সব তার হত তবে সে বিনিময়ে তা প্রদান করে ‘আযাব হতে বাঁচতে চাইত। তারা যখন ‘আযাব প্রত্যক্ষ করবে তখন মনের দুঃখ-তাপ গোপন করবে। ন্যায়পরায়ণতার সঙ্গে তাদের ব্যাপারে ফায়সালা করা হবে। তাদের প্রতি কোন প্রকার যুলম করা হবে না।', 'And if each soul that wronged had everything on earth, it would offer it in ransom. And they will confide regret when they see the punishment; and they will be judged in justice, and they will not be wronged', 'যুলম করেছে এমন প্রত্যেকেই দুনিয়াতে যা কিছু আছে যদি তা সব তার হত তবে সে বিনিময়ে তা প্রদান করে ‘আযাব হতে বাঁচতে চাইত। তারা যখন ‘আযাব প্রত্যক্ষ করবে তখন মনের দুঃখ-তাপ গোপন করবে। ন্যায়পরায়ণতার সঙ্গে তাদের ব্যাপারে ফায়সালা করা হবে। তাদের প্রতি কোন প্রকার যুলম করা হবে না।', 'And if each soul that wronged had everything on earth, it would offer it in ransom. And they will confide regret when they see the punishment; and they will be judged in justice, and they will not be wronged', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010054.mp3', now()),
  (10, 55, '', '[{"id":52009,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান (শুনে রাখো)","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":52010,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52011,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52012,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যাকিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":52013,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52014,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52015,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","transliteration":"wal-arḍi","translation_bn":"ও পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52017,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান (শুনে রাখো)","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":52018,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":52019,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَعْدَ","transliteration":"waʿda","translation_bn":"প্রতিশ্রুতি","root":"وعد","lemma":"وَعْد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52020,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":52021,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"حَقٌّۭ","transliteration":"ḥaqqun","translation_bn":"সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52022,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52023,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharahum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশই তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52024,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":52025,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"يَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তারা জানে","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52026,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٥٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alā inna lillahi mā fī l-samāwāti wal-arḍi alā inna waʿda l-lahi ḥaqqun walākinna aktharahum lā yaʿlamūna', 'জেনে রেখ, আসমানসমূহ আর যমীনে যা কিছু আছে সবই আল্লাহর। জেনে রেখ, আল্লাহর ওয়া‘দা সত্য, কিন্তু অধিকাংশ মানুষ (এ সকল বিষয়) জানে না।', 'Unquestionably, to Allah belongs whatever is in the heavens and the earth. Unquestionably, the promise of Allah is truth, but most of them do not know', 'জেনে রেখ, আসমানসমূহ আর যমীনে যা কিছু আছে সবই আল্লাহর। জেনে রেখ, আল্লাহর ওয়া‘দা সত্য, কিন্তু অধিকাংশ মানুষ (এ সকল বিষয়) জানে না।', 'Unquestionably, to Allah belongs whatever is in the heavens and the earth. Unquestionably, the promise of Allah is truth, but most of them do not know', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010055.mp3', now()),
  (10, 56, '', '[{"id":52550,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":52551,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يُحْىِۦ","transliteration":"yuḥ''yī","translation_bn":"জীবনদান করেন","root":"حيي","lemma":"أَحْيَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52552,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَيُمِيتُ","transliteration":"wayumītu","translation_bn":"ও মৃত্যু ঘটান","root":"موت","lemma":"أَمَاتَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52553,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَإِلَيْهِ","transliteration":"wa-ilayhi","translation_bn":"এবং দিকে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52554,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"تُرْجَعُونَ","transliteration":"tur''jaʿūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা প্রত্যাবর্তিত হবে","root":"رجع","lemma":"رَجَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52555,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"٥٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa yuḥ''yī wayumītu wa-ilayhi tur''jaʿūna', 'তিনি জীবন দান করেন, তিনিই মৃত্যু দেন, আর তাঁর দিকেই তোমরা ফিরে যাবে।', 'He gives life and causes death, and to Him you will be returned', 'তিনি জীবন দান করেন, তিনিই মৃত্যু দেন, আর তাঁর দিকেই তোমরা ফিরে যাবে।', 'He gives life and causes death, and to Him you will be returned', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010056.mp3', now()),
  (10, 57, '', '[{"id":52962,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","translation_bn":"হে","root":"—","lemma":"أَيُّهَا","grammar_bn":"সম্বোধন পদ (Vocative)"},{"id":52963,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسُ","transliteration":"l-nāsu","translation_bn":"মানব সমাজ","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52964,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَدْ","transliteration":"qad","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"قَد\r","grammar_bn":"নিশ্চয়তাবোধক (Certainty)"},{"id":52965,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَتْكُم","transliteration":"jāatkum","translation_bn":"কাছে এসেছে তোমাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":52966,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"مَّوْعِظَةٌۭ","transliteration":"mawʿiẓatun","translation_bn":"উপদেশ","root":"وعظ","lemma":"مَّوْعِظَة","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52967,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"পক্ষ হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52968,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"رَّبِّكُمْ","transliteration":"rabbikum","translation_bn":"রবের তোমাদের","root":"ربب","lemma":"رَبّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":52969,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَشِفَآءٌۭ","transliteration":"washifāon","translation_bn":"ও আরোগ্য","root":"شفي","lemma":"شِفَا^ء","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52970,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لِّمَا","transliteration":"limā","translation_bn":"তার জন্যে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52971,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52972,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلصُّدُورِ","transliteration":"l-ṣudūri","translation_bn":"অন্তরসমূহের","root":"صدر","lemma":"صَدْر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":52973,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَهُدًۭى","transliteration":"wahudan","translation_bn":"এবং পথনির্দেশ","root":"هدي","lemma":"هُدًى","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52974,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَرَحْمَةٌۭ","transliteration":"waraḥmatun","translation_bn":"ও দয়া","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":52975,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِّلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"lil''mu''minīna","translation_bn":"জন্য মু''মিনদের","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":52976,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٥٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'yāayyuhā l-nāsu qad jāatkum mawʿiẓatun min rabbikum washifāon limā fī l-ṣudūri wahudan waraḥmatun lil''mu''minīna', 'হে মানুষ! তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে তোমাদের কাছে এসেছে নাসীহাত আর তোমাদের অন্তরে যা আছে তার নিরাময়, আর মু’মিনদের জন্য সঠিক পথের দিশা ও রহমাত।', 'O mankind, there has to come to you instruction from your Lord and healing for what is in the breasts and guidance and mercy for the believers.', 'হে মানুষ! তোমাদের প্রতিপালকের নিকট থেকে তোমাদের কাছে এসেছে নাসীহাত আর তোমাদের অন্তরে যা আছে তার নিরাময়, আর মু’মিনদের জন্য সঠিক পথের দিশা ও রহমাত।', 'O mankind, there has to come to you instruction from your Lord and healing for what is in the breasts and guidance and mercy for the believers.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010057.mp3', now()),
  (10, 58, '', '[{"id":53542,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53543,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"بِفَضْلِ","transliteration":"bifaḍli","translation_bn":"\"মাধ্যমে অনুগ্রহের","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53544,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"\"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53545,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَبِرَحْمَتِهِۦ","transliteration":"wabiraḥmatihi","translation_bn":"ও মাধ্যমে দয়ার তাঁর (এটা পাঠিয়েছেন)","root":"رحم","lemma":"رَحْمَة","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53546,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فَبِذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"fabidhālika","translation_bn":"সুতরা এজন্যে","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53547,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"فَلْيَفْرَحُوا۟","transliteration":"falyafraḥū","translation_bn":"অতএব তাদের আনন্দ করা উচিত\"","root":"فرح","lemma":"فَرِحَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":53548,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":53549,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"خَيْرٌۭ","transliteration":"khayrun","translation_bn":"উত্তম","root":"خير","lemma":"خَيْر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53550,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مِّمَّا","transliteration":"mimmā","translation_bn":"তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53551,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يَجْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yajmaʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা জমা করছে","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53552,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٥٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul bifaḍli l-lahi wabiraḥmatihi fabidhālika falyafraḥū huwa khayrun mimmā yajmaʿūna', 'বল, আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ ও দয়ার বদৌলতে (তা এসেছে), এজন্য তারা আনন্দিত হোক। তারা যা স্তুপীকৃত করছে তার চেয়ে তা (অর্থাৎ হিদায়াত ও রহমাতপূর্ণ কুরআন) উত্তম।', 'Say, "In the bounty of Allah and in His mercy - in that let them rejoice; it is better than what they accumulate."', 'বল, আল্লাহর অনুগ্রহ ও দয়ার বদৌলতে (তা এসেছে), এজন্য তারা আনন্দিত হোক। তারা যা স্তুপীকৃত করছে তার চেয়ে তা (অর্থাৎ হিদায়াত ও রহমাতপূর্ণ কুরআন) উত্তম।', 'Say, "In the bounty of Allah and in His mercy - in that let them rejoice; it is better than what they accumulate."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010058.mp3', now()),
  (10, 59, '', '[{"id":53922,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53923,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَرَءَيْتُم","transliteration":"ara-aytum","translation_bn":"\"কি (ভেবে) দেখেছো তোমরা","root":"راي","lemma":"رَءَا","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":53924,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"مَّآ","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":53925,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"أَنزَلَ","transliteration":"anzala","translation_bn":"অবতীর্ণ করেছেন","root":"نزل","lemma":"أَنزَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53926,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53927,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لَكُم","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53928,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53929,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"رِّزْقٍۢ","transliteration":"riz''qin","translation_bn":"জীবিকা","root":"رزق","lemma":"رِزْق","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53930,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"فَجَعَلْتُم","transliteration":"fajaʿaltum","translation_bn":"অতঃপর তোমরা বানিয়েছো","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53931,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مِّنْهُ","transliteration":"min''hu","translation_bn":"কিছু তার","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53932,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"حَرَامًۭا","transliteration":"ḥarāman","translation_bn":"হারাম","root":"حرم","lemma":"حَرَام","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":53933,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَحَلَـٰلًۭا","transliteration":"waḥalālan","translation_bn":"আর হালাল\"","root":"حلل","lemma":"حَلَٰل","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53934,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قُلْ","transliteration":"qul","translation_bn":"বলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53935,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ءَآللَّهُ","transliteration":"āllahu","translation_bn":"\"কি আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":53936,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"أَذِنَ","transliteration":"adhina","translation_bn":"অনুমতি দিয়েছেন","root":"اذن","lemma":"أَذِنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53937,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"lakum","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمْ ۖ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53939,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَمْ","transliteration":"am","translation_bn":"অথবা","root":"—","lemma":"أَم\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":53940,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":53941,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":53942,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"تَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"taftarūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা মিথ্যারোপ করছো\"","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":53943,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"٥٩","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৫৯)","root":"—","lemma":"٥٩","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qul ara-aytum mā anzala l-lahu lakum min riz''qin fajaʿaltum min''hu ḥarāman waḥalālan qul āllahu adhina lakum am ʿalā l-lahi taftarūna', 'বল-তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ আল্লাহ যে রিযক তোমাদের জন্য পাঠিয়েছেন, তোমরা তার কতকগুলোকে হারাম আর কতককে হালাল করে নিয়েছ। বল, আল্লাহ কি তোমাদেরকে এর অনুমতি দিয়েছেন? না তোমরা আল্লাহর উপর মিথ্যা অপবাদ দিচ্ছ?', 'Say, "Have you seen what Allah has sent down to you of provision of which you have made [some] lawful and [some] unlawful?" Say, "Has Allah permitted you [to do so], or do you invent [something] about Allah?"', 'বল-তোমরা কি ভেবে দেখেছ আল্লাহ যে রিযক তোমাদের জন্য পাঠিয়েছেন, তোমরা তার কতকগুলোকে হারাম আর কতককে হালাল করে নিয়েছ। বল, আল্লাহ কি তোমাদেরকে এর অনুমতি দিয়েছেন? না তোমরা আল্লাহর উপর মিথ্যা অপবাদ দিচ্ছ?', 'Say, "Have you seen what Allah has sent down to you of provision of which you have made [some] lawful and [some] unlawful?" Say, "Has Allah permitted you [to do so], or do you invent [something] about Allah?"', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010059.mp3', now()),
  (10, 60, '', '[{"id":54202,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং কি","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54203,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ظَنُّ","transliteration":"ẓannu","translation_bn":"ধারণা (করে)","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنّ","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54204,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":54205,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَفْتَرُونَ","transliteration":"yaftarūna","translation_bn":"রচনা করে","root":"فري","lemma":"ٱفْتَرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54206,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54207,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54208,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكَذِبَ","transliteration":"l-kadhiba","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা","root":"كذب","lemma":"كَذِب","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54209,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"يَوْمَ","transliteration":"yawma","translation_bn":"(সম্বন্ধে) দিন","root":"يوم","lemma":"يَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54210,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","translation_bn":"ক্বিয়ামাতের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قِيَٰمَة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54212,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":54213,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":54214,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"لَذُو","transliteration":"ladhū","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই","root":"—","lemma":"ذُو","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":54215,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فَضْلٍ","transliteration":"faḍlin","translation_bn":"অনুগ্রহসম্পন্ন","root":"فضل","lemma":"فَضْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54216,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":54217,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلنَّاسِ","transliteration":"l-nāsi","translation_bn":"মানুষের","root":"نوس","lemma":"نَّاس","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":54218,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","transliteration":"walākinna","translation_bn":"কিন্তু","root":"—","lemma":"لَٰكِنّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":54219,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"أَكْثَرَهُمْ","transliteration":"aktharahum","translation_bn":"অধিকাংশই তাদের","root":"كثر","lemma":"أَكْثَر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":54220,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":54221,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَشْكُرُونَ","transliteration":"yashkurūna","translation_bn":"কৃতজ্ঞতা প্রকাশ করে","root":"شكر","lemma":"شَكَرَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":54222,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"٦٠","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬০)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٠","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wamā ẓannu alladhīna yaftarūna ʿalā l-lahi l-kadhiba yawma l-qiyāmati inna l-laha ladhū faḍlin ʿalā l-nāsi walākinna aktharahum lā yashkurūna', 'যারা আল্লাহর প্রতি মিথ্যোরোপ করে, কিয়ামাতের দিন (আল্লাহ তাদের সঙ্গে যে ব্যবহার করবেন সে) সম্পর্কে তাদের কী ধারণা? আল্লাহ তো মানুষদের উপর বড়ই অনুগ্রহশীল, কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই আল্লাহর শোকর করে না।', 'And what will be the supposition of those who invent falsehood about Allah on the Day of Resurrection? Indeed, Allah is full of bounty to the people, but most of them are not grateful."', 'যারা আল্লাহর প্রতি মিথ্যোরোপ করে, কিয়ামাতের দিন (আল্লাহ তাদের সঙ্গে যে ব্যবহার করবেন সে) সম্পর্কে তাদের কী ধারণা? আল্লাহ তো মানুষদের উপর বড়ই অনুগ্রহশীল, কিন্তু তাদের অধিকাংশই আল্লাহর শোকর করে না।', 'And what will be the supposition of those who invent falsehood about Allah on the Day of Resurrection? Indeed, Allah is full of bounty to the people, but most of them are not grateful."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010060.mp3', now()),
