onably, [for] the allies of Allah there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve', 'জেনে রেখ! আল্লাহর বন্ধুদের কোন ভয় নেই আর তারা দুঃখিতও হবে না।', 'Unquestionably, [for] the allies of Allah there will be no fear concerning them, nor will they grieve', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010062.mp3', now()),
  (10, 63, '', '[{"id":56205,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":56206,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ءَامَنُوا۟","transliteration":"āmanū","translation_bn":"ঈমান এনেছে","root":"امن","lemma":"ءَامَنَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56207,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"ও তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56208,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّقُونَ","transliteration":"yattaqūna","translation_bn":"তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করেছে","root":"وقي","lemma":"ٱتَّقَىٰ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":56209,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"٦٣","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৩)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٣","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alladhīna āmanū wakānū yattaqūna', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে', 'Those who believed and were fearing Allah', 'যারা ঈমান আনে আর তাকওয়া অবলম্বন করে', 'Those who believed and were fearing Allah', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010063.mp3', now()),
  (10, 64, '', '[{"id":56658,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"لَهُمُ","transliteration":"lahumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাদের (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56659,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْبُشْرَىٰ","transliteration":"l-bush''rā","translation_bn":"সুসংবাদ","root":"بشر","lemma":"بُشْرَىٰ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56660,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56661,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةِ","transliteration":"l-ḥayati","translation_bn":"জীবনের","root":"حيي","lemma":"حَيَوٰة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56662,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","transliteration":"l-dun''yā","translation_bn":"পার্থিব","root":"دنو","lemma":"دُّنْيَا","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56663,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"وَفِى","transliteration":"wafī","translation_bn":"এবং মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":56664,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-ākhirati","translation_bn":"আখিরাতের","root":"اخر","lemma":"ا^خِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56666,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":56667,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"تَبْدِيلَ","transliteration":"tabdīla","translation_bn":"কোনো পরিবর্তন","root":"بدل","lemma":"تَبْدِيل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":56668,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"لِكَلِمَـٰتِ","transliteration":"likalimāti","translation_bn":"জন্যে কথাগুলোর","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَٰت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":56669,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":56671,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":56672,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"সেই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":56673,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْفَوْزُ","transliteration":"l-fawzu","translation_bn":"সাফল্য","root":"فوز","lemma":"فَوْز","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56674,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَظِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿaẓīmu","translation_bn":"মহা","root":"عظم","lemma":"عَظِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":56675,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٦٤","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৪)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٤","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'lahumu l-bush''rā fī l-ḥayati l-dun''yā wafī l-ākhirati lā tabdīla likalimāti l-lahi dhālika huwa l-fawzu l-ʿaẓīmu', 'তাদের জন্য সুসংবাদ দুনিয়ার জীবনে আর আখেরাতেও। আল্লাহর কথার কোন হেরফের হয় না, এটাই হল বিরাট সাফল্য।', 'For them are good tidings in the worldly life and in the Hereafter. No change is there in the words of Allah. That is what is the great attainment.', 'তাদের জন্য সুসংবাদ দুনিয়ার জীবনে আর আখেরাতেও। আল্লাহর কথার কোন হেরফের হয় না, এটাই হল বিরাট সাফল্য।', 'For them are good tidings in the worldly life and in the Hereafter. No change is there in the words of Allah. That is what is the great attainment.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010064.mp3', now()),
  (10, 65, '', '[{"id":57126,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"এবং না (যেন)","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57127,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"يَحْزُنكَ","transliteration":"yaḥzunka","translation_bn":"দুঃখ দেয় তোমাকে","root":"حزن","lemma":"يَحْزُن","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57128,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"قَوْلُهُمْ ۘ","transliteration":"qawluhum","translation_bn":"কথা তাদের","root":"قول","lemma":"قَوْل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57130,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57131,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعِزَّةَ","transliteration":"l-ʿizata","translation_bn":"সব সম্মানই","root":"عزز","lemma":"عِزَّة","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57132,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহরই","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57133,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"جَمِيعًا ۚ","transliteration":"jamīʿan","translation_bn":"সব","root":"جمع","lemma":"جَمِيع","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57135,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":57136,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمِيعُ","transliteration":"l-samīʿu","translation_bn":"সবকিছু শুনেন","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِيع","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57137,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْعَلِيمُ","transliteration":"l-ʿalīmu","translation_bn":"সবকিছু জানেন","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِيم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57138,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٦٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'walā yaḥzunka qawluhum inna l-ʿizata lillahi jamīʿan huwa l-samīʿu l-ʿalīmu', 'ওদের কথা যেন তোমাকে দুঃখ না দেয়, যাবতীয় সম্মান আল্লাহরই জন্য, তিনি সব কিছুই শোনেন, সব কিছু জানেন।', 'And let not their speech grieve you. Indeed, honor [due to power] belongs to Allah entirely. He is the Hearing, the Knowing.', 'ওদের কথা যেন তোমাকে দুঃখ না দেয়, যাবতীয় সম্মান আল্লাহরই জন্য, তিনি সব কিছুই শোনেন, সব কিছু জানেন।', 'And let not their speech grieve you. Indeed, honor [due to power] belongs to Allah entirely. He is the Hearing, the Knowing.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010065.mp3', now()),
  (10, 66, '', '[{"id":57604,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"أَلَآ","transliteration":"alā","translation_bn":"সাবধান (জেনে রাখো)","root":"—","lemma":"أَلَا^\r","grammar_bn":"অসম্পূর্ণ (Inceptive)"},{"id":57605,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":57606,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِلَّهِ","transliteration":"lillahi","translation_bn":"জন্যে আল্লাহরই (মালিকানাভুক্ত)","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57607,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مَن","transliteration":"man","translation_bn":"যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":57608,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57609,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশসমূহের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57610,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"وَمَن","transliteration":"waman","translation_bn":"এবং যারা","root":"—","lemma":"مَن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57611,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57612,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۗ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57614,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং কিসের","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57615,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّبِعُ","transliteration":"yattabiʿu","translation_bn":"অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57616,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ","transliteration":"alladhīna","translation_bn":"(তারা) যারা","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":57617,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"يَدْعُونَ","transliteration":"yadʿūna","translation_bn":"ডাকে","root":"دعو","lemma":"دَعَا","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57618,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مِن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"দিয়ে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":57619,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"دُونِ","transliteration":"dūni","translation_bn":"বাদ","root":"دون","lemma":"دُون","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57620,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":57621,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"شُرَكَآءَ ۚ","transliteration":"shurakāa","translation_bn":"(তাদের কল্পিত) শরীকদেরকে","root":"شرك","lemma":"شَرِيك","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":57623,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"إِن","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":57624,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"يَتَّبِعُونَ","transliteration":"yattabiʿūna","translation_bn":"তারা অনুসরণ করে","root":"تبع","lemma":"ٱتَّبَعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57625,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":57626,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"ٱلظَّنَّ","transliteration":"l-ẓana","translation_bn":"অনুমানের","root":"ظنن","lemma":"ظَنّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":57627,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"وَإِنْ","transliteration":"wa-in","translation_bn":"এবং না","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":57628,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"هُمْ","transliteration":"hum","translation_bn":"তারা","root":"—","lemma":"هُمْ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":57629,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"إِلَّا","transliteration":"illā","translation_bn":"এ ছাড়া","root":"—","lemma":"إِلَّا\r","grammar_bn":"সীমাবদ্ধতা (Restriction)"},{"id":57630,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"يَخْرُصُونَ","transliteration":"yakhruṣūna","translation_bn":"মিথ্যা বলে","root":"خرص","lemma":"يَخْرُصُ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":57631,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٦٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'alā inna lillahi man fī l-samāwāti waman fī l-arḍi wamā yattabiʿu alladhīna yadʿūna min dūni l-lahi shurakāa in yattabiʿūna illā l-ẓana wa-in hum illā yakhruṣūna', 'জেনে রেখ! যা কিছু আসমানসমূহে আছে আর যারা যমীনে আছে সবাই আল্লাহর। (এ অবস্থায়) যারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে (তাদের মনগড়া) শরীকদের ডাকে তারা কিসের অনুসরণ করে? তারা ধারণা-অনুমান ছাড়া অন্য কিছুরই অনুসরণ করে না, আর তারা শুধু মিথ্যাই বলে।', 'Unquestionably, to Allah belongs whoever is in the heavens and whoever is on the earth. And those who invoke other than Allah do not [actually] follow [His] "partners." They follow not except assumption, and they are not but falsifying', 'জেনে রেখ! যা কিছু আসমানসমূহে আছে আর যারা যমীনে আছে সবাই আল্লাহর। (এ অবস্থায়) যারা আল্লাহকে বাদ দিয়ে (তাদের মনগড়া) শরীকদের ডাকে তারা কিসের অনুসরণ করে? তারা ধারণা-অনুমান ছাড়া অন্য কিছুরই অনুসরণ করে না, আর তারা শুধু মিথ্যাই বলে।', 'Unquestionably, to Allah belongs whoever is in the heavens and whoever is on the earth. And those who invoke other than Allah do not [actually] follow [His] "partners." They follow not except assumption, and they are not but falsifying', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010066.mp3', now()),
  (10, 67, '', '[{"id":58312,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনিই (আল্লাহ)","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":58313,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِى","transliteration":"alladhī","translation_bn":"যিনি","root":"—","lemma":"ٱلَّذِى","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58314,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"جَعَلَ","transliteration":"jaʿala","translation_bn":"বানিয়েছেন","root":"جعل","lemma":"جَعَلَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58315,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمُ","transliteration":"lakumu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمُ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58316,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"ٱلَّيْلَ","transliteration":"al-layla","translation_bn":"রাতকে","root":"ليل","lemma":"لَيْل","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58317,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"لِتَسْكُنُوا۟","transliteration":"litaskunū","translation_bn":"যেন তোমরা বিশ্রাম নাও","root":"سكن","lemma":"سَكَنَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58318,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"فِيهِ","transliteration":"fīhi","translation_bn":"মধ্যে তার","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58319,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَٱلنَّهَارَ","transliteration":"wal-nahāra","translation_bn":"এবং দিনকে (বানিয়েছেন)","root":"نهر","lemma":"نَهَار","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58320,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مُبْصِرًا ۚ","transliteration":"mub''ṣiran","translation_bn":"দেখার জন্যে","root":"بصر","lemma":"مُبْصِر","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58322,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":58323,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (রয়েছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58324,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ذَٰلِكَ","transliteration":"dhālika","translation_bn":"এর","root":"—","lemma":"ذَٰلِك","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":58325,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"لَـَٔايَـٰتٍۢ","transliteration":"laāyātin","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই নিদর্শনাবলী","root":"ايي","lemma":"ءَايَة","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":58326,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لِّقَوْمٍۢ","transliteration":"liqawmin","translation_bn":"জন্যে সম্প্রদায়ের","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58327,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يَسْمَعُونَ","transliteration":"yasmaʿūna","translation_bn":"(যারা উন্মুক্ত কানে) শোনে","root":"سمع","lemma":"سَمِعَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58328,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"٦٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'huwa alladhī jaʿala lakumu al-layla litaskunū fīhi wal-nahāra mub''ṣiran inna fī dhālika laāyātin liqawmin yasmaʿūna', 'তিনিই তোমাদের জন্য রাত বানিয়েছেন যেন তোমরা তাতে শান্তি লাভ করতে পার, আর দিন সৃষ্টি করেছেন (সব কিছু) দেখার জন্য। অবশ্যই এতে নিদর্শন আছে ঐ সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য যারা (মনোযোগ দিয়ে) শোনে।', 'It is He who made for you the night to rest therein and the day, giving sight. Indeed in that are signs for a people who listen.', 'তিনিই তোমাদের জন্য রাত বানিয়েছেন যেন তোমরা তাতে শান্তি লাভ করতে পার, আর দিন সৃষ্টি করেছেন (সব কিছু) দেখার জন্য। অবশ্যই এতে নিদর্শন আছে ঐ সম্প্রদায়ের জন্য যারা (মনোযোগ দিয়ে) শোনে।', 'It is He who made for you the night to rest therein and the day, giving sight. Indeed in that are signs for a people who listen.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010067.mp3', now()),
  (10, 68, '', '[{"id":58490,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলে","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58491,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱتَّخَذَ","transliteration":"ittakhadha","translation_bn":"\"গ্রহণ করেছেন","root":"اخذ","lemma":"ٱتَّخَذَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58492,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"\"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58493,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"وَلَدًۭا ۗ","transliteration":"waladan","translation_bn":"সন্তান\"","root":"ولد","lemma":"وَلَد","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58495,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"سُبْحَـٰنَهُۥ ۖ","transliteration":"sub''ḥānahu","translation_bn":"(প্রকৃতপক্ষে)পবিত্র তিনি","root":"سبح","lemma":"سُبْحَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58497,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"هُوَ","transliteration":"huwa","translation_bn":"তিনি","root":"—","lemma":"هُوَ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":58498,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْغَنِىُّ ۖ","transliteration":"l-ghaniyu","translation_bn":"অভাবমুক্ত","root":"غني","lemma":"غَنِىّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58500,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"لَهُۥ","transliteration":"lahu","translation_bn":"জন্যে তাঁরই","root":"—","lemma":"لَهُۥ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58501,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58502,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58503,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","transliteration":"l-samāwāti","translation_bn":"আকাশের","root":"سمو","lemma":"سَمَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58504,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং যা কিছু","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":58505,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে (আছে)","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58506,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۚ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"পৃথিবীর","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":58508,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"إِنْ","transliteration":"in","translation_bn":"নেই","root":"—","lemma":"إِن\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58509,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عِندَكُم","transliteration":"ʿindakum","translation_bn":"কাছে তোমাদের","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"স্থানবাচক (Location)"},{"id":58510,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"مِّن","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"কোনো","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58511,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"سُلْطَـٰنٍۭ","transliteration":"sul''ṭānin","translation_bn":"প্রমাণ","root":"سلط","lemma":"سُلْطَٰن","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":58512,"position":19,"text_uthmani":"بِهَـٰذَآ ۚ","transliteration":"bihādhā","translation_bn":"সম্বন্ধে এই(তোমাদের দাবীর)","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58514,"position":20,"text_uthmani":"أَتَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"ataqūlūna","translation_bn":"কি তোমরা বলছো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":58515,"position":21,"text_uthmani":"عَلَى","transliteration":"ʿalā","translation_bn":"উপর","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":58516,"position":22,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهِ","transliteration":"l-lahi","translation_bn":"আল্লাহর","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":58517,"position":23,"text_uthmani":"مَا","transliteration":"mā","translation_bn":"যা","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সাপেক্ষ সর্বনাম (Relative)"},{"id":58518,"position":24,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":58519,"position":25,"text_uthmani":"تَعْلَمُونَ","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","translation_bn":"তোমরা জানো","root":"علم","lemma":"عَلِمَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":58520,"position":26,"text_uthmani":"٦٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৬৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٦٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū ittakhadha l-lahu waladan sub''ḥānahu huwa l-ghaniyu lahu mā fī l-samāwāti wamā fī l-arḍi in ʿindakum min sul''ṭānin bihādhā ataqūlūna ʿalā l-lahi mā lā taʿlamūna', 'ওরা বলে-‘‘আল্লাহ পুত্র গ্রহণ করেছেন’’। মহান পবিত্র তিনি, তিনি কারো মুখাপেক্ষী নন, আসমানসমূহে ও যমীনে যা আছে সবই তাঁর মালিকানাধীন, (আল্লাহ পুত্র গ্রহণ করেছেন) এ ব্যাপারে তোমাদের কাছে কোন প্রমাণ নেই, তাহলে তোমরা কি আল্লাহ সম্পর্কে এমন কথা বলছ যে বিষয়ে তোমাদের কোনই জ্ঞান নেই?', 'They have said, "Allah has taken a son." Exalted is He; He is the [one] Free of need. To Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is in the earth. You have no authority for this [claim]. Do you say about Allah that which you do not know?', 'ওরা বলে-‘‘আল্লাহ পুত্র গ্রহণ করেছেন’’। মহান পবিত্র তিনি, তিনি কারো মুখাপেক্ষী নন, আসমানসমূহে ও যমীনে যা আছে সবই তাঁর মালিকানাধীন, (আল্লাহ পুত্র গ্রহণ করেছেন) এ ব্যাপারে তোমাদের কাছে কোন প্রমাণ নেই, তাহলে তোমরা কি আল্লাহ সম্পর্কে এমন কথা বলছ যে বিষয়ে তোমাদের কোনই জ্ঞান নেই?', 'They have said, "Allah has taken a son." Exalted is He; He is the [one] Free of need. To Him belongs whatever is in the heavens and whatever is in the earth. You have no authority for this [claim]. Do you say about Allah that which you do not know?', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010068.mp3', now()),
