"শব্দ"},{"id":62046,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"وَكَانُوا۟","transliteration":"wakānū","translation_bn":"এবং তারা ছিলো","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":62047,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"قَوْمًۭا","transliteration":"qawman","translation_bn":"জাতি","root":"قوم","lemma":"قَوْم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62048,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"مُّجْرِمِينَ","transliteration":"muj''rimīna","translation_bn":"অপরাধী","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":62049,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"٧٥","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৫)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٥","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'thumma baʿathnā min baʿdihim mūsā wahārūna ilā fir''ʿawna wamala-ihi biāyātinā fa-is''takbarū wakānū qawman muj''rimīna', 'তাদের পর আমি মূসা ও হারূনকে আমার নিদর্শন সহকারে ফির‘আওন ও তার প্রধানদের নিকট পাঠিয়েছিলাম। কিন্তু তারা অহঙ্কার করে, তারা ছিল এক অপরাধী সম্প্রদায়।', 'Then We sent after them Moses and Aaron to Pharaoh and his establishment with Our signs, but they behaved arrogantly and were a criminal people', 'তাদের পর আমি মূসা ও হারূনকে আমার নিদর্শন সহকারে ফির‘আওন ও তার প্রধানদের নিকট পাঠিয়েছিলাম। কিন্তু তারা অহঙ্কার করে, তারা ছিল এক অপরাধী সম্প্রদায়।', 'Then We sent after them Moses and Aaron to Pharaoh and his establishment with Our signs, but they behaved arrogantly and were a criminal people', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010075.mp3', now()),
  (10, 76, '', '[{"id":62359,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"فَلَمَّا","transliteration":"falammā","translation_bn":"অতঃপর যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62360,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَهُمُ","transliteration":"jāahumu","translation_bn":"কাছে আসলো তাদের","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62361,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqu","translation_bn":"প্রকৃত সত্য","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":62362,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"مِنْ","transliteration":"min","translation_bn":"হতে","root":"—","lemma":"مِن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":62363,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"عِندِنَا","transliteration":"ʿindinā","translation_bn":"নিকট আমাদের","root":"عند","lemma":"عِند","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":62364,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":62365,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"إِنَّ","transliteration":"inna","translation_bn":"\"নিশ্চয়ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":62366,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":62367,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَسِحْرٌۭ","transliteration":"lasiḥ''run","translation_bn":"অবশ্যই জাদু","root":"سحر","lemma":"سِحْر","grammar_bn":"দৃঢ়তাবোধক (Emphatic)"},{"id":62368,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"مُّبِينٌۭ","transliteration":"mubīnun","translation_bn":"সুস্পষ্ট\"","root":"بين","lemma":"مُّبِين","grammar_bn":"বিশেষণ (Adjective)"},{"id":62369,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"٧٦","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৬)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٦","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā jāahumu l-ḥaqu min ʿindinā qālū inna hādhā lasiḥ''run mubīnun', 'অতঃপর আমার নিকট থেকে যখন তাদের কাছে প্রকৃত সত্য এসে পড়ল, তখন তারা বলল, ‘‘এটা তো অবশ্যই সুস্পষ্ট যাদু’’।', 'So when there came to them the truth from Us, they said, "Indeed, this is obvious magic."', 'অতঃপর আমার নিকট থেকে যখন তাদের কাছে প্রকৃত সত্য এসে পড়ল, তখন তারা বলল, ‘‘এটা তো অবশ্যই সুস্পষ্ট যাদু’’।', 'So when there came to them the truth from Us, they said, "Indeed, this is obvious magic."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010076.mp3', now()),
  (10, 77, '', '[{"id":63043,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالَ","transliteration":"qāla","translation_bn":"বললো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63044,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"مُوسَىٰٓ","transliteration":"mūsā","translation_bn":"মূসা","root":"—","lemma":"مُوسَىٰ","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":63045,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"أَتَقُولُونَ","transliteration":"ataqūlūna","translation_bn":"\"কি তোমরা বলছো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":63046,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"لِلْحَقِّ","transliteration":"lil''ḥaqqi","translation_bn":"সম্পর্কে সত্য (এরূপ কথা)","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63047,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"لَمَّا","transliteration":"lammā","translation_bn":"যখন","root":"—","lemma":"لَمَّا\r","grammar_bn":"কালবাচক (Time)"},{"id":63048,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"جَآءَكُمْ ۖ","transliteration":"jāakum","translation_bn":"তোমাদের কাছে (তা) এসেছে","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63050,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"أَسِحْرٌ","transliteration":"asiḥ''run","translation_bn":"কি জাদু","root":"سحر","lemma":"سِحْر","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":63051,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"هَـٰذَا","transliteration":"hādhā","translation_bn":"এটা","root":"—","lemma":"هَٰذَا","grammar_bn":"নির্দেশক সর্বনাম (Demonstrative)"},{"id":63052,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"وَلَا","transliteration":"walā","translation_bn":"আর না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63053,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"يُفْلِحُ","transliteration":"yuf''liḥu","translation_bn":"সফলকাম হয়","root":"فلح","lemma":"أَفْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63054,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"ٱلسَّـٰحِرُونَ","transliteration":"l-sāḥirūna","translation_bn":"জাদুকররা\"","root":"سحر","lemma":"سَٰحِر","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63055,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"٧٧","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৭)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٧","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qāla mūsā ataqūlūna lil''ḥaqqi lammā jāakum asiḥ''run hādhā walā yuf''liḥu l-sāḥirūna', 'মূসা বলল, ‘‘প্রকৃত সত্য সম্পর্কে তোমরা (এ রকম) কথা বলছ যখন তা তোমাদের কাছে এসে গেছে। এটা কি যাদু? যাদুকররা মুক্তি পাবে না।’’', 'Moses said, "Do you say [thus] about the truth when it has come to you? Is this magic? But magicians will not succeed."', 'মূসা বলল, ‘‘প্রকৃত সত্য সম্পর্কে তোমরা (এ রকম) কথা বলছ যখন তা তোমাদের কাছে এসে গেছে। এটা কি যাদু? যাদুকররা মুক্তি পাবে না।’’', 'Moses said, "Do you say [thus] about the truth when it has come to you? Is this magic? But magicians will not succeed."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010077.mp3', now()),
  (10, 78, '', '[{"id":63344,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"قَالُوٓا۟","transliteration":"qālū","translation_bn":"তারা বলেছিলো","root":"قول","lemma":"قَالَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63345,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"أَجِئْتَنَا","transliteration":"aji''tanā","translation_bn":"\"কি আমাদের কাছে তুমি এসেছো","root":"جيا","lemma":"جَا^ءَ","grammar_bn":"প্রশ্নবোধক (Interrogative)"},{"id":63346,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"لِتَلْفِتَنَا","transliteration":"litalfitanā","translation_bn":"যাতে তুমি আমাদেরকে সরিয়ে দিবে","root":"لفت","lemma":"تَلْفِتَ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63347,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"عَمَّا","transliteration":"ʿammā","translation_bn":"তা হতে যা","root":"—","lemma":"عَن\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63348,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَجَدْنَا","transliteration":"wajadnā","translation_bn":"পেয়েছি আমরা","root":"وجد","lemma":"وَجَدَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":63349,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"عَلَيْهِ","transliteration":"ʿalayhi","translation_bn":"উপর তার","root":"—","lemma":"عَلَىٰ\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63350,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ءَابَآءَنَا","transliteration":"ābāanā","translation_bn":"পূর্বপুরুষদেরকে আমাদের","root":"ابو","lemma":"ا^بَاء","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":63351,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"وَتَكُونَ","transliteration":"watakūna","translation_bn":"এবং হয় (যেন)","root":"كون","lemma":"كَانَ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63352,"position":9,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمَا","transliteration":"lakumā","translation_bn":"জন্যে তোমাদের দু''জনের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63353,"position":10,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْكِبْرِيَآءُ","transliteration":"l-kib''riyāu","translation_bn":"প্রতিপত্তি","root":"كبر","lemma":"كِبْرِيَا^ء","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63354,"position":11,"text_uthmani":"فِى","transliteration":"fī","translation_bn":"মধ্যে","root":"—","lemma":"فِى\r","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63355,"position":12,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْأَرْضِ","transliteration":"l-arḍi","translation_bn":"দেশের","root":"ارض","lemma":"أَرْض","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":63356,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"وَمَا","transliteration":"wamā","translation_bn":"এবং নই","root":"—","lemma":"مَا\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":63357,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"نَحْنُ","transliteration":"naḥnu","translation_bn":"আমরা","root":"—","lemma":"نَحْنُ","grammar_bn":"সর্বনাম (Pronoun)"},{"id":63358,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"لَكُمَا","transliteration":"lakumā","translation_bn":"প্রতি তোমাদের দু''জনের","root":"—","lemma":"لَكُمَا","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63359,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"بِمُؤْمِنِينَ","transliteration":"bimu''minīna","translation_bn":"বিশ্বাসী\"","root":"امن","lemma":"مُؤْمِن","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":63360,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"٧٨","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৭৮)","root":"—","lemma":"٧٨","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'qālū aji''tanā litalfitanā ʿammā wajadnā ʿalayhi ābāanā watakūna lakumā l-kib''riyāu fī l-arḍi wamā naḥnu lakumā bimu''minīna', 'তারা বলল, ‘‘তোমরা কি আমাদেরকে ঐ পথ থেকে সরিয়ে দেয়ার জন্য এসেছ আমরা আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষদেরকে যে পথের উপর পেয়েছি আর এজন্য যে যমীনে তোমাদের দু’জনের প্রাধান্য প্রতিষ্ঠিত হয়? আমরা তোমাদের কথা মোটেই মেনে নেব না।’’', 'They said, "Have you come to us to turn us away from that upon which we found our fathers and so that you two may have grandeur in the land? And we are not believers in you."', 'তারা বলল, ‘‘তোমরা কি আমাদেরকে ঐ পথ থেকে সরিয়ে দেয়ার জন্য এসেছ আমরা আমাদের পিতৃপুরুষদেরকে যে পথের উপর পেয়েছি আর এজন্য যে যমীনে তোমাদের দু’জনের প্রাধান্য প্রতিষ্ঠিত হয়? আমরা তোমাদের কথা মোটেই মেনে নেব না।’’', 'They said, "Have you come to us to turn us away from that upon which we found our fathers and so that you two may have grandeur in the land? And we are not believers in you."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010078.mp3', now()),
