ই","root":"—","lemma":"إِنّ","grammar_bn":"অভিঘাত পদ (Accusative)"},{"id":64475,"position":13,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهَ","transliteration":"l-laha","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":64476,"position":14,"text_uthmani":"لَا","transliteration":"lā","translation_bn":"না","root":"—","lemma":"لَا\r","grammar_bn":"না-বোধক (Negative)"},{"id":64477,"position":15,"text_uthmani":"يُصْلِحُ","transliteration":"yuṣ''liḥu","translation_bn":"পরিশুদ্ধ করেন","root":"صلح","lemma":"أَصْلَحَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":64478,"position":16,"text_uthmani":"عَمَلَ","transliteration":"ʿamala","translation_bn":"কাজকে","root":"عمل","lemma":"عَمَل","grammar_bn":"বিশেষ্য (Noun)"},{"id":64479,"position":17,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُفْسِدِينَ","transliteration":"l-muf''sidīna","translation_bn":"বিপর্যয়সৃষ্টিকারীদের","root":"فسد","lemma":"مُفْسِد","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":64480,"position":18,"text_uthmani":"٨١","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮১)","root":"—","lemma":"٨١","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'falammā alqaw qāla mūsā mā ji''tum bihi l-siḥ''ru inna l-laha sayub''ṭiluhu inna l-laha lā yuṣ''liḥu ʿamala l-muf''sidīna', 'তারা যখন নিক্ষেপ করল, তখন মূসা বলল, ‘‘তোমরা যা নিয়ে এসেছ তাতো যাদু, আল্লাহ এখনই তা ব্যর্থ করে দেবেন, আল্লাহ বিশৃঙ্খলাকারীদের কাজকে সংশোধন করেন না’’।', 'And when they had thrown, Moses said, "What you have brought is [only] magic. Indeed, Allah will expose its worthlessness. Indeed, Allah does not amend the work of corrupters.', 'তারা যখন নিক্ষেপ করল, তখন মূসা বলল, ‘‘তোমরা যা নিয়ে এসেছ তাতো যাদু, আল্লাহ এখনই তা ব্যর্থ করে দেবেন, আল্লাহ বিশৃঙ্খলাকারীদের কাজকে সংশোধন করেন না’’।', 'And when they had thrown, Moses said, "What you have brought is [only] magic. Indeed, Allah will expose its worthlessness. Indeed, Allah does not amend the work of corrupters.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010081.mp3', now()),
  (10, 82, '', '[{"id":65229,"position":1,"text_uthmani":"وَيُحِقُّ","transliteration":"wayuḥiqqu","translation_bn":"এবং সত্যে পরিণত করবেন","root":"حقق","lemma":"يُحِقَّ","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65230,"position":2,"text_uthmani":"ٱللَّهُ","transliteration":"l-lahu","translation_bn":"আল্লাহ","root":"اله","lemma":"ٱللَّه","grammar_bn":"নামবাচক বিশেষ্য (Proper Noun)"},{"id":65231,"position":3,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقَّ","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","translation_bn":"সত্যকে","root":"حقق","lemma":"حَقّ","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65232,"position":4,"text_uthmani":"بِكَلِمَـٰتِهِۦ","transliteration":"bikalimātihi","translation_bn":"মাধ্যমে বাণীর তাঁর","root":"كلم","lemma":"كَلِمَٰت","grammar_bn":"অব্যয় (Preposition)"},{"id":65233,"position":5,"text_uthmani":"وَلَوْ","transliteration":"walaw","translation_bn":"এবং যদিও","root":"—","lemma":"لَو\r","grammar_bn":"সংযোজক অব্যয় (Conjunction)"},{"id":65234,"position":6,"text_uthmani":"كَرِهَ","transliteration":"kariha","translation_bn":"অপছন্দ করে (তা)","root":"كره","lemma":"كَرِهَ","grammar_bn":"ক্রিয়া (Verb)"},{"id":65235,"position":7,"text_uthmani":"ٱلْمُجْرِمُونَ","transliteration":"l-muj''rimūna","translation_bn":"অপরাধীরা\"","root":"جرم","lemma":"مُجْرِم","grammar_bn":"শব্দ"},{"id":65236,"position":8,"text_uthmani":"٨٢","transliteration":"","translation_bn":"(৮২)","root":"—","lemma":"٨٢","grammar_bn":"মার্কার"}]'::jsonb, 'wayuḥiqqu l-lahu l-ḥaqa bikalimātihi walaw kariha l-muj''rimūna', 'আল্লাহ তাঁর বাণীর সাহায্যে প্রকৃত সত্যকে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করবেনই, অপরাধীদের কাছে তা যতই অপ্রীতিকর হোক না কেন।', 'And Allah will establish the truth by His words, even if the criminals dislike it."', 'আল্লাহ তাঁর বাণীর সাহায্যে প্রকৃত সত্যকে প্রতিষ্ঠিত করবেনই, অপরাধীদের কাছে তা যতই অপ্রীতিকর হোক না কেন।', 'And Allah will establish the truth by His words, even if the criminals dislike it."', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://everyayah.com/data/Alafasy_128kbps/010082.mp3', now()),
